values
  ('651731139912392464', 'Hellboy', 2019, 'Fantasy, Horror, Action, Adventure', 'Maya Markova, Neil Marshall, Lorenzo Senatore', 'Andrew Cosby', 'David Harbour, Milla Jovovich, Ian McShane, Sasha Lane, Daniel Dae Kim, Thomas Haden Church, Stephen Graham, Douglas Tait', 'R', 'Hellboy comes to England, where he must defeat Nimue, Merlin''s consort and the Blood Queen. But their battle will bring about the end of the world, a fate he desperately tries to turn away.', 'Hellboy comes to England, where he must defeat Nimue, Merlin''s consort and the Blood Queen. But their battle will bring about the end of the world, a fate he desperately tries to turn away.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bk8LyaMqUtaQ9hUShuvFznQYQKR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:456740'),
  ('785850988988149081', 'Hellboy Animated: Blood and Iron', 2007, 'Animation, Fantasy, Horror, Action, Thriller, Science Fiction, TV Movie', 'Victor Cook, Tad Stones', 'Kevin Hopps', 'Ron Perlman, Selma Blair, Doug Jones, John Hurt, Peri Gilpin, J. Grant Albrecht, Jim Cummings, Grey DeLisle', 'NR', 'When Hellboy, Liz Sherman, and Abe Sapien are assigned to investigate the ghost-infested mansion of a publicity-hound billionaire, they uncover a plot to resurrect a beautiful yet monstrous vampire from Professor Bruttenholm’s past. But before they can stop her bloodbath, Hellboy will have to battle harpies, hellhounds, a giant werewolf, and even the ferocious goddess Hecate herself.', 'When Hellboy, Liz Sherman, and Abe Sapien are assigned to investigate the ghost-infested mansion of a publicity-hound billionaire, they uncover a plot to resurrect a beautiful yet monstrous vampire from Professor Bruttenholm’s past. But before they can stop her bloodbath, Hellboy will have to battle harpies, hellhounds, a giant werewolf, and even the ferocious goddess Hecate herself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/itj3KXrYL6iSa7eBDLYIVWZuZtW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13204'),
  ('828318704290884121', 'Hellboy Animated: Iron Shoes', 2007, 'Action, Horror, Fantasy, Animation, Science Fiction', 'Victor Cook', 'Tad Stones', 'Ron Perlman, Dan Castellaneta, Mike Mignola', 'PG', 'In Ireland in 1961, Hellboy enters a ruined tower and is attacked by Iron Shoes.', 'In Ireland in 1961, Hellboy enters a ruined tower and is attacked by Iron Shoes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/LhrfZWjdeI44t2sLg1bUZtYCAb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:154207'),
  ('429031438936489845', 'Hellboy Animated: Sword of Storms', 2006, 'Science Fiction, Animation, Fantasy, Action, Horror, Adventure, Thriller, TV Movie', 'Phil Weinstein, Tad Stones, Art Vitello', 'Karen Inwood Somers, Tad Stones, Matthew Waynee', 'Ron Perlman, Selma Blair, Doug Jones, Peri Gilpin, Gwendoline Yeo, Dee Bradley Baker, Phil LaMarr, Mitchell Whitfield', 'PG', 'A folklore professor becomes unwittingly possessed by the ancient Japanese demons of Thunder and Lightning. But when The Bureau of Paranormal Research & Defense dispatches a team of agents to investigate, a cursed samurai sword sends Hellboy to a supernatural dimension of ghosts, monsters, and feudal mayhem. Now while pyrokinetic Liz Sherman and fishboy Abe Sapien battle one very pissed-off dragon, a lost and cranky Hellboy must find his way home.', 'A folklore professor becomes unwittingly possessed by the ancient Japanese demons of Thunder and Lightning. But when The Bureau of Paranormal Research & Defense dispatches a team of agents to investigate, a cursed samurai sword sends Hellboy to a supernatural dimension of ghosts, monsters, and feudal mayhem. Now while pyrokinetic Liz Sherman and fishboy Abe Sapien battle one very pissed-off dragon, a lost and cranky Hellboy must find his way home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vUCrcikFCDsvA6IiS59kdfQkseU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16774'),
  ('175475307387653901', 'Hellboy II: The Golden Army', 2008, 'Fantasy, Action', 'Cliff Lanning, Guillermo del Toro, Guillermo Navarro', 'Guillermo del Toro', 'Ron Perlman, Selma Blair, Doug Jones, John Alexander, Seth MacFarlane, Luke Goss, Anna Walton, Jeffrey Tambor', 'PG-13', 'Hellboy, his pyrokinetic girlfriend, Liz, and aquatic empath, Abe Sapien, face their biggest battle when an underworld elven prince plans to reclaim Earth for his magical kindred. Tired of living in the shadow of humans, Prince Nuada tries to awaken an ancient force of killing machines, the all-powerful Golden Army, to clear the way for fantasy creatures to roam free. Only Hellboy can stop the dark prince and prevent humanity''s annihilation.', 'Hellboy, his pyrokinetic girlfriend, Liz, and aquatic empath, Abe Sapien, face their biggest battle when an underworld elven prince plans to reclaim Earth for his magical kindred. Tired of living in the shadow of humans, Prince Nuada tries to awaken an ancient force of killing machines, the all-powerful Golden Army, to clear the way for fantasy creatures to roam free. Only Hellboy can stop the dark prince and prevent humanity''s annihilation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zO0Wdrxnhx3KoJEvychSmnY3urC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11253'),
  ('373376325233629835', 'Hellboy: The Crooked Man', 2024, 'Fantasy, Horror, Action', 'Brian Taylor, Ivan Vatsov, Mark Roper', 'Christopher Golden, Mike Mignola, Brian Taylor', 'Jack Kesy, Jefferson White, Adeline Rudolph, Leah McNamara, Hannah Margetson, Martin Bassindale, Joseph Marcell, Suzanne Bertish', 'R', 'Hellboy and a rookie BPRD agent get stranded in 1950s rural Appalachia. There, they discover a small community haunted by witches, led by a local devil with a troubling connection to Hellboy''s past: the Crooked Man.', 'Hellboy and a rookie BPRD agent get stranded in 1950s rural Appalachia. There, they discover a small community haunted by witches, led by a local devil with a troubling connection to Hellboy''s past: the Crooked Man.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iz2GabtToVB05gLTVSH7ZvFtsMM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1087822'),
  ('1148432597625249953', 'Hellcats', 2008, 'Drama, Romance', 'Kwon Chil-in', 'Hyeon-su Kim, Kim Soo-ah, Park Hye-ryun', 'Lee Mi-sook, Kim Min-hee, An So-hee, Kim Heung-soo, Kim Sung-su, Yoon Hee-seok, Kang Hae-In, Kim Bum', null, 'A screenwriter dreams of success and has a boyfriend who is a member of an unsuccessful rock band. Her sister, an interior designer, meets an actor she falls for. Her niece is trying to figure out how to get her first kiss from her boyfriend. Three stories about life and dating.', 'A screenwriter dreams of success and has a boyfriend who is a member of an unsuccessful rock band. Her sister, an interior designer, meets an actor she falls for. Her niece is trying to figure out how to get her first kiss from her boyfriend. Three stories about life and dating.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gtkd8hTQ4lurIWI7fArRm9CJOLW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55788'),
  ('31674121806851006', 'Hellcats of the Navy', 1957, 'War, Drama, Thriller', 'Nathan Juran, Irving Lippman', 'Bernard Gordon, David Lang', 'Ronald Reagan, Nancy Reagan, Arthur Franz, Robert Arthur, William Leslie, William Phillips, Harry Lauter, Michael Garth', 'NR', 'Future "first couple" Ronald Reagan and Nancy Davis made their only joint film appearance in Hellcats of the Navy. Ronnie plays Casey Abbott, commander of a WW2 submarine, while Nancy portrays navy nurse Helen Blair, Abbott''s off-and-on girlfriend. During a delicate mission in which his sub is ordered to retrieve a revolutionary new Japanese mine, Abbott is forced to leave frogman Wes Barton (Harry Lauter) behind to save the rest of his crew. But Abbott''s second-in-command Don Landon (Eduard Franz) is convinced that Abbott''s sacrifice of Barton was due to the fact that the dead man had been amorously pursuing Helen.', 'Future "first couple" Ronald Reagan and Nancy Davis made their only joint film appearance in Hellcats of the Navy. Ronnie plays Casey Abbott, commander of a WW2 submarine, while Nancy portrays navy nurse Helen Blair, Abbott''s off-and-on girlfriend. During a delicate mission in which his sub is ordered to retrieve a revolutionary new Japanese mine, Abbott is forced to leave frogman Wes Barton (Harry Lauter) behind to save the rest of his crew. But Abbott''s second-in-command Don Landon (Eduard Franz) is convinced that Abbott''s sacrifice of Barton was due to the fact that the dead man had been amorously pursuing Helen.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sdt2fdPjhX2NhfpZtRtRPDX65J6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:82181'),
  ('1051156635289908109', 'Helldriver', 2010, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Yoshihiro Nishimura, Isao Karasawa, Hiroshi Ota', 'Yoshihiro Nishimura, Daichi Nagisa', 'Yumiko Hara, Eihi Shiina, Yûrei Yanagi, Kazuki Namioka, Kentaro Kishi, Mizuki Kusumi, Takumi Saitoh, Asami', null, 'Still reeling from the events of a zombie apocalypse, a young woman, along with a group of allies, makes her way across a dystopian Japan in search of her mother, the Zombie Queen.', 'Still reeling from the events of a zombie apocalypse, a young woman, along with a group of allies, makes her way across a dystopian Japan in search of her mother, the Zombie Queen.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8h6meSgpHvRwEOxbWoYoyUDHNhT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:76216'),
  ('735767851519325666', 'Heller in Pink Tights', 1960, 'Adventure, Romance, Western', 'George Cukor, Harold Lipstein, Charles C. Coleman', 'Dudley Nichols, Walter Bernstein', 'Sophia Loren, Anthony Quinn, Margaret O''Brien, Steve Forrest, Eileen Heckart, Ramon Novarro, Edmund Lowe, George Mathews', 'NR', 'Nineteenth century Wyoming: the wild West. Mild-mannered Tom Healy has a two-wagon theater troupe hounded by creditors because Angela, his leading lady and the object of his affection, constantly buys clothes. In Cheyenne, they meet with applause, so they hope to stay awhile: the theater owner likes Angela, and she keeps him on a string. She''s also the object of the attentions of Mabry, a gunslinger who''s owed money by the richest man in Bonanza.', 'Nineteenth century Wyoming: the wild West. Mild-mannered Tom Healy has a two-wagon theater troupe hounded by creditors because Angela, his leading lady and the object of his affection, constantly buys clothes. In Cheyenne, they meet with applause, so they hope to stay awhile: the theater owner likes Angela, and she keeps him on a string. She''s also the object of the attentions of Mabry, a gunslinger who''s owed money by the richest man in Bonanza.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A3H1Z6Oo4ZfI8rBcL0qju7ZanPY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43035'),
  ('75885921496908261', 'Hellevator: The Bottled Fools', 2004, 'Science Fiction, Horror', 'Hiroki Yamaguchi', 'Hiroki Yamaguchi', 'Lukino Fujisaki, Yoshiichi Kawada, Ryôsuke Koshiba, Kae Minami, Ikuma Saisho, Masato Tsujioka, Keisuke Urushizaki, Kôji Yokokawa', null, 'Luchino''s routine morning elevator ride up from her subterranean home on level 138 to her school many stories above turns horrific when the elevator operator is ordered to pick up two passengers from floor 99, the maximum security level. What starts as psychological manipulation soon turns wholly physical as both the cruel convicts and Luchino''s own dysfunctional past are unleashed. And then every passenger must fight for his or her survival.', 'Luchino''s routine morning elevator ride up from her subterranean home on level 138 to her school many stories above turns horrific when the elevator operator is ordered to pick up two passengers from floor 99, the maximum security level. What starts as psychological manipulation soon turns wholly physical as both the cruel convicts and Luchino''s own dysfunctional past are unleashed. And then every passenger must fight for his or her survival.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1dr7hmURza1r2Dxhit2wraeFkJX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49037'),
  ('557982897499863246', 'Hellfighters', 1968, 'Action, Adventure, Romance', 'Andrew V. McLaglen, William H. Clothier, Robert Berry', 'Clair Huffaker', 'John Wayne, Katharine Ross, Jim Hutton, Vera Miles, Jay C. Flippen, Bruce Cabot, Edward Faulkner, Edmund Hashim', 'G', 'The adventures of oil well fire specialist Chance Buckman (based on real-life Red Adair), who extinguishes massive fires in oil fields around the world.', 'The adventures of oil well fire specialist Chance Buckman (based on real-life Red Adair), who extinguishes massive fires in oil fields around the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qTGlUtaxYgfVJGTA04gEov2EJwd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32726'),
  ('668847480903926869', 'Hellfire', 1949, 'Western', 'Jack A. Marta, Dick Moder, R.G. Springsteen', 'Stuart E. McGowan, Dorrell McGowan', 'Bill Elliott, Marie Windsor, Forrest Tucker, Jim Davis, H.B. Warner, Paul Fix, Grant Withers, Emory Parnell', 'NR', 'Zeb Smith is a gambler with a larcenous streak, but when an itinerant preacher takes a bullet meant for him, Zeb vows to fulfill the preacher''s mission of building a church. Frustrated in his attempts to get donations, Zeb attempts to capture fugitive Doll Brown in order to obtain the reward. But he finds that there''s more to Doll than meets the eye. When his old friend Bucky McLean shows up gunning for Doll, Zeb sees a chance to redeem them all... one way or another.', 'Zeb Smith is a gambler with a larcenous streak, but when an itinerant preacher takes a bullet meant for him, Zeb vows to fulfill the preacher''s mission of building a church. Frustrated in his attempts to get donations, Zeb attempts to capture fugitive Doll Brown in order to obtain the reward. But he finds that there''s more to Doll than meets the eye. When his old friend Bucky McLean shows up gunning for Doll, Zeb sees a chance to redeem them all... one way or another.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zaY52748aNERUGEu0QB8zJv3Ls7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:177254'),
  ('498278771396511778', 'Hellfire', 1995, 'Horror, Thriller, TV Movie', 'David Tausik, Evgeniy Korzhenkov, Alexander Zelenkov', 'Louis Morneau', 'Ben Cross, Jennifer Burns, Beverly Garland, Doug Wert, Lev Prygunov, Vladimir Kuleshov, Yekaterina Rednikova', 'PG-13', 'Gabriella finds an unfinished symphony that was written by her late uncle Octave Barron who found inspiration through murder. Thrilled by it''s possibilities she hires Marius (Ben Cross) to complete the symphony. As he begins work on the piece he finds himself stuck in a bizarre murdering cycle handed down from the original composer.', 'Gabriella finds an unfinished symphony that was written by her late uncle Octave Barron who found inspiration through murder. Thrilled by it''s possibilities she hires Marius (Ben Cross) to complete the symphony. As he begins work on the piece he finds himself stuck in a bizarre murdering cycle handed down from the original composer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9UgbSLZI9J8dudLatyuxEUBtuWr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:213281'),
  ('734762733232545304', 'Hellfire', 2026, 'Action, Thriller', 'Isaac Florentine, Ross W. Clarkson', 'Richard Lowry', 'Stephen Lang, Harvey Keitel, Scottie Thompson, Dolph Lundgren, Chris Mullinax, Michael Sirow, Johnny Yong Bosch, Maurice Compte', 'R', 'A drifter with a mysterious past arrives in a small town and finds the residents in the grip of a ruthless crime boss and realizes he has to help them.', 'A drifter with a mysterious past arrives in a small town and finds the residents in the grip of a ruthless crime boss and realizes he has to help them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tQti9QTf13MfzNpXguijgNh7ojE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1088434'),
  ('612566621111352882', 'Hellgate', 1989, 'Comedy, Horror', 'William A. Levey, Peter Palmér', 'Michael S. O''Rourke', 'Ron Palillo, Abigail Wolcott, Carel Trichardt, Petrea Curran, Evan J. Klisser, Joanne Warde, Frank Notaro, Lance Vaughan', 'R', 'A motorcycle gang kidnaps a young woman, Josie, from a diner and brutally kills her. Many years later, the girl''s father finds a magic crystal that can bring the life back to dead objects. He uses it to re-animate his daughter. He lets her seduce any young man that comes to visit the small town and then kills them. Four young students, two boys and two girls spend a vacation near the town, Hellgate. They hear about the story and get involved.', 'A motorcycle gang kidnaps a young woman, Josie, from a diner and brutally kills her. Many years later, the girl''s father finds a magic crystal that can bring the life back to dead objects. He uses it to re-animate his daughter. He lets her seduce any young man that comes to visit the small town and then kills them. Four young students, two boys and two girls spend a vacation near the town, Hellgate. They hear about the story and get involved.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/exIf15lOtbcrRFFmkchcoxsWrwE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:83613'),
  ('362509535193938194', 'Hellhole', 1985, 'Horror, Action, Drama, Thriller', 'Pierre De Moro, Gary Barlough, Stephen L. Posey', 'Aaron Butler', 'Ray Sharkey, Judy Landers, Mary Woronov, Marjoe Gortner, Richard Cox, Edy Williams, Terry Moore, Robert Z''Dar', 'R', 'An unlucky woman’s mother is murdered by a scarf-wielding killer named Silk, leaving the woman injured, traumatised and suffering from amnesia. She’s committed to a mental institution, where Silk follows her, looking for the papers he was trying to get from her mother. And Silk’s only the beginning of her problems, since the asylum is run by a mad doctor, performing experiments in chemical lobotomies!', 'An unlucky woman’s mother is murdered by a scarf-wielding killer named Silk, leaving the woman injured, traumatised and suffering from amnesia. She’s committed to a mental institution, where Silk follows her, looking for the papers he was trying to get from her mother. And Silk’s only the beginning of her problems, since the asylum is run by a mad doctor, performing experiments in chemical lobotomies!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g6wm2BVwIjgFoi2ylT2EmksM1Ry.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28734'),
  ('369120162422176830', 'Hellhole', 2022, 'Horror, Mystery', 'Ernest Walczyński, Agnieszka Gryżewska, Radosław Ochnio', 'Bartosz M. Kowalski, Mirella Zaradkiewicz', 'Piotr Żurawski, Olaf Lubaszenko, Sebastian Stankiewicz, Lech Dyblik, Rafał Iwaniuk, Krzysztof Satała, Malwina Dubowska, Zbigniew Waleryś', 'R', 'In a monastery cut off from the world, the monks run a clinic for the possessed. One day, a young policeman Marek comes to the convent. Posing as a clergyman, he penetrates monastic life and tries to explain the recent, mysterious disappearance of several tormented inmates. It turns out, however, that there is no way out of the monastery.', 'In a monastery cut off from the world, the monks run a clinic for the possessed. One day, a young policeman Marek comes to the convent. Posing as a clergyman, he penetrates monastic life and tries to explain the recent, mysterious disappearance of several tormented inmates. It turns out, however, that there is no way out of the monastery.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y47wBamj9vdqBeGaLEFTrYEPTeC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1032950'),
  ('430834587229811721', 'Hellhound', 2024, 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 'Joshua Dixon', 'Niccolo De La Fere', 'Louis Mandylor, Vithaya Pansringarm, Van Quattro, Panya Yimmumphai, Winai Wiangyangkung, Salita Klinchan, Jennie Pines, Jakrin Jaruthongchai', 'R', 'Ready to leave his profession behind, Loreno, an assassin, lends help to an old friend, Cetan, and taking one last job in Thailand seeking out a local kingpin. A lapse in judgment means Loreno crosses paths with old colleague Paul.', 'Ready to leave his profession behind, Loreno, an assassin, lends help to an old friend, Cetan, and taking one last job in Thailand seeking out a local kingpin. A lapse in judgment means Loreno crosses paths with old colleague Paul.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f9hkaCIha8hIhRo0XXShhcosrPH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1217379'),
  ('246318593430883123', 'Hellion', 2014, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Brett Pawlak, Kat Candler', 'Kat Candler', 'Aaron Paul, Juliette Lewis, Josh Wiggins, Deke Garner, Jonny Mars, Walt Roberts, Dalton Sutton, Camron Owens', 'R', 'When motocross and heavy metal obsessed, 13-year-old Jacob''s delinquent behavior forces CPS to place his little brother Wes with his aunt, Jacob and his emotionally absent father must finally take responsibility for their actions and each other in order to bring Wes home.', 'When motocross and heavy metal obsessed, 13-year-old Jacob''s delinquent behavior forces CPS to place his little brother Wes with his aunt, Jacob and his emotionally absent father must finally take responsibility for their actions and each other in order to bring Wes home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7jfSzQumy9o28Scbfs3ENf32NRt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:244536'),
  ('235296292433167008', 'Hellions', 2015, 'Horror', 'Bruce McDonald, Norayr Kasper', 'Pascal Trottier', 'Chloe Rose, Rachel Wilson, Rossif Sutherland, Peter DaCunha, Robert Patrick, Luke Bilyk, Sydney Cross', null, 'A teen faces a night of terror when three malevolent trick-or-treaters come knocking at her door.', 'A teen faces a night of terror when three malevolent trick-or-treaters come knocking at her door.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hFIimZOCMyoQvbGnz0gntgcbYVm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:241927'),
  ('141617662316919213', 'Hellish Flesh', 1977, 'Horror, Thriller', 'José Mojica Marins, Giorgio Attili', 'Rubens Francisco Lucchetti', 'José Mojica Marins, Luely Figueiró, Oswaldo De Souza, Helena Ramos, Lirio Bertelli, France Mary, Mauro Russo, Cristina Andréia', null, 'Dr. George Medeiros, a brilliant scientist, is badly disfigured when his wife takes a lover and plans to murder him. After months in the hospital, he returns with nothing in mind but revenge.', 'Dr. George Medeiros, a brilliant scientist, is badly disfigured when his wife takes a lover and plans to murder him. After months in the hospital, he returns with nothing in mind but revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tPKxXpewj17GjrKc2BUy8QK4DV4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:113488'),
  ('128000539405113533', 'Hellish Spiders', 1968, 'Science Fiction, Action, Horror', 'Federico Curiel, Eduardo Valdés', 'Luis Enrique Vergara, Adolfo Torres Portillo', 'Blue Demon, Blanca Sánchez, Martha Elena Cervantes, Ramón Bugarini, Fernando Osés, Nathanael León, Sergio Virel, Jessica Munguía', null, 'Arácnea''s residents have been desperately searching for a source of food to save the life of their queen (a big spider). Earth is chosen, since human brains are apparently like health food for alien spiders.', 'Arácnea''s residents have been desperately searching for a source of food to save the life of their queen (a big spider). Earth is chosen, since human brains are apparently like health food for alien spiders.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/knZkgrrrKiLtr7sGM1yj8kg60z3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:110092'),
  ('365314288691971897', 'HellKat', 2021, 'Action, Thriller, Horror', 'Ben Collin, Michael Hoad, Hannah Moore', 'Michele Pacitto, Jordan Rockwell', 'Abi Casson Thompson, Adrian Bouchet, Sarah T. Cohen, Ricardo Freitas, Richard D. Myers, Ryan Davies, Serhat Metin, Frances Katz', null, 'A fallen MMA fighter must win a netherworld no-holds-barred death tournament against man, beast and demon to save her soul.', 'A fallen MMA fighter must win a netherworld no-holds-barred death tournament against man, beast and demon to save her soul.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sNUQVeU78lVomwC7bR8SyCRnjdg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:786573'),
  ('242441992184395367', 'Hellmaster', 1992, 'Horror', 'Michael Goi, Douglas Schulze', 'Douglas Schulze', 'John Saxon, David Emge, Amy Raasch, Jeff Rector, Ron Asheton, Todd Tesen, Sean Sweeney, Emile B. Levisetti', null, 'A psychotic college professor uses unwitting students as laboratory rats, injecting them with a drug that mutates them into gory killers', 'A psychotic college professor uses unwitting students as laboratory rats, injecting them with a drug that mutates them into gory killers', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8UreyrVc3cnPP1G2LPo7QtzBBl4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:148991'),
  ('932096506794397902', 'Hello', 1984, 'Animation', 'Faith Hubley', null, null, null, 'Extraterrestrials contact earth in this delightful fable. Their message is "HELLO" in many languages, and there is a celebration.', 'Extraterrestrials contact earth in this delightful fable. Their message is "HELLO" in many languages, and there is a celebration.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nJLwo5owN2ss1eX1I3yEOeKZFpM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:681850'),
  ('522380193764499452', 'Hello', 1999, 'Romance, Drama', 'K. Selvabharathy', null, 'Prashanth, Preeti Jhangiani, Ranjith, Manivannan, Senthil, Charle, Vaiyapuri', null, 'Chandru''s friends make fun of him as he does not have a girlfriend. He points out at a girl claiming that she is his girlfriend, due to which a number of unfortunate events take place in her life.', 'Chandru''s friends make fun of him as he does not have a girlfriend. He points out at a girl claiming that she is his girlfriend, due to which a number of unfortunate events take place in her life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uA8i38ri4MpaWI3Lcy7fnWOIZMK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:277875'),
  ('915495196437461458', 'Hello', 2003, 'Animation, Music', 'Jonathan Nix', 'Jonathan Nix', null, null, 'In a digital world, can analogue find true love? It is the wise old gramaphone who has the answers for a lovesick loner.', 'In a digital world, can analogue find true love? It is the wise old gramaphone who has the answers for a lovesick loner.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vuRdRcQrii8PvoZhHwKlLyst0i2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:351406'),
