  ('954249368523570044', 'HELLO', 2021, 'Drama', 'Christopher Gribbin', 'Christopher Gribbin', 'Kieron Moore, Jim Woodward, Kofi Sharkey, Mark Thompson, Jan Bunner, Liz Winter', null, 'Through a haze of smoke, coke, and booze; possible futures, pasts, and presents coalesce chaos inside the mind of a man drifting directionless through life. When your future calls, what will you have to say?', 'Through a haze of smoke, coke, and booze; possible futures, pasts, and presents coalesce chaos inside the mind of a man drifting directionless through life. When your future calls, what will you have to say?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/137qvAWKLN661ZQ3l1j14tWmU0D.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1101886'),
  ('53626750960222619', 'Hello Again', 1987, 'Fantasy, Comedy, Romance', 'Frank Perry, Jan Weincke', 'Susan Isaacs', 'Shelley Long, Judith Ivey, Gabriel Byrne, Corbin Bernsen, Sela Ward, Austin Pendleton, Carrie Nye, Robert Lewis', 'PG', 'A suburban housewife chokes to death and is brought back to life by a spell cast by her wacky sister.', 'A suburban housewife chokes to death and is brought back to life by a spell cast by her wacky sister.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mbNJ7Qe33XtN2aenO0ildCOpG0y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:35151'),
  ('45891814965586931', 'Hello Again', 2017, 'Music, Drama, Romance', 'Austin Schmidt, Tom Gustafson', 'Cory Krueckeberg', 'Nolan Gerard Funk, Martha Plimpton, Sam Underwood, Jenna Ushkowitz, Al Calderon, Rumer Willis, T. R. Knight, Tyler Blackburn', 'NR', 'Ten lost souls slip in and out of one another''s arms in a daisy-chained musical exploration of love''s bittersweet embrace. A film adaptation of Michael John LaChiusa''s celebrated musical, originally based on Arthur Schnitzler''s play, La Ronde.', 'Ten lost souls slip in and out of one another''s arms in a daisy-chained musical exploration of love''s bittersweet embrace. A film adaptation of Michael John LaChiusa''s celebrated musical, originally based on Arthur Schnitzler''s play, La Ronde.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bHHt3HIr7MpYiRSw1XNxZm3B3cn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:446289'),
  ('1092797194900665793', 'Hello Again - A Wedding A Day', 2020, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Marc Achenbach, Korbinian Wandinger, Maggie Peren', 'Maggie Peren', 'Alicia von Rittberg, Edin Hasanović, Tim Oliver Schultz, Emilia Schüle, Samuel Schneider, Amelie Plaas-Link, Nina Gummich, Jule Ronstedt', null, 'Zazie lives with her buddies, womanizer Patrick and sweetheart Anton, in a flat share. All three are completely incapable of being in a relationship. Finding the great love? No need. Zazie is sure of that. When Philipp, Zazie''s best friend from childhood, sends an invitation to his wedding, Zazie is shocked to find out that he wants to marry stuck up and vicious Franziska. She is definitely the wrong girl for Philipp! Zazie decides to do everything she can to save him from making the biggest mistake of his life. But will this turn out to be her own path to happiness?', 'Zazie lives with her buddies, womanizer Patrick and sweetheart Anton, in a flat share. All three are completely incapable of being in a relationship. Finding the great love? No need. Zazie is sure of that. When Philipp, Zazie''s best friend from childhood, sends an invitation to his wedding, Zazie is shocked to find out that he wants to marry stuck up and vicious Franziska. She is definitely the wrong girl for Philipp! Zazie decides to do everything she can to save him from making the biggest mistake of his life. But will this turn out to be her own path to happiness?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4WEyVfO7r17GDcHJ9VUTnXYamcC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:734622'),
  ('233829143823477282', 'Hello Aloha', 1952, 'Animation', 'Jack Kinney', null, 'Pinto Colvig, Harry Owens', null, 'In the city, Goofy finds his daily job much too stressful so he decides to leave this hustle and bustle for a more peaceful life in the tropics. He finds life there most enjoyable collecting shells from the beach, making a hut in which to live, getting back to nature, and even joining in the big luau feast (with meals such as shark fin soup). Yes, Goofy thinks nothing can go wrong in this paradise...until the natives need to sacrifice someone to their volcano.', 'In the city, Goofy finds his daily job much too stressful so he decides to leave this hustle and bustle for a more peaceful life in the tropics. He finds life there most enjoyable collecting shells from the beach, making a hut in which to live, getting back to nature, and even joining in the big luau feast (with meals such as shark fin soup). Yes, Goofy thinks nothing can go wrong in this paradise...until the natives need to sacrifice someone to their volcano.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h8mfu0RQFPunEoVpjOaY4XIqJli.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:66874'),
  ('250751736728062685', 'Hello Beautiful', 2022, 'Comedy', 'Agostino Castiglioni, Gennaro Nunziante', 'Gennaro Nunziante, Amedeo Grieco, Pio D''Antini', 'Pio D''Antini, Amedeo Grieco, Lorena Cacciatore, Rosa Diletta Rossi, Gegia, Nicasio Catanese, Giorgio Colangeli, Adriano De Pasquale', null, 'Pio and Amedeo are inseparable friends, or at least they were until they graduated from high school, at which point each one was faced with the question: move up north or stay in the south?', 'Pio and Amedeo are inseparable friends, or at least they were until they graduated from high school, at which point each one was faced with the question: move up north or stay in the south?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xxnwN2utMmGuYhwdEfy4LDvhi1U.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:773820'),
  ('458001412370294510', 'Hello Brother', 1994, 'Romance, Comedy', 'E.V.V. Satyanarayana, S. Gopala Reddy', 'L. B. Sriram', 'Nagarjuna Akkineni, Soundarya, Ramya Krishnan, Srihari, Kota Srinivasa Rao, Brahmanandam, Ali Basha, Sarath Babu', null, 'A couple has twin sons with reflection mentality but one of the sons is abducted and left on the road by a criminal. Both brothers grow up with different personalities and when they cross each other''s path misunderstanding arises.', 'A couple has twin sons with reflection mentality but one of the sons is abducted and left on the road by a criminal. Both brothers grow up with different personalities and when they cross each other''s path misunderstanding arises.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f2BLnilf2ELTA1riVFB7GCr8Qse.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:496698'),
