  ('808546143485749071', 'Hello Charlie', 2021, 'Adventure, Comedy', 'Manohar Verma, Andre Menezes, Pankaj Saraswat', 'Abhishek Khairkar', 'Aadar Jain, Shlokka Pandit, Elnaaz Norouzi, Jackie Shroff, Darshan Jariwala, Rajpal Yadav, Girish Kulkarni, Bharat Ganeshpure', null, 'Charlie, a simpleton daydreamer, currently a pizza delivery boy is tasked with driving his uncle''s truck , Girnaar Express, to deliver a gorilla from Mumbai to the jetty at Diu. However, Charlie is unaware that Gorilla is disguised business tycoon MD Makwana, who is on the run after committing a multi-crore scam.', 'Charlie, a simpleton daydreamer, currently a pizza delivery boy is tasked with driving his uncle''s truck , Girnaar Express, to deliver a gorilla from Mumbai to the jetty at Diu. However, Charlie is unaware that Gorilla is disguised business tycoon MD Makwana, who is on the run after committing a multi-crore scam.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8dhYgQ0nsFRIIXOKBNHW0hUTDyN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:807072'),
  ('249875343323756026', 'Hello Cubans', 1963, 'Documentary', 'Agnès Varda, Agnès Varda', 'Agnès Varda', 'Michel Piccoli, Agnès Varda, Rosalie Varda, Fidel Castro, Alejo Carpentier, Juan Almeida, Raúl Castro, Tomás Gutiérrez Alea', null, 'A photo montage of Cubans filmed by Agnès Varda during her visit to Cuba in 1963, four years after Fidel Castro came to power. This black & white documentary explores their socialist culture and society while making use of 1500 pictures (out of 4000!) the filmmaker took while on the island.', 'A photo montage of Cubans filmed by Agnès Varda during her visit to Cuba in 1963, four years after Fidel Castro came to power. This black & white documentary explores their socialist culture and society while making use of 1500 pictures (out of 4000!) the filmmaker took while on the island.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lsFFLB1dPQVyGRAiaFTPPkynDoE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:144599'),
