  ('793334433565101744', 'Hello Dracula 2: Son of the Vampire', 1987, 'Comedy, Horror, Fantasy, Adventure', 'Ricky Cheng Tien-Chi, Hui Bo-Chuen, Lu Feng', 'Su Kuang-hsun', 'Chin Tu, Shadow Liu Chih-Yuh, Pang San, Lin Kuang-Yung, Hong Ching-Yuan, Chung-Yu Huang, Johnny Liu, Wong Chung-Yue', null, 'A priest, a nun and a showman sneaks into the morgue and sees a dancing vampire and catches it. It all lead to an assault and abduction of Tien Tien.', 'A priest, a nun and a showman sneaks into the morgue and sees a dancing vampire and catches it. It all lead to an assault and abduction of Tien Tien.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lMUeVnCru8jjOXDAF8i6WV6fsxQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:105754'),
  ('1067588530718281897', 'Hello Ghost', 2010, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance, Family', 'Kim Yeong-tak, Choi Sang-muk, Lee Sung-jae', 'Kim Yeong-tak', 'Cha Tae-hyun, Kang Ye-won, Lee Moon-su, Ko Chang-seok, Jang Young-nam, Cheon Bo-geun, Jeong Gyu-su, Goo Seung-hyun', null, 'A man''s failed suicide attempt enables him to see ghosts, who later keep following him everywhere. It is now up to him to fulfill their wishes to make them go away.', 'A man''s failed suicide attempt enables him to see ghosts, who later keep following him everywhere. It is now up to him to fulfill their wishes to make them go away.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eABJoKMxXky1R13aR2E9It90Djm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:62439'),
  ('330629535902406896', 'Hello Ghost!', 2023, 'Comedy, Family, Drama', 'Hsieh Pei-ju, Jake Pollock, Hong Shi-hao', 'Chou Ching-Wen', 'Tseng Jing-hua, Ivy Shao, Lu Yi-ching, Chang Tsai-hsing, Tsai Jia-yin, Hung Chun-hao, Bai Jing-yi, Xie Kun-da', null, 'After a failed attempt to take his own life, a man discovers he''s returned with four ghosts seeking to fulfil their last wishes in hopes of earning his own place in the afterlife.', 'After a failed attempt to take his own life, a man discovers he''s returned with four ghosts seeking to fulfil their last wishes in hopes of earning his own place in the afterlife.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cYk5a01m3HM06rt1QgV5khuWrSe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:993092'),
  ('1051088685865728871', 'Hello Goodbye', 2008, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Graham Guit, Gérard Sterin', 'Michael Lellouche', 'Gérard Depardieu, Fanny Ardant, Jean Benguigui, Lior Ashkenazi, Gilles Gaston-Dreyfus, Manu Payet, Jean-Michel Lahmi, Clémentine Poidatz', null, 'French film icons Gérard Depardieu and Fanny Ardant star in this romantic comedy about a Parisian couple in their fifties who share a comfortable life, a beautiful home, a posh country club and a midlife crisis. Following a dream vacation to Israel where Alain (Depardieu) explores his Jewish roots, Gisèle (Ardant) insists they change their life and move to Tel Aviv. While Gisèle, a Jewish convert, finds her new life inspiring; Alain fights to embrace Hebrew, Jewish tradition and a new circumcision. Will Alain and Gisèle learn whether Shalom represents Hello or Goodbye?', 'French film icons Gérard Depardieu and Fanny Ardant star in this romantic comedy about a Parisian couple in their fifties who share a comfortable life, a beautiful home, a posh country club and a midlife crisis. Following a dream vacation to Israel where Alain (Depardieu) explores his Jewish roots, Gisèle (Ardant) insists they change their life and move to Tel Aviv. While Gisèle, a Jewish convert, finds her new life inspiring; Alain fights to embrace Hebrew, Jewish tradition and a new circumcision. Will Alain and Gisèle learn whether Shalom represents Hello or Goodbye?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9A1c3QC6z673oaeJr9FMr5Mi2bl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18400'),
  ('710705487189110475', 'Hello Herman', 2013, 'Drama', 'Michelle Danner', 'John Buffalo Mailer', 'Norman Reedus, Garrett Backstrom, Martha Higareda, Rob Estes, Sabrina Debler, Andy McPhee, Olivia Faye, Jake White', null, 'Set in the not so distant future, in Any Town USA, sixteen-years-old Herman Howards makes a fateful decision. He enters his suburban school and kills thirty nine students, two teachers, and a police officer. Just before his arrest, he emails his idol, famous journalist Lax Morales, sending him clips of the shootings captured with Herman''s own digital camera. In the clips Herman tells Lax, "I want to tell my story on your show". Lax, haunted by his own past, is now face to face with Herman.', 'Set in the not so distant future, in Any Town USA, sixteen-years-old Herman Howards makes a fateful decision. He enters his suburban school and kills thirty nine students, two teachers, and a police officer. Just before his arrest, he emails his idol, famous journalist Lax Morales, sending him clips of the shootings captured with Herman''s own digital camera. In the clips Herman tells Lax, "I want to tell my story on your show". Lax, haunted by his own past, is now face to face with Herman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nbG49b8cPgUBIC1k41o5LiUVDqq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:138977'),
  ('369218593298471061', 'Hello I Must Be Going', 2012, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Julie Kirkwood, Todd Louiso', 'Sarah Koskoff', 'Melanie Lynskey, Blythe Danner, John Rubinstein, Sara Chase, Daniel Eric Gold, Tori Feinstein, Dave T. Koenig, Greta Lee', 'R', 'An affair with a 19-year old actor helps reinvigorate life for thirty-something Amy after she moves home to her parents’ house following her divorce.', 'An affair with a 19-year old actor helps reinvigorate life for thirty-something Amy after she moves home to her parents’ house following her divorce.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p1LzTkVUB9nMPumPan2WchqtKKE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84281'),
