  ('408496912957785853', 'Hello Murderer', 2010, 'Comedy, Thriller', 'Kim Dong-uk', 'Kim Dong-uk', 'Kim Dong-wook, Yu Oh-seong, Kim Eung-soo, Shim Eun-kyung, Lee Mi-do, Song Ok-suk', null, 'Slacker detective Jeong-min (Kim Dong-wuk) is assigned to investigate a serial killer case. For the first time in his career he puts his heart into his work but Yeong-seok (Yoo Oh-seong), an unemployed man with natural instincts as a detective, gets in the way by trying to catch the killer as well.', 'Slacker detective Jeong-min (Kim Dong-wuk) is assigned to investigate a serial killer case. For the first time in his career he puts his heart into his work but Yeong-seok (Yoo Oh-seong), an unemployed man with natural instincts as a detective, gets in the way by trying to catch the killer as well.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zO3GxZtZotUoXH9R80kr1Wjx2k8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:57264'),
  ('181218234982132107', 'Hello My Love', 2009, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Aaron Kim, Kim Tae-sung', 'Aaron Kim, Ji-eun Kim', 'Jo An, Oh Min-suk, Ryu Sang-wook, Yang Eun-yong, Lee Jong-won, Lee Kyeong-shil, Jeong Mi-Seong, Ah-ryeong Min', null, 'Ho-jung is a scriptwriter in a local radio station. She is waiting for her 30th birthday and also eager to be promoted as a DJ of her own program. One day, she hears that Won-jae, her old flame, will be back to town again after 2 years studying in France. With a dream of getting married with him, Ho-jung is getting excited.', 'Ho-jung is a scriptwriter in a local radio station. She is waiting for her 30th birthday and also eager to be promoted as a DJ of her own program. One day, she hears that Won-jae, her old flame, will be back to town again after 2 years studying in France. With a dream of getting married with him, Ho-jung is getting excited.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vo3d2ElnA3J8v1kHDaAdd37lyfS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:91623'),
