  ('869579527554356690', 'Hello Stranger', 2010, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Nalina Chayasombat, Weerachai Yaikwawong, Niramon Ross', 'Chantavit Dhanasevi, Banjong Pisanthanakun, Nontra Kumwong', 'Chantavit Dhanasevi, Nuengthida Sophon, Warattaya Nilkuha, Nattapong Chatpong, Pongsatorn Jongwilas, Attharut Kongrasri, Natkrita Rummanu, Necha Khoovatanapaisal', null, 'Two strangers meet in South Korea, each on a vacation. When he misses his tour bus, he asks a woman if he can hang out with her for a few days. They have fun together, but never tell each other their names. So when the trip is over they don''t know how to contact each other.', 'Two strangers meet in South Korea, each on a vacation. When he misses his tour bus, he asks a woman if he can hang out with her for a few days. They have fun together, but never tell each other their names. So when the trip is over they don''t know how to contact each other.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ypaXllTlLV9tFsJkLX7674isxk9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50938'),
  ('1143577966100087772', 'Hello World', 2019, 'Animation, Romance, Science Fiction, Drama', 'Yoshikazu Iwanami, Yoshiki Obata, Tomohiko Ito', 'Mado Nozaki', 'Takumi Kitamura, Tori Matsuzaka, Minami Hamabe, Haruka Fukuhara, Minako Kotobuki, Rie Kugimiya, Takehito Koyasu, Moka Hiraguri', null, 'A shy high schooler in Kyoto meets a man claiming to be his future self, who tells him he’s hacked into the past to save their first love.', 'A shy high schooler in Kyoto meets a man claiming to be his future self, who tells him he’s hacked into the past to save their first love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vmizP4G4EWsxNf6PLOvGNaFJ89Y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:604605'),
  ('561294561782859094', 'Hello-Goodbye', 1970, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Henri Decaë, Jean Negulesco', 'Roger Marshall', 'Michael Crawford, Curd Jürgens, Geneviève Gilles, Peter Myers, Ira von Fürstenberg, Mike Marshall, Didier Haudepin, Vivian Pickles', null, 'A car salesman journeys to France and encounters an apparently lonely woman. He immediately begins to successfully woo her only to learn that she is actually a baron''s wife. Fortunately, the baron believes in open marriages and winds up hiring the Englishman to teach his son (from an earlier marriage) everything about automobiles. Meanwhile the car salesman finds himself falling seriously in love with the wife. The baron really doesn''t mind as he himself is involved with another.', 'A car salesman journeys to France and encounters an apparently lonely woman. He immediately begins to successfully woo her only to learn that she is actually a baron''s wife. Fortunately, the baron believes in open marriages and winds up hiring the Englishman to teach his son (from an earlier marriage) everything about automobiles. Meanwhile the car salesman finds himself falling seriously in love with the wife. The baron really doesn''t mind as he himself is involved with another.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8dshIjstWuMsPS0xCSrJsODbqa8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1864'),
  ('850479704018949383', 'Hello, Dolly!', 1969, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Gene Kelly, Harry Stradling Sr.', 'Ernest Lehman', 'Barbra Streisand, Walter Matthau, Michael Crawford, Marianne McAndrew, Danny Lockin, E.J. Peaker, Joyce Ames, Tommy Tune', 'G', 'Dolly Levi is a strong-willed matchmaker who travels to Yonkers, New York in order to see the miserly "well-known unmarried half-a-millionaire" Horace Vandergelder. In doing so, she convinces his niece, his niece''s intended, and Horace''s two clerks to travel to New York City.', 'Dolly Levi is a strong-willed matchmaker who travels to Yonkers, New York in order to see the miserly "well-known unmarried half-a-millionaire" Horace Vandergelder. In doing so, she convinces his niece, his niece''s intended, and Horace''s two clerks to travel to New York City.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aPZOt9BR3gnk1RyX924ySq81S4P.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14030'),
