  ('1062345289285567700', 'Hello, Schoolgirl', 2008, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Ryu Jang-ha, Hong Seung-chul, Cho Sang-yun', 'Ryu Jang-ha, Kim Sae-bom', 'Yoo Ji-tae, Kim Young-woon, Lee Yeon-hee, Chae Jung-an, Sooyoung Choi, Shin Dong-woo, Hwang Seok-jeong, Kim Kang-woo', null, 'Kwon Yeon-woo is a thirty year old low-level civil servant who works in a district office; quite innocent for his age, he has been on numerous blind dates in an unsuccessful bid to find a wife. After moving into a new place, he begins to encounter a high school girl, Soo-yeong, on his way to work every morning, and she begins to develop feelings for him. Meanwhile, Kang Sook has just started working at the district office straight out of high school, and falls head over heels for older woman Kwon Ha-kyeong.', 'Kwon Yeon-woo is a thirty year old low-level civil servant who works in a district office; quite innocent for his age, he has been on numerous blind dates in an unsuccessful bid to find a wife. After moving into a new place, he begins to encounter a high school girl, Soo-yeong, on his way to work every morning, and she begins to develop feelings for him. Meanwhile, Kang Sook has just started working at the district office straight out of high school, and falls head over heels for older woman Kwon Ha-kyeong.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tmuG77YQEoXDQu3ypJadgc8FDmJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40580'),
