  ('405575240977078286', 'Hellzapoppin''', 1941, 'Music, Comedy', 'H. C. Potter, Elwood Bredell, Joseph A. McDonough', 'Nat Perrin, Warren Wilson', 'Ole Olsen, Chic Johnson, Martha Raye, Hugh Herbert, Jane Frazee, Robert Paige, Mischa Auer, Richard Lane', 'NR', 'Olsen and Johnson, a pair of stage comedians, try to turn their play into a movie and bring together a young couple in love, while breaking the fourth wall every step of the way.', 'Olsen and Johnson, a pair of stage comedians, try to turn their play into a movie and bring together a young couple in love, while breaking the fourth wall every step of the way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/O5Ta3URiRglqt1fPi2APCvnb8x.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19136'),
  ('119733299230271273', 'Helmet', 2021, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Milind Jog, Satramm Ramani', 'Rohan Shankar', 'Aparshakti Khurana, Pranutan Bahl, Abhishek Banerjee, Ashish Verma, Ashish Vidhyarthi, Jameel Khan, Saanand Verma, Sharib Hashmi', null, 'Desperate to make some quick money, Lucky and his friends rob an e-commerce company truck. But to their surprise, the looted boxes contain condoms instead of electronic gadgets. They decide to sell them directly to the people, who want the product but are too embarrassed to buy it publicly.', 'Desperate to make some quick money, Lucky and his friends rob an e-commerce company truck. But to their surprise, the looted boxes contain condoms instead of electronic gadgets. They decide to sell them directly to the people, who want the product but are too embarrassed to buy it publicly.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jx0dug8xdAVP6insxW2kBcO2LUO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:862717'),
  ('529496246525886195', 'Helmut Newton: The Bad and the Beautiful', 2020, 'Documentary', 'Gero von Boehm', 'Gero von Boehm', 'Helmut Newton, Isabella Rossellini, Grace Jones, Charlotte Rampling, Anna Wintour, Claudia Schiffer, Catherine Deneuve, Sylvia Gobbel', null, 'Women were clearly at the core of legendary photographer Helmut Newton''s work. The stars of his iconic portraits and fashion editorials – from Catherine Deneuve to Grace Jones, Charlotte Rampling to Isabella Rossellini – finally give their own interpretation of the life and work of this controversial genius. A portrait by the portrayed. Provocative, unconventional, subversive, his depiction of women still sparks the question: were they subjects or objects?', 'Women were clearly at the core of legendary photographer Helmut Newton''s work. The stars of his iconic portraits and fashion editorials – from Catherine Deneuve to Grace Jones, Charlotte Rampling to Isabella Rossellini – finally give their own interpretation of the life and work of this controversial genius. A portrait by the portrayed. Provocative, unconventional, subversive, his depiction of women still sparks the question: were they subjects or objects?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z5RAovjOwTlFWY5Mi0FWYZrw9NA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:698369'),
  ('475328925695171453', 'Helmut Schmidt - Questions of life', 2013, 'Documentary, History, TV Movie', 'Ben von Grafenstein', 'Sebastian Orlac', 'Ludwig Blochberger, Britta Hammelstein, Bernhard Schütz, Bibiana Beglau, Peter Striebeck, Imke Büchel, Johannes Klaußner, Dagmar Leesch', null, 'On December 23, 2013, former Federal Chancellor Helmut Schmidt will be 95 years old. As the second Social Democratic head of government in the Federal Republic of Germany, he shaped the country like few other chancellors. Even 30 years after the end of his time in government, he is still a highly esteemed expert whose advice and opinions are in demand. He is one of the most popular chancellors among the population and is held in the highest esteem by his party; even his political opponents at the time pay him the greatest respect.', 'On December 23, 2013, former Federal Chancellor Helmut Schmidt will be 95 years old. As the second Social Democratic head of government in the Federal Republic of Germany, he shaped the country like few other chancellors. Even 30 years after the end of his time in government, he is still a highly esteemed expert whose advice and opinions are in demand. He is one of the most popular chancellors among the population and is held in the highest esteem by his party; even his political opponents at the time pay him the greatest respect.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4yWXDliDnsW8YhbAKHiVCkBAMxS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:279840'),
  ('1107472629795989713', 'Help', 2021, 'Drama', 'Marc Munden, Simon Dale, Laura Hulmes', 'Jack Thorne', 'Jodie Comer, Stephen Graham, Ian Hart, Sue Johnston, Lesley Sharp, David Hayman, Angela Griffin, Charles De''Ath', null, 'Sarah seems to have found her calling working in a Liverpool care home where she has a special talent for connecting with the residents. Then, in March 2020, the Coronavirus pandemic hits.', 'Sarah seems to have found her calling working in a Liverpool care home where she has a special talent for connecting with the residents. Then, in March 2020, the Coronavirus pandemic hits.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xuB589szYuTcBJ0lZa0MSGAf1Ok.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:826796'),
  ('968271310805120139', 'Help for the Holidays', 2012, 'Family, Fantasy, TV Movie', 'Bradford May, Maximo Munzi', 'Abbey Cleland, Bob Sáenz', 'Summer Glau, Dan Gauthier, Eva LaRue, Izabela Vidovic, Mason Cook, Jessie Lande, John Brotherton, Steve Larkin', 'G', 'Although she loves Christmas, Santa’s elf Christine (Summer Glau) wonders if there could be more to life than making toys in the North Pole. When Santa receives an emergency wish from a little boy in Los Angeles, he puts Christine on a special assignment, sending her to L.A. to give the VanCamp family—mom Sara (Eva La Rue), dad Scott (Dan Gauthier), and their two kids Ally (Izabela Vidovic) and Will (Mason Cook)—a holiday wake-up call. Will Christine fail her assignment and be sent back to the North Pole for good, or will the VanCamps come to their senses about the meaning of Christmas?', 'Although she loves Christmas, Santa’s elf Christine (Summer Glau) wonders if there could be more to life than making toys in the North Pole. When Santa receives an emergency wish from a little boy in Los Angeles, he puts Christine on a special assignment, sending her to L.A. to give the VanCamp family—mom Sara (Eva La Rue), dad Scott (Dan Gauthier), and their two kids Ally (Izabela Vidovic) and Will (Mason Cook)—a holiday wake-up call. Will Christine fail her assignment and be sent back to the North Pole for good, or will the VanCamps come to their senses about the meaning of Christmas?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pXKUeppxOmRIgL2Qyt7tIKrNQUA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:149235'),
  ('731138913495663966', 'Help Me, Eros', 2007, 'Drama', 'Lee Kang-sheng, Liao Pen-jung', 'Lee Kang-sheng', 'Lee Kang-sheng, Dennis Nieh, Ivy Yin, Liao Hui-jen', null, 'Having lost all his money in the stock market, a depressed man falls in love with a woman over a suicide helpline.', 'Having lost all his money in the stock market, a depressed man falls in love with a woman over a suicide helpline.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i8u4pXaq1P5kEAf7Wg8hgEQWq1c.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54326'),
  ('821721221644834448', 'Help Me, My Love', 1969, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Alberto Sordi, Carlo Di Palma, Mimmola Girosi', 'Tullio Pinelli, Alberto Sordi, Rodolfo Sonego', 'Alberto Sordi, Monica Vitti, Silvano Tranquilli, Laura Adani, Ugo Gregoretti, Mariolina Cannuli, Néstor Garay, Gaetano Imbró', null, 'Giovanni and Raffaella are happily married from ten years, but their relationship goes into crisis when Raffaella falls in love with Valerio Mantovani, a handsome forty-year-old man she knew during the concerts of chamber music she weekly attends with her mother.', 'Giovanni and Raffaella are happily married from ten years, but their relationship goes into crisis when Raffaella falls in love with Valerio Mantovani, a handsome forty-year-old man she knew during the concerts of chamber music she weekly attends with her mother.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rHLPlz3hIR5DEMyckVCe7A0h8Ru.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:62369'),
  ('1080632813552284710', 'Help, I Shrunk My Friends', 2021, 'Family, Adventure, Fantasy', 'Marcus Kanter, Granz Henman', 'Gerrit Hermans', 'Oskar Keymer, Lina Hüesker, Anja Kling, Axel Stein, Andrea Sawatzki, Otto Waalkes, Michael Ostrowski, Julia Hartmann', null, 'Melanie is a new pupil at the Otto Leonhard High School, and Felix takes a real shine to this newbie, much to the annoyance of Ella and Felix’s gang. They believe that Melanie is responsible for a number of small thefts that have been happening at the school since she arrived. Events take a drastic turn when the class goes on a school trip...', 'Melanie is a new pupil at the Otto Leonhard High School, and Felix takes a real shine to this newbie, much to the annoyance of Ella and Felix’s gang. They believe that Melanie is responsible for a number of small thefts that have been happening at the school since she arrived. Events take a drastic turn when the class goes on a school trip...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fmHVUJ6ueMaVfB6rkmzAlFmA9hA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:751503'),
  ('148375347515742993', 'Help, I Shrunk My Parents', 2018, 'Comedy, Adventure, Family', 'Felix Poplawsky, Tim Trageser', 'Gerrit Hermans', 'Oskar Keymer, Lina Hüesker, Otto Waalkes, Andrea Sawatzki, Axel Stein, Julia Hartmann, Anja Kling, Maximilian Ehrenreich', 'PG', 'Felix''s school is haunted again, only this time it''s not the benevolent spirit of school founder Otto Leonhard and the nuisance he caused, but the once hated and long-since dead Director Hulda Stingbeard. A coincidence causes the former shrunken and skeletonized school principle to rise again, leading to chaos...', 'Felix''s school is haunted again, only this time it''s not the benevolent spirit of school founder Otto Leonhard and the nuisance he caused, but the once hated and long-since dead Director Hulda Stingbeard. A coincidence causes the former shrunken and skeletonized school principle to rise again, leading to chaos...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7335uX2btMkwFGndN0OGeFCvFgn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:454545'),
  ('887304876791699528', 'Help, I Shrunk My Teacher', 2015, 'Comedy, Family, Fantasy', 'Sven Unterwaldt Jr., Stephan Schuh', 'Silja Clemens, Florian Schumacher', 'Oskar Keymer, Lina Hüesker, Axel Stein, Justus von Dohnányi, Anja Kling, Johannes Zeiler, Michael Ostrowski, Siegfried Foster', 'PG', 'Already having a hard time adjusting at his new school, things take a turn for the bizarre for eleven year old Felix when he accidentally shrinks his strict principal to only fifteen centimetres in height!', 'Already having a hard time adjusting at his new school, things take a turn for the bizarre for eleven year old Felix when he accidentally shrinks his strict principal to only fifteen centimetres in height!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dKcp0LzAPF1Y78JjJlVU3WITtms.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:365961'),
  ('416826877126114042', 'Help!', 1965, 'Comedy, Music, Adventure', 'Richard Lester, David Watkin, Ken Thorne', 'Marc Behm, Charles Wood', 'George Harrison, John Lennon, Paul McCartney, Ringo Starr, Leo McKern, Eleanor Bron, Victor Spinetti, Roy Kinnear', 'G', 'An obscure Eastern cult that practices human sacrifice pursues Ringo after he unknowingly puts on a ceremonial ring (that, of course, won''t come off). On top of that, a pair of mad scientists, members of Scotland Yard, and a beautiful but dead-eyed assassin all have their own plans for the Fab Four.', 'An obscure Eastern cult that practices human sacrifice pursues Ringo after he unknowingly puts on a ceremonial ring (that, of course, won''t come off). On top of that, a pair of mad scientists, members of Scotland Yard, and a beautiful but dead-eyed assassin all have their own plans for the Fab Four.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nLvgIB3bVb8jyhls5W6B74Xt4Ei.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14831'),
  ('766122899987869933', 'Help! I''m a Boy', 2002, 'Comedy, Family', 'Oliver Dommenget', 'Astrid Ströher', 'Sarah Hannemann, Nick Seidensticker, Philipp Blank, Pinkas Braun, Nina Petri, Stephan Benson, Tanja Schumann, Dominique Horwitz', null, 'In Hamburg, an aged sorcerer is searching for a replacement. Freddie, who''s about 12, finds the wizard''s book of spells and knows enough to read a few lines to his friend Emma. She repeats the lines adding exasperation about Mickey, a boy who''s often mean to her. The next morning, Mickey finds himself in Emma''s body, and Emma finds herself in Mickey''s body. The wizard tracks down the book, takes it back, and disappears, leaving Freddy with no way to reverse the spell, which becomes permanent in 54 hours. Freddy, Emma, and Mickey must work together to search out a solution, while making discoveries about sex roles, courage, friendship, and each other', 'In Hamburg, an aged sorcerer is searching for a replacement. Freddie, who''s about 12, finds the wizard''s book of spells and knows enough to read a few lines to his friend Emma. She repeats the lines adding exasperation about Mickey, a boy who''s often mean to her. The next morning, Mickey finds himself in Emma''s body, and Emma finds herself in Mickey''s body. The wizard tracks down the book, takes it back, and disappears, leaving Freddy with no way to reverse the spell, which becomes permanent in 54 hours. Freddy, Emma, and Mickey must work together to search out a solution, while making discoveries about sex roles, courage, friendship, and each other', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/doIaIwm2i7StcSAWloKBduBUS4W.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:59921'),
  ('395727893770340538', 'Help! I''m a Fish', 2000, 'Adventure, Animation, Comedy, Family, Drama', 'Michael Hegner, Stefan Fjeldmark, Jesper Møller', 'Stefan Fjeldmark, Karsten Kiilerich, John Stefan Olsen', 'Sebastian Jessen, Pil Neja, Morten Kerrn Nielsen, Søren Sætter-Lassen, Nis Bank-Mikkelsen, Dick Kaysø, Louise Fribo, Ulf Pilgaard', null, 'Three children are accidentally transformed into fish after consuming a potion made by an eccentric scientist. The kids end up in the sea, with one problem: they must find and drink the antidote within 48 hours, or forever remain as fish.', 'Three children are accidentally transformed into fish after consuming a potion made by an eccentric scientist. The kids end up in the sea, with one problem: they must find and drink the antidote within 48 hours, or forever remain as fish.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s9yFQD19xJqXEnAnUAZFUan25DJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12609'),
  ('694427740346550565', 'Help! My In-Laws Are Vampires!', 2021, 'Comedy, Fantasy', 'Cristina Corna, Volfango De Biasi, Roberto Forza', 'Tiziana Martini, Filippo Bologna, Alessandro Bencivenni', 'Emanuela Rei, Cristiano Caccamo, Massimo Ghini, Lucia Ocone, Lillo Petrolo, Ilaria Spada, Barbara Bouchet, Pippo Franco', 'NR', 'A loving young couple discover they''re expecting a child, but the man isn''t too keen on introducing her girlfriend to his family. Is it because he has a vampire father, a witch mother, a ghostly grandma, and a zombie uncle?', 'A loving young couple discover they''re expecting a child, but the man isn''t too keen on introducing her girlfriend to his family. Is it because he has a vampire father, a witch mother, a ghostly grandma, and a zombie uncle?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d87mHOoF4Bgj6EI2u7etpHQJRNg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:715874'),
  ('692791927612143687', 'Help! The Doctor Is Drowning', 1974, 'Comedy', 'Nikolai van der Heyde', 'Felix Thijssen', 'Jules Croiset, Martine Bijl, Piet Bambergen, Ward de Ravet, Leen Jongewaard, Fanny Winkler, Romain Deconinck, Frans Mulder', null, 'Small-town doctor Angelino falls in love at first sight with schoolteacher Irene. Bram the Builder is in love with gypsy girl Katja. Neither of the two men know how to convey their feelings to the objects of their affection.', 'Small-town doctor Angelino falls in love at first sight with schoolteacher Irene. Bram the Builder is in love with gypsy girl Katja. Neither of the two men know how to convey their feelings to the objects of their affection.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fq9PC0H8oSpLiB7I1PI0PYTjQCO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:95442'),
  ('884355823855999412', 'Help! Vengos Visible Agent ''000''', 1967, 'Comedy', 'Thanasis Veggos, Lakis Antonakos', 'Napoleon Eleftheriou, Nikos Tsiforos', 'Thanasis Veggos, Zannino, Dimitris Nikolaidis, Lavrentis Dianellos, Ria Deloutsi, Kostas Bakas, Nikos Fermas, Giorgos Grigoriou', null, 'Vengos studies in a secret agents'' academy, dreaming of becoming a great spy like 007. Unfortunately, he can''t do anything right, so he wreaks havoc during his final exams.', 'Vengos studies in a secret agents'' academy, dreaming of becoming a great spy like 007. Unfortunately, he can''t do anything right, so he wreaks havoc during his final exams.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rbTWLuCowsMB2ysauN9VesXKIg3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47799'),
  ('805607198018573776', 'Helpless', 1996, 'Drama, Crime', 'Shinji Aoyama, Masaki Tamura, Hiroyuki Kiyosue', 'Shinji Aoyama', 'Tadanobu Asano, Ken Mitsuishi, Yoichiro Saito, Kaori Tsuji, Tarō Suwa, Hiroko Isayama, Toshiya Nagasawa', null, 'Yasuo is a gangster just released from jail. Believing his boss double-crossed him, enraged Yasuo is on his way to find the boss. But before setting out for the dangerous trip, Yasuo asks Kenji to take care of his mentally challenged sister, Yuri, and a mysterious black bag.', 'Yasuo is a gangster just released from jail. Believing his boss double-crossed him, enraged Yasuo is on his way to find the boss. But before setting out for the dangerous trip, Yasuo asks Kenji to take care of his mentally challenged sister, Yuri, and a mysterious black bag.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5VNYLarIc3p7w2cmtSwocJFa7tD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:98872'),
  ('195500944782279349', 'Helpless', 2012, 'Mystery, Thriller', 'Byun Young-joo, Kim Dong-young, Kim Seung-gyu', 'Byun Young-joo', 'Kim Min-hee, Lee Sun-kyun, Cho Seong-ha, Song Ha-yoon, Choi Deok-moon, Lee Hee-jun, Kim Min-jae, Choi Il-hwa', null, 'A woman suddenly disappears. Her fiance then sets out to find her and, in the process, uncovers layers of dark hidden secrets.', 'A woman suddenly disappears. Her fiance then sets out to find her and, in the process, uncovers layers of dark hidden secrets.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yt1ZQ0C8C8fayMK8VRXiWX40Its.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:108972'),
  ('635455748803039763', 'Helpmates', 1932, 'Comedy', 'James Parrott, Art Lloyd', 'James Parrott, Oliver Hardy, Stan Laurel', 'Stan Laurel, Oliver Hardy, Blanche Payson, Bobby Burns, Bob Callahan', null, 'Ollie''s house is a mess after a wild party from the previous night. Ollie receives a telegram from his wife (who is on vacation in Chicago), which tells him that she is returning home in the afternoon. Fearing his wife''s wrath he calls Stan over to help him clean up. Things go downhill and they make more mess not less.', 'Ollie''s house is a mess after a wild party from the previous night. Ollie receives a telegram from his wife (who is on vacation in Chicago), which tells him that she is returning home in the afternoon. Fearing his wife''s wrath he calls Stan over to help him clean up. Things go downhill and they make more mess not less.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4CucxeTSqx2KKL49NOwsIn8CFq7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50927'),
  ('760039491744079547', 'Helter Skelter', 1976, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller, TV Movie, Horror', 'Tom Gries, Jules Brenner', null, 'George DiCenzo, Steve Railsback, Nancy Wolfe, Marilyn Burns, Christina Hart, Cathey Paine, Alan Oppenheimer, Rudy Ramos', null, 'The investigation of two horrific mass murders leads to the capture and trial of the psychotic pseudo-hippie Charles Manson and his "family".', 'The investigation of two horrific mass murders leads to the capture and trial of the psychotic pseudo-hippie Charles Manson and his "family".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t2GMGZFT6AKEocASzRRe2yoOkuK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17200'),
  ('525972797865043954', 'Helter Skelter', 2004, 'Action, Crime, Drama, TV Movie', 'John Gray, Don E. FauntLeRoy, Drew Ann Rosenberg', 'John Gray', 'Jeremy Davies, Clea DuVall, Allison Smith, Mary Lynn Rajskub, Marguerite Moreau, Eric Dane, Michael Weston, Hal Ozsan', null, 'The rise of Charles Manson and his "family," who are responsible for a series of famous murders in the late 1960s. Manson, a magnetic and mysterious man, attracts road-weary single mother Linda Kasabian to join his collection of outcasts on a ranch outside of Los Angeles. After murdering actress Sharon Tate, Manson and his followers are investigated by district attorney Vincent Bugliosi.', 'The rise of Charles Manson and his "family," who are responsible for a series of famous murders in the late 1960s. Manson, a magnetic and mysterious man, attracts road-weary single mother Linda Kasabian to join his collection of outcasts on a ranch outside of Los Angeles. After murdering actress Sharon Tate, Manson and his followers are investigated by district attorney Vincent Bugliosi.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qunKvPx1m2VuuMELKIMqPKjkwbT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45759'),
  ('698893554498167136', 'Helter Skelter', 2012, 'Drama, Horror', 'Mika Ninagawa, Daisuke Soma', 'Arisa Kaneko', 'Erika Sawajiri, Nao Omori, Shinobu Terajima, Go Ayano, Kiko Mizuhara, Hirofumi Arai, Anne Suzuki, Susumu Terajima', null, 'Top model Lilico, having recently undergone multiple cosmetic surgeries, begins to experience troubling side effects. As she desperately tries to retain her perfect image, Lilico descends into a world of nightmares and makes those around her miserable.', 'Top model Lilico, having recently undergone multiple cosmetic surgeries, begins to experience troubling side effects. As she desperately tries to retain her perfect image, Lilico descends into a world of nightmares and makes those around her miserable.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nrTHLNNjejHgoVVkJUowkTpndI0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:104524'),
  ('674278798017833969', 'Helvetica', 2007, 'Documentary', 'Gary Hustwit', null, 'Michael Bierut, Neville Brody, David Carson, Manfred Schulz, Massimo Vignelli, Rick Poynor, Wim Crouwel, Matthew Carter', 'NR', 'Helvetica is a feature-length independent film about typography, graphic design and global visual culture. It looks at the proliferation of one typeface (which will celebrate its 50th birthday in 2007) as part of a larger conversation about the way type affects our lives. The film is an exploration of urban spaces in major cities and the type that inhabits them, and a fluid discussion with renowned designers about their work, the creative process, and the choices and aesthetics behind their use of type.', 'Helvetica is a feature-length independent film about typography, graphic design and global visual culture. It looks at the proliferation of one typeface (which will celebrate its 50th birthday in 2007) as part of a larger conversation about the way type affects our lives. The film is an exploration of urban spaces in major cities and the type that inhabits them, and a fluid discussion with renowned designers about their work, the creative process, and the choices and aesthetics behind their use of type.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s47TOnvnwfSnAflQvsBxJbOLnmP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13348'),
  ('926874654984096899', 'Hemingway & Gellhorn', 2012, 'Drama, Romance', 'Philip Kaufman, Rogier Stoffers', 'Jerry Stahl, Barbara Turner', 'Nicole Kidman, Clive Owen, David Strathairn, Rodrigo Santoro, Molly Parker, Parker Posey, Tony Shalhoub, Santiago Cabrera', null, 'Writer Ernest Hemingway begins a romance with fellow scribe Martha Gellhorn.', 'Writer Ernest Hemingway begins a romance with fellow scribe Martha Gellhorn.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b3fdkG3S8z6ibGOIVZYWvQlZPl0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:111839'),
  ('297244891784150068', 'Hemingway’s Adventures of a Young Man', 1962, 'Drama, Romance', 'Martin Ritt, Lee Garmes', 'A. E. Hotchner', 'Richard Beymer, Diane Baker, Corinne Calvet, Fred Clark, Dan Dailey, James Dunn, Juano Hernández, Arthur Kennedy', 'NR', 'Young and restless Nick Adams, the only son of a domineering mother and a weak but noble doctor father, leaves his rural Michigan home to embark on an eventful cross-country journey. He is touched and affected by his encounters with a punch-drunk ex-boxer, a sympathetic telegrapher, and an alcoholic advanceman for a burlesque show. After failing to get a job as reporter in New York, he enlists in the Italian army during World War I as an ambulance driver. His camaraderie with fellow soldiers and a romance with a nurse he meets after being wounded propel him to manhood.', 'Young and restless Nick Adams, the only son of a domineering mother and a weak but noble doctor father, leaves his rural Michigan home to embark on an eventful cross-country journey. He is touched and affected by his encounters with a punch-drunk ex-boxer, a sympathetic telegrapher, and an alcoholic advanceman for a burlesque show. After failing to get a job as reporter in New York, he enlists in the Italian army during World War I as an ambulance driver. His camaraderie with fellow soldiers and a romance with a nurse he meets after being wounded propel him to manhood.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8IqWKVSHCmBWICtyrluWPN0TfrN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:111683'),
  ('767509527553715354', 'Hemşo', 2001, null, 'Ömer Uğur', 'Resul Ertaş, Ömer Uğur', 'Okan Bayülgen, Mehmet Ali Erbil, Demet Şener, Oya Aydoğan, Sümer Tilmaç, Yılmaz Köksal, Yıldo, Cengiz Küçükayvaz', null, 'Directed by Ömer Ugur.', 'Directed by Ömer Ugur.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yTlsCVRJubhFJ7HkwHXT8p1pvmg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:272835'),
  ('283367197323496481', 'Hen', 2026, 'Drama, Family, Adventure', 'György Pálfi, Giorgos Karvelas', 'György Pálfi, Zsófia Ruttkay', 'Yannis Kokiasmenos, Maria Diakopanagiotou, Argyris Pandazaras, Antonis Kafetzopoulos, Antonis Tsiotsiopoulos', null, '« With great power comes great responsibility » but what if the hero is just a hen? Escaping from a chicken farm, she finds refuge in the courtyard of a crumbling restaurant. There, she discovers love, confronts the pecking order, and fights to protect her eggs from a greedy owner. Her droll yet touching quest for motherhood mirrors the messy compromises and silent struggles of human lives.', '« With great power comes great responsibility » but what if the hero is just a hen? Escaping from a chicken farm, she finds refuge in the courtyard of a crumbling restaurant. There, she discovers love, confronts the pecking order, and fights to protect her eggs from a greedy owner. Her droll yet touching quest for motherhood mirrors the messy compromises and silent struggles of human lives.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2Fq1HgK2pyhKfWCALvJTN9Gq9gBu4.jpg', 'plex:movie:hen-2026'),
  ('761653331461134927', 'Hen Hop', 1942, 'Animation', 'Norman McLaren', null, null, null, 'This joyful short animation features a dancing hen that transforms into an egg. The film was made without a camera by Norman McLaren, who drew directly onto 35 mm movie stock with ordinary pen and ink. Colour was added optically.', 'This joyful short animation features a dancing hen that transforms into an egg. The film was made without a camera by Norman McLaren, who drew directly onto 35 mm movie stock with ordinary pen and ink. Colour was added optically.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9WnxOcQAt14RmOE4qtCV5vFcMb9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:247437'),
  ('527515877352163934', 'Hen Pecked', 1974, 'Comedy', 'Mariano Ozores Puchol, Zacarías Urbiola, Manuel Rojas', 'Vicente Coello, Carlos Arniches, Mariano Ozores Puchol', 'Paco Martínez Soria, Florinda Chico, Mari Carmen Prendes, María Kosty, Emilio Gutiérrez Caba, Luis Varela, Emilio Laguna, Guadalupe Muñoz Sampedro', null, 'Don Juan Alcántara is ruined. He does not dare to confess it to the family, since the unanimous opinion of those who know him is that he is a weakling. His lack of character is remedied by his doctor - pretend that he is suffering from schizophrenia.', 'Don Juan Alcántara is ruined. He does not dare to confess it to the family, since the unanimous opinion of those who know him is that he is a weakling. His lack of character is remedied by his doctor - pretend that he is suffering from schizophrenia.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sro1x45jxYAYgiWCn66VXIQDXLg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:86037'),
  ('588128290796816175', 'Hen, His Wife', 1990, 'Animation, Fantasy', 'Igor Kovalyov, Iosif Golomb', 'Igor Kovalyov', null, null, 'Extraordinarily detailed and beautifully drawn animation of a bizarre and surreal world; the domestic life of a fat man, his wife, a sort of oversized obese chicken, and their child/pet, a slug-like creature with a human head. This expressionistic and interior vision of Soviet animator Kovalyov is like an animated Eraserhead.', 'Extraordinarily detailed and beautifully drawn animation of a bizarre and surreal world; the domestic life of a fat man, his wife, a sort of oversized obese chicken, and their child/pet, a slug-like creature with a human head. This expressionistic and interior vision of Soviet animator Kovalyov is like an animated Eraserhead.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ifkWSL8Ik6SUgmg9E7WKbl12Yrf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:168202'),
  ('741713999002794826', 'Henge', 2011, 'Horror', 'Hajime Ohata, Hidetoshi Shinomiya', 'Hajime Ohata', 'Kazunari Aizawa, Aki Morita, Teruhiko Nobukuni', null, 'A young couple''s lives take a turn for the worse after a mysterious attack on the husband leaves him suffering from some bizarre after effects.', 'A young couple''s lives take a turn for the worse after a mysterious attack on the husband leaves him suffering from some bizarre after effects.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g1273UI7b05AxfIifNoW17oX5cf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:101730'),
  ('858928016157171533', 'Henhouse Henery', 1949, 'Animation', 'Robert McKimson, Carl W. Stalling', null, 'Mel Blanc', null, 'Little Henery the Chicken Hawk goes hunting chickens with a hammer and clunks Foghorn Leghorn on the noggin. Foghorn sends Henery after the barnyard dog by misleading him into thinking the dog is a chicken. The dog sets Henery straight and helps him build a tree trap to catch Foggy for supper.', 'Little Henery the Chicken Hawk goes hunting chickens with a hammer and clunks Foghorn Leghorn on the noggin. Foghorn sends Henery after the barnyard dog by misleading him into thinking the dog is a chicken. The dog sets Henery straight and helps him build a tree trap to catch Foggy for supper.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lokYHHDo6LFeFP3c9541G8Om9vh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:237368'),
  ('204124654345119284', 'Henna', 1991, 'Drama, Romance, Music', 'Randhir Kapoor', 'Jainendra Jain', 'Rishi Kapoor, Zeba Bakhtiar, Ashwini Bhave, Saeed Jaffrey, Farida Jalal, Kulbhushan Kharbanda, Kiran Kumar, Reema Lagoo', null, 'Beautiful Henna Khan lives the life of a gypsy near the river, Jhelum, in Pakistan with her widowed dad, Khan Baba; three brothers, Ashraf, Razzak, and Zaman; and Razzak''s wife, Najma. One day she comes across a male body that has been washed ashore. Khan Baba, Bibi Gul, and Henna take this male in, nurse him back to health, only to find out that he has lost his memory. The male in his sleep cries out the name of "Chand", and everyone starts calling him by that name.', 'Beautiful Henna Khan lives the life of a gypsy near the river, Jhelum, in Pakistan with her widowed dad, Khan Baba; three brothers, Ashraf, Razzak, and Zaman; and Razzak''s wife, Najma. One day she comes across a male body that has been washed ashore. Khan Baba, Bibi Gul, and Henna take this male in, nurse him back to health, only to find out that he has lost his memory. The male in his sleep cries out the name of "Chand", and everyone starts calling him by that name.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vChTvHPB01q4XnrR6wVGAh26pqd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:168495'),
  ('885762974393636187', 'Hennessy', 1975, 'Thriller, Drama, Action', 'Don Sharp, Barry Langley, Mike Higgins', 'John Gay', 'Rod Steiger, Lee Remick, Richard Johnson, Trevor Howard, Peter Egan, Eric Porter, Ian Hogg, Stanley Lebor', null, 'Former Irish Republican Army member Niall Hennessy lives in Belfast, Ireland, with his wife and daughter amid the ongoing Irish-British conflict. Though he still knows people in the IRA, including fugitive leader Tobin, Niall has given up his violent ways. One day his family is caught in a chaotic street shootout and killed by British forces. Overwhelmed with rage and hunted by a Scotland Yard inspector, Niall heads to London to exact his deadly revenge.', 'Former Irish Republican Army member Niall Hennessy lives in Belfast, Ireland, with his wife and daughter amid the ongoing Irish-British conflict. Though he still knows people in the IRA, including fugitive leader Tobin, Niall has given up his violent ways. One day his family is caught in a chaotic street shootout and killed by British forces. Overwhelmed with rage and hunted by a Scotland Yard inspector, Niall heads to London to exact his deadly revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j0hoR1K7lzYzeqxTJOyQj36RPOI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54417'),
  ('231681996491002729', 'Henpecked', 1983, 'Comedy', 'Uğur İnan, Ahmet Sezerel, Oğuz Abadan', 'Osman F. Seden', 'Kemal Sunal, Nevra Serezli, Ali Şen, Sümer Tilmaç, Günay Girik, Sırrı Elitaş, Reha Yurdakul, Hüseyin Kutman', null, 'Father of two kids who looks exactly like a rowdy takes advantage of this and go into different and funny events.', 'Father of two kids who looks exactly like a rowdy takes advantage of this and go into different and funny events.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qn517cQlGHHvLMic4Ak89aKsGx0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:307016'),
  ('51149783479983446', 'Henpecked Hoboes', 1946, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Tex Avery', 'Heck Allen', 'Dick Nelson, Tex Avery', null, 'George and Junior are two hungry bears who try to make a meal out of a not too bright barnyard chicken.', 'George and Junior are two hungry bears who try to make a meal out of a not too bright barnyard chicken.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/29nzvSgF6lqq0DpOhgXh1J7COpf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84887'),
  ('684449856632417478', 'Henri', 2013, 'Drama', 'Philippe Guilbert, Yolande Moreau', 'Yolande Moreau', 'Pippo Delbono, Jackie Berroyer, Gwen Berrou, Alexis Meigneux, Miss Ming, Simon André, Lio, Brigitte Mariaulle', null, 'The meeting of two lonely, marginal souls. There is Henri, a man in his 50s, limp, resigned, somewhat alcoholic. And Rosette, a woman who dreams of love, sexuality, normality', 'The meeting of two lonely, marginal souls. There is Henri, a man in his 50s, limp, resigned, somewhat alcoholic. And Rosette, a woman who dreams of love, sexuality, normality', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ogkz6ah5krb0DwtX9tNTc14hQUr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:190845'),
  ('305799657678155157', 'Henri 4', 2010, 'History, Drama', 'Jo Baier, Gernot Roll', 'Jo Baier, Cooky Ziesche', 'Julien Boisselier, Joachim Król, Andreas Schmidt, Roger Casamajor, Armelle Deutsch, Chloé Stefani, Hannelore Hoger, Ulrich Noethen', null, 'A wide-ranging, energetic period piece tracing the rise of the Protestant Henry of Navarre as he goes from battlefield warrior to France''s beloved King Henri IV. Director Jo Baier''s epic is a classically entertaining adventure, albeit one with more than a little bloodshed and frequent bawdy sexual interludes. In late 16th-century France, Catholics and Protestant Huguenots were at war. Seemingly seeking peace, the French dowager queen, Catherine de Medici summons Henry to her court to have him marry her daughter, uniting the two warring factions. However, the Catholics slaughter the Protestant wedding guests in what became known as the St. Bartholomew''s Day massacre and Henry-now married-must use all his guile to both stay alive and maneuver for the throne. [Written by Palm Springs International Film Festival]', 'A wide-ranging, energetic period piece tracing the rise of the Protestant Henry of Navarre as he goes from battlefield warrior to France''s beloved King Henri IV. Director Jo Baier''s epic is a classically entertaining adventure, albeit one with more than a little bloodshed and frequent bawdy sexual interludes. In late 16th-century France, Catholics and Protestant Huguenots were at war. Seemingly seeking peace, the French dowager queen, Catherine de Medici summons Henry to her court to have him marry her daughter, uniting the two warring factions. However, the Catholics slaughter the Protestant wedding guests in what became known as the St. Bartholomew''s Day massacre and Henry-now married-must use all his guile to both stay alive and maneuver for the throne. [Written by Palm Springs International Film Festival]', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nhxQICfkmXYZPEjF0bWAdNFKyMP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:58602'),
  ('966646776702606197', 'Henri-Georges Clouzot''s Inferno', 2009, 'Documentary', 'Serge Bromberg, Ruxandra Medrea, Jérôme Krumenacker', 'Serge Bromberg', 'Romy Schneider, Henri-Georges Clouzot, Serge Reggiani, Bérénice Bejo, Jacques Gamblin, Dany Carrel, Jean-Claude Bercq, Mario David', null, 'In 1964, Henri-Georges Clouzot''s production of L''Enfer came to a halt. Despite huge expectations, major studio backing and an unlimited budget, after three weeks the production collapsed. This documentary presents Inferno''s incredible expressionistic original rushes, screen tests, and on-location footage, whilst also reconstructing Clouzot''s original vision, and shedding light on the ill-fated endeavor through interviews, dramatizations of unfilmed scenes, and Clouzot''s own notes.', 'In 1964, Henri-Georges Clouzot''s production of L''Enfer came to a halt. Despite huge expectations, major studio backing and an unlimited budget, after three weeks the production collapsed. This documentary presents Inferno''s incredible expressionistic original rushes, screen tests, and on-location footage, whilst also reconstructing Clouzot''s original vision, and shedding light on the ill-fated endeavor through interviews, dramatizations of unfilmed scenes, and Clouzot''s own notes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m2r4RgTTDotGozJcxEOXxjTcmRs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41504'),
  ('642924631985222108', 'Henry', 2011, 'Drama', 'Yan England', 'Yan England', 'Louise Laprade, Hubert Lemire, Gérard Poirier, Ariane-Li Simard-Côté, Marie Tifo', null, 'Henry, a great concert pianist, has his life thrown in turmoil the day the love of this life, Maria, disappears mysteriously. He''ll then discover the inevitable verdict of life.', 'Henry, a great concert pianist, has his life thrown in turmoil the day the love of this life, Maria, disappears mysteriously. He''ll then discover the inevitable verdict of life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xcTasCxD1Fn8a5Z9cjLryxu8tG6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:146896'),
  ('251223636859987011', 'Henry Danger: The Movie', 2025, 'Action, Comedy, Family, Science Fiction', 'Joe Menendez, Christopher Charles Kempinski, Joanne Gerein', 'Christopher J. Nowak, Jake Farrow', 'Jace Norman, Sean Ryan Fox, Ella Anderson, Michael D. Cohen, Frankie Grande, Glee Dango, Andre Tricoteux, Cooper Barnes', 'PG', 'Henry Hart meets a superfan—eager to fight crime with Kid Danger—who comes into possession of a device that can open up alternate realities. Facing a wild ride, Henry will need his best friend Jasper and his new superfan sidekick to find his way out or be stuck in another dimension forever.', 'Henry Hart meets a superfan—eager to fight crime with Kid Danger—who comes into possession of a device that can open up alternate realities. Facing a wild ride, Henry will need his best friend Jasper and his new superfan sidekick to find his way out or be stuck in another dimension forever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dFWj2rOGsqSIX1PHFghbCBgpMnk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:926670'),
  ('297951495836311852', 'Henry Fool', 1998, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Hal Hartley, Michael Spiller', 'Hal Hartley', 'Thomas Jay Ryan, James Urbaniak, Parker Posey, Maria Porter, James Saito, Kevin Corrigan, Liam Aiken, Miho Nikaido', 'R', 'An egocentric bum transforms the lives of a shy New Jersey garbageman and his sister.', 'An egocentric bum transforms the lives of a shy New Jersey garbageman and his sister.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1Uun13GJi5U0gs303e7BnER6SpG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37410'),
  ('759936186111068625', 'Henry Gamble''s Birthday Party', 2015, 'Drama', 'Stephen Cone, Jason Chiu', 'Stephen Cone', 'Cole Doman, Pat Healy, Elizabeth Laidlaw, Nina Ganet, Daniel Kyri, Francis Guinan, Hanna Dworkin, Darci Nalepa', 'NR', 'Unfolding over the course of one very eventful day in his life, at 17-year-old preacher’s kid Henry''s afternoon birthday pool party, the guests include an assortment of grown-ups from the family church, as well as Henry’s secular and religious teen friends — including the closeted young Logan, who clearly has eyes for Henry.', 'Unfolding over the course of one very eventful day in his life, at 17-year-old preacher’s kid Henry''s afternoon birthday pool party, the guests include an assortment of grown-ups from the family church, as well as Henry’s secular and religious teen friends — including the closeted young Logan, who clearly has eyes for Henry.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kW48UEn1Mbx62QNFzLnpDhX6fG1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:339739'),
  ('476780747881074262', 'Henry IV', 1984, 'Drama', 'Giuseppe Lanci, Marco Bellocchio, Lisa Caracciolo', 'Tonino Guerra', 'Marcello Mastroianni, Claudia Cardinale, Leopoldo Trieste, Paolo Bonacelli, Gianfelice Imparato, Claudio Spadaro, Giuseppe Cederna, Giacomo Bertozzi', null, 'Deranged after a fall from a horse, a man has lived for twenty years in a castle laboring under the delusion that he is Holy Roman Emperor Henry IV. His psychiatrist concocts an elaborate scheme to shock him out of his medieval reverie.', 'Deranged after a fall from a horse, a man has lived for twenty years in a castle laboring under the delusion that he is Holy Roman Emperor Henry IV. His psychiatrist concocts an elaborate scheme to shock him out of his medieval reverie.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tAXfb2OQWE6v78SfpFLKvlKroNf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42835'),
  ('742773662721987290', 'Henry Poole Is Here', 2008, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Mark Pellington, Eric Schmidt, Tracey Poirier', null, 'Luke Wilson, George López, Radha Mitchell, Morgan Lily, Adriana Barraza, Cheryl Hines, Earl Carroll, Noah Dahl', 'PG', 'Henry Poole abandons his fiancée and family business to spend what he believes are his remaining days alone. The discovery of a ''miracle'' by a nosy neighbor ruptures his solitude and restores his faith in life.', 'Henry Poole abandons his fiancée and family business to spend what he believes are his remaining days alone. The discovery of a ''miracle'' by a nosy neighbor ruptures his solitude and restores his faith in life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jUDrRxSuA7ZSHsIVd1MnFRtwLOf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13107'),
  ('76490530908981279', 'Henry V', 1944, 'History, Drama, War', 'Laurence Olivier, Robert Krasker, Vincent Permane', 'Alan Dent, Laurence Olivier, Dallas Bower', 'Laurence Olivier, Renée Asherson, Ralph Truman, Ernest Thesiger, Frederick Cooper, Robert Helpmann, Leslie Banks, Felix Aylmer', null, 'In 1415, in the midst of the Hundred Years'' War, the young King Henry V of England embarks on the conquest of France.', 'In 1415, in the midst of the Hundred Years'' War, the young King Henry V of England embarks on the conquest of France.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eAisr20DvaKJeHvjDN0oHSx0l7u.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22638'),
