  ('770914404731845555', 'Henry VIII and His Six Wives', 1972, 'Drama, History', 'Waris Hussein, Peter Suschitzky', 'Ian Thorne', 'Keith Michell, Donald Pleasence, Charlotte Rampling, Jane Asher, Brian Blessed, Michael Gough, Barbara Leigh-Hunt, Jenny Bos', null, 'Adapted from the BBC2 serial The Six Wives of Henry VIII. 1547, King Henry VIII''s life has taken a turn for the worse and he is forced to look back over his life and the many loves which had brought him his three children, only one of which was the desired male heir to secure the Tudor dynasty.', 'Adapted from the BBC2 serial The Six Wives of Henry VIII. 1547, King Henry VIII''s life has taken a turn for the worse and he is forced to look back over his life and the many loves which had brought him his three children, only one of which was the desired male heir to secure the Tudor dynasty.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5VgLkooNL5Ea1IWpbFhNxnPJC3K.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:71924'),
  ('1150713384081276485', 'Henry: Portrait of a Serial Killer', 1986, 'Crime, Horror, Thriller, Drama', 'Charlie Lieberman, John McNaughton, Andrew Bradburn', 'Richard Fire, John McNaughton', 'Michael Rooker, Tracy Arnold, Tom Towles, Mary Demas, Anne Bartoletti, Elizabeth Kaden, Ted Kaden, Denise Sullivan', 'NR', 'Arriving in Chicago, Henry moves in with ex-con acquaintance Otis and starts schooling him in the ways of the serial killer.', 'Arriving in Chicago, Henry moves in with ex-con acquaintance Otis and starts schooling him in the ways of the serial killer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/diVMzTarVLgjc3jyODyhZMadfwD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10692'),
  ('39832226129949412', 'Henry: Portrait of a Serial Killer, Part 2', 1996, 'Crime, Horror, Thriller', 'Chuck Parello, Gary B. Goldman, Bob Saunders', 'Chuck Parello', 'Neil Giuntoli, Rich Komenich, Kate Walsh, Carri Levinson, Daniel Allar, Penelope Milford, Mike Houlihan, James Otis', 'R', 'Henry has wandered into a small town looking for work and a place to stay. He gets a job delivering and cleaning porto-potties and moves in with a co-worker until he gets his feet off of the ground. Henry and his new friend soon start to kill.', 'Henry has wandered into a small town looking for work and a place to stay. He gets a job delivering and cleaning porto-potties and moves in with a co-worker until he gets his feet off of the ground. Henry and his new friend soon start to kill.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/udDCCmIpvMoRvl0ArioceHkI8ix.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39930'),
  ('697224816142956210', 'Henry''s Crime', 2010, 'Crime, Comedy', 'Malcolm Venville, Paul Cameron', 'David N. White, Sacha Gervasi', 'Keanu Reeves, Vera Farmiga, James Caan, Judy Greer, Fisher Stevens, Danny Hoch, Bill Duke, Peter Stormare', 'R', 'An aimless man is sent to prison for a crime he did not commit, an ex-con targets the same bank he was sent away for robbing.', 'An aimless man is sent to prison for a crime he did not commit, an ex-con targets the same bank he was sent away for robbing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1i1sDWOZecbUZ4Yp9DG5UiTBBRl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53172'),
  ('545735630821461864', 'Henson''s Place: The Man Behind the Muppets', 1984, 'Documentary, Family', 'David A. Goldsmith', 'Joan Thirkettle', 'Julia McKenzie, Jim Henson, Frank Oz, Jane Henson, Gabriel Velez, Caroll Spinney, Pam Arciero, Brian Henson', 'G', 'Trace the life and career of visionary puppeteer Jim Henson through this fascinating documentary, which profiles the creative genius''s early endeavors in college, his incredible contributions to "Sesame Street" and the creation of "The Muppet Show." In addition to interviews with Henson, his wife, Jane, and close collaborator Frank Oz, this in-depth special also offers viewers a peek inside the magical Henson Workshop.', 'Trace the life and career of visionary puppeteer Jim Henson through this fascinating documentary, which profiles the creative genius''s early endeavors in college, his incredible contributions to "Sesame Street" and the creation of "The Muppet Show." In addition to interviews with Henson, his wife, Jane, and close collaborator Frank Oz, this in-depth special also offers viewers a peek inside the magical Henson Workshop.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w60uASytLGaHBLNjcAOn31ON05q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42761'),
  ('349968741098267501', 'Hep Yek 3: You Shook Me', 2019, 'Comedy', 'Müge Kıraner, Özgür Bakar, Uğur Kaplan', 'Bilal Kalyoncu', 'Ali Sürmeli, Gökhan Yıkılkan, İnan Ulaş Torun, Yıldırım Memişoğlu, Mahmut Tuncer, Ömer Başdoğan, Serdal Genç, Onur Sermik', null, 'With the mafia on their tail, Altan and Gürkan embark on new misadventures when they find themselves at a party hosted by a notorious antiques smuggler.', 'With the mafia on their tail, Altan and Gürkan embark on new misadventures when they find themselves at a party hosted by a notorious antiques smuggler.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1bous6riqZ5DNQCMFQnomXNly2u.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:477312'),
  ('345294121368916082', 'Her', 2013, 'Romance, Science Fiction, Drama', 'Robert E. Kay, Thomas Patrick Smith, Hoyte van Hoytema', 'Spike Jonze', 'Joaquin Phoenix, Scarlett Johansson, Lynn Adrianna, Lisa Renee Pitts, Gabe Gomez, Chris Pratt, Artt Butler, May Lindstrom', 'R', 'In the not so distant future, Theodore, a lonely writer, purchases a newly developed operating system designed to meet the user''s every need. To Theodore''s surprise, a romantic relationship develops between him and his operating system. This unconventional love story blends science fiction and romance in a sweet tale that explores the nature of love and the ways that technology isolates and connects us all.', 'In the not so distant future, Theodore, a lonely writer, purchases a newly developed operating system designed to meet the user''s every need. To Theodore''s surprise, a romantic relationship develops between him and his operating system. This unconventional love story blends science fiction and romance in a sweet tale that explores the nature of love and the ways that technology isolates and connects us all.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eCOtqtfvn7mxGl6nfmq4b1exJRc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:152601'),
  ('275598773807626208', 'Her & Him & the Rest of the World', 2024, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Emmanuelle Belohradsky, Jérôme Alméras, Fabrice Gilbert', 'Emmanuelle Belohradsky, Jérôme Boivin', 'Victor Belmondo, Galatea Bellugi, Inas Chanti, Charline Ben Larbi, Antoine Levannier, Frédéric Maranber, Natte You, Charles Peccia-Galletto', null, 'Marco, who is in his twenties and a bit lost, helps out a friend by standing in for him at his place of work: an emergency center for lifts. At around 3 am, a young woman called him: trapped in a broken-down car, she was having an anxiety attack. Marco tried to reassure her on the phone, but as no technician was available to help, he decided to go and rescue her himself. Unfortunately, when he arrives, the young woman has vanished into thin air. And so begins his incredible quest to track down this enigmatic stranger in Paris on the night of Valentine''s Day.', 'Marco, who is in his twenties and a bit lost, helps out a friend by standing in for him at his place of work: an emergency center for lifts. At around 3 am, a young woman called him: trapped in a broken-down car, she was having an anxiety attack. Marco tried to reassure her on the phone, but as no technician was available to help, he decided to go and rescue her himself. Unfortunately, when he arrives, the young woman has vanished into thin air. And so begins his incredible quest to track down this enigmatic stranger in Paris on the night of Valentine''s Day.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tLcJi8D6gAcKGTGPTjCIV2GrUrW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1084849'),
  ('594263842120560401', 'Her Alibi', 1989, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Bruce Beresford, Freddie Francis, Tracy Rosenthal-Newsom', 'Charlie Peters', 'Tom Selleck, Paulina Porizkova, William Daniels, James Farentino, Patrick Wayne, Tess Harper, Ronald Guttman, Victor Argo', 'PG', 'A writer of BAD detective novels is in full writers'' block. He pretends to be the alibi of a beautiful woman who was arrested for murder at first thinking her innocent, but as she shows more and more interesting abilities (such as knife throwing) he begins to doubt his first assessment.', 'A writer of BAD detective novels is in full writers'' block. He pretends to be the alibi of a beautiful woman who was arrested for murder at first thinking her innocent, but as she shows more and more interesting abilities (such as knife throwing) he begins to doubt his first assessment.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zPewmxWwDOMucFnaXXH26tfAv7m.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17819'),
  ('1027929757774216983', 'Her and She and Him', 1970, 'Drama', 'Robert Lefebvre, Max Pécas', 'Michèle Ressi', 'Nicole Debonne, Astrid Frank, Yves Vincent, Frederick Sakiss, Michel Vocoret, Bruno Balp, Michel Charrel, Kim Camba', null, 'A stylish sensual sample of European erotica about an aspiring model in Paris who becomes a participant in a relationship with a lesbian.Her female lover becomes too possessive, the model takes a job with an homosexual painter.', 'A stylish sensual sample of European erotica about an aspiring model in Paris who becomes a participant in a relationship with a lesbian.Her female lover becomes too possessive, the model takes a job with an homosexual painter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k7URNMnbJEY50Da0RsZlJDyFIuM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:281197'),
  ('434811087272000329', 'Her Best Move', 2007, 'Comedy, Drama, Family', 'Norm Hunter, Paul Ryan', 'Norm Hunter, Tony Vidal', 'Daryl Sabara, Leah Pipes, Lisa Darr, Jhoanna Flores, Fay Masterson, Scott Patterson, Janine de Boisblanc, Lalaine', 'G', '15 year-old soccer prodigy, Sara Davis, has a chance to join the U.S. National Team, but she must juggle high school, romance, sports, and parental pressure while deciding her own priorities.', '15 year-old soccer prodigy, Sara Davis, has a chance to join the U.S. National Team, but she must juggle high school, romance, sports, and parental pressure while deciding her own priorities.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5HlN7oYzqRDJ8yTHPlc9PTRD9EP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18598'),
  ('469505780695806404', 'Her Best Revenge', 2026, 'Thriller', 'LaQuita Langhorn', 'Laquita Langhorn', 'Quasheem D. Herring, LaQuita Langhorn, Jikena Bush', 'TV-MA', 'After nearly 10 years following the death of sorority big sister Zariyah Redding, someone is harassing those suspected of involvement in her death. Everyone attending college homecoming night has a different story.', 'After nearly 10 years following the death of sorority big sister Zariyah Redding, someone is harassing those suspected of involvement in her death. Everyone attending college homecoming night has a different story.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fmetadata-static.plex.tv%2Fc%2Fgracenote%2Fcc9c7557c37aaca472302c9ab6ae96b5.jpg', 'plex:movie:her-best-revenge'),
  ('996792915656149287', 'Her Blue Sky', 2019, 'Animation, Romance', 'Miyuki Kuroki, Tatsuyuki Nagai, Ai Yukimura', 'Mari Okada', 'Ryo Yoshizawa, Riho Yoshioka, Shion Wakayama, Ken Matsudaira, Fukushi Ochiai, You Taichi, Atsumi Tanezaki, Yuto Uemura', null, 'High school student Aoi Aioi lives with her elder sister, Akane, after a tragic accident took their parents away 13 years ago. Because Akane has since been taking care of her single-handedly, Aoi wants to move to Tokyo after her graduation to relieve her sister''s burden and pursue a musical career, inspired by Akane''s ex-boyfriend Shinnosuke "Shinno" Kanamuro. Shinno was part of a band until he left for Tokyo to become a professional guitarist after the sisters'' parents passed away, and he was never to be seen again.', 'High school student Aoi Aioi lives with her elder sister, Akane, after a tragic accident took their parents away 13 years ago. Because Akane has since been taking care of her single-handedly, Aoi wants to move to Tokyo after her graduation to relieve her sister''s burden and pursue a musical career, inspired by Akane''s ex-boyfriend Shinnosuke "Shinno" Kanamuro. Shinno was part of a band until he left for Tokyo to become a professional guitarist after the sisters'' parents passed away, and he was never to be seen again.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s8B0K89piYbYaESTZ0NlIyAjhDg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:615165'),
  ('730897369863416426', 'Her Body', 2023, 'Drama', 'Natálie Císařovská', 'Natálie Císařovská, Aneta Honzková', 'Natalia Germani, Denisa Barešová, Cyril Dobrý, Zuzana Mauréry, Martin Finger, Zuzana Stivínová, Karolína Krezlová, Tereza Švejdová', null, 'A Czech high diver''s Olympic dreams are shattered when she suffers a devastating injury while training. Forced to leave the sport she loves, she follows a photographer friend into the world of nude modeling, ultimately reinventing herself as an adult film actress. Inspired by the true story of diving champion Andrea Absolonová.', 'A Czech high diver''s Olympic dreams are shattered when she suffers a devastating injury while training. Forced to leave the sport she loves, she follows a photographer friend into the world of nude modeling, ultimately reinventing herself as an adult film actress. Inspired by the true story of diving champion Andrea Absolonová.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/foNYeBzrTpz94Sg9yV6hGMsax8A.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1109402'),
  ('1046645617435660504', 'Her Brother', 1960, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Kon Ichikawa, Kazuo Miyagawa, Bainari Nakamura', 'Yōko Mizuki', 'Keiko Kishi, Hiroshi Kawaguchi, Kinuyo Tanaka, Masayuki Mori, Kyôko Kishida, Noboru Nakaya, Kyōko Enami, Jun Hamamura', null, 'Set in 1926 when Japanese tradition was much stronger, this drama looks at the inner workings of a small family, especially the relationship between a sister and brother.', 'Set in 1926 when Japanese tradition was much stronger, this drama looks at the inner workings of a small family, especially the relationship between a sister and brother.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/srh3eWzWVRpHt0r1609kcr0JdI6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:125251'),
  ('819134292515777127', 'Her Difference', 2025, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Lola Doillon, Ludovic Eyrolle, Pierre Milon', 'Lola Doillon', 'Jehnny Beth, Thibaut Évrard, Mireille Perrier, Emmanuelle Schaaff, Irina Muluile, Julie Dachez, Fabienne Casalis, Philippe Le Gall', null, 'Katia, a 35-year-old researcher in a documentary production company, has a chaotic way of navigating her relationship with Fred, her boyfriend. When she takes part in a new project, she finally puts her difference into words – and this revelation will turn their life upside down.', 'Katia, a 35-year-old researcher in a documentary production company, has a chaotic way of navigating her relationship with Fred, her boyfriend. When she takes part in a new project, she finally puts her difference into words – and this revelation will turn their life upside down.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dMkYKdYFbVEu7CteaBPlWSORI0K.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1001030'),
  ('258474207999699165', 'Her Fatal Ways', 1990, 'Comedy', 'Alfred Cheung Kin-Ting, William Yim Wai-Lun', 'Alfred Cheung Kin-Ting, Keith Wong, Albert Mak Kai-Kwong', 'Carol Cheng, Alfred Cheung Kin-Ting, Tony Leung Ka-fai, Lam Kau, Michael Chow Man-Kin, Sheila Chan Suk-Lan, Sunny Fang Kang, Walter Tso Tat-Wah', null, 'Cheng Shih-Nan is a Mainland inspector who journeys to Hong Kong with her assistant and cousin Hsiou Sheng to deliver a ruthless criminal. But the bad guy escapes, meaning Shih-Nan and Hsiou Sheng are now stuck in capitalist Hong Kong for an extended stay! A flag-waving supporter of the Communist Party, Shih-Nan marvels at the “decadent” lifestyle of her Hong Kong counterpart, Inspector Wu Kei Kuo. But despite the culture clash, the two disparate cops find the common ground they need to dispense justice – and even discover something akin to romance! But will the Party approve?', 'Cheng Shih-Nan is a Mainland inspector who journeys to Hong Kong with her assistant and cousin Hsiou Sheng to deliver a ruthless criminal. But the bad guy escapes, meaning Shih-Nan and Hsiou Sheng are now stuck in capitalist Hong Kong for an extended stay! A flag-waving supporter of the Communist Party, Shih-Nan marvels at the “decadent” lifestyle of her Hong Kong counterpart, Inspector Wu Kei Kuo. But despite the culture clash, the two disparate cops find the common ground they need to dispense justice – and even discover something akin to romance! But will the Party approve?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eIUziq8d7TCK7zhZZIQI1kAjhbM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:138790'),
  ('523478085682543830', 'Her Granddaughter', 2015, 'Drama, Romance', 'Ryuichi Hiroki, Atsuhiro Nabeshima', 'Hiroshi Saito', 'Nana Eikura, Etsushi Toyokawa, Osamu Mukai, Sakura Ando, Tomoya Maeno, Toshie Negishi, Motoki Ochiai, Mari Hamada', null, 'Tsugumi Dozono works at a large electronics company in Tokyo. She likes to spend long vacations at her grandmother’s house in the countryside. When her grandmother dies, Tsugumi Dozono decides to live in the house full-time, and to work from there as well. However, one day she encounters a middle-aged man in the house, who tells Tsugumi that her grandmother gave him a key to the annex house when he was her student. The two share the property, although Tsugumi still does not know the exact relationship that her grandmother had with this man.', 'Tsugumi Dozono works at a large electronics company in Tokyo. She likes to spend long vacations at her grandmother’s house in the countryside. When her grandmother dies, Tsugumi Dozono decides to live in the house full-time, and to work from there as well. However, one day she encounters a middle-aged man in the house, who tells Tsugumi that her grandmother gave him a key to the annex house when he was her student. The two share the property, although Tsugumi still does not know the exact relationship that her grandmother had with this man.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f8PqkPxh5QAFOmtZ7nyGuPc2MYv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:338400'),
  ('313983404862965073', 'Her Highness and the Bellboy', 1945, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Richard Thorpe, Harry Stradling Sr.', 'Richard Connell, Gladys Lehman', 'Hedy Lamarr, Robert Walker, June Allyson, Carl Esmond, Agnes Moorehead, Rags Ragland, Ludwig Stössel, George Cleveland', 'NR', 'In a fictional European country, a beautiful princess meets a handsome American reporter and falls in love with him. On a trip to New York, she hopes to find him again. While staying at one of the city''s finest hotels she meets a kind-hearted bellhop who mistakes her for a maid. She invites him to be her escort, not realizing that he believes he has fallen in love with her. Every nice thing the princess does encourages him to believe that she feels the same way he does.', 'In a fictional European country, a beautiful princess meets a handsome American reporter and falls in love with him. On a trip to New York, she hopes to find him again. While staying at one of the city''s finest hotels she meets a kind-hearted bellhop who mistakes her for a maid. She invites him to be her escort, not realizing that he believes he has fallen in love with her. Every nice thing the princess does encourages him to believe that she feels the same way he does.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k7QSnOvA0U6IZfAKJ0bAxadMrsN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:80030'),
  ('741691583663860271', 'Her Love Boils Bathwater', 2016, 'Drama', 'Ryota Nakano, Yoshihiro Ikeuchi', 'Ryota Nakano', 'Rie Miyazawa, Hana Sugisaki, Joe Odagiri, Tori Matsuzaka, Aoi Ito, Yukiko Shinohara, Taro Suruga, Nanoka Matsubara', 'PG', 'After being diagnosed with a terminal illness, Futaba resolves to spend her remaining time reuniting her broken family, reopening the long-closed bathhouse, and helping her shy daughter Azumi learn to stand on her own.', 'After being diagnosed with a terminal illness, Futaba resolves to spend her remaining time reuniting her broken family, reopening the long-closed bathhouse, and helping her shy daughter Azumi learn to stand on her own.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eQPZQMBlwSZwJ5d3T21KhcWBjrQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:412120'),
  ('1020875107059822348', 'Her Man', 1930, 'Drama, Romance', 'Tay Garnett, Josiah Zuro, Edward Snyder', 'Tom Buckingham', 'Helen Twelvetrees, Phillips Holmes, Marjorie Rambeau, James Gleason, Ricardo Cortez, Harry Sweet, Slim Summerville, Thelma Todd', null, 'A prostitute sees a friendly sailor as a way out of Havana''s grimy underworld.', 'A prostitute sees a friendly sailor as a way out of Havana''s grimy underworld.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cYVONUdtiROJuKNqLdaTTyRbnjm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:116861'),
  ('225051550283936748', 'Her Minor Thing', 2005, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Charles Matthau, John J. Connor', 'Jim Meyers, Debra Meyers', 'Estella Warren, Christian Kane, Michael Weatherly, Rachel Dratch, Kathy Griffin, Flex Alexander, Ivana Miličević, Victoria Jackson', 'PG-13', 'Jeana does IT for the Sacramento Fire Department. She and Tom, a self-confident local TV news reporter, are about to go on a cruise to Rio when he lets slip on TV that she is a virgin. It''s a slow news week, so this becomes a story: the media pursue Jeana, she breaks up with Tom and wants the tickets or her cruise money back, and Tom can''t believe she''s serious. Her path crosses that of Paul, a photographer recently arrived from Texas who''s also Tom''s cameraman; he''s had six serious relationships that have ended with his heart broken. A triangle of sorts develops. Will Jeana end up with either man? Will she end up on the cruise? And what about that minor thing?', 'Jeana does IT for the Sacramento Fire Department. She and Tom, a self-confident local TV news reporter, are about to go on a cruise to Rio when he lets slip on TV that she is a virgin. It''s a slow news week, so this becomes a story: the media pursue Jeana, she breaks up with Tom and wants the tickets or her cruise money back, and Tom can''t believe she''s serious. Her path crosses that of Paul, a photographer recently arrived from Texas who''s also Tom''s cameraman; he''s had six serious relationships that have ended with his heart broken. A triangle of sorts develops. Will Jeana end up with either man? Will she end up on the cruise? And what about that minor thing?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tB11rbsJ3Ka4huSygtYV0IQ7tUM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39344'),
  ('212997926073145649', 'Her Night of Romance', 1924, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Sidney Franklin', 'Hanns Kräly', 'Constance Talmadge, Ronald Colman, Jean Hersholt, Albert Gran, Robert Rendel, Sidney Bracey, Joseph J. Dowling, Templar Saxe', null, 'An impoverished British lord (Paul Menford) impersonates a doctor in order to woo an ailing American heiress (Dorothy Adams). The lord is in it for love, but his business associate (Joe Diamond) smells money.', 'An impoverished British lord (Paul Menford) impersonates a doctor in order to woo an ailing American heiress (Dorothy Adams). The lord is in it for love, but his business associate (Joe Diamond) smells money.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2oHmsA6ajrTTYZCPWX04X7vo3qz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:186431'),
  ('185812463731438742', 'Her Pen Pal', 2021, 'Romance, Comedy, TV Movie', 'Kris Carrillo, Clare Niederpruem, Desislava Apostolova', 'Joie Botkin', 'Mallory Jansen, Joshua Sasse, Lachlan Nieboer, Amanda Blake, Jayne Wisener, Gregory Haney, Amy Louise Pemberton, John Macdonald', 'G', 'Event planner Victoria can’t wait to attend –- and plan –- her best friend’s wedding in Paris. But when she finds out her ex is bringing a date, Victoria reconnects with her French childhood pen pal.', 'Event planner Victoria can’t wait to attend –- and plan –- her best friend’s wedding in Paris. But when she finds out her ex is bringing a date, Victoria reconnects with her French childhood pen pal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oz71mRn4UeiE7wr7KV5mUwsncA3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:809340'),
  ('568301301641202593', 'Her Private Hell', null, 'Thriller, Crime, Drama, Mystery, Science Fiction', 'Nicolas Winding Refn, Magnus Nordenhof Jønck, Niels Nørløv Hansen', 'Nicolas Winding Refn, Esti Giordani', 'Sophie Thatcher, Charles Melton, Kristine Froseth, Havana Rose Liu, Diego Calva, Dougray Scott, Shioli Kutsuna, Hidetoshi Nishijima', null, 'As a strange mist engulfs a futuristic metropolis and unleashes an elusive deadly presence, a troubled young woman sets out in search of her father. In this quest, her fate crosses with that of an American GI engaged in a desperate journey to snatch his daughter from Hell.', 'As a strange mist engulfs a futuristic metropolis and unleashes an elusive deadly presence, a troubled young woman sets out in search of her father. In this quest, her fate crosses with that of an American GI engaged in a desperate journey to snatch his daughter from Hell.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cuNxB6Uyh8m2EQhkya8VmerwdP8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1469342'),
  ('915657745229568284', 'Her Private Hell', 1968, 'Drama', 'Norman J. Warren', 'Glynn Christian', 'Lucia Modugno, Terence Skelton, Pearl Catlin, Daniel Oliver, Jeannette Wild, Robert Crewdson, Mary Land', null, 'A young Italian girl arrives in London, where she''s tricked into posing nude for risqué magazines.', 'A young Italian girl arrives in London, where she''s tricked into posing nude for risqué magazines.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kRgS1eqbYMGoCQgmZbd77P3euGx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:91418'),
  ('20157819466880642', 'Her Return', 1975, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Witold Orzechowski, Kazimierz Konrad', 'Witold Orzechowski', 'Beata Tyszkiewicz, Jerzy Zelnik, Andrzej Mrożewski, Maria Wachowiak, Lucja Kowolik, Leon Niemczyk, Andrzej Bogucki, Tadeusz Tarnowski', null, 'An industrialist''s wife announces that she is leaving him, but returns shortly after and tells him that she will only stay with him for appearances. This causes the industrialist to rethink his life choices.', 'An industrialist''s wife announces that she is leaving him, but returns shortly after and tells him that she will only stay with him for appearances. This causes the industrialist to rethink his life choices.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f35FRAXAC101naVVIPnjfZCWnLm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:888286'),
  ('816551666081345147', 'Her Smell', 2019, 'Drama, Music', 'Joshua Hartsoe, Andreas O''Donohue Villaggio, Pierre Zagdoun', 'Alex Ross Perry', 'Elisabeth Moss, Cara Delevingne, Dan Stevens, Agyness Deyn, Gayle Rankin, Ashley Benson, Dylan Gelula, Virginia Madsen', 'R', 'A self-destructive punk rocker struggles with sobriety while trying to recapture the creative inspiration that led her band to success.', 'A self-destructive punk rocker struggles with sobriety while trying to recapture the creative inspiration that led her band to success.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qEvgdGBMORPS0rz8pqkVH3obLee.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:520679'),
  ('541815723210595304', 'Her Story', 2024, 'Drama, Romance', 'Shao Yihui, Xiaozhu Long, Xie Zhengyu', 'Shao Yihui', 'Song Jia, Zhong Chuxi, Zeng Mumei, Zhang Yu, Mark Chao You-Ting, Ren Bin, Zhang Chi, Zhou Yemang', null, 'Wang Tiemei, a single mother, loses her job and moves, befriending neighbor Xiaoye who appears cheerful but is depressed. Their bond grows as Tiemei navigates relationships with her ex-husband causing trouble.', 'Wang Tiemei, a single mother, loses her job and moves, befriending neighbor Xiaoye who appears cheerful but is depressed. Their bond grows as Tiemei navigates relationships with her ex-husband causing trouble.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d19YpGra7LRMYnOZQi9Vbn1jjhB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1260951'),
  ('865759361127093906', 'Her Vengeance', 1988, 'Crime, Horror', 'Lam Nai-Choi, Simon Leung Siu Wah, Kwan Chi-Kan', 'Shirley Woo Suet-Lai', 'Pauline Wong, Lam Ching-Ying, Fanny Sit Chi-Lun, Elaine Jin Yan-Ling, Kelvin Wong Siu, Shing Fui-On, Billy Chow Bei-Lei, Shum Wai', null, 'Fong Kit Ying is an unassuming nightclub employee in Macao who inadvertently angers a gang of drunken patrons. They follow her home after her shift and mount a viscous gang assault. After her traumatic ordeal, she vows to hunt them down one by one.', 'Fong Kit Ying is an unassuming nightclub employee in Macao who inadvertently angers a gang of drunken patrons. They follow her home after her shift and mount a viscous gang assault. After her traumatic ordeal, she vows to hunt them down one by one.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/42ctSwsyQgIMp3xVIpEZNyHkCRS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:90965'),
  ('289994698856178684', 'Her Way', 2021, 'Drama', 'Cécile Ducrocq, Noé Bach', 'Cécile Ducrocq', 'Laure Calamy, Nissim Renard, Béatrice Facquer, Maxence Tual, Romain Brau, Sam Louwyck, Diana Korudzhiyska, Amlan Larcher', null, 'Marie, an independent and militant woman, has never needed anyone''s help, including when it comes to raising her son. When the latter is expelled from his certificate of professional competence training class, Marie cannot accept it. Dreaming of a brighter future for him, she decides to enrol him in one of the best cooking schools in France.', 'Marie, an independent and militant woman, has never needed anyone''s help, including when it comes to raising her son. When the latter is expelled from his certificate of professional competence training class, Marie cannot accept it. Dreaming of a brighter future for him, she decides to enrol him in one of the best cooking schools in France.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kTCmev4EidCPNxQsGApRpW2zYpx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:810677'),
  ('512346906537241931', 'Her Word Against His', 2018, 'Drama, Crime, Mystery, TV Movie', 'Didier Bivel, Marc Falchier', 'Gilda Piersanti, Gianguido Spinelli', 'Elsa Lunghini, François Vincentelli, Patrick Ridremont, Nathalie Blanc, Sara Martins, Julie Bargeton, Laure Marsac, Réginald Huguenin', null, 'A rape victim faces a dilemma: tell the truth about her assault or stay silent and allow her attacker to be falsely convicted for murder.', 'A rape victim faces a dilemma: tell the truth about her assault or stay silent and allow her attacker to be falsely convicted for murder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7pqL4cpR2sBPfjR6CRaRMyQeG0A.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:497917'),
  ('1145227722540862927', 'Hera Pheri', 1976, 'Action, Comedy, Drama', 'Prakash Mehra, N. Satyen', null, 'Amitabh Bachchan, Vinod Khanna, Saira Banu, Goga Kapoor, Sulakshana Pandit, Shreeram Lagoo, Pinchoo Kapoor, Asrani', null, 'Two con men, Vijay and Ajay, manage to hoodwink a number of wealthy people as well as Police Commissioner Khanna. Their lives undergo many changes, after a caper at a casino, where Vijay is recognized by a gangster named P.K., who decides to separate the two friends by claiming that Ajay is his long-lost son; insinuating that Vijay has not been completely forthright with Ajay; and implicating him in the murder of a male named Mac. Written by rAjOo (gunwanti@hotmail.com)', 'Two con men, Vijay and Ajay, manage to hoodwink a number of wealthy people as well as Police Commissioner Khanna. Their lives undergo many changes, after a caper at a casino, where Vijay is recognized by a gangster named P.K., who decides to separate the two friends by claiming that Ajay is his long-lost son; insinuating that Vijay has not been completely forthright with Ajay; and implicating him in the murder of a male named Mac. Written by rAjOo (gunwanti@hotmail.com)', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hUlekD8DKi7GBTqy5HIrVovnU8i.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:170645'),
  ('903465874529915070', 'Hera Pheri', 2000, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Priyadarshan, Vikram Kumar, Jeeva', 'Neeraj Vora', 'Akshay Kumar, Suniel Shetty, Paresh Rawal, Tabu, Om Puri, Gulshan Grover, Kulbhushan Kharbanda, Mukesh Khanna', null, 'Two tenants and a landlord, in desperate need of money, chance upon a ransom call via a cross connection. They hatch a plan to claim the ransom for themselves.', 'Two tenants and a landlord, in desperate need of money, chance upon a ransom call via a cross connection. They hatch a plan to claim the ransom for themselves.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/23MKGUPT5laTStim4TaGhfgSltu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21614'),
  ('877912333928392461', 'Herakles', 1962, 'Documentary', 'Werner Herzog', 'Werner Herzog', 'Reinhard Lichtenberg, Franco Columbu', null, 'Basically, ''Herakles'' is an omnium-gatherum of film clips depicting images of machismo. Some of those images are explicitly macho: we see various body-builders flexing their biceps and triceps. Other images seen here are not macho in the literal sense, but are indirectly related to testosterone or cojones on some level: we see military aircraft making bombing raids, and footage of car crashes.', 'Basically, ''Herakles'' is an omnium-gatherum of film clips depicting images of machismo. Some of those images are explicitly macho: we see various body-builders flexing their biceps and triceps. Other images seen here are not macho in the literal sense, but are indirectly related to testosterone or cojones on some level: we see military aircraft making bombing raids, and footage of car crashes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3LTOShYDSUrgJ5pTcofrXzi24bG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45763'),
  ('345680884171137603', 'Herb & Dorothy', 2009, 'Documentary', 'Megumi Sasaki', null, 'Herbert Vogel, Dorothy Vogel, Charlie Rose, Mike Wallace, Paula Antebi, Will Barnet, Robert Barry, Lynda Benglis', null, 'He was a postal clerk. She was a librarian. With their modest means, the couple managed to build one of the most important contemporary art collections in history. Meet Herb and Dorothy Vogel, whose shared passion and disciplines and defied stereotypes and redefined what it means to be an art collector.', 'He was a postal clerk. She was a librarian. With their modest means, the couple managed to build one of the most important contemporary art collections in history. Meet Herb and Dorothy Vogel, whose shared passion and disciplines and defied stereotypes and redefined what it means to be an art collector.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lkQAoesDJQiIszrW8boqwhhpBAP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37583'),
  ('276694978731237821', 'Herbie', 1966, 'Music', 'George Lucas, Paul Golding', 'Paul Golding, George Lucas', null, null, 'Herbie is a short 16mm black and white film by George Lucas and Paul Golding made in 1966 as part of their USC film school course. It is an abstract film with no story and no actors, that graphically depicts the reflections of moving light streaks and light flashes from traffic at night. It is set to a piece of jazz music by Herbie Hancock, whose first name was used for the title.', 'Herbie is a short 16mm black and white film by George Lucas and Paul Golding made in 1966 as part of their USC film school course. It is an abstract film with no story and no actors, that graphically depicts the reflections of moving light streaks and light flashes from traffic at night. It is set to a piece of jazz music by Herbie Hancock, whose first name was used for the title.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dJfx6h4SWGPjeT6py75fXlglByf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:204958'),
  ('700876010906165826', 'Herbie Fully Loaded', 2005, 'Comedy, Family, Adventure, Fantasy, Romance', 'Angela Robinson, Greg Gardiner, Hans Bjerno', 'Robert Ben Garant, Alfred Gough, Thomas Lennon', 'Lindsay Lohan, Michael Keaton, Matt Dillon, Breckin Meyer, Justin Long, Cheryl Hines, Jimmi Simpson, Scoot McNairy', 'G', 'Maggie Peyton, the new owner of Number 53 - the free-wheelin'' Volkswagen bug with a mind of its own - puts the car through its paces on the road to becoming a NASCAR competitor.', 'Maggie Peyton, the new owner of Number 53 - the free-wheelin'' Volkswagen bug with a mind of its own - puts the car through its paces on the road to becoming a NASCAR competitor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7lTfTZ8CDfXw09eAv3OOvsbCVgs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11451'),
  ('1014690288696246115', 'Herbie Goes Bananas', 1980, 'Fantasy, Comedy, Family, Adventure', 'Vincent McEveety, Frank V. Phillips', 'Don Tait', 'Cloris Leachman, Charles Martin Smith, John Vernon, Stephen W. Burns, Elyssa Davalos, Joaquin Garay III, Harvey Korman, Richard Jaeckel', 'G', 'The adorable little VW helps its owners break up a counterfeiting ring in Mexico.', 'The adorable little VW helps its owners break up a counterfeiting ring in Mexico.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7cBOYLDhHMA351ndLthSxBCwO5N.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12129'),
  ('840765805013724356', 'Herbie Goes to Monte Carlo', 1977, 'Romance, Comedy, Family, Action, Adventure', 'Vincent McEveety, Leonard J. South', 'Don Nelson, Arthur Alsberg', 'Dean Jones, Don Knotts, Julie Sommars, Jacques Marin, Roy Kinnear, Bernard Fox, Eric Braeden, Xavier Saint-Macary', 'G', 'Herbie, the Volkswagen Beetle with a mind of its own, is racing in the Monte Carlo Rally. But thieves have hidden a cache of stolen diamonds in Herbie''s gas tank, and are now trying to get them back.', 'Herbie, the Volkswagen Beetle with a mind of its own, is racing in the Monte Carlo Rally. But thieves have hidden a cache of stolen diamonds in Herbie''s gas tank, and are now trying to get them back.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4gMplOTJWAj1oNrv0QJG6SGhBNQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14140'),
  ('1079446913859031820', 'Herbie Rides Again', 1974, 'Romance, Comedy, Family, Fantasy', 'Frank V. Phillips, Robert Stevenson', 'Bill Walsh', 'Helen Hayes, Ken Berry, Stefanie Powers, John McIntire, Keenan Wynn, Huntz Hall, Ivor Barry, Dan Tobin', 'G', 'The living Volkswagen Beetle helps an old lady protect her home from a corrupt developer.', 'The living Volkswagen Beetle helps an old lady protect her home from a corrupt developer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1k14PPykkUQfhjn3xXDrc55lfHl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10869'),
  ('209310471941236172', 'Herculanum', 2016, 'Drama', 'Arthur Cahn, Alice Douard, Delphine Cazelles', 'Arthur Cahn', 'Arthur Cahn, Jérémie Elkaïm', null, 'Three "meetings." Two men. A rumbling volcano.', 'Three "meetings." Two men. A rumbling volcano.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4BS1OJlHadDe3Z5ZR1An6G0LvWu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:442303'),
  ('1023579417790467240', 'Hercule and Sherlock', 1996, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Jeannot Szwarc', 'Joe Morheim, A. Sanford Wolfe, Marie-Christine de Montbrial', 'Christopher Lambert, Richard Anconina, Philippine Leroy-Beaulieu, Béatrice Agenin, Roland Blanche, Laurent Gendron, Benjamin Rataud, Michel Crémadès', null, 'A story of two dogs which can find false money end two mafioso losers. One tries to be a tough guy and the other eats only pizza and listens to zen music, but both are totally terrified by dogs.', 'A story of two dogs which can find false money end two mafioso losers. One tries to be a tough guy and the other eats only pizza and listens to zen music, but both are totally terrified by dogs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pts8hqvmKKnNRbHnyZ3y4t92ngq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:103029'),
  ('412014815464754397', 'Hercules', 1958, 'Fantasy, Adventure', 'Pietro Francisci, Ettore Mattia, Pietro Nuccorini', 'Ennio De Concini, Pietro Francisci, Gaio Fratini', 'Steve Reeves, Sylva Koscina, Fabrizio Mioni, Gianna Maria Canale, Arturo Dominici, Mimmo Palmara, Lidia Alfonsi, Gabriele Antonini', null, 'In this melange of characters and events from separate mythological stories, Hercules, demigod and superman, arrives in the ancient Greek kingdom of Iolcus to tutor Iphitus, son of king Pelias; immediately on arrival, he falls in love with the king''s delectable, briefly clad daughter Iole. Before he can win her, he must succeed in a series of quests, in the course of which he teams up with Jason, true heir of Iolcus, whom he accompanies on the famous voyage of the Argonauts.', 'In this melange of characters and events from separate mythological stories, Hercules, demigod and superman, arrives in the ancient Greek kingdom of Iolcus to tutor Iphitus, son of king Pelias; immediately on arrival, he falls in love with the king''s delectable, briefly clad daughter Iole. Before he can win her, he must succeed in a series of quests, in the course of which he teams up with Jason, true heir of Iolcus, whom he accompanies on the famous voyage of the Argonauts.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t2HYYuN2PmQtpdO44trWg4ain4d.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39400'),
  ('120404390994649857', 'Hercules', 1983, 'Action, Adventure, Fantasy', 'Luigi Cozzi, Alberto Spagnoli, Giancarlo Santi', 'Luigi Cozzi', 'Lou Ferrigno, Sybil Danning, Brad Harris, Rossana Podestà, Ingrid Anderson, Mirella D''Angelo, William Berger, Bobby Rhodes', 'PG', 'Hercules, a semi-divine being, squares off against King Minos, who is attempting to use science to gain power and take over the world. With the help of a benevolent sorceress, Circe, Hercules tries to save his beloved Cassiopeia from being sacrificed by Minos, and struggles against laser-breathing creatures and an evil sorceress.', 'Hercules, a semi-divine being, squares off against King Minos, who is attempting to use science to gain power and take over the world. With the help of a benevolent sorceress, Circe, Hercules tries to save his beloved Cassiopeia from being sacrificed by Minos, and struggles against laser-breathing creatures and an evil sorceress.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x02VMg4z7frtezt7bGSAw37mHqg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26452'),
  ('101215245642224460', 'Hercules', 1997, 'Animation, Family, Fantasy, Adventure, Comedy, Romance', 'Ron Clements, John Musker', 'Ron Clements, John Musker, Irene Mecchi', 'Tate Donovan, Josh Keaton, Roger Bart, Danny DeVito, James Woods, Susan Egan, Bobcat Goldthwait, Matt Frewer', 'G', 'Bestowed with superhuman strength, a young mortal named Hercules sets out to prove himself a hero in the eyes of his father, the great god Zeus. Along with his friends Pegasus, a flying horse, and Phil, a personal trainer, Hercules is tricked by the hilarious, hotheaded villain Hades, who''s plotting to take over Mount Olympus!', 'Bestowed with superhuman strength, a young mortal named Hercules sets out to prove himself a hero in the eyes of his father, the great god Zeus. Along with his friends Pegasus, a flying horse, and Phil, a personal trainer, Hercules is tricked by the hilarious, hotheaded villain Hades, who''s plotting to take over Mount Olympus!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dK9rNoC97tgX3xXg5zdxFisdfcp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11970'),
  ('88583702691556677', 'Hercules', 2014, 'Action, Adventure', 'Brett Ratner, Dante Spinotti, Annamária Orosz', 'Ryan Condal, Evan Spiliotopoulos', 'Dwayne Johnson, Ian McShane, John Hurt, Rufus Sewell, Aksel Hennie, Ingrid Bolsø Berdal, Reece Ritchie, Joseph Fiennes', 'PG-13', 'When a new enemy threatens the innocent, Hercules must lead his fearless team of warriors in a battle against overwhelming odds.', 'When a new enemy threatens the innocent, Hercules must lead his fearless team of warriors in a battle against overwhelming odds.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sKNIwY6UENCJ36FvYvnBW3Vdzt7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:184315'),
  ('766325859288224357', 'Hercules Against the Moon Men', 1964, 'Adventure, Fantasy', 'Giacomo Gentilomo, Oberdan Troiani', 'Arpad De Riso, Giovanni Scolaro', 'Sergio Ciani, Jany Clair, Anna Maria Polani, Nando Tamberlani, Delia D''Alberti, Goffredo Unger, Anna Maria Dionisio, Paola Pitti', 'NR', 'Hercules is summoned to oppose the evil Queen Samara, who has allied herself with aliens and is sacrificing her own people in a bid to awaken a moon goddess.', 'Hercules is summoned to oppose the evil Queen Samara, who has allied herself with aliens and is sacrificing her own people in a bid to awaken a moon goddess.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lQSDjwoJUr7uxmHYcrUHxVA2Roq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31396'),
  ('225736092092222376', 'Hercules and the Amazon Women', 1994, 'Adventure, Fantasy, TV Movie, Action', 'Bill L. Norton, James Bartle', 'Jule Selbo, Daniel Truly, Andrew Dettmann', 'Kevin Sorbo, Anthony Quinn, Roma Downey, Michael Hurst, Lucy Lawless, Rose McIver, Jill Sayre, Kim Michalis', 'PG', 'Hercules and Iolaus take time out from Iolaus'' wedding preparations, to help a distant village under attack from "monsters". When they reach their destination, they find the monsters are in fact Amazonian women who are controlled by Hera. "Hercules and the Amazon Women" is the first movie-length pilot episode of the television series "Hercules: The Legendary Journeys".', 'Hercules and Iolaus take time out from Iolaus'' wedding preparations, to help a distant village under attack from "monsters". When they reach their destination, they find the monsters are in fact Amazonian women who are controlled by Hera. "Hercules and the Amazon Women" is the first movie-length pilot episode of the television series "Hercules: The Legendary Journeys".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aTcAL4khfIAZjmbOeKIMqOtv1kd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37404'),
  ('951469166276276896', 'Hercules and the Captive Women', 1961, 'Adventure, Fantasy, Action', 'Vittorio Cottafavi, Giorgio Cristallini, Odoardo Fiory', 'Duccio Tessari, Sandro Continenza', 'Reg Park, Fay Spain, Ettore Manni, Luciano Marin, Laura Efrikian, Mario Valdemarin, Mimmo Palmara, Mino Doro', 'NR', 'King Androcles of Thebes commands a ship in search of a threat to Greece, predicted by an atmospheric oracle. Hercules is part of the crew, but the strongman falls overboard in a thick fog. Washed ashore, he saves a young Ismene from Proteus, an evil, shape-shifting creature. Ismene takes Hercules to Atlantis, where he discovers that her mother, Queen Antinea, has captured Androcles. Hercules schemes to rescue him and thwart Antinea''s dream of world conquest.', 'King Androcles of Thebes commands a ship in search of a threat to Greece, predicted by an atmospheric oracle. Hercules is part of the crew, but the strongman falls overboard in a thick fog. Washed ashore, he saves a young Ismene from Proteus, an evil, shape-shifting creature. Ismene takes Hercules to Atlantis, where he discovers that her mother, Queen Antinea, has captured Androcles. Hercules schemes to rescue him and thwart Antinea''s dream of world conquest.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w7AmUyC8irs9ho31dC4SEl2mLRb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42576'),
  ('561819020502334325', 'Hercules and the Circle of Fire', 1994, 'Adventure, Fantasy, TV Movie, Action', 'Doug Lefler, James Bartle', 'Barry Pullman, Andrew Dettmann, Daniel Truly', 'Kevin Sorbo, Anthony Quinn, Tawny Kitaen, Mark Ferguson, Kim Michalis, Patrick Morrison, Joseph Greer, Zo Hartley', null, 'When all the earth''s fire begins to go out, Hercules and Deianeira must go in search for fire to stop the world from cold. "Hercules and the Circle of Fire" is the third movie-length pilot episode of the television series "Hercules: The Legendary Journeys".', 'When all the earth''s fire begins to go out, Hercules and Deianeira must go in search for fire to stop the world from cold. "Hercules and the Circle of Fire" is the third movie-length pilot episode of the television series "Hercules: The Legendary Journeys".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bH04FIbgsAlDkxF5QGCFQHhEPAg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:75822'),
  ('1004525574520701471', 'Hercules and the Lost Kingdom', 1994, 'Adventure, Fantasy, TV Movie, Action', 'Harley Cokeliss, James Bartle', 'Christian Williams', 'Kevin Sorbo, Anthony Quinn, Renée O''Connor, Robert Trebor, Eric Close, Elizabeth Hawthorne, Nathaniel Lees, Darren Warren', null, 'Hercules comes to the aid of a young woman who is seeking the lost city of Troy. Eventually, Hercules leads her to a camp of refugees from the city, which has been taken over by Hera''s Blue Priests. Hercules helps the refugees take back the city. "Hercules and the Lost Kingdom" is the second movie-length pilot episode of the television series "Hercules: The Legendary Journeys".', 'Hercules comes to the aid of a young woman who is seeking the lost city of Troy. Eventually, Hercules leads her to a camp of refugees from the city, which has been taken over by Hera''s Blue Priests. Hercules helps the refugees take back the city. "Hercules and the Lost Kingdom" is the second movie-length pilot episode of the television series "Hercules: The Legendary Journeys".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1ZeDv8ffdIqLxTV1glIKCTC1xLX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:75826'),
  ('1030553229012400707', 'Hercules and the Tyrants of Babylon', 1964, 'Fantasy, Adventure', 'Domenico Paolella, Giancarlo Romitelli, Augusto Tiezzi', 'Domenico Paolella, Luciano Martino', 'Peter Lupus, Helga Liné, Mario Petri, Arturo Dominici, Piero Lulli, Livio Lorenzon, Anna Maria Polani, Tullio Altamura', null, 'Hercules goes to Babylon to rescue the Queen of the Hellenes and free the people of Babylon from slavery.', 'Hercules goes to Babylon to rescue the Queen of the Hellenes and free the people of Babylon from slavery.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9f33sqoPF5sF1JGHZoNqdYgjqcY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85347'),
  ('471254258283950075', 'Hercules and Xena - The Animated Movie: The Battle for Mount Olympus', 1998, 'Fantasy, Adventure, Animation', 'Lynne Naylor, Diana Rowan, Chris Reccardi', 'John Loy', 'Kevin Sorbo, Lucy Lawless, Michael Hurst, Renée O''Connor, Kevin Smith, Alexandra Tydings, Josephine Davison, Ted Raimi', 'PG', 'Mighty Zeus brings Hercules'' mother, Alcmene, to Mount Olympus, and Hercules, believing she has been kidnapped, leads a rescue mission to save her. Zeus'' jealous wife, Hera, decides that it should now be her time to rule the universe. Hera steals the Chronos Stone, source of the God''s power, and unleashes the four Titans from their eons of imprisonment. With these angry behemoths on the loose, only the combined forces of Hercules and Xena, together with their trusty sidekicks Iolaus and Gabrielle, can save Mount Olympus.', 'Mighty Zeus brings Hercules'' mother, Alcmene, to Mount Olympus, and Hercules, believing she has been kidnapped, leads a rescue mission to save her. Zeus'' jealous wife, Hera, decides that it should now be her time to rule the universe. Hera steals the Chronos Stone, source of the God''s power, and unleashes the four Titans from their eons of imprisonment. With these angry behemoths on the loose, only the combined forces of Hercules and Xena, together with their trusty sidekicks Iolaus and Gabrielle, can save Mount Olympus.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mbsxJMuHjb672Pb3X1vwGEjW0A2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53346'),
  ('326529374014016392', 'Hercules in New York', 1970, 'Comedy, Adventure, Fantasy', 'Arthur Allan Seidelman, Leo Lebowitz, François Moullin', 'Aubrey Wisberg', 'Arnold Stang, Arnold Schwarzenegger, Deborah Loomis, James Karen, Ernest Graves, Tanny McDonald, Harold Burstein, Merwin Goldsmith', 'G', 'Hercules is sent from Mount Olympus to modern-day Manhattan, where he takes up professional wrestling before getting mixed up with a gang of mobsters.', 'Hercules is sent from Mount Olympus to modern-day Manhattan, where he takes up professional wrestling before getting mixed up with a gang of mobsters.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2Rad0CXcWSyjp6vidmz08QriYNZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:5227'),
  ('1024007371364275112', 'Hercules in the Haunted World', 1961, 'Adventure, Horror, Fantasy', 'Mario Bava, Mario Bava, Franco Prosperi', 'Mario Bava, Sandro Continenza, Duccio Tessari', 'Reg Park, Christopher Lee, Leonora Ruffo, George Ardisson, Marisa Belli, Ida Galli, Franco Giacobini, Mino Doro', null, 'Upon his return from battle in the previous film, the great warrior Hercules learns that his lover, Daianara, has lost her senses. Acording of the oracle Medea, Dianara''s only hope is the Stone of Forgetfulness which lies deep in the realm of Hades. Hercules, with two companions, Theseus and Telemachus, embarks on a dangerous quest for the stone, while he is unaware that Dianara''s guardian, King Lico, is the one responsible for her condition and plots to have the girl for himself as his bride upon her revival.', 'Upon his return from battle in the previous film, the great warrior Hercules learns that his lover, Daianara, has lost her senses. Acording of the oracle Medea, Dianara''s only hope is the Stone of Forgetfulness which lies deep in the realm of Hades. Hercules, with two companions, Theseus and Telemachus, embarks on a dangerous quest for the stone, while he is unaware that Dianara''s guardian, King Lico, is the one responsible for her condition and plots to have the girl for himself as his bride upon her revival.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tGmVETh3SLQpYXoEEQ9QVC803NE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28058'),
  ('117497907503130682', 'Hercules in the Maze of the Minotaur', 1994, 'Adventure, Fantasy, TV Movie, Action', 'Josh Becker, James Bartle, Diana Rowan', 'Andrew Dettmann, Daniel Truly', 'Kevin Sorbo, Anthony Quinn, Tawny Kitaen, Michael Hurst, Anthony Ray Parker, Rose McIver, Terry Batchelor, Maya Dalziel', 'NR', 'Hercules has settled down with his wife and children, but misses the good old days traveling around having exciting adventures. Then one day he is persuaded out of his farming "retirement" to help a distant village which is being attacked by an unseen monster. "Hercules in the Maze of the Minotaur" is the fifth out of five made for TV movies that spawned the series "Hercules: The Legendary Journeys".', 'Hercules has settled down with his wife and children, but misses the good old days traveling around having exciting adventures. Then one day he is persuaded out of his farming "retirement" to help a distant village which is being attacked by an unseen monster. "Hercules in the Maze of the Minotaur" is the fifth out of five made for TV movies that spawned the series "Hercules: The Legendary Journeys".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m2JoUnBae0GYYuTEKWRYvddtVnx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:70811'),
  ('361906780495800273', 'Hercules in the Underworld', 1994, 'Adventure, Fantasy, TV Movie, Action', 'Bill L. Norton, James Bartle', 'Andrew Dettmann, Daniel Truly', 'Kevin Sorbo, Anthony Quinn, Tawny Kitaen, Marley Shelton, Cliff Curtis, Michael Hurst, Rose McIver, Andrew Kovacevich', null, 'When villagers begin disappearing it is discovered that they had fallen through a crack in the earth which goes straight to Hades. Hercules once again comes to the rescue and faces one of his most difficult challenges, and must prove himself as a man as well as a god. "Hercules in the Underworld" is the fourth made for TV movie in the series Hercules: The Legendary Journeys.', 'When villagers begin disappearing it is discovered that they had fallen through a crack in the earth which goes straight to Hades. Hercules once again comes to the rescue and faces one of his most difficult challenges, and must prove himself as a man as well as a god. "Hercules in the Underworld" is the fourth made for TV movie in the series Hercules: The Legendary Journeys.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bskH8CKf3f926IrZC6tvUmyt57O.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:75834'),
  ('959453647136349804', 'Hercules Reborn', 2014, 'Adventure, Action', 'Eric Gustavo Petersen, Nick Lyon, Esther Elise Johnson', 'Jose Montesinos, Jim Hemphill', 'John Hennigan, Christian Oliver, Christina Wolfe, Marcus Shirock, James Duval, Dylan Vox, Jeremy M. Inman, Alistair A. Duff', 'NR', 'When a young man''s bride is kidnapped by an evil king, he turns to Hercules for help. The fallen hero has been living in exile, banished for killing his family, but the young man''s courage inspires Hercules. Together, they fight to rescue the bride and reclaim the honor of Hercules.', 'When a young man''s bride is kidnapped by an evil king, he turns to Hercules for help. The fallen hero has been living in exile, banished for killing his family, but the young man''s courage inspires Hercules. Together, they fight to rescue the bride and reclaim the honor of Hercules.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zustI9EStTWz2PxVmy8KvWVpJTP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:277594'),
  ('503209390175717160', 'Hercules Returns', 1993, 'Comedy', 'David Connell, Tony Gilbert, Euan Keddie', 'Des Mangan', 'David Argue, Michael Carman, Mary Coustas, Bruce Spence, Brendon Suhr, Des Mangan, Sally Patience, Frank Thring', 'PG-13', 'When Brad gets fired from his job, he goes to reopen an old cinema, he enlists his frends to help him show the last film the cinema aired before it closed... Only they don''t know, the film is in Italian. With everyone sitting ready they begin to dub the movie... on the fly!', 'When Brad gets fired from his job, he goes to reopen an old cinema, he enlists his frends to help him show the last film the cinema aired before it closed... Only they don''t know, the film is in Italian. With everyone sitting ready they begin to dub the movie... on the fly!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8DDByl1HBjdrDa5lDmOMWiP37e8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16327'),
  ('43466047857354720', 'Hercules the Invincible', 1964, 'Adventure, Fantasy', 'Lewis Mann, Alvaro Mancori, Claude Haroy', 'Alvaro Mancori, Kirk Mayer, Pat Kein', 'Dan Vadis, Špela Rozin, Carla Calò, Ken Clark, Maria Fiore, Ugo Sasso, Olga Solbelli, Alberto Cevenini', null, 'Hercules battles to save the population from a giant dragon.', 'Hercules battles to save the population from a giant dragon.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p0Ot937W1Om3pG5spKWutpYMepO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85369'),
  ('485838814224225298', 'Hercules Unchained', 1959, 'Fantasy, Action', 'Pietro Francisci, Pietro Nuccorini, Mario Bava', 'Pietro Francisci, Ennio De Concini', 'Steve Reeves, Sylva Koscina, Sylvia Lopez, Gabriele Antonini, Primo Carnera, Patrizia Della Rovere, Sergio Fantoni, Fulvia Franco', 'NR', 'En route to Thebes for an important diplomatic mission, Hercules drinks from a magic spring and loses his memory. He spends most of the movie in the pleasure gardens of Queen Omphale of Lydia. While young Ulysses tries to help him regain his memory, political tensions escalate in Thebes, and Hercules'' new wife Iole finds herself in mortal danger.', 'En route to Thebes for an important diplomatic mission, Hercules drinks from a magic spring and loses his memory. He spends most of the movie in the pleasure gardens of Queen Omphale of Lydia. While young Ulysses tries to help him regain his memory, political tensions escalate in Thebes, and Hercules'' new wife Iole finds herself in mortal danger.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4lzZhokSXwb93GlrREMuRLw0SLL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39402'),
  ('1059643304434546878', 'Hercules, Samson & Ulysses', 1963, 'Adventure', 'Pietro Francisci, Silvano Ippoliti, Pietro Nuccorini', 'Pietro Francisci', 'Kirk Morris, Iloush Khoshabe, Liana Orfei, Diletta D''Andrea, Enzo Cerusico, Fulvia Franco, Aldo Giuffrè, Andrea Fantasia', null, 'Two strongmen set out to hunt down a murderous sea monster. Their ship is wrecked and they end up in the Holy Land where Hercules is assumed to be Samson who is a wanted man. The two team up to survive.', 'Two strongmen set out to hunt down a murderous sea monster. Their ship is wrecked and they end up in the Holy Land where Hercules is assumed to be Samson who is a wanted man. The two team up to survive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bcCCU1qR1yv0BNSW39K28O1Uzal.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44457'),
  ('497807681072342474', 'Here', 2024, 'Drama', 'Robert Zemeckis, Lucy Bevan, Don Burgess', 'Eric Roth, Robert Zemeckis', 'Tom Hanks, Robin Wright, Paul Bettany, Kelly Reilly, Finn Guegan, Callum Macreadie, Ellis Grunsell, Teddy Russell', 'PG-13', 'An odyssey through time and memory, centered on a place in New Jersey where—from wilderness, and then, later, from a home—love, loss, struggle, hope and legacy play out between couples and families over generations.', 'An odyssey through time and memory, centered on a place in New Jersey where—from wilderness, and then, later, from a home—love, loss, struggle, hope and legacy play out between couples and families over generations.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/79euHUJJtfgeGU63ef38KtNjXEn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:940139'),
  ('479587324379057094', 'Here After', 2024, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Robert Salerno, Bartosz Nalazek', 'Sarah Conradt', 'Connie Britton, Giovanni Cirfiera, Tommaso Basili, Babetida Sadjo, Syama Rayner, Alessandro Bressanello, Freya Hannan-Mills, Andrea Bruschi', 'PG-13', 'When her teen daughter displays increasingly disturbing behavior after a near death experience, a mother becomes convinced the girl brought something evil back from the other side.', 'When her teen daughter displays increasingly disturbing behavior after a near death experience, a mother becomes convinced the girl brought something evil back from the other side.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/by3EEDIVTdhNJolYK2Msn1RHRFH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1096838'),
  ('204673254947997865', 'Here Alone', 2016, 'Horror, Thriller, Science Fiction', 'Rod Blackhurst, Adam McDaid', 'David Ebeltoft', 'Lucy Walters, Gina Piersanti, Adam David Thompson, Shane West', null, 'A woman struggles to survive on her own in the wake of a mysterious epidemic, which has decimated society and forced her deep into the unforgiving wild.', 'A woman struggles to survive on her own in the wake of a mysterious epidemic, which has decimated society and forced her deep into the unforgiving wild.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A975uoqpADhIXvREe6fNtTW3KBN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:390582'),
  ('1086749329780431436', 'Here and Elsewhere', 1976, 'Documentary', 'Jean-Luc Godard, Anne-Marie Miéville, William Lubtchansky', 'Jean-Luc Godard, Anne-Marie Miéville, Jean-Pierre Gorin', 'Jean-Luc Godard, Anne-Marie Miéville', null, 'Here and Elsewhere takes its name from the contrasting footage it shows of the fedayeen and of a French family watching television at home. Originally shot by the Dziga Vertov Group as a film on Palestinian freedom fighters, Godard later reworked the material alongside Anne-Marie Miéville.', 'Here and Elsewhere takes its name from the contrasting footage it shows of the fedayeen and of a French family watching television at home. Originally shot by the Dziga Vertov Group as a film on Palestinian freedom fighters, Godard later reworked the material alongside Anne-Marie Miéville.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yxdBS1jF7HF1GryHwCZSvLPukpL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26298'),
  ('966018126061156905', 'Here and Now', 2018, 'Romance, Drama', 'Javier Aguirresarobe, Fabien Constant', 'Laura Eason', 'Sarah Jessica Parker, Simon Baker, Gus Birney, Jacqueline Bisset, Common, Taylor Kinney, Mary Beth Peil, Phillipa Soo', 'R', 'On the eve of a major performance, singer Vivienne receives life-altering news that causes her to reevaluate her priorities. Crisscrossing the busy streets of New York City, she tries to balance her upcoming tour, family, and friends. Through interaction with her overbearing mother, Jeanne, her long-time manager, Ben, and her ex-husband, Nick, Vivienne strives to make peace with the decisions and sacrifices she''s made along the way.', 'On the eve of a major performance, singer Vivienne receives life-altering news that causes her to reevaluate her priorities. Crisscrossing the busy streets of New York City, she tries to balance her upcoming tour, family, and friends. Through interaction with her overbearing mother, Jeanne, her long-time manager, Ben, and her ex-husband, Nick, Vivienne strives to make peace with the decisions and sacrifices she''s made along the way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j0Kr99KebJUSlNMtVruC0fN2hUf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:484355'),
  ('196828553751089230', 'Here and There', 2012, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Antonio Méndez Esparza', null, 'Pedro De los Santos, Teresa Ramírez Aguirre, Lorena Guadalupe Pantaleón Vázquez, Heidi Laura Solano Espinoza, Néstor Tepetate Medina, Carolina Prado Ángel, Noel Payno Vendíz, Nicolás Parra Quiroz', null, 'Pedro returns home to a small mountain village in Guerrero, Mexico after years of working in the US. He finds his daughters older, and more distant than he imagined. His wife still has the same smile. Having saved some earnings from two trips to the US, he hopes to now finally make a better life with his family, and even to pursue his dreams on the side by starting a band: Copa Kings. He cherishes the everyday moments with his family. The villagers think this year''s crop will be bountiful. There is also good work in a growing city an hour away. But the locals are wise to a life of insecurity, and their thoughts are often of family members or opportunities far away, north of the border. While working in the fields, Pedro meets and begins to mentor a teenager who dreams of the US. That place somehow always feels very present, practically knocking at the door. "Aquí y Allá" is a story about hope, and the memories and loss of what we leave behind.', 'Pedro returns home to a small mountain village in Guerrero, Mexico after years of working in the US. He finds his daughters older, and more distant than he imagined. His wife still has the same smile. Having saved some earnings from two trips to the US, he hopes to now finally make a better life with his family, and even to pursue his dreams on the side by starting a band: Copa Kings. He cherishes the everyday moments with his family. The villagers think this year''s crop will be bountiful. There is also good work in a growing city an hour away. But the locals are wise to a life of insecurity, and their thoughts are often of family members or opportunities far away, north of the border. While working in the fields, Pedro meets and begins to mentor a teenager who dreams of the US. That place somehow always feels very present, practically knocking at the door. "Aquí y Allá" is a story about hope, and the memories and loss of what we leave behind.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g6bamLPeMdbrvQdoY5t7QYRcCL8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:121211'),
  ('1036288719316810509', 'Here and There', 2024, 'Comedy', 'Bastien Blum, Lily Gantelmi d''Ile, Louise Delécaut', 'Ludovic Bernard', 'Ahmed Sylla, Hakim Jemili, Hugo Becker, Etienne Guillou-Kervern, Ibrahima Ba, Luiza Benaïssa, Annelise Hesme, Ériq Ebouaney', null, 'A visa problem forces Adrien back to Paris after 15 years in Senegal with his wife Aminata. Her cousin Sékou, now distanced from his Senegalese origins, takes in Adrien. As Adrien awaits his return, Sékou shows him France, sparking surprises.', 'A visa problem forces Adrien back to Paris after 15 years in Senegal with his wife Aminata. Her cousin Sékou, now distanced from his Senegalese origins, takes in Adrien. As Adrien awaits his return, Sékou shows him France, sparking surprises.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pwZ55jD7mZWXgDLRKJIYCdVucDd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1114751'),
  ('552756676666155459', 'Here Are the Young Men', 2021, 'Drama', 'Eoin Macken, Niall Owens, James Mather', 'Eoin Macken', 'Dean-Charles Chapman, Anya Taylor-Joy, Finn Cole, Ferdia Walsh-Peelo, Conleth Hill, Emmett J. Scanlan, Lola Petticrew, Carl Shaaban', null, 'Dublin teenagers Matthew, nihilistic Rez, and the deranged Kearney, leave school to a social vacuum of drinking and drugs, falling into shocking acts of transgression.', 'Dublin teenagers Matthew, nihilistic Rez, and the deranged Kearney, leave school to a social vacuum of drinking and drugs, falling into shocking acts of transgression.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7fUrq1mtyk0I0kFWy7KqaKfHqD8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:540248'),
  ('217313952072438535', 'Here Before', 2022, 'Drama, Mystery, Thriller', 'Stacey Gregg, Chloë Thomson, Jamie Hegarty', 'Stacey Gregg', 'Andrea Riseborough, Martin McCann, Jonjo O''Neill, Eileen O''Higgins, Louise Mathews, Niamh Dornan, Lewis McAskie, Grace O''Dwyer', 'R', 'Haunted by the death of her young daughter, a distraught woman develops an all-consuming obsession with a girl she believes is her reincarnated child.', 'Haunted by the death of her young daughter, a distraught woman develops an all-consuming obsession with a girl she believes is her reincarnated child.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q7zlzoBX51NtWiNAO1MdhNkW7Aw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:669400'),
  ('78837592332252254', 'Here Below', 2012, 'Drama, History', 'Jean-Pierre Denis', 'Richard Boidin, Jean-Pierre Denis', 'Céline Sallette, Éric Caravaca, François Loriquet, Maud Rayer, Adeline D''Hermy, Jacques Spiesser, Nelly Antignac, Yves Beneyton', null, 'The true story of a nun who betrayed a network of Resistance fighters after having a passionate but doomed love affair with a priest during the Second World War.', 'The true story of a nun who betrayed a network of Resistance fighters after having a passionate but doomed love affair with a priest during the Second World War.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ySknMgUQvzHGysLd3w6RHgce3WD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:125342'),
  ('467207281081208041', 'Here Come the Co-Eds', 1945, 'Comedy', 'Edgar Fairchild, George Robinson, Jean Yarbrough', 'Arthur T. Horman, John Grant', 'Bud Abbott, Lou Costello, Martha O''Driscoll, Peggy Ryan, Lon Chaney Jr., Donald Cook, Charles Dingle, June Vincent', 'NR', 'Molly, her brother, Slats, and his pal, Oliver, are taxi dancers at the Miramar Ballroom. As a publicity stunt, Slats plants an article about Molly claiming her ambition is to earn enough money to attend staid, all-girl Bixby College. Bixby''s progressive dean offers Molly a scholarship. Molly accepts on the condition that Slats and Oliver come along too as campus caretakers. But the pompous Chairman threatens to foreclose on the school''s mortgage if Molly isn''t expelled. Together, the trio, with the help of some new friends, concocts a scheme to raise enough money to save the school. The plan involves a bet on the Bixby basketball team, which is playing in a game rated at 20 to 1 by the local bookie. But the bookie has other plans for their dough and hires a group of ringers to step in for the opponents. All is not lost, at least while Oliver has the chance to turn things around for his friends-one way or another.', 'Molly, her brother, Slats, and his pal, Oliver, are taxi dancers at the Miramar Ballroom. As a publicity stunt, Slats plants an article about Molly claiming her ambition is to earn enough money to attend staid, all-girl Bixby College. Bixby''s progressive dean offers Molly a scholarship. Molly accepts on the condition that Slats and Oliver come along too as campus caretakers. But the pompous Chairman threatens to foreclose on the school''s mortgage if Molly isn''t expelled. Together, the trio, with the help of some new friends, concocts a scheme to raise enough money to save the school. The plan involves a bet on the Bixby basketball team, which is playing in a game rated at 20 to 1 by the local bookie. But the bookie has other plans for their dough and hires a group of ringers to step in for the opponents. All is not lost, at least while Oliver has the chance to turn things around for his friends-one way or another.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6V3Qhpbv8CJZHc2YXf5ATPMaVrY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33482'),
  ('1143496898339793035', 'Here Come the Munsters', 1995, 'Horror, Comedy, Family, TV Movie', 'Robert Ginty', 'Chris Hayward, Jim Fisher, Jim Staahl', 'Edward Herrmann, Veronica Hamel, Robert Morse, Christine Taylor, Mathew Botuchis, Troy Evans, Joel Brooks, Sean O''Bryan', null, 'The Munsters come to America to search for Herman''s brother-in-law Norman Hyde, only to find out that he has turned himself into Brent Jekyll, who is running for congress, and Grandpa must make a formula to change Norman back.', 'The Munsters come to America to search for Herman''s brother-in-law Norman Hyde, only to find out that he has turned himself into Brent Jekyll, who is running for congress, and Grandpa must make a formula to change Norman back.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a0i8csi1cw8OHPwUzFqwLd0tWFr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:249391'),
  ('205832484348127592', 'Here Come the Teachers', 2018, 'Comedy', 'Lorenzo Adorisio, Saverio Di Biagio, Mariachiara Squassino', 'Mathias Gavarry, Pierre-François Martin-Laval, Serena Patrignanelli', 'Claudio Bisio, Lino Guanciale, Maurizio Nichetti, Maria Di Biase, Andrea Pennacchi, Pietro Ragusa, Alessio Sakara, Shalana Santana', null, 'The Manzoni High School in Milan is the worst in Italy. When the percentage of those promoted falls to 12%, it''s time for the last resort: to entrust the classes to the worst of the available teachers.', 'The Manzoni High School in Milan is the worst in Italy. When the percentage of those promoted falls to 12%, it''s time for the last resort: to entrust the classes to the worst of the available teachers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mBc8UOa5VxdgLfY5qYWZvuboJKq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:516043'),
  ('73271468907533897', 'Here Comes Garfield', 1982, 'Animation, Comedy, Adventure, Fantasy, Family, Music, TV Movie', 'Nick Vasu, Phil Roman', 'Jim Davis', 'Lorenzo Music, Hal Smith, Hank Garrett, Gregg Berger, Angela Lee Sloan, Henry Corden, Sandy Kenyon', 'G', 'The first TV special starring the rotund comic strip staple Garfield the Cat. Here, he and his dull-witted canine cohort Odie end up at the pound.', 'The first TV special starring the rotund comic strip staple Garfield the Cat. Here, he and his dull-witted canine cohort Odie end up at the pound.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sSs7GPSdD1309Cu2ebjiKWG5q2y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29131'),
  ('462729262578152520', 'Here Comes Lola!', 2010, 'Family, Comedy, Drama, Music', 'Franziska Buch', null, 'Axel Prahl, Meira Durand, Felina Czycykowski, Fernando Spengler, Julia Jentsch, Nora Tschirner, Birthe Gerken, Margarita Broich', null, 'A nine-year-old girl who has just moved with her parents to Hamburg, Germany, is desperate for finding a best friend. The daughter of a Brazilian father and German mother, Lola is a little girl who dreams she''s a rock star, but mostly dreams of having a best friend.', 'A nine-year-old girl who has just moved with her parents to Hamburg, Germany, is desperate for finding a best friend. The daughter of a Brazilian father and German mother, Lola is a little girl who dreams she''s a rock star, but mostly dreams of having a best friend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8pzpTk8eWvsZ8qmfl2V8zWH00LV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:61035'),
  ('366894931719297997', 'Here Comes Mr. Jordan', 1941, 'Comedy, Fantasy, Romance', 'William Mull, Morris Stoloff, Alexander Hall', 'Sidney Buchman, Seton I. Miller', 'Robert Montgomery, Evelyn Keyes, Claude Rains, Rita Johnson, Edward Everett Horton, James Gleason, John Emery, Donald MacBride', 'NR', 'Boxer Joe Pendleton, flying to his next fight, crashes...because a Heavenly Messenger, new on the job, snatched Joe''s spirit prematurely from his body. Before the matter can be rectified, Joe''s body is cremated; so the celestial Mr. Jordan grants him the use of the body of wealthy Bruce Farnsworth, who''s just been murdered by his wife. Joe tries to remake Farnsworth''s unworthy life in his own clean-cut image, but then falls in love; and what about that murderous wife?', 'Boxer Joe Pendleton, flying to his next fight, crashes...because a Heavenly Messenger, new on the job, snatched Joe''s spirit prematurely from his body. Before the matter can be rectified, Joe''s body is cremated; so the celestial Mr. Jordan grants him the use of the body of wealthy Bruce Farnsworth, who''s just been murdered by his wife. Joe tries to remake Farnsworth''s unworthy life in his own clean-cut image, but then falls in love; and what about that murderous wife?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k6gmIV3hTSCG2JBh2zPMLogZ5y3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38914'),
  ('602751161980435071', 'Here Comes Peter Cottontail', 1971, 'Animation, Family, Adventure, Comedy', 'Jules Bass, Arthur Rankin, Jr.', 'Romeo Muller, Thornton W. Burgess', 'Danny Kaye, Vincent Price, Casey Kasem, Paul Frees, Joan Gardner, Iris Rainer, Greg Thomas, Jeff Thomas', 'NR', 'Peter Cottontail wants to be the #1 chief Easter Bunny, and everyone in April Valley agrees...except for Evil Irontail. Peter must deliver more eggs than this archrival to earn the top spot...and save Easter for children everywhere!', 'Peter Cottontail wants to be the #1 chief Easter Bunny, and everyone in April Valley agrees...except for Evil Irontail. Peter must deliver more eggs than this archrival to earn the top spot...and save Easter for children everywhere!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/85pOfm8QfOHCTud8D91sqXESFi6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47182'),
  ('153691473428971748', 'Here Comes the Boom', 2012, 'Comedy, Action, Drama', 'Frank Coraci, Garrett Warren, Phil Meheux', 'Kevin James, Allan Loeb', 'Kevin James, Salma Hayek Pinault, Henry Winkler, Greg Germann, Joe Rogan, Gary Valentine, Jake Zyrus, Bas Rutten', 'PG', 'A high school biology teacher moonlights as a mixed-martial arts fighter in an effort to raise money to save the school''s music program.', 'A high school biology teacher moonlights as a mixed-martial arts fighter in an effort to raise money to save the school''s music program.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g3ZjNkQP4M7Cs0clPD9q7EO2P1g.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:87826'),
  ('240930146204834780', 'Here Comes the Devil', 2012, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Adrián García Bogliano', 'Adrián García Bogliano', 'Francisco Barreiro, Giancarlo Ruiz, Laura Caro, Alan Martinez, Michele Garcia, David Arturo Cabezud, Enrique Saint-Martin, Michele Estrada', 'R', 'A married couple loses their children while on a family trip near some caves in Tijuana. The kids eventually reappear without explanation, but it becomes clear that they are not who they used to be, that something terrifying has changed them.', 'A married couple loses their children while on a family trip near some caves in Tijuana. The kids eventually reappear without explanation, but it becomes clear that they are not who they used to be, that something terrifying has changed them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xj5eqCfIxU5H99vCthrR2tkpG5N.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:123359'),
  ('390381881376467107', 'Here Comes the Groom', 1951, 'Comedy, Music, Romance', 'Frank Capra, Arthur S. Black Jr., Joseph J. Lilley', 'Liam O''Brien, Virginia Van Upp, Myles Connolly', 'Bing Crosby, Jane Wyman, Alexis Smith, Franchot Tone, James Barton, Robert Keith, Jacky Gencel, H.B. Warner', 'NR', 'Foreign correspondent Pete Garvey has 5 days to win back his former fiancée, or he''ll lose the orphans he adopted.', 'Foreign correspondent Pete Garvey has 5 days to win back his former fiancée, or he''ll lose the orphans he adopted.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eboMQGKcRQJC1ZuYfeCudi0eiwY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27629'),
  ('1142811042553836368', 'Here Comes the Navy', 1934, 'War, Drama', 'Lloyd Bacon, Arthur Edeson', 'Earl Baldwin, Ben Markson', 'James Cagney, Pat O''Brien, Gloria Stuart, Frank McHugh, Dorothy Tree, Robert Barrat, Willard Robertson, Guinn ''Big Boy'' Williams', 'NR', 'A cocky guy joins the Navy for the wrong reason but finds romance and twice is cited for heroism.', 'A cocky guy joins the Navy for the wrong reason but finds romance and twice is cited for heroism.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m2eHdAuXq1UElpmGK3RjfXOBjUR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84099'),
  ('830119139852425233', 'Here Comes the Storm', 1993, 'Comedy', 'Sandro De Santis, Franco Di Giacomo, Daniele Luchetti', 'Stefano Rulli, Sandro Petraglia, Daniele Luchetti', 'Diego Abatantuono, Margherita Buy, Silvio Orlando, Marina Confalone, Eros Pagni, Lucio Allocca, Antonino Iuorio, Angela Finocchiaro', null, 'Depressed magistrate Damiano Fortezza relocates from Milan to a small town in Campania, where the three Fontana sisters, owners of a chain of incinerators, dominate. The youngest, Eugenia, is about to marry a well-known crook Fortezza has to prosecute. However, he ends up falling in love with Eugenia and questioning the priorities of his job.', 'Depressed magistrate Damiano Fortezza relocates from Milan to a small town in Campania, where the three Fontana sisters, owners of a chain of incinerators, dominate. The youngest, Eugenia, is about to marry a well-known crook Fortezza has to prosecute. However, he ends up falling in love with Eugenia and questioning the priorities of his job.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tX94sy9mfAPg4JVhR4KuZOGzpOw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:112269'),
  ('812124599329217529', 'Here for Blood', 2022, 'Horror, Comedy', 'Daniel Turres', 'James Roberts', 'Shawn Roberts, Maya Misaljevic, Joelle Farrow, Tara Spencer-Nairn, Michael Therriault, Kelly Penner, Samantha Helt, Marqus Bobesich', null, 'A rowdy pro-wrestler, struggling to make ends meet, agrees to fill in as a last-minute replacement for his girlfriend''s well-paying babysitting job. Upon arriving at the secluded family home, he meets the precocious 10-year-old Grace. What starts off as a quiet night of pizza and video games quickly spirals into bloody, violent chaos as Tom and Grace find themselves fighting for their lives when an otherworldly cult of masked intruders descend on the home.', 'A rowdy pro-wrestler, struggling to make ends meet, agrees to fill in as a last-minute replacement for his girlfriend''s well-paying babysitting job. Upon arriving at the secluded family home, he meets the precocious 10-year-old Grace. What starts off as a quiet night of pizza and video games quickly spirals into bloody, violent chaos as Tom and Grace find themselves fighting for their lives when an otherworldly cult of masked intruders descend on the home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pj1qooBHoRvBm00PFiE0EumDt6V.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1035583'),
  ('399473363608266887', 'Here Is Your Life', 1966, 'Drama, History', 'Jan Troell, Jan Troell', 'Bengt Forslund, Jan Troell', 'Eddie Axberg, Gudrun Brost, Ulla Akselson, Bo Wahlström, Rick Axberg, Holger Löwenadler, Göran Lindberg, Tage Sjögren', null, 'A working class teenager comes of age in 1910s rural Sweden, moving through a series of jobs and romances that gradually shape his future.', 'A working class teenager comes of age in 1910s rural Sweden, moving through a series of jobs and romances that gradually shape his future.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nrHefsYCBJsTfQRAuZfrrFLWBHU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9646'),
  ('120051967131997212', 'Here Now', 2024, 'Thriller, Crime, Romance', 'Gabriele Muccino, Fabio Zamarion', 'Gabriele Muccino, Paolo Costella', 'Elena Kampouris, Saul Nanni, Lorenzo Richelmy, Enrico Elia Inserra, Francesco Garilli, Ruby Kammer, Yan Tual, Mitch Salm', null, 'Sophie is a twenty-year-old American who has lived her life in isolation, cut off from the world. While on vacation in Palermo with her sister, she meets Giulio and his group of Sicilian friends during her final 24 hours before returning to California. Eager to break free from her sheltered past, Sophie embarks on a whirlwind romance with Giulio.', 'Sophie is a twenty-year-old American who has lived her life in isolation, cut off from the world. While on vacation in Palermo with her sister, she meets Giulio and his group of Sicilian friends during her final 24 hours before returning to California. Eager to break free from her sheltered past, Sophie embarks on a whirlwind romance with Giulio.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gVL8eoeI5BgWbFi7E1GGlbrEg5y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1183761'),
  ('1011937396722984346', 'Here on Earth', 2000, 'Romance, Drama', 'Mark Piznarski, Michael D. O''Shea', 'Michael Seitzman', 'Leelee Sobieski, Chris Klein, Josh Hartnett, Michael Rooker, Annie Corley, Bruce Greenwood, Annette O''Toole, Elaine Hendrix', 'PG-13', 'Three lives of three young people intersect over the course of one summer. A rich student and a young working-class man accidentally destroy a diner when their impromptu road race takes a disastrous turn. Ordered by a judge to spend the summer repairing the building, they find themselves becoming rivals for the affections of the owner''s daughter.', 'Three lives of three young people intersect over the course of one summer. A rich student and a young working-class man accidentally destroy a diner when their impromptu road race takes a disastrous turn. Ordered by a judge to spend the summer repairing the building, they find themselves becoming rivals for the affections of the owner''s daughter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/shvubL3pIrCyEK22ZHrx00oNtCY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13539'),
  ('1122190416778797943', 'Here Today', 2021, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Vanja Černjul, Billy Crystal', 'Billy Crystal, Alan Zweibel', 'Billy Crystal, Tiffany Haddish, Penn Badgley, Laura Benanti, Louisa Krause, Dierdre Friel, Alex Brightman, Matthew Broussard', 'PG-13', 'Veteran comedy writer Charlie Berns, who is slowly but surely losing his grip on reality, befriends a talented young New York street singer Emma Payge. Together, they form an unlikely yet hilarious and touching friendship that kicks the generation gap aside and redefines the meaning of love and trust.', 'Veteran comedy writer Charlie Berns, who is slowly but surely losing his grip on reality, befriends a talented young New York street singer Emma Payge. Together, they form an unlikely yet hilarious and touching friendship that kicks the generation gap aside and redefines the meaning of love and trust.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xp64qD0V9SRE3jU6sEtQufAzYRk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:711475'),
  ('458134180608513323', 'Here Today, Gone Tamale', 1959, 'Animation', 'Friz Freleng', null, 'Mel Blanc', null, 'Sylvester Cat won''t allow starving Mexican mice access to a cache of cheeses on a ship and prompts a challenge by Speedy Gonzales, the fastest mouse in Mexico. Speedy makes several raids on the ship''s stores by outsmarting Sylvester again and again.', 'Sylvester Cat won''t allow starving Mexican mice access to a cache of cheeses on a ship and prompts a challenge by Speedy Gonzales, the fastest mouse in Mexico. Speedy makes several raids on the ship''s stores by outsmarting Sylvester again and again.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hhZKfgHWmFREXSmdUyrmHZ6jSM9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:234805'),
  ('435560991421730011', 'Here We Are', 1978, 'Comedy, TV Movie', 'Sulev Nõmmik, Enn Putnik, Raivo Pikner', 'Sulev Nõmmik, Enn Vetemaa', 'Lia Laats, Ervin Abel, Renate Karhu, Karl Kalkun, Eva Malmsten, Kadri Jäätma, Sulev Nõmmik, Väino Puura', null, 'On a nice summer day a funny little car rolls over a peaceful farm yard of Muhu island. The family that withdraws from the vehicle is quite odd-looking: an overbearing madam, a henpecked stammering husband and a mystical red-head. They announce that they want to spend their vacation in the farm ... "We are from capital, we will pay". This quiet vacation turns out to be a frantic day with romance, unexpected turns and fisticuffs between suitors.', 'On a nice summer day a funny little car rolls over a peaceful farm yard of Muhu island. The family that withdraws from the vehicle is quite odd-looking: an overbearing madam, a henpecked stammering husband and a mystical red-head. They announce that they want to spend their vacation in the farm ... "We are from capital, we will pay". This quiet vacation turns out to be a frantic day with romance, unexpected turns and fisticuffs between suitors.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n5TlakY4N4DWokKctHlX8C9kB75.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:172886'),
  ('422086998041451223', 'Here We Are', 2021, 'Drama', 'Shai Goldman, Nir Bergman', 'Dana Idisis', 'Shai Avivi, Noam Imber, Efrat Ben-Zur, Smadi Wolfman, Amir Feldman, Sharon Zelikovsky, Natalia Faust, Uri Klauzner', null, 'Aharon has devoted his life to raising his son Uri. They live together in a gentle routine, away from the real world. But Uri is autistic, and now as a young adult it might be time for him to live in a specialized home. While on their way to the institution, Aharon decides to run away with his son and hits the road, knowing that Uri is not ready for this separation. Or is it, in fact, his father who is not ready?', 'Aharon has devoted his life to raising his son Uri. They live together in a gentle routine, away from the real world. But Uri is autistic, and now as a young adult it might be time for him to live in a specialized home. While on their way to the institution, Aharon decides to run away with his son and hits the road, knowing that Uri is not ready for this separation. Or is it, in fact, his father who is not ready?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/47P1b8AzOlZfqqTTxxgnv9Z06gV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:712117'),
  ('998811542201795404', 'Here We Are Waiting for You', 1999, 'Documentary', 'Marcelo Masagão', 'Marcelo Masagão', null, null, 'A fascinating and poetical collage of countless images from the 20th century with the purpose of revealing matters of life and death during the era and its many social, cultural and political transformations, with the director making several statements on several issues, combining fact and fiction to compose his powerful mosaic of images along with the magnificent music of Wim Mertens. A true work of art that dares to make several questions about the human condition, its contradictions and ironies.', 'A fascinating and poetical collage of countless images from the 20th century with the purpose of revealing matters of life and death during the era and its many social, cultural and political transformations, with the director making several statements on several issues, combining fact and fiction to compose his powerful mosaic of images along with the magnificent music of Wim Mertens. A true work of art that dares to make several questions about the human condition, its contradictions and ironies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iXiaIrEpbUhSg1RGxlRJLJPZgCf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:76183'),
  ('681056860287574532', 'Here We Are: Notes for Living on Planet Earth', 2020, 'Animation, Family', 'Philip Hunt, Guillaume Glachant, Jeroen Hooghoudt', 'Philip Hunt, Luke Matheny', 'Meryl Streep, Jacob Tremblay, Chris O''Dowd, Ruth Negga, Rob Rackstraw', 'G', 'On the eve of Earth Day, a precocious seven-year-old learns about the wonders of the planet from his parents—and a mysterious exhibit at the aptly named Museum of Everything.', 'On the eve of Earth Day, a precocious seven-year-old learns about the wonders of the planet from his parents—and a mysterious exhibit at the aptly named Museum of Everything.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tZWgclntziFRPQg0u0nI2FU4nYg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:664850'),
  ('1027381013656341322', 'Here We for Example...', 1977, 'Comedy', 'Sergio Corbucci, Gianni Arduini, Giuseppe Rotunno', 'Giuseppe Catalano, Sabatino Ciuffini, Sergio Corbucci', 'Adriano Celentano, Renato Pozzetto, Barbara Bach, Antonio Casagrande, Giuliana Calandra, Felice Andreasi, Franca Marzi, Imma Piro', null, 'Poet Palmambrogio Guanziroli loses his wallet mere moments after arriving in Milan. He locates the culprit, a photographer nicknamed ''Click'' and takes up residence with him until he either gets his money back or his poetry published.', 'Poet Palmambrogio Guanziroli loses his wallet mere moments after arriving in Milan. He locates the culprit, a photographer nicknamed ''Click'' and takes up residence with him until he either gets his money back or his poetry published.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5658YScD3G7ZsbXQmVOYkSYSMDX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50188'),
  ('255027715037710533', 'Here We Go Round the Mulberry Bush', 1968, 'Comedy', 'Clive Donner, Mark James, Peter Price', 'Hunter Davies', 'Barry Evans, Judy Geeson, Angela Scoular, Sheila White, Adrienne Posta, Vanessa Howard, Diane Keen, Moyra Fraser', null, 'Jamie McGregor is a virginal sixth-former in suburbia delivering groceries for the local supermarket, but he is more interested in other matters - Mary, Linda, Paula, and Caroline. He tries to seduce the girls of his dreams in the swinging sixties.', 'Jamie McGregor is a virginal sixth-former in suburbia delivering groceries for the local supermarket, but he is more interested in other matters - Mary, Linda, Paula, and Caroline. He tries to seduce the girls of his dreams in the swinging sixties.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w4UIhf3ZqlIp3XUaQzonpuyMgsh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:71921'),
  ('494883729286970338', 'Here, Beneath the North Star', 1968, 'History, Drama', 'Edvin Laine, Pekka Parikka, Olavi Tuomi', 'Edvin Laine, Väinö Linna, Matti Kassila', 'Aarno Sulkanen, Titta Karakorpi, Risto Taulo, Anja Pohjola, Kalevi Kahra, Rose-Marie Precht, Matti Ranin, Mirjam Novero', null, 'Täällä Pohjantähden alla is based on the book with the same title. It is a story of the little village. The movie starts in the 1890''s and it ends to the Finnish civil war in 1918. Story concentrates around a tenant farmer family, although it gives us a good look at the society at whole. While the class struggle depends, people of the village are driven to bloody civil war.', 'Täällä Pohjantähden alla is based on the book with the same title. It is a story of the little village. The movie starts in the 1890''s and it ends to the Finnish civil war in 1918. Story concentrates around a tenant farmer family, although it gives us a good look at the society at whole. While the class struggle depends, people of the village are driven to bloody civil war.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mKIRPsiK2ZZiF9kJZZe05Czw5kT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:103752'),
  ('38830970922081414', 'Here''s the Deal', 2013, 'Comedy', 'Arnau Valls Colomer, Alejandro Marzoa Blasco', 'Alejandro Marzoa Blasco, Juan Cruz, Miguel Ángel Blanca', 'Miguel de Lira, Paco Tous, Manuela Vellés, Unax Ugalde, Marisol Membrillo, Antonio Durán ''Morris'', Sílvia Filipe, Xosé Manuel Olveira', null, 'Suso and Manuel, two-parent family and lifelong friends, met fifty years, they become unemployed. When the situation is no longer tenable, an unusual fact: one day, while fishing, find a package with ten kilos of cocaine.', 'Suso and Manuel, two-parent family and lifelong friends, met fifty years, they become unemployed. When the situation is no longer tenable, an unusual fact: one day, while fishing, find a package with ten kilos of cocaine.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rqoV2xYGnNIgzYRCCCt3anorhkq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:180410'),
  ('988514870357310683', 'Here''s to the Young Lady', 1949, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Keisuke Kinoshita, Hiroshi Kusuda', 'Kaneto Shindō', 'Shūji Sano, Setsuko Hara, Chieko Higashiyama, Keiji Sada, Takeshi Sakamoto, Sachiko Murase', null, 'A matchmaker looks to unite a young woman from a wealthy Tokyo family with the humble owner of an auto garage.', 'A matchmaker looks to unite a young woman from a wealthy Tokyo family with the humble owner of an auto garage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mzJGzQRuzG4NjJFTCf2ks5GNWaH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:125230'),
  ('565080603362786047', 'Hereafter', 2010, 'Drama, Fantasy', 'Clint Eastwood, Tom Stern, David M. Bernstein', 'Peter Morgan', 'Matt Damon, Cécile de France, Bryce Dallas Howard, Thierry Neuvic, Cyndi Mayo-Akeo, Lisa Griffiths, Jessica Griffiths, Ferguson Reid', 'PG-13', 'Three people — a blue-collar American, a French journalist and a London school boy — are touched by death in different ways.', 'Three people — a blue-collar American, a French journalist and a London school boy — are touched by death in different ways.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zEBdYRjwFLEXXXE6IBOUD8W1mr6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44603'),
  ('494835092814147286', 'Hereditary', 2018, 'Horror, Mystery, Thriller', 'Davy Leeman, Matt Punosevic, MarSchelle Walker', 'Ari Aster', 'Toni Collette, Alex Wolff, Gabriel Byrne, Milly Shapiro, Ann Dowd, Mallory Bechtel, Brock McKinney, Jake Brown', 'R', 'Following the death of the Leigh family matriarch, Annie and her children uncover disturbing secrets about their heritage. Their daily lives are not only impacted, but they also become entangled in a chilling fate from which they cannot escape, driving them to the brink of madness.', 'Following the death of the Leigh family matriarch, Annie and her children uncover disturbing secrets about their heritage. Their daily lives are not only impacted, but they also become entangled in a chilling fate from which they cannot escape, driving them to the brink of madness.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hjlZSXM86wJrfCv5VKfR5DI2VeU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:493922'),
  ('241763559975211265', 'Heretic', 1931, null, 'Julien Bryan', null, 'Martha Graham', null, 'Heretic is a modern dance work by Martha Graham performed to Tetus Breton, an old folk tune from Brittany.', 'Heretic is a modern dance work by Martha Graham performed to Tetus Breton, an old folk tune from Brittany.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r1TuCLqxamAfXJzRJE15S6309ty.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:438832'),
  ('391666030337559891', 'Heretic', 2024, 'Thriller, Horror', 'Chung Chung-hoon, Richard Cowan, Scott Beck', 'Scott Beck, Bryan Woods', 'Hugh Grant, Sophie Thatcher, Chloe East, Topher Grace, Elle Young, Julie Lynn-Mortensen, Haylie Hansen, Elle McKinnon', 'R', 'Two young missionaries are forced to prove their faith when they knock on the wrong door and are greeted by a diabolical Mr. Reed, becoming ensnared in his deadly game of cat-and-mouse.', 'Two young missionaries are forced to prove their faith when they knock on the wrong door and are greeted by a diabolical Mr. Reed, becoming ensnared in his deadly game of cat-and-mouse.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fr96XzlzsONrQrGfdLMiwtQjott.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1138194'),
  ('437402487050929827', 'Hergé: In the Shadow of Tintin', 2016, 'Documentary', 'Grégoire de Calignon, Hugues Nancy, Matthieu Daude', 'Fraser McNaught', 'Laurent Stocker, Andreas C. Knigge, Benoît Mouchart, Cécile Malsonneuve, François Schuiten, Frédérik Peeters, Joost Swarte, Michael Farr', null, 'Georges Remi, known as Hergé, a complex and complicated artist, created Tintin, one of the most famous characters in the world. With exceptional access to the archives of Studios Hergé and Moulinsart, this documentary looks at Remi''s life and the way he changed the art of comic.', 'Georges Remi, known as Hergé, a complex and complicated artist, created Tintin, one of the most famous characters in the world. With exceptional access to the archives of Studios Hergé and Moulinsart, this documentary looks at Remi''s life and the way he changed the art of comic.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b3WUrIGB1NMJHcyHikrs4peGIh7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:426470'),
  ('352413623677289820', 'Herman', 1990, 'Drama, Family', 'Erik Gustavson, Kjell Vassdal', 'Lars Saabye Christensen', 'Anders Danielsen Lie, Jarl Kulle, Bjørn Floberg, Elisabeth Sand, Frank Robert, Sossen Krohg, Kai Remlov, Harald Heide-Steen Jr.', null, '"Herman", based on Lars Saabye Christensen''s novel of the same name, tells the story of the young boy Herman who suddenly loses his hair and becomes bald at the age of eleven. It follows him through what is a very difficult period in his life, through big mood swings and irrational behaviour until he finally learns to accept himself for who he is.', '"Herman", based on Lars Saabye Christensen''s novel of the same name, tells the story of the young boy Herman who suddenly loses his hair and becomes bald at the age of eleven. It follows him through what is a very difficult period in his life, through big mood swings and irrational behaviour until he finally learns to accept himself for who he is.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yYIf5LlyzhzeJKNkHWX276U8Nbr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52890'),
  ('476866807330020464', 'Herman the German', 2015, 'Comedy', 'Michael Binz, Jesse Mazuch', 'Michael Binz', 'Gustav Peter Wöhler, Anke Engelke, Piet Fuchs, Hans Martin Stier, Kerstin Thielemann, Enno Kalisch, Igor Novic, Thorsten Franzen', null, 'After an accident Herman learns that the suffers from a very rare illness which causes him that the emotion "fear" falls out whereby he is forced to try out all phobias to become normal again.', 'After an accident Herman learns that the suffers from a very rare illness which causes him that the emotion "fear" falls out whereby he is forced to try out all phobias to become normal again.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sy6JoA5m0JoqnajvzS8ph0J3QDs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:357017'),
  ('434885715226057742', 'Hermana, ¿pero qué has hecho?', 1995, 'Comedy', 'Pedro Masó, Fernando Arribas', 'Santiago Moncada, Pedro Masó', 'Lina Morgan, Tote García Ortega, José Manuel Cervino, Aurora Bautista, Jesús Castejón, Beatriz Rico, Luis Fernando Alvés, Neus Asensi', null, 'Sister Angela and Sister Mary park his van in front of a bank branch. They enter the bank and with the weapons hidden under their habits, commit the robbery of the century, to the astonishment of all employees and customers. After thorough police investigation the two nuns are arrested, but then appears Trini, twin sister of one of them and now all is not so clear. Were the nuns who committed the robbery?', 'Sister Angela and Sister Mary park his van in front of a bank branch. They enter the bank and with the weapons hidden under their habits, commit the robbery of the century, to the astonishment of all employees and customers. After thorough police investigation the two nuns are arrested, but then appears Trini, twin sister of one of them and now all is not so clear. Were the nuns who committed the robbery?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xOCjrFFVlMOPwGb4ST1O0LYofX8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:117198'),
  ('750042034604483981', 'Hermanas', 2005, 'Drama', 'Julia Solomonoff, Ramiro Civita, Ana Laura Gussoni', 'Julia Solomonoff', 'Valeria Bertuccelli, Ingrid Rubio, Adrián Navarro, Milton De La Canal, Nicolás Pauls, Horacio Peña, Mónica Galán, Eusebio Poncela', null, 'Argentinian sisters Elena and Natalia, who were separated, meet again in Texas in 1984.', 'Argentinian sisters Elena and Natalia, who were separated, meet again in Texas in 1984.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/agIhWAeOqnuHQhmqKtsVnsG9uvU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:138258'),
  ('525644441585481742', 'Hermanoteu In the Land of Godah', 2009, 'Comedy', 'Bernardo Palmeiro', null, 'Ricardo Pipo, Jovane Nunes, Adriana Nunes, Adriano Siri, Welder Rodrigues, Victor Leal, Chico Anysio', null, 'The comedy tells the story of Hermanotheus, brother of Micalateia and typical Hebrew of the year zero, companion, good shepherd and obedient. He receives the divine mission to guide his people to the land of Godah, in a satire on the biblical story of Moses. In a setting that represents an immense desert, actor Ricardo Pipo plays Hermanotheu, who encounters characters on the way from Cleopatra to the son of the Whole -Powerful. Actors Adriana Nunes, Adriano Siri, Jovane Nunes, Victor Leal and Welder Rodrigues take turns in the other roles. The voice of God, which appears in the off-screen, is by Chico Anysio. Following the group''s line of satire, “Hermanoteu in the Land of Godah” visits the diversity of the Bible. The comedy also makes numerous quotes from the modern world, bringing the past closer to the present.', 'The comedy tells the story of Hermanotheus, brother of Micalateia and typical Hebrew of the year zero, companion, good shepherd and obedient. He receives the divine mission to guide his people to the land of Godah, in a satire on the biblical story of Moses. In a setting that represents an immense desert, actor Ricardo Pipo plays Hermanotheu, who encounters characters on the way from Cleopatra to the son of the Whole -Powerful. Actors Adriana Nunes, Adriano Siri, Jovane Nunes, Victor Leal and Welder Rodrigues take turns in the other roles. The voice of God, which appears in the off-screen, is by Chico Anysio. Following the group''s line of satire, “Hermanoteu in the Land of Godah” visits the diversity of the Bible. The comedy also makes numerous quotes from the modern world, bringing the past closer to the present.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/63y5BfDt4vpnTdzDM1yIGDWmdCe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56083'),
  ('315320225204207022', 'Hermanoteu na Terra de Godah: O Filme', 2021, 'Comedy', 'Dudu Miranda, Homero Olivetto, Léo Carvalho', 'Victor Leal, Pedro Neschling, Jovane Nunes', 'Ricardo Pipo, Adriana Nunes, Welder Rodrigues, Jovane Nunes, Victor Leal, Adriano Siri, Chico Anysio, Marcos Caruso', null, 'Hermanoteu is a young shepherd boy who, enlightened by the "Divine Light", travels to the land of Godah to free the people from the oppressive hands of cruel tyrants. A comedy based on the hugely successful play "Hermanoteu in the Land of Godah" by the Brazilian theater company "The Best of the World".', 'Hermanoteu is a young shepherd boy who, enlightened by the "Divine Light", travels to the land of Godah to free the people from the oppressive hands of cruel tyrants. A comedy based on the hugely successful play "Hermanoteu in the Land of Godah" by the Brazilian theater company "The Best of the World".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qYYy7j90LHWWPhSeOx4rMXqwdoa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:806354'),
  ('538474370529844527', 'Hermelinda Linda', 1984, 'Action, Fantasy, Comedy, Drama, Horror', 'Raymundo Calixto Sánchez, Julio Aldama', null, 'Evita Muñoz ''Chachita'', Julio Aldama, Rubi Re, María Cardinal, Queta Lavat, Queta Carrasco, Julio Aldama Jr., Arturo Benavides', null, 'Live action feature based on the Mexican comic about the exploits of a witch living in the outskirts of ''Bondojia'', when a ruthless small time politician tries to steal their land in order to build a luxurious condo.', 'Live action feature based on the Mexican comic about the exploits of a witch living in the outskirts of ''Bondojia'', when a ruthless small time politician tries to steal their land in order to build a luxurious condo.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eQbQK2TjmiNkrWB92bTpYU5ueq1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:326853'),
  ('725247489602834552', 'Hermia & Helena', 2016, 'Drama', 'Agostina Gálvez, Bingham Bryant, Lindsey Vandevier', 'Matías Piñeiro', 'Agustina Muñoz, Mati Diop, María Villar, Julián Larquier Tellarini, Keith Poulson, Dan Sallitt, Laura Paredes, Dustin Guy Defa', null, 'Camila, a young Argentine theater director, travels from Buenos Aires to New York to attend an artistic residency to develop a Spanish translation of Shakespeare''s "A Midsummer Night''s Dream." Upon her arrival, she begins to receive a series of mysterious postcards which set her down a winding path through her past and towards her future.', 'Camila, a young Argentine theater director, travels from Buenos Aires to New York to attend an artistic residency to develop a Spanish translation of Shakespeare''s "A Midsummer Night''s Dream." Upon her arrival, she begins to receive a series of mysterious postcards which set her down a winding path through her past and towards her future.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/loKzWM0467gOlpE6bJaDT8ALBQq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:377279'),
  ('1052223989249466427', 'Hero', 1983, 'Romance', 'Subhash Ghai', 'Subhash Ghai', 'Sanjeev Kumar, Shammi Kapoor, Jackie Shroff, Meenakshi Sheshadri, Amrish Puri, Neeta Mehta, Madan Puri, Bharat Bhushan', null, 'Hero is the story of a criminal transforming and evolving as a good person under the influence of love. Jackie is a baddie with a heart of gold though, who has to settle scores with the area''s ''Thakur'' and his police officer son Sanjeev Kumar. So he opts for kidnapping their soft spot, Radha, Thakur khandaan''s only daughter. Radha is given to understand that Jackie and his gang are police people who have taken her away to the safety of jungles because their house has been invaded by dacoits. The rest of the story is about the gang''s camaraderie with Radha in sylvan spots and the discovery of truth by Radha.', 'Hero is the story of a criminal transforming and evolving as a good person under the influence of love. Jackie is a baddie with a heart of gold though, who has to settle scores with the area''s ''Thakur'' and his police officer son Sanjeev Kumar. So he opts for kidnapping their soft spot, Radha, Thakur khandaan''s only daughter. Radha is given to understand that Jackie and his gang are police people who have taken her away to the safety of jungles because their house has been invaded by dacoits. The rest of the story is about the gang''s camaraderie with Radha in sylvan spots and the discovery of truth by Radha.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cz0Zbdra2YbZlsmoTrslzRyrrBZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:62803'),
  ('270212904273514373', 'Hero', 1986, 'Documentary', 'Tony Maylam', 'Tony Maylam', 'Michael Caine, Diego Maradona, Hugo Sánchez, Sócrates, Preben Elkjær, Michel Platini, Enzo Francescoli, Gary Lineker', 'G', '1986 FIFA World Cup Official Film. Mexico had just recovered from a devastating earthquake, but the nation put on a great tournament and Argentina, inspired by Maradona, justified "favourite" status. Eighty-six minutes of football magic from numerous world stars, including Diego Maradona, Gary Lineker, Michel Platini, Socrates, Rummenigge, Sanchez, Laudrup and many others. Michael Caine narrates this, the official FIFA coverage.', '1986 FIFA World Cup Official Film. Mexico had just recovered from a devastating earthquake, but the nation put on a great tournament and Argentina, inspired by Maradona, justified "favourite" status. Eighty-six minutes of football magic from numerous world stars, including Diego Maradona, Gary Lineker, Michel Platini, Socrates, Rummenigge, Sanchez, Laudrup and many others. Michael Caine narrates this, the official FIFA coverage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v9jP6f01VhmUDqwSZDZ8IBEtELV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53818'),
  ('1126788533337464285', 'Hero', 1992, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Oliver Stapleton, Stephen Frears, Nina K. Noble', 'David Webb Peoples', 'Dustin Hoffman, Geena Davis, Andy Garcia, Joan Cusack, Kevin J. O''Connor, Chevy Chase, Maury Chaykin, Stephen Tobolowsky', 'PG-13', 'Bernie Laplante is having a rough time. He''s divorced, his ex-wife hates him and has custody of their son, the cops are setting a trap for him, then to top it all, he loses a shoe whilst rescuing passengers of a crashed jet. Being a thief who is down on his luck, Bernie takes advantage of the crash, but then someone else claims credit for the rescue.', 'Bernie Laplante is having a rough time. He''s divorced, his ex-wife hates him and has custody of their son, the cops are setting a trap for him, then to top it all, he loses a shoe whilst rescuing passengers of a crashed jet. Being a thief who is down on his luck, Bernie takes advantage of the crash, but then someone else claims credit for the rescue.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wD7D0B9U9ooanxyhtgLKaqM7www.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10699'),
  ('243016666028718747', 'Hero', 1997, 'Action', 'Corey Yuen, Tom Lau Moon-Tong, Tam Hong-Ming', 'Jeffrey Lau Chun-Wai, Corey Yuen', 'Takeshi Kaneshiro, Yuen Biao, Jessica Hsuan, Valerie Chow, Yuen Wah, Corey Yuen, Richard Yuen Tak, Guo Jianyong', null, 'Ma Wing Jing and his older brother Ma Tai Chueng arrive in Shanghai to make their fortune at the end of the Qin Dynasty. Be-friending a powerful mobster Wing Jing is given his nightclub in return for saving Tam Sei''s life. Unfortunately, another Gangster wants the territory a well. Corruption and violence rule the streets as Wing Jing and Tam Sei must battle not only the rival gangs but the corrupt police officials as well.', 'Ma Wing Jing and his older brother Ma Tai Chueng arrive in Shanghai to make their fortune at the end of the Qin Dynasty. Be-friending a powerful mobster Wing Jing is given his nightclub in return for saving Tam Sei''s life. Unfortunately, another Gangster wants the territory a well. Corruption and violence rule the streets as Wing Jing and Tam Sei must battle not only the rival gangs but the corrupt police officials as well.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r9rQsbD6UJccmulxw2MwpOZq9ED.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32982'),
  ('706428247420411837', 'Hero', 2002, 'Drama, Adventure, Action, History', 'Christopher Doyle, Zhang Yimou', 'Feng Li, Feng Li, Zhang Yimou', 'Jet Li, Tony Leung Chiu-wai, Maggie Cheung, Donnie Yen, Zhang Ziyi, Chen Daoming, Liu Zhongyuan, Zheng Tianyong', 'PG-13', 'During China''s Warring States period, a district prefect arrives at the palace of Qin Shi Huang, claiming to have killed the three assassins who had made an attempt on the king''s life three years ago.', 'During China''s Warring States period, a district prefect arrives at the palace of Qin Shi Huang, claiming to have killed the three assassins who had made an attempt on the king''s life three years ago.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vxgZto2Cz7ILHAlmRXt50I2brB2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:79'),
  ('754342161817811356', 'Hero', 2007, 'Mystery', 'Masayuki Suzuki, Takahiro Tsutai, Shozo Katashima', 'Yasushi Fukuda', 'Takuya Kimura, Takako Matsu, Nene Otsuka, Hiroshi Abe, Masanobu Katsumura, Fumiyo Kohinata, Norito Yashima, Takuzo Kadono', null, 'After six years away, D.A. Kuryu Kohei (Kimura Takuya) returns to his former Josai branch of the Tokyo District Public Prosecutors Office, just in time for a brewing storm. Kohei''s first case starts out simple enough. The suspect, a blonde-haired security guard, had already confessed to manslaughter, but he suddenly retracts his confession and takes things to court with big-shot defense attorney Gamo (Matsumoto Koshiro). It turns out that the security guard is a key alibi witness in a high-profile political corruption case, and the results of his case will directly affect the next. With the media, politicians, and a special investigative team breathing down his back, Kohei must handle the case with care (and flair) to find out the truth.', 'After six years away, D.A. Kuryu Kohei (Kimura Takuya) returns to his former Josai branch of the Tokyo District Public Prosecutors Office, just in time for a brewing storm. Kohei''s first case starts out simple enough. The suspect, a blonde-haired security guard, had already confessed to manslaughter, but he suddenly retracts his confession and takes things to court with big-shot defense attorney Gamo (Matsumoto Koshiro). It turns out that the security guard is a key alibi witness in a high-profile political corruption case, and the results of his case will directly affect the next. With the media, politicians, and a special investigative team breathing down his back, Kohei must handle the case with care (and flair) to find out the truth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aVxjqECYwdC6fkXwccQaWkZEAga.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51550'),
  ('733220780000670370', 'Hero', 2015, 'Romance, Comedy, Drama, Crime', 'Masayuki Suzuki, Takahiro Tsutai, Kimiyoshi Adachi', 'Yasushi Fukuda, Kosuke Nishi', 'Takuya Kimura, Keiko Kitagawa, Takako Matsu, Koichi Sato, Tetta Sugimoto, Gaku Hamada, Bokuzo Masana, Yoh Yoshida', null, 'Prosecutor Kohei Kuryu takes charge of a case with a foreign embassy possessing the key to solve the case. Due to the extraterritoriality involving the case, the investigation has not gone anywhere. A crisis then ensues. Kohei Kuryu and his office attempt to extract the truth behind the wall of the Neustrian Embassy.', 'Prosecutor Kohei Kuryu takes charge of a case with a foreign embassy possessing the key to solve the case. Due to the extraterritoriality involving the case, the investigation has not gone anywhere. A crisis then ensues. Kohei Kuryu and his office attempt to extract the truth behind the wall of the Neustrian Embassy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pcnjUHvKTrdpaA3F3yiaK7XaP5N.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:360635'),
  ('753361379764297420', 'Hero', 2022, 'Drama, History, Action', 'Cho Sang-yun, Shin Tae-seob, Kim Deok-min', null, 'Chung Sung-hwa, Kim Go-eun, Na Moon-hee, Jo Jae-yun, Bae Jung-nam, Lee Hyun-woo, Park Jin-joo, Chang Gi-young', null, 'An Jung-geun fights for Korea''s independence from the Japanese Empire and sparks a movement. In 1909, he assassinates Itō Hirobumi, the first prime minister of Japan and resident-general of Korea.', 'An Jung-geun fights for Korea''s independence from the Japanese Empire and sparks a movement. In 1909, he assassinates Itō Hirobumi, the first prime minister of Japan and resident-general of Korea.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h9ILIeAgDFRgz2czx7tJEChXv5k.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:602464'),
  ('1014483265133354648', 'Hero - Beyond the Boundary of Time', 1993, 'Comedy, Fantasy', 'Blackie Ko Sau-Leung, Alan Chui Chung-San, Chun Kwai-Bo', 'Clarence Yip Wai-Chung, Matt Chow Hoi-Kwong, Joe Ma Wai-Ho', 'Tony Leung Chiu-wai, Dicky Cheung Wai-Kin, Sophia Crawford, Jacqueline Ng Suet-Man, Veronica Yip Yuk-Hing, Kent Tong Chun-Yip, Lee Fai, Won Jin', null, 'Wai Siu-Bo travels to the future on a mission to cure the emperor''s illness.', 'Wai Siu-Bo travels to the future on a mission to cure the emperor''s illness.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mB4QnBfYnIyXJcoUrxTU3czQ1iX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:221461'),
  ('563083885547471389', 'Hero and the Terror', 1988, 'Drama, Action, Thriller, Crime, Romance', 'Eric Van Haren Noman, William Tannen', 'Michael Blodgett, Dennis Shryack', 'Chuck Norris, Brynn Thayer, Steve James, Jack O''Halloran, Jeffrey Kramer, Ron O''Neal, Murphy Dunne, Heather Blodgett', 'R', 'Danny O''Brien is back in action fighting the notorious Simon Moon, also known as The Terror. Three years earlier O''Brien had single-handedly captured The Terror and was called Hero by the people of L.A. Now Simon has escaped and has started killing women again, and O''Brien is the only man who can stop him.', 'Danny O''Brien is back in action fighting the notorious Simon Moon, also known as The Terror. Three years earlier O''Brien had single-handedly captured The Terror and was called Hero by the people of L.A. Now Simon has escaped and has started killing women again, and O''Brien is the only man who can stop him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hGu0e6dHop1KIBB3BmFbQpVONb1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38950'),
  ('723136534746020571', 'Hero at Large', 1980, 'Action, Comedy, Drama', 'Martin Davidson, Jack Roe, David M. Walsh', 'AJ Carothers', 'John Ritter, Anne Archer, Bert Convy, Kevin McCarthy, Harry Bellaver, Anita Dangler, Jane Hallaren, Leonard Harris', 'PG', 'An idealistic but struggling actor finds his life unexpectedly complicated when he stops a robbery while wearing the costume of Captain Avenger, a superhero character of a film he is hired to promote. He decides to dabble at being a superhero only to find that it is more difficult and dangerous than he ever imagined.', 'An idealistic but struggling actor finds his life unexpectedly complicated when he stops a robbery while wearing the costume of Captain Avenger, a superhero character of a film he is hired to promote. He decides to dabble at being a superhero only to find that it is more difficult and dangerous than he ever imagined.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s5y93WClZAZfYXNRB9uuw4VWIzY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44004'),
  ('408547574316615102', 'Hero Dog: The Journey Home', 2021, 'Adventure', 'Richard Boddington, Stephen Chandler Whitehead', 'Richard Boddington', 'Steve Byers, Natasha Henstridge, Zackary Arthur, John Tench, Jeremy Ferdman', 'PG', 'Chinook the Alaskan Malamute must lead a shipwrecked blind man out of the wilderness, while the man''s children launch a rescue mission of their own.', 'Chinook the Alaskan Malamute must lead a shipwrecked blind man out of the wilderness, while the man''s children launch a rescue mission of their own.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ybWtSFLVakBIVeAviZ6SsQKIuSv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:747548'),
  ('55255671682463886', 'Hero Mode', 2021, 'Comedy, Family', 'Gustavo Peña, Cameron H. Price, Jonathan Hall', 'Jeff Carpenter', 'Chris Carpenter, Indiana Massara, Mira Sorvino, Sean Astin, Mary Lynn Rajskub, Erik Griffin, Creed Bratton, Nelson Franklin', 'PG', 'A teenage coding genius has just 30 days to create the world''s greatest video game or his family loses everything. No pressure.', 'A teenage coding genius has just 30 days to create the world''s greatest video game or his family loses everything. No pressure.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yh8FKfdoddaOQjyVVBUPebdoB1x.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:764068'),
  ('183044816830949205', 'Hero No. 1', 1997, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Anand Chitragupth, Milind Chitragupth, David Dhawan', 'Rumi Jaffery', 'Govinda, Karisma Kapoor, Kader Khan, Paresh Rawal, Satish Shah, Tiku Talsania, Anil Dhawan, Master Omkar Kapoor', null, 'Rajesh and Meena fall in love and want to get married. But Meena''s grandfather rejects Rajesh without seeing him because of a terrible encounter with Rajesh''s father. Rajesh pretends to be a servant and finds employment in Meena''s house to try and win her family over.', 'Rajesh and Meena fall in love and want to get married. But Meena''s grandfather rejects Rajesh without seeing him because of a terrible encounter with Rajesh''s father. Rajesh pretends to be a servant and finds employment in Meena''s house to try and win her family over.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ruKS1nf9EfMuAIEQZqj2N2aCySW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30613'),
  ('569261534129641905', 'Hero of Rome', 1964, 'Action, Adventure', 'Giorgio Ferroni', 'Antonio Visone', 'Gordon Scott, Gabriella Pallotta, Massimo Serato, Gabriele Antonini, Maria Pia Conte, Roldano Lupi, Philippe Hersent, Franco Fantasia', null, 'In ancient Rome, the people finally oust their despised king, Tarquinius, and declare the city a republic. Tarquinius makes an alliance with the Etruscan king, Porsenna, to take back power in Rome, but a Roman general, the heroic Mucius, sets out to stop him.', 'In ancient Rome, the people finally oust their despised king, Tarquinius, and declare the city a republic. Tarquinius makes an alliance with the Etruscan king, Porsenna, to take back power in Rome, but a Roman general, the heroic Mucius, sets out to stop him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yIerSf9MNF32ajysw90KZVB54fv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:187852'),
  ('991219771143348033', 'Hero of the Red Light District', 1960, 'Drama, History', 'Tomu Uchida, Sadaji Yoshida', 'Yoshikata Yoda', 'Chiezo Kataoka, Yoshie Mizutani, Isao Kimura, Minoru Chiaki, Shinobu Chihara, Kogiku Hanayagi, Hiroshi Mizuno, Tsukie Matsuura', null, 'A successful textile industrialist from the provinces, who is beloved by his employees for his kindness, cannot find a wife because of a disfiguring birthmark on his face. Even the courtesans in Yoshiwara refuse to entertain him, until an indentured peasant prostitute, Tamarazu, takes the unsavoury assignment and treats him with brash tenderness.', 'A successful textile industrialist from the provinces, who is beloved by his employees for his kindness, cannot find a wife because of a disfiguring birthmark on his face. Even the courtesans in Yoshiwara refuse to entertain him, until an indentured peasant prostitute, Tamarazu, takes the unsavoury assignment and treats him with brash tenderness.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uBhHuFSE4j0jvcbo3yHFGJvJure.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:184244'),
  ('794825323405365302', 'Hero of the Wild', 1977, 'Adventure, Action', 'William Chang Kee, William Chang Kee', 'Ni Kuang, William Chang Kee, Chang Hsin-Yi', 'Chan Sing, Hwang Jang-Lee, Doris Lung Chun-Erh, Yuen Biao, Hua Chung Ting, Corey Yuen, Man-no Chan, Ming Lieh Chan', null, 'A regional champion martial artist that moonlights as an honour-bound assassin, Tu Ta Shen, solidifies his reputation by challenging top fighters en route to the other champion, Nan Pa Tien, in order to unify both titles. Along the way he defeats a man who''s shame in defeat drives him to suicide. Before he dies, recognizing Tu Ta Shen honour, he asks Tu Ta Shen to defeat a group of Manchu supporters led by none other that Nan Pa Tien. The dying mans son, Sa Woo, tries to kill Tu Ta Shen but is easily outmatched. Tu Ta Shen offer to teach Sa Yoo enough so that he can take revenge for his father. The two set out together; One to fulfill a promise to a dying man, one to keep a promise of revenge.', 'A regional champion martial artist that moonlights as an honour-bound assassin, Tu Ta Shen, solidifies his reputation by challenging top fighters en route to the other champion, Nan Pa Tien, in order to unify both titles. Along the way he defeats a man who''s shame in defeat drives him to suicide. Before he dies, recognizing Tu Ta Shen honour, he asks Tu Ta Shen to defeat a group of Manchu supporters led by none other that Nan Pa Tien. The dying mans son, Sa Woo, tries to kill Tu Ta Shen but is easily outmatched. Tu Ta Shen offer to teach Sa Yoo enough so that he can take revenge for his father. The two set out together; One to fulfill a promise to a dying man, one to keep a promise of revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6x6JPx6wU8eurXN1nfTSaPsjtuC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:135549'),
  ('133675708323630621', 'Hero Wanted', 2008, 'Crime, Action, Thriller', 'Brian Smrz, Larry Blanford, Mathew Dunne', 'Chad Law, Evan Law', 'Cuba Gooding Jr., Ray Liotta, Norman Reedus, Kim Coates, Tommy Flanagan, Jean Smart, Christa Campbell, Gary Cairns', 'R', 'Liam Case is a garbage man whose life hasn''t quite turned out the way he expected it would. In order to impress the girl of his dreams, Liam plans an elaborate heist that will culminate with him jumping in to save the day at the last minute. When the day of the heist arrives, however, the plan takes an unexpected turn and Liam winds up in the hospital.', 'Liam Case is a garbage man whose life hasn''t quite turned out the way he expected it would. In order to impress the girl of his dreams, Liam plans an elaborate heist that will culminate with him jumping in to save the day at the last minute. When the day of the heist arrives, however, the plan takes an unexpected turn and Liam winds up in the hospital.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d7QsvWn92eTpSsOv0JHmpsWXY8X.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16450'),
  ('348667869891663534', 'Herod''s Law', 1999, 'Comedy, Crime, Mystery, Drama', 'Luis Estrada, Andrés Franco, Martín Torres', 'Jaime Sampietro, Vicente Leñero, Fernando Javier León Rodríguez', 'Damián Alcázar, Pedro Armendáriz Jr., Isela Vega, Salvador Sánchez, Juan Carlos Colombo, Delia Casanova, Leticia Huijara, Alex Cox', null, 'In the 1940s, a small Mexican town has seen its last three mayors assassinated in rapid succession. A naive janitor is recruited to become the new mayor, and he believes he will modernize the little town and usher in a reign of peace. But the system corrupts him very quickly, and he takes to abusing his power while associating with an unscrupulous assortment of opportunists, hypocrites and criminals.', 'In the 1940s, a small Mexican town has seen its last three mayors assassinated in rapid succession. A naive janitor is recruited to become the new mayor, and he believes he will modernize the little town and usher in a reign of peace. But the system corrupts him very quickly, and he takes to abusing his power while associating with an unscrupulous assortment of opportunists, hypocrites and criminals.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/653dXbr6dXffXG0oN8OfZGShFRP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14430'),
  ('745898570390140685', 'Heroes', 1977, 'Drama, Romance, War', 'Jeremy Kagan, Frank Stanley', 'James Carabatsos', 'Henry Winkler, Sally Field, Harrison Ford, Val Avery, Olivia Cole, Hector Elias, Dennis Burkley, Tony Burton', 'PG', 'A Vietnam veteran suffering from post traumatic stress disorder breaks out of a VA hospital and goes on a road trip with a sympathetic traveler to find out what became of the other men in his unit.', 'A Vietnam veteran suffering from post traumatic stress disorder breaks out of a VA hospital and goes on a road trip with a sympathetic traveler to find out what became of the other men in his unit.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ixScBPEizfgCM7BogZTpx3jgdVx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:83061'),
  ('371535768024992663', 'Heroes', 2008, 'Action, Adventure, Comedy', 'Samir Karnik', null, 'Salman Khan, Preity Zinta, Sunny Deol, Bobby Deol, Mithun Chakraborty, Sohail Khan, Vatsal Sheth, Dino Morea', null, 'Havaldar Balkar Singh, Captain Dhananjay Shergill and Lieutenant Sahil Naqvi are amongst numerous fatalities on India''s side in the 1999 Kargil war against Pakistan. All 3 men had written their last letters to Kuljeet Kaur, Squadron Leader Vikram Singh, and Dr. Naqvi respectively. These letters were located 3 years later by IBN Reporter, Avinash Sarin, who entrusts them to two Indore-based slackers, Ali Shah and Sameer Suri, and asks them to deliver them to Chandigarh, Manali, and Leh respectively. Ali and Sameer set out to film this journey in order to get a graduation degree so that they can re-locate to America as well as televise it widely in order to convince the youth not to join any of India''s armed forces.', 'Havaldar Balkar Singh, Captain Dhananjay Shergill and Lieutenant Sahil Naqvi are amongst numerous fatalities on India''s side in the 1999 Kargil war against Pakistan. All 3 men had written their last letters to Kuljeet Kaur, Squadron Leader Vikram Singh, and Dr. Naqvi respectively. These letters were located 3 years later by IBN Reporter, Avinash Sarin, who entrusts them to two Indore-based slackers, Ali Shah and Sameer Suri, and asks them to deliver them to Chandigarh, Manali, and Leh respectively. Ali and Sameer set out to film this journey in order to get a graduation degree so that they can re-locate to America as well as televise it widely in order to convince the youth not to join any of India''s armed forces.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n3yb9bPeQxJt41thDm7kXjSDbWz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20563'),
  ('904404528604311998', 'Heroes Among Heroes', 1993, 'Action', 'Yuen Woo-Ping, Chan Chin-Chung, Stephen Poon Tak-Yip', null, 'Donnie Yen, Wong Gok, Richard Ng Man-Tat, Sheila Chan Suk-Lan, Dickson Lee Kar-Sing, Xiong Xinxin, Bao Fang, Kwan Hoi-San', null, 'Expert fighters must band together in an ultimate martial arts showdown when Southern China’s High Officers begin smuggling opium over the border and endangering the lives of the local villagers. With no one to protect them and an Emperor that does not honor them, the people turn to the Master Fighters Lin Shih Tsui and Hwang Fei Hung to battle the evil officers and bring justice to the land.', 'Expert fighters must band together in an ultimate martial arts showdown when Southern China’s High Officers begin smuggling opium over the border and endangering the lives of the local villagers. With no one to protect them and an Emperor that does not honor them, the people turn to the Master Fighters Lin Shih Tsui and Hwang Fei Hung to battle the evil officers and bring justice to the land.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eXpo2q5fQDc0yJg36hMZw71QkwF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44616'),
  ('300357587603986893', 'Heroes Are Not Wet Behind the Ears', 1979, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Étienne Fauduet, René Longueville, José Salcedo', 'Gérard Jugnot', 'Gérard Jugnot, Daniel Auteuil, Anne Jousset, Henri Guybet, Patricia Karim, Roland Giraud, Bruno Moynot, Gérard Lanvin', null, 'Two brothers are fighting for a one girl attention...', 'Two brothers are fighting for a one girl attention...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q1OakGG3gwQKrLfhHHkS8F3VuHo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50216'),
  ('998815220871539238', 'Héroes de barrio', 2022, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Ángeles Reiné, Alberto Pareja', 'Ángeles Reiné, Antonio Prieto', 'Antonio Pagudo, Luna Fulgencio, Antonio Dechent, Álex O''Dogherty, Lisi Linder, Jesús Olmedo, Ken Appledorn', null, 'Paula (Luna Fulgencio) is a girl who plays for a girls'' soccer team in a small town in Seville. One day she asks her father, Luis (Antonio Pagudo), to bring her famous Betis player Joaquín as a visitor, as a reward for her and her teammates, whom Luis presumes to be her great friends.', 'Paula (Luna Fulgencio) is a girl who plays for a girls'' soccer team in a small town in Seville. One day she asks her father, Luis (Antonio Pagudo), to bring her famous Betis player Joaquín as a visitor, as a reward for her and her teammates, whom Luis presumes to be her great friends.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wKBV1jSKGlWmR5IQaQgIKec1I3g.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:810214'),
  ('843176506242865334', 'Héroes del Silencio Tour 2007', 2007, null, null, null, null, null, 'Tour 2007 is a live album released in 2007 by the Spanish rock band Héroes del Silencio, it was recorded during their 2007 Reunion Tour. This album is to date their latest release.', 'Tour 2007 is a live album released in 2007 by the Spanish rock band Héroes del Silencio, it was recorded during their 2007 Reunion Tour. This album is to date their latest release.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ofooiDzHhYaXkxKGgZ7bdcdVmKD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:132643'),
