  ('1014428327478544133', 'Heroes of the East', 1978, 'Action, Comedy', 'Lau Kar-Leung, Arthur Wong Ngok-Tai, Tong Yuen', 'Ni Kuang', 'Gordon Liu Chia-Hui, Yuka Mizuno, Cheng Kang-Yeh, Ching Miao, Yasuaki Kurata, Naozo Kato, Riki Harada, Tetsu Sumi', 'R', 'When a series of martial misunderstandings spirals into an international incident, a Chinese martial arts student struggling to relate to his new Japanese wife is forced to take on seven of Japan''s most powerful martial arts masters, each an expert in a different discipline, ranging from karate to samurai to ninjitsu.', 'When a series of martial misunderstandings spirals into an international incident, a Chinese martial arts student struggling to relate to his new Japanese wife is forced to take on seven of Japan''s most powerful martial arts masters, each an expert in a different discipline, ranging from karate to samurai to ninjitsu.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h06JtkvCkOChzcm13O8DYVwmspP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40980'),
  ('101511106218071595', 'Heroes Return', 2021, 'Action', 'Guo Hu, Du Xiubin', 'Dan Kun, Liu Wanting', 'Ray Lui, Yuen Biao, Xu Dongdong, Kathy Chow Hoi-Mei, Pavarit Mongkolpisit', null, 'Warm and justice veteran Wu Wei, chemical expert Xu Zhilan, undercover detective Gao Tianming and others set up a temporary special operation team to understand and rescue the hostages trapped on the island. They infiltrated the gathering point of hundreds of thugs, used their wealth of knowledge and professional skills to make combat weapons', 'Warm and justice veteran Wu Wei, chemical expert Xu Zhilan, undercover detective Gao Tianming and others set up a temporary special operation team to understand and rescue the hostages trapped on the island. They infiltrated the gathering point of hundreds of thugs, used their wealth of knowledge and professional skills to make combat weapons', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/im715HvOTZXx3tryWrtOCks972D.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:791900'),
  ('9706336861419165', 'Heroes Shed No Tears', 1984, 'Action, War, Drama', 'Kenichi Nakagawa, John Woo', 'John Woo', 'Eddy Ko Hung, Lam Ching-Ying, Ma Yingchun, Philippe Loffredo, Cécile Le Bailly, Lee Hae-suk, Chin Yuet-Sang, Tsang Choh-Lam', null, 'The Thai government hires a group of Chinese mercenaries to capture a powerful drug lord from the Golden Triangle. The mercenaries manage to capture the drug lord, but soon find themselves pursued by his forces, and the forces of a bitter Thai officer. The Chinese mercenaries are vastly outnumbered, and as their numbers begin to dwindle, their desperation pulls them into a corner as their enemies close in on them.', 'The Thai government hires a group of Chinese mercenaries to capture a powerful drug lord from the Golden Triangle. The mercenaries manage to capture the drug lord, but soon find themselves pursued by his forces, and the forces of a bitter Thai officer. The Chinese mercenaries are vastly outnumbered, and as their numbers begin to dwindle, their desperation pulls them into a corner as their enemies close in on them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4pHMcQeumCxVur57XN79BelfQfo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:69161'),
  ('276626440307722137', 'Heroes Two', 1974, 'Action, Drama, History', 'Chang Cheh, Shao Hao, Kung Mu-To', 'Chang Cheh, Ni Kuang', 'Chen Kuan-Tai, Alexander Fu Sheng, Fong Sam, Chu Mu, Wong Ching, Bruce Tong Yim-Chaan, Chiang Nan, Fung Ngai', null, 'A band of fighting Ming Dynasty loyalists branded as enemies of the state are driven underground following the burning of the Shaolin Temple by Qing Dynasty officials. Due to a misunderstanding, Shaolin kung fu prodigy Fong Sai-yuk is duped into helping Qing agents to capture leading Shaolin rebel Hung Hei-gun. Upon discovering his mistake, Sai-yuk teams up with the remaining rebels to free Hei-gun before his planned execution. Plotting to stop them is General Che Kang, a formidable Tibetan kung fu master who commands an army of fighters including four deadly Tibetan llamas.', 'A band of fighting Ming Dynasty loyalists branded as enemies of the state are driven underground following the burning of the Shaolin Temple by Qing Dynasty officials. Due to a misunderstanding, Shaolin kung fu prodigy Fong Sai-yuk is duped into helping Qing agents to capture leading Shaolin rebel Hung Hei-gun. Upon discovering his mistake, Sai-yuk teams up with the remaining rebels to free Hei-gun before his planned execution. Plotting to stop them is General Che Kang, a formidable Tibetan kung fu master who commands an army of fighters including four deadly Tibetan llamas.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c7EMGzaFbqmYIPgVOy4I172P5iF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:88633'),
