  ('906737546848854797', 'Heroic', 2023, 'Drama, Thriller', 'David Zonana, Carolina Costa, Agustín Peralta Lemes', 'David Zonana', 'Santiago Sandoval, Fernando Cuautle, Mónica del Carmen, Esteban Caicedo, Isabel Yudice, Carlos Gerardo García, Germán Carrizales, Salvador Rico', null, 'Luis, an 18-year-old Mexican boy with indigenous roots, enters the Heroico Military College with the hope of securing a better future. There, he encounters a rigid and institutionally violent system designed to make him a perfect soldier.', 'Luis, an 18-year-old Mexican boy with indigenous roots, enters the Heroico Military College with the hope of securing a better future. There, he encounters a rigid and institutionally violent system designed to make him a perfect soldier.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tRD18JW9iKqmwkQKvzPYDQetRoI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:958182'),
  ('495436611848428208', 'Heroic Duo', 2003, 'Action, Thriller', 'Benny Chan Muk-Sing, Anthony Pun Yiu-Ming, Stephen Tung Wai', 'Adrian Kwan, Alan Yuen Kam-Lun', 'Leon Lai Ming, Ekin Cheng Yee-Kin, Francis Ng Chun-Yu, Karena Lam Kar-Yan, Raymond Ho-Yin Wong, Anson Leung Chun-Yat, Samuel Pang King-Chi, Rico Kwok', null, 'Tough cop Ken Li (Cheng) is at the top of his game, but he''s going to need some help to solve a grisly crime that the offender, a respected police officer, doesn''t even remember committing. He seeks out Jack Lai (Lai), a former psychologist now in disgrace and behind bars, who has an uncanny ability to bend people to his will. Making an uneasy truce, this unconventional pair set out on a mission to find the man responsible, a master of hypnotism who will stop at nothing to get his revenge!', 'Tough cop Ken Li (Cheng) is at the top of his game, but he''s going to need some help to solve a grisly crime that the offender, a respected police officer, doesn''t even remember committing. He seeks out Jack Lai (Lai), a former psychologist now in disgrace and behind bars, who has an uncanny ability to bend people to his will. Making an uneasy truce, this unconventional pair set out on a mission to find the man responsible, a master of hypnotism who will stop at nothing to get his revenge!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vxHPnyz0ydE428j7gbweqI1CHyI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45482'),
  ('929467248301983586', 'Heroic Losers', 2019, 'Comedy, Thriller', 'Teresita Barusso, Federico Berón, Federico Berón', 'Eduardo Sacheri, Sebastián Borensztein', 'Ricardo Darín, Luis Brandoni, Chino Darín, Verónica Llinás, Daniel Aráoz, Carlos Belloso, Rita Cortese, Andrés Parra', null, 'In a town in the Northwest of the province of Buenos Aires, a group of neighbors is organized to recover the economy of the area, but when the corralito is implemented in the country and they suffer a fraud, their hopes disappear. Now, they will unite to recover the lost money and give the blow of their lives to their greatest enemy.', 'In a town in the Northwest of the province of Buenos Aires, a group of neighbors is organized to recover the economy of the area, but when the corralito is implemented in the country and they suffer a fraud, their hopes disappear. Now, they will unite to recover the lost money and give the blow of their lives to their greatest enemy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9MaAzW8sERDcIEYORE7jzeCew3P.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:596054'),
  ('1136439886089914735', 'Heroic Purgatory', 1970, 'Drama', 'Yoshishige Yoshida, Motokichi Hasegawa, Masahiro Moro', 'Masahiro Yamada', 'Mariko Okada, Kaizo Kamoda, Kaneko Iwasaki, Toru Takeuchi, Naho Kimura, Yoshiaki Makita, Kazumi Tsutsui, Kakuya Saeki', null, 'Rikiya Shoda is an engineer working for the Atomic Agency in Japan. One day, his wife Nanako returns home with a lost teenager called Ayu. A man, pretending to be the father, comes to get her back; Ayu keeps telling him that Rikiya and Nanako are her parents. Through this disruption, Rikiya suddenly starts remembering his youth as a revolutionary.', 'Rikiya Shoda is an engineer working for the Atomic Agency in Japan. One day, his wife Nanako returns home with a lost teenager called Ayu. A man, pretending to be the father, comes to get her back; Ayu keeps telling him that Rikiya and Nanako are her parents. Through this disruption, Rikiya suddenly starts remembering his youth as a revolutionary.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tTKXjxCDHdFztiT212xq9mBOX9G.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:104241'),
