  ('897085823342465937', 'Hesher', 2010, 'Drama', 'Spencer Susser, Morgan Susser, Kim Davis-Wagner', 'Spencer Susser, David Michôd', 'Joseph Gordon-Levitt, Natalie Portman, Devin Brochu, Rainn Wilson, Piper Laurie, John Carroll Lynch, Helen Slayton-Hughes, Monica Staggs', 'R', 'A young boy has lost his mother and is losing touch with his father and the world around him. Then he meets Hesher who manages to make his life even more chaotic.', 'A young boy has lost his mother and is losing touch with his father and the world around him. Then he meets Hesher who manages to make his life even more chaotic.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dD03azf3h1hUHVzVkkqJs96Kkay.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44835'),
  ('215491352863829288', 'Hesitation Wound', 2024, 'Drama', 'Selman Nacar', 'Selman Nacar', 'Tülin Özen, Oğulcan Arman Uslu, Gülçin Kültür Şahin, Vedat Erincin, Erdem Şenocak, Mücahit Koçak, Nilüfer Alptekin, İlyas Özçakır', null, 'A criminal lawyer Canan, divides her time in the courthouse and mother''s hospital bed at night. She has to make a moral choice that will affect lives of her mother, judge and murder suspect client.', 'A criminal lawyer Canan, divides her time in the courthouse and mother''s hospital bed at night. She has to make a moral choice that will affect lives of her mother, judge and murder suspect client.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kiRDQQBMXYJwxBTQ95xuDqH2z6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1025377'),
  ('227112021348997396', 'Hester Street', 1975, 'Drama, Romance', 'Joan Micklin Silver, Kenneth Van Sickle, Jack Baran', 'Abraham Cahan', 'Steven Keats, Carol Kane, Mel Howard, Dorrie Kavanaugh, Doris Roberts, Stephen Strimpell, Lauren Friedman, Paul Freedman', 'PG', 'A Russian emigre prides himself on the way he''s molded himself into a real Yankee in the USA, though the world he lives in, New York''s Lower East Side in the late 19th century, is almost exclusively populated by other Jewish immigrants. When his wife finally arrives in the New World, however, she has a lot of assimilating to do.', 'A Russian emigre prides himself on the way he''s molded himself into a real Yankee in the USA, though the world he lives in, New York''s Lower East Side in the late 19th century, is almost exclusively populated by other Jewish immigrants. When his wife finally arrives in the New World, however, she has a lot of assimilating to do.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sEYKnLShvnJuXzYWFI870F1hqZK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42257'),
  ('830123214080397533', 'Hetalia: Axis Powers: Paint It, White!', 2010, 'Animation, History, Comedy', 'Bob Shirohata', null, 'Daisuke Namikawa, Hiroki Yasumoto, Hiroki Takahashi, Katsuyuki Konishi, Noriaki Sugiyama, Masaya Onosaka, Yuki Kaida, Atsushi Kosaka', null, 'The Pictorians have arrived from deep in space. They also have dangly glow-balls on their heads, which is kinda cool, but still. The freaky aliens are using use their crazy rainbow-beam-thingy to paint everything on Earth the same color: white! See, now the title of the movie makes more sense, right? Anyway, if the Pictorians are to be stopped, the Allied guys and the Axis boys - plus some new characters, too - must set aside their differences, unite against their common foe, and hopefully get together for a sweaty workout to make sure they''re super-ready to save the world!', 'The Pictorians have arrived from deep in space. They also have dangly glow-balls on their heads, which is kinda cool, but still. The freaky aliens are using use their crazy rainbow-beam-thingy to paint everything on Earth the same color: white! See, now the title of the movie makes more sense, right? Anyway, if the Pictorians are to be stopped, the Allied guys and the Axis boys - plus some new characters, too - must set aside their differences, unite against their common foe, and hopefully get together for a sweaty workout to make sure they''re super-ready to save the world!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bqHlcmFLCLK8s2kXEWYAJNOsz7e.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:119441'),
