  ('449979597765212661', 'Hex', 1980, 'Horror', 'Kuei Chih-Hung, Lee San-Yip, Peng Yun-Chung', 'Tam Gam-Wa, Kuei Chih-Hung', 'Tanny Tien-Ni, Wang Yong, Chen Szu-Chia, Shum Lo, Lee Sau-Kei, Hon Kwok-Choi, Yue Tau-Wan, Chan Lap-Ban', null, 'Constantly mistreated by her cruel husband, the frail Chan Sau-ying awaits certain death from tuberculosis. The new servant girl, Yi-wah takes pity on her mistress'' plight and the pair proceed to drown him one evening. They dump his body in a near-by pond but Sau-ying believes that the man''s bloated corpse has risen from the bog to seek vengeance.', 'Constantly mistreated by her cruel husband, the frail Chan Sau-ying awaits certain death from tuberculosis. The new servant girl, Yi-wah takes pity on her mistress'' plight and the pair proceed to drown him one evening. They dump his body in a near-by pond but Sau-ying believes that the man''s bloated corpse has risen from the bog to seek vengeance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fByBb0DFEmXd9Z3N8JM9gUWFWnw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:124870'),
