  ('711670612729745790', 'Hey Babu Riba', 1985, 'Drama, Romance', 'Jovan Aćin', 'Jovan Aćin', 'Gala Videnović, Nebojša Bakočević, Dragan Bjelogrlić, Srđan ''Žika'' Todorović, Goran Radaković, Milan Štrljić, Relja Bašić, Marko Todorović', null, 'In 1985, four middle-aged Yugoslav emigres return to Belgrade for the funeral of Mariana, their beautiful compatriot. They called her Esther, for Esther Williams, she was the coxswain for their four-man rowing team, and they each loved her. They''d last seen her in 1953, when they rowed her across the Adriatic, pregnant, to join her exiled father in Italy. In flashbacks we learn the story of their youthful baptism into sex, smoking, rock and roll (Hey Ba-ba-re-bop), Hollywood and Swedish films, blue jeans on the black market, and their rivalry with Ristic, the Communist Party youth leader for whom they had instant antipathy.', 'In 1985, four middle-aged Yugoslav emigres return to Belgrade for the funeral of Mariana, their beautiful compatriot. They called her Esther, for Esther Williams, she was the coxswain for their four-man rowing team, and they each loved her. They''d last seen her in 1953, when they rowed her across the Adriatic, pregnant, to join her exiled father in Italy. In flashbacks we learn the story of their youthful baptism into sex, smoking, rock and roll (Hey Ba-ba-re-bop), Hollywood and Swedish films, blue jeans on the black market, and their rivalry with Ristic, the Communist Party youth leader for whom they had instant antipathy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4Pjl2rPX8ZH2N0UjyiRSY1BcIuS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42024'),
  ('1143110335217755094', 'Hey Balwanth', 2026, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Gopi Atchara, Mahi Reddy Pandugula', 'Gopi Atchara, Shanmukha Prashanth, Midhun Shankar Reddy', 'Naresh, Suhas, Shivani Nagaram', null, 'A young man uncovers the secrets behind his father''s peculiar business.', 'A young man uncovers the secrets behind his father''s peculiar business.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2F3e3mWungTL3A4mnFtfqt3bdKxtx.jpg', 'plex:movie:hey-balwanth'),
  ('656852389368694578', 'Hey Good Lookin''', 1982, 'Animation, Comedy, Drama', 'Ralph Bakshi, William A. Fraker, Timothy Galfas', 'Ralph Bakshi', 'Richard Romanus, David Proval, Jesse Welles, Tina Romanus, Danny Wells, Larry Bishop, Tabi Cooper, Juno Dawson', 'R', 'In 1953 Brooklyn, charismatic hood and The Stompers leader Vinnie Genzianna, his friend and second-in-command Crazy Shapiro, and their respective girlfriends Roz and Eva get wrapped up in an escalating conflict with the rival Black gang, The Chaplains, lead by Boogaloo Jones.', 'In 1953 Brooklyn, charismatic hood and The Stompers leader Vinnie Genzianna, his friend and second-in-command Crazy Shapiro, and their respective girlfriends Roz and Eva get wrapped up in an escalating conflict with the rival Black gang, The Chaplains, lead by Boogaloo Jones.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nCZKGoVnWiwl2F83umE2T3wFw5b.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32202'),
  ('944273401882599124', 'Hey Hey It''s Esther Blueburger', 2008, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Anna Howard, Anousha Zarkesh, Chris Webb', 'Cathy Randall', 'Danielle Catanzariti, Keisha Castle-Hughes, Toni Collette, Christian Byers, Essie Davis, Russell Dykstra, Jonny Pasvolsky, Cassandra Jinman', null, 'With help from a new friend, a misfit at a fancy private school secretly enrolls at a public school as a foreign exchange student.', 'With help from a new friend, a misfit at a fancy private school secretly enrolls at a public school as a foreign exchange student.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dluxHdIEQZKpJOO1vFNFRHJQoUE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50700'),
  ('388993782792947310', 'Hey Ram', 2000, 'History, Drama, Crime', 'Kamal Haasan, Santhana Bharathi, R.S. Shivaji', 'Kamal Haasan', 'Kamal Haasan, Shah Rukh Khan, Vasundhara Das, Rani Mukerji, Atul Kulkarni, Girish Karnad, Om Puri, Hema Malini', 'PG-13', 'Saketh Ram''s wife is raped and killed during direct action day riots in Calcutta. He is convinced that Mahatma Gandhi is responsible for all the problems happening in the country. He sets out to kill him.', 'Saketh Ram''s wife is raped and killed during direct action day riots in Calcutta. He is convinced that Mahatma Gandhi is responsible for all the problems happening in the country. He sets out to kill him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hHaq5QffND0x8dXEqjVPAmFlJv6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:60579'),
  ('350704177934685134', 'Hey There, It''s Yogi Bear!', 1964, 'Animation, Comedy, Family, Adventure', 'Joseph Barbera, William Hanna, Charles August Nichols', null, 'Daws Butler, Don Messick, Julie Bennett, James Darren, Mel Blanc, J. Pat O''Malley, Hal Smith, Jean Vander Pyl', 'G', 'Following a misunderstanding about Yogi Bear’s whereabouts, Cindy Bear ends up in captivity at a Missouri circus. It’s now up to Yogi and his friend, Boo-Boo, to save her.', 'Following a misunderstanding about Yogi Bear’s whereabouts, Cindy Bear ends up in captivity at a Missouri circus. It’s now up to Yogi and his friend, Boo-Boo, to save her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x8ZBi9rdjl0zTgC4O4aWdPNK05s.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33037'),
  ('411568118766120541', 'Hey There!', 2021, 'Comedy', 'Reha Erdem, Reha Erdem', 'Reha Erdem', 'Serkan Keskin, Nihal Yalçın, Bülent Emin Yarar, Ezgi Mola, Taner Birsel, Tilbe Saran, Esra Bezen Bilgin, Tansu Biçer', null, 'Istanbul is under quarantine. Felek and Kerim find the best way to make profits in this period. They will access people''s computers and introduce themselves as government officials, making them confess their "crimes". However, the city in question is Istanbul and all kinds of people live here.', 'Istanbul is under quarantine. Felek and Kerim find the best way to make profits in this period. They will access people''s computers and introduce themselves as government officials, making them confess their "crimes". However, the city in question is Istanbul and all kinds of people live here.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c3jsmFjBxPRgJlg9AqI7kgY8IEb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:799020'),
  ('994386007501525374', 'Hey, Did You Score?', 2012, 'Comedy', 'Felipe Joffily, Marcelo Brasil', 'Marcelo Rubens Paiva, Lusa Silvestre', 'Bruno Mazzeo, Marcos Palmeira, Emílio Orciollo Netto, Dira Paes, Seu Jorge, Tainá Müller, Laura Neiva, Juliana Schalch', null, 'Three male friends navigate different stages of romantic relationships: One is starting to date; another fears infidelity; the third is divorcing.', 'Three male friends navigate different stages of romantic relationships: One is starting to date; another fears infidelity; the third is divorcing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Av3xRNFS0Zgvqp4nirocppD3Bjy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:117534'),
  ('503018270003916757', 'Hey, Lads and Lasses', 1991, 'Drama', 'Lidiya Bobrova, Sergey Astakhov', 'Lidiya Bobrova', 'Vyacheslav Sobolev, Yury Bobrov, Vasily Frolov, Nina Usatova, Svetlana Gaytan, Vitaliy Bobrov, Valentina Smirnova, Ivan Kolesnikov', null, 'Director Lydia Bobrova pictures the bleak life in the Russian countryside by showing some events in the life of three brothers and their families. The three brothers are different in character, but all suffer from the dreariness of kolchoz life. The title is derived from a nostalgic Russian song. The wild geese have the possibility of moving on to milder climes, a possibility that Russian country people don’t have.', 'Director Lydia Bobrova pictures the bleak life in the Russian countryside by showing some events in the life of three brothers and their families. The three brothers are different in character, but all suffer from the dreariness of kolchoz life. The title is derived from a nostalgic Russian song. The wild geese have the possibility of moving on to milder climes, a possibility that Russian country people don’t have.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kYPWzOQL7lX7y0spY8TC76bKrHY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:365282'),
  ('158123714820607289', 'Hey, You!', 1976, 'Animation', 'Péter Szoboszlay', 'Péter Szoboszlay', null, null, 'Set in the allegorical space of an abandoned room, a frustrated mind feels the distorting effects of aggression and paranoia—including visions of butterflies, the Mona Lisa, and nuclear fallout.', 'Set in the allegorical space of an abandoned room, a frustrated mind feels the distorting effects of aggression and paranoia—including visions of butterflies, the Mona Lisa, and nuclear fallout.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gtKae2ohArc1H7P53Ba7F4nenpc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:570966'),
  ('427201155924018936', 'Hey! Hey! USA', 1938, 'Comedy', 'Marcel Varnel', 'J.O.C. Orton', 'Will Hay, Edgar Kennedy, David Burns, Edmon Ryan, Fred Duprez, Paddy Reynolds, Tommy Bupp, Arthur Goullet', null, 'While working as a porter Benjamin Twist mistakenly ends up on a cruise ship heading for the USA. Upon landing on the American coast Twist takes up work as a professor.', 'While working as a porter Benjamin Twist mistakenly ends up on a cruise ship heading for the USA. Upon landing on the American coast Twist takes up work as a professor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rcBLuUkXwA3jd78LfAvZfjJoDBT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:173447'),
  ('427495618013084107', 'Hey! Sinamika', 2022, 'Drama, Romance', 'R. Hariharakrishnan, Brinda Gopal, Preetha Jayaraman', 'Madhan Karky', 'Dulquer Salmaan, Aditi Rao Hydari, Kajal Aggarwal, Nakshathra Nagesh, Yogi Babu, Mirchi Vijay, Pradeep K Vijayan, Sharmila Thapa', null, 'A wife who feels suffocated by her husband''s incessant attention hires a psychologist to make him fall in love with her so that she can separate from him.', 'A wife who feels suffocated by her husband''s incessant attention hires a psychologist to make him fall in love with her so that she can separate from him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3t6kgGJqsSMtKitIXXBPgWSqeCf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:803736'),
  ('414568861930614070', 'Heyy Babyy', 2007, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Himman Dhamija, Sajid Khan', 'Sajid Khan', 'Akshay Kumar, Riteish Deshmukh, Fardeen Khan, Vidya Balan, Boman Irani, Anupam Kher, Chirag Vohra, Vrajesh Hirjee', null, 'Three womanisers find a baby left at their doorstep. Chaos ensues as they try to contact their former girlfriends to determine who is the father amongst them.', 'Three womanisers find a baby left at their doorstep. Chaos ensues as they try to contact their former girlfriends to determine who is the father amongst them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9XxhqihX1kcZXcvJ48aQlPYHPQo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4157'),
  ('647953299412870751', 'Hi Diddle Diddle', 1943, 'Comedy', 'Andrew L. Stone, Charles Schoenbaum, Phil Boutelje', 'Frederick J. Jackson', 'Adolphe Menjou, Martha Scott, Pola Negri, Dennis O''Keefe, Billie Burke, Walter Kingsford, Barton Hepburn, June Havoc', 'NR', 'When the bride''s mother is supposedly swindled out of her money by a spurned suitor, the groom''s father orchestrates a scheme of his own to set things right. He is aided by a cabaret singer, while placating a jealous wife.', 'When the bride''s mother is supposedly swindled out of her money by a spurned suitor, the groom''s father orchestrates a scheme of his own to set things right. He is aided by a cabaret singer, while placating a jealous wife.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8d9YPEkSzwA6A1YlcyhldKtpJhJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:90799'),
  ('946516005647929163', 'Hi Nanna', 2023, 'Drama, Family, Romance', 'Shouryuv, Sanu John Varghese', 'Shouryuv', 'Nani, Mrunal Thakur, Baby Kiara Khanna, Jayaram, Shilpa Tulaskar, Priyadarshi Pullikonda, Angad Bedi, Viraj Ashwin', null, 'Six-year-old Mahi, a spirited child with cystic fibrosis, shares a deep yet complex bond with her father, Viraj, a dedicated single parent and successful fashion photographer. Her curiosity about her absent mother leads to a journey of discovery when she runs away with her loyal dog, Pluto. A chance encounter with a kind woman named Yashna sparks unexpected revelations, intertwining their lives in ways they never anticipated. Set against a backdrop of love, sacrifice, and redemption, Mahi’s story is a heartfelt exploration of family, resilience, and the enduring power of connection.', 'Six-year-old Mahi, a spirited child with cystic fibrosis, shares a deep yet complex bond with her father, Viraj, a dedicated single parent and successful fashion photographer. Her curiosity about her absent mother leads to a journey of discovery when she runs away with her loyal dog, Pluto. A chance encounter with a kind woman named Yashna sparks unexpected revelations, intertwining their lives in ways they never anticipated. Set against a backdrop of love, sacrifice, and redemption, Mahi’s story is a heartfelt exploration of family, resilience, and the enduring power of connection.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hhMLtq9m1aK0dpY9Wcq26XeDH2z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1068452'),
  ('1024579410375818805', 'Hi Stranger', 2017, 'Animation', 'Kirsten Lepore', 'Kirsten Lepore', 'Garrett Davis', null, 'I made this film especially for you. I needed to check in with you. I needed to tell you how I feel.', 'I made this film especially for you. I needed to check in with you. I needed to tell you how I feel.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lXMydNXO2IeZlkkolqNfmwJDRVH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:446370'),
  ('1024424639535092833', 'Hi-Five', 2025, 'Action, Adventure, Comedy, Fantasy', 'Choi Chan-min, Kang Hyoung-chul, You Seok-moon', 'Kang Hyoung-chul', 'Lee Jae-in, Ahn Jae-hong, Yoo Ah-in, Ra Mi-ran, Kim Hie-won, Oh Jung-se, Shin Gu, Jinyoung', null, 'In the dead of night, a body donated for organ transplants mysteriously disintegrates into ashes. Soon after, five recipients, given a heart, corneas, lungs, liver, and kidneys, begin to develop supernatural powers. A teenage girl gains immense strength, a hipster manipulates electromagnetic waves, a novelist summons powerful gusts, a factory manager can heal others, and a woman discovers a strange, still-unidentified ability. Together, they form a reluctant but heroic team known as "HI-FIVE." But they aren''t the only ones transformed. A cult leader who received the donor’s pancreas gains the terrifying power to drain life energy and sets his sights on stealing the abilities of HI-FIVE to achieve godlike domination.', 'In the dead of night, a body donated for organ transplants mysteriously disintegrates into ashes. Soon after, five recipients, given a heart, corneas, lungs, liver, and kidneys, begin to develop supernatural powers. A teenage girl gains immense strength, a hipster manipulates electromagnetic waves, a novelist summons powerful gusts, a factory manager can heal others, and a woman discovers a strange, still-unidentified ability. Together, they form a reluctant but heroic team known as "HI-FIVE." But they aren''t the only ones transformed. A cult leader who received the donor’s pancreas gains the terrifying power to drain life energy and sets his sights on stealing the abilities of HI-FIVE to achieve godlike domination.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5hi6bQWfbXfJ1W0iCrM78RWbrwi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:793058'),
  ('61562380629451647', 'Hi-Jack Highway', 1955, 'Drama, Crime', 'Gilles Grangier, Pierre Montazel, Jacques Deray', 'Gilles Grangier', 'Jean Gabin, Jeanne Moreau, Gaby Basset, Marcel Bozzuffi, Robert Dalban, Albert Dinan, Ginette Leclerc, Henri Crémieux', null, 'A trucker encounters a dead body on the road home. He reports the incident to the police, who suspect that Jean was responsible for the death, and his new truck is impounded. To make matters worse, the man''s widow accuses him of having robbed her husband, and a gang of sinister crooks are also harassing him.', 'A trucker encounters a dead body on the road home. He reports the incident to the police, who suspect that Jean was responsible for the death, and his new truck is impounded. To make matters worse, the man''s widow accuses him of having robbed her husband, and a gang of sinister crooks are also harassing him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1drnaaHSa1sDXOcLyIkpxQgEeH3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67431'),
  ('929396227246207332', 'Hi-Life', 1998, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Roger Hedden, John Thomas', 'Roger Hedden', 'Eric Stoltz, Daryl Hannah, Campbell Scott, Katrin Cartlidge, Moira Kelly, Peter Riegert, Charles Durning, Michelle Durning', null, 'Jimmy needs $900 to clear a gambling debt but a series of lies leads to Ray trying to raise the cash from friends who owe him money.', 'Jimmy needs $900 to clear a gambling debt but a series of lies leads to Ray trying to raise the cash from friends who owe him money.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gyIa6F8MuNwYjH2E6nAYhnFCs1g.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:125300'),
  ('909883202923701342', 'Hi, Are You Alone?', 1995, 'Comedy', 'Icíar Bollaín, Teo Delgado', null, 'Silke, Candela Peña, Álex Angulo, Elena Irureta, Arcadi Levin, Daniel Guzmán, Pedro Miguel Martínez, Antonio de la Torre', null, 'Nina is a 20 years old girl from Valladolid who lives with her divorced father, an autoritarian and conservative man. Trini is of the same age and has lost her mother. For both Valladolid and their families have nothing to offer and therefore they go on a risky voyage to the Costa del Sol at the south of Spain.', 'Nina is a 20 years old girl from Valladolid who lives with her divorced father, an autoritarian and conservative man. Trini is of the same age and has lost her mother. For both Valladolid and their families have nothing to offer and therefore they go on a risky voyage to the Costa del Sol at the south of Spain.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vAeqRXgYrCJF9LkC4dEQRI0N5s4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2538'),
  ('647627507209069428', 'Hi, Dharma!', 2001, 'Action, Comedy', 'Park Chul-kwan', 'Park Gyu-tae', 'Park Shin-yang, Jung Jin-young, Park Sang-myeon, Kang Seong-jin, Hong Kyung-in, Lee Mu-hyeon, Lee Moon-sik, Lee Dae-yeon', null, 'Laughs and thrills go hand-in-fist in this Korean action comedy, as a band of criminals fleeing a violent gang war hides out in a monastery. The monks in residence quickly tire of the goons’ distressing behavior and manufacture a series of activities to get even.', 'Laughs and thrills go hand-in-fist in this Korean action comedy, as a band of criminals fleeing a violent gang war hides out in a monastery. The monks in residence quickly tire of the goons’ distressing behavior and manufacture a series of activities to get even.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hkXrJzrz2kjpYia5hB5WRXFlBP1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:68457'),
  ('983214137043572130', 'Hi, Mom', 2021, 'Drama, Comedy, Fantasy', 'Liu Yin, Sun Ming, Jia Ling', 'Wang Yu, Sun Jibin, Bu Yu', 'Jia Ling, Zhang Xiaofei, Teng Shen, Chen He, He Huan, Liu Jia, Ding Jiali, Qiao Shan', null, 'Devastated after her mom''s serious accident and grief-stricken because she hasn''t become the daughter she wanted to be for her mother, Jia Xiaoling finds herself transported back in time to the year 1981, where she meets her young mother before she was her mom.', 'Devastated after her mom''s serious accident and grief-stricken because she hasn''t become the daughter she wanted to be for her mother, Jia Xiaoling finds herself transported back in time to the year 1981, where she meets her young mother before she was her mom.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/31W7qLEMqQKgdCeCtV9EbVi3bwG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:758891'),
  ('96488269922173083', 'Hi, Mom!', 1970, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Brian De Palma, Bruce Joel Rubin, Robert Elfstrom', 'Brian De Palma', 'Robert De Niro, Jennifer Salt, Allen Garfield, Charles Durning, Lara Parker, Paul Bartel, Gerrit Graham, Nelson Peltz', 'R', 'Vietnam vet Jon Rubin returns to New York and rents a rundown flat in Greenwich Village. It is in this flat that he begins to film, ''Peeping Tom'' style, the people in the apartment across the street. His obsession with making films leads him to fall in with a radical ''Black Power'' group, which in turn leads him to carry out a bizarre act of urban terrorism.', 'Vietnam vet Jon Rubin returns to New York and rents a rundown flat in Greenwich Village. It is in this flat that he begins to film, ''Peeping Tom'' style, the people in the apartment across the street. His obsession with making films leads him to fall in with a radical ''Black Power'' group, which in turn leads him to carry out a bizarre act of urban terrorism.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l4rge37nxK6nQFQVJxgdRaBG1xS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42589'),
  ('351459364017087755', 'Hi, Nellie!', 1934, 'Comedy, Drama, Crime', 'Mervyn LeRoy, Sol Polito', 'Abem Finkel, Sidney Sutherland', 'Paul Muni, Glenda Farrell, Ned Sparks, Robert Barrat, Berton Churchill, Kathryn Sergava, Hobart Cavanaugh, Douglass Dumbrille', 'NR', 'Managing Editor Brad Bradshaw refuses to run a story linking the disappearance of Frank Canfield with embezzlement of the bank. He considers Frank a straight shooter and he goes easy on the story. Every other paper goes with the story that Frank took the money and Brad is demoted, by the publisher, to the Heartthrob column - writing advice to the lovelorn. After feeling sorry for himself for two months, he takes the column seriously and makes it the talk of the town. But Brad still wants his old job back so he will have to find Canfield and the missing money.', 'Managing Editor Brad Bradshaw refuses to run a story linking the disappearance of Frank Canfield with embezzlement of the bank. He considers Frank a straight shooter and he goes easy on the story. Every other paper goes with the story that Frank took the money and Brad is demoted, by the publisher, to the Heartthrob column - writing advice to the lovelorn. After feeling sorry for himself for two months, he takes the column seriously and makes it the talk of the town. But Brad still wants his old job back so he will have to find Canfield and the missing money.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7z3ICgwmBCjSsWUYQWbGAKyFTHO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:217387'),
  ('27014385666999975', 'Hi, Tereska', 2001, 'Drama', 'Robert Gliński, Petro Aleksowski', 'Jacek Wyszomirski, Robert Gliński', 'Aleksandra Gietner, Karolina Sobczak, Zbigniew Zamachowski, Małgorzata Rożniatowska, Krzysztof Kiersznowski', null, 'Teenager Tereska comes from poor family and has to face difficult world and mean people around her.', 'Teenager Tereska comes from poor family and has to face difficult world and mean people around her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/slHR2b0q5U9TnLBRmq2LcdNwGlv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:144541'),
  ('752419710704622173', 'Hiawatha''s Rabbit Hunt', 1941, 'Animation, Comedy, Western', 'Friz Freleng, Carl W. Stalling', null, 'Mel Blanc', null, 'Bugs Bunny is hunted by Hiawatha, a stereotyped Native American who fills roughly the same role as Elmer Fudd in other Bugs Bunny cartoons of this era.', 'Bugs Bunny is hunted by Hiawatha, a stereotyped Native American who fills roughly the same role as Elmer Fudd in other Bugs Bunny cartoons of this era.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dLLpq8RFsUuHKr8DSVYYsk9kO6x.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:168191'),
  ('50503434338619204', 'Hibernatus', 1969, 'Comedy, Science Fiction', 'Édouard Molinaro, Pierre Cosson, Philippe Monnier', 'Jacques Vilfrid', 'Louis de Funès, Claude Gensac, Bernard Alane, Olivier de Funès, Paul Préboist, Martine Kelly, Claude Piéplu, Michael Lonsdale', null, 'Hubert de Tartas'' life becomes a complete muddle when his wife''s grandfather is unearthed after having spent 65 years in frozen hibernation in the polar circle. After being de-frosted, the Hibernating Man believes it is still the beginning of the century. Nothing is spared to keep that illusion alive. At the end of his rope, Hubert blurts out the truth and takes the man from Edwardian times on a crazy spree through an ultramodern Twentieth Century.', 'Hubert de Tartas'' life becomes a complete muddle when his wife''s grandfather is unearthed after having spent 65 years in frozen hibernation in the polar circle. After being de-frosted, the Hibernating Man believes it is still the beginning of the century. Nothing is spared to keep that illusion alive. At the end of his rope, Hubert blurts out the truth and takes the man from Edwardian times on a crazy spree through an ultramodern Twentieth Century.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dQTG9gwSgaGD9T8vukNFPMOcBh0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2462'),
  ('330911418968179623', 'Hibiki', 2018, 'Action, Comedy', 'Kohtaro Goto, Sho Tsukikawa, Atsuhiro Nabeshima', 'Masafumi Nishida', 'Yurina Hirate, Keiko Kitagawa, Ayaka Wilson, Masanobu Takashima, Yuya Yagira, Toru Nomaguchi, Kazushige Komatsu, Mizuki Itagaki', null, 'A high school girl with overwhelming literary talent shakes up the lives of those around her with her brilliant spontaneity.', 'A high school girl with overwhelming literary talent shakes up the lives of those around her with her brilliant spontaneity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rK86QnCyzJ3CXbiImG0BNzp4rxB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:545143'),
