  ('178341693250373267', 'Hic-cup Pup', 1954, 'Animation, Comedy', 'William Hanna, Joseph Barbera', null, 'Daws Butler', null, 'Spike has just put Tyke to bed for his nap when Tom and Jerry chase out the door to Tyke''s crib, waking him up. This gives Tyke an attack of hiccups. Spike warns Tom not to wake him up again, which of course is all Jerry needs.', 'Spike has just put Tyke to bed for his nap when Tom and Jerry chase out the door to Tyke''s crib, waking him up. This gives Tyke an attack of hiccups. Spike warns Tom not to wake him up again, which of course is all Jerry needs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4sbTklC2R10NTjgfkBq3QWk1B1R.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:99089'),
