  ('56171940733578619', 'High Forces', 2024, 'Action, Crime', 'Oxide Pang Chun, William Chan Wai-Lin, Dion Lam', 'Bai Yu, Sun Chan', 'Andy Lau, Zhang Zifeng, Qu Chuxiao, Liu Tao, Guo Xiaodong, Jiang Mengjie, David Wang, Jiang Chao', null, '"Anyone? There is ......" A mysterious message from Gao Haojun comes from ten thousand meters in the air. A five-star A380 ultra-luxury airliner was hijacked on its international maiden voyage, and international security expert Gao Haojun stood up to a group of thugs, his daughter Xiaojun was trapped in the cabin, and Mike, the leader of the hijackers, threatened the lives of more than 800 people in the plane as a bargaining chip, and Xiaojun''s mother, Fu Yuan, was also in danger. ...... Will the passengers on board be able to land safely and how should this crisis be resolved?', '"Anyone? There is ......" A mysterious message from Gao Haojun comes from ten thousand meters in the air. A five-star A380 ultra-luxury airliner was hijacked on its international maiden voyage, and international security expert Gao Haojun stood up to a group of thugs, his daughter Xiaojun was trapped in the cabin, and Mike, the leader of the hijackers, threatened the lives of more than 800 people in the plane as a bargaining chip, and Xiaojun''s mother, Fu Yuan, was also in danger. ...... Will the passengers on board be able to land safely and how should this crisis be resolved?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b8xNJ39aOtEk3I7MFt8XJuN2bGS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:949709'),
  ('430703274541276245', 'High Ground', 2021, 'Thriller, Action, Drama, Western', 'Stephen Johnson, Thom Neal, David Fraser Young', 'Chris Anastassiades', 'Simon Baker, Jacob Junior Nayinggul, Jack Thompson, Callan Mulvey, Caren Pistorius, Witiyana Marika, Aaron Pedersen, Ryan Corr', 'NR', 'In a remote corner of the wild country, a bloody war rages. Travis is a bounty hunter with one last hope of redemption. Gutjuk is a young Indigenous man trying to save the last of his family. Together they embark on a manhunt, which unravels a secret that ultimately pits them against each other.', 'In a remote corner of the wild country, a bloody war rages. Travis is a bounty hunter with one last hope of redemption. Gutjuk is a young Indigenous man trying to save the last of his family. Together they embark on a manhunt, which unravels a secret that ultimately pits them against each other.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qtjaGXS9Aa0ksUNInuzkVIVua9c.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:522466'),
