  ('761419482803394104', 'High Kukus', 1973, 'Drama', 'James Broughton', null, 'James Broughton', null, 'In this homage to Zen poet Basho, the subtle changes of a pond are chronicled on film over a period of time. Broughton recites his cuckoo haikus in the background.', 'In this homage to Zen poet Basho, the subtle changes of a pond are chronicled on film over a period of time. Broughton recites his cuckoo haikus in the background.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dHI0Uv67JyQkhIHEVdx8ERBUQDT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:249354'),
