  ('1014358080010700111', 'High Life', 2009, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Gary Yates', 'Lee MacDougall, Gary Yates', 'Timothy Olyphant, Stephen Eric McIntyre, Rossif Sutherland, Joe Anderson, Mike Bell, Jon Ted Wynne, Steven Ratzlaff, Mark McKinney', null, 'It''s 1983, and hopeless junkie Dick gets an unwelcome visit from the past - his seriously sleazy former cellmate, Bug, to be precise. Bug requires a crash course in the 80s: different music, different drugs, and machines in walls that dispense money. The latter development gives Dick an idea.', 'It''s 1983, and hopeless junkie Dick gets an unwelcome visit from the past - his seriously sleazy former cellmate, Bug, to be precise. Bug requires a crash course in the 80s: different music, different drugs, and machines in walls that dispense money. The latter development gives Dick an idea.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/alzUTGTbpA204di5WSIWlBKdjbl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29388'),
  ('732957636520497692', 'High Life', 2018, 'Science Fiction, Drama, Mystery', 'Claire Denis, Kamila Tarabura, Yorick Le Saux', 'Nick Laird', 'Robert Pattinson, Juliette Binoche, Mia Goth, André 3000, Agata Buzek, Lars Eidinger, Claire Tran, Ewan Mitchell', 'R', 'Monte and his baby daughter are the last survivors of a damned and dangerous mission to deep space. The crew—death-row inmates led by a doctor with sinister motives—has vanished. As the mystery of what happened onboard the ship is unraveled, father and daughter must rely on each other to survive as they hurtle toward the oblivion of a black hole.', 'Monte and his baby daughter are the last survivors of a damned and dangerous mission to deep space. The crew—death-row inmates led by a doctor with sinister motives—has vanished. As the mystery of what happened onboard the ship is unraveled, father and daughter must rely on each other to survive as they hurtle toward the oblivion of a black hole.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wElOvH7H6sLElsTOLu1MY6oWRUx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:376865'),
  ('51074356072790848', 'High Maintenance', 2006, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Phillip Van', 'Simon P. Biggs', 'Nicolette Krebitz, Wanja Mues', null, 'In the near-future, a woman whose robotic husband fails to meet her standards returns and upgrades him for a better version with standards that she now fails to meet.', 'In the near-future, a woman whose robotic husband fails to meet her standards returns and upgrades him for a better version with standards that she now fails to meet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w7cDVqfp73eWgQ3UraxhJJMWl8R.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:226898'),
  ('624918266922084634', 'High Noon', 2009, 'Drama, Romance, TV Movie', 'Peter Markle, Joel Ransom', null, 'Emilie de Ravin, Cybill Shepherd, Ivan Sergei, Brian Markinson, Ty Olsson, Olivia Cheng, Patrick Sabongui, Savanna Carlson', null, 'Baltimore''s top hostage negotiator embarks on a relationship with a man who could be her soulmate while racing to resolve a case that threatens her job and her life', 'Baltimore''s top hostage negotiator embarks on a relationship with a man who could be her soulmate while racing to resolve a case that threatens her job and her life', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2rWF1ObmtjPvsO266Cd2eXRw0cQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:35059'),
  ('818537560945620323', 'High Note', 1960, 'Animation, Comedy, Family', 'Chuck Jones', null, 'Mel Blanc', null, 'The sheet music for Johann Strauss'' The Blue Danube is constructed by moving musical symbols. A baton-toting conductor note tries to direct his fellow notes in performing this musical piece, but finds that one of the notes has become drunk.', 'The sheet music for Johann Strauss'' The Blue Danube is constructed by moving musical symbols. A baton-toting conductor note tries to direct his fellow notes in performing this musical piece, but finds that one of the notes has become drunk.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/30XGcnlzbzMcjNz4yuFIhYB5jN4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:134102'),
  ('836679439398058150', 'High on Crack Street: Lost Lives in Lowell', 1995, 'Documentary', 'Richard Farrell, Maryann DeLeo, Jon Alpert', 'Maryann DeLeo, Richard Farrell, Jon Alpert', 'Dick Eklund, Jon Alpert, Mickey O''Keefe, Brenda, Gary "Boo Boo" Giuffrida', 'PG-13', 'Documents 18 months in the lives of three crack addicts in Lowell, Massachusetts.', 'Documents 18 months in the lives of three crack addicts in Lowell, Massachusetts.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s1I5hnUY87SkdfyHHxnlHzj4u4k.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:58607'),
  ('340058254838526594', 'High Plains Drifter', 1973, 'Western, Drama, Mystery', 'Clint Eastwood, Bruce Surtees, James Fargo', 'Ernest Tidyman', 'Clint Eastwood, Verna Bloom, Marianna Hill, Mitchell Ryan, Jack Ging, Stefan Gierasch, Ted Hartley, Billy Curtis', 'R', 'A gunfighting stranger comes to the small settlement of Lago. After gunning down three gunmen who tried to kill him, the townsfolk decide to hire the Stranger to hold off three outlaws who are on their way.', 'A gunfighting stranger comes to the small settlement of Lago. After gunning down three gunmen who tried to kill him, the townsfolk decide to hire the Stranger to hold off three outlaws who are on their way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AjkJCFkqanK1OZqiHxc6Kl2wPQO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11901'),
  ('150174134886384791', 'High Plains Invaders', 2009, 'Western, Science Fiction, Horror, TV Movie, Action', 'Kristoffer Tabori', 'Richard Beattie', 'James Marsters, Cindy Sampson, Sebastian Knapp, Sanny van Heteren, Antony Byrne, Angus MacInnes, Adriana Butoi, James Carroll Jordan', null, 'In the lawless heart of the Old West, notorious outlaw Sam Phoenix stands at the gallows, moments from justice—or so it seems. But when an unearthly terror descends on the town without warning, everything changes. As chaos erupts and survival becomes the only law, Phoenix finds himself facing a threat far deadlier than any posse. Something not of this world has arrived… and it’s just getting started.', 'In the lawless heart of the Old West, notorious outlaw Sam Phoenix stands at the gallows, moments from justice—or so it seems. But when an unearthly terror descends on the town without warning, everything changes. As chaos erupts and survival becomes the only law, Phoenix finds himself facing a threat far deadlier than any posse. Something not of this world has arrived… and it’s just getting started.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mwN2d3ELKVLxn3vHH4c5PyVboiW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36139'),
  ('566763149207034631', 'High Risk', 1981, 'Action, Thriller, Adventure', 'Stewart Raffill, Leonard S. Smith Jr.', 'Fernando Celis', 'James Brolin, Anthony Quinn, James Coburn, Ernest Borgnine, Bruce Davison, Cleavon Little, Chick Vennera, Lindsay Wagner', 'R', 'Four American friends, badly needing money, decide to make a commando-like raid into a South American drug lord''s compound.', 'Four American friends, badly needing money, decide to make a commando-like raid into a South American drug lord''s compound.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hWRFdEQiUeKNovLzjhzEcO6JDDN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47201'),
  ('149463093310347657', 'High Risk', 1995, 'Action, Comedy, Crime, Thriller', 'Wong Jing, Tom Lau Moon-Tong', 'Wong Jing', 'Jet Li, Jacky Cheung Hok-Yau, Chingmy Yau Suk-Ching, Kelvin Wong Siu, Charlie Yeung Choi-Nei, Ken Yang, Wu Ma, Valerie Chow', 'R', 'After failing to save his wife from ''The Doctor'', Kit Li is working as a bodyguard and secret stunt double for the cowardly martial arts film star Frankie Lane. Frankie attends an exhibition of the crown jewels of Russia at a Hong Kong hotel, and when the Doctor''s gang take over the building in attempt to steal them, Kit is the only thing standing in their way. Will Frankie regain his courage? Will romance blossom between Kit and the nosy reporter? Who has the best Kung-Fu?', 'After failing to save his wife from ''The Doctor'', Kit Li is working as a bodyguard and secret stunt double for the cowardly martial arts film star Frankie Lane. Frankie attends an exhibition of the crown jewels of Russia at a Hong Kong hotel, and when the Doctor''s gang take over the building in attempt to steal them, Kit is the only thing standing in their way. Will Frankie regain his courage? Will romance blossom between Kit and the nosy reporter? Who has the best Kung-Fu?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qheDCRVhFKl5boX5sl71bzkt9RW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18665'),
  ('1133314473607933059', 'High Road to China', 1983, 'Adventure, Drama, History', 'Brian G. Hutton, Ronnie Taylor', 'Sandra Weintraub, S. Lee Pogostin', 'Tom Selleck, Bess Armstrong, Wilford Brimley, Jack Weston, Robert Morley, Cassandra Gava, Brian Blessed, Michael Sheard', 'PG', 'A biplane pilot is saddled with a spoiled industrialist''s daughter on a search for her missing father through Asia that eventually involves them in a struggle against a Chinese warlord.', 'A biplane pilot is saddled with a spoiled industrialist''s daughter on a search for her missing father through Asia that eventually involves them in a struggle against a Chinese warlord.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ts6Pykj9IuVm1eWwaWiVl8Gzxqt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19606'),
  ('868454513415354491', 'High Rollers', 2025, 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 'Randall Emmett, Alejandro Lalinde', 'Chris Sivertson', 'John Travolta, Gina Gershon, Lukas Haas, Quavo, Natali Yura, Noel Gugliemi, Swen Temmel, Demián Castro', 'R', 'A master thief must pull off a dangerous casino heist when his nemesis kidnaps his lover. Caught between rival criminals and FBI pursuit, he risks all to save her and score big.', 'A master thief must pull off a dangerous casino heist when his nemesis kidnaps his lover. Caught between rival criminals and FBI pursuit, he risks all to save her and score big.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hHowAaChDjwueySmwVbsjHmpWa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1149167'),
  ('975757993504488391', 'High School', 1969, 'Documentary', 'Frederick Wiseman, Richard Leiterman', 'Frederick Wiseman', null, 'NR', 'Documentary filmmaker Frederick Wiseman takes us inside Northeast High School as a fly on the wall to observe the teachers and how they interact with the students.', 'Documentary filmmaker Frederick Wiseman takes us inside Northeast High School as a fly on the wall to observe the teachers and how they interact with the students.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d3R2ELJJJtsdC722O63BVLmcxSe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:60315'),
  ('876183181492707939', 'High School', 2010, 'Comedy', 'Mitchell Amundsen, John Stalberg Jr.', 'Erik Linthorst, Stephen Susco, John Stalberg Jr.', 'Adrien Brody, Matt Bush, Sean Marquette, Colin Hanks, Michael Chiklis, Adhir Kalyan, Mykelti Williamson, Luis Chávez', 'R', 'A high school valedictorian who gets baked with the local stoner finds himself the subject of a drug test. The situation causes him to concoct an ambitious plan to get his entire graduating class to face the same fate, and fail.', 'A high school valedictorian who gets baked with the local stoner finds himself the subject of a drug test. The situation causes him to concoct an ambitious plan to get his entire graduating class to face the same fate, and fail.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3pZzS9R1r6qHvstMxmGq54JkFDR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27584'),
  ('922234286494181529', 'High School Big Shot', 1959, 'Crime, Drama', 'John M. Nickolaus Jr., Joel Rapp', 'Joel Rapp', 'Tom Pittman, Virginia Aldridge, Howard Veit, Malcolm Atterbury, Stanley Adams, Louis Quinn, Peter Leeds, John Barrick', 'NR', 'Unpopular at school because of his high I.Q., neglected by his weak and alcoholic father, Marvin is easy prey for the campus vamp, Betty, who pretends an interest in Marv only so that he will write her term paper. When the two are discovered cheating by their professor, the longed-for scholarship recommendation is withdrawn. Meanwhile the jealousy of Betty''s boyfriend has been aroused and when Marv learns that he can only hold the girl''s affections by offering her riches, he plans a million dollar robbery. Even the professional gangsters with whom he works are amazed at the brilliance of the young genius.', 'Unpopular at school because of his high I.Q., neglected by his weak and alcoholic father, Marvin is easy prey for the campus vamp, Betty, who pretends an interest in Marv only so that he will write her term paper. When the two are discovered cheating by their professor, the longed-for scholarship recommendation is withdrawn. Meanwhile the jealousy of Betty''s boyfriend has been aroused and when Marv learns that he can only hold the girl''s affections by offering her riches, he plans a million dollar robbery. Even the professional gangsters with whom he works are amazed at the brilliance of the young genius.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hykr4TX2E6kk6Jul8v2in7HrhfO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:161088'),
  ('900482477479876261', 'High School Confidential!', 1958, 'Crime, Drama', 'Jack Arnold, Joseph E. Kenney, Harold J. Marzorati', 'Robert Blees, Lewis Meltzer', 'Russ Tamblyn, Jan Sterling, John Drew Barrymore, Mamie Van Doren, Jerry Lee Lewis, Ray Anthony, Jackie Coogan, Charles Chaplin, Jr.', 'NR', 'A tough kid comes to a new high school and begins muscling his way into the drug scene. This is a typical morality play of the era, filled with a naive view of drugs, nihilistic beat poetry, and some incredible ''50s slang.', 'A tough kid comes to a new high school and begins muscling his way into the drug scene. This is a typical morality play of the era, filled with a naive view of drugs, nihilistic beat poetry, and some incredible ''50s slang.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ihyyUeCVCKc9CRjvQ2WAhC7v5Eu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43116'),
  ('136953851082523232', 'High School Debut', 2011, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Tsutomu Hanabusa, Hiroyasu Kitagawa', 'Yuichi Fukuda', 'Junpei Mizobata, Ito Ohno, Masaki Suda, Yuki Furukawa, Rin Aizawa, Yuka Masuda, Elaiza Ikeda', null, 'Based on the best selling manga, Haruna Nagashima (Ito Ono) devoted herself to softball while in middle school. Now that she is in high school, Haruna believes its time find a boyfriend. Unfortunately for Haruna, she didn''t pay attention to trends and is now clueless on how to attract a boy. Through a fortuitous event, Haruna encounters popular upperclassman You Komiyama (Junpei Mizobata) Haruna asks You to teach her how to become attractive to boys. You agrees but with one catch. She can''t fall in love with him ...', 'Based on the best selling manga, Haruna Nagashima (Ito Ono) devoted herself to softball while in middle school. Now that she is in high school, Haruna believes its time find a boyfriend. Unfortunately for Haruna, she didn''t pay attention to trends and is now clueless on how to attract a boy. Through a fortuitous event, Haruna encounters popular upperclassman You Komiyama (Junpei Mizobata) Haruna asks You to teach her how to become attractive to boys. You agrees but with one catch. She can''t fall in love with him ...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/boUP5PFvZlyk287QWZGyRiSKP2N.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:78822'),
  ('256601168545212629', 'High School Girl''s Diary', 1981, 'Drama', 'Nobuyoshi Araki, Masaru Mori, Yasunobu Takahashi', 'Rokuro Kumagai, Shun Nakahara', 'Yoko Morimura, Naomi Hagio, Rika Arai, Koshiro Asami, Kazuyo Ezaki, Hidetoshi Kageyama, Yûsuke Koike, Yūichi Minato', null, 'A high school girl is recruited by a photographer to be a model for a photo book. Thinking that she can make lots of money she agrees. He starts innocently enough but slowly convinces her to pose for more explicit shots.', 'A high school girl is recruited by a photographer to be a model for a photo book. Thinking that she can make lots of money she agrees. He starts innocently enough but slowly convinces her to pose for more explicit shots.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fa0sl6xf2oph9kSCUF41onRHfV2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:424321'),
  ('562910098607032625', 'High School Hellcats', 1958, 'Crime, Drama', 'Edward Bernds, Gilbert Warrenton', 'Mark Lowell, Jan Lowell, Jan Englund', 'Yvonne Lime, Brett Halsey, Jana Lund, Susanne Sidney, Heather Ames, Nancy Kilgas, Rhoda Williams, Don Shelton', 'NR', 'The Hellcats are an all-female gang bent on bucking authority at their high school. New student Joyce moves into the neighborhood and quickly draws their attention. Desperate for acceptance and unhappy with her home life, she becomes close to the Hellcats and begins drinking, dancing and meeting boys. Can Joyce''s parents stop her descent into depravity?', 'The Hellcats are an all-female gang bent on bucking authority at their high school. New student Joyce moves into the neighborhood and quickly draws their attention. Desperate for acceptance and unhappy with her home life, she becomes close to the Hellcats and begins drinking, dancing and meeting boys. Can Joyce''s parents stop her descent into depravity?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dAlI2Lo0IaQUoxQy9mP7giHbl8V.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:62037'),
  ('754739412276238111', 'High School High', 1996, 'Comedy, Crime, Romance', 'Hart Bochner, Vernon Layton, Elisabeth Leustig', 'Robert LoCash, Pat Proft, David Zucker', 'Jon Lovitz, Tia Carrere, Louise Fletcher, Mekhi Phifer, Natasha Gregson Wagner, John Neville, Malinda Williams, Guillermo Díaz', 'PG-13', 'Richard Clark has just left the well-known Wellington Academy to teach at Marion Barry High School. Now, he will try to inspire the D-average students into making good grades and try to woo a fellow teacher.', 'Richard Clark has just left the well-known Wellington Academy to teach at Marion Barry High School. Now, he will try to inspire the D-average students into making good grades and try to woo a fellow teacher.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rVaKt2stFzTfae2VEuTz3hlF3yC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9308'),
  ('357684773713967326', 'High School Musical', 2006, 'Comedy, Drama, Family, Music, Romance, TV Movie', 'Kenny Ortega, Gordon Lonsdale, Matias Alvarez', 'Peter Barsocchini', 'Zac Efron, Vanessa Hudgens, Ashley French, Lucas Grabeel, Corbin Bleu, Monique Coleman, Bart Johnson, Alyson Reed', 'G', 'A popular high school athlete and an academically gifted girl get roles in the school musical and develop a friendship that threatens East High''s social order.', 'A popular high school athlete and an academically gifted girl get roles in the school musical and develop a friendship that threatens East High''s social order.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1DGmWZjUJPeKGFRHGCA6VPFUBML.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10947'),
  ('268103270972076201', 'High School Musical 2', 2007, 'Comedy, Drama, Family, Music, Romance, TV Movie', 'Kenny Ortega, Daniel Aranyó', 'Peter Barsocchini', 'Zac Efron, Vanessa Hudgens, Ashley French, Lucas Grabeel, Corbin Bleu, Olesya Rulin, Chris Warren, Monique Coleman', 'G', 'The East High Wildcats are gearing up for big fun as they land the coolest summer jobs imaginable. Troy, Gabriella, Chad, and Taylor have scored sweet gigs at the Lava Springs Country Club owned by Sharpay and Ryan''s family. Sharpay''s first rule of business: Get Troy. As Troy experiences a life of privilege he''s never known, will he give up the Wildcats and Gabriella to rise to the top?', 'The East High Wildcats are gearing up for big fun as they land the coolest summer jobs imaginable. Troy, Gabriella, Chad, and Taylor have scored sweet gigs at the Lava Springs Country Club owned by Sharpay and Ryan''s family. Sharpay''s first rule of business: Get Troy. As Troy experiences a life of privilege he''s never known, will he give up the Wildcats and Gabriella to rise to the top?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kqImEYXsDIlzPpu0KxyTXIx7smW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13649'),
  ('234895321453557571', 'High School Musical 3: Senior Year', 2008, 'Comedy, Romance, Drama, Family, Music', 'Kenny Ortega, Daniel Aranyó, Mark Hansson', 'Peter Barsocchini', 'Zac Efron, Vanessa Hudgens, Ashley French, Lucas Grabeel, Corbin Bleu, Monique Coleman, Olesya Rulin, Chris Warren', 'G', 'As seniors in high school, Troy and Gabriella struggle with the idea of being separated from one another as college approaches. Along with the rest of the Wildcats, they stage a spring musical to address their experiences, hopes and fears about their future.', 'As seniors in high school, Troy and Gabriella struggle with the idea of being separated from one another as college approaches. Along with the rest of the Wildcats, they stage a spring musical to address their experiences, hopes and fears about their future.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aq2o1wT0crBOTxof36O6KTyjpgE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11887'),
