  ('697282944297737565', 'High School Musical: The Musical: The Holiday Special', 2020, 'Music, Documentary', 'Christopher Baffa, Tim Federle', null, 'Olivia Rodrigo, Joshua Bassett, Matt Cornett, Sofia Wylie, Larry Saperstein, Julia Lester, Dara Reneé, Frankie A. Rodriguez', null, 'The cast of “High School Musical: The Musical: The Series” delivers an abundance of feel-good holiday cheer as they perform their favorite Christmas, Hanukkah and New Year’s songs and share their fondest holiday memories.', 'The cast of “High School Musical: The Musical: The Series” delivers an abundance of feel-good holiday cheer as they perform their favorite Christmas, Hanukkah and New Year’s songs and share their fondest holiday memories.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qN7UKhqo5f3KE12FXjJf9D0603c.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:751126'),
  ('1090905920207711884', 'High School of the Dead: Drifters of the Dead', 2011, 'Comedy, Animation, Adventure, Horror', 'Tetsuro Araki', 'Yosuke Kuroda', 'Marina Inoue, Eri Kitamura, Miyuki Sawashiro, Nobuyuki Hiyama, Yukari Fukui, Junichi Suwabe', null, 'In their efforts to find a safe haven from the zombie apocalypse, the gang find themselves on a deserted island. Now, they take advantage of the momentary respite to enjoy some surf, sand and bathing suits!', 'In their efforts to find a safe haven from the zombie apocalypse, the gang find themselves on a deserted island. Now, they take advantage of the momentary respite to enjoy some surf, sand and bathing suits!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qXy2J2oy6JF369gZuUIQkr7MQn0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:203101'),
  ('287559749688515487', 'High School Teacher: Maturing', 1985, 'Drama, Romance', 'Shōgorō Nishimura, Yoshihiro Yamazaki, Takeshi Kitamura', 'Hiroshi Saitou', 'Rei Akasaka, Saeko Kuga, Toshiyuki Kitami, Jouji Nakata, Kosuke Yoda, Ryōko Watanabe, Koji Umeda, Kunpei Sakamoto', null, 'A female highschool teacher must deal with sexual harrassment from her students and being trapped in a love triangle with two men, neither of whom has any interest in marrying her.', 'A female highschool teacher must deal with sexual harrassment from her students and being trapped in a love triangle with two men, neither of whom has any interest in marrying her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r83w6ClnMYLIlyP46uKp5MFJd7y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:630639'),
  ('1058005920741402218', 'High School U.S.A.', 1983, 'TV Movie, Romance, Comedy', 'Rod Amateau, Jack Whitman, Laura Andrus', 'Alan Eisenstock, Larry Mintz', 'Michael J. Fox, Nancy McKeon, Todd Bridges, Angela Cartwright, Bob Denver, Dwayne Hickman, Lauri Hendler, Dana Plato', null, 'Set in a senior high school class, J.J. pursues the girlfriend of a rival from a higher clique which culminates in a race at the end of the movie between the two rivals in this light comedy.', 'Set in a senior high school class, J.J. pursues the girlfriend of a rival from a higher clique which culminates in a race at the end of the movie between the two rivals in this light comedy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jV9Zg3DCWltwxRuOktMoXm4gx2q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38923'),
  ('130814110631501366', 'High Schoolers: Rock ''n'' Roll', 1991, 'Comedy, Music, Romance', 'Mona Segall, Nicolae Corjos, Aurel Kostrachievici', 'George Șovu', 'Tamara Buciuceanu-Botez, Ștefan Bănică Jr., Oana Sîrbu, Mihai Constantin, Cesonia Postelnicu, Adrian Vâlcu, Cătălin Păduraru, Rodica Mureșan', null, 'The adventures of high schoolers, including strict maths teachers, rock ''n'' roll music, and first love experiences.', 'The adventures of high schoolers, including strict maths teachers, rock ''n'' roll music, and first love experiences.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ipxaR6K6DWW1o3ttHuNN6hBXNiW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:442957'),
  ('315215613016954250', 'High Season', 1987, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Chris Menges, Clare Peploe, Andrew Wood', 'Mark Peploe, Clare Peploe', 'Jacqueline Bisset, James Fox, Irene Papas, Sebastian Shaw, Kenneth Branagh, Lesley Manville, Robert Stephens, Geoffrey Rose', null, 'On the isle of Rhodes, Katherine, an expatriate English photographer, lives with her daughter. A young local wants to encourage tourism, so he commissions a sculpture of the Unknown Tourist for the town square; the sculptor he brings to Rhodes is Kate''s ex-husband. Also there to see Kate is Sharp, an aging antiquarian and her dear friend. He has something important to tell her. As Kate, her ex, and Sharp sort out things that go back years, two English tourists bumble about, one thinking he''s fallen in love with Kate, his wife thinking she''s found her own lover. A rare vase, a spy, old friendships, the statue''s unveiling, and off-hand English sorting-out play into the resolution.', 'On the isle of Rhodes, Katherine, an expatriate English photographer, lives with her daughter. A young local wants to encourage tourism, so he commissions a sculpture of the Unknown Tourist for the town square; the sculptor he brings to Rhodes is Kate''s ex-husband. Also there to see Kate is Sharp, an aging antiquarian and her dear friend. He has something important to tell her. As Kate, her ex, and Sharp sort out things that go back years, two English tourists bumble about, one thinking he''s fallen in love with Kate, his wife thinking she''s found her own lover. A rare vase, a spy, old friendships, the statue''s unveiling, and off-hand English sorting-out play into the resolution.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b3KqJglV3ADqJ6WrmOTFiqaB7j.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:121893'),
  ('472076962015269871', 'High Security Vacation', 2009, 'Comedy, Drama, Adventure', 'Igor Zaytsev, Antoine Vivas Denisov, Sergey Chuprov', 'Andrey Kivinov', 'Sergei Bezrukov, Dmitriy Dyuzhev, Alyona Babenko, Vladimir Menshov, Aleksei Kravchenko, Aleksandr Lykov, Kirill Pletnyov, Roman Madyanov', 'G', 'Two escaped convicts pose as children''s summer camp staff in order to evade capture and learn about caring for others in the process. Sumrak has been in prison since he was 16 years old but is pushing thirty now, is well acquainted with prison gang culture and covered with tattoos. Evgeni Koltsov is a former police officer unjustly imprisoned and destined for a death sentence from the other inmates if he stays in prison.', 'Two escaped convicts pose as children''s summer camp staff in order to evade capture and learn about caring for others in the process. Sumrak has been in prison since he was 16 years old but is pushing thirty now, is well acquainted with prison gang culture and covered with tattoos. Evgeni Koltsov is a former police officer unjustly imprisoned and destined for a death sentence from the other inmates if he stays in prison.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dqT6II2Ya26oVDNpafkmiqBq8aW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41978'),
  ('665563877696678067', 'High Sierra', 1941, 'Crime, Drama, Action', 'Raoul Walsh, Russell Saunders, Tony Gaudio', 'W.R. Burnett, John Huston', 'Ida Lupino, Humphrey Bogart, Alan Curtis, Arthur Kennedy, Joan Leslie, Henry Travers, Henry Hull, Jerome Cowan', 'NR', 'Given a pardon from jail, Roy Earle gets back into the swing of things as he robs a swanky resort.', 'Given a pardon from jail, Roy Earle gets back into the swing of things as he robs a swanky resort.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fkP6yy25Wja6Sn3AIlZ4F1BWsy0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27725'),
  ('668285665668421564', 'High Society', 1956, 'Music, Comedy, Romance', 'Paul Vogel, Charles Walters, Arvid Griffen', 'John Patrick', 'Bing Crosby, Grace Kelly, Frank Sinatra, Celeste Holm, John Lund, Louis Calhern, Sidney Blackmer, Louis Armstrong', 'NR', 'With socialite Tracy Lord about to remarry, her ex-husband - with the help of a sympathetic reporter - has 48 hours to convince her that she really still loves him.', 'With socialite Tracy Lord about to remarry, her ex-husband - with the help of a sympathetic reporter - has 48 hours to convince her that she really still loves him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eOKLignOrNN7pgTQbwCzW6WPwbD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11424'),
  ('98334385013803713', 'High Society', 2014, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Julie Lopes-Curval, Céline Bozon', 'Julie Lopes-Curval, Sophie Hiet', 'Ana Girardot, Bastien Bouillon, Baptiste Lecaplain, Aurélia Petit, Sergi López, India Hair, Stéphane Bissot, Jean-Noël Brouté', null, 'Class barriers threaten the budding romance of two young lovers striving to realize their artistic ambitions.', 'Class barriers threaten the budding romance of two young lovers striving to realize their artistic ambitions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pua25uc5RTFItoqt6EFcqrF30QY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:286742'),
  ('1014114972090535941', 'High Society', 2017, 'Comedy', 'Anika Decker, Andreas Berger', 'Anika Decker', 'Emilia Schüle, Jannis Niewöhner, Caro Cult, Iris Berben, Katja Riemann, Jannik Schümann, Manuel Rubey, Bella Bading', null, 'Two girls from very different social backgrounds discover, at the age of 25, that they had been switched at birth.', 'Two girls from very different social backgrounds discover, at the age of 25, that they had been switched at birth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y1jkYgGExy1MsAEgvdnxEu0yQsR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:428081'),
  ('443411432280416418', 'High Society', 2018, 'Drama', 'Park Se-seung, Byun Hyuk, Bae Il-hyuck', 'Kim Seong-tae, Wang Hye-ji, Byun Hyuk', 'Park Hae-il, Soo Ae, Yoon Je-moon, Ra Mi-ran, Lee Jin-uk, Kim Kyu-seon, Han Joo-young, Kim Kang-woo', null, 'The story of the journey of married couple up the social latter. The husband is professor at Seoul National University who is running for the National Assembly, and his wife is a painter.', 'The story of the journey of married couple up the social latter. The husband is professor at Seoul National University who is running for the National Assembly, and his wife is a painter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jiNYN0LDfBllYAYOkT4NJPaOvuH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:543753'),
  ('428000403118620451', 'High Spirits', 1988, 'Fantasy, Comedy, Horror', 'Neil Jordan, Alex Thomson, Tim Lewis', 'Neil Jordan', 'Peter O''Toole, Daryl Hannah, Steve Guttenberg, Beverly D''Angelo, Jennifer Tilly, Liam Neeson, Peter Gallagher, Martin Ferrero', 'PG-13', 'When a hotelier attempts to fill the chronic vacancies at his castle by launching an advertising campaign that falsely portrays the property as haunted, two actual ghosts show up and end up falling for two guests.', 'When a hotelier attempts to fill the chronic vacancies at his castle by launching an advertising campaign that falsely portrays the property as haunted, two actual ghosts show up and end up falling for two guests.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/88sqqQrltIok7ayhs21mAHoSrcK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21362'),
  ('91302653093142264', 'High Stakes - A Night In The Ward', 2024, 'Comedy', 'Giovanni Dota, Jacopo Caramella', 'Giovanni Dota, Giulia Magda Martinez, Matteo Visconti', 'Carlo Buccirosso, Lino Musella, Nando Paone, Yari Gugliucci, Vittorio Ciorcalo, Clotilde Sabatino, Chiarastella Sorrentino, Elvira Zingone', null, 'It’s Ferragosto, Italy’s mid-August holiday, in a practically deserted hospital in Naples. Two nurses, Angelo and Salvatore, are on shift when a desperately ill patient is wheeled in. With his seasoned eye, Angelo knows at once that Mr. Caputo won’t last the night. Salvatore happens to loathe Angelo and decides to bet on the opposite outcome. The winner of the bet will nab the top holiday slot: Christmas vacation. Angelo takes up the challenge. From that moment on, Salvatore will spend the night trying to keep Mr. Caputo alive, while Angelo will play dirty to make sure he wins the bet. That night, it’s anything goes at their hospital, from the nurses’ cheap shots to doctors on cocaine and suspicious characters lurking in the ward.', 'It’s Ferragosto, Italy’s mid-August holiday, in a practically deserted hospital in Naples. Two nurses, Angelo and Salvatore, are on shift when a desperately ill patient is wheeled in. With his seasoned eye, Angelo knows at once that Mr. Caputo won’t last the night. Salvatore happens to loathe Angelo and decides to bet on the opposite outcome. The winner of the bet will nab the top holiday slot: Christmas vacation. Angelo takes up the challenge. From that moment on, Salvatore will spend the night trying to keep Mr. Caputo alive, while Angelo will play dirty to make sure he wins the bet. That night, it’s anything goes at their hospital, from the nurses’ cheap shots to doctors on cocaine and suspicious characters lurking in the ward.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rP5xK5KwmzirLwrfYppxMoQoXbX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1116144'),
  ('265318885027062689', 'High Steaks', 1962, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Gene Deitch, Václav Bedřich', null, 'Allen Swift', null, 'Tom''s owner, Clint Clobber, is grilling steaks in his backyard. The steak''s scent reaches Jerry, who is aroused by it and is led to the steak.', 'Tom''s owner, Clint Clobber, is grilling steaks in his backyard. The steak''s scent reaches Jerry, who is aroused by it and is led to the steak.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hLg590tjnJ3neik2ZlAlEVpdXbE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:223019'),
  ('417523140971599731', 'High Strung', 1992, 'Comedy', 'Roger Nygard, Christina McKinlay, Tom Koranda', 'Robert Kuhn, Steve Oedekerk', 'Steve Oedekerk, Thomas F. Wilson, Denise Crosby, Fred Willard, Jani Lane, Kirsten Dunst, Ed Williams, Toni Sawyer', 'PG', 'Thane Furrows, an extremely cynical but unintentionally hilarious children''s book writer, wakes up one morning, and, since pretty much everyone and everything annoys him, begins another day of complaining to himself. However, the day proves to be much different than normal when Thane begins to recieve strange phone calls, letters, and voices in his head, all indicating that something will happen at 8 o''clock. As the day goes on, Thane rants and raves about the things that annoy him, as the clock slowly ticks closer and closer to his destiny.', 'Thane Furrows, an extremely cynical but unintentionally hilarious children''s book writer, wakes up one morning, and, since pretty much everyone and everything annoys him, begins another day of complaining to himself. However, the day proves to be much different than normal when Thane begins to recieve strange phone calls, letters, and voices in his head, all indicating that something will happen at 8 o''clock. As the day goes on, Thane rants and raves about the things that annoy him, as the clock slowly ticks closer and closer to his destiny.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/myl4HdGadeQll6UY2DBZQ7ZXnoc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22792'),
  ('637787021590685309', 'High Strung', 2016, 'Music, Romance, Drama', 'Michael Damian, Viorel Sergovici', 'Janeen Damian, Michael Damian', 'Keenan Kampa, Nicholas Galitzine, Sonoya Mizuno, Jane Seymour, Richard Southgate, Paul Freeman, Marcus Emanuel Mitchell, Maia Morgenstern', 'PG', 'When a hip hop violinist busking in the New York subway encounters a classical dancer on scholarship at the Manhattan Conservatory of the Arts, sparks fly. With the help of a hip hop dance crew they must find a common ground while preparing for a competition that could change their lives forever.', 'When a hip hop violinist busking in the New York subway encounters a classical dancer on scholarship at the Manhattan Conservatory of the Arts, sparks fly. With the help of a hip hop dance crew they must find a common ground while preparing for a competition that could change their lives forever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xfj4Vomg8h3I1hBHj4GfpduUfkv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:382399'),
  ('674345296799963607', 'High Strung Free Dance', 2018, 'Music, Romance, Drama', 'Michael Damian, Viorel Sergovici, Carolyn McLeod', 'Janeen Damian, Michael Damian', 'Thomas Doherty, Harry Jarvis, Juliet Doherty, Jane Seymour, Ace Bhatti, Kika Markham, Nataly Santiago, Kerrynton Jones', 'PG', 'Zander Raines, a dazzling and tempestuous young choreographer, gives the break of a lifetime to two hopeful artists when he casts a stunning contemporary dancer, Barlow, and innovative pianist, Charlie, in New York’s most-anticipated new Broadway show: Free Dance. But the move throws off the show’s delicate creative balance when Charlie falls hard for Barlow, while Zander embraces her as his muse.', 'Zander Raines, a dazzling and tempestuous young choreographer, gives the break of a lifetime to two hopeful artists when he casts a stunning contemporary dancer, Barlow, and innovative pianist, Charlie, in New York’s most-anticipated new Broadway show: Free Dance. But the move throws off the show’s delicate creative balance when Charlie falls hard for Barlow, while Zander embraces her as his muse.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dOdWTC9gvdQLhN1eYpiy77c2QEQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:540158'),
  ('512059570933171549', 'High Tension', 2003, 'Horror, Thriller, Mystery', 'Maxime Alexandre, Alexandre Aja, Călin Papură', 'Grégory Levasseur, Alexandre Aja', 'Cécile de France, Maïwenn, Philippe Nahon, Andrei Finti, Oana Pellea, Marco Claudiu Pascu, Franck Khalfoun, Jean-Claude de Goros', 'R', 'Best friends Marie and Alexia decide to spend a quiet weekend at Alexia''s parents'' secluded farmhouse. But on the night of their arrival, the girls'' idyllic getaway turns into an endless night of horror.', 'Best friends Marie and Alexia decide to spend a quiet weekend at Alexia''s parents'' secluded farmhouse. But on the night of their arrival, the girls'' idyllic getaway turns into an endless night of horror.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vKeFa7CqSxmWsQDjHP6SJXKoDbj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10226'),
