  ('599228092257663342', 'High Voltage', 1972, 'Crime, Thriller', 'Julio Buchs, Mario Montuori', 'Domenico Comanducci, Mino Roli, Julio Buchs', 'Marisa Mell, Gabriele Ferzetti, Juan Luis Galiardo, Helga Liné, Patrizia Adiutori, Manuel Alexandre, Jacinto San Emeterio, Gogó Rojo', null, 'José, a young mechanic, arrives in Madrid to make it big. After being conned he loses his savings, and is taken in by Elisa, a photographer. She introduces him to Pablo and Laura. Laura makes him an offer he cant refuse and then his troubles really begin.', 'José, a young mechanic, arrives in Madrid to make it big. After being conned he loses his savings, and is taken in by Elisa, a photographer. She introduces him to Pablo and Laura. Laura makes him an offer he cant refuse and then his troubles really begin.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eyoN5CCzGIklKQ5kYCYLQeI1bI9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:3403'),
  ('791483017433039682', 'High Voltage', 1995, 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 'Andrew Kam Yeung-Wah, Cindy Chow Fung, Patrick Jim', 'Cindy Chow Fung', 'Donnie Yen, Roy Cheung Yiu-Yeung, Lily Lee Lai-Lai, Edu Manzano, Lai Chi-Saan, Frankie Chan Chi-Leung, Mandy Chan Chi-Man, Raymond Chan Ga-Jun', null, 'Donnie Yen is back with a vengeance in this electric action thriller. The star of Fist of Fury, Hero and Highlander goes up against Hong Kong''s deadliest gangsters in a no holds barred duel to the death. Donnie Yen has proven to be one of martial arts most reliable and dedicated martial arts stars. Through the years he''s been the lead in his own films, as well as co-starring with the modern legends such as Jet Li and Jackie Chan.', 'Donnie Yen is back with a vengeance in this electric action thriller. The star of Fist of Fury, Hero and Highlander goes up against Hong Kong''s deadliest gangsters in a no holds barred duel to the death. Donnie Yen has proven to be one of martial arts most reliable and dedicated martial arts stars. Through the years he''s been the lead in his own films, as well as co-starring with the modern legends such as Jet Li and Jackie Chan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qUZ5PPeHuUZZfTxqkcMsfljaOcZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:99582'),
