  ('206698328742413804', 'High☆Speed!: Free! Starting Days', 2015, 'Animation, Drama, Comedy', 'Eisaku Kawanami, Yuko Myouken, Yuji Shibata', 'Maiko Nishioka', 'Koki Uchiyama, Nobunaga Shimazaki, Tatsuhisa Suzuki, Satomi Sato, Kenji Nojima, Mamoru Miyano, Yoko Hikasa, Chihiro Suzuki', null, 'Middle school freshmen Haruka and Makoto join the school swim team, and have to join forces with their new teammates to win.', 'Middle school freshmen Haruka and Makoto join the school swim team, and have to join forces with their new teammates to win.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jxAiYwh0HYCQuu5NwE0auKbfPRB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:357416'),
