  ('817868216794678634', 'Higher Ground', 2011, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Vera Farmiga, Michael McDonough', 'Tim Metcalfe, Carolyn S. Briggs', 'Vera Farmiga, Donna Murphy, Dagmara Dominczyk, John Hawkes, Joshua Leonard, Nina Arianda, Taissa Farmiga, Taylor Schwencke', 'R', 'Vera Farmiga''s directorial debut, HIGHER GROUND, depicts the landscape of a tight-knit spiritual community thrown off-kilter when one of their own begins to question her faith. Inspired by screenwriter Carolyn S. Briggs'' memoir This Dark World, the film tells the story of a thoughtful woman''s struggles with belief, love, and trust - in human relationships as well as in God.', 'Vera Farmiga''s directorial debut, HIGHER GROUND, depicts the landscape of a tight-knit spiritual community thrown off-kilter when one of their own begins to question her faith. Inspired by screenwriter Carolyn S. Briggs'' memoir This Dark World, the film tells the story of a thoughtful woman''s struggles with belief, love, and trust - in human relationships as well as in God.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xFvN6OVYGwPokUnkZlKxd1coxbS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50875'),
  ('801137691139137547', 'Higher Learning', 1995, 'Drama, Crime, Thriller', 'John Singleton, Peter Lyons Collister', 'John Singleton', 'Omar Epps, Kristy Swanson, Michael Rapaport, Jennifer Connelly, Ice Cube, Jason Wiles, Tyra Banks, Cole Hauser', 'R', 'African-American student Malik is on a track scholarship; academics are not his strong suit, and he goes in thinking that his athletic abilities will earn him a free ride through college. Fudge, a "professional student" who has been at Columbus for six years so far, becomes friendly with Malik and challenges his views about race and politics in America.', 'African-American student Malik is on a track scholarship; academics are not his strong suit, and he goes in thinking that his athletic abilities will earn him a free ride through college. Fudge, a "professional student" who has been at Columbus for six years so far, becomes friendly with Malik and challenges his views about race and politics in America.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tuud1Blsdwo1KQRdz5UVwjlLAWQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16295'),
  ('1082423656944819271', 'Higher Power', 2018, 'Science Fiction, Action, Thriller', 'Matthew Charles Santoro, Dallas Sterling, Jeff Fuller', 'Matthew Charles Santoro, Julia Fair', 'Ron Eldard, Jordan Danger, Austin Stowell, Colm Feore, Jade Tailor, Winston James Francis, Marielle Jaffe, Tom Wright', 'R', 'When the Universe decides what it wants, it''s pointless to resist. With his family''s life at stake, Joseph Steadman finds himself the unwilling test subject of a maniacal scientist in a battle that could save the world – or destroy it.', 'When the Universe decides what it wants, it''s pointless to resist. With his family''s life at stake, Joseph Steadman finds himself the unwilling test subject of a maniacal scientist in a battle that could save the world – or destroy it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cplMeBlGdkpDzypHRKZ64BrpLoL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:513324'),
  ('487337666914444176', 'Higher Principle', 1960, 'Drama', 'Jiří Krejčík, Věra Ženíšková, Miroslav Kubišta', 'Jan Drda, Jiří Krejčík', 'František Smolík, Jana Brejchová, Ivan Mistrík, Jan Šmíd, Alexandr Postler, Petr Kostka, Radovan Lukavský, Václav Lohniský', null, 'During the Nazi occupation of a Czech city civilians are being rounded up on the slightest of pretexts and shot. One day three high school boys who crack jokes about a recently deceased "hero of the Reich" are pulled out of school by the Gestapo.', 'During the Nazi occupation of a Czech city civilians are being rounded up on the slightest of pretexts and shot. One day three high school boys who crack jokes about a recently deceased "hero of the Reich" are pulled out of school by the Gestapo.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eHOhjM0B8e2rMlZV6mlt0Bs6Q1x.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:201267'),
  ('158665344100325429', 'Highest 2 Lowest', 2025, 'Thriller, Crime, Drama', 'Spike Lee, Matthew Libatique, Joseph P. Reidy', 'Ryuzo Kikushima, Eijiro Hisaita, Akira Kurosawa', 'Denzel Washington, Jeffrey Wright, Ilfenesh Hadera, Elijah Wright, Aubrey Joseph, A$AP Rocky, John Douglas Thompson, LaChanze', 'R', 'When a titan music mogul, widely known as having the "best ears in the business", is targeted with a ransom plot, he is jammed up in a life-or-death moral dilemma.', 'When a titan music mogul, widely known as having the "best ears in the business", is targeted with a ransom plot, he is jammed up in a life-or-death moral dilemma.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/RFQtinuiHhOnbmJaCn3uzegCYF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1242434'),
  ('794120621940460791', 'Highlander', null, 'Action, Fantasy, Science Fiction', 'Chad Stahelski, Tom Still, Dan Laustsen', 'Michael Finch, Ryan Condal, Kerry Williamson', 'Henry Cavill, Russell Crowe, Marisa Abela, Karen Gillan, Djimon Hounsou, Dave Bautista, Andrew Galloway, Max Zhang', null, 'An immortal Scottish swordsman faces off with other immortal warriors in order to obtain a coveted prize: mortality.', 'An immortal Scottish swordsman faces off with other immortal warriors in order to obtain a coveted prize: mortality.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n2NWJ82NjobXaNI0ODpFUpzKm5R.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:339727'),
  ('779709469060476634', 'Highlander', 1986, 'Adventure, Action, Fantasy', 'Russell Mulcahy, Gerry Fisher, Mark Raggett', 'Gregory Widen, Peter Bellwood, Larry Ferguson', 'Christopher Lambert, Roxanne Hart, Clancy Brown, Sean Connery, Beatie Edney, Alan North, Jon Polito, Sheila Gish', 'R', 'He fought his first battle on the Scottish Highlands in 1536. He will fight his greatest battle on the streets of New York City in 1986. His name is Connor MacLeod. He is immortal.', 'He fought his first battle on the Scottish Highlands in 1536. He will fight his greatest battle on the streets of New York City in 1986. His name is Connor MacLeod. He is immortal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8Z8dptJEypuLoOQro1WugD855YE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8009'),
  ('811472004714672249', 'Highlander II: The Quickening', 1991, 'Fantasy, Action, Adventure', 'Russell Mulcahy, Phil Meheux, John King', 'Peter Bellwood', 'Christopher Lambert, Sean Connery, Virginia Madsen, Michael Ironside, John C. McGinley, Phillip Brock, Rusty Schwimmer, Ed Trucco', 'R', 'In the year 2024, the ozone layer is believed to have been destroyed, and it''s up to MacLeod and Ramirez to set things right. Opposition comes from both the planet Zeist (MacLeod and Ramirez''s homeworld) and a corporation profiting from the supposed lack of ozone. Also, flashbacks show the story behind MacLeod and Ramirez''s exile from Zeist.', 'In the year 2024, the ozone layer is believed to have been destroyed, and it''s up to MacLeod and Ramirez to set things right. Opposition comes from both the planet Zeist (MacLeod and Ramirez''s homeworld) and a corporation profiting from the supposed lack of ozone. Also, flashbacks show the story behind MacLeod and Ramirez''s exile from Zeist.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qxKeykPNGbKAK0DJijMUaZ5cVPo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8010'),
  ('707464245535337985', 'Highlander III: The Sorcerer', 1994, 'Fantasy, Action, Adventure', 'Andrew Morahan, Marc Larose, François Aubry', 'Paul Ohl, Brad Mirman, René Manzor', 'Christopher Lambert, Mario Van Peebles, Deborah Kara Unger, Mako, Martin Neufeld, Daniel Dõ, Michael Jayston, Louis Bertignac', 'R', 'Starts off in the 15th century, with Connor McLeod training with another immortal swordsman, the Japanese sorcerer Nakano. When an evil immortal named Kane kills the old wizard, the resulting battle leaves him buried in an underground cave. When Kane resurfaces in the 20th century to create havoc, it''s up to McLeod to stop him.', 'Starts off in the 15th century, with Connor McLeod training with another immortal swordsman, the Japanese sorcerer Nakano. When an evil immortal named Kane kills the old wizard, the resulting battle leaves him buried in an underground cave. When Kane resurfaces in the 20th century to create havoc, it''s up to McLeod to stop him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9OwpKEb4kR3s3tgfJUMX7yficcm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8011'),
  ('748991862787990633', 'Highlander: Endgame', 2000, 'Action, Adventure, Fantasy', 'Douglas Milsome, Douglas Aarniokoski, Șerban Porupcă', 'Joel Soisson', 'Christopher Lambert, Adrian Paul, Bruce Payne, Lisa Barbuscia, Donnie Yen, Jim Byrnes, Peter Wingfield, Beatie Edney', 'R', 'Immortals Connor and Duncan Macleod join forces against a man from Connor''s distant past in the highlands of Scotland, Kell, an immensely powerful immortal who leads an army of equally powerful and deadly immortal swordsmen and assassins. No immortal alive has been able to defeat Kell yet, and neither Connor nor Duncan are skilled enough themselves to take him on and live. The two of them eventually come to one inevitable conclusion; one of them must die so that the combined power of both the Highlanders can bring down Kell for good. There can be only one... the question is, who will it be?', 'Immortals Connor and Duncan Macleod join forces against a man from Connor''s distant past in the highlands of Scotland, Kell, an immensely powerful immortal who leads an army of equally powerful and deadly immortal swordsmen and assassins. No immortal alive has been able to defeat Kell yet, and neither Connor nor Duncan are skilled enough themselves to take him on and live. The two of them eventually come to one inevitable conclusion; one of them must die so that the combined power of both the Highlanders can bring down Kell for good. There can be only one... the question is, who will it be?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u7kIXMyagqcek2SaS9svfPTTGVT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12211'),
  ('37967593909673891', 'Highlander: The Search for Vengeance', 2007, 'Action, Animation, Fantasy, Science Fiction', 'Yoshiaki Kawajiri, Satoshi Tasaki, Hisashi Abe', 'David Abramowitz', 'Alistair Abell, Debi Mae West, Nolan North, Scott McNeil, Ogie Banks, Janyse Jaud, Jim Byrnes, Kathleen Barr', 'R', 'Colin MacLeod hunts for the man responsible for the death of his love. He chases the immortal Marcus Octavius across centuries as his quest threatens to take over his life and heart. In his quest, he meets a woman who reminds him of his slain beauty. But it''s his final battle with Marcus that will decide not only his fate, but also the fate of everyone in the world.', 'Colin MacLeod hunts for the man responsible for the death of his love. He chases the immortal Marcus Octavius across centuries as his quest threatens to take over his life and heart. In his quest, he meets a woman who reminds him of his slain beauty. But it''s his final battle with Marcus that will decide not only his fate, but also the fate of everyone in the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f4htbMf2LORgMjKn0litcUFWuWY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13194'),
  ('971439957364260247', 'Highlander: The Source', 2007, 'Action, Fantasy, Adventure, TV Movie', 'Brett Leonard, Steve Arnold', 'Stephen Kelvin Watkins, Mark Bradley', 'Adrian Paul, Thekla Reuten, Cristian Solimeno, Peter Wingfield, Jim Byrnes, Stephen Rahman Hughes, Stephen Wight, Thom Fell', 'R', 'The world is falling into chaos. As he roams a crumbling city, Duncan MacLeod, the Highlander, remembers happier times before the love of his life left... Hopeless and alone, MacLeod finds his way to a band of immortal companions, including his mysterious friend Methos, and a mortal, Watcher Joe Dawson. Together this small group sets out on a quest to find the origin of the first Immortal.', 'The world is falling into chaos. As he roams a crumbling city, Duncan MacLeod, the Highlander, remembers happier times before the love of his life left... Hopeless and alone, MacLeod finds his way to a band of immortal companions, including his mysterious friend Methos, and a mortal, Watcher Joe Dawson. Together this small group sets out on a quest to find the origin of the first Immortal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1d0pKQuk6KUHaK5LL6ZNvSp6vS8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13360'),
  ('1091701326246290935', 'Highly Dangerous', 1950, 'Thriller, Action', 'Reginald H. Wyer, Roy Ward Baker', 'Eric Ambler', 'Margaret Lockwood, Dane Clark, Marius Goring, Naunton Wayne, Wilfrid Hyde-White, Eugene Deckers, Olaf Pooley, Gladys Henson', null, 'A US newsman and a British entomologist spy on germ-warfare research in a mythical country.', 'A US newsman and a British entomologist spy on germ-warfare research in a mythical country.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zl6HcgYEKxdINIOWj9s9ulXoAFS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:87588'),
  ('3688656889586013', 'Highway', 2002, 'Action, Adventure, Drama', 'James Cox, Justin Muller, John M. Morse', 'Scott Rosenberg', 'Jared Leto, Selma Blair, Jake Gyllenhaal, John C. McGinley, Jeremy Piven, Kimberley Kates, Mark Rolston, Arden Myrin', 'R', 'Jack is caught with the wife of his employer, a Vegas thug. The thug sends goons after Jack, who convinces his best friend, Pilot, to flee with him. Pilot insists that they head for Seattle, but doesn''t tell Jack why. The goons learn from Pilot''s drug source where the youths are headed, and they follow, hell bent on breaking Jack''s feet. On the road, Jack and Pilot give a ride to Cassie, a distressed young woman. She and Jack hit it off. They pick up an aging stoner headed to Seattle for Kurt Cobain''s memorial, and they help a circus sideshow family. Why is Pilot so set on Seattle, will the goons catch Jack, and is there any way the friends'' competing needs can be resolved?', 'Jack is caught with the wife of his employer, a Vegas thug. The thug sends goons after Jack, who convinces his best friend, Pilot, to flee with him. Pilot insists that they head for Seattle, but doesn''t tell Jack why. The goons learn from Pilot''s drug source where the youths are headed, and they follow, hell bent on breaking Jack''s feet. On the road, Jack and Pilot give a ride to Cassie, a distressed young woman. She and Jack hit it off. They pick up an aging stoner headed to Seattle for Kurt Cobain''s memorial, and they help a circus sideshow family. Why is Pilot so set on Seattle, will the goons catch Jack, and is there any way the friends'' competing needs can be resolved?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jttL1E4eCQn7tHBbYlUkMz865Q4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18808'),
  ('244107995132683931', 'Highway', 2014, 'Drama, Romance, Crime', 'Imtiaz Ali, Abhishek Roy Sanyal, Mukesh Chhabra', 'Imtiaz Ali', 'Alia Bhatt, Randeep Hooda, Durgesh Kumar, Pradeep Nagar, Saharsh Kumar Shukla, Shakeel Khan, Mohit Choudhary, Hemant Mahaur', 'PG-13', 'Right before her wedding, a young woman finds herself abducted and held for ransom. As the initial days pass, she begins to develop a strange bond with her kidnapper.', 'Right before her wedding, a young woman finds herself abducted and held for ransom. As the initial days pass, she begins to develop a strange bond with her kidnapper.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xuTevYF35WDkElpm5vNBVaISkT9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:252841'),
  ('712552741665834460', 'Highway 13', 1948, 'Crime, Mystery', 'William Berke, Carl Berger', 'Maurice Tombragel', 'Robert Lowery, Pamela Blake, Clem Bevans, Michael Whalen, Steve Pendleton, Lyle Talbot, Mary Gordon, Maris Wrixon', 'NR', 'Hank Wilson is a driver for a truck for a big transportation company which is in financial straits. He is in love with Doris Lacy, a waitress at the truck-stop where the company has its truck fleet serviced. Frequent accidents near the place leads the company to hire a private detective to investigate, and when the detective is murdered Hank is arrested as a suspect. The insurance company that covers the fleet has him released and he is sent back to work with instructions to investigate the accidents on his own. The trail leads to the uncle of Doris, and one of the part-owners of the company.', 'Hank Wilson is a driver for a truck for a big transportation company which is in financial straits. He is in love with Doris Lacy, a waitress at the truck-stop where the company has its truck fleet serviced. Frequent accidents near the place leads the company to hire a private detective to investigate, and when the detective is murdered Hank is arrested as a suspect. The insurance company that covers the fleet has him released and he is sent back to work with instructions to investigate the accidents on his own. The trail leads to the uncle of Doris, and one of the part-owners of the company.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kQua9GllzZI8hBFxL7lNZVVKX5A.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:122740'),
  ('748181998512896610', 'Highway 301', 1950, 'Crime', 'Andrew L. Stone, Carl E. Guthrie, Oren Haglund', 'Andrew L. Stone', 'Steve Cochran, Virginia Grey, Gaby André, Edmon Ryan, Robert Webber, Wally Cassell, Aline Towne, Richard Egan', null, 'The "Tri-State" gang goes on a successful bank robbing streak causing local authorities to turn up the heat on the daring career criminals.', 'The "Tri-State" gang goes on a successful bank robbing streak causing local authorities to turn up the heat on the daring career criminals.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qgkhQ2LWEXdPZoiXFUrypkpyooK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29477'),
  ('982959376708972267', 'Highway 61', 1991, 'Comedy', 'Bruce McDonald, David Webb, Mirosław Baszak', 'Don McKellar', 'Valerie Buhagiar, Don McKellar, Earl Pastko, Peter Breck, Jello Biafra, Hadley Obodiac, Tav Falco, Tracy Wright', 'R', 'A naive Canadian barber who knows US popular culture inside and out meets a flamboyant roadie who needs someone to drive her and her "brother''s" corpse from Thunder Bay, Ontario to New Orleans. Chaos ensues after the barber agrees to drive her, the corpse, and the drugs stashed within all the way.', 'A naive Canadian barber who knows US popular culture inside and out meets a flamboyant roadie who needs someone to drive her and her "brother''s" corpse from Thunder Bay, Ontario to New Orleans. Chaos ensues after the barber agrees to drive her, the corpse, and the drugs stashed within all the way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kUJNsyvl3yezjbWuQG2Mh7HtPmc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8468'),
  ('641717312965484374', 'Highway Battle R×R', 2008, null, 'Tetsuya Ikeda', null, null, null, 'After suffering a crushing defeat against the new CBA-R35, Koji takes his GT-R32 and trains hard in hopes of taking back his racing crown.', 'After suffering a crushing defeat against the new CBA-R35, Koji takes his GT-R32 and trains hard in hopes of taking back his racing crown.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4cJFO4GiUqFUo81XHCAQy4CAKQG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:539130'),
  ('53715160264587340', 'Highway Dragnet', 1954, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'John J. Martin, Nathan Juran', 'Herb Meadow, Jerome Odlum', 'Richard Conte, Joan Bennett, Wanda Hendrix, Reed Hadley, Mary Beth Hughes, Iris Adrian, Harry Harvey, Tom Hubbard', null, 'An ex-Marine, on the lam from a murder charge, hitches a ride with a glamour-magazine photographer, who is travelling cross-country with her principal model. Tensions rise when the women realize the man with them may be a killer.', 'An ex-Marine, on the lam from a murder charge, hitches a ride with a glamour-magazine photographer, who is travelling cross-country with her principal model. Tensions rise when the women realize the man with them may be a killer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/SxO8BT1cqPDtqEyFIooiJ7SYsG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47149'),
  ('896870863067182267', 'Highway Patrolman', 1991, 'Drama, Crime', 'Alex Cox, Miguel Garzón', 'Madeleine Gavin', 'Roberto Sosa, Bruno Bichir, Vanessa Bauche, Zaide Silvia Gutiérrez, Pedro Armendáriz Jr., Mike Moroff, Arturo Farfán, Ernesto Gómez Cruz', null, 'A naïve rookie in the Mexican highway patrol must adapt in order to survive as he contends with widespread corruption, dangerous drug runners and the consequences of his often morally gray actions.', 'A naïve rookie in the Mexican highway patrol must adapt in order to survive as he contends with widespread corruption, dangerous drug runners and the consequences of his often morally gray actions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dRnOQCMEjZWViZvGa5iZqQ5vPXS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54837'),
  ('368108850377868817', 'Highway Pick-Up', 1963, 'Crime, Drama', 'Julien Duvivier, Léonce-Henri Burel', null, 'Robert Hossein, Jean Sorel, Catherine Rouvel, Georges Wilson, Lucien Raimbourg, Nicole Berger, Jacques Bertrand, Jean-Jacques Delbo', null, 'An escaped convict makes a remote gas station his safe haven. But soon the cunning, devious wife of the owner seeks a chance to use him to get what she wants.', 'An escaped convict makes a remote gas station his safe haven. But soon the cunning, devious wife of the owner seeks a chance to use him to get what she wants.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/40rd5W2vc67P0zOqPWFQkxxhkqL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:115162'),
  ('75677739216300586', 'Highway Racer', 1977, 'Crime, Action', 'Stelvio Massi, Riccardo Pallottini, Franco Delli Colli', 'Gino Capone', 'Maurizio Merli, Giancarlo Sbragia, Angelo Infanti, Lilli Carati, Glauco Onorato, Orazio Orlando, Gaetano Balestrieri, Rosario Borelli', null, 'A hot-shot police officer has more guts than brains, often landing him in hot water with his middle-aged mentor, who was once a legendary cop responsible for numerous large scale arrests.', 'A hot-shot police officer has more guts than brains, often landing him in hot water with his middle-aged mentor, who was once a legendary cop responsible for numerous large scale arrests.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yBSdkjM8TEl8ihN16BdVjqXg0CA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:95096'),
  ('1150916924664796663', 'Highway Star', 2007, 'Music, Comedy', 'Hyeon-su Kim, Kim Sang-chan, Yoon Hong-sik', 'Kim Sang-chan, Seon Seung-yeon', 'Cha Tae-hyun, Lim Chae-mu, Lee So-yeon, Lee Byung-joon, Jeong Seok-yong, Park Young-seo, Lim Se-mi', null, 'Stuck in a small town, aspiring rocker Dal Ho makes a living reluctantly playing trot at local clubs. When small-time recording company head Jang offers Dal Ho a contract, he eagerly grabs the opportunity, believing that his time has finally come. After he signs, however, Dal Ho discovers that he won''t be rocking after all. Instead, he will be singing trot. Unable to back out of his contract, Dal Ho takes to the stage behind a mask to hide his embarrassment, and ends up an overnight sensation. The wannabe rocker seems to have found his true calling, but doing music he dislikes. With the help of Jang and a certain cute trot singer, maybe he''ll actually learn the passion of trot.', 'Stuck in a small town, aspiring rocker Dal Ho makes a living reluctantly playing trot at local clubs. When small-time recording company head Jang offers Dal Ho a contract, he eagerly grabs the opportunity, believing that his time has finally come. After he signs, however, Dal Ho discovers that he won''t be rocking after all. Instead, he will be singing trot. Unable to back out of his contract, Dal Ho takes to the stage behind a mask to hide his embarrassment, and ends up an overnight sensation. The wannabe rocker seems to have found his true calling, but doing music he dislikes. With the help of Jang and a certain cute trot singer, maybe he''ll actually learn the passion of trot.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7CuEcRuqNlEcgnvrAFxFG56tvWz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:131922'),
  ('105256637639287690', 'Highway to Hell', 1991, 'Fantasy, Action, Comedy, Horror', 'Robin Vidgeon, Ate de Jong, Michael Waxman', 'Brian Helgeland', 'Patrick Bergin, Adam Storke, Chad Lowe, Kristy Swanson, Pamela Gidley, Jarrett Lennon, C.J. Graham, Richard Farnsworth', 'R', 'Charlie and Rachel run away from home to get married in Las Vegas. But they get attacked by a zombie who takes Rachel with him to hell, where she will become one of Satan''s brides.', 'Charlie and Rachel run away from home to get married in Las Vegas. But they get attacked by a zombie who takes Rachel with him to hell, where she will become one of Satan''s brides.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/672mGX0B3LIbaBQEdWKAJpCVHO5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16191'),
  ('949013855529731155', 'Highway to Hellas', 2015, 'Comedy', 'Aron Lehmann', 'Moses Wolff, Arnd Schimkat', 'Christoph Maria Herbst, Adam Bousdoukos, Akilas Karazisis, Georgia Tsagaraki, Kleopatra Markou, Rosalie Thomass, Eva Bay, Panagos Ioakeim', null, 'The life of Jorg Geissner, a German banker, totally transforms with a visit to Paladiki Island, Greece. A business trip to check on a project called “Galapagos in Greece” by the islanders and for which his bank extended a loan and credit, brought him there. Being a German, he wants to investigate thoroughly, but Panos, a mini-mart owner, and the mayor try their utmost to sabotage him—to camouflage a not-so-good reality. After every single trial resulted in nothing because of the islanders’ secret meddling, Jorg’s trip becomes elongated, like The Odyssey’s, forcing him to contemplate the priorities and responsibilities in life again.', 'The life of Jorg Geissner, a German banker, totally transforms with a visit to Paladiki Island, Greece. A business trip to check on a project called “Galapagos in Greece” by the islanders and for which his bank extended a loan and credit, brought him there. Being a German, he wants to investigate thoroughly, but Panos, a mini-mart owner, and the mayor try their utmost to sabotage him—to camouflage a not-so-good reality. After every single trial resulted in nothing because of the islanders’ secret meddling, Jorg’s trip becomes elongated, like The Odyssey’s, forcing him to contemplate the priorities and responsibilities in life again.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2RqX9BLGM76S1Bwks2MZiR0cCsE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:334362'),
  ('1029421231707488089', 'Highwaymen', 2004, 'Action, Thriller, Crime, Horror', 'Robert Harmon, Rene Ohashi, Michael Zenon', 'Craig Mitchell, Hans Bauer', 'Jim Caviezel, Rhona Mitra, Frankie Faison, Colm Feore, Gordon Currie, Andrea Roth, Noam Jenkins, Guylaine St-Onge', 'R', 'James Cray watched as his wife was killed by Fargo, a hit-and-run serial murderer. After severely injuring Fargo and going to prison for several years, James is now determined to avenge his wife''s death. He drives across the country looking for Fargo''s 1972 Cadillac Eldorado, which the now-disabled killer has turned into a rolling death trap. James'' search is helped by a state traffic officer and a singer with her own agenda.', 'James Cray watched as his wife was killed by Fargo, a hit-and-run serial murderer. After severely injuring Fargo and going to prison for several years, James is now determined to avenge his wife''s death. He drives across the country looking for Fargo''s 1972 Cadillac Eldorado, which the now-disabled killer has turned into a rolling death trap. James'' search is helped by a state traffic officer and a singer with her own agenda.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fJb2XlqYSYFA25EMyodon0cBare.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29979'),
  ('625897748788786536', 'Higuita: The Way of the Scorpion', 2023, 'Documentary', 'Luis Ara, Federico Moreira', 'Luis Ara', 'René Higuita', 'R', 'From humble origins to soccer legend, this documentary captures the rise of Colombia’s René Higuita, from iconic career to personal controversies.', 'From humble origins to soccer legend, this documentary captures the rise of Colombia’s René Higuita, from iconic career to personal controversies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oXrlGiQ6ghjN25rMPmlKeGe0gNm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1187872'),
  ('345682918380446175', 'Higurashi: When They Cry - Outbreak', 2013, 'Mystery, Animation, Horror', 'Toshifumi Kawase', null, 'Mika Kanai, Mai Nakahara, Soichiro Hoshi, Yukari Tamura, Satsuki Yukino, Satsuki Yukino, Yui Horie, Rie Tanaka', null, 'Higurashi Outbreak is set in the same Hinamizawa village of the previous stories. The village has been completely sealed off due to a mysterious virus in 1983, and Keiichi Maebara and Rena Ryūgū deal with the outbreak. But this time, they don''t know if its Oyashiro-sama''s curse or a conspiracy. It is also shown that Rika might be infected by the virus. Not much is known about the story yet, but in an interview the makers of the OVA revealed that the ending will differ from the original story.', 'Higurashi Outbreak is set in the same Hinamizawa village of the previous stories. The village has been completely sealed off due to a mysterious virus in 1983, and Keiichi Maebara and Rena Ryūgū deal with the outbreak. But this time, they don''t know if its Oyashiro-sama''s curse or a conspiracy. It is also shown that Rika might be infected by the virus. Not much is known about the story yet, but in an interview the makers of the OVA revealed that the ending will differ from the original story.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gxdbrp9UhXX5SSYvLRfHrDrBzXi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:300442'),
  ('52142157152741939', 'Hijack', 1999, 'Thriller, Action', 'Worth Keeter, Doyle Smith, Franklin A. Vallette', 'Steve Latshaw', 'Jeff Fahey, Ernie Hudson, Beth Toussaint, Brent Huff, Patrick Kilpatrick, Robert Miano, Larry Manetti, Frank McRae', null, 'A prestigious senator and the passengers on board a train are kidnapped by a militia group.', 'A prestigious senator and the passengers on board a train are kidnapped by a militia group.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zNSUyLctq6oOWmwi5tzREHFq5uw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:142583'),
  ('1020073167886724234', 'Hijack ''93', 2024, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Robert Peters', 'Musa Jeffery David', 'Idia Aisien, John Dumelo, Efa Iwara, Sharon Ooja, Jemima Osunde, Nnamdi Agbo, Oluwaseyi Akinsola, Allison Precious Emmanuel', 'PG-13', 'In an effort to dismantle their military-backed government, four men hijack an airplane, leveraging passengers onboard in the name of social change.', 'In an effort to dismantle their military-backed government, four men hijack an airplane, leveraging passengers onboard in the name of social change.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nrwTBMlexcgy11MXRVRz8IZrfTI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1364082'),
  ('1016143151425040736', 'Hijack 1971', 2024, 'Action, Thriller, Crime', 'Kim Sung-han, Lee Hyung-deok, Ryu Si-moon', 'Kim Kyung-chan', 'Ha Jung-woo, Yeo Jin-goo, Sung Dong-il, Chae Soo-bin, Moon You-kang, Kim Sun-young, Lim Se-mi, Kim Dong-wook', null, 'In the year 1971, former Korean Air Force fighter pilot Tae-In (Ha Jung-Woo) works as a pilot for a commercial airline. He faces a crisis inside a hijacked flight with the passengers, including Yong-Dae (Yeo Jin-Goo), and his crew members, including Captain Kyu-Sik (Sung Dong-Il) and Flight Attendant Ok-Soon (Chae Soo-Bin).', 'In the year 1971, former Korean Air Force fighter pilot Tae-In (Ha Jung-Woo) works as a pilot for a commercial airline. He faces a crisis inside a hijacked flight with the passengers, including Yong-Dae (Yeo Jin-Goo), and his crew members, including Captain Kyu-Sik (Sung Dong-Il) and Flight Attendant Ok-Soon (Chae Soo-Bin).', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/68jNkFi61MQjrJEqj2up5wZ4w5R.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1147710'),
