  ('918857008097736984', 'Hijacked: Flight 285', 1996, 'Action, Drama, Crime, Thriller, TV Movie', 'Charles Correll, Vincent Palmo Jr., Bob Lewis', 'David E. Peckinpah', 'Anthony Michael Hall, Ally Sheedy, Perry King, James Brolin, Michael Gross, Casey Sander, Susan Batten, Kyla Pratt', 'NR', 'A convicted murderer is escorted by marshals on a regular flight from Phoenix to Dallas. Shortly after takeoff, two of his aides, traveling as ordinary passengers, take control and free him. He demands $20 million in bonds upon landing. And a sick passenger, bad weather or mechanical problems won''t stop him.', 'A convicted murderer is escorted by marshals on a regular flight from Phoenix to Dallas. Shortly after takeoff, two of his aides, traveling as ordinary passengers, take control and free him. He demands $20 million in bonds upon landing. And a sick passenger, bad weather or mechanical problems won''t stop him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A3KARrKngGKJC9KHAqk1NjLBSLx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:290049'),
