  ('452077805074983259', 'Hikers in Saint-Tropez', 2008, 'Comedy', 'Philippe Harel, Laurent Machuel', 'Eric Assous, Sylvie Bourgeois, Philippe Harel', 'Karin Viard, Benoît Poelvoorde, Vincent Elbaz, Philippe Harel, Cyrielle Clair, Géraldine Pailhas, Alain Guillo, Sacha Bourdo', null, 'Ten years after their disastrous walking holiday in Corsica, four friends – Cora, Nadine, Mathieu and Louis – decide to spend the summer together on the Côte d’Azur. To their surprise, who should they meet in St-Tropez but Eric, the guide-from-Hell who transformed their last holiday into a nightmare and whom they swore never to see again...', 'Ten years after their disastrous walking holiday in Corsica, four friends – Cora, Nadine, Mathieu and Louis – decide to spend the summer together on the Côte d’Azur. To their surprise, who should they meet in St-Tropez but Eric, the guide-from-Hell who transformed their last holiday into a nightmare and whom they swore never to see again...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l8KOvffky8R3PQMBVHEOLMhdDOk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13735'),
