  ('111621759120584618', 'Hillary''s America: The Secret History of the Democratic Party', 2016, 'Documentary', 'Dinesh D''Souza, Bruce Schooley', 'Dinesh D''Souza, Bruce Schooley', 'Dinesh D''Souza, Rebekah Turner, Joel David Taylor, Kenny Gardner, Dean Gosdin, Andrea Cohen, Gidget Taylor, Oscar Avila', 'PG-13', 'Bestselling author and influential filmmaker Dinesh D’Souza reveals the sordid truth about Hillary Clinton and the secret history of the Democratic Party. This important and controversial film releases at a critical time leading up to the 2016 Presidential campaign and challenges the state of American politics.', 'Bestselling author and influential filmmaker Dinesh D’Souza reveals the sordid truth about Hillary Clinton and the secret history of the Democratic Party. This important and controversial film releases at a critical time leading up to the 2016 Presidential campaign and challenges the state of American politics.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wtoAwIm5mZb2MDPBfeOxhjRSXq9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:391995'),
