  ('62795078860871086', 'Hillbillys in a Haunted House', 1967, 'Comedy, Horror, Music', 'Jean Yarbrough, Vaughn Wilkins', 'Duke Yelton', 'Ferlin Husky, Joi Lansing, Don Bowman, John Carradine, Lon Chaney Jr., Linda Ho, Basil Rathbone, Molly Bee', null, 'Country singers on their way to Nashville have car trouble, forcing them to stop at an old haunted mansion. Soon they realize that the house is not only haunted, but is also the headquarters of a ring of international spies after a top secret formula for rocket fuel.', 'Country singers on their way to Nashville have car trouble, forcing them to stop at an old haunted mansion. Soon they realize that the house is not only haunted, but is also the headquarters of a ring of international spies after a top secret formula for rocket fuel.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i2QSsv1DobFwD7V9pwvSzpvHPhd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:99008'),
  ('914942158686742632', 'Hills of Home', 1948, 'Family, Adventure, Action, Drama', 'Fred M. Wilcox, Charles Schoenbaum', 'William Ludwig', 'Edmund Gwenn, Donald Crisp, Tom Drake, Janet Leigh, Rhys Williams, Alan Napier, Reginald Owen, Edmund Breon', 'NR', 'William McClure is the villlage doctor in a remote Scottish glen. Tricked into buying Lassie, a collie afraid of water, he sets about teaching her to swim. At the same time he has the bigger problem that he is getting older and must ensure the glen will have a new local doctor ready.', 'William McClure is the villlage doctor in a remote Scottish glen. Tricked into buying Lassie, a collie afraid of water, he sets about teaching her to swim. At the same time he has the bigger problem that he is getting older and must ensure the glen will have a new local doctor ready.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fz5uSD1bl7Q1uO3HRD5Pca9i2mh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:128854'),
  ('970140886912678771', 'Hillsborough', 1996, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Charles McDougall, Barry Ackroyd', 'Jimmy McGovern', 'Christopher Eccleston, Ricky Tomlinson, Mark Womack, Maurice Roëves, Annabelle Apsion, Rachel Davies, Stephen Walters, Scot Williams', 'PG-13', 'Drama based on the real life events of April 1989, when ninety-six Liverpool supporters were crushed to death during an F.A. Cup Semi-Final match against Nottingham Forest at Sheffield Wednesday''s Hillsborough Stadium. This movie follows three Liverpudlian families before the match, during the tragedy and at the ensuing court battles which tried to decide who was to blame and what went wrong.', 'Drama based on the real life events of April 1989, when ninety-six Liverpool supporters were crushed to death during an F.A. Cup Semi-Final match against Nottingham Forest at Sheffield Wednesday''s Hillsborough Stadium. This movie follows three Liverpudlian families before the match, during the tragedy and at the ensuing court battles which tried to decide who was to blame and what went wrong.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fCODD8f1ODK9lyndI5l7fZwPgua.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42762'),
  ('1103777836721310521', 'Hillside Cannibals', 2006, 'Horror', 'Leigh Scott, Lincoln Lewis, Steven Linnett', 'Steve Bevilacqua', 'Heather Conforto, Tom Nagel, Vaz Andreas, Frank Pacheco, Erica Kessler, Marie Westbrook, Thomas Downey, Crystal Napoles', null, 'A group of teenagers in the desert become the prey of cannibalistic inbreds who live in the nearby hillside.', 'A group of teenagers in the desert become the prey of cannibalistic inbreds who live in the nearby hillside.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nbkhp5aidYJg66ddMeOq4Hwsk5j.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:103433'),
  ('401834948487104469', 'Hilma', 2022, 'Drama, History', 'Lasse Hallström, Sophie Pearson, Ragna Jorming', 'Lasse Hallström', 'Lena Olin, Tora Hallström, Lily Cole, Tom Wlaschiha, Emmi Tjernström, Catherine Chalk, Rebecca Calder, Maeve Dermody', null, 'Hilma af Klint (1862-1944) is an important part of art history and one of the first ever painters of abstract art. However, unlike the work of many of her peers at the time hers was misunderstood and neglected until long after her death. This is a story about Hilma and the circumstances which made her paintings possible. The film picks up during her early life and ends today; when her art connects with people of all religions and cultures. Just as she intended.', 'Hilma af Klint (1862-1944) is an important part of art history and one of the first ever painters of abstract art. However, unlike the work of many of her peers at the time hers was misunderstood and neglected until long after her death. This is a story about Hilma and the circumstances which made her paintings possible. The film picks up during her early life and ends today; when her art connects with people of all religions and cultures. Just as she intended.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1DG8gAw3ghKy1QhM7O55wbD7XDI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:827991'),
  ('104471670078290594', 'Him', 2021, 'Drama', 'Guillaume Canet, André Chemetoff', 'Guillaume Canet', 'Guillaume Canet, Virginie Efira, Mathieu Kassovitz, Laetitia Casta, Nathalie Baye, Patrick Chesnais, Gilles Cohen, Clive Owen', null, 'Lacking inspiration, a composer isolates himself at a desolate house, on a small island, in Brittany. There he finds an old piano and receives visits from people who won''t let him rest.', 'Lacking inspiration, a composer isolates himself at a desolate house, on a small island, in Brittany. There he finds an old piano and receives visits from people who won''t let him rest.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/73hv4MR4LZSWD2nM0qfjG7Z2rvD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:752070'),
  ('891426658086259930', 'HIM', 2025, 'Horror, Mystery', 'Justin Tipping, Kira Kelly, Tyler Standen', 'Zack Akers, Skip Bronkie, Justin Tipping', 'Marlon Wayans, Tyriq Withers, Julia Fox, Tim Heidecker, Jim Jefferies, Maurice Greene, Indira G. Wilson, Geron McKinley', 'R', 'After suffering a potentially career-ending brain trauma, Cameron Cade receives a lifeline when his hero, legendary eight-time Championship quarterback and cultural megastar Isaiah White, offers to train Cam at Isaiah''s isolated compound that he shares with his celebrity influencer wife. But as Cam''s training accelerates, Isaiah''s charisma begins to curdle into something darker.', 'After suffering a potentially career-ending brain trauma, Cameron Cade receives a lifeline when his hero, legendary eight-time Championship quarterback and cultural megastar Isaiah White, offers to train Cam at Isaiah''s isolated compound that he shares with his celebrity influencer wife. But as Cam''s training accelerates, Isaiah''s charisma begins to curdle into something darker.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qPJzcYR2f1O1uynYBCVPPJuOiAH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:986097'),
  ('813289805433241501', 'HIM: Beyond the Light', 2010, 'Drama', 'Frank Darier-Baziere, Lars Herrmann', 'Frank Darier-Baziere', 'Guillermo Larrea, Marcela Ruiz Esparza, Nando Estevane, Montserrat de León, Eugenio Castillo, Magda Vizcaíno', null, 'Nathan is a very gifted Mexican scientist specializing in cellular biology. He is a very withdrawn man, good, solitary and helpful, who has a secret passion for Maya, one of his colleagues at work. But soon their lives are shaken by an encounter with Jacques, a man with supernatural powers.', 'Nathan is a very gifted Mexican scientist specializing in cellular biology. He is a very withdrawn man, good, solitary and helpful, who has a secret passion for Maya, one of his colleagues at work. But soon their lives are shaken by an encounter with Jacques, a man with supernatural powers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/99l43DXjpCgqFmgetmDKeG75pvv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:59254'),
  ('532604069237641465', 'Himalaya', 1999, 'Adventure, Drama', 'Eric Valli, Éric Guichard, Jean-Paul Meurisse', 'Nathalie Azoulai, Olivier Dazat, Eric Valli', 'Thilen Lhondup, Gurgon Kyap, Lhakpa Tsamchoe, Karma Tensing, Karma Wangel, Labrang Tundup, Jampa Kalsang Tamang, Tsering Dorjee', null, 'As the denizens of a Tibetan village prepare for their arduous annual trek to exchange salt for grain, the community''s allegiances are split between aging chieftain Tinle (Thilen Lhondup) and rebellious young Karma (Gurgon Kyap). Tinle tries to maintain his clout and preserve obedience to ancient customs when Karma challenges the old man''s power.', 'As the denizens of a Tibetan village prepare for their arduous annual trek to exchange salt for grain, the community''s allegiances are split between aging chieftain Tinle (Thilen Lhondup) and rebellious young Karma (Gurgon Kyap). Tinle tries to maintain his clout and preserve obedience to ancient customs when Karma challenges the old man''s power.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zppCfYBl0kRTpD9T0KTlZG5ZpWw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26813'),
  ('1097796144506922773', 'Himeanole', 2016, 'Mystery, Drama', 'Takayuki Shida, Keisuke Yoshida, Maya Ayabe', 'Keisuke Yoshida', 'Gaku Hamada, Aimi Satsukawa, Go Morita, Tsuyoshi Muro, Ryusuke Komakine, Maho Yamada, Makoto Ôtake, Eishin', null, 'An ordinary man plays matchmaker to his friend only to realize the girl being pursued is being stalked.', 'An ordinary man plays matchmaker to his friend only to realize the girl being pursued is being stalked.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gPxELHu6pigRe2Ebvo8QaB7qkne.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:394448'),
  ('839499092816069021', 'Himiko', 1974, 'Drama, History', 'Akiyoshi Kanda, Tooru Fujita, Hidehiro Yamamoto', 'Taeko Tomioka, Masahiro Shinoda', 'Shima Iwashita, Masao Kusakari, Rentaro Mikuni, Rie Yokoyama, Jun Hamamura, Tatsumi Hijikata, Yoshi Katō, Chōichirō Kawarasaki', null, 'The myth of the Sun Goddess who founded Japanese society is seen through the lens of a modern view of history.', 'The myth of the Sun Goddess who founded Japanese society is seen through the lens of a modern view of history.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nVuX6Kk5qf0AJfnA9M1tC4He2O.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:86520'),
  ('528477038567796043', 'Himizu', 2012, 'Crime, Drama', 'Sion Sono, Sohei Tanikawa, Go KINOMOTO', 'Sion Sono', 'Shota Sometani, Fumi Nikaido, Tetsu Watanabe, Ken Mitsuishi, Denden, Tarō Suwa, Hidetoshi Kawaya, Mitsuru Fukikoshi', null, 'Two 14-year-olds from troubled, abusive homes come together sharing misery and pain. In the aftermath of an earthquake, the classmates learn how to survive while relying on one another for emotional and physical support.', 'Two 14-year-olds from troubled, abusive homes come together sharing misery and pain. In the aftermath of an earthquake, the classmates learn how to survive while relying on one another for emotional and physical support.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s6T399aAmPNQEK8Uf4MImlQdiil.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:98631'),
  ('917803258634763614', 'Himmatwala', 2013, 'Action, Comedy, Drama', 'Sajid Khan, Anshai Lal, Ameet Dhanwani', 'Sajid Khan', 'Ajay Devgn, Tamannaah Bhatia, Mahesh Manjrekar, Adhyayan Suman, Zarina Wahab, Leena Jumani, Anil Dhawan, Riteish Deshmukh', 'NR', 'When a temple priest commits suicide after being dishonored by an evil landlord, his son returns to his native village on a mission of vengeance.', 'When a temple priest commits suicide after being dishonored by an evil landlord, his son returns to his native village on a mission of vengeance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rWuzBNbsNc0DPFoWBb9FlKwWt7f.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:180680'),
  ('417571030464891550', 'Hindenburg Disaster Newsreel Footage', 1937, 'Documentary', null, null, 'Herbert Morrison, Graham McNamee', null, 'The airship Hindenburg, arriving from Europe, was being led to its mooring at Lakehurst, New Jersey when suddenly disaster struck. The hydrogen-filled zeppelin ignited, and was almost instantly transformed into an enormous fireball. In less than a minute, the entire ship had been consumed by flames. The Hindenburg explosion marked the end of the budding airship travel industry.', 'The airship Hindenburg, arriving from Europe, was being led to its mooring at Lakehurst, New Jersey when suddenly disaster struck. The hydrogen-filled zeppelin ignited, and was almost instantly transformed into an enormous fireball. In less than a minute, the entire ship had been consumed by flames. The Hindenburg explosion marked the end of the budding airship travel industry.', null, 'tmdb:movie:146829'),
  ('309320148518142454', 'Hindi Medium', 2017, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Saket Chaudhary, Laxman Utekar', 'Zeenat Lakhani, Saket Chaudhary', 'Irrfan Khan, Saba Qamar, Sanjana Sanghi, Deepak Dobriyal, Mallika Dua, Tillotama Shome, Amrita Singh, Delzad Hiwale', 'NR', 'Mita and Raj Batra, an affluent couple from Delhi’s Chandni Chowk, are grappling with getting their daughter admission into an English medium school. But there is one big problem. Their zubaan is Hindi, and the elitist snobs won’t let the Hindi speaking hoi-polloi fit in.', 'Mita and Raj Batra, an affluent couple from Delhi’s Chandni Chowk, are grappling with getting their daughter admission into an English medium school. But there is one big problem. Their zubaan is Hindi, and the elitist snobs won’t let the Hindi speaking hoi-polloi fit in.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2v0nQd3kYBV0iPNCVHiaLWGb1hg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:456570'),
  ('140104503433490861', 'Hindsight', 2011, 'Action, Drama, Romance', 'Lee Hyun-seung, Kim Byung-seo, Shin Kyung-man', 'Lee Hyun-seung', 'Song Kang-ho, Shin Sae-kyeong, Chun Jung-myung, Lee Jong-hyuk, Kim Min-jun, Youn Yuh-jung, Esom, Jang Young-nam', null, 'A young assassin is sent to kill a retired mob boss. But things get complicated when she begins to like him.', 'A young assassin is sent to kill a retired mob boss. But things get complicated when she begins to like him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uzotD4t8W14mEsRZlcJ1X2x6fPb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:81460'),
  ('335247728926908639', 'Hinokio: Inter Galactic Love', 2005, 'Drama, Science Fiction', 'Takahiko Akiyama', 'Shouji Yonemura, Masumi Suetanii', 'Kanata Hongo, Mikako Tabe, Masatoshi Nakamura, Maki Horikita, Ryoko Kobayashi, Yuta Murakami, Ryo Kato, Sachie Hara', null, 'Satoru, a wheelchair-bound elementary student, locks himself away from the outside world after his mother dies. His father designs a remote-controlled robot to go to school for him, allowing him to interact with people and do normal things.', 'Satoru, a wheelchair-bound elementary student, locks himself away from the outside world after his mother dies. His father designs a remote-controlled robot to go to school for him, allowing him to interact with people and do normal things.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yG3ilaRNMJj6CI6ljDPpJvJANXY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15622'),
  ('1095250758088710623', 'Hint of Love', 2020, 'Romance, Comedy, TV Movie', 'Geoff Wallace, Joe Gold, Topher Mann', 'John Dion', 'Debs Howard, Dennis Andres, Matthew James Dowden, Aadila Dosani, Edwin Perez, Matteo Bolognese, Nils Hognestad, Todd Matthews', null, 'A cookbook literary agent with culinary training is tasked with helping elevate the brand of a food channel personality known for his convenience-oriented recipes. However, as the agent works with her client on a new cookbook, playfully clashing over everything from ingredients to tastes, she must choose between following the directions or her heart.', 'A cookbook literary agent with culinary training is tasked with helping elevate the brand of a food channel personality known for his convenience-oriented recipes. However, as the agent works with her client on a new cookbook, playfully clashing over everything from ingredients to tastes, she must choose between following the directions or her heart.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/44dqPXO7HWMjReXSZ4ERhqcBhn3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:725989'),
  ('172976693298028681', 'Hinterholz 8', 1998, 'Comedy', 'Walter Kindler, Harald Sicheritz', 'Harald Sicheritz, Roland Düringer', 'Roland Düringer, Nina Proll, Rudolf Rohaczek, Wolfgang Böck, Reinhard Nowak, Lukas Resetarits, Herwig Seeböck, I Stangl', null, 'Herbert Krcal (Roland Düringer) and his wife Margit (Nina Proll) dream of owning a home. They prefer to do this in the "Blue Lagoon", a prefabricated house park in the south of Vienna, where they regularly go on pilgrimage with their son Philipp. Just as regularly, they have to recognize the bitter truth that they cannot actually afford the dream house they have visited.', 'Herbert Krcal (Roland Düringer) and his wife Margit (Nina Proll) dream of owning a home. They prefer to do this in the "Blue Lagoon", a prefabricated house park in the south of Vienna, where they regularly go on pilgrimage with their son Philipp. Just as regularly, they have to recognize the bitter truth that they cannot actually afford the dream house they have visited.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2mXXl6PLpDHKsTrp59V0eQpz8GQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38005'),
  ('200730035192689458', 'Hinterland', 2021, 'Thriller, Drama, History', 'Stefan Ruzowitzky, Markus Gasser, Julia Schmachtel', 'Robert Buchschwenter, Stefan Ruzowitzky, Hanno Pinter', 'Murathan Muslu, Liv Lisa Fries, Max von der Groeben, Marc Limpach, Matthias Schweighöfer, Margarethe Tiesel, Maximilien Jadin, Aaron Friesz', null, 'Vienna, 1920. The Austro-Hungarian Empire has collapsed. Peter Perg returns home from the Great War, after years of captivity. But the Vienna he comes home to is nothing like the place he once knew. The new Austrian Republic thrives on social and artistic freedom, but anti-democratic movements and unemployment loom overhead. A stranger in his hometown, his life takes a turn for the worse when one of his former comrades is murdered. Suddenly the mysterious killings of veterans are mounting. Personally connected to the victims, Perg decides to bring the killer to justice. He finds an ally in the cool-headed forensic doctor Theresa Körner, with whom he has a deeper, shared history. Their investigation leads them into the darkest corners of the city, as they confront a brutal and systematic killer and intrigues from within the police force. But when the killer’s net closes around Perg himself, he faces the moral dilemma of his life.', 'Vienna, 1920. The Austro-Hungarian Empire has collapsed. Peter Perg returns home from the Great War, after years of captivity. But the Vienna he comes home to is nothing like the place he once knew. The new Austrian Republic thrives on social and artistic freedom, but anti-democratic movements and unemployment loom overhead. A stranger in his hometown, his life takes a turn for the worse when one of his former comrades is murdered. Suddenly the mysterious killings of veterans are mounting. Personally connected to the victims, Perg decides to bring the killer to justice. He finds an ally in the cool-headed forensic doctor Theresa Körner, with whom he has a deeper, shared history. Their investigation leads them into the darkest corners of the city, as they confront a brutal and systematic killer and intrigues from within the police force. But when the killer’s net closes around Perg himself, he faces the moral dilemma of his life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zaA5ql3oI0ZImO57QP1I1sqbqaV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:843338'),
  ('179799341180044241', 'Hip Hip-Hurry!', 1958, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Chuck Jones', null, null, null, 'Wile E. Coyote is once again after the Road Runner, this time resorting to hand grenades, dynamite, falling rocks and a speed potion (which contains vitamins R, P and M).', 'Wile E. Coyote is once again after the Road Runner, this time resorting to hand grenades, dynamite, falling rocks and a speed potion (which contains vitamins R, P and M).', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cisrHkmvQUk91KEMyKMPj9lZZwA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:234981'),
  ('837595442903592277', 'Hipnos', 2004, 'Horror, Thriller', 'David Carreras, Xavi Giménez', 'Juan María Ruiz Córdoba, David Carreras', 'Cristina Brondo, Demián Bichir, Marisol Membrillo, Julián Villagrán, Féodor Atkine, Natalia Sánchez, Marisa Duaso, Beatriz Escalas', null, 'Dr Sánchez Blanch owns and operates a psychiatric hospital where he specializes in hypnotizing his severely emotionally disturbed patients.', 'Dr Sánchez Blanch owns and operates a psychiatric hospital where he specializes in hypnotizing his severely emotionally disturbed patients.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/inrappFLgBO81u1pMb2P8EK6DJr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19936'),
  ('69233136425604569', 'Hippety Hopper', 1949, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Robert McKimson', null, 'Mel Blanc', null, 'A mouse is saved from committing suicide by a baby kangaroo, Hippety Hopper, who he frees from a crate on the docks. His new friend, who looks like a "king-sized mouse," then helps him get revenge on Sylvester the cat.', 'A mouse is saved from committing suicide by a baby kangaroo, Hippety Hopper, who he frees from a crate on the docks. His new friend, who looks like a "king-sized mouse," then helps him get revenge on Sylvester the cat.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bgi3cLnnMZDEA8VC3Gixkh4NPer.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:222034'),
  ('1056482220445235486', 'Hippocrates', 2014, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Thomas Lilti, Nicolas Gaurin', 'Shérazade Khalladi, Baya Kasmi, Pierre Chosson', 'Vincent Lacoste, Reda Kateb, Jacques Gamblin, Marianne Denicourt, Félix Moati, Carole Franck, Philippe Rebbot, Julie Brochen', null, 'Benjamin is meant to be a great doctor, he’s certain of it. But his first experience as a junior doctor in the hospital ward where his father works doesn’t turn out the way he hoped it would. Responsibility is overwhelming, his father is all but present, and his co-junior partner, a foreign doctor, is far more experimented than he is. This internship will force Benjamin to confront his limits… and start his way to adulthood.', 'Benjamin is meant to be a great doctor, he’s certain of it. But his first experience as a junior doctor in the hospital ward where his father works doesn’t turn out the way he hoped it would. Responsibility is overwhelming, his father is all but present, and his co-junior partner, a foreign doctor, is far more experimented than he is. This internship will force Benjamin to confront his limits… and start his way to adulthood.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qOwNCoSG0Kxwj13IboP4lNOJkpD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:271724'),
  ('172673331257840911', 'Hippopotamus', 2018, 'Horror, Drama, Thriller', 'Edward A Palmer', 'Edward A Palmer', 'Ingvild Deila, Stuart Mortimer, Tom Lincoln', null, 'Ruby wakes from a bad dream to find herself in a real life nightmare. She''s trapped in a basement, her legs are broken and she can''t remember who she is or how she got there. Her kidnapper, Tom, tells her she will remain captive until she falls in love with him. Ruby is focused on trying to escape until Tom starts helping her to remember her past and she begins to question everything.', 'Ruby wakes from a bad dream to find herself in a real life nightmare. She''s trapped in a basement, her legs are broken and she can''t remember who she is or how she got there. Her kidnapper, Tom, tells her she will remain captive until she falls in love with him. Ruby is focused on trying to escape until Tom starts helping her to remember her past and she begins to question everything.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yFXyiBp3SVxu3U9SYpbZxvjgFfX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:516027'),
  ('551371692717539989', 'Hipsters', 2008, 'Drama, Romance', 'Valery Todorovsky, Roman Vasyanov, Sergey Chuprov', 'Yuri Korotkov, Valery Todorovsky, Evgeniy Margulis', 'Anton Shagin, Oksana Akinshina, Maksim Matveev, Igor Voynarovskiy, Ekaterina Vilkova, Konstantin Balakirev, Oleg Yankovskiy, Lyudmila Solovyova', null, 'In this hit Russian musical, a group of friends flaunts Soviet authority in 1950s Moscow by embracing jazz. When Communist Mels falls for Polly, a free-spirited jazz fan, he risks losing his party membership by associating with her rebellious crew.', 'In this hit Russian musical, a group of friends flaunts Soviet authority in 1950s Moscow by embracing jazz. When Communist Mels falls for Polly, a free-spirited jazz fan, he risks losing his party membership by associating with her rebellious crew.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ongsJQScENi8QPrt8hXIjh0PKR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38336'),
  ('1026828516684627819', 'Hirano and Kagiura', 2023, 'Animation', null, null, 'Yoshitsugu Matsuoka, Nobunaga Shimazaki', null, 'The diligent high school freshman Akira Kagiura and his senior Taiga Hirano have been roommates for half a year. Kagiura used to be anxious about his future dormitory life, but thanks to his energetic senior looking out for him, he has come to feel content and at ease. As he continues to rely on Hirano more and more each day, he develops strong feelings for his selfless friend. In the six months they have left as roommates, Kagiura is determined to put a name to the relationship he cherishes so dearly before it comes to an end.', 'The diligent high school freshman Akira Kagiura and his senior Taiga Hirano have been roommates for half a year. Kagiura used to be anxious about his future dormitory life, but thanks to his energetic senior looking out for him, he has come to feel content and at ease. As he continues to rely on Hirano more and more each day, he develops strong feelings for his selfless friend. In the six months they have left as roommates, Kagiura is determined to put a name to the relationship he cherishes so dearly before it comes to an end.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dbgRc2vtKqOf0IpzvtAoovClFAU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1071639'),
  ('6595847756962634', 'Hired to Kill', 1990, 'Action, Thriller', 'Nico Mastorakis, Andreas Bellis, Peter Rader', 'Fred C. Perry, Kirk Ellis, Nico Mastorakis', 'Brian Thompson, Oliver Reed, George Kennedy, José Ferrer, Michelle Moffett, Barbara Niven, Penelope Reed, Jordana Capra', 'R', 'A fashion photographer and seven models travel to a South American island fortress, ostensibly to do a fashion shoot. In reality, the photographer is a mercenary and their job is to free an imprisoned rebel leader', 'A fashion photographer and seven models travel to a South American island fortress, ostensibly to do a fashion shoot. In reality, the photographer is a mercenary and their job is to free an imprisoned rebel leader', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/shK0x8Eq4bPO12SDEIIAkFNrGrf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:96635'),
  ('768373742474292136', 'Hirngespinster', 2014, 'Drama', 'Christian Bach, Hans Fromm', 'Christian Bach', 'Tobias Moretti, Johannes Silberschneider, Jonas Nay, Stefan Hunstein, Stephanie Japp, Ella Frey, Hanna Plaß, Michael Kranz', null, 'Simon falls head over heels in love with pretty and quick-witted Verena. When his father, who suffers from schizophrenia, has a relapse, Simon devotes himself completely to his mother and little sister and endangers his budding romance. Maneuvering himself into a near-fatal situation, Simon realizes that he cannot change the others'' lives, but only his own.', 'Simon falls head over heels in love with pretty and quick-witted Verena. When his father, who suffers from schizophrenia, has a relapse, Simon devotes himself completely to his mother and little sister and endangers his budding romance. Maneuvering himself into a near-fatal situation, Simon realizes that he cannot change the others'' lives, but only his own.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qQw4XxK5jcq6QKEecHkGUgb2IKN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:293303'),
  ('1108949732269322410', 'Hiroshima', 1953, 'Drama, History', 'Kei Kumai, Hideo Sekigawa, Shunichirō Nakao', 'Yasutaro Yagi', 'Isuzu Yamada, Eiji Okada, Yoshi Katō, Yumeji Tsukioka, Masaya Tsukida, Yasumi Hara, Shizue Kawarazaki, Hatae Kishi', null, 'Historical fiction about the aftermath of the atomic bombing of Hiroshima, Japan, on 6 August 1945, and its effects on various civilians, especially children, of that city.', 'Historical fiction about the aftermath of the atomic bombing of Hiroshima, Japan, on 6 August 1945, and its effects on various civilians, especially children, of that city.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cOXoD7BN4R8J8VB4AxcXYcspd4G.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:273433'),
  ('1127587067765158870', 'Hiroshima', 2005, 'Documentary, Drama, War, History', 'Paul Wilmshurst, Graham Smith, Weronika Migoń', 'Paul Wilmshurst', 'John Hurt, Shuntaro Hida, Robert Austin, George Anton, George Elsey, Paul Tibbets, Theodore "Dutch" Van Kirk, Akiko Takakura', null, 'The documentary recounts the world''s first nuclear attack and examines the alarming repercussions. Covering a three-week period from the Trinity test to the atomic bombing of Hiroshima, the program chronicles America''s political gamble and the planning for the momentous event. Archival film, dramatizations, and special effects feature what occurred aboard the Enola Gay (the aircraft that dropped the bomb) and inside the exploding bomb.', 'The documentary recounts the world''s first nuclear attack and examines the alarming repercussions. Covering a three-week period from the Trinity test to the atomic bombing of Hiroshima, the program chronicles America''s political gamble and the planning for the momentous event. Archival film, dramatizations, and special effects feature what occurred aboard the Enola Gay (the aircraft that dropped the bomb) and inside the exploding bomb.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jHIyA9zRm6nEo4P8pYwTa3zCsJt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:68297'),
  ('933620980024132160', 'Hirttämättömät', 1971, 'Comedy, Western', 'Kari Sohlberg, Vesa-Matti Loiri, Spede Pasanen', 'Spede Pasanen', 'Vesa-Matti Loiri, Simo Salminen, Spede Pasanen, Pirjo Laitila, Evita Wager, Heli Lehtonen, Olavi Ahonen, Jaakko Talaskivi', null, 'Two outlaws, The Lonely Rider and the Indian Tonto, have caught (at least they think they have) Speedy Gonzales, a ruthless gunfighter from the town of Njietponimaistadi. They start to travel to another town for the reward, through the desert without water and fighting against Indians. And just to find out that they have made a full circle back to origin.', 'Two outlaws, The Lonely Rider and the Indian Tonto, have caught (at least they think they have) Speedy Gonzales, a ruthless gunfighter from the town of Njietponimaistadi. They start to travel to another town for the reward, through the desert without water and fighting against Indians. And just to find out that they have made a full circle back to origin.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qghSdZ1eYoPABLgKLdiVe2KvUcD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:223192'),
  ('510928787942222705', 'Hirugao', 2017, 'Drama, Romance', 'Hiroshi Nishitani, Tomokazu Naruse, Hideo Yamamoto', 'Yumiko Inoue', 'Aya Ueto, Takumi Saitoh, Ayumi Ito, Hiroyuki Hirayama, Asuka Kurosawa, Minori Hagiwara, Kotaro Shiga, Masaki Miura', null, 'Set 3 years after the drama series. Kitano Yuichiro comes to give a lecture in the town where divorcee Sasamoto Sawa now lives quietly. The two meet again and their love story continue.', 'Set 3 years after the drama series. Kitano Yuichiro comes to give a lecture in the town where divorcee Sasamoto Sawa now lives quietly. The two meet again and their love story continue.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2P8RRz5wA3hCEaKcTL4pdDZAt2E.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:459592'),
  ('681001635115702798', 'Hiruko the Goblin', 1991, 'Horror, Fantasy, Comedy', 'Shinya Tsukamoto, Shigeru Sakurada, Kenjiro Konaka', 'Daijirô Morohoshi', 'Kenji Sawada, Naoto Takenaka, Megumi Ueno, Masaki Kudou, Hideo Murota, Kimiko Yo, Ken Mitsuishi, Bang-ho Cho', null, 'A school was built on one of the Gates of Hell, behind which hordes of demons await the moment they will be free to roam the Earth. Hiruko is a goblin sent to Earth on a reconnaissance mission. He beheads students in order to assemble their heads on the demons'' spider-like bodies. Hieda, an archaeology professor, and Masao, a haunted student, investigate the gory deaths.', 'A school was built on one of the Gates of Hell, behind which hordes of demons await the moment they will be free to roam the Earth. Hiruko is a goblin sent to Earth on a reconnaissance mission. He beheads students in order to assemble their heads on the demons'' spider-like bodies. Hieda, an archaeology professor, and Masao, a haunted student, investigate the gory deaths.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/59D3kAu88UHbBRiOUSoFEx07Qtc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38405'),
  ('423124779358449564', 'His', 2020, 'Drama, Romance', 'Rikiya Imaizumi, Masami Inomoto, Yoshikazu Iki', 'Atsushi Asada', 'Hio Miyazawa, Kisetsu Fujiwara, Wakana Matsumoto, Honoka Matsumoto, Sotomura Sakura, Kumi Nakamura, Keiichi Suzuki, Toshie Negishi', 'NR', 'Shun and Nagisa first meet and fall in love during their first year of high school. While Shun is graduating from university, Nagisa tells him that he doesn''t see a future for them. Despite Shun''s strong feelings, they go their separate ways. Years later, Shun is now a store owner, living alone in a rural area. Out of the blue, Nagisa arrives with his six-year-old daughter, Sora. Spending time together, Shun realizes he still harbors feelings for Nagisa. Can Nagisa reconcile with his feelings for Shun, which have been there all along?', 'Shun and Nagisa first meet and fall in love during their first year of high school. While Shun is graduating from university, Nagisa tells him that he doesn''t see a future for them. Despite Shun''s strong feelings, they go their separate ways. Years later, Shun is now a store owner, living alone in a rural area. Out of the blue, Nagisa arrives with his six-year-old daughter, Sora. Spending time together, Shun realizes he still harbors feelings for Nagisa. Can Nagisa reconcile with his feelings for Shun, which have been there all along?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ePBDOSLQ26voWspjWoDn1GuhiU8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:663105'),
  ('456580901818896533', 'His Brother', 2003, 'Drama', 'Patrice Chéreau, Éric Gautier, Guillaume Bonnier', 'Patrice Chéreau, Anne-Louise Trividic', 'Bruno Todeschini, Éric Caravaca, Nathalie Boutefeu, Sylvain Jacques, Maurice Garrel, Catherine Ferran, Antoinette Moya, Fred Ulysse', null, 'After years of estrangement due to difficulties accepting his brother''s sexuality, a man diagnosed with a terminal illness decides to reconnect. As the brothers grow closer, their renewed bond starts to alienate their partners, leading to emotional turmoil and strained relationships.', 'After years of estrangement due to difficulties accepting his brother''s sexuality, a man diagnosed with a terminal illness decides to reconnect. As the brothers grow closer, their renewed bond starts to alienate their partners, leading to emotional turmoil and strained relationships.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pTBeS1PLFSRavsg3wMsYDLxxBHU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:78208'),
  ('945159587132977022', 'His Days Are Numbered', 1962, 'Drama', 'Elio Petri, Berto Pelosso, Ennio Guarnieri', 'Tonino Guerra, Carlo Romano, Elio Petri', 'Salvo Randone, Franco Sportelli, Regina Bianchi, Marcella Valeri, Angela Minervini, Renato Maddalena, Alberto Amato, Giulio Battiferri', null, 'A middle-aged plumber quits his job and questions his life after seeing somebody his own age suddenly die from a heart attack on his way to work.', 'A middle-aged plumber quits his job and questions his life after seeing somebody his own age suddenly die from a heart attack on his way to work.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6C97icuaWa5tnRAOzTJtMhCuarh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:62243'),
  ('369980848444026675', 'His Double Life', 1933, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Arthur Hopkins, Arthur Edeson', 'Arthur Hopkins, Clara Beranger', 'Roland Young, Lillian Gish, Montagu Love, Lumsden Hare, Lucy Beaumont, Charles Richman, Oliver Smith, Philip Tonge', 'NR', 'Priam Farrel is a celebrated artist but a social recluse. When his valet dies of a sudden illness, a mix-up leads to the body being identified as Farrel''s. The timid artist then assumes the identity of his former servant, but finds himself faced with constant dilemmas as a result.', 'Priam Farrel is a celebrated artist but a social recluse. When his valet dies of a sudden illness, a mix-up leads to the body being identified as Farrel''s. The timid artist then assumes the identity of his former servant, but finds himself faced with constant dilemmas as a result.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gQRnKrntsmxFYImfL1aZpJdeF1x.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:164418'),
  ('306484322812501152', 'His Girl Friday', 1940, 'Comedy, Romance, Drama', 'Howard Hawks, Joseph Walker, Cliff P. Broughton', 'Charles Lederer, Ben Hecht', 'Cary Grant, Rosalind Russell, Ralph Bellamy, Gene Lockhart, Porter Hall, Ernest Truex, Cliff Edwards, Clarence Kolb', 'NR', 'Walter Burns is an irresistibly conniving newspaper publisher desperate to woo back his paper’s star reporter, who also happens to be his estranged wife. She’s threatening to quit and settle down with a new beau, but, as Walter knows, she has a weakness: she can’t resist a juicy scoop.', 'Walter Burns is an irresistibly conniving newspaper publisher desperate to woo back his paper’s star reporter, who also happens to be his estranged wife. She’s threatening to quit and settle down with a new beau, but, as Walter knows, she has a weakness: she can’t resist a juicy scoop.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lu86Y9zTPH3neCiUzLzHCEFHf7f.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:3085'),
  ('956598851151625244', 'His Girlfriend', 2015, 'Drama, Romance', 'Chihiro Ikeda', 'Kiyoto Wada', 'Jun Shison, Kyoko Yoshine, Riria Kojima, Kaho Mizutani, Junki Tozuka', null, 'Teen romance is complicated for a boy who''s secretly in love with a college girl but who''s also captured the heart of a high school freshman.', 'Teen romance is complicated for a boy who''s secretly in love with a college girl but who''s also captured the heart of a high school freshman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/48jtJDEKIbfgnGNd0UIrgchv3of.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:391004'),
  ('395462619353213030', 'His Highness Abdullah', 1990, 'Drama, Music', 'Sibi Malayil', 'A K Lohithadas', 'Mohanlal, Nedumudi Venu, Gautami Tadimalla, Mamukkoya, Kaviyoor Ponnamma, Thikkurissy Sukumaran Nair, Kaithapram Damodaran, Kunchan', null, 'The story follows Abdullah (Mohanlal) who is hired by the members of a wealthy royal family to assassinate the family head Maharaja Udayavarma (Nedumudi Venu). Abdullah comes into the royal palace under the disguise Ananthan Namboothiri, a classical singer, and tries to use this mask to softly kill the Maharaja.', 'The story follows Abdullah (Mohanlal) who is hired by the members of a wealthy royal family to assassinate the family head Maharaja Udayavarma (Nedumudi Venu). Abdullah comes into the royal palace under the disguise Ananthan Namboothiri, a classical singer, and tries to use this mask to softly kill the Maharaja.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tpLfoYFKW6qkCXARGh5G4qREFKF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:251218'),
  ('933399707936363479', 'His Highness Hanafy', 1990, 'Crime, Comedy, Thriller', 'Mohamed Abdelaziz, Emad Abdel Azim, Mohsen Nasr', 'Basyouni Othman', 'Adel Emam, Huda Ramzi, Farouq Al Fishawy, Ola Rami, Magdy Wahba, Ragaa Al-Giddawy, Youssef Daoud, Hendeya', null, 'Hanafi al''abiha steals a jewelry shop with his partners and hides the bag with his brother Ahmad before they were arrested. His three accomplices escape and kidnap Ahmed''s wife Duaa until they recover the bag. Hanafi is temporarily released to lead the Police to the place of his colleagues, and the events follow.', 'Hanafi al''abiha steals a jewelry shop with his partners and hides the bag with his brother Ahmad before they were arrested. His three accomplices escape and kidnap Ahmed''s wife Duaa until they recover the bag. Hanafi is temporarily released to lead the Police to the place of his colleagues, and the events follow.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2N0NG2oLpdmFLnPyOOHEbtFnlQq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:86602'),
  ('815484614373257412', 'His House', 2020, 'Horror, Drama', 'Alden Dalia, Sara Harrak, Emily Woodward', 'Remi Weekes', 'Ṣọpẹ́ Dìrísù, Wunmi Mosaku, Malaika Wakoli-Abigaba, Matt Smith, Javier Botet, Yvonne Campbell, Vivienne Soan, Lola May', 'NR', 'After making a harrowing escape from war-torn South Sudan, a young refugee couple struggle to adjust to their new life in a small English town that has an unspeakable evil lurking beneath the surface.', 'After making a harrowing escape from war-torn South Sudan, a young refugee couple struggle to adjust to their new life in a small English town that has an unspeakable evil lurking beneath the surface.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mM1ELeOF4qmdIFbZh9VSBn685g.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:575774'),
  ('903815490425612286', 'His Kind of Woman', 1951, 'Crime, Comedy, Thriller', 'John Farrow, Harry J. Wild, C. Bakaleinikoff', 'Frank Fenton, Jack Leonard', 'Robert Mitchum, Jane Russell, Vincent Price, Tim Holt, Charles McGraw, Marjorie Reynolds, Raymond Burr, Leslie Banning', 'NR', 'Career gambler Dan Milner agrees to a $50,000 deal to leave the USA for Mexico, only to find himself entangled with fellow guests at a luxurious resort and suspecting that the man who hired him may be the deported crime boss Nick Ferraro aiming to re-enter to the USA.', 'Career gambler Dan Milner agrees to a $50,000 deal to leave the USA for Mexico, only to find himself entangled with fellow guests at a luxurious resort and suspecting that the man who hired him may be the deported crime boss Nick Ferraro aiming to re-enter to the USA.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mB5vCfHE7ootyK96F3IVhLSaJzP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33673'),
  ('258180658368885149', 'His Majesty Minor', 2007, 'Fantasy', 'Jean-Jacques Annaud, Jean-Marie Dreujou', 'Jean-Jacques Annaud, Gérard Brach', 'José Garcia, Vincent Cassel, Sergio Peris-Mencheta, Mélanie Bernier, Claude Brasseur, Rufus, Jean-Luc Bideau, Marc Andréoni', null, 'In this offbeat comedy, a man raised by a pig dies and is resurrected with a newfound power of speech, elevating his stature among his fellow humans.', 'In this offbeat comedy, a man raised by a pig dies and is resurrected with a newfound power of speech, elevating his stature among his fellow humans.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cWmWTYkMCt7BSSOmgPUTt3HfScS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40181'),
  ('476181528133856136', 'His Majesty O''Keefe', 1954, 'Action, Adventure, Drama, Romance', 'Byron Haskin, Otto Heller, Richard McWhorter', 'Borden Chase, James Hill', 'Burt Lancaster, Joan Rice, André Morell, Abraham Sofaer, Archie Savage, Benson Fong, Tessa Prendergast, Lloyd Berrell', 'NR', 'Men steal for it. Nations go to war for it. The it is oil - and it grows on trees. Coconut oil is the precious lifeblood of 1870s South Seas traders. And lots of real blood will be spilled to get it! Screen royalty Burt Lancaster is His Majesty O''Keefe in this last of three adventures that (along with The Flame and the Arrow and The Crimson Pirate) blew a revitalizing wind into the sails of the swashbuckler genre. Action, cunning and derring-do are watchwords of the title seafarer as he befriends, defends and ultimately rules the islanders of exotic Yap. Lensed on gorgeus Fiji locations, grandly scored by Robert Farnon and rousingly directed by Byron Haskin, His Majesty O''Keefe delivers heroics of regal proportions.', 'Men steal for it. Nations go to war for it. The it is oil - and it grows on trees. Coconut oil is the precious lifeblood of 1870s South Seas traders. And lots of real blood will be spilled to get it! Screen royalty Burt Lancaster is His Majesty O''Keefe in this last of three adventures that (along with The Flame and the Arrow and The Crimson Pirate) blew a revitalizing wind into the sails of the swashbuckler genre. Action, cunning and derring-do are watchwords of the title seafarer as he befriends, defends and ultimately rules the islanders of exotic Yap. Lensed on gorgeus Fiji locations, grandly scored by Robert Farnon and rousingly directed by Byron Haskin, His Majesty O''Keefe delivers heroics of regal proportions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kdHvzBI9lzoUJ0roiDvFALxMegs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:113785'),
  ('734399398296697686', 'His Master''s Voice', 2001, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Emilio Martínez Lázaro, Antxon Zabala, Javier Salmones', 'Emilio Martínez Lázaro, Alfredo Montoya, José Ángel Esteban', 'Eduard Fernández, Silvia Abascal, Joaquim de Almeida, Imanol Arias, Ana Otero, Joseba Apaolaza, Alicia Agut, Miguel del Arco', null, 'Basque Country, Spain, 1980s. In Bilbao, a gray city dominated by political corruption and nationalist terrorism, Charli works as a chauffeur for Oliveira, a businessman engaged in shady deals. Alarmed by a series of threats and attacks, Oliveira decides to entrust Charli with the protection of his daughter Marta.', 'Basque Country, Spain, 1980s. In Bilbao, a gray city dominated by political corruption and nationalist terrorism, Charli works as a chauffeur for Oliveira, a businessman engaged in shady deals. Alarmed by a series of threats and attacks, Oliveira decides to entrust Charli with the protection of his daughter Marta.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e9xKFx4lRgRT0teDMxYHpCsDsAE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:115480'),
  ('1121931917131932374', 'His Mother''s Eyes', 2011, 'Drama', 'Thierry Klifa, Julien Hirsch', 'Thierry Klifa', 'Catherine Deneuve, Géraldine Pailhas, Nicolas Duvauchelle, Marina Foïs, Jean-Marc Barr, Marisa Paredes, Jean-Baptiste Lafarge, Hélène Fillières', null, 'A writer suffering from a lack of inspiration sneaks his way into the lives of a star television journalist and his lead ballerina daughter to write, unbeknownst to them, a non-authorized biography. Meanwhile, in Brittany, twenty-year-old Bruno, who lives with his parents, doesn''t yet know the consequences that this story will have on his existence...', 'A writer suffering from a lack of inspiration sneaks his way into the lives of a star television journalist and his lead ballerina daughter to write, unbeknownst to them, a non-authorized biography. Meanwhile, in Brittany, twenty-year-old Bruno, who lives with his parents, doesn''t yet know the consequences that this story will have on his existence...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q4LJjziwWNSn3gnplOC9iDyNb8g.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:65237'),
  ('766625022353805107', 'His Motorbike, Her Island', 1986, 'Romance, Drama', 'Nobuhiko Obayashi, Yoshitaka Sakamoto', 'Ikuo Sekimoto', 'Riki Takeuchi, Kiwako Harada, Noriko Watanabe, Ryōichi Takayanagi, Takahiro Tamura, Tomokazu Miura, Toshie Negishi, Toru Minegishi', null, 'Ko, a motorbike enthusiast from the city wandering the Japanese countryside, falls for the carefree local Miyo and teaches her how to ride. When Miyo proves herself a biker prodigy, Ko begins to fear she''s destined to crash.', 'Ko, a motorbike enthusiast from the city wandering the Japanese countryside, falls for the carefree local Miyo and teaches her how to ride. When Miyo proves herself a biker prodigy, Ko begins to fear she''s destined to crash.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2yUN50OHeJLaMcu5nO1D2nX5frr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:298973'),
