  ('185543994854284317', 'His Name Was Jason: 30 Years of Friday the 13th', 2010, 'Documentary', 'Daniel Farrands', 'Anthony Masi, Thommy Hutson', 'Diane Almeida, Erich Anderson, Judie Aronson, Diana Barrows, Steven Barton, Rachel Belofsky, Peter Bracke, Richard Brooker', 'NR', 'A retrospective documentary about the groundbreaking horror series, Friday the 13th, featuring interviews with cast and crew from the twelve films spanning 3 decades.', 'A retrospective documentary about the groundbreaking horror series, Friday the 13th, featuring interviews with cast and crew from the twelve films spanning 3 decades.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1YyPmtz41mXO0A2ztsn3Ibe6ssF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15004'),
  ('685627655281284435', 'His Name Was King', 1971, 'Western', 'Giancarlo Romitelli, Guglielmo Mancori', 'Renato Savino', 'Richard Harrison, Klaus Kinski, Anne Puskin, Goffredo Unger, Lorenzo Fineschi, Lucio Zarini, Tom Felleghy, Luciano Pigozzi', null, 'The Benson brothers, who are smuggling guns across the Mexican border, kill King''s brother and rape his wife. King must stop their illegal activities, find who is behind them and gain revenge for his family.', 'The Benson brothers, who are smuggling guns across the Mexican border, kill King''s brother and rape his wife. King must stop their illegal activities, find who is behind them and gain revenge for his family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qr79TMK7LJ4xLaptxRT0Fua22sM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:150677'),
  ('548772532486868070', 'His Only Son', 2023, 'Drama, Fantasy', 'David Helling', 'David Helling', 'Daniel da Silva, Nicolas Mouawad, Sara Seyed, Scot Cooper, Luis Fernandez-Gil, Orestis Sophocleous, Ted Harvey, Edaan Moskowitz', 'PG-13', 'By God''s order, Abraham was commanded to sacrifice his son Isaac on the mountain of Moriah. While traveling to the place of the sacrifice, alongside Isaac and two servants, Abraham is flooded with vivid memories from the years he and Sarah spent longing for the son they were promised—the son he must now lay upon the altar.', 'By God''s order, Abraham was commanded to sacrifice his son Isaac on the mountain of Moriah. While traveling to the place of the sacrifice, alongside Isaac and two servants, Abraham is flooded with vivid memories from the years he and Sarah spent longing for the son they were promised—the son he must now lay upon the altar.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e85UDGmD9HmKcS0BOgoha029bkK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:761851'),
  ('104049055917593807', 'His Private Secretary', 1933, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Phil Whitman, Abe Scholtz', 'Sam Katzman', 'Evalyn Knapp, John Wayne, Reginald Barlow, Alec B. Francis, Arthur Hoyt, Natalie Kingston, Patrick Cunning, Al St. John', 'NR', 'Dick Wallace wants to marry a minister''s grand-daughter but his father, who wants him to get work on his company''s business, is opposed. She takes a job with the company to prove she''s okay.', 'Dick Wallace wants to marry a minister''s grand-daughter but his father, who wants him to get work on his company''s business, is opposed. She takes a job with the company to prove she''s okay.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/psQYfpuD89iq9tNQApqU17A5nVU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36499'),
