  ('337813391598696119', 'Hit Man', 1972, 'Action, Crime', 'George Armitage, Andrew Davis', 'George Armitage', 'Bernie Casey, Pam Grier, Lisa Moore, Bhetty Waldron, Sam Laws, Don Diamond, Bob Harris, Christopher Joy', 'R', 'Bernie Casey portrays Tyrone and Pamela Grier plays a sultry skin-flick star in this first Americanized remake of the iconic Michael Caine action film Get Carter. From Watts to the West Side, from porno parlors to a high-rise, from motel dives to a crime kingpin’s sprawling pleasure dome, from corner hangouts to a wildlife preserve, Tyrone covers a lot of real estate, busts a lot of heads.', 'Bernie Casey portrays Tyrone and Pamela Grier plays a sultry skin-flick star in this first Americanized remake of the iconic Michael Caine action film Get Carter. From Watts to the West Side, from porno parlors to a high-rise, from motel dives to a crime kingpin’s sprawling pleasure dome, from corner hangouts to a wildlife preserve, Tyrone covers a lot of real estate, busts a lot of heads.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zYO2ychL6Sw0Ww9LMFUNdcjZVKg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37488'),
  ('779432996728350545', 'Hit Man', 2024, 'Comedy, Romance, Crime', 'Richard Linklater, Aaron Statler, Andi Budman', 'Richard Linklater, Glen Powell', 'Glen Powell, Adria Arjona, Austin Amelio, Retta, Sanjay Rao, Molly Bernard, Evan Holtzman, Gralen Bryant Banks', 'R', 'A mild-mannered professor moonlighting as a fake hit man in police stings ignites a chain reaction of trouble when he falls for a potential client.', 'A mild-mannered professor moonlighting as a fake hit man in police stings ignites a chain reaction of trouble when he falls for a potential client.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oil3EZwKFp3CWxZnfGfGglesvm9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:974635'),
