  ('749618924235715426', 'Hit the Ice', 1943, 'Comedy', 'Charles Lamont, Bernard B. Brown, Charles Van Enger', 'Frederic I. Rinaldo, John Grant, Robert Lees', 'Bud Abbott, Lou Costello, Ginny Simms, Patric Knowles, Elyse Knox, Joe Sawyer, Marc Lawrence, Sheldon Leonard', 'NR', 'After Flash Fulton and Weejie McCoy take pictures of a bank robbery, they''re lured to the mountain resort hideout of the robbers, where they meet an old friend and his band.', 'After Flash Fulton and Weejie McCoy take pictures of a bank robbery, they''re lured to the mountain resort hideout of the robbers, where they meet an old friend and his band.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/euD92LQwQet1qZ68Jn5Y6qxHqnz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33484'),
  ('644124655976933499', 'Hit the Road', 2021, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Panah Panahi, Amin Jafari, Negar Joneidi', 'Panah Panahi', 'Hasan Ma''juni, Pantea Panahiha, Rayan Sarlak, Amin Simiar, Bahram Ark', null, 'A chaotic family is on a road trip across a rugged landscape. In the back seat, Dad has a broken leg, Mom tries to laugh when she''s not holding back tears, and the youngest keeps exploding into car karaoke. Only the older brother is quiet.', 'A chaotic family is on a road trip across a rugged landscape. In the back seat, Dad has a broken leg, Mom tries to laugh when she''s not holding back tears, and the youngest keeps exploding into car karaoke. Only the older brother is quiet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vJziqfgyEmY1kimb1vbMqEJdYKI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:838154'),
  ('926127013552092654', 'Hit-and-Run Squad', 2019, 'Crime, Action', 'Lee Hu-bin, Hong Seung-chul, Kim Tae-kyeong', 'Han Jun-hee, Kim Kyung-chan', 'Gong Hyo-jin, Ryu Jun-yeol, Cho Jung-seok, Yum Jung-ah, Jeon Hye-jin, Son Suk-ku, Key, Lee Sung-min', null, 'Min-jae, a rookie police officer with a natural born talent for driving, is assigned to the perfect team: the Hit-and-Run Squad. But at the same time, for police detective Si-yeon, it is a place she is unjustly demoted to for doing her job. The two team up to arrest the rich and powerful speed maniac Jae-chul who is suspected of committing crimes for his obsession for speed.', 'Min-jae, a rookie police officer with a natural born talent for driving, is assigned to the perfect team: the Hit-and-Run Squad. But at the same time, for police detective Si-yeon, it is a place she is unjustly demoted to for doing her job. The two team up to arrest the rich and powerful speed maniac Jae-chul who is suspected of committing crimes for his obsession for speed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jGMkLo7FDgQikYwFJSlbc49ewVU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:568320'),
  ('947783194579253348', 'HIT: The 2nd Case', 2022, 'Crime, Thriller, Action', 'Sailesh Kolanu, Manikandan Saravanan', 'Sailesh Kolanu', 'Adivi Sesh, Meenakshi Chaudhary, Komalee Prasad, Maganti Srinath, Rao Ramesh, Suhas, Divya Narni, Tanikella Bharani', 'R', 'Krishna Dev aka KD, a laidback cop working in Andhra Pradesh State HIT, takes on a gruesome murder case. As KD unravels the layers of the crime, the stakes rise unbelievably high and the threat comes unusually close.', 'Krishna Dev aka KD, a laidback cop working in Andhra Pradesh State HIT, takes on a gruesome murder case. As KD unravels the layers of the crime, the stakes rise unbelievably high and the threat comes unusually close.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tidXGOilCSa5sch1KGiEXrWeYCf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:811945'),
  ('427642997391816569', 'HIT: The First Case', 2020, 'Crime, Thriller, Action', 'Manikandan Saravanan, Sailesh Kolanu', 'Sailesh Kolanu', 'Vishwak Sen, Ruhani Sharma, Murali Sharma, Bhanuchander, Brahmaji, Chaitanya Sagiraju, Naveena Reddy, Ravi Raja', 'PG-13', 'Vikram Rudraraju is a 30-year-old cop working for the Telangana State Police. While Vikram is battling with his own traumatic past, the stakes get high when a girl called Preethi mysteriously disappears in Hyderabad and Vikram has to solve the case at any cost.', 'Vikram Rudraraju is a 30-year-old cop working for the Telangana State Police. While Vikram is battling with his own traumatic past, the stakes get high when a girl called Preethi mysteriously disappears in Hyderabad and Vikram has to solve the case at any cost.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dMxentLHEJPBMQCPXHrUKluODpe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:678391'),
  ('662005366158287690', 'HIT: The Third Case', 2025, 'Crime, Thriller, Action', 'Sailesh Kolanu, Sanu John Varghese, Venkat Maddirala', 'Sailesh Kolanu', 'Nani, Srinidhi Shetty, Komalee Prasad, Rao Ramesh, Surya Srinivas, Adil Pala, Prateik Smita Patil, Amit Sharma', 'R', 'The Homicide Intervention Team (HIT) sends ruthless police officer Arjun Sarkaar to find a group of killers and stop their grisly murder spree.', 'The Homicide Intervention Team (HIT) sends ruthless police officer Arjun Sarkaar to find a group of killers and stop their grisly murder spree.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wT9tGyFol4RBwkjESXUWeBdnLJn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1060046'),
  ('954868237463242694', 'Hit!', 1973, 'Drama, Action, Crime', 'Sidney J. Furie, John A. Alonzo, Robin S. Clark', 'Alan Trustman, David M. Wolf', 'Billy Dee Williams, Richard Pryor, Paul Hampton, Gwen Welles, Warren J. Kemmerling, Janet Brandt, Sid Melton, Zooey Hall', 'R', 'A federal agent whose daughter dies of a heroin overdose is determined to destroy the drug ring that supplied her. He recruits various people whose lives have been torn apart by the drug trade and trains them. Then they all leave for France to track down and destroy the ring.', 'A federal agent whose daughter dies of a heroin overdose is determined to destroy the drug ring that supplied her. He recruits various people whose lives have been torn apart by the drug trade and trains them. Then they all leave for France to track down and destroy the ring.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3J7reLsmnYxMrVuoFm5FA1nvB4o.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:103314'),
  ('887925318732935338', 'Hitch', 2005, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Andrew Dunn, Andy Tennant, Scott Printz', 'Kevin Bisch', 'Will Smith, Eva Mendes, Kevin James, Amber Valletta, Julie Ann Emery, Adam Arkin, Robinne Lee, Nathan Lee Graham', 'PG-13', 'Dating coach Alex ''Hitch'' Hitchens mentors a bumbling client, Albert, who hopes to win the heart of the glamorous Allegra Cole. While Albert makes progress, Hitch faces his own romantic setbacks when proven techniques fail to work on Sara Melas, a tabloid reporter digging for dirt on Allegra Cole''s love life. When Sara discovers Hitch''s connection to Albert – now Allegra''s boyfriend – it threatens to destroy both relationships.', 'Dating coach Alex ''Hitch'' Hitchens mentors a bumbling client, Albert, who hopes to win the heart of the glamorous Allegra Cole. While Albert makes progress, Hitch faces his own romantic setbacks when proven techniques fail to work on Sara Melas, a tabloid reporter digging for dirt on Allegra Cole''s love life. When Sara discovers Hitch''s connection to Albert – now Allegra''s boyfriend – it threatens to destroy both relationships.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x3W9H3nhGQbWSlyI8Amp2F6Z6cz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8488'),
  ('111096494450442230', 'Hitch Hike', 1977, 'Thriller, Crime, Drama', 'Pasquale Festa Campanile, Giuseppe Ruzzolini, Franco Di Giacomo', 'Peter Crane, Aldo Crudo', 'Franco Nero, Corinne Cléry, David Hess, Joshua Sinclair, Ignazio Spalla, Leonardo Scavino, Mónica Zanchi, Benito Pacifico', null, 'A bickering couple driving cross-country pick up a murderous hitchhiker who threatens to kill them unless they take him to a sanctuary. In return he agrees to split some bank loot he has on him.', 'A bickering couple driving cross-country pick up a murderous hitchhiker who threatens to kill them unless they take him to a sanctuary. In return he agrees to split some bank loot he has on him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sHRt1alAIPDOBqaRu8E65ykDR9t.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54523'),
  ('627946131450068072', 'Hitch Hike to Hell', 1977, 'Crime, Mystery', 'Irvin Berwick, William DeDiego', 'John Buckley', 'Robert Gribbin, Russell Johnson, Dorothy Bennett, John Harmon, Randy Echols, Mary Ellen Christie, Kippi Bell, Sheryl Lynn', 'R', 'Howard is mild-mannered and slightly simple-minded, with a habit of picking up teenage hitchhikers while driving his delivery routes. Sometimes the girls admit to being runaways, and if they claim to hate their mothers it drives Howard into a violent frenzy; his sister ran away from home years ago and was never heard from again, causing his desperate, addled mother to tighten her hold on him. Howard never remembers raping his victims or strangling them with wire coat hangers, though his boss does notice missed deliveries and late arrivals.', 'Howard is mild-mannered and slightly simple-minded, with a habit of picking up teenage hitchhikers while driving his delivery routes. Sometimes the girls admit to being runaways, and if they claim to hate their mothers it drives Howard into a violent frenzy; his sister ran away from home years ago and was never heard from again, causing his desperate, addled mother to tighten her hold on him. Howard never remembers raping his victims or strangling them with wire coat hangers, though his boss does notice missed deliveries and late arrivals.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/79FQkYyA1EKGYyRWjGvtitF9kZY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29073'),
  ('1099261426340313665', 'Hitch-Hike', 2013, 'Crime, Thriller', 'Ainosuke Shibata, Masashi Seki, Ainosuke Shibata', 'Hiroyasu Kubota', 'Miyuki Yokoyama, Hiroaki Kawatsure, Shoichi Matsuda, Natsuko Kimura, Isamu Sugihara, Mitsuki Koga, Hiroshi Watari', null, 'The brutal Yoshio and his quiet young wife Saeko are on a road trip. Their drive will take a wrong turn when Yoshio decides to pick up a hitch hiker along the way. When the man reveals himself as a deranged bank robber and serial killer, the couple will be forced to cooperate in his getaway. Now it''s Saeko''s turn to take revenge on the man who drove her through hell!', 'The brutal Yoshio and his quiet young wife Saeko are on a road trip. Their drive will take a wrong turn when Yoshio decides to pick up a hitch hiker along the way. When the man reveals himself as a deranged bank robber and serial killer, the couple will be forced to cooperate in his getaway. Now it''s Saeko''s turn to take revenge on the man who drove her through hell!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hvOGuY9vRfdVtJ5ImLngD34aIdk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:332373'),
  ('189959331813776079', 'Hitchcock', 2012, 'Drama', 'Sacha Gervasi, Jeff Cronenweth, Brittany Perham-MacWhorter', 'John J. McLaughlin', 'Anthony Hopkins, Helen Mirren, Scarlett Johansson, Danny Huston, Toni Collette, Michael Stuhlbarg, Michael Wincott, Jessica Biel', 'PG-13', 'Following his great success with "North by Northwest," director Alfred Hitchcock makes a daring choice for his next project: an adaptation of Robert Bloch''s novel "Psycho." When the studio refuses to back the picture, Hitchcock decides to pay for it himself in exchange for a percentage of the profits. His wife, Alma Reville, has serious reservations about the film but supports him nonetheless. Still, the production strains the couple''s marriage.', 'Following his great success with "North by Northwest," director Alfred Hitchcock makes a daring choice for his next project: an adaptation of Robert Bloch''s novel "Psycho." When the studio refuses to back the picture, Hitchcock decides to pay for it himself in exchange for a percentage of the profits. His wife, Alma Reville, has serious reservations about the film but supports him nonetheless. Still, the production strains the couple''s marriage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zlG4QzB00VM6QHUmRkKaboCOgat.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:112336'),
  ('496403521450450139', 'Hitchcock Confidential', 2019, 'Documentary', 'Laurent Herbiet', 'Patrick McGilligan', 'Alfred Hitchcock, Alma Reville, Cary Grant, Elsa Lepoivre', null, 'Alfred Hitchcock is known as a giant of movie making, a facetious master of suspense, obsessed with blond heroines in peril, with the reputation of being tyrannical towards his actors. But who knows the real Hitchcock? During his last public appearance, "Hitch" paid tribute to the wife, mother, co-writer, editor and partner of a lifetime that was Alma Reville Hitchcock. The two Hitchcock were inseparable, engineering the unquestionable masterpieces together. Their genuine collaboration never stopped from the day they met until the end of their lives. It''s in light of this fusional relationship that this film will revisit and shed fresh light on the legend.', 'Alfred Hitchcock is known as a giant of movie making, a facetious master of suspense, obsessed with blond heroines in peril, with the reputation of being tyrannical towards his actors. But who knows the real Hitchcock? During his last public appearance, "Hitch" paid tribute to the wife, mother, co-writer, editor and partner of a lifetime that was Alma Reville Hitchcock. The two Hitchcock were inseparable, engineering the unquestionable masterpieces together. Their genuine collaboration never stopped from the day they met until the end of their lives. It''s in light of this fusional relationship that this film will revisit and shed fresh light on the legend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l5czvw08MyGutniC0mnAGLID1Sa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:667222'),
  ('306837218660893662', 'Hitchcock/Truffaut', 2015, 'Documentary', 'Lisa Rinzler, Nick Bentgen, Daniel Cowen', 'Serge Toubiana, Kent Jones', 'Bob Balaban, Wes Anderson, Olivier Assayas, Peter Bogdanovich, Arnaud Desplechin, David Fincher, James Gray, Kiyoshi Kurosawa', 'PG-13', 'Filmmakers discuss the legacy of Alfred Hitchcock and the book “Hitchcock/Truffaut” (“Le cinéma selon Hitchcock”), written by François Truffaut and published in 1966.', 'Filmmakers discuss the legacy of Alfred Hitchcock and the book “Hitchcock/Truffaut” (“Le cinéma selon Hitchcock”), written by François Truffaut and published in 1966.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hzNasVeTKenNnS8eS4EOtQA5TVY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:339751'),
  ('174883768361779204', 'Hitcher in the Dark', 1989, 'Crime, Horror, Thriller', 'Umberto Lenzi, Jerry Phillips', 'Olga Pehar', 'Joe Balogh, Josie Bissett, Jason Saucier, Robin Fox, Gary Wade Morton, Fay W. Edwards, Tom Schultheis, Todd Livingston', null, 'A sick young man drives around in his daddy''s camper, looking for lone stray females to kidnap, torture, rape and murder.', 'A sick young man drives around in his daddy''s camper, looking for lone stray females to kidnap, torture, rape and murder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5EvkUDS2Epdqbx7j8KsUw7jYx7w.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28318'),
  ('830876342529425332', 'Hitler', 1962, 'History, War', 'Stuart Heisler, Joseph F. Biroc', 'Sam Neuman, E. Charles Straus', 'Richard Basehart, Maria Emo, Cordula Trantow, Martin Kosleck, Berry Kroeger, John Banner, Martin Brandt, John Wengraf', null, 'Richard Basehart stars as one of the most influential and one of the most reviled men in history in this probing psychological study of a man who nearly gained dominance over the entire western world--at the cost of millions of lives--Hitler.', 'Richard Basehart stars as one of the most influential and one of the most reviled men in history in this probing psychological study of a man who nearly gained dominance over the entire western world--at the cost of millions of lives--Hitler.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/NDK54o9AKgSot77EvTWq7D3nWy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:102155'),
  ('191761737275057917', 'Hitler', 1996, 'Drama', 'Siddique, Anandakuttan', 'Siddique', 'Mammootty, Mukesh, Shobana, Vani Viswanath, Ilavarasi, Suchitra, Chippy, Seetha', null, 'Madhavan, an eligible bachelor, is very protective of his five sisters. However, things take an ugly turn for Madhavan when his sisters turn against him and fail to understand his love for them.', 'Madhavan, an eligible bachelor, is very protective of his five sisters. However, things take an ugly turn for Madhavan when his sisters turn against him and fail to understand his love for them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/itZ0GW5RyXNNOZfupBupLVa9Uii.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:237735'),
  ('261246963197960738', 'Hitler - Never Heard of Him', 1963, 'Documentary', 'Bertrand Blier, Jean-Louis Picavet', null, 'Zouzou', null, 'In 1963, 22-year-old Bertrand Blier invited 11 of his peers to come to a film studio and talk about their lives. The record of what was said is a discussion of values that remains relevant and fascinating today. The footage was shot just five years prior to May 1968, and the atmosphere of that time is clearly discernible: these young people may not yet be revolutionaries, but there is clearly a ferment in the air.', 'In 1963, 22-year-old Bertrand Blier invited 11 of his peers to come to a film studio and talk about their lives. The record of what was said is a discussion of values that remains relevant and fascinating today. The footage was shot just five years prior to May 1968, and the atmosphere of that time is clearly discernible: these young people may not yet be revolutionaries, but there is clearly a ferment in the air.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9741DgjWIyVUw9Q7MCAlpcIxtOA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:130638'),
  ('489045806897622694', 'Hitler in Hollywood', 2011, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Carlo Varini, Frédéric Sojcher', 'Renaud Andris, Lionel Samain', 'Maria de Medeiros, Wim Willaert, Micheline Presle, François Morel, Michael Lonsdale, Nathalie Baye, Arielle Dombasle, Andrei Konchalovsky', null, 'A bio-doc about Micheline Presle changes into a thrilling investigation of the long hidden truth about European cinema. This mockumentary thriller uncovers Hollywood''s unsuspected plot against the European motion picture industry. Numerous directors and stars appear in the film, making it a choice morsel for all film lovers.', 'A bio-doc about Micheline Presle changes into a thrilling investigation of the long hidden truth about European cinema. This mockumentary thriller uncovers Hollywood''s unsuspected plot against the European motion picture industry. Numerous directors and stars appear in the film, making it a choice morsel for all film lovers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8gvpdZKfj3NYeIoZfwl2ayP9ZME.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:473621'),
  ('729070276480071695', 'Hitler Lives', 1945, 'Documentary', 'Don Siegel', 'Saul Elkins', 'Knox Manning', null, 'This short film, produced at the end of WWII, warns that although Adolf Hitler is dead, his ideas live on.', 'This short film, produced at the end of WWII, warns that although Adolf Hitler is dead, his ideas live on.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jNXDe6u2N4xBK6jukYDQDcjek65.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:240400'),
  ('1008639671164639610', 'Hitler Versus Picasso', 2018, 'Documentary', 'Mateusz Stolecki, Marco Alfieri, Claudio Poli', 'Sabina Fedeli, Arianna Marelli', 'Toni Servillo, Jean-Marc Dreyfus, Edgar Feuchtwanger, Simon Goodman, Timothy Garton Ash, Berthold Hinz, Meike Hoffmann, Eva Kleeman', null, 'In 1937 the Nazi regime held two exhibitions in Munich: one to stigmatize “Degenerate Art” (which they systematically looted and destroyed) and one, personally curated by Hitler, to glorify “Classic Art”. This immersive new documentary reveals the Nazi’s complicated relationship with classical and modern art, displaying an incredible number of masterpieces by Botticelli, Klee, Matisse, Monet, Chagall, Renoir and Gauguin amongst others, intertwined with human stories from the most infamous period of the twentieth century. A state-of-the-art detective story exploring the Nazis’ obsession with creative expression, Hitler versus Picasso combines history, art and human drama for an unforgettable cinema experience.', 'In 1937 the Nazi regime held two exhibitions in Munich: one to stigmatize “Degenerate Art” (which they systematically looted and destroyed) and one, personally curated by Hitler, to glorify “Classic Art”. This immersive new documentary reveals the Nazi’s complicated relationship with classical and modern art, displaying an incredible number of masterpieces by Botticelli, Klee, Matisse, Monet, Chagall, Renoir and Gauguin amongst others, intertwined with human stories from the most infamous period of the twentieth century. A state-of-the-art detective story exploring the Nazis’ obsession with creative expression, Hitler versus Picasso combines history, art and human drama for an unforgettable cinema experience.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oP2gP06isyDzL7moxlM45dH7IU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:509893'),
  ('625474612829491184', 'Hitler Youth Quex', 1933, 'Drama', 'Hans Steinhoff, Konstantin Irmen-Tschet', 'Bobby E. Lüthge, Karl Aloys Schenzinger', 'Heinrich George, Berta Drews, Jürgen Ohlsen, Hans Richter, Rudolf Platte, Reinhold Bernt, Anna Müller-Lincke, Hermann Speelmans', null, 'Nazi propaganda film based on the life and death of Hitler Youth Herbert "Quex" Norkus – in the film, renamed Heini Völker – who was killed while distributing flyers in a Communist neighborhood.', 'Nazi propaganda film based on the life and death of Hitler Youth Herbert "Quex" Norkus – in the film, renamed Heini Völker – who was killed while distributing flyers in a Communist neighborhood.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ndIG50vNtPYKGimY1hgOBxCjyS0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:167235'),
  ('32960202210101420', 'Hitler- Dead or Alive', 1942, 'Thriller, Adventure, Comedy', 'Nick Grindé, Paul Ivano', 'Sam Neuman, Karl Brown', 'Ward Bond, Dorothy Tree, Warren Hymer, Paul Fix, Russell Hicks, Bruce Edwards, Felix Basch, Bobby Watson', 'NR', 'A team of ex-con bounty hunters go to Germany in search of Hitler. If they can find him, a million dollar reward is to be paid to them.', 'A team of ex-con bounty hunters go to Germany in search of Hitler. If they can find him, a million dollar reward is to be paid to them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uuspCJZ2gM43bwN414npOOi5269.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:126807'),
  ('1037930283699413432', 'Hitler: A Career', 1977, 'Documentary, History', 'Joachim Fest, Christian Herrendoerfer', 'Joachim Fest', 'Gert Westphal, Adolf Hitler, Ernest Bevin, Karl Brandt, Eva Braun, Neville Chamberlain, Charlie Chaplin, Winston Churchill', null, 'A keen chronicle of the unlikely rise to power of Adolf Hitler (1889-1945) and a dissection of the Third Reich (1933-1945), but also an analysis of mass psychology and how the desperate crowd can be deceived and shepherded to the slaughterhouse.', 'A keen chronicle of the unlikely rise to power of Adolf Hitler (1889-1945) and a dissection of the Third Reich (1933-1945), but also an analysis of mass psychology and how the desperate crowd can be deceived and shepherded to the slaughterhouse.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jtaLqChWbcpdXvBO3VUwfL3IatE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:60378'),
  ('239090358189293410', 'Hitler: A Film from Germany', 1978, 'Drama, History, War', 'Hans-Jürgen Syberberg, Dietrich Lohmann, Gerhard von Halem', 'Hans-Jürgen Syberberg', 'Harry Baer, Heinz Schubert, Peter Kern, Hellmut Lange, Rainer von Artenfels, Peter Moland, Johannes Buzalski, Alfred Edel', 'NR', 'A structure-free, four-part examination of the rise and fall of the Third Reich. Each part explores a different topic, from Hitler''s cult of personality in propaganda to how said propaganda was associated with pre-Nazi German cultural, spiritual, and national heritage to the Holocaust and the ideology behind it, particularly from Himmler''s point of view.', 'A structure-free, four-part examination of the rise and fall of the Third Reich. Each part explores a different topic, from Hitler''s cult of personality in propaganda to how said propaganda was associated with pre-Nazi German cultural, spiritual, and national heritage to the Holocaust and the ideology behind it, particularly from Himmler''s point of view.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hj0dsmyL8tKAGKOmfhFb49H3krV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:58435'),
  ('456603261705869772', 'Hitler: Beast of Berlin', 1939, 'War, Drama', 'Sam Newfield', 'Fred Myton', 'Roland Drew, Steffi Duna, Greta Granstedt, Alan Ladd, Vernon Dent, Lucien Prival, John Ellis, George Rosener', 'NR', 'Hans Memling, a young intellectual, patriotic German, is secretly opposed to the Nazi regime. With the aid of Gustav Schultz, Father Pommer, Anna Wahl and others, he is gleaning accurate information from foreign radio broadcasts and distributing it through Germany with an underground-press operation.', 'Hans Memling, a young intellectual, patriotic German, is secretly opposed to the Nazi regime. With the aid of Gustav Schultz, Father Pommer, Anna Wahl and others, he is gleaning accurate information from foreign radio broadcasts and distributing it through Germany with an underground-press operation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dzLhRKUJLGcRBRAuNDkJUk97R8D.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:148096'),
  ('269023453291199377', 'Hitler: The Last Ten Days', 1973, 'Drama, War, History', 'Ennio De Concini, Ennio Guarnieri', 'Maria Pia Fusco, Wolfgang Reinhardt, Ennio De Concini', 'Alec Guinness, Simon Ward, Adolfo Celi, Diane Cilento, Gabriele Ferzetti, Eric Porter, Doris Kunstmann, Joss Ackland', 'PG', 'Hitler: The Last Ten Days takes us into the depths of der Furher’s Berlin bunker during his final days. Based on the book by Gerhard Boldt, it provides a bleak look at the goings-on within, and without.', 'Hitler: The Last Ten Days takes us into the depths of der Furher’s Berlin bunker during his final days. Based on the book by Gerhard Boldt, it provides a bleak look at the goings-on within, and without.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tllM8kqfmk4IIlEEBmedoVRsJJG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47536'),
  ('202790798998738413', 'Hitler''s Children', 1943, 'Romance, War', 'Edward Dmytryk, Russell Metty, C. Bakaleinikoff', 'Emmet Lavery', 'Tim Holt, Bonita Granville, Kent Smith, Otto Kruger, Hans Conried, H.B. Warner, Lloyd Corrigan, Erford Gage', 'NR', 'This lurid exposé of the Hitler Youth follows the woes of an American girl declared legally German by the Nazi government.', 'This lurid exposé of the Hitler Youth follows the woes of an American girl declared legally German by the Nazi government.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4y4RFRnBYhzc7opSiBwQgEhdjW6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:98493'),
  ('168314184226336330', 'Hitler''s Evil Science', 2019, 'Documentary, History, TV Movie', 'David Korn-Brzoza, Charles Sautreuil', 'David Korn-Brzoza, Johann Chapoutot', 'Vincent Lindon, Yves Ternon, Michael Kater, Laurent Olivier, Peter Schöttler, Christian Ingrao, Christina Kott, Raphaël Toledano', null, 'In 1935, German scientists dug for bones; in 1943, they murdered to get them. How the German scientific community supported Nazism, distorted history to legitimize a hideous system and was an accomplice to its unspeakable crimes. The story of the Ahnenerbe, a sinister organization created to rewrite the obscure origins of a nation.', 'In 1935, German scientists dug for bones; in 1943, they murdered to get them. How the German scientific community supported Nazism, distorted history to legitimize a hideous system and was an accomplice to its unspeakable crimes. The story of the Ahnenerbe, a sinister organization created to rewrite the obscure origins of a nation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pccxHFBBGomo4HyUp3nT7hhdw4h.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:605936'),
  ('203097323510377681', 'Hitler''s Hollywood', 2017, 'Documentary, History', 'Rüdiger Suchsland, Anne Bürger', 'Rüdiger Suchsland', 'Rüdiger Suchsland, Hans Henrik Wöhler, Rike Schmid, Ingrid Bergman, Adolf Hitler, Joseph Goebbels, Leni Riefenstahl, Brigitte Helm', null, 'Film journalist and critic Rüdiger Suchsland examines German cinema from 1933, when the Nazis came into power, until 1945, when the Third Reich collapsed. (A sequel to From Caligari to Hitler, 2015.)', 'Film journalist and critic Rüdiger Suchsland examines German cinema from 1933, when the Nazis came into power, until 1945, when the Third Reich collapsed. (A sequel to From Caligari to Hitler, 2015.)', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/YlFqWoN7VmWSRjXQJUHvSD2ikc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:439988'),
  ('885209125539852840', 'Hitler''s Kaput!', 2008, 'Comedy', 'Maryus Vaysberg, Irek Hartowicz, Saulius Urbanavičius', 'Maryus Vaysberg', 'Pavel Derevyanko, Anna Semenovich, Yuriy Galtsev, Yuriy Stoyanov, Aleksey Ogurtsov, Evelina Bledans, Mikhail Krylov, Ilya Oleynikov', null, 'A Russian WW2 spy spoof following misadventures of a clueless Soviet secret agent trapped inside Hitler''s inner circle.', 'A Russian WW2 spy spoof following misadventures of a clueless Soviet secret agent trapped inside Hitler''s inner circle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vje50IVDvpphUfzJfIBqxQgeyej.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52891'),
  ('1042056950318066150', 'Hitler''s Madman', 1943, 'Drama, War', 'Douglas Sirk, Jack Greenhalgh, Eugen Schüfftan', 'Peretz Hirschbein, Melvin Levy, Edgar G. Ulmer', 'Patricia Morison, John Carradine, Alan Curtis, Howard Freeman, Ralph Morgan, Edgar Kennedy, Ludwig Stössel, Al Shean', 'NR', 'In 1942, a young paratrooper in the RAF returns to Czechoslovakia to encourage his fellow countrymen to sabotage the German war effort.', 'In 1942, a young paratrooper in the RAF returns to Czechoslovakia to encourage his fellow countrymen to sabotage the German war effort.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/X7yicpEUd5Wj21vFVkUnAFNnq3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:100747'),
  ('409640932712139756', 'Hitler''s SS: Portrait in Evil', 1985, 'TV Movie, Drama, War, History', 'Jim Goddard, Ernest Vincze', 'Lukas Heller', 'John Shea, Bill Nighy, Lucy Gutteridge, David Warner, Warren Clarke, Michael Elphick, Stratford Johns, Robert Urquhart', 'NR', 'The two-part TV movie Hitler''s SS: Portrait in Evil crystallizes that evil by concentrating on two Berlin brothers. In 1931, Helmut Hoffman a brilliant student and self-styled opportunist, joins Hitler''s SS. At the same time, his younger brother Karl, a top athlete and idealist, becomes a chauffeur for the "S.A.".', 'The two-part TV movie Hitler''s SS: Portrait in Evil crystallizes that evil by concentrating on two Berlin brothers. In 1931, Helmut Hoffman a brilliant student and self-styled opportunist, joins Hitler''s SS. At the same time, his younger brother Karl, a top athlete and idealist, becomes a chauffeur for the "S.A.".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fJAc3KKB5DCc1oqXCDq8iiboXnX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:97061'),
  ('978869939157877549', 'Hitler''s Steel Beast', 2017, 'Documentary', 'Daniel Ablin', null, 'François Delpla, Clive Lamming', null, 'Trace the history of Hitler''s armored private train, a 15-car mobile headquarters boasting state-of-the-art communications and anti-aircraft cannons.', 'Trace the history of Hitler''s armored private train, a 15-car mobile headquarters boasting state-of-the-art communications and anti-aircraft cannons.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pVwIxNxDrSayK3DoT6Dn4JXyMzk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:485219'),
  ('1096269266508535540', 'Hitman', 2007, 'Action, Thriller, Drama', 'Xavier Gens, Laurent Barès, David Campi-Lemaire', 'Skip Woods', 'Timothy Olyphant, Dougray Scott, Olga Kurylenko, Robert Knepper, Ulrich Thomsen, Henry Ian Cusick, Michael Offei, Christian Erickson', 'R', 'A genetically engineered assassin with deadly aim, known only as "Agent 47" eliminates strategic targets for a top-secret organization. But when he''s double-crossed, the hunter becomes the prey as 47 finds himself in a life-or-death game of international intrigue.', 'A genetically engineered assassin with deadly aim, known only as "Agent 47" eliminates strategic targets for a top-secret organization. But when he''s double-crossed, the hunter becomes the prey as 47 finds himself in a life-or-death game of international intrigue.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h69UJOOKlrHcvhl5H2LY74N61DQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1620'),
  ('603568573130301469', 'Hitman 2', 2025, 'Action, Comedy', 'Choi Won-sub, Nam Dong-geun, Lee Jeong-hyeon', 'Shin Jung-ryoul, Choi Won-sub', 'Kwon Sang-woo, Jung Jun-ho, Lee Yi-kyung, Hwang Woo-seul-hye, Lee Ji-won, Kim Seung-o, Lee Soon-won, Lee Jun-hyeok', 'NR', 'After a successful first season, Webtoon "Assassin Jun" is about to begin it''s second season. Out of ideas, Jun uses an anonymous email''s plot in his Webtoon, only to see real-life terrorist attacks resembling the story unfold.', 'After a successful first season, Webtoon "Assassin Jun" is about to begin it''s second season. Out of ideas, Jun uses an anonymous email''s plot in his Webtoon, only to see real-life terrorist attacks resembling the story unfold.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/efCaYlRl0LcZNX15dEz3KxcUigi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1129923'),
  ('176127029290061151', 'Hitman Hart: Wrestling with Shadows', 1998, 'Documentary, TV Movie', 'Paul Jay, Joan Hutton', 'Paul Jay', 'Bret Hart, Owen Hart, Vince McMahon, Steve Austin, Michael Hickenbottom, Mick Foley, Brian Pillman, Blade Hart', null, 'This documentary follows superstar Bret Hart during his last year in the WWF. The film documents the tensions that resulted in The Montreal Screwjob, one of the most controversial events in the history of professional wrestling, in which Vince McMahon, Shawn Micheals, and others, legitimately conspired behind the scenes to go against the script and remove Bret Hart as champion.', 'This documentary follows superstar Bret Hart during his last year in the WWF. The film documents the tensions that resulted in The Montreal Screwjob, one of the most controversial events in the history of professional wrestling, in which Vince McMahon, Shawn Micheals, and others, legitimately conspired behind the scenes to go against the script and remove Bret Hart as champion.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vAMdeGiCv5BRfTXyU1aANaTGl4Y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34303'),
  ('779179525232977084', 'Hitman the Cobra', 1987, 'War, Action', 'Godfrey Ho', null, 'Richard Harrison, Mike Abbott, Nathan Chukueke, Phil Parker, Joan Romano, Robert Miller, Paquito Diaz, Roland Dantes', null, '"The war has reached its peak; the entire country is suffering under the bloody and merciless occupation of enemy troops. Innocent people are being tortured and ruthlessly executed. To put an end to this reign of terror once and for all, the local troops have received support from a handful of highly trained commandos. These commandos are led by the American elite soldier Gordon, who also has a very personal score to settle. The guerrilla troops are under the command of Mike, with whom he shares a gruesome past dating back to the Vietnam War. The day of deadly reckoning is drawing ever closer, and only one will survive." - DVD Back of the Box Description Hong Kong cut and paste edit of the 1984 Filipino War film "Kumander Sumulong" with new scenes.', '"The war has reached its peak; the entire country is suffering under the bloody and merciless occupation of enemy troops. Innocent people are being tortured and ruthlessly executed. To put an end to this reign of terror once and for all, the local troops have received support from a handful of highly trained commandos. These commandos are led by the American elite soldier Gordon, who also has a very personal score to settle. The guerrilla troops are under the command of Mike, with whom he shares a gruesome past dating back to the Vietnam War. The day of deadly reckoning is drawing ever closer, and only one will survive." - DVD Back of the Box Description Hong Kong cut and paste edit of the 1984 Filipino War film "Kumander Sumulong" with new scenes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d4fFIr37XpQ3xxQ8qnAtORvqptB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:205311'),
  ('87744164856956083', 'Hitman: Agent 47', 2015, 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 'Aleksander Bach, Óttar Guðnason, Stephan O. Gessler', 'Michael Finch, Skip Woods', 'Rupert Friend, Zachary Quinto, Hannah Ware, Emilio Rivera, Rolf Kanies, Thomas Kretschmann, Dan Bakkedahl, Ciarán Hinds', 'R', 'An assassin teams up with a woman to help her find her father and uncover the mysteries of her ancestry.', 'An assassin teams up with a woman to help her find her father and uncover the mysteries of her ancestry.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cx9AOBOv9Qf5ufZYQMbfTV7w7VY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:249070'),
  ('840063457575089329', 'Hitman: Agent Jun', 2020, 'Action, Comedy', 'Choi Won-sub, Park Se-seung, Shin Seung-hoon', 'Choi Won-sub, Shin Jung-ryoul', 'Kwon Sang-woo, Jung Jun-ho, Hwang Woo-seul-hye, Lee Yi-kyung, Lee Ji-won, Heo Sung-tae, Jo Woon, Heo Dong-won', null, 'A failing webtoon artist finds he''s drawn a target on his own back after publishing a story containing real secrets from his former life as a superspy.', 'A failing webtoon artist finds he''s drawn a target on his own back after publishing a story containing real secrets from his former life as a superspy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dAt3nolyXLEEuXiIXZwv1iikbcA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:604362'),
  ('18953113028535935', 'Hitman''s Wife''s Bodyguard', 2021, 'Action, Comedy, Crime, Thriller', 'Patrick Hughes, Terry Stacey', 'Phillip Murphy, Brandon Murphy, Tom O''Connor', 'Ryan Reynolds, Samuel L. Jackson, Salma Hayek Pinault, Antonio Banderas, Morgan Freeman, Frank Grillo, Caroline Goodall, Rebecca Front', 'R', 'The world’s most lethal odd couple – bodyguard Michael Bryce and hitman Darius Kincaid – are back on another life-threatening mission. Still unlicensed and under scrutiny, Bryce is forced into action by Darius''s even more volatile wife, the infamous international con artist Sonia Kincaid. As Bryce is driven over the edge by his two most dangerous protectees, the trio get in over their heads in a global plot and soon find that they are all that stand between Europe and a vengeful and powerful madman.', 'The world’s most lethal odd couple – bodyguard Michael Bryce and hitman Darius Kincaid – are back on another life-threatening mission. Still unlicensed and under scrutiny, Bryce is forced into action by Darius''s even more volatile wife, the infamous international con artist Sonia Kincaid. As Bryce is driven over the edge by his two most dangerous protectees, the trio get in over their heads in a global plot and soon find that they are all that stand between Europe and a vengeful and powerful madman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6zwGWDpY8Zu0L6W4SYWERBR8Msw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:522931'),
  ('587927144142080695', 'Hitpig!', 2024, 'Animation, Comedy, Adventure, Family', 'Olaf Skjenna, Philippe Zerounian, David Feiss', 'Tyler Werrin, Dave Rosenbaum', 'Jason Sudeikis, Lilly Singh, Rainn Wilson, Anitta, Hannah Gadsby, RuPaul, Charlie Adler, Flavor Flav', 'PG', 'A porcine bounty hunter accepts his next hit: Pickles, a naive, ebullient elephant. Though he initially sets out to capture the perky pachyderm, the unlikely pair find themselves crisscrossing the globe on an adventure that brings out the best in both of them.', 'A porcine bounty hunter accepts his next hit: Pickles, a naive, ebullient elephant. Though he initially sets out to capture the perky pachyderm, the unlikely pair find themselves crisscrossing the globe on an adventure that brings out the best in both of them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bYa20LYAZ3Q7lKXtLYybo0yWWTN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:756397'),
  ('521684314877084434', 'Hits', 2014, 'Drama, Comedy', 'David Cross, Paul Koestner, Michael S. Chandler', 'David Cross', 'Meredith Hagner, Matt Walsh, James Adomian, Jake Cherry, Derek Waters, Wyatt Cenac, Amy Sedaris, David Koechner', null, 'A talentless teen will do anything to get on TV''s "The Voice." Meanwhile, her father, a municipal worker, creates an uproar when a video of his rants at City Hall goes viral.', 'A talentless teen will do anything to get on TV''s "The Voice." Meanwhile, her father, a municipal worker, creates an uproar when a video of his rants at City Hall goes viral.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w7TdwnSh5McR5J28ZHTvttTKaCi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:242083'),
  ('446149799702938826', 'Hittin'' the Trail for Hallelujah Land', 1931, 'Comedy, Animation, Horror', 'Rudolf Ising, Arthur Lueker', null, 'Ken Darby, Marcellite Garner, Johnny Murray, Rudolf Ising, The King''s Men', null, 'Piggy and Fluffy have adventures on a riverboat and Uncle Tom is chased by skeletons promising to take him to Hallelujah Land.', 'Piggy and Fluffy have adventures on a riverboat and Uncle Tom is chased by skeletons promising to take him to Hallelujah Land.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/79OM2qBQhZM4xtI12moKkElnneE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:162708'),
  ('265814809542802482', 'Hitting a New High', 1937, 'Comedy, Music, Romance', 'Andre Kostelanetz, Dewey Starkey, Raoul Walsh', 'Gertrude Purcell, John Twist', 'Lily Pons, Jack Oakie, Edward Everett Horton, John Howard, Eric Blore, Eduardo Ciannelli, Luis Alberni, Vinton Hayworth', null, 'A Paris cabaret singer dreams of becoming a Metropolitan Opera singer. A press agent arranges her Manhattan debut by way of Africa.', 'A Paris cabaret singer dreams of becoming a Metropolitan Opera singer. A press agent arranges her Manhattan debut by way of Africa.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g553uTpsTGQblnoNP0pbOlpthzU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:77870'),
  ('227403110360107592', 'Hitting the Apex', 2015, 'Documentary', 'Mark Neale, Jan Zabeil, Grant Gee', 'Mark Neale', 'Brad Pitt, Valentino Rossi, Dani Pedrosa, Casey Stoner, Jorge Lorenzo, Marco Simoncelli, Marc Márquez', null, 'The inside story of six fighters – six of the fastest motorcycle racers of all time – and of the fates that awaited them at the peak of the sport. It''s the story of what is at stake for all of them: all that can be won, and all that can be lost, when you go chasing glory at over two hundred miles an hour – on a motorcycle. But this documentary is also an opportunity to understand the passionate relationship that links the pilots, the technical teams and the legions of fans to the spirit of GP Moto.', 'The inside story of six fighters – six of the fastest motorcycle racers of all time – and of the fates that awaited them at the peak of the sport. It''s the story of what is at stake for all of them: all that can be won, and all that can be lost, when you go chasing glory at over two hundred miles an hour – on a motorcycle. But this documentary is also an opportunity to understand the passionate relationship that links the pilots, the technical teams and the legions of fans to the spirit of GP Moto.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lvtyQcHuUc4xh392DeoqPVyUqZk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:357681'),
  ('801484101299094750', 'Hitting the Fan!', 1986, 'Comedy', 'Theo van de Sande, Ruud van Hemert', 'Ruud van Hemert', 'Geert de Jong, Sanne van der Noort, Alexander Mouissie, Rijk de Gooyer, Adelheid Roosen, Hans Veerman, Trudy de Jong, Bartho Braat', null, 'When a wife and mother of two finds out her husband has an affair, she tries to make his life a living hell. The sequel to Dutch move hit Schatjes!', 'When a wife and mother of two finds out her husband has an affair, she tries to make his life a living hell. The sequel to Dutch move hit Schatjes!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6jP7gOBvgHwMFioqM4E7cZFMNLK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:57590'),
  ('132112189647880284', 'Hive', 2021, 'Drama', 'Alex Bloom, Blerta Basholli, Jehona Berisha', 'Blerta Basholli', 'Yllka Gashi, Aurita Agushi, Adriana Matoshi, Kaona Sylejmani, Çun Lajçi, Kumrije Hoxha, Molike Maxhuni, Blerta Ismaili', null, 'Fahrije’s husband has been missing since the war in Kosovo so she sets up her own small business to provide for her kids, but as she fights against a patriarchal society that does not support her, she faces a crucial decision: to wait for his return, or to continue to persevere.', 'Fahrije’s husband has been missing since the war in Kosovo so she sets up her own small business to provide for her kids, but as she fights against a patriarchal society that does not support her, she faces a crucial decision: to wait for his return, or to continue to persevere.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tpIVRbbWM6wvpugYrKvQPY2NQyJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:776541'),
  ('1043287837143847220', 'Hiver 54, l''abbé Pierre', 1989, 'Drama, History', 'Denis Amar, Gérard de Battista', 'Marie Devort, Denis Amar', 'Lambert Wilson, Claudia Cardinale, Robert Hirsch, Bernie Bonvoisin, Antoine Vitez, Bernard Lefort, Maxime Leroux, Wladimir Yordanoff', null, 'Postwar France was slow to recover from the after-effects of the World War Two. The economy was doing poorly, and many people were poor and homeless, sleeping under bridges, etc. The winter of 1953-54 proved particularly difficult for these people, as it was one of the coldest on record. Father Pierre (Lambert Wilson), a parish priest, on seeing the suffering of these people (and their frequent death from the cold), was moved to write the French government seeking help for them. When his letter, which was published in the newspapers, succeeded in rousing overwhelming popular support for helping the homeless, he was able to form a charitable group (still active today) titled "Les Chiffoniers d''Emmaus," or "The Ragpickers of Emmaus" to channel help to them. This biographical film tells the true story of Abbe Pierre''s successful efforts in those years.', 'Postwar France was slow to recover from the after-effects of the World War Two. The economy was doing poorly, and many people were poor and homeless, sleeping under bridges, etc. The winter of 1953-54 proved particularly difficult for these people, as it was one of the coldest on record. Father Pierre (Lambert Wilson), a parish priest, on seeing the suffering of these people (and their frequent death from the cold), was moved to write the French government seeking help for them. When his letter, which was published in the newspapers, succeeded in rousing overwhelming popular support for helping the homeless, he was able to form a charitable group (still active today) titled "Les Chiffoniers d''Emmaus," or "The Ragpickers of Emmaus" to channel help to them. This biographical film tells the true story of Abbe Pierre''s successful efforts in those years.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qNBgjmZYSJVNDe1jGMjLEKjFflA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:179956'),
  ('783458998376985400', 'Ho !', 1968, 'Action, Drama', 'Robert Enrico, Jean Boffety', 'Robert Enrico, Lucienne Hamon, Pierre Pelegri', 'Jean-Paul Belmondo, Joanna Shimkus, Raymond Bussières, Paul Crauchet, Stéphane Fey, Alain Mottet, Tony Taffin, André Weber', null, 'Race driver who has lost his membership card becomes the chauffeur of a gangsters pack', 'Race driver who has lost his membership card becomes the chauffeur of a gangsters pack', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5U5rE82eetYPkWH6IYfYakxJcsp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85392'),
  ('89860813164001814', 'Ho Fatto Splash', 1980, 'Comedy', 'Maurizio Nichetti, Gianluca Massiotta, Lidia Biondi', 'Guido Manuli, Maurizio Nichetti', 'Maurizio Nichetti, Angela Finocchiaro, Luisa Morandini, Carlina Torta, Daniel Bongiovanni, Flavio Bonacci, Walter Valdi, Enzo Radicchio', null, 'Angela, Luisa, and Carlina are three roommates who live in a house in Milan. Maurizio, Carlina''s eccentric cousin, joins the group after waking up from a coma after 20 years. His arrival is crucial to the household''s finances and the girls relationships.', 'Angela, Luisa, and Carlina are three roommates who live in a house in Milan. Maurizio, Carlina''s eccentric cousin, joins the group after waking up from a coma after 20 years. His arrival is crucial to the household''s finances and the girls relationships.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/teb5OXYIVmvKBuEmsCMlTb21kpx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:131897'),
