  ('121671823299286277', 'Hochelaga', 2000, 'Drama', 'Michel Jetté, Larry Lynn', 'Michel Jetté', 'Dominic Darceuil, David Boutin, Ronald Houle, Jean-Nicolas Verreault, Michel Charette, Deano Clavet, Claudia Hurtubise, Patrick Peuvion', null, 'After an unpleasant run-in with a group of bikers, a young convenience store robber (Marc) gets approached by the same bikers to help out with a picnic. After the picnic, seeing he has guts, the bikers propose him for membership. As the story unfolds, Marc winds up questioning his own morality and wondering whether he''s going down the wrong path. The biggest problem, however, is that one of his friends got him into trouble, and he has little time to fix it...', 'After an unpleasant run-in with a group of bikers, a young convenience store robber (Marc) gets approached by the same bikers to help out with a picnic. After the picnic, seeing he has guts, the bikers propose him for membership. As the story unfolds, Marc winds up questioning his own morality and wondering whether he''s going down the wrong path. The biggest problem, however, is that one of his friends got him into trouble, and he has little time to fix it...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mgafYWbtKJEUf3UzQGcjcEk7BZp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:69843'),
  ('1008873263587859274', 'Hochelaga, Land of Souls', 2017, 'Adventure, Drama, History', 'François Girard, Nicolas Bolduc, Pascal Elissalde', 'François Girard', 'Samian, Raoul Max Trujillo, Vincent Perez, Siân Phillips, Sébastien Ricard, Emmanuel Schwartz, Gilles Renaud, Linus Roache', null, 'Mohawk archaeologist Baptiste Asigny engages in a search for his ancestors following a tragic terrain slump in the Percival Molson Stadium.', 'Mohawk archaeologist Baptiste Asigny engages in a search for his ancestors following a tragic terrain slump in the Percival Molson Stadium.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/65vQrkOEorAPo5KyNca0r6MbBJj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:473183'),
  ('682976827010099707', 'Hochzeit auf Immenhof', 1956, 'Comedy, Drama, Family', 'Volker von Collande, Fritz Arno Wagner', 'Per Schwenzen', 'Angelika Meissner, Heidi Brühl, Paul Klinger, Hans Nielsen, Margarete Haagen, Paul Henckels, Karin Andersen, Matthias Fuchs', null, 'The Immenhof has been closed by officials, awaiting auction. In the meantime, Angela has died, so Jochen is now a widower. Oma Jantzen and Angela''s younger sisters Dick and Dalli live with him in the forester''s house. In order to save the manor house, Dalli has started a "pony circus" with the village children in the barn, while Dick has given up hope of Ethelbert ever returning.', 'The Immenhof has been closed by officials, awaiting auction. In the meantime, Angela has died, so Jochen is now a widower. Oma Jantzen and Angela''s younger sisters Dick and Dalli live with him in the forester''s house. In order to save the manor house, Dalli has started a "pony circus" with the village children in the barn, while Dick has given up hope of Ethelbert ever returning.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uq4g96IbOjSscLtvUm58RA09YU6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12551'),
  ('407284269795313991', 'Hochzeit in Rom', 2017, 'TV Movie, Comedy, Romance', 'Kai Longolius, Olaf Kreinsen', 'Anna Samueli, Cecilia Calvi', 'Stefania Rocca, Matthias Zera, Harald Krassnitzer, Ann-Kathrin Kramer, Ricky Tognazzi, Elena Cotta, Annika Ernst, Federica Sabatini', null, 'On business trip in Milan, Bavarian architect Max Hauser falls in love with strong-willed waitress Bianca, who is fired for speaking up to his rude colleagues. When he proposes, she runs, but he traces her to Rome, where he finds she''s actually the multi-titled rebellious daughter of impoverished prince and count Vibaldo D''Arcadia and his snobbish silver spoon wife Gioia, who inhabit a stunning but slowly derelict renaissance palace. When Max asks for her hand, she hastily accepts, and after getting the matriarchal blessing of the countess-mother Donna Costanza, Max invites his parents, egalitarian dentist Walter Hauser and wine merchant Eva and Zahnarzt to attend his socialite wedding. Max is not amused to find his father cornered by his mistress, flight attendant Xenia who demands Waleter''s divorce, a secret they will painfully fail to keep under control, yet the parents refuse to spoil their son''s wedding, but the palatial maid gets wind of half the story and confides into the ...', 'On business trip in Milan, Bavarian architect Max Hauser falls in love with strong-willed waitress Bianca, who is fired for speaking up to his rude colleagues. When he proposes, she runs, but he traces her to Rome, where he finds she''s actually the multi-titled rebellious daughter of impoverished prince and count Vibaldo D''Arcadia and his snobbish silver spoon wife Gioia, who inhabit a stunning but slowly derelict renaissance palace. When Max asks for her hand, she hastily accepts, and after getting the matriarchal blessing of the countess-mother Donna Costanza, Max invites his parents, egalitarian dentist Walter Hauser and wine merchant Eva and Zahnarzt to attend his socialite wedding. Max is not amused to find his father cornered by his mistress, flight attendant Xenia who demands Waleter''s divorce, a secret they will painfully fail to keep under control, yet the parents refuse to spoil their son''s wedding, but the palatial maid gets wind of half the story and confides into the ...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h4Gd8uGlHEv8A7EL2kTD3Otejk6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:436742'),
  ('402625413458333197', 'Hockey Homicide', 1945, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Jack Kinney', null, 'Doodles Weaver, Pinto Colvig', 'NR', 'A crowd gathers at the skating rink to watch the big championship hockey game of the Pelicans versus the Aardvarks. Although referee "Clean Game" Kinney does his best to supervise, the hockey game really gets out of hand eventually. Two star players, Bertino and Ferguson, are so anxious, they never get let out of the penalty box, referee Kinney is never able to drop the puck without being physically hurt somehow, and the spectators themselves are so worked into the game, they take out their aggression on the ice while the players relax in the bleachers.', 'A crowd gathers at the skating rink to watch the big championship hockey game of the Pelicans versus the Aardvarks. Although referee "Clean Game" Kinney does his best to supervise, the hockey game really gets out of hand eventually. Two star players, Bertino and Ferguson, are so anxious, they never get let out of the penalty box, referee Kinney is never able to drop the puck without being physically hurt somehow, and the spectators themselves are so worked into the game, they take out their aggression on the ice while the players relax in the bleachers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f0P2oPEI2vyeWE4p5G9g6V61pwF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:66876'),
  ('902978869658264932', 'Hocus Pocus', 1993, 'Fantasy, Comedy, Family', 'Kenny Ortega, Hiro Narita, Bettiann Fishman', 'Neil Cuthbert, Mick Garris', 'Bette Midler, Sarah Jessica Parker, Kathy Najimy, Omri Katz, Thora Birch, Vinessa Shaw, Tobias Jelinek, Larry Bagby', 'PG', 'After 300 years of slumber, three sister witches are accidentally resurrected in Salem on Halloween night, and it is up to three kids and their newfound feline friend to put an end to the witches'' reign of terror once and for all.', 'After 300 years of slumber, three sister witches are accidentally resurrected in Salem on Halloween night, and it is up to three kids and their newfound feline friend to put an end to the witches'' reign of terror once and for all.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/by4D4Q9NlUjFSEUA1yrxq6ksXmk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10439'),
  ('42272066028490616', 'Hocus Pocus 2', 2022, 'Fantasy, Comedy', 'Anne Fletcher, Elliot Davis, Matthew C. Jacobs', 'Jen D''Angelo', 'Bette Midler, Sarah Jessica Parker, Kathy Najimy, Whitney Peak, Belissa Escobedo, Lilia Buckingham, Froy Gutierrez, Sam Richardson', 'PG', '29 years since the Black Flame Candle was last lit, the 17th-century Sanderson sisters are resurrected, and they are looking for revenge. Now it''s up to three high school students to stop the ravenous witches from wreaking a new kind of havoc on Salem before dawn on All Hallow''s Eve.', '29 years since the Black Flame Candle was last lit, the 17th-century Sanderson sisters are resurrected, and they are looking for revenge. Now it''s up to three high school students to stop the ravenous witches from wreaking a new kind of havoc on Salem before dawn on All Hallow''s Eve.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7ze7YNmUaX81ufctGqt0AgHxRtL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:642885'),
  ('515367439736343160', 'Hoffa', 1992, 'Crime, History, Drama', 'Danny DeVito, Stephen H. Burum', 'David Mamet', 'Jack Nicholson, Danny DeVito, Armand Assante, J.T. Walsh, John C. Reilly, Natalija Nogulich, Kevin Crowley, Robert Prosky', 'R', 'A portrait of union leader James R. Hoffa, as seen through the eyes of his friend, Bobby Ciaro. The film follows Hoffa through his countless battles with the RTA and President Roosevelt.', 'A portrait of union leader James R. Hoffa, as seen through the eyes of his friend, Bobby Ciaro. The film follows Hoffa through his countless battles with the RTA and President Roosevelt.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aMGhaSkhkFwz33hKEsBrJ3ptx3g.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10410'),
  ('161731274603600249', 'Hoffman', 1970, 'Drama', 'Alvin Rakoff, Gerry Turpin', 'Ernest Gebler', 'Peter Sellers, Sinéad Cusack, Jeremy Bulloch, Ruth Dunning, David Lodge, George Hilsdon, John Tatum, Kay Hall', null, 'A businessman blackmails his young secretary into spending a weekend with him.', 'A businessman blackmails his young secretary into spending a weekend with him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yT8nDK3lQzI0s9qgA8iXi2nb2mC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26427'),
  ('654931283328140823', 'Hog Wild', 1930, 'Comedy', 'James Parrott, Jack Stevens', 'H.M. Walker, Oliver Hardy', 'Stan Laurel, Oliver Hardy, Fay Holderness, Dorothy Granger, Charles McMurphy', 'NR', 'First, Ollie can''t find his hat. Then he and Stan attempt to install a rooftop radio antenna.', 'First, Ollie can''t find his hat. Then he and Stan attempt to install a rooftop radio antenna.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dIdBsZ6Qgm2s2oLLOWX36d7WKl0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50928'),
  ('545007064375914846', 'Hogfather', 2007, 'Fantasy, TV Movie', 'Vadim Jean, Gavin Finney, Jan Pester', 'Terry Pratchett', 'David Jason, Marc Warren, Michelle Dockery, David Warner, Tony Robinson, Nigel Planer, Peter Guinness, Stephen Marcus', 'NR', 'It''s the night before Hogswatch, usually a time of joy on Discworld, but there are suspicious going-on and the criminal underworld is abuzz. The beloved Hogfather - the jolly bearer of glee and pork-related gifts for children everywhere - has vanished. Suddenly, Discworld''s entire mythical system is under threat. The fate of this magical time rests in the hands of a very motley group: A band of wizards headed up by a mystical university president named Mustrum Ridcully (Joss Ackland), a loyal manservant called Albert (David Jason), a level-headed governess called Susan Sto Heilt (Michelle Dockery), and her grandfather, who happens to be - Death (Marnix van den Broeke).', 'It''s the night before Hogswatch, usually a time of joy on Discworld, but there are suspicious going-on and the criminal underworld is abuzz. The beloved Hogfather - the jolly bearer of glee and pork-related gifts for children everywhere - has vanished. Suddenly, Discworld''s entire mythical system is under threat. The fate of this magical time rests in the hands of a very motley group: A band of wizards headed up by a mystical university president named Mustrum Ridcully (Joss Ackland), a loyal manservant called Albert (David Jason), a level-headed governess called Susan Sto Heilt (Michelle Dockery), and her grandfather, who happens to be - Death (Marnix van den Broeke).', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t6HqXGne1LkRShTot23Hhlm3z5e.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11910'),
  ('578312125227177729', 'Hogo Fogo Homolka', 1971, 'Comedy', 'Jozef Ort-Šnep, Milan Muchna, Marie Beránková', 'Jaroslav Papoušek', 'Josef Šebánek, Marie Motlová, František Husák, Helena Růžičková, Petr Forman, Matěj Forman, Josef Kolb, Josefa Pechlátová', null, 'The Homolka family celebrates a great occasion: they were finally able to buy a car. They immediately begin to drive for small trips to Hradcany, to the airport, and plan further trips. Their euphoria is spoiled by a letter from their great-grandmother. Their great-grandfather is dying and the family is expected to come along to say goodbye. The annoyed Homolkas therefore set off to the South Bohemian village where the grandparents live.', 'The Homolka family celebrates a great occasion: they were finally able to buy a car. They immediately begin to drive for small trips to Hradcany, to the airport, and plan further trips. Their euphoria is spoiled by a letter from their great-grandmother. Their great-grandfather is dying and the family is expected to come along to say goodbye. The annoyed Homolkas therefore set off to the South Bohemian village where the grandparents live.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aS0OOmmEtM2G1d5Tv8ZkDZXn9Mq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:142725'),
  ('477475263079294657', 'Hoi Polloi', 1935, 'Comedy', 'Del Lord', 'Felix Adler', 'Curly Howard, Larry Fine, Moe Howard, Phyllis Crane, Mary Dees, Poppy Wilde, Bud Jamison, Gino Corrado', 'NR', 'A professor bets that he can turn the stooges into gentlemen. After many attempts to teach them etiquette, he brings them to a fancy society party. The stooges'' new found manners don''t last very long, and the party quickly degenerates. By the end, the other guests have adopted stooge-like behavior and the stooges leave as gentlemen.', 'A professor bets that he can turn the stooges into gentlemen. After many attempts to teach them etiquette, he brings them to a fancy society party. The stooges'' new found manners don''t last very long, and the party quickly degenerates. By the end, the other guests have adopted stooge-like behavior and the stooges leave as gentlemen.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/64TMEYIkFHhxlaJe7cSY1NAWfZM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:115777'),
  ('8344661295134123', 'Hok Kolorob', 2026, 'Drama', 'Raj Chakraborty', 'Raj Chakraborty, Souvik Bhattacharya', 'Saswata Chatterjee, Rohaan Bhattacharya, Om Sahani', null, 'The story explores the shocking death of a fresher allegedly caused by ragging at a city university hostel, reopening wounds and igniting urgent conversations about abuse, accountability, and a system that failed to protect its own.', 'The story explores the shocking death of a fresher allegedly caused by ragging at a city university hostel, reopening wounds and igniting urgent conversations about abuse, accountability, and a system that failed to protect its own.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2F7Zw7VC6eAwYmqpNvCjHWtx9IQS7.jpg', 'plex:movie:hok-kolorob'),
  ('493642687597849218', 'Hokuriku Proxy War', 1977, 'Drama, Crime, Action', 'Kinji Fukasaku, Tôru Nakajima', 'Kōji Takada', 'Hiroki Matsukata, Yumiko Nogawa, Sonny Chiba, Mikio Narita, Kō Nishimura, Takeo Chii, Gorō Ibuki, Hajime Hana', null, 'A Yakuza group from Osaka with dreams of national dominance moves into the snowy Hokuriku region, sparking a bloody turf war with local gangs.', 'A Yakuza group from Osaka with dreams of national dominance moves into the snowy Hokuriku region, sparking a bloody turf war with local gangs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zBN3t9bdnokaEKy2XxmERwxUACp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:91892'),
