  ('310826812437021417', 'HOKUSAI', 2021, 'Drama', 'Hajime Hashimoto, Akihiko Nihonmatsu, Taro Nishiyama', 'Ren Kawahara', 'Yuya Yagira, Min Tanaka, Hiroshi Abe, Eita Nagayama, Hiroshi Tamaki, Munetaka Aoki, Miori Takimoto, Seishu Uragami', null, 'The unknown life of Ukiyo-e artist Katsushika Hokusai in the Edo period, who is said to have painted more than 30,000 works throughout his life, such as "Thirty-Six Views of Mount Fuji"', 'The unknown life of Ukiyo-e artist Katsushika Hokusai in the Edo period, who is said to have painted more than 30,000 works throughout his life, such as "Thirty-Six Views of Mount Fuji"', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AgPcFBUUuYsWSHewO9Wg70IQ7eG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:698215'),
  ('1149127655234795623', 'Hola Frida!', 2025, 'Animation, Family, History', 'Karine Vézina, André Kadi, Karine Vézina', 'André Kadi, Émilie Gabrielle, Sophie Faucher', 'Olivia Ruiz, Emma Rodriguez, Rebeca Gonzales, Léo Côté, Sophie Faucher, Manuel Tadros, Anne Girard, Joey Bélanger', null, 'It’s the story of a little girl who is different. Her world is Coyoacan, Mexico City. Sparkling, vibrant, everything interests her and when difficulties arise, she faces them with an overflowing imagination. This little girl is called Frida Kahlo.', 'It’s the story of a little girl who is different. Her world is Coyoacan, Mexico City. Sparkling, vibrant, everything interests her and when difficulties arise, she faces them with an overflowing imagination. This little girl is called Frida Kahlo.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hY8TslXAaJD0cytxifrhy6h5cJl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1245399'),
  ('1013704383304150380', 'Hold Anything', 1930, 'Animation, Comedy, Family', 'Hugh Harman, Rudolf Ising', null, 'Rochelle Hudson, Johnny Murray', null, 'Bosko is a construction worker who impresses Honey by making music from everything in sight, including a decapitated mouse, a typewriter and a goat filled with hot air.', 'Bosko is a construction worker who impresses Honey by making music from everything in sight, including a decapitated mouse, a typewriter and a goat filled with hot air.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n1mpry07SLPyHf9lAumdCTDACjO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:35135'),
  ('870928423496371754', 'Hold Back the Dawn', 1941, 'Drama, Romance', 'Mitchell Leisen, Leo Tover', 'Charles Brackett, Billy Wilder', 'Charles Boyer, Olivia de Havilland, Paulette Goddard, Victor Francen, Walter Abel, Curt Bois, Rosemary DeCamp, Eric Feldary', 'NR', 'Romanian-French gigolo Georges Iscovescu wishes to enter the USA. Stopped in Mexico by the quota system, he decides to marry an American, then desert her and join his old partner Anita, who''s done likewise. But after sweeping teacher Emmy Brown off her feet, he finds her so sweet that love and jealousy endanger his plans.', 'Romanian-French gigolo Georges Iscovescu wishes to enter the USA. Stopped in Mexico by the quota system, he decides to marry an American, then desert her and join his old partner Anita, who''s done likewise. But after sweeping teacher Emmy Brown off her feet, he finds her so sweet that love and jealousy endanger his plans.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wYfLVAvGZcikP3KI3gTNsrLX3W2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51395'),
  ('760544178206505775', 'Hold Back Tomorrow', 1955, 'Drama, Romance', 'Hugo Haas, Paul Ivano, Byron Roberts', 'Hugo Haas', 'Cleo Moore, John Agar, Frank De Kova, Dallas Boyd, Steffi Sidney, Mel Welles, Harry Guardino, Mona Knox', 'NR', 'A condemned murderer, scheduled to hang in the morning, asks for the company of a woman in his final hours.', 'A condemned murderer, scheduled to hang in the morning, asks for the company of a woman in his final hours.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2lN9T0lBbDdLjGUpPILbfH0a5iI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38058'),
  ('840012894512778712', 'Hold It Now!!!', 2026, 'Comedy, Family', 'Ron Elliott Jr., Carlucci Weyant', 'Ron Elliott Jr.', 'Devin Banks, Quentin Sharpe, Christopher Allen, Aiden Barnes, Madison Barnes', null, 'After returning home from the army, a struggling vet searches for a hidden family fortune but when he discovers that his sneaky nieces have already found it, one is kidnapped by her scheming boyfriend and he teams up with her sisters to rescue her, proving he''s a hero to himself and his family.', 'After returning home from the army, a struggling vet searches for a hidden family fortune but when he discovers that his sneaky nieces have already found it, one is kidnapped by her scheming boyfriend and he teams up with her sisters to rescue her, proving he''s a hero to himself and his family.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fm.media-amazon.com%2Fimages%2FM%2FMV5BYWMwZmQ2OTUtNzYwYy00NzQ4LTg2MzEtNDYyZTlmNzE4OGUyXkEyXkFqcGc%40._V1_.jpg', 'plex:movie:hold-it-now'),
  ('1138252722151672445', 'Hold Me Back', 2020, 'Comedy, Romance, Drama', 'Natsuyo Nakamura, Tomokazu Naruse, Akiko Ohku', 'Akiko Ohku', 'Non, Kento Hayashi, Asami Usuda, Takuya Wakabayashi, Hairi Katagiri, Ai Hashimoto, Tomoya Nakamura, Yuumi Goto', null, 'Mitsuko Kuroda is 31 years old and single. She enjoys her life as a single woman. A big reason why she enjoys her single life is that she has counsellor "A" in her mind, which is her other self. Whenever she does not know what to do, "A" gives her the right answers. She believes her happy and peaceful single life with "A" will continue, but she falls in love with Tada-kun. He is a salesperson and younger than her.', 'Mitsuko Kuroda is 31 years old and single. She enjoys her life as a single woman. A big reason why she enjoys her single life is that she has counsellor "A" in her mind, which is her other self. Whenever she does not know what to do, "A" gives her the right answers. She believes her happy and peaceful single life with "A" will continue, but she falls in love with Tada-kun. He is a salesperson and younger than her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k1T09gj5ZStPkA8QXDiURA2vWBn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:726620'),
  ('1080311823644020638', 'Hold Me Thrill Me Kiss Me', 1992, 'Comedy', 'Joel Hershman, Kent L. Wakeford', 'Joel Hershman', 'Max Parrish, Adrienne Shelly, Sean Young, Diane Ladd, April Rayne, Bela Lehoczky, Ania Suli, Timothy Leary', 'R', 'Eli is a burglar who is caught in the act by Twinkle, an heiress who coerces him into a sexual relationship. Their violent break-up makes him a fugitive in search of a new identity. He lands in a trashy trailer park where he touches the lives of several dysfunctional residents.', 'Eli is a burglar who is caught in the act by Twinkle, an heiress who coerces him into a sexual relationship. Their violent break-up makes him a fugitive in search of a new identity. He lands in a trashy trailer park where he touches the lives of several dysfunctional residents.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8I3FzBPBu7tCgNFlwYJ6LKKtvnD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:214620'),
  ('363842001260807495', 'Hold Me Tight', 2021, 'Drama', 'Christophe Beaucarne, Mathieu Amalric', 'Mathieu Amalric', 'Vicky Krieps, Arieh Worthalter, Anne-Sophie Bowen-Chatet, Sacha Ardilly, Juliette Benveniste, Aurèle Grzesik, Aurélia Petit, Erwan Ribard', null, 'At dawn, Clarisse takes a last look at her husband and two sleeping children, hesitates to leave a note, and hits the road. A desperate escape that gradually reveals its layers as Clarisse — who seems to have an extra-sensory connection to the family she has left behind — loses herself in the world.', 'At dawn, Clarisse takes a last look at her husband and two sleeping children, hesitates to leave a note, and hits the road. A desperate escape that gradually reveals its layers as Clarisse — who seems to have an extra-sensory connection to the family she has left behind — loses herself in the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dVEeFE3s5r6hGQfhuMFlZQZgpMx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:756651'),
  ('1015075110963868991', 'Hold Me While I''m Naked', 1966, 'Comedy, Drama', 'George Kuchar', 'George Kuchar', 'Donna Kerness, George Kuchar, Stella Kuchar, Andrea Lunin, Hope Morris, Steve Packard, Gina Zuckerman', null, 'Presented as loosely autobiographical, Hold Me While I’m Naked centres on the tribulations of an independent filmmaker, frustrated at every turn as he tries to make a film that pretends to artistic merit.', 'Presented as loosely autobiographical, Hold Me While I’m Naked centres on the tribulations of an independent filmmaker, frustrated at every turn as he tries to make a film that pretends to artistic merit.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/80DDYIRdPKNrmsTPAyJrzeGsGkP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:86811'),
  ('195191777546187361', 'Hold Onto Me', 2026, 'Drama', 'Myrsini Aristidou', 'Myrsini Aristidou', 'Hristos Passalis, Maria Petrova, Jenny Sallo, Aulona Lupa, Achilleas Grammatikopoulos', null, '11-year-old Iris learns her estranged father, Aris, is back in town for his own father’s funeral. Determined to know him, Iris tracks him down to a dilapidated shipyard, where he’s been keeping to himself. What begins as a stubborn attempt to reconnect slowly unfolds into a fragile bond.', '11-year-old Iris learns her estranged father, Aris, is back in town for his own father’s funeral. Determined to know him, Iris tracks him down to a dilapidated shipyard, where he’s been keeping to himself. What begins as a stubborn attempt to reconnect slowly unfolds into a fragile bond.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FwuRTutGAHJ2JEOKDNSFHhZuKp36.jpg', 'plex:movie:hold-onto-me-2026'),
  ('851392153876198782', 'Hold That Blonde!', 1945, 'Comedy', 'George Marshall, Daniel L. Fapp', 'Walter DeLeon, Earl Baldwin, Eddie Moran', 'Eddie Bracken, Veronica Lake, Albert Dekker, Frank Fenton, George Zucco, Donald MacBride, Lewis L. Russell, Norma Varden', 'NR', 'Ogden Spencer Trulow III is a wealthy kleptomaniac who turned to stealing when he was spurned by a girl. His psychoanalyst advises him to find another girl for a cure. He fastens his interest upon Sally Martin, who happens to be engaged upon helping some crooks steal a valuable necklace. Complications include two scantily attired individuals, one of them drunk, clinging to the cornice of a skyscraper and a large band of crooks in quest of the precious jewels.', 'Ogden Spencer Trulow III is a wealthy kleptomaniac who turned to stealing when he was spurned by a girl. His psychoanalyst advises him to find another girl for a cure. He fastens his interest upon Sally Martin, who happens to be engaged upon helping some crooks steal a valuable necklace. Complications include two scantily attired individuals, one of them drunk, clinging to the cornice of a skyscraper and a large band of crooks in quest of the precious jewels.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uUOMLSpkGSwq3imkTutHqEoDisP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:285406'),
  ('306151047965253679', 'Hold That Ghost', 1941, 'Comedy, Horror', 'Arthur Lubin, Elwood Bredell, Hans J. Salter', 'Robert Lees, Frederic I. Rinaldo, John Grant', 'Bud Abbott, Lou Costello, Richard Carlson, Joan Davis, Mischa Auer, Evelyn Ankers, Marc Lawrence, Shemp Howard', 'NR', 'Two bumbling service station attendants are left as the sole beneficiaries in a gangster''s will. Their trip to claim their fortune is sidetracked when they are stranded in a haunted house along with several other strangers.', 'Two bumbling service station attendants are left as the sole beneficiaries in a gangster''s will. Their trip to claim their fortune is sidetracked when they are stranded in a haunted house along with several other strangers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9CPix9FAWSiUHoxcDOa8eWZYqJ8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14604'),
  ('256716984522828097', 'Hold That Pose', 1950, 'Comedy, Animation', 'Jack Kinney', null, 'Pinto Colvig, Winston Hibler, Bob Jackman, James MacDonald', 'G', 'Goofy is tired and bored. He needs a hobby and decides to pursue photography. Wildlife is an excellent choice for photography so Goofy decides to take a grizzly bear''s picture. Unfortunately, when Goofy''s flash powder explodes, the bear becomes infuriated and chases Goofy through an amusement park and back to his apartment. Fortunately for Goofy, the bear is pleased with the resulting pictures and ultimately sets up a stand giving his "autographed photo" for $10.', 'Goofy is tired and bored. He needs a hobby and decides to pursue photography. Wildlife is an excellent choice for photography so Goofy decides to take a grizzly bear''s picture. Unfortunately, when Goofy''s flash powder explodes, the bear becomes infuriated and chases Goofy through an amusement park and back to his apartment. Fortunately for Goofy, the bear is pleased with the resulting pictures and ultimately sets up a stand giving his "autographed photo" for $10.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/icn8cA7qB5qXybzUZnEODFC8AxS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:66877'),
  ('196992034995965471', 'Hold the Dark', 2018, 'Thriller, Mystery, Crime', 'Bryant Marshall, Adam Druxman, Joel Tobman', 'Macon Blair', 'Jeffrey Wright, Alexander Skarsgård, James Badge Dale, Riley Keough, Julian Black Antelope, Tantoo Cardinal, Macon Blair, Jonathan Whitesell', null, 'In the grim Alaskan winter, a naturalist hunts for wolves blamed for killing a local boy, but he soon finds himself swept into a chilling mystery.', 'In the grim Alaskan winter, a naturalist hunts for wolves blamed for killing a local boy, but he soon finds himself swept into a chilling mystery.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1etEySwZQnBJpzgplgadPi5y4PL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:395841'),
  ('894101456087180481', 'Hold the Lion, Please', 1942, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Chuck Jones', 'Tedd Pierce', 'Tex Avery, Mel Blanc, Harry Lang, Tedd Pierce', 'NR', 'A lion wants to prove he''s still "King of the Jungle" and, to prove it, he hunts rabbit.', 'A lion wants to prove he''s still "King of the Jungle" and, to prove it, he hunts rabbit.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yH5NK8auETxoPQ5Q1WG1bVm7TNr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:236635'),
  ('217135975181348782', 'Hold You Tight', 1998, 'Drama', 'Stanley Kwan Kam-Pang, Kwan Pung-Leung, Katie Kwan Siu-Wai', 'Jimmy Ngai Shiu-Yan', 'Chingmy Yau Suk-Ching, Sunny Chan Kam-Hung, Eric Tsang Chi-Wai, Lawrence Ko Yu-Luen, Sandra Ng Kwan-Yu, Timothy Shaw Chun-Yung, Rio Peng, Bonnie Wong Man-Wai', null, 'Two women are bound for the same plane, one of whom makes the flight while the other does not. In a cruel twist of fate, the plane crashes, killing everyone on board, and leaving the friends and family of the two women to talk about what was and what could have been.', 'Two women are bound for the same plane, one of whom makes the flight while the other does not. In a cruel twist of fate, the plane crashes, killing everyone on board, and leaving the friends and family of the two women to talk about what was and what could have been.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/blY0NU0I4EQyRf78LawBdkXCHxG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:138060'),
  ('371749867282359454', 'Hold Your Breath', 2012, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Jared Cohn, Stuart Brereton, Dan Golden', 'Kenny Zinn, Geoff Meed', 'Katrina Bowden, Randy Wayne, Erin Marie Hogan, Steve Hanks, Joshua Michael Allen, Jordan Pratt-Thatcher, Gerald Webb, Alex Ball', 'R', 'There is an old wives tale that you should hold your breath when passing by a cemetery because an evil spirit rejected by both heaven and hell can get inside of you when you inhale. Somewhere in a carload of college kids on holiday doesn''t follow the rules when driving by a graveyard, allowing a spirit of a recently executed serial killer to get inside him/her to begin a killing spree of body-jumping carnage.', 'There is an old wives tale that you should hold your breath when passing by a cemetery because an evil spirit rejected by both heaven and hell can get inside of you when you inhale. Somewhere in a carload of college kids on holiday doesn''t follow the rules when driving by a graveyard, allowing a spirit of a recently executed serial killer to get inside him/her to begin a killing spree of body-jumping carnage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w7PJWZOHCLzfnw57TRFTcrLk1Ni.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:127548'),
  ('933753691620435627', 'Hold Your Breath', 2024, 'Horror, Thriller, Drama', 'Dennis Crow, Denise Harkins, Kelsi Drew Howard', 'Karrie Crouse', 'Sarah Paulson, Amiah Miller, Annaleigh Ashford, Alona Jane Robbins, Ebon Moss-Bachrach, Arron Shiver, Bill Heck, Frances Lee McCain', 'R', 'In 1930s Oklahoma amid the region''s horrific dust storms, a woman is convinced that a sinister presence is threatening her family.', 'In 1930s Oklahoma amid the region''s horrific dust storms, a woman is convinced that a sinister presence is threatening her family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cRTDtSjv2RMCokS6naed4RBsuQT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:718014'),
  ('1059728226152831780', 'Hold Your Breath: The Ice Dive', 2022, 'Documentary', 'Ian Derry', null, 'Johanna Nordblad, Elina Manninen', 'PG', 'Follow free diver Johanna Nordblad in this documentary as she attempts to break the world record for distance traveled under ice with one breath.', 'Follow free diver Johanna Nordblad in this documentary as she attempts to break the world record for distance traveled under ice with one breath.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/efAxEHMvlgE4qterU0FWwovxkOa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:958080'),
  ('449392828237672481', 'Hold Your Man', 1933, 'Drama, Romance', 'Sam Wood, Douglas Shearer, Harold Rosson', 'Frances Marion', 'Jean Harlow, Clark Gable, Stuart Erwin, Dorothy Burgess, Muriel Kirkland, Garry Owen, Barbara Barondess, Elizabeth Patterson', null, 'Ruby falls in love with small-time con man Eddie. During a botched blackmail scheme, Eddie accidentally kills the man they were setting up. Eddie takes off and Ruby is sent to a reformatory for two years.', 'Ruby falls in love with small-time con man Eddie. During a botched blackmail scheme, Eddie accidentally kills the man they were setting up. Eddie takes off and Ruby is sent to a reformatory for two years.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xQYkhqL9yQ1aaPp2WXGG7WWRofw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:90957'),
  ('220667107723718817', 'Hold-up', 1985, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Alexandre Arcady, Richard Ciupka', 'Alexandre Arcady, Daniel Saint-Hamont, Francis Veber', 'Jean-Paul Belmondo, Guy Marchand, Kim Cattrall, Jacques Villeret, Jean-Pierre Marielle, Jean-Claude de Goros, Tex Konig, Raymond Aquilon', null, 'Dressed as a clown, the clever rascal Grimm holds up the most secure bank of Montreal and takes 30 hostages. While confusing and ridiculing the police with his strange behavior, he calmly manages to rid the bank of a fortune. But then an unsatisfied companion arouses trouble...', 'Dressed as a clown, the clever rascal Grimm holds up the most secure bank of Montreal and takes 30 hostages. While confusing and ridiculing the police with his strange behavior, he calmly manages to rid the bank of a fortune. But then an unsatisfied companion arouses trouble...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v7ASqmGprPPSI30JmjGNnO8EVlT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40411'),
  ('559674695388798097', 'Holding Trevor', 2007, 'Drama', 'Kara Stephens, Rosser Goodman', null, 'Brent Gorski, Jay Brannan, Melissa Searing, Eli Kranski, Isaiah Garnica, Yaniv Madmon, Dawn Mondie, Mathew Pasillas', 'R', 'After finally breaking up with his drug-addicted lover, Trevor begins a new romance that unexpectedly complicates his other relationships.', 'After finally breaking up with his drug-addicted lover, Trevor begins a new romance that unexpectedly complicates his other relationships.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tS7hKzRrR6OeQvaLmMNHwnZ2Le5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14205'),
  ('703077829624665281', 'Hole in One', 2009, 'Comedy', 'Drew Ann Rosenberg, Byron Werner', 'Mike Terrell', 'Steve Talley, David Ellison, Dean Cameron, Christopher Showerman, Sandra Lynn Ellison, K.T. Tatara, Jerad Anderson, Jossara Jinaro', 'R', 'Eric, a highly-gifted golfer but radically-undisciplined college undergrad, finds his world drastically altered after losing a golf bet to a pair of sadistic plastic surgeons. Eric''s bad-boy attitude lifestyle comes to a screeching halt as he loses his money, his girlfriend, his dignity and his golf swing. Eric and his best friend Tyler decide to take on the doctors, in a final golf match of "Best-Ball" to get his life back and become the man he should have been all along.', 'Eric, a highly-gifted golfer but radically-undisciplined college undergrad, finds his world drastically altered after losing a golf bet to a pair of sadistic plastic surgeons. Eric''s bad-boy attitude lifestyle comes to a screeching halt as he loses his money, his girlfriend, his dignity and his golf swing. Eric and his best friend Tyler decide to take on the doctors, in a final golf match of "Best-Ball" to get his life back and become the man he should have been all along.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Af7Vt2GaMDIfzEnrUVJevYk0Kek.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45781'),
  ('1022318244568961583', 'Hole in the Moon', 1964, 'Comedy', 'Uri Zohar, David Gurfinkel', 'Amos Kenan', 'Uri Zohar, Arik Lavie, Shmulik Kraus, Israel Gurion, Shaike Ophir, Shoshik Shani, Avraham Heffner, Shoshana Shani-Lavie', null, 'A comic and episodic satire, the film uses improvisation to illustrate the clash between fantasy and reality in real life. Although conceived in the style of Mekas’ “Hallelujah the hills” (1962), it’s an authentically Israeli satire, an openly rebellious and individualistic expression that poked fun at the sacred myths of earlier zionist films. The technique of film within the film is used to portray cinema as reflection of the imagination, a miracle based on dreams and fantasies that take on concrete characteristics – parallel to the miracle of Israel, the dream that has become reality. Although not a commercial success, its importance is beyond any measure, though it remains a unique experiment, boldly uncommercial and subversive, out of any context in that patriotic, ideological epoch.', 'A comic and episodic satire, the film uses improvisation to illustrate the clash between fantasy and reality in real life. Although conceived in the style of Mekas’ “Hallelujah the hills” (1962), it’s an authentically Israeli satire, an openly rebellious and individualistic expression that poked fun at the sacred myths of earlier zionist films. The technique of film within the film is used to portray cinema as reflection of the imagination, a miracle based on dreams and fantasies that take on concrete characteristics – parallel to the miracle of Israel, the dream that has become reality. Although not a commercial success, its importance is beyond any measure, though it remains a unique experiment, boldly uncommercial and subversive, out of any context in that patriotic, ideological epoch.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/huzVEMROKnpFQSH14VWUI0qdzc6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44350'),
  ('21790839055965489', 'Hole-in-law', 2020, 'Romance', 'Lee Sang-soo', null, 'Seung Ha, Han Yi-seul, Min Do-yoon, Kang Min-woo, Alex-I', null, 'An omnibus movie about the jealousy of a man who can''t stand the fact that his favorite woman slept with another man in two episodes. Episode 1 At a drinking party led by Jae-hoon, movie director Sang-min meets Hye-jin. Sang-min compliments and sleeps with her favorite Hye-jin while watching her movie. The next morning, Hye-jin''s friend Mina left early because of her job, Jae-hoon and Sang-min, who were watching a movie together in Hye-jin''s bed are attracted by the atmosphere and curiosity and enjoy 2 to 1. Episode 2 Sang-min meets his school friend Ji-eun at the club. When his foreign friend James showed interest in Ji-eun, Sang-min suddenly became interested in Ji-eun. That night, Sang-min finds out that Ji-eun slept with James, and visits Ji-eun''s house with complex emotions mixed with like, anger and jealousy and confesses that he likes her.', 'An omnibus movie about the jealousy of a man who can''t stand the fact that his favorite woman slept with another man in two episodes. Episode 1 At a drinking party led by Jae-hoon, movie director Sang-min meets Hye-jin. Sang-min compliments and sleeps with her favorite Hye-jin while watching her movie. The next morning, Hye-jin''s friend Mina left early because of her job, Jae-hoon and Sang-min, who were watching a movie together in Hye-jin''s bed are attracted by the atmosphere and curiosity and enjoy 2 to 1. Episode 2 Sang-min meets his school friend Ji-eun at the club. When his foreign friend James showed interest in Ji-eun, Sang-min suddenly became interested in Ji-eun. That night, Sang-min finds out that Ji-eun slept with James, and visits Ji-eun''s house with complex emotions mixed with like, anger and jealousy and confesses that he likes her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ZAhAOX5RsstfrbLtkSjiUZGgw2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:724109'),
  ('585719382248039811', 'Holes', 2003, 'Adventure, Family, Drama, Comedy', 'Stephen St. John, Andrew Davis, Austin Gorg', 'Louis Sachar', 'Shia LaBeouf, Khleo Thomas, Sigourney Weaver, Jon Voight, Tim Blake Nelson, Patricia Arquette, Dulé Hill, Henry Winkler', 'PG', 'After being wrongfully convicted for stealing a pair of shoes, Stanley Yelnats is sent away to Camp Green Lake, a boys detention facility where inmates are forced to dig holes all day in the hot desert sun as a form of character building. But Stanley and the other boys start to unravel a mystery, linked with the camps tough-as-nails warden —and possibly Stanley’s family itself.', 'After being wrongfully convicted for stealing a pair of shoes, Stanley Yelnats is sent away to Camp Green Lake, a boys detention facility where inmates are forced to dig holes all day in the hot desert sun as a form of character building. But Stanley and the other boys start to unravel a mystery, linked with the camps tough-as-nails warden —and possibly Stanley’s family itself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o2Dm2mcE1qW8vT0bpsJO5OMBbqa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8326'),
  ('120400036946960910', 'Holidate', 2020, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Cody Williams, Rob Burgess, John Whitesell', 'Tiffany Paulsen', 'Emma Roberts, Luke Bracey, Kristin Chenoweth, Frances Fisher, Andrew Bachelor, Manish Dayal, Jessica Capshaw, Alex Moffat', null, 'Fed up with being single on holidays, two strangers agree to be each other''s platonic plus-ones all year long, only to catch real feelings along the way.', 'Fed up with being single on holidays, two strangers agree to be each other''s platonic plus-ones all year long, only to catch real feelings along the way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oXCLSlCRWWHsSSwLJSVIC0DDWsE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:615665'),
  ('371534124806062305', 'Holiday', 1930, 'Romance, Drama, Comedy', 'Edward H. Griffith, Norbert Brodine, Paul Jones', 'Horace Jackson', 'Ann Harding, Mary Astor, Edward Everett Horton, Robert Ames, Hedda Hopper, Hallam Cooley, William Holden, Creighton Hale', 'NR', 'A young man is torn between his free-thinking lifestyle and the tradition of his wealthy fiancée''s family.', 'A young man is torn between his free-thinking lifestyle and the tradition of his wealthy fiancée''s family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5ggQTQYq6415C82CWUGcu5RghCA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:104219'),
  ('399581774139656909', 'Holiday', 1938, 'Comedy, Romance, Drama', 'George Cukor, Lionel Banks, Morris Stoloff', 'Donald Ogden Stewart, Sidney Buchman', 'Katharine Hepburn, Cary Grant, Doris Nolan, Lew Ayres, Edward Everett Horton, Henry Kolker, Binnie Barnes, Jean Dixon', 'NR', 'Johnny Case, a freethinking financier, has finally found the girl of his dreams — Julia Seton, the spoiled daughter of a socially prominent millionaire — and she''s agreed to marry him. But when Johnny plans a holiday for the two to enjoy life while they are still young, his fiancée has other plans & that is for Johnny to work in her father''s bank!', 'Johnny Case, a freethinking financier, has finally found the girl of his dreams — Julia Seton, the spoiled daughter of a socially prominent millionaire — and she''s agreed to marry him. But when Johnny plans a holiday for the two to enjoy life while they are still young, his fiancée has other plans & that is for Johnny to work in her father''s bank!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vTswoixIge9o84NLlWGaWl5lrHO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16274'),
  ('922801964669236063', 'Holiday', 2006, 'Drama, Crime, Thriller', 'Lee Seong-hwan, Yun-ho Yang, Shin Ok-hyun', 'Kim Hee-jae', 'Lee Sung-jae, Choi Min-soo, Jang Se-jin, Lee Eol, Moon Young-dong, Kim Dong-hyun, Yeo Hyun-soo, Lee Bong-gyu', null, 'After 1988 Seoul Olympic, Ji Kang-heon, who is sentenced for 7 years, and other inmates escape from the police van. After escaping, Ji Kang-heon and inmates make the entire Seoul under fear while they hold hostages.', 'After 1988 Seoul Olympic, Ji Kang-heon, who is sentenced for 7 years, and other inmates escape from the police van. After escaping, Ji Kang-heon and inmates make the entire Seoul under fear while they hold hostages.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bjYhn9XRzAIVixo8WgoQLA9jngS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13311'),
  ('542135176067983436', 'Holiday', 2010, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Guillaume Nicloux, Georges Lechaptois', 'Jean-Bernard Pouy, Nathalie Leuthreau, Guillaume Nicloux', 'Jean-Pierre Darroussin, Judith Godrèche, Josiane Balasko, Pascal Bongard, Biyouna, Françoise Lebrun, Nicolas Jouhet, Stéphan Wojtowicz', null, 'After a crazy and tumultuous night embellished with singular encounters, Michel''s awakening is brutal and painful. Not only does he find himself accused of murder, but his wife cannot be found.', 'After a crazy and tumultuous night embellished with singular encounters, Michel''s awakening is brutal and painful. Not only does he find himself accused of murder, but his wife cannot be found.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yWJnMQgvqWKwnjJ2TelUeXlJ3Ji.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51074'),
  ('753517013522478700', 'Holiday', 2014, 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 'A. R. Murugadoss, Natarajan Subramaniam', null, 'Akshay Kumar, Sonakshi Sinha, Freddy Daruwala, Govinda, Sumeet Raghvan, Zakir Hussain, Apoorva Arora, Cherry Mardia', null, 'Virat Bakshi, an Indian army soldier on vacation stumbles upon a terror plot to rip Mumbai apart with a series of bomb blasts and must hunt down the sleeper cell of the terror organisation before it''s too late.', 'Virat Bakshi, an Indian army soldier on vacation stumbles upon a terror plot to rip Mumbai apart with a series of bomb blasts and must hunt down the sleeper cell of the terror organisation before it''s too late.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8aPPza9BHumJYl0KAABmOdFbUjm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:273886'),
  ('350459336789692801', 'Holiday', 2018, 'Drama, Crime', 'Isabella Eklöf, Nadim Carlsen, Begütay Temurhan', 'Johanne Algren, Isabella Eklöf', 'Vic Carmen Sonne, Lai Yde, Thijs Römer, Yuval Segal, Bo Brønnum, Adam Ild Rohweder, Morten Hemmingsen, Mill Jober', null, 'Sascha, the young and beautiful trophy girlfriend of a Danish drug lord, arrives at his holiday villa in the seaside town of Bodrum, on the Turkish Riviera, where she is welcomed into his inner circle. Under the summer sun, she lives a carefree dream of luxury and fun until she meets Tomas, a Dutch traveler trying to discover himself.', 'Sascha, the young and beautiful trophy girlfriend of a Danish drug lord, arrives at his holiday villa in the seaside town of Bodrum, on the Turkish Riviera, where she is welcomed into his inner circle. Under the summer sun, she lives a carefree dream of luxury and fun until she meets Tomas, a Dutch traveler trying to discover himself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5NU063sVE2Y3zNg8isOIG5RSrDL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:490033'),
  ('276360710712453020', 'Holiday', 2023, 'Drama', 'Edoardo Gabbriellini', 'Edoardo Gabbriellini, Carlo Salsa', 'Margherita Corradi, Giorgia Frank, Alessandro Tedeschi, Alice Arcuri, Alessia Giuliani, Flavio Furno, Massimo Mesciulam, Alessio De Persio', null, 'Veronica, after a long trial and two years in prison for the alleged murder of her mother and her lover, is found innocent. She is only twenty years old, but it is difficult to look ahead...', 'Veronica, after a long trial and two years in prison for the alleged murder of her mother and her lover, is found innocent. She is only twenty years old, but it is difficult to look ahead...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aibnjQQ5kqAshG0HN2Alzz9iaES.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1084140'),
  ('532219916093744184', 'Holiday Affair', 1949, 'Comedy, Romance, Drama', 'Don Hartman, C. Bakaleinikoff, Milton Krasner', 'Isobel Lennart', 'Robert Mitchum, Janet Leigh, Wendell Corey, Griff Barnett, Esther Dale, Henry O''Neill, Harry Morgan, Larry J. Blake', 'NR', 'Just before Christmas, department store clerk Steve Mason meets big spending customer Connie Ennis, who''s actually a comparison shopper sent by another store. Steve lets her go, which gets him fired. They spend the afternoon together, which doesn''t sit well with Connie''s steady suitor, Carl, when he finds out, but delights her young son Timmy, who quickly takes to Steve.', 'Just before Christmas, department store clerk Steve Mason meets big spending customer Connie Ennis, who''s actually a comparison shopper sent by another store. Steve lets her go, which gets him fired. They spend the afternoon together, which doesn''t sit well with Connie''s steady suitor, Carl, when he finds out, but delights her young son Timmy, who quickly takes to Steve.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aQsQJNiRI8L8pBBrCIGUUXNtv2M.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24863'),
  ('529326716722442145', 'Holiday Camp', 1947, 'Comedy', 'Ken Annakin, Jack E. Cox', 'Muriel Box, Sydney Box, Peter Rogers', 'Flora Robson, Dennis Price, Jack Warner, Kathleen Harrison, Hazel Court, Yvonne Owen, Esmond Knight, Jimmy Hanley', 'NR', 'The Huggett family go to a holiday camp, and get involved in crooked card players, a murderer on the run, and a pregnant young girl and her boyfriend missing from home.', 'The Huggett family go to a holiday camp, and get involved in crooked card players, a murderer on the run, and a pregnant young girl and her boyfriend missing from home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5u6L3p3u8xMuuLJlxffqw0bzw97.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47228'),
  ('795684010623572032', 'Holiday Camp', 2010, 'Drama', 'Pascal-Alex Vincent', 'Guillaume Nail', 'Axel Wursten, Paul Perles, Côme Levin, Laura Boujenah, Emylou Brunet, Alexis Michalik', null, 'At a meeting of the game "Truth or Dare?" two young boys, Matthew and Maximus, are challenging to embrace. The kiss will cause them some excitement. From that time, teens who witnessed this scene are allusions more or less directly to the possible homosexuality of Maxim. A revelation will then destabilize the group.', 'At a meeting of the game "Truth or Dare?" two young boys, Matthew and Maximus, are challenging to embrace. The kiss will cause them some excitement. From that time, teens who witnessed this scene are allusions more or less directly to the possible homosexuality of Maxim. A revelation will then destabilize the group.', null, 'tmdb:movie:240500'),
  ('937347208964478981', 'Holiday Crashers', 2024, 'TV Movie, Comedy, Romance', 'Michael Robison, Mel Ward, Clea Mihalik', null, 'Lyndsy Fonseca, Daniella Monet, Chris McNally, Jag Bal, Keith MacKechnie, Daylin Willis, Heather-Claire Nortey, Andy Nez', null, 'Best friends Toni and Bri, working at a card print shop, decide to crash the amazing Christmas parties from some of the shop''s confidential invitations for a bit of harmless fun. Harmless that is, until Toni is mistaken for a lawyer and they get whisked away to a fancy corporate Christmas retreat in the snowy Vermont mountains by handsome business mogul.', 'Best friends Toni and Bri, working at a card print shop, decide to crash the amazing Christmas parties from some of the shop''s confidential invitations for a bit of harmless fun. Harmless that is, until Toni is mistaken for a lawyer and they get whisked away to a fancy corporate Christmas retreat in the snowy Vermont mountains by handsome business mogul.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hcWk9ttwj4zXD0QduTkm377cToq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1358987'),
  ('1024427695444994661', 'Holiday Engagement', 2011, 'Comedy, Romance, TV Movie', 'Jim Fall, John Matysiak, Trent Dempsey', null, 'Bonnie Somerville, Jordan Bridges, Chris L. McKenna, Edi Patterson, Shelley Long, Sam McMurray, Haylie Duff, Carrie Wiita', 'NR', 'Thirty-something Hillary Burns has spent her life trying to get the approval of her parents, in the shadow of her more successfully-attached siblings. So when Hillary''s fiance, workaholic lawyer Jason King, dumps her because she isn''t willing to relocate for his potential promotion, she panics because she had been promising to bring him home to meet her expectant family, whom she does not want to let down! As a last-minute idea, her best friend Sophie convinces her to actually hire someone to "play the role" of Jason for her return home on Thanksgiving.. leading to an interesting combination of sparks & revelations for all involved.', 'Thirty-something Hillary Burns has spent her life trying to get the approval of her parents, in the shadow of her more successfully-attached siblings. So when Hillary''s fiance, workaholic lawyer Jason King, dumps her because she isn''t willing to relocate for his potential promotion, she panics because she had been promising to bring him home to meet her expectant family, whom she does not want to let down! As a last-minute idea, her best friend Sophie convinces her to actually hire someone to "play the role" of Jason for her return home on Thanksgiving.. leading to an interesting combination of sparks & revelations for all involved.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4yM1krPnjkWhIOmrY33mVQgSwXJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:82099'),
  ('24863386724544962', 'Holiday for Henrietta', 1952, 'Comedy', 'Julien Duvivier, Roger Hubert', 'Henri Jeanson, Julien Duvivier', 'Dany Robin, Michel Auclair, Hildegard Knef, Michel Roux, Louis Seigner, Henri Crémieux, Micheline Francey, Daniel Ivernel', null, 'Two scriptwriters argue about the fate of Henrietta, a charming and gamine shopgirl. One favors a comical path for their heroine, who is overcome with sentimental love for a young photographer on Bastille Day. The other has a more thrilling and dastardly fate in mind for her. Among the film''s irresistible conceits is Hildegarde Neff as an oversexed circus bareback rider.', 'Two scriptwriters argue about the fate of Henrietta, a charming and gamine shopgirl. One favors a comical path for their heroine, who is overcome with sentimental love for a young photographer on Bastille Day. The other has a more thrilling and dastardly fate in mind for her. Among the film''s irresistible conceits is Hildegarde Neff as an oversexed circus bareback rider.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qGGsEVGIVUPcmt8PrLNEHBQ3SCH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4709'),
  ('1024242720138072580', 'Holiday for Shoestrings', 1946, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Friz Freleng', null, 'Mel Blanc', null, 'To the tune of The Nutcracker, a number of elves do all the work in a shoe shop.', 'To the tune of The Nutcracker, a number of elves do all the work in a shoe shop.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eC6cCccpMxgebyGUaeuLq99UpY7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:237073'),
