  ('109830347591582788', 'Holiday in the Vineyards', 2023, 'Romance, Drama', 'Alex Ranarivelo', 'Cecilia Franco, David Zanardi', 'Josh Swickard, Sol Rodriguez, Eileen Davidson, Annika Noelle, Carly Jibson, Omar Gooding, Julian Rangel, Carlos Solórzano', 'PG', 'A widow struggling to keep the local vineyard and raising her two young boys may be in store for a Christmas miracle when she falls for a big city playboy sent to get intel on a prospective vineyard for sale.', 'A widow struggling to keep the local vineyard and raising her two young boys may be in store for a Christmas miracle when she falls for a big city playboy sent to get intel on a prospective vineyard for sale.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zJdW13xObKM3lmLsLAFGnCfrXza.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1189733'),
