  ('585479523169376956', 'Holiday on Mars', 2020, 'Comedy, Science Fiction', 'Filippo Orobello, Matteo Spagni, Gino Sgreva', 'Neri Parenti, Gianluca Bomprezzi', 'Christian De Sica, Massimo Boldi, Milena Vukotić, Lucia Mascino, Paola Minaccioni, Denise Tantucci, Herbert Ballerina, Fiammetta Cicogna', null, 'We are in 2030, and on vacation we go to Mars! Having made his wife and son Giulio lose his tracks for years, Fabio (Christian De Sica) is about to marry the wealthy Bea on Mars. But what could happen if during an excursion into space, something goes wrong and Giulio suddenly becomes a sprightly old man (Massimo Boldi)? Between hilarious unexpected events and amusing misunderstandings, Fabio will find himself dealing with a seventy-year-old son and a marriage that is in danger of jumping ...', 'We are in 2030, and on vacation we go to Mars! Having made his wife and son Giulio lose his tracks for years, Fabio (Christian De Sica) is about to marry the wealthy Bea on Mars. But what could happen if during an excursion into space, something goes wrong and Giulio suddenly becomes a sprightly old man (Massimo Boldi)? Between hilarious unexpected events and amusing misunderstandings, Fabio will find himself dealing with a seventy-year-old son and a marriage that is in danger of jumping ...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xToifX6n4U5WZoiiBMaPiibyjXr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:727246'),
  ('624230563243084001', 'Holiday on the Buses', 1973, 'Comedy', 'Bryan Izzard, Brian Probyn', 'Ronald Wolfe, Ronald Chesney', 'Reg Varney, Stephen Lewis, Doris Hare, Michael Robbins, Anna Karen, Bob Grant, Wilfrid Brambell, Kate Williams', null, 'Due to a female passenger falling out of her top whilst running for the bus Stan is distracted and crashes the bus resulting in the depot managers car being written off. As a result Stan, Jack and Blakey are fired. Stan and Jack soon get new jobs as a bus crew at a Pontins holiday resort but discover that Blakey has also gotten a job there as the chief security guard.', 'Due to a female passenger falling out of her top whilst running for the bus Stan is distracted and crashes the bus resulting in the depot managers car being written off. As a result Stan, Jack and Blakey are fired. Stan and Jack soon get new jobs as a bus crew at a Pontins holiday resort but discover that Blakey has also gotten a job there as the chief security guard.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3ewJwuY28E4RzCRf2lklwvzPrsK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19249'),
  ('652698254113504216', 'Holiday Road', 2023, 'TV Movie, Drama, Romance', 'Martin Wood, Graham Talbot, Nelson Talbot', 'Grant Scharbo, Gina Matthews', 'Sara Canning, Warren Christie, Enid-Raye Adams, Kiefer O''Reilly, Brittany-Ellen Willacy, Trevor Lerner, Princess Davis, Sharon Crandall', 'G', 'A travel writer, a tech entrepreneur, a devoted mother and more strangers are stranded at the airport for the holidays, they rent a van for an unexpected road trip.', 'A travel writer, a tech entrepreneur, a devoted mother and more strangers are stranded at the airport for the holidays, they rent a van for an unexpected road trip.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4XfxvKm0gAgOFBOL8vguBCiLxiI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1180791'),
  ('363229465551703336', 'Holiday Rush', 2019, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Steve Parys, Anne Marie Dentici, Ryan Klutch', 'Greg Cope White, Sean Dwyer', 'Sonequa Martin-Green, La La Anthony, Deon Cole, Stormi Maya, Tamala Jones, Romany Malco, Roscoe Orman, Darlene Love', null, 'After his sudden firing, a popular radio DJ moves in with his aunt, bringing along his four spoiled children, and a plan to return to the airwaves.', 'After his sudden firing, a popular radio DJ moves in with his aunt, bringing along his four spoiled children, and a plan to return to the airwaves.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ccL8XtMJSAl5VRoOdyKn7Cd0QA2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:639609'),
  ('335633021330614936', 'Holiday Touchdown: A Chiefs Love Story', 2024, 'Romance, TV Movie', 'John Putch, Andrew Rawson, Ryan Tighe', 'Julie Sherman Wolfe', 'Hunter King, Tyler Hynes, Ed Begley Jr., Megyn Price, Diedrich Bader, Christine Ebersole, Richard Riehle, Jamie Addison', null, 'Alana Higman, a die-hard Kansas City Chiefs fan, and her family are competing to win the team''s Fan of the Year contest, in a process judged by the director of fan engagement Derrick. As the pair spends time together, it''s clear there''s a spark between them. But when her grandfather''s vintage Chiefs good luck winter hat goes missing, Alana begins to doubt everything she believed about fate, destiny and even questions her future with Derrick.', 'Alana Higman, a die-hard Kansas City Chiefs fan, and her family are competing to win the team''s Fan of the Year contest, in a process judged by the director of fan engagement Derrick. As the pair spends time together, it''s clear there''s a spark between them. But when her grandfather''s vintage Chiefs good luck winter hat goes missing, Alana begins to doubt everything she believed about fate, destiny and even questions her future with Derrick.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8LiR0eSpagTqq4ZSG2p4MnqJZNC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1319443'),
  ('468063901476855975', 'Holidays', 2016, 'Comedy, Horror, Fantasy, Mystery', 'Brian James Fitzpatrick, Kevin Smith, Nicholas McCarthy', 'Nicholas McCarthy, Kevin Kölsch, Gary Shore', 'Madeleine Coghlan, Savannah Kennick, Rick Peters, Kate Rachesky, Marilyn Flores, Emily Hagins, Sierra Malo, Aimee Sagara', 'R', 'An anthology feature film that puts a uniquely dark and original spin on some of the most iconic and beloved holidays of all time by challenging our folklore, traditions and assumptions.', 'An anthology feature film that puts a uniquely dark and original spin on some of the most iconic and beloved holidays of all time by challenging our folklore, traditions and assumptions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5FXtPtetZaB0giJEqC6mOLBr15A.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:323262'),
  ('1133502254981955499', 'Holidays at All Cost', 2020, 'Comedy', 'Stevan Lee Mraovitch, Hugo Le Gourrierec', null, 'Donia Eden, Priska Peraste, Djibril Gueye, Oumar Diaw, Wesley Weigel, Benjamin Garnier, Véronique Berthoud, Lise Marsault-Hierro', null, 'It has been seven years since Frederic has taken his beautiful wife and son away from Paris for a summer vacation. This year, he is determined to offer them an unforgettable holiday at all cost. But, as usual, his scoundrel boss takes advantage of his kindness to not properly pay him. Without the cash to pay for a hotel, Frederic makes a deal with his friend, Jean-Luc, the director of a luxury resort in the South of France. The secret agreement between the two is simple: one day of work for one day at the resort. Frederic will have to handle the most outrageous and despicable tasks in order to keep the resort running smoothly, and all this, far from his wife and son who are unaware of the deal. What follows is both hysterical and horrifying as Jean-Luc attempts to seduce Fredric’s wife and Fredric finds himself in the most hilariously, preposterous positions. Will someone come to his rescue to save their vacation…and his marriage?', 'It has been seven years since Frederic has taken his beautiful wife and son away from Paris for a summer vacation. This year, he is determined to offer them an unforgettable holiday at all cost. But, as usual, his scoundrel boss takes advantage of his kindness to not properly pay him. Without the cash to pay for a hotel, Frederic makes a deal with his friend, Jean-Luc, the director of a luxury resort in the South of France. The secret agreement between the two is simple: one day of work for one day at the resort. Frederic will have to handle the most outrageous and despicable tasks in order to keep the resort running smoothly, and all this, far from his wife and son who are unaware of the deal. What follows is both hysterical and horrifying as Jean-Luc attempts to seduce Fredric’s wife and Fredric finds himself in the most hilariously, preposterous positions. Will someone come to his rescue to save their vacation…and his marriage?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8wGkUEfEaydo3uFJCyP3nlPCes4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:965548'),
  ('555568730550000544', 'Holidays by the Sea', 2011, 'Comedy', 'Pascal Rabaté, Benoît Chamaillard', 'Pascal Rabaté, Scop', 'Jacques Gamblin, Maria de Medeiros, François Damiens, François Morel, Dominique Pinon, Arsène Mosca, Marie Kremer, Chantal Neuwirth', null, 'A comedy about funny adventures of the group of French people during the summer vacation.', 'A comedy about funny adventures of the group of French people during the summer vacation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uuE5Eof3QAKSBZkSeDGkq9RqGV8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:79850'),
  ('857477247637294877', 'Holland', 2025, 'Thriller, Mystery', 'Mimi Cave, Hiro Koda, Peter Thorell', 'Andrew Sodroski', 'Nicole Kidman, Gael García Bernal, Matthew Macfadyen, Jude Hill, Jeff Pope, Isaac Krasner, Lennon Parham, Rachel Sennott', 'R', 'Teacher Nancy''s life with her husband in Holland, Michigan, tumbles into a twisted tale when she and a colleague become suspicious of a secret.', 'Teacher Nancy''s life with her husband in Holland, Michigan, tumbles into a twisted tale when she and a colleague become suspicious of a secret.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/39jIr3A4ScUeGxFdMeARYKNxTgU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:257094'),
  ('647911084647400824', 'Holler', 2021, 'Drama', 'Dustin Lane, Nicole Riegel, Tracy Rosenblum', 'Nicole Riegel', 'Jessica Barden, Pamela Adlon, Becky Ann Baker, Austin Amelio, Gus Halper, Grace Kaiser, Larry Jones, Joe Hemsley', 'R', 'In a forgotten pocket of Southern Ohio where American manufacturing and opportunity are drying up, a determined young woman finds a ticket out when she is accepted to college. Alongside her older brother, Ruth Avery joins a dangerous scrap metal crew in order to pay her way. Together, they spend one brutal winter working the scrap yards during the day and stealing valuable metal from the once thriving factories by night. With her goal in sight, Ruth finds that the ultimate cost of an education for a girl like her may be more than she bargained for, and she soon finds herself torn between a promising future and the family she would leave behind.', 'In a forgotten pocket of Southern Ohio where American manufacturing and opportunity are drying up, a determined young woman finds a ticket out when she is accepted to college. Alongside her older brother, Ruth Avery joins a dangerous scrap metal crew in order to pay her way. Together, they spend one brutal winter working the scrap yards during the day and stealing valuable metal from the once thriving factories by night. With her goal in sight, Ruth finds that the ultimate cost of an education for a girl like her may be more than she bargained for, and she soon finds herself torn between a promising future and the family she would leave behind.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7pqE8HeWv7Mqrjqi0QHTTfP1tvC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:665886'),
  ('595352085150045942', 'Hollow', 2011, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Michael Axelgaard', 'Matthew Holt', 'Emily Plumtree, Sam Stockman, Jessica Ellerby, Matt Stokoe', null, 'An old monastery in a small, remote village in Suffolk, England has been haunted by a local legend for centuries. Left in ruin and shrouded by the mystery of a dark spirit that wills young couples to suicide, the place has been avoided for years, marked only by a twisted, ancient tree with an ominous hollow said to be the home of great evil. When four friends on holiday explore the local folklore, they realize that belief in a myth can quickly materialize into reality, bringing horror to life for the town.', 'An old monastery in a small, remote village in Suffolk, England has been haunted by a local legend for centuries. Left in ruin and shrouded by the mystery of a dark spirit that wills young couples to suicide, the place has been avoided for years, marked only by a twisted, ancient tree with an ominous hollow said to be the home of great evil. When four friends on holiday explore the local folklore, they realize that belief in a myth can quickly materialize into reality, bringing horror to life for the town.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bXy8r2WysptFJMmTvYDErMg5X34.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:127626'),
  ('297919614221887560', 'Hollow', 2021, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Jonathan Zaurin', 'Keith Temple', 'Pat Garrett, Pete Bird, Ellie Jeffreys, Ben Manning, Pablo Raybould, Michael Coombes, Ayvianna Snow, Keith Temple', null, 'A woman with early signs of Alzheimer''s begins to have lucid dreams and nightmares that a living Punch puppet has moved in with her and her family. She uncovers something sinister is observing her every move.', 'A woman with early signs of Alzheimer''s begins to have lucid dreams and nightmares that a living Punch puppet has moved in with her and her family. She uncovers something sinister is observing her every move.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a2NCtBpiaVyAMZdSCQCPT93v06y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:820748'),
  ('306398751736031476', 'Hollow in the Land', 2017, 'Mystery, Drama, Thriller', 'Scooter Corkle, Norm Li', 'Scooter Corkle', 'Dianna Agron, Jared Abrahamson, Shawn Ashmore, Rachelle Lefevre, Jess McLeod, David Lennon, Sarah Dugdale, Michael J Rogers', null, 'With their father in prison for murder, siblings Alison and Brandon are instantly considered suspects when a string of killings plagues their town, and they must fight to clear their names.', 'With their father in prison for murder, siblings Alison and Brandon are instantly considered suspects when a string of killings plagues their town, and they must fight to clear their names.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/972zKdDp4rJfu1IkOigiL97vsQh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:352491'),
  ('776722756185929601', 'Hollow Man', 2000, 'Action, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Paul Verhoeven, Jost Vacano, Sue Chan', 'Andrew W. Marlowe', 'Kevin Bacon, Elisabeth Shue, Josh Brolin, Kim Dickens, Greg Grunberg, Joey Slotnick, Mary Randle, William Devane', 'R', 'Cocky researcher Sebastian Caine is working on a project to make living creatures invisible. Determined to achieve the ultimate breakthrough, Caine pushes his team to move to the next phase — using himself as the subject. The test is a success, but when the process can''t be reversed and Caine seems doomed to future without flesh, he starts to turn increasingly dangerous.', 'Cocky researcher Sebastian Caine is working on a project to make living creatures invisible. Determined to achieve the ultimate breakthrough, Caine pushes his team to move to the next phase — using himself as the subject. The test is a success, but when the process can''t be reversed and Caine seems doomed to future without flesh, he starts to turn increasingly dangerous.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sd3qUIv5uoP2oTbqv66CzXSPjKG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9383'),
  ('381907597523182657', 'Hollow Man II', 2006, 'Horror, Thriller, Science Fiction', 'Claudio Fäh, Peter Wunstorf', 'Joel Soisson', 'Christian Slater, Laura Regan, Peter Facinelli, David McIlwraith, Jessica Harmon, Sarah Deakins, Sonya Salomaa, Stefano Giulianetti', 'R', 'After the mysterious death of scientist Dr. Devin Villiers, Det. Frank Turner and his partner are assigned to protect Villiers'' colleague, who revealed that a veteran soldier was subjected to an experiment with the objective of creating the ultimate national security weapon... an undetectable soldier. The experiment failed – with disastrous side effects.', 'After the mysterious death of scientist Dr. Devin Villiers, Det. Frank Turner and his partner are assigned to protect Villiers'' colleague, who revealed that a veteran soldier was subjected to an experiment with the objective of creating the ultimate national security weapon... an undetectable soldier. The experiment failed – with disastrous side effects.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c6Ga1AUGPe3GwlpX3qDYrD9y3EZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8997'),
  ('372279867849655483', 'Hollow Point', 1996, 'Action, Comedy, Thriller', 'Sidney J. Furie, David Franco', 'Kevin Bernhardt', 'Donald Sutherland, John Lithgow, Tia Carrere, Thomas Ian Griffith, David Hemblen, Carl Alacchi, Robert Ito, Andreas Apergis', null, 'Livingston is trying to merge the Russians, Chinese and Italian gangsters into one group with huge amounts of money and power. FBI agent Susan and DEA agent Max are trying to stop them.', 'Livingston is trying to merge the Russians, Chinese and Italian gangsters into one group with huge amounts of money and power. FBI agent Susan and DEA agent Max are trying to stop them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1fb03z1y3Ruz6HLgh7OS35A5CCw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:58028'),
  ('1068405565494756937', 'Hollow Point', 2019, 'Action', 'Daniel Zirilli, Carmen Cabana, Prince Bagdasarian', 'Daniel Zirilli, Chad Law, Evan Law', 'Luke Goss, JuJu Chan, Dilan Jay, Jay Mohr, Michael Paré, Roger Guenveur Smith, Bill Duke, Peter Lee Thomas', 'PG-13', 'When his wife and daughter are senselessly murdered, a grieving man finds himself caught up in a war between a group of charismatic vigilantes and the crime that infests their city.', 'When his wife and daughter are senselessly murdered, a grieving man finds himself caught up in a war between a group of charismatic vigilantes and the crime that infests their city.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8toDIronC85Qsd0EhKdtzJAIs4q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:611562'),
  ('979566771371507891', 'Hollow Reed', 1996, 'Drama', 'Angela Pope, Remi Adefarasin, Sara Desmond', 'Paula Milne', 'Martin Donovan, Ian Hart, Joely Richardson, Jason Flemyng, Shaheen Khan, Kelly Hunter, Jane Hill', null, 'Following the break-up of his marriage after revealing his homosexuality, GP Martin Wyatt loses custody of his son Oliver to his now ex-wife Hannah and her new partner Frank. It is not long, however, until Oliver appears at the house of Martin and his new lover Tom claiming to have been beaten up by boys in the park. After another incident, Martin puts two and two together and comes to the conclusion that Frank has been beating Oliver without Hannah''s knowledge. Martin then begins a long courtroom custody battle to win back his son.', 'Following the break-up of his marriage after revealing his homosexuality, GP Martin Wyatt loses custody of his son Oliver to his now ex-wife Hannah and her new partner Frank. It is not long, however, until Oliver appears at the house of Martin and his new lover Tom claiming to have been beaten up by boys in the park. After another incident, Martin puts two and two together and comes to the conclusion that Frank has been beating Oliver without Hannah''s knowledge. Martin then begins a long courtroom custody battle to win back his son.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rNnCJn5xtoQegE9mvOAxqQhmSIB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:93946'),
  ('1102409117672283346', 'Hollow Triumph', 1948, 'Thriller, Crime', 'John Alton, Steve Sekely, Irving Friedman', 'Daniel Fuchs', 'Paul Henreid, Joan Bennett, Eduard Franz, Leslie Brooks, John Qualen, Mabel Paige, Herbert Rudley, Charles Arnt', 'NR', 'Pursued by the big-time gambler he robbed, John Muller assumes a new identity—with unfortunate results.', 'Pursued by the big-time gambler he robbed, John Muller assumes a new identity—with unfortunate results.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gRbXP8cKiufjKjtZoyxHjOORUMQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25672'),
  ('251092883426703020', 'Hollows Grove', 2014, 'Horror', 'Craig Efros', 'Craig Efros', 'Lance Henriksen, Mykelti Williamson, Matthew Carey, Sunkrish Bala, Bresha Webb, Eddie Perez, Gary Sievers, Tanc Sade', null, 'A young filmmaker documents his ghost-hunting, reality show friends as their routine investigation of an abandoned orphanage turns into a nightmare from which they can''t escape.', 'A young filmmaker documents his ghost-hunting, reality show friends as their routine investigation of an abandoned orphanage turns into a nightmare from which they can''t escape.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3NVbImZIYLkDavjAnbGMZdqkiD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:298609'),
  ('339095483768470963', 'Holly & Ivy', 2020, 'Romance, TV Movie', 'Kristoffer Carrillo, Erica Dunton', 'Jamie Pachino', 'Janel Parrish, Jeremy Jordan, Marisol Nichols, Sadie Coleman, Piper Rubio, Anne Sward, Nova Patten, Jon Stafford', null, 'When Melody’s neighbor, Nina, learns that her illness has returned, Melody promises to keep Nina’s kids, Holly & Ivy, together. To adopt the children, she must renovate her new fixer-upper, which she does with the help of contractor, Adam.', 'When Melody’s neighbor, Nina, learns that her illness has returned, Melody promises to keep Nina’s kids, Holly & Ivy, together. To adopt the children, she must renovate her new fixer-upper, which she does with the help of contractor, Adam.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2L5CqrFgHgt9RYtpkGT0Baz0Jp2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:737793'),
  ('958964906248440704', 'Holly Slept Over', 2020, 'Comedy', 'Joshua Friedlander, John W. Rutland', 'Joshua Friedlander', 'Josh Lawson, Britt Lower, Nathalie Emmanuel, Erinn Hayes, Ron Livingston, Kimberly G. Grader, Alex Poplawki', null, 'Audra confesses to her husband Noel that she had a lesbian fling in college with her roommate Holly. Things turn upside down when Holly visits their house and Noel suggests the idea of having a threesome after getting the idea stuck in his head from his friend Pete.', 'Audra confesses to her husband Noel that she had a lesbian fling in college with her roommate Holly. Things turn upside down when Holly visits their house and Noel suggests the idea of having a threesome after getting the idea stuck in his head from his friend Pete.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u6vw5DqEvcCMreliZxLamykmWKm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:641483'),
  ('1094175083093921558', 'Holly''s Holiday', 2012, 'Comedy, Romance, Fantasy, TV Movie', 'Jim Fall, John Matysiak', 'Andrea Janakas, Justine Cogan', 'Claire Coffee, Jeff Ward, Ryan McPartlin, Gabrielle Dennis, Annie Quinn, Aketza López Totorika, Robin Riker, Marc Barnes', null, 'A professional in the advertising business, Holly dreams of finding Mr. Right, & getting the "perfect" romance. When she meets someone who ~looks the part, she falls hard & fast. But soon she is reminded that appearances can be deceiving, & true love grows in more unexpected places.', 'A professional in the advertising business, Holly dreams of finding Mr. Right, & getting the "perfect" romance. When she meets someone who ~looks the part, she falls hard & fast. But soon she is reminded that appearances can be deceiving, & true love grows in more unexpected places.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xqVK1e30rrPh8xUeKaxItOjyRXE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:231385'),
  ('659021144101179605', 'HollyBlood', 2022, 'Comedy, Fantasy, Romance', 'Jesús Font, Julián Núñez Sánchez, Javier Salmones', 'José Pérez Quintero', 'Óscar Casas, Isa Montalbán, Carlos Suárez, Ferrán Gadea, Lara Boedo, Mateo Medina, Jany Collado, Piero Méndez', null, 'Javi is a teenage student so shy and clumsy that he does not know how to attract the attention of his classmate Sara, a geeky girl who is only interested in a literary saga about vampires.', 'Javi is a teenage student so shy and clumsy that he does not know how to attract the attention of his classmate Sara, a geeky girl who is only interested in a literary saga about vampires.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ts82TuL0Uz2P3YNbMzZWC9Kp16Q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:821133'),
  ('1141206359153509309', 'Hollywoo', 2011, 'Comedy', 'Pascal Serieis, Frédéric Berthe, Ludovic Colbeau-Justin', 'Florence Foresti, Pascal Serieis, Xavier Maingon', 'Florence Foresti, Jamel Debbouze, Nikki DeLoach, Muriel Robin, Sophie Mounicot, Jeff Roop, Kirk B.R. Woller, Laurie Searle', null, 'Sometimes, when you think you have it all, everything falls apart. That is exactly the story of Jeanne .Just when she is offered the chance to dub famous American actress Jennifer Marshall in a successful American TV Show and her salary is about to triple, Marshall decides to withdraw from the show. So Jeanne makes a crazy decision, fly to Hollywood herself and make Jennifer change her mind about leaving the series...', 'Sometimes, when you think you have it all, everything falls apart. That is exactly the story of Jeanne .Just when she is offered the chance to dub famous American actress Jennifer Marshall in a successful American TV Show and her salary is about to triple, Marshall decides to withdraw from the show. So Jeanne makes a crazy decision, fly to Hollywood herself and make Jennifer change her mind about leaving the series...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oI0om8vqiiBmIifxLr73nsWBFcB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:80015'),
  ('1042188575438081069', 'Hollywood 90028', 1973, 'Drama, Horror', 'Christina Hornisher, John H. Pratt', 'Christina Hornisher', 'Christopher Augustine, Jeannette Dilger, Dick Glass, Gayle Davis, Ralph Campbell, Kia Cameron, Dianna Huntress, Beverly Walker', null, 'Mark, a cameraman who aspires to work on serious Hollywood films but can only find work making porno loops, turns to murder when his personal and professional frustrations reach their breaking point.', 'Mark, a cameraman who aspires to work on serious Hollywood films but can only find work making porno loops, turns to murder when his personal and professional frustrations reach their breaking point.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5V9V1dZJg3XslcUmSpGG7jcnDc7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:273544'),
  ('456762438804813342', 'Hollywood Adventures', 2015, 'Comedy, Action', 'Timothy Kendall', 'Alfredo Botello', 'Vicky Zhao, Huang Xiaoming, Tong Dawei, Simon Helberg, Missi Pyle, Abby Walker, Natalija Ugrina, Kat Dennings', null, 'A young man goes from China to Hollywood on short notice to find his girlfriend. He ends up connected with two others in his quest, which gets much more complicated than he envisioned.', 'A young man goes from China to Hollywood on short notice to find his girlfriend. He ends up connected with two others in his quest, which gets much more complicated than he envisioned.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rgzwRzTkPdyyCwsbubggPQI4xn2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:343059'),
  ('456327529856143836', 'Hollywood After Dark', 1961, null, 'John Hayes', 'John Hayes', 'Tony Vorno, Rue McClanahan, Paul Bruce, Joanne Stewart, Lea Marmer', null, 'A young girl comes to Hollywood to try to break into the movies, but winds up being taken advantage of by sleazy producers, and is forced to become a stripper.', 'A young girl comes to Hollywood to try to break into the movies, but winds up being taken advantage of by sleazy producers, and is forced to become a stripper.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iIOxTIHjy4rVGYFymVN6zemYYfJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:141600'),
  ('1043437274809100383', 'Hollywood Boulevard', 1976, 'Comedy, Thriller', 'Allan Arkush, Joe Dante, Jamie Anderson', 'Danny Opatoshu', 'Candice Rialson, Mary Woronov, Rita George, Jeffrey Kramer, Dick Miller, Richard Doran, Tara Strohmeier, Paul Bartel', 'R', 'A Midwestern ingenue arrives in Hollywood to try her luck as an actress. An incompetent agent hooks her up with a production company which specializes in low budget B-movie fair, which starts being plagued by strange, deadly accidents.', 'A Midwestern ingenue arrives in Hollywood to try her luck as an actress. An incompetent agent hooks her up with a production company which specializes in low budget B-movie fair, which starts being plagued by strange, deadly accidents.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fPvzlPpaXcnj8QmQjqevyxZNcVi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29856'),
  ('44710730746344742', 'Hollywood Canteen', 1944, 'Comedy, Music, Romance', 'Delmer Daves, Bert Glennon', 'Delmer Daves', 'Robert Hutton, Dane Clark, Laverne Andrews, Maxene Andrews, Patty Andrews, Jack Benny, Joe E. Brown, Eddie Cantor', 'NR', 'Two soldiers on leave spend three nights at a club offering free of charge food, dancing, and entertainment for servicemen on their way overseas. Club founders Bette Davis and John Garfield give talks on the history of the place.', 'Two soldiers on leave spend three nights at a club offering free of charge food, dancing, and entertainment for servicemen on their way overseas. Club founders Bette Davis and John Garfield give talks on the history of the place.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4ifU2c7Kbt4sCLbTdLFBqnhPYDp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38697'),
  ('609601035155039397', 'Hollywood Capers', 1935, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Jack King', null, 'Tommy Bond, Bernice Hansen', 'NR', 'W.C.Fields enters the Warmer Bros. Studio. Beans tries to drive in, but the guard throws him and his car against a tree. Charlie Chaplin drives in, followed by Oliver Hardy on foot - but we see that it''s really Beans in disguise. Oliver Owl is directing a picture; Beans sneaks onto the stage. He''s watching from a catwalk when someone knocks him off, into the middle of the scene. Beans is thrown off the set, right into the set of a Frankenstein movie. He accidentally brings the robotic monster to life, and it crashes into the original studio, eating the camera. Beans tries to stop the monster, but is sent flying. He lands against a wind machine. which chops up the monster.', 'W.C.Fields enters the Warmer Bros. Studio. Beans tries to drive in, but the guard throws him and his car against a tree. Charlie Chaplin drives in, followed by Oliver Hardy on foot - but we see that it''s really Beans in disguise. Oliver Owl is directing a picture; Beans sneaks onto the stage. He''s watching from a catwalk when someone knocks him off, into the middle of the scene. Beans is thrown off the set, right into the set of a Frankenstein movie. He accidentally brings the robotic monster to life, and it crashes into the original studio, eating the camera. Beans tries to stop the monster, but is sent flying. He lands against a wind machine. which chops up the monster.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3kUGS6qmqHxlMUsL22EhHZ2gx4s.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:100308'),
  ('323151992897765760', 'Hollywood Chainsaw Hookers', 1988, 'Comedy, Horror', 'Fred Olen Ray, Gary Graver, Scott Andrew Ressler', 'Fred Olen Ray, T.L. Lankford', 'Gunnar Hansen, Linnea Quigley, John Henry Richardson, Dawn Wildsmith, Michelle Bauer, Dennis T. Mooney, Fox Harris, Esther Elise', 'R', 'Los Angeles private eye Jack Chandler is hired by a worried mother to find her missing runaway daughter, Samantha. As Chandler searches for her whereabouts, he uncovers an evil cult that worships an Egyptian god, whose followers commit human sacrifices with chainsaws to appease their deity. He soon learns that Samantha has revenge in store for the cult leader and his bevy of blood-thirsty, chainsaw-wielding hookers.', 'Los Angeles private eye Jack Chandler is hired by a worried mother to find her missing runaway daughter, Samantha. As Chandler searches for her whereabouts, he uncovers an evil cult that worships an Egyptian god, whose followers commit human sacrifices with chainsaws to appease their deity. He soon learns that Samantha has revenge in store for the cult leader and his bevy of blood-thirsty, chainsaw-wielding hookers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2IRG18T8Jt6H8oa0dNM01Ikxc5e.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27412'),
  ('94516933114136803', 'Hollywood Cop', 1987, 'Action', 'Amir Shervan', 'Amir Shervan', 'David Goss, James Mitchum, Cameron Mitchell, Lincoln Kilpatrick, Aldo Ray, Julie Schoenhofer, Troy Donahue, Zuhair Haddad', 'R', 'A detective tries to get back a child who has been kidnapped by gangsters.', 'A detective tries to get back a child who has been kidnapped by gangsters.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ijLugAMKf8Fmg4NQtJsxokAx1KN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:112078'),
  ('1031974607211247493', 'Hollywood Daffy', 1946, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Hawley Pratt, Friz Freleng', null, 'Mel Blanc, Sara Berner, Richard Bickenbach', null, 'Daffy sneaks onto the Warmer Brothers lot, eventually posing as a tour guide. Daffy spoofs a number of contemporary stars, and others appear as "themselves". He also has a number of run-ins with a studio cop.', 'Daffy sneaks onto the Warmer Brothers lot, eventually posing as a tour guide. Daffy spoofs a number of contemporary stars, and others appear as "themselves". He also has a number of run-ins with a studio cop.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6Y5Sk4BUPd1knOsiqSvbbWcdg0L.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:237075'),
  ('626069573009870061', 'Hollywood Dirt', 2017, 'Drama, Romance', 'Tosca Musk, Denis Maloney', 'Joany Kane', 'Emma Rigby, Johann Urb, Mindy Cohn, Marco Dapper, Melissa LeEllen, Beverly Leech, Joel Michaely, Barry Ratcliffe', null, 'Hollywood arrives in force to Quincy, the small town where the secret Crown Cola billionaire''s live. They want to film about the billionaire''s and how they made their fortunes. Summer Jenkins, who was the town pariah, joins forces with the scout, Ben, and finds filming locations, extras, lessons with the town officials and house owners, etc. When Cole Masten arrives, they hate each other, but sparks fly. Cole is running from a nasty divorce, yet is captivated by Summer. Summer is dying to leave town to get away from the gossip. This is a great story about Southern customs, a Southern girl, and a Hollywood star who finds his lady.', 'Hollywood arrives in force to Quincy, the small town where the secret Crown Cola billionaire''s live. They want to film about the billionaire''s and how they made their fortunes. Summer Jenkins, who was the town pariah, joins forces with the scout, Ben, and finds filming locations, extras, lessons with the town officials and house owners, etc. When Cole Masten arrives, they hate each other, but sparks fly. Cole is running from a nasty divorce, yet is captivated by Summer. Summer is dying to leave town to get away from the gossip. This is a great story about Southern customs, a Southern girl, and a Hollywood star who finds his lady.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3mhv9gjqFJscFM14rRSPsM9d1UW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:465080'),
  ('1009721717015177506', 'Hollywood Ending', 2002, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Wedigo von Schultzendorff, Woody Allen, Jonathan Arkin', 'Woody Allen', 'Woody Allen, George Hamilton, Téa Leoni, Debra Messing, Mark Rydell, Treat Williams, Jodie Markell, Isaac Mizrahi', 'PG-13', 'Woody Allen stars as Val Waxman, a two-time Oscar winner turned washed-up, neurotic director in desperate need of a comeback. When it comes, Waxman finds himself backed into a corner: Work for his ex-wife Ellie or forfeit his last shot. Is Val blinded by love when he opts for the reconnect? Is love blind when it comes to Ellie''s staunch support? Literally and figuratively, the proof is the picture.', 'Woody Allen stars as Val Waxman, a two-time Oscar winner turned washed-up, neurotic director in desperate need of a comeback. When it comes, Waxman finds himself backed into a corner: Work for his ex-wife Ellie or forfeit his last shot. Is Val blinded by love when he opts for the reconnect? Is love blind when it comes to Ellie''s staunch support? Literally and figuratively, the proof is the picture.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aDRbdtNoTRoYnIpH3g1icGeHGBh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9689'),
  ('211105174493298402', 'Hollywood Handicap', 1938, 'Comedy, Music', 'Buster Keaton', null, 'The Original Sing Band, Charles Ruggles, Mickey Rooney, Stuart Erwin, June Collyer, Charles Butterworth, Al Jolson, Ruby Keeler', 'NR', 'A group of stable hands is given a race horse when its owner retires from the business. They raise money to run the horse in the Hollywood Derby at Santa Anita race track. Many Hollywood personalities attend the event.', 'A group of stable hands is given a race horse when its owner retires from the business. They raise money to run the horse in the Hollywood Derby at Santa Anita race track. Many Hollywood personalities attend the event.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sMmSYGthtPjwYb2pSfFGUbcxUKW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51383'),
  ('1033297135651929625', 'Hollywood High', 1976, 'Comedy', 'Jonathan Silveira, Patrick Wright', null, 'Susanne Severeid, Sherry Hardin, Rae Sperling, Marcy Albrecht, Kevin Mead, John William Young, Richard Hynes, Joseph Butcher', 'R', 'Four high school girls at Hollywood High are looking for fun. Together they frolic on the beach and cavort with their guys. In their search for a little privacy they meet up with a retired movie star whose mammoth house offers 10 private bedrooms. But there''s a catch...', 'Four high school girls at Hollywood High are looking for fun. Together they frolic on the beach and cavort with their guys. In their search for a little privacy they meet up with a retired movie star whose mammoth house offers 10 private bedrooms. But there''s a catch...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s2W3QfHCCbMbGzk98ewBPM4TeyB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:83001'),
  ('507709377903721205', 'Hollywood Homicide', 2003, 'Action, Adventure, Comedy, Thriller', 'Ron Shelton, Barry Peterson, Eric Fox Hays', 'Ron Shelton, Robert Souza', 'Harrison Ford, Josh Hartnett, Lena Olin, Bruce Greenwood, Isaiah Washington, Lolita Davidovich, Keith David, Dwight Yoakam', 'PG-13', 'Joe Gavilan and his new partner K. C. Calden, are detectives on the beat in Tinseltown. Neither one of them really wants to be a cop, Gavilan moonlights as a real estate broker, and Calden is an aspiring actor moonlighting as a yoga instructor. When the two are assigned a big case they must work out whether they want to solve the case or follow their hearts.', 'Joe Gavilan and his new partner K. C. Calden, are detectives on the beat in Tinseltown. Neither one of them really wants to be a cop, Gavilan moonlights as a real estate broker, and Calden is an aspiring actor moonlighting as a yoga instructor. When the two are assigned a big case they must work out whether they want to solve the case or follow their hearts.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Am7AhZYG7HLksY5E35oaEJ3Desz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11375'),
  ('787656508880023899', 'Hollywood Hong Kong', 2002, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Fruit Chan, O Sing-Pui', 'Fruit Chan, Jason Lam Kee-To', 'Zhou Xun, Glen Chin, Wong Yau-Nam, Ho Sai-Man, Leung Sze-Ping, Debbie Tam Kit-Man, Wan Kam-Li, Wu Wai-Man', null, 'A prostitute named Tong Tong enters the life of a man who runs a barbecue pork restaurant and quickly begins to ruin his life, as well as the life of his two rotund sons, and a local gangster.', 'A prostitute named Tong Tong enters the life of a man who runs a barbecue pork restaurant and quickly begins to ruin his life, as well as the life of his two rotund sons, and a local gangster.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yoLPucuJO4AqNoF75iAalUwwZLz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:60278'),
  ('572182914455358271', 'Hollywood Hot Tubs', 1984, 'Comedy', 'Chuck Vincent, Larry Revene, Per Sjostedt', 'Craig Horrall, Mark Borde', 'Paul Gunning, Donna McDaniel, Michael Andrew, Stafford Morgan, Remy O''Neill, Katt Shea, Edy Williams, Jewel Shepard', 'R', 'All hilarity breaks loose in this rousing and raucous tale of Hollywood hi-jinks and chicanery as a teenage delinquent turns plumber... and turns up in Hollywood Hot Tubs. After changing the famous "Hollywood" sign to "Hollyweed," Shawn Wright is given a choice of jail or getting a job. He takes a job as a hot tub plumber, and thus begins his arduous adventure into the wild world of sensuous starlets and star-studded parties in bubbling Hollywood tubs.', 'All hilarity breaks loose in this rousing and raucous tale of Hollywood hi-jinks and chicanery as a teenage delinquent turns plumber... and turns up in Hollywood Hot Tubs. After changing the famous "Hollywood" sign to "Hollyweed," Shawn Wright is given a choice of jail or getting a job. He takes a job as a hot tub plumber, and thus begins his arduous adventure into the wild world of sensuous starlets and star-studded parties in bubbling Hollywood tubs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ozJ4uhGtHPqByzS2o3CjKIWPFhh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36808'),
  ('198955356448204793', 'Hollywood Hotel', 1938, 'Comedy, Music, Romance', 'Busby Berkeley, Russell Saunders, Leo F. Forbstein', 'Jerry Wald, Maurice Leo, Richard Macaulay', 'Dick Powell, Rosemary Lane, Lola Lane, Hugh Herbert, Ted Healy, Glenda Farrell, Johnnie Davis, Louella Parsons', 'NR', 'After losing a coveted role in an upcoming film to another actress, screen queen Mona Marshall (Lola Lane) protests by refusing to appear at her current movie''s premiere. Her agent discovers struggling actress Virginia Stanton (Rosemary Lane) -- an exact match for Mona -- and sends her to the premiere instead, with young musician Ronnie Bowers (Dick Powell). After various mishaps, including a case of mistaken identity, Ronnie and Virginia struggle to find success in Hollywood.', 'After losing a coveted role in an upcoming film to another actress, screen queen Mona Marshall (Lola Lane) protests by refusing to appear at her current movie''s premiere. Her agent discovers struggling actress Virginia Stanton (Rosemary Lane) -- an exact match for Mona -- and sends her to the premiere instead, with young musician Ronnie Bowers (Dick Powell). After various mishaps, including a case of mistaken identity, Ronnie and Virginia struggle to find success in Hollywood.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/67WhlzMM4u847dl45lMKN3THmg7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43859'),
  ('963254795444644042', 'Hollywood Man', 1976, 'Action, Drama', 'Jack Starrett, Robert C. Jessup', 'Ray Girardin, Dominic Gombardella, William Smith', 'William Smith, Jennifer Billingsley, Ray Girardin, Jude Farese, Mary Woronov, Tom Simcox, Don Stroud, Carmine Caridi', 'R', 'A film crew struggles to finish a motorcycle-stunt epic despite repeated threats of sabotage from the mob.', 'A film crew struggles to finish a motorcycle-stunt epic despite repeated threats of sabotage from the mob.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oNFOhgfz0GqsGTZtz76IJZHpCI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29860'),
  ('555780199248247734', 'Hollywood or Bust', 1956, 'Comedy', 'Frank Tashlin, Daniel L. Fapp, William Watson', 'Erna Lazarus', 'Dean Martin, Jerry Lewis, Pat Crowley, Maxie Rosenbloom, Anita Ekberg, Willard Waterman, Richard Karlan, Richard Alexander', 'NR', 'The last movie with Jerry Lewis and Dean Martin together, is a satire of the life in Hollywood. Steve Wiley is a deceiver who cheats Malcolm Smith when he wins a car, claiming that he won it too. Trying to steal the car, Steve tells Malcolm that he lives in Hollywood, next to Anita Ekberg''s. When Malcom hears that, they both set out for Hollywood and the adventure begins...', 'The last movie with Jerry Lewis and Dean Martin together, is a satire of the life in Hollywood. Steve Wiley is a deceiver who cheats Malcolm Smith when he wins a car, claiming that he won it too. Trying to steal the car, Steve tells Malcolm that he lives in Hollywood, next to Anita Ekberg''s. When Malcom hears that, they both set out for Hollywood and the adventure begins...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mm6VZSq6251wy3ynqNDHW7aoWfx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43259'),
  ('978537946629387607', 'Hollywood Party', 1934, 'Comedy, Music', 'George Stevens, Charles Reisner, Allan Dwan', 'Howard Dietz, Arthur Kober', 'Stan Laurel, Oliver Hardy, Jimmy Durante, Jack Pearl, Polly Moran, Charles Butterworth, Eddie Quillan, June Clyde', 'NR', 'Jimmy Durante is jungle movie star Schnarzan the Conqueror, but the public is tiring of his fake lions. When Baron Munchausen comes to town with real man-eating lions, Durante throws him a big Hollywood star-studded party so that he might use the lions in his next movie. But, his film rival sneaks into the party to buy the lions before Durante.', 'Jimmy Durante is jungle movie star Schnarzan the Conqueror, but the public is tiring of his fake lions. When Baron Munchausen comes to town with real man-eating lions, Durante throws him a big Hollywood star-studded party so that he might use the lions in his next movie. But, his film rival sneaks into the party to buy the lions before Durante.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6vQqQP4yqfb3Q2zhUMhYKPbKKda.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:178452'),
  ('1124203623356533522', 'Hollywood Sex Fantasy', 2001, 'Comedy, Romance', 'David Trulli, Kelley Cauthen, Frank Pinnock', 'Leland Zaitz', 'Marklen Kennedy, Tracy Ryan, Zay Harding, Catalina Larranaga, Teanna Kai, Kelli McCarty, Sasha Peralto, Keri Windsor', 'R', 'The story of a Hollywood star who, tired of his lifestyle, one night encounters his doppelganger leading to a role switch so the star can slip away for some alone time leaving the double to indulge in his fantasies.', 'The story of a Hollywood star who, tired of his lifestyle, one night encounters his doppelganger leading to a role switch so the star can slip away for some alone time leaving the double to indulge in his fantasies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AmF3mnnObNPn5kADfEjjfyPCt1W.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:240697'),
  ('107733285738864619', 'Hollywood Shuffle', 1987, 'Comedy', 'Robert Townsend, Peter Deming', 'Robert Townsend, Keenen Ivory Wayans', 'Robert Townsend, Craigus R. Johnson, Helen Martin, Starletta DuPois, Keenen Ivory Wayans, Anne-Marie Johnson, John Witherspoon, Lou B. Washington', 'R', 'Aspiring actor and hot-dog stand employee Bobby Taylor catches the ire of his grandmother for auditioning for a role in the regrettably titled exploitation film "Jivetime Jimmy''s Revenge." When Tinseltown Studios casts Taylor in the title role, he has a series of conflicted dreams satirizing African-American stereotypes in Hollywood, and must reconcile his career goals with his desire to remain a positive role model for his little brother.', 'Aspiring actor and hot-dog stand employee Bobby Taylor catches the ire of his grandmother for auditioning for a role in the regrettably titled exploitation film "Jivetime Jimmy''s Revenge." When Tinseltown Studios casts Taylor in the title role, he has a series of conflicted dreams satirizing African-American stereotypes in Hollywood, and must reconcile his career goals with his desire to remain a positive role model for his little brother.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xidkzvrJfBeZ6wVcVOxobZruiR7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34101'),
  ('426615798767944108', 'Hollywood Stargirl', 2022, 'Comedy, Romance, Music', 'Bryce Fortner, Julia Hart', 'Jordan Horowitz', 'Grace VanderWaal, Judy Greer, Elijah Richardson, Uma Thurman, Tyrel Jackson Williams, Judd Hirsch, Nija Okoro, Chris Williams', 'PG', 'When Stargirl''s mother is hired as the costume designer on a movie, they relocate to L.A., where Stargirl quickly becomes involved with an eclectic assortment of characters.', 'When Stargirl''s mother is hired as the costume designer on a movie, they relocate to L.A., where Stargirl quickly becomes involved with an eclectic assortment of characters.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3ZNvOWYrnqz27TfS0USHNwlPp99.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:799883'),
