  ('253791390811452085', 'Holy Flame of the Martial World', 1983, 'Fantasy, Action, Adventure, Comedy', 'Philip Ma Kam-Cheung, Tony Lou Chun-Ku', 'Cheung Kwok-Yuen, Tony Lou Chun-Ku', 'Max Mok Siu-Chung, Leanne Liu, Yung Jing-Jing, Lau Siu-Kwan, Jason Pai Piao, Phillip Kwok Chui, Yeung Ching-Ching, Liu Lai-Ling', null, 'A brother and sister seek vengeance for the death of their parents by honing their martial skills and searching for the legendary Holy Flame sword. To avenge their parents they must fight their way through demons, ghosts, ancient booby-trapped temples, and cultish clans.', 'A brother and sister seek vengeance for the death of their parents by honing their martial skills and searching for the legendary Holy Flame sword. To avenge their parents they must fight their way through demons, ghosts, ancient booby-trapped temples, and cultish clans.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mGIrHrySnO1YsCIoQx3m7lBujEo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:74257'),
