  ('510370371708971207', 'Holy Lola', 2004, 'Drama', 'Bertrand Tavernier, Alain Choquart', 'Tiffany Tavernier, Dominique Sampiero', 'Jacques Gamblin, Isabelle Carré, Bruno Putzulu, Lara Guirao, Frédéric Pierrot, Maria Pitarresi, Jean-Yves Roan, Séverine Caneele', null, 'The story of a young couple, Pierre and Geraldine, and their desire for a child, which leads them on a journey of initiation to Cambodia. On their difficult and transformative adventure, they must contend with obstructive authorities and the jealousies and mistrust of a small community of would-be adoptive parents.', 'The story of a young couple, Pierre and Geraldine, and their desire for a child, which leads them on a journey of initiation to Cambodia. On their difficult and transformative adventure, they must contend with obstructive authorities and the jealousies and mistrust of a small community of would-be adoptive parents.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dG6ytJeEvQXQyCAZTsH9q82rgPS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1998'),
  ('290637177645157387', 'Holy Man', 1998, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Stephen Herek, Adrian Biddle, Cathy Sandrich Gelfond', 'Tom Schulman', 'Eddie Murphy, Jeff Goldblum, Kelly Preston, Robert Loggia, Jon Cryer, Eric McCormack, Sam Kitchin, Robert Small', 'PG', 'In a world governed by commerce, Ricky and Kate, dedicated employees, find their lives forever changed when they encounter the enigmatic stranger G. As they navigate the realm of commerce, their paths intertwine in a surreal dance of love, loss, and redemption. G''s presence, amplified through the pervasive influence of globalized television, casts a spell that reverberates beyond Ricky and Kate, impacting the lives of those who bear witness to their intertwined destinies.', 'In a world governed by commerce, Ricky and Kate, dedicated employees, find their lives forever changed when they encounter the enigmatic stranger G. As they navigate the realm of commerce, their paths intertwine in a surreal dance of love, loss, and redemption. G''s presence, amplified through the pervasive influence of globalized television, casts a spell that reverberates beyond Ricky and Kate, impacting the lives of those who bear witness to their intertwined destinies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sfJBsOdSbgLLarO6GIS0dWzFcCv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9713'),
  ('971681750197842481', 'Holy Matrimony', 1943, 'Comedy, Drama', 'John M. Stahl, Emil Newman, Lucien Ballard', 'Nunnally Johnson', 'Monty Woolley, Gracie Fields, Laird Cregar, Una O''Connor, Alan Mowbray, Melville Cooper, Franklin Pangborn, Ethel Griffies', null, 'An artist returning from years abroad takes the identity of his dead valet and gets married, but then there are complications.', 'An artist returning from years abroad takes the identity of his dead valet and gets married, but then there are complications.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4WKa7s8WydeDEO45pvjLJRebFC4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:180114'),
  ('669316010302358917', 'Holy Matrimony', 1994, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Leonard Nimoy, Bobby Bukowski', 'David Weisberg, Douglas S. Cook', 'Patricia Arquette, Joseph Gordon-Levitt, Armin Mueller-Stahl, Tate Donovan, John Schuck, Lois Smith, Courtney B. Vance, Jeffrey Nordling', 'PG-13', 'A young Hutterite boy must marry his late brother''s wife who comes from outside the community.', 'A young Hutterite boy must marry his late brother''s wife who comes from outside the community.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/guuXfnxgXWPFrvgPbqySnujnjqb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2348'),
  ('103975236801207695', 'Holy Meat', 2026, 'Comedy', 'Alison Kuhn, Matthias Reisser, Charlotte Sagert, Andreas Kessler, Yannick Leopold, Jona Menuet, Stephanie Maile', 'Alison Kuhn, Jorg Michael Schneider, Bianca Fischer', 'Lars Brygmann, Jens Albinus, Pit Bukowski, Christian Pätzold, Jeremias Meyer', null, 'Father Iversen has a mission: to save his parish. He already has an idea. With a spectacular performance of the Passion story, he wants to convince the theater-loving archbishop to keep the parish. But director Roberto, who has been canceled by the Berlin theater scene, and Mia, the butcher who has returned involuntarily, thwart his plans.', 'Father Iversen has a mission: to save his parish. He already has an idea. With a spectacular performance of the Passion story, he wants to convince the theater-loving archbishop to keep the parish. But director Roberto, who has been canceled by the Berlin theater scene, and Mia, the butcher who has returned involuntarily, thwart his plans.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2Fvf5cagkoOz3WhF7EZVbsDZPmUYp.jpg', 'plex:movie:holy-meat-2026'),
  ('836240872424021759', 'Holy Motors', 2012, 'Drama, Fantasy', 'Leos Carax, Thierry Delobel, Thomas Bobrowski', 'Leos Carax', 'Denis Lavant, Édith Scob, Eva Mendes, Kylie Minogue, Élise Lhomeau, Jeanne Disson, Michel Piccoli, Leos Carax', 'NR', 'We follow 24 hours in the life of a being moving from life to life like a cold and solitary assassin moving from hit to hit. In each of these interwoven lives, the being possesses an entirely distinct identity: sometimes a man, sometimes a woman, sometimes youthful, sometimes old. By turns murderer, beggar, company chairman, monstrous creature, worker, family man.', 'We follow 24 hours in the life of a being moving from life to life like a cold and solitary assassin moving from hit to hit. In each of these interwoven lives, the being possesses an entirely distinct identity: sometimes a man, sometimes a woman, sometimes youthful, sometimes old. By turns murderer, beggar, company chairman, monstrous creature, worker, family man.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4ZuTrrDQhCS9f6KzIX6HfsjjyMd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:103328'),
  ('961988559041242593', 'Holy Night: Demon Hunters', 2025, 'Action, Fantasy, Horror, Thriller', 'Lim Dae-hee, Kim Ji-yong, Pak Jun-u', 'Lim Dae-hee', 'Don Lee, Seohyun, David Lee, Gyeong Su-jin, Jung Zi-so, Choi Gwang-il, Ryu Seung-su, Jeon Ik-ryoung', null, 'When a devil-worshipping criminal network plunges Seoul into chaos, the police turn to Holy Night—a trio of supernatural demon hunters—to restore order and defeat the rising evil.', 'When a devil-worshipping criminal network plunges Seoul into chaos, the police turn to Holy Night—a trio of supernatural demon hunters—to restore order and defeat the rising evil.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v3Mo77Qjp6pctpD4eJaNT6kFRSB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:793387'),
  ('914238157933091046', 'Holy Rollers', 2010, 'Drama', 'Kevin Asch, Ben Kutchins', 'Antonio Macia', 'Jesse Eisenberg, Justin Bartha, Danny A. Abeckaser, Ari Graynor, Jason Fuchs, Charlie Hewson, Elizabeth Marvel, Hallie Eisenberg', 'R', 'Inspired by actual events in the late nineties when Hasidic Jews were recruited as mules to smuggle ecstasy from Europe into the United States.', 'Inspired by actual events in the late nineties when Hasidic Jews were recruited as mules to smuggle ecstasy from Europe into the United States.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/594RhDOkzRXkQM30XKjEG0843Ol.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45022'),
  ('918182518020388161', 'Holy Shit!', 2022, 'Horror, Comedy, Thriller', 'Lukas Rinker, Knut Adass, Helen Dreesen', null, 'Thomas Niehaus, Gedeon Burkhard, Olga von Luckwald, Rodney Charles, Friederike Kempter, Björn Meyer, Uke Bosse, Micaela Schäfer', null, 'An architect regains consciousness in a locked portaloo – known in German vernacular by the ‘Dixi’ brand name – on a building site where a detonation is being prepared. As he desperately tries to find ways of escaping this ‘prison’ before potentially being blown to smithereens, he realizes who has put him into this predicament. Now he has to do everything in his power to get out alive…', 'An architect regains consciousness in a locked portaloo – known in German vernacular by the ‘Dixi’ brand name – on a building site where a detonation is being prepared. As he desperately tries to find ways of escaping this ‘prison’ before potentially being blown to smithereens, he realizes who has put him into this predicament. Now he has to do everything in his power to get out alive…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gTbaGcKJgpiBpcnIDG2dvhOBBjg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:955532'),
  ('367926554792980746', 'Holy Smoke', 1999, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Jane Campion, Dion Beebe', 'Anna Campion, Jane Campion', 'Kate Winslet, Harvey Keitel, Julie Hamilton, Sophie Lee, Dan Wyllie, Paul Goddard, Tim Robertson, George Mangos', 'R', 'While on a journey of discovery in exotic India, beautiful young Ruth Barron falls under the influence of a charismatic religious guru. Her desperate parents then hire PJ Waters, a macho cult de-programmer who confronts Ruth in a remote desert hideaway. But PJ quickly learns that he''s met his match in the sexy, intelligent and iron-willed Ruth.', 'While on a journey of discovery in exotic India, beautiful young Ruth Barron falls under the influence of a charismatic religious guru. Her desperate parents then hire PJ Waters, a macho cult de-programmer who confronts Ruth in a remote desert hideaway. But PJ quickly learns that he''s met his match in the sexy, intelligent and iron-willed Ruth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/utBNYz1cX43SQKZFH1JmMZU34Dy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13787'),
  ('971125352141793293', 'Holy Spider', 2022, 'Thriller, Drama, Crime', 'Tarik Afifi, Ali Abbasi, Nadim Carlsen', 'Afshin Kamran Bahrami, Ali Abbasi', 'Zar Amir Ebrahimi, Mehdi Bajestani, Arash Ashtiani, Forouzan Jamshidnejad, Sina Parvaneh, Nima Akbarpour, Sara Fazilat, Alice Rahimi', 'NR', 'A journalist descends into the dark underbelly of the Iranian holy city of Mashhad as she investigates the serial killings of sex workers by the so called "Spider Killer", who believes he is cleansing the streets of sinners.', 'A journalist descends into the dark underbelly of the Iranian holy city of Mashhad as she investigates the serial killings of sex workers by the so called "Spider Killer", who believes he is cleansing the streets of sinners.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6ObJ4x7m1F5QRY06WzOxNJQHwGb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:889699'),
  ('592000477399408285', 'Holy Tongue', 2000, 'Comedy', 'Carlo Mazzacurati, Marina Zangirolami, Alessandro Pesci', 'Marco Pettenello, Franco Bernini, Umberto Contarello', 'Antonio Albanese, Fabrizio Bentivoglio, Isabella Ferrari, Toni Bertorelli, Ivano Marescotti, Marco Paolini, Giulio Brogi, Marta Bellocchio', null, 'Two deadbeat friends see the opportunity of turning their fortune around after they come into possession of a precious stolen relic, the tongue of St. Anthony of Padua.', 'Two deadbeat friends see the opportunity of turning their fortune around after they come into possession of a precious stolen relic, the tongue of St. Anthony of Padua.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tjfWegMyLOCm8p1dun5JejwqMXp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24177'),
  ('229181939464798990', 'Holy Tour', 2019, 'Documentary', 'Valéry Rosier, Méryl Fortunat-Rossi', 'Valéry Rosier, Méryl Fortunat-Rossi', null, null, 'It''s summer. The Tour de France is coming and senior fans arrive in their camper vans in this endearing documentary that revels in its visual humour.', 'It''s summer. The Tour de France is coming and senior fans arrive in their camper vans in this endearing documentary that revels in its visual humour.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3aZyd7DnVjNHp7owpk9dKOJ689W.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:545575'),
  ('735207016159109403', 'Holy Water', 2009, 'Comedy', 'Tom Reeve, Josh Newiss, Matthew Hanson', 'Michael O''Mahony', 'John Lynch, Cornelius Clarke, Lochlann Ó Mearáin, Cian Barry, Susan Lynch, Deirdre Mullins, Linda Hamilton, Tommy Lister Jr.', null, 'The village of Kilcoulins Leap was once a thriving spa town, and was home to a famous Holy Well, but now offers little by way of employment for its people, and its decline seems inexorable. When local Postie, Podger Byrnes, comes up with a plan to hijack a consignment of Viagra, and sell it on the open market in Amsterdam, his friends are desperate enough to try it. Not counting on the muscular response of Viagra''s makers, the boys panic and hide the lorry load of Viagra down the town''s Holy Well.', 'The village of Kilcoulins Leap was once a thriving spa town, and was home to a famous Holy Well, but now offers little by way of employment for its people, and its decline seems inexorable. When local Postie, Podger Byrnes, comes up with a plan to hijack a consignment of Viagra, and sell it on the open market in Amsterdam, his friends are desperate enough to try it. Not counting on the muscular response of Viagra''s makers, the boys panic and hide the lorry load of Viagra down the town''s Holy Well.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5EMPHNVAyP14gkeDZ0gebhrbHvD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38932'),
  ('923594320860385613', 'Holy Water Joe', 1971, 'Western', 'Mario Gariazzo, Franco Villa', 'Mario Gariazzo, Ferdinando Poggi', 'Ty Hardin, Richard Harrison, Lincoln Tate, Siliva Monelli, Giulio Baraghini, Pietro Ceccarelli, Tuccio Musumeci, Mario Novelli', null, 'A gang of robbers armed with a union army cannon rob the bank holding bounty Killer Acquasanta Joe''s earnings to date. He pursues, crossing and double crossing along the way.', 'A gang of robbers armed with a union army cannon rob the bank holding bounty Killer Acquasanta Joe''s earnings to date. He pursues, crossing and double crossing along the way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/37sQHNSl0vQNyGbWhBIL4p0s7Ok.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:143923'),
  ('242767053873803294', 'Holy Weapon', 1993, 'Action, Fantasy, Comedy', 'Wong Jing, Gigo Lee Ji-Hang', 'Lam Wai-Lun, Wong Jing', 'Sandra Ng Kwan-Yu, Damian Lau Chung-Yan, Michelle Yeoh, Sharla Cheung, Maggie Cheung, Carol Cheng, Simon Yam, Richard Ng Man-Tat', null, 'During the Ming dynasty, Mo Kake takes an invincibility drink to defeat the best Japanese warrior, Super Sword. Three years later, the samurai returns, determined to take the power of 7 Maidens to defeat Mo Kake.', 'During the Ming dynasty, Mo Kake takes an invincibility drink to defeat the best Japanese warrior, Super Sword. Three years later, the samurai returns, determined to take the power of 7 Maidens to defeat Mo Kake.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iq5cY5ze8EUGXFaE7TWf5B7Dzv2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:74258'),
  ('582549368333673069', 'Holy Week', 1995, 'Drama, War, History', 'Andrzej Wajda, Wit Dąbal, Magdalena Szwarcbart', 'Andrzej Wajda', 'Beata Fudalej, Wojciech Malajkat, Magdalena Warzecha, Jakub Przebindowski, Bożena Dykiel, Cezary Pazura, Wojciech Pszoniak, Agnieszka Kotulanka', null, 'During the Nazi era, a Jewish woman on the run takes a trolley which passes near the Warsaw ghetto, where the uprising battle is taking place, and some passengers are struck by stray bullets. They take temporary refuge in an empty building, and there she has a chance meeting with her ex-fiancé. He offers to put her up--that is, hide her--for a few days. He''s now married, a professional who lives in an idyllic suburb reached by a trolley that runs through the woods. His wife seems more committed to putting up the fugitive than he is. The story involves the neighbors, the building owner who avoids involvement and seeks solace in classic poetry, and the super and his suspicious wife.', 'During the Nazi era, a Jewish woman on the run takes a trolley which passes near the Warsaw ghetto, where the uprising battle is taking place, and some passengers are struck by stray bullets. They take temporary refuge in an empty building, and there she has a chance meeting with her ex-fiancé. He offers to put her up--that is, hide her--for a few days. He''s now married, a professional who lives in an idyllic suburb reached by a trolley that runs through the woods. His wife seems more committed to putting up the fugitive than he is. The story involves the neighbors, the building owner who avoids involvement and seeks solace in classic poetry, and the super and his suspicious wife.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r0BjtAihZscUPlYnBNd5crTNqlw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:173510'),
  ('758886989563801596', 'Holy Year', 1976, 'Comedy', 'Jean Girault', 'Jacques Vilfrid, Louis-Émile Galey', 'Jean Gabin, Jean-Claude Brialy, Henri Virlogeux, Danielle Darrieux, Nicoletta Machiavelli, Jacques Marin, Giampiero Albertini, Paolo Giusti', null, 'Two bank robbers, an old and a young, escape from prison to get to the hidden loot.', 'Two bank robbers, an old and a young, escape from prison to get to the hidden loot.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/47bxtzaeTrRpsrINZqIwaf3JtqX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:144726'),
  ('370474463988660909', 'Hombre', 1967, 'Western', 'Martin Ritt, James Wong Howe', 'Irving Ravetch, Harriet Frank Jr.', 'Paul Newman, Fredric March, Richard Boone, Diane Cilento, Cameron Mitchell, Barbara Rush, Peter Lazer, Margaret Blye', 'NR', 'John Russell, disdained by his "respectable" fellow stagecoach passengers because he was raised by Indians, becomes their only hope for survival when they are set upon by outlaws.', 'John Russell, disdained by his "respectable" fellow stagecoach passengers because he was raised by Indians, becomes their only hope for survival when they are set upon by outlaws.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/puqgDLxdIZSnodDJ6Q0KxofOebo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27945'),
