  ('342798693490763488', 'Home', 1998, 'Drama', 'Morag McKinnon, Kenneth Simpson', 'Colin McLaren', 'Russell Anderson, Malcolm Shields, Eddie Mearns, Raymond Mearns, Dorothy McLaren', null, 'A local council worker inspects three homes.', 'A local council worker inspects three homes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9P1y2KcPw8MB79ULmvRxc6dRsH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49470'),
  ('666680123682947942', 'Home', 2008, 'Drama', 'Ursula Meier, Elitza Gueorguieva, Maurad Kara', 'Antoine Jaccoud, Ursula Meier, Gilles Taurand', 'Isabelle Huppert, Adélaïde Leroux, Madeleine Budd, Kacey Mottet Klein, Olivier Gourmet, Renaud Rivier, Kilian Torrent, Nicolas Del Sordo', null, 'Along with her husband and three children, Marthe lives in an eden of her own creation, nearly isolated from the rest of the world. The arrival of a construction vehicle, however, pierces their tranquil, hermetic existence—before long a disused highway has been re-opened, and the family finds their home situated in the midst of rush-hour traffic. While the privileges of clean air, quietude and privacy are thus denied them, Marthe remains determined to stay no matter the cost.', 'Along with her husband and three children, Marthe lives in an eden of her own creation, nearly isolated from the rest of the world. The arrival of a construction vehicle, however, pierces their tranquil, hermetic existence—before long a disused highway has been re-opened, and the family finds their home situated in the midst of rush-hour traffic. While the privileges of clean air, quietude and privacy are thus denied them, Marthe remains determined to stay no matter the cost.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4Jq1IA3Z9NqlikWqBy7pgHiZyeJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:61222'),
  ('109211743045396056', 'Home', 2009, 'Documentary, Drama, Family', 'Yann Arthus-Bertrand, Michel Benjamin, Dominique Gentil', 'Denis Carot, Isabelle Delannoy, Yen Le Van', 'Yann Arthus-Bertrand, Jacques Gamblin', 'NR', 'In 200,000 years of existence, man has upset the balance on which the Earth had lived for 4 billion years. Global warming, resource depletion, species extinction: man has endangered his own home. But it is too late to be pessimistic: humanity has barely ten years left to reverse the trend, become aware of its excessive exploitation of the Earth''s riches, and change its consumption pattern.', 'In 200,000 years of existence, man has upset the balance on which the Earth had lived for 4 billion years. Global warming, resource depletion, species extinction: man has endangered his own home. But it is too late to be pessimistic: humanity has barely ten years left to reverse the trend, become aware of its excessive exploitation of the Earth''s riches, and change its consumption pattern.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2Ph0vzTiORSSlYjsXLFM1OZHkI8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:62320'),
  ('994839950878308444', 'Home', 2011, 'Drama, Mystery', 'Oleg Pogodin, Antoine Vivas Denisov', 'Oleg Pogodin', 'Sergey Garmash, Bohdan Stupka, Yekaterina Rednikova, Vladimir Yepifantsev, Konstantin Adaev, Aleksandra Blednaya, Ivan Dobronravov, Eduard Flerov', null, 'In a large house in the middle of the steppes, the Shamanovs meet for a family gathering. When suddenly the eldest brother Victor appears after a 25 year absence, unspoken family conflicts come to light. Nobody suspects that Victor is escaping his dark past and that killers are looking for his hiding place.', 'In a large house in the middle of the steppes, the Shamanovs meet for a family gathering. When suddenly the eldest brother Victor appears after a 25 year absence, unspoken family conflicts come to light. Nobody suspects that Victor is escaping his dark past and that killers are looking for his hiding place.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iSnRfGxEeX9O2rTHcWn38qR5D1F.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:79580'),
  ('776168059166720459', 'Home', 2015, 'Fantasy, Comedy, Animation, Science Fiction, Family', 'Tim Johnson, Munira Moiz Tayabji, Ferris Webby', 'Tom J. Astle, Matt Ember', 'Jim Parsons, Rihanna, Steve Martin, Jennifer Lopez, Matt Jones, Brian Stepanek, April Lawrence, Lisa Stewart', 'PG', 'When Earth is taken over by the overly-confident Boov, an alien race in search of a new place to call home, all humans are promptly relocated, while all Boov get busy reorganizing the planet. But when one resourceful girl, Tip, manages to avoid capture, she finds herself the accidental accomplice of a banished Boov named Oh. The two fugitives realize there’s a lot more at stake than intergalactic relations as they embark on the road trip of a lifetime.', 'When Earth is taken over by the overly-confident Boov, an alien race in search of a new place to call home, all humans are promptly relocated, while all Boov get busy reorganizing the planet. But when one resourceful girl, Tip, manages to avoid capture, she finds herself the accidental accomplice of a banished Boov named Oh. The two fugitives realize there’s a lot more at stake than intergalactic relations as they embark on the road trip of a lifetime.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/usFenYnk6mr8C62dB1MoAfSWMGR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:228161'),
  ('767418761658367006', 'Home Again', 2017, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Hallie Meyers-Shyer, Dean Cundey, David M. Bernstein', 'Hallie Meyers-Shyer', 'Reese Witherspoon, Nat Wolff, Jon Rudnitsky, Pico Alexander, Lake Bell, Reid Scott, Dolly Wells, Lola Flanery', 'PG-13', 'Life for a single mom in Los Angeles takes an unexpected turn when she allows three young guys to move in with her.', 'Life for a single mom in Los Angeles takes an unexpected turn when she allows three young guys to move in with her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pE4VHzhDZgvbx2QOllaXXPADiW1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:427900'),
  ('312952976472314842', 'Home Alone', 1990, 'Comedy, Family', 'Julio Macat, Chris Columbus, Geoffrey Hansen', 'John Hughes', 'Macaulay Culkin, Joe Pesci, Daniel Stern, John Heard, Roberts Blossom, Catherine O''Hara, Angela Goethals, Devin Ratray', 'PG', 'Eight-year-old Kevin McCallister makes the most of the situation after his family unwittingly leaves him behind when they go on Christmas vacation. When thieves try to break into his home, he puts up a fight like no other.', 'Eight-year-old Kevin McCallister makes the most of the situation after his family unwittingly leaves him behind when they go on Christmas vacation. When thieves try to break into his home, he puts up a fight like no other.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/onTSipZ8R3bliBdKfPtsDuHTdlL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:771'),
  ('948796399451866581', 'Home Alone 2: Lost in New York', 1992, 'Comedy, Family, Adventure', 'Julio Macat, Chris Columbus, Douglas F. O''Neons', 'John Hughes', 'Macaulay Culkin, Joe Pesci, Daniel Stern, Catherine O''Hara, John Heard, Brenda Fricker, Tim Curry, Devin Ratray', 'PG', 'Instead of flying to Florida with his folks, Kevin ends up alone in New York, where he gets a hotel room with his dad''s credit card—despite problems from a clerk and meddling bellboy. But when Kevin runs into his old nemeses, the Wet Bandits, he''s determined to foil their plans to rob a toy store on Christmas Eve.', 'Instead of flying to Florida with his folks, Kevin ends up alone in New York, where he gets a hotel room with his dad''s credit card—despite problems from a clerk and meddling bellboy. But when Kevin runs into his old nemeses, the Wet Bandits, he''s determined to foil their plans to rob a toy store on Christmas Eve.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uuitWHpJwxD1wruFl2nZHIb4UGN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:772'),
  ('311746016850982713', 'Home Alone 3', 1997, 'Comedy, Family', 'Raja Gosnell, Julio Macat, Benjamin Rosenberg', 'John Hughes', 'Alex D. Linz, Olek Krupa, Rya Kihlstedt, Lenny Von Dohlen, David Thornton, Haviland Morris, Kevin Kilner, Marian Seldes', 'PG', '9-year-old Alex Pruitt is home alone with the chicken pox. Turns out, due to a mix-up among nefarious spies, Alex was given a toy car concealing a top-secret microchip. Now Alex must fend off the spies as they try to break into his house to get it back.', '9-year-old Alex Pruitt is home alone with the chicken pox. Turns out, due to a mix-up among nefarious spies, Alex was given a toy car concealing a top-secret microchip. Now Alex must fend off the spies as they try to break into his house to get it back.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6uOadrCfle0n2LOOxHbgWEdnrm2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9714'),
  ('1080521133504774017', 'Home Alone 4', 2002, 'Comedy, Family, TV Movie', 'Rod Daniel, Peter Benison', 'Debra Frank, Steve L. Hayes', 'Mike Weinberg, French Stewart, Missi Pyle, Erick Avari, Barbara Babcock, Jason Beghe, Joanna Going, Chelsea Russo', 'PG', 'Kevin McCallister''s parents have split up. Now living with his mom, he decides to spend Christmas with his dad at the mansion of his father''s rich girlfriend, Natalie. Meanwhile robber Marv Merchants, one of the villains from the first two movies, partners up with a new criminal named Vera to hit Natalie''s mansion.', 'Kevin McCallister''s parents have split up. Now living with his mom, he decides to spend Christmas with his dad at the mansion of his father''s rich girlfriend, Natalie. Meanwhile robber Marv Merchants, one of the villains from the first two movies, partners up with a new criminal named Vera to hit Natalie''s mansion.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qRktvMOO2QaCL7gvNyvZDoxPOZj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12536'),
  ('1107118000521984158', 'Home Alone: The Holiday Heist', 2012, 'Comedy, Family, TV Movie', 'Peter Hewitt, Peter Benison, Doug Mitchell', 'Aaron Ginsburg, Wade McIntyre', 'Christian Martyn, Jodelle Ferland, Malcolm McDowell, Debi Mazar, Eddie Steeples, Doug Murray, Ellie Harvie, Peter DaCunha', 'PG', '10-year-old Finn is terrified to learn his family is relocating from sunny California to Maine in the scariest house he has ever seen! Convinced that his new house is haunted, Finn sets up a series of elaborate traps to catch the “ghost” in action. Left home alone with his sister while their parents are stranded across town, Finn’s traps catch a new target – a group of thieves who have targeted Finn’s house.', '10-year-old Finn is terrified to learn his family is relocating from sunny California to Maine in the scariest house he has ever seen! Convinced that his new house is haunted, Finn sets up a series of elaborate traps to catch the “ghost” in action. Left home alone with his sister while their parents are stranded across town, Finn’s traps catch a new target – a group of thieves who have targeted Finn’s house.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6bZdqzK3le84IVUIJCppYMG7UeA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:134375'),
  ('111391770341361897', 'Home at Seven', 1952, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery', 'Ralph Richardson, Edward Scaife, Jack Hildyard', 'Anatole de Grunwald', 'Ralph Richardson, Margaret Leighton, Campbell Singer, Jack Hawkins, Michael Shepley, Frederick Piper, Meriel Forbes, Margaret Withers', null, 'Unable to recall the past 24 hours, a British bank clerk is the prime suspect for a robbery/murder.', 'Unable to recall the past 24 hours, a British bank clerk is the prime suspect for a robbery/murder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u1wTXmIktK0v04EHdtJ6BYlNeaL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:259183'),
  ('657440472303357905', 'Home Before Dark', 1958, 'Drama', 'Mervyn LeRoy, Joseph F. Biroc', 'Eileen Bassing, Robert Bassing', 'Jean Simmons, Dan O''Herlihy, Rhonda Fleming, Efrem Zimbalist Jr., Mabel Albertson, Stephen Dunne, Joan Weldon, Joanna Barnes', null, 'A young woman returns home after being institutionalized in a mental hospital.', 'A young woman returns home after being institutionalized in a mental hospital.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ArL6JE6E2YltKRWKmBpuqb6Rt3b.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:121250'),
  ('862140387566822902', 'Home Before Midnight', 1979, 'Drama', 'Pete Walker, Peter Jessop', 'Murray Smith', 'James Aubrey, Alison Elliot, Mark Burns, Debbie Linden, Andy Forray, Chris Jagger, Sharon Maughan, Ivor Roberts', null, 'A successful rock lyricist becomes romantically involved with a girl he picks up hitchhiking only to learn that she is only fourteen. Her parents take action against him.', 'A successful rock lyricist becomes romantically involved with a girl he picks up hitchhiking only to learn that she is only fourteen. Her parents take action against him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zCXcHrsTbQP2ZxzCHcRJN2K1iG1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:145660'),
  ('1049803204051467256', 'Home Behind Bars', 2025, 'Drama', 'Cha Jeong-yoon, Hwang Gyeong-sik', 'Cha Jeong-yoon', 'Song Ji-hyo, Do Yeong-seo, Ok Ji-young', null, 'Tae-jeo, a correctional officer with 15 years of experience, learns about the death of an inmate''s mother during a night shift. On that winter night, she visits the funeral home and unexpectedly meets the inmate''s daughter, Jun-young. Their encounter brings warmth to both their lives, and Tae-jeo hopes Jun-young understands: “Every decision you make shapes who you become."', 'Tae-jeo, a correctional officer with 15 years of experience, learns about the death of an inmate''s mother during a night shift. On that winter night, she visits the funeral home and unexpectedly meets the inmate''s daughter, Jun-young. Their encounter brings warmth to both their lives, and Tae-jeo hopes Jun-young understands: “Every decision you make shapes who you become."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nRXbQ2wyv5AVQPLrMfHYJdgLoaR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1211635'),
  ('1052721699722067042', 'Home Coming', 2006, 'Drama', 'Ömer Uğur, Mustafa Kuşçu', 'Ömer Uğur', 'Memet Ali Alabora, Sibel Kekilli, Altan Erkekli, Savaş Dinçel, Perihan Savaş, Civan Canova, Erdal Tosun, Necmettin Çobanoğlu', null, 'September 1980. Mustafa ''Mehmet Ali Alabora'' and his wife, who''re both laborers are married for 5 years. The couple has nothing to do with politics and spend their days happily with their 3 year old daughter and their TV, despite the clamor of guns clashing outside every night. One Friday morning, they wake up and hear the voice of Hasan Mutlucan on radio and observe soldiers marching through the streets, the very confirmation of the military coup that has taken place. Arrests begin instantly in workplace and neighborhood. Yet Mustafa, far from being disturbed, assumes that all apprehensions must have rightful reasons. Until the night he''s taken into custody, charged with the crimes of a militant code named "Sehmuz".', 'September 1980. Mustafa ''Mehmet Ali Alabora'' and his wife, who''re both laborers are married for 5 years. The couple has nothing to do with politics and spend their days happily with their 3 year old daughter and their TV, despite the clamor of guns clashing outside every night. One Friday morning, they wake up and hear the voice of Hasan Mutlucan on radio and observe soldiers marching through the streets, the very confirmation of the military coup that has taken place. Arrests begin instantly in workplace and neighborhood. Yet Mustafa, far from being disturbed, assumes that all apprehensions must have rightful reasons. Until the night he''s taken into custody, charged with the crimes of a militant code named "Sehmuz".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ksTG2MRGFajc12tZ6EYjaepk24K.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52130'),
  ('395191825064951749', 'Home Coming', 2022, 'Drama, War', 'Rao Xiaozhi, Liao Ni', 'Shi Ce, Lei Zhilong, Qin Haiyan', 'Zhang Yi, Karry Wang, Yin Tao, Cheng Taishen, Zhang Zixian, Li Xuejian, Wang Xun, Wan Qian', null, 'Two members of the Chinese Ministry of Foreign Affairs are tasked with the evacuation of Chinese citizens when war breaks out in Numia, North Africa.', 'Two members of the Chinese Ministry of Foreign Affairs are tasked with the evacuation of Chinese citizens when war breaks out in Numia, North Africa.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AcacHtZ4LzZvL0Wz6CzvJrXkRqT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1022145'),
  ('138743739340745385', 'Home Defense', 1943, 'Animation', 'Jack King', null, 'Clarence Nash', 'NR', 'Donald is manning a listening post and falls asleep; he blows trumpet calls in his sleep and wakes his nephews. For their revenge, they send up a model airplane filled with gingerbread men with parachutes; Donald shoots it down, and cowers in fear when he sees the parachutes (and hears a simulated battle), until one lands on his beak. Donald kicks his nephews out until he mistakes a bee for an airplane, and calls them back to fight this menace.', 'Donald is manning a listening post and falls asleep; he blows trumpet calls in his sleep and wakes his nephews. For their revenge, they send up a model airplane filled with gingerbread men with parachutes; Donald shoots it down, and cowers in fear when he sees the parachutes (and hears a simulated battle), until one lands on his beak. Donald kicks his nephews out until he mistakes a bee for an airplane, and calls them back to fight this menace.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ed71CLy5LWMgUognrAQ4OlOepKb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:62598'),
  ('543881943252430911', 'Home Education', 2023, 'Horror, Thriller, Drama, Mystery', 'Andrea Niada, Stefano Falivene', 'Andrea Niada', 'Lydia Page, Julia Ormond, Rocco Fasano, Richard Ginn', null, 'A home-schooled girl begins to question her domineering mother''s teachings when their beliefs face the ultimate test.', 'A home-schooled girl begins to question her domineering mother''s teachings when their beliefs face the ultimate test.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/huTZvpr7foRX77VxXM2G6mJlpHU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1125186'),
  ('810828665289761815', 'Home for Christmas Day', 2017, 'Romance, Drama, TV Movie', 'Gary Harvey, Ron Stannett', null, 'Catherine Bell, Victor Webster, Matreya Fedor, Anthony Konechny, Chiara Zanni, Chanelle Peloso, Kelly-Ruth Mercier, Devielle Johnson', 'G', 'Jane is a single mother dead set on protecting her teenage daughter Betsy from the harsh realities of life. When Betsy falls in love with an enlisted man, Jane tries her best to steer Betsy away from heartache. Little does Jane realize she and her daughter are about to learn important lessons of the heart and that taking chances can sometimes lead to the most extraordinary happy endings.', 'Jane is a single mother dead set on protecting her teenage daughter Betsy from the harsh realities of life. When Betsy falls in love with an enlisted man, Jane tries her best to steer Betsy away from heartache. Little does Jane realize she and her daughter are about to learn important lessons of the heart and that taking chances can sometimes lead to the most extraordinary happy endings.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tD2VlbNVrwzm4aH4bUPUEUQRj8F.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:453217'),
  ('968440659114749037', 'Home for Rent', 2023, 'Horror, Thriller, Mystery', 'Sophon Sakdaphisit, Niramon Ross, Thanapon Punyapakul', 'Tanida Hantaweewatana, Sophon Sakdaphisit', 'Nittha Jirayungyurn, Sukollawat Kanarot, Thanyaphat Mayuraleela, Penpak Sirikul, Namfon Pakdee, Suphithak Chatsuriyawong, Natniphaporn Ingamornrat, Pawarisa Surathin', null, 'When her good tenants go bad, a landlord finds herself terrorized by a cult that seemingly has her husband enthralled — and her daughter in its sights.', 'When her good tenants go bad, a landlord finds herself terrorized by a cult that seemingly has her husband enthralled — and her daughter in its sights.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/59TGKlReiFlAni4Cqrb16oVL9oi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:977177'),
  ('777573850363056876', 'Home for the Holidays', 1974, 'Horror, Thriller, TV Movie', 'John Llewellyn Moxey, Leonard J. South', 'Joseph Stefano', 'Jessica Walter, Sally Field, Jill Haworth, Julie Harris, Eleanor Parker, Walter Brennan, John Fink, Med Flory', null, 'An ailing man summons his four daughters home for Christmas and asks them to kill his new wife, who he suspects is poisoning him.', 'An ailing man summons his four daughters home for Christmas and asks them to kill his new wife, who he suspects is poisoning him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/37X7iZM9GsK5YPwC7w68LmMQLBo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30933'),
  ('242970708750857781', 'Home for the Holidays', 1995, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Jodie Foster, Lajos Koltai, Mike Topoozian', 'W.D. Richter, Chris Radant', 'Holly Hunter, Robert Downey Jr., Anne Bancroft, Charles Durning, Dylan McDermott, Geraldine Chaplin, Steve Guttenberg, Cynthia Stevenson', 'PG-13', 'After losing her job, making out with her soon-to-be former boss, and finding out that her daughter plans to spend Thanksgiving with her boyfriend, Claudia Larson faces spending the holiday with her unhinged family.', 'After losing her job, making out with her soon-to-be former boss, and finding out that her daughter plans to spend Thanksgiving with her boyfriend, Claudia Larson faces spending the holiday with her unhinged family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3zqlKdOttWyExzopVxglz50Vjxq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9089'),
  ('577940980823385222', 'Home for the Weekend', 2012, 'Drama', 'Bogumił Godfrejów, Hans-Christian Schmid', 'Bernd Lange', 'Lars Eidinger, Corinna Harfouch, Sebastian Zimmler, Ernst Stötzner, Picco von Groote, Egon Merten, Birge Schade, Eva Meckbach', null, 'On the request of his mother Gitte, Marko, who has been living in Berlin for years, drives off to the countryside to visit his parents. His hopes of spending a quiet and relaxing time with his family fall short when Gitte surprises everyone by revealing that she has recovered after a long mental illness. Marko is the only one who respects her wish from now on to be treated as a full member of this family and, as a result, ends up tipping more than just the delicate balance of his parent’s seemingly harmonious relationship.', 'On the request of his mother Gitte, Marko, who has been living in Berlin for years, drives off to the countryside to visit his parents. His hopes of spending a quiet and relaxing time with his family fall short when Gitte surprises everyone by revealing that she has recovered after a long mental illness. Marko is the only one who respects her wish from now on to be treated as a full member of this family and, as a result, ends up tipping more than just the delicate balance of his parent’s seemingly harmonious relationship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bZaXhMJ3ibzd6w26nBwMkfgnrWj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:88249'),
  ('790813607679620539', 'Home Fries', 1998, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Jerzy Zieliński, Dean Parisot', 'Vince Gilligan', 'Drew Barrymore, Catherine O''Hara, Luke Wilson, Jake Busey, Shelley Duvall, Kim Robillard, Daryl Mitchell, Lanny Flaherty', 'PG-13', 'Dorian and Angus chase down their womanizing stepfather with a helicopter, frightening him to death. In his effort to cover their tracks, Dorian begins investigating his stepfather''s mistress, Sally. She works at a fast-food drive-through, she''s pregnant and Dorian quickly falls in love with her. Unfortunately, his scheming mother wants Sally dead. And Sally isn''t sure she wants Dorian to be her child''s father and also his brother.', 'Dorian and Angus chase down their womanizing stepfather with a helicopter, frightening him to death. In his effort to cover their tracks, Dorian begins investigating his stepfather''s mistress, Sally. She works at a fast-food drive-through, she''s pregnant and Dorian quickly falls in love with her. Unfortunately, his scheming mother wants Sally dead. And Sally isn''t sure she wants Dorian to be her child''s father and also his brother.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rXEpaJIPlBqKq7QepB8uowmeAT2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12257'),
  ('1090518828846709222', 'Home from Home – Chronicle of a Vision', 2013, 'Drama, History', 'Edgar Reitz, Gernot Roll', 'Edgar Reitz, Gert Heidenreich', 'Jan Dieter Schneider, Antonia Bill, Maximilian Scheidt, Marita Breuer, Rüdiger Kriese, Philine Lembeck, Mélanie Fouché, Eva Zeidler', null, 'Follow-up to the TV trilogy “Heimat”, this time for cinemas, set again in the fictional village Schabbach in the Hunsrück region of Rhineland-Palatinate.', 'Follow-up to the TV trilogy “Heimat”, this time for cinemas, set again in the fictional village Schabbach in the Hunsrück region of Rhineland-Palatinate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aIgtT1WQaLnFmhEZGtfotYv9YY0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:215740'),
  ('537759518039293630', 'Home from the Hill', 1960, 'Drama, Romance', 'Vincente Minnelli, Milton Krasner', 'Irving Ravetch, Harriet Frank Jr.', 'Robert Mitchum, Eleanor Parker, George Peppard, George Hamilton, Everett Sloane, Luana Patten, Anne Seymour, Constance Ford', 'NR', 'The wealthiest man in a Texas town decides to teach his teenage son how to hunt to make a man out of him.', 'The wealthiest man in a Texas town decides to teach his teenage son how to hunt to make a man out of him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cE52KPgeJqDyaVu29OFGKqSDyET.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:89484'),
  ('679728165311828582', 'Home Front', 2020, 'Drama, History', 'Lucas Belvaux, Guillaume Deffontaines', 'Lucas Belvaux', 'Gérard Depardieu, Catherine Frot, Jean-Pierre Darroussin, Yoann Zimmer, Félix Kysyl, Édouard Sulpice, Fleur Fitoussi, Ahmed Hammoud', null, 'Burgundy, France. Solange''s 60th birthday celebrations are violently interrupted by her estranged brother, Bernard. His outburst will reawaken painful memories and reveal untold stories of the Algerian War.', 'Burgundy, France. Solange''s 60th birthday celebrations are violently interrupted by her estranged brother, Bernard. His outburst will reawaken painful memories and reveal untold stories of the Algerian War.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xslbFv3oLhbbeqqOu98W1kPbs03.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:660004'),
  ('1078470832975575428', 'Home in Indiana', 1944, 'Adventure, Drama, Romance', 'Henry Hathaway, Edward Cronjager', 'Winston Miller', 'Lon McCallister, Jeanne Crain, Walter Brennan, June Haver, Charlotte Greenwood, Ward Bond, Charles Dingle, George H. Reed', 'NR', '''Sparke'' Thorton, a lad with a penchant for trouble, is sent to live with his Uncle and Aunt Bolt in Indiana after his Aunt Henrietta Bolt dies. Though he''s not happy about the arrangement at first, his love of horses and his affection for a young filly that he plans to race make life bearable. He also finds romance with tomboyish ''Char'' Bruce who shares his love for horses.', '''Sparke'' Thorton, a lad with a penchant for trouble, is sent to live with his Uncle and Aunt Bolt in Indiana after his Aunt Henrietta Bolt dies. Though he''s not happy about the arrangement at first, his love of horses and his affection for a young filly that he plans to race make life bearable. He also finds romance with tomboyish ''Char'' Bruce who shares his love for horses.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bPQBbyL8SOB2b3zvJj1zLYzw35Q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:218105'),
  ('8213420336471640', 'Home Invasion', 2016, 'Thriller, Crime, Horror', 'David Tennant, Toby Gorman, Florian Halbedl', 'Peter Sullivan', 'Natasha Henstridge, Jason Patric, Liam Dickinson, Scott Adkins, Kyra Zagorsky, Michael J Rogers, Christian Tessier, Brenda Crichlow', 'PG-13', 'Terror arrives at the one place we all feel safest... When a wealthy woman, Chloe, and her stepson, Jacob, are targeted by a trio of expert thieves in their remote mansion, her only form of help comes from a call with Mike, a security systems specialist. But as the intruders become increasingly hostile and the connection wavers, will she trust him to be her eyes and navigate her to safety?', 'Terror arrives at the one place we all feel safest... When a wealthy woman, Chloe, and her stepson, Jacob, are targeted by a trio of expert thieves in their remote mansion, her only form of help comes from a call with Mike, a security systems specialist. But as the intruders become increasingly hostile and the connection wavers, will she trust him to be her eyes and navigate her to safety?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9Wbt3orDldytLe3JMOl2lzukxnw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:380565'),
  ('1124957184707335173', 'Home Made Home', 1951, 'Animation', 'Jack Kinney', 'Dick Kinney, Milt Schaffer', 'Pinto Colvig', 'G', 'Goofy''s building a house, and struggling with the blueprints, the window glass, the paint, and finally the house-warming guests.', 'Goofy''s building a house, and struggling with the blueprints, the window glass, the paint, and finally the house-warming guests.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Ir1NxS9OLiomaaV0q15FPXGWTm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:66878'),
  ('341190218911465242', 'Home Makeover', 2010, 'Animation, Family, Comedy', 'Samuel Tourneux, Kyle Balda', 'Brett Hoffman', 'Miranda Cosgrove, Dana Gaier, Elsie Fisher, Pierre Coffin', 'G', 'When a social worker visits Gru’s house to assess its suitability for children, chaos ensues. Margo, Edith, and Agnes, along with the ever-mischievous Minions, scramble to give the home a makeover in record time. Their attempts to create a warm and inviting environment quickly spiral into hilarity as the Minions’ unorthodox methods lead to outrageous results. This short captures the Minions’ inventive, albeit chaotic, solutions, blending humor with heartwarming moments of teamwork.', 'When a social worker visits Gru’s house to assess its suitability for children, chaos ensues. Margo, Edith, and Agnes, along with the ever-mischievous Minions, scramble to give the home a makeover in record time. Their attempts to create a warm and inviting environment quickly spiral into hilarity as the Minions’ unorthodox methods lead to outrageous results. This short captures the Minions’ inventive, albeit chaotic, solutions, blending humor with heartwarming moments of teamwork.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ch1QTMEOBrBhSSILw6CPFXCdxgB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54553'),
  ('720627986081328238', 'Home Movie', 2008, 'Drama, Horror, Thriller', 'Christopher Denham, William M. Miller, Richard Peete', 'Christopher Denham', 'Adrian Pasdar, Cady McClain, Amber Joy Williams, Austin Williams, Lucian Maisel, River O''Neal', 'R', 'Reverend David Poe and his psychiatrist wife trade hectic New York life for an idyllic rural farmhouse; the perfect place for 10 year old twins Jack & Emily to run, play and imagine. Documenting this lifestyle change, David decides to film every holiday and special family event. To the Poe''s horror their home movies reveal an increasing malice and evil within their children.', 'Reverend David Poe and his psychiatrist wife trade hectic New York life for an idyllic rural farmhouse; the perfect place for 10 year old twins Jack & Emily to run, play and imagine. Documenting this lifestyle change, David decides to film every holiday and special family event. To the Poe''s horror their home movies reveal an increasing malice and evil within their children.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iy3c2eeEW714ZJ8t0NtsS1wZTiK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27258'),
  ('200649017877822787', 'Home Movies', 1980, 'Comedy', 'Brian De Palma, James L. Carter, Mark Romanek', 'Charlie Loventhal, Dana Edelman, Gloria Norris', 'Nancy Allen, Mary Davenport, Kirk Douglas, Vincent Gardenia, Keith Gordon, Gerrit Graham, Loretta Tupper, Captain Haggerty', 'PG', 'A cult guru urges a shy disciple to make life a movie and be its star.', 'A cult guru urges a shy disciple to make life a movie and be its star.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r1d7syjC3bRKAFCfahCZ6PjD8XI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:6984'),
  ('851854625478382789', 'Home of the Brave', 1949, 'Drama, War', 'Mark Robson, Robert De Grasse, Ivan Volkman', 'Arthur Laurents, Carl Foreman', 'Jeff Corey, James Edwards, Lloyd Bridges, Douglas Dick, Frank Lovejoy, Steve Brodie, Cliff Clark', 'NR', 'A sensitive, educated black man''s World War II-time problems. This is essentially the duplicate of his peace-time problems which are pointed up in a flashback of his life, and primarily of his war-time adventures with four white soldiers on a dangerous reconnaissance mission on a Japanese-held island.', 'A sensitive, educated black man''s World War II-time problems. This is essentially the duplicate of his peace-time problems which are pointed up in a flashback of his life, and primarily of his war-time adventures with four white soldiers on a dangerous reconnaissance mission on a Japanese-held island.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5DCIWBuKVZmJcM61gOcPDzm4sRU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:90807'),
  ('543342875120206729', 'Home of the Brave', 2006, 'War, Drama', 'Irwin Winkler, Tony Pierce-Roberts', 'Mark Friedman', 'Samuel L. Jackson, Jessica Biel, Christina Ricci, Victoria Rowell, 50 Cent, Sam Jones, Chad Michael Murray, Jeffrey Nordling', 'R', 'The day after they get the word they''ll go home in two weeks, a group of soldiers from Spokane are ambushed in an Iraqi city. Back stateside we follow four of them - a surgeon who saw too much, a teacher who''s a single mom and who lost a hand in the ambush, an infantry man whose best friend died that day, and a soldier who keeps reliving the moment he killed a civilian woman.', 'The day after they get the word they''ll go home in two weeks, a group of soldiers from Spokane are ambushed in an Iraqi city. Back stateside we follow four of them - a surgeon who saw too much, a teacher who''s a single mom and who lost a hand in the ambush, an infantry man whose best friend died that day, and a soldier who keeps reliving the moment he killed a civilian woman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eQokFEJYba9PUhJ99W0TsxzOynp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14171'),
  ('668992968441348998', 'Home of the Brave: A Film by Laurie Anderson', 1986, 'Music, Documentary', 'Laurie Anderson, Richard Garber, Nina K. Noble', 'Laurie Anderson', 'Laurie Anderson, Joy Askew, Adrian Belew, William S. Burroughs, Dickie Landry, Dolette McDonald, Park Won-Sang, Janice Pendarvis', null, 'A concert film directed by and featuring the music of Laurie Anderson, filmed at the Park Theater in Union City, New Jersey, during the summer of 1985. The film includes songs from her 1984 album 1984’s “Mister Heartbreak” and selections from her 1983 “United States” show, along with eclectic, experimental visuals blending film, animation, dance and electronics.', 'A concert film directed by and featuring the music of Laurie Anderson, filmed at the Park Theater in Union City, New Jersey, during the summer of 1985. The film includes songs from her 1984 album 1984’s “Mister Heartbreak” and selections from her 1983 “United States” show, along with eclectic, experimental visuals blending film, animation, dance and electronics.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/beUQd3AsEc63IxtmI3P2mI6vBzq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:117680'),
