  ('568661820211684950', 'Home Owners', 2022, 'Comedy, Fantasy, Thriller', 'Pablo Aragüés, Adrián Barcelóna, Marta Cabrera', 'Pablo Aragüés', 'Bárbara Goenaga, Gorka Otxoa, Luisa Gavasa, Kira Miró, Jorge Usón', null, 'Ana and Maxi are a couple in their 30''s who have just found the house of their dreams. Everything is perfect until they realize that it is even better: the house gives them everything they ask for. But, what will happen if they stop doing it?', 'Ana and Maxi are a couple in their 30''s who have just found the house of their dreams. Everything is perfect until they realize that it is even better: the house gives them everything they ask for. But, what will happen if they stop doing it?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fnbnFLzhXvDPqLazIR9dD8UA7yv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1017829'),
