  ('905337261271108034', 'Homebound', 2025, 'Drama', 'Neeraj Ghaywan, Pratik Shah, Jogi Malang', 'Neeraj Ghaywan', 'Ishaan Khatter, Vishal Jethwa, Janhvi Kapoor, Shalini Vatsa, Pankaj Dubey, Harshika Parmar, Chandan Anand, Dadhi Pandey', 'R', 'Two childhood friends from a small North Indian village chase a police job that promises them the dignity they’ve long been denied. But as they inch closer to their dream, mounting desperation threatens the bond that holds them together.', 'Two childhood friends from a small North Indian village chase a police job that promises them the dignity they’ve long been denied. But as they inch closer to their dream, mounting desperation threatens the bond that holds them together.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vyezjSvSdLO0bvr6jSNuFi6yuiw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1227739'),
  ('355357398786603463', 'Homeboy', 1988, 'Drama', 'Michael Seresin, Gale Tattersall', 'Mickey Rourke', 'Mickey Rourke, Christopher Walken, Jon Polito, Debra Feuer, Antony Alda, Thomas Quinn, Kevin Conway, Rubén Blades', 'R', 'Johnny Walker is a cowboy and a boxer. He is very shy and a bit of a fool. He is in love with Ruby, but he cannot tell her. He is also a bit old to keep on boxing, but its the only thing he does well.', 'Johnny Walker is a cowboy and a boxer. He is very shy and a bit of a fool. He is in love with Ruby, but he cannot tell her. He is also a bit old to keep on boxing, but its the only thing he does well.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kBgj9y1mrzFCxtnktsnZeVWRgVC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12787'),
  ('787005465418337875', 'Homecoming', 1928, 'Drama', 'Joe May, Günther Rittau', 'Joe May, Fritz Wendhausen, Joe May', 'Lars Hanson, Dita Parlo, Gustav Fröhlich, Theodor Loos, Philipp Manning', null, 'Following World War I, after a long imprisonment, two German prisoner-of-war soldiers escape from a Siberian lead-mine. Karl manages to reach Germany before Richard, and is sheltered by Anna, wife of Richard. While Richard is still on his homeward trek, Karl and Anna fall in love. And then Richard comes home.', 'Following World War I, after a long imprisonment, two German prisoner-of-war soldiers escape from a Siberian lead-mine. Karl manages to reach Germany before Richard, and is sheltered by Anna, wife of Richard. While Richard is still on his homeward trek, Karl and Anna fall in love. And then Richard comes home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/74drcp8kxDzO6HdzHvtMnWjVZLM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:133649'),
  ('378504766748382904', 'Homecoming', 1948, 'Drama, Romance, War', 'Mervyn LeRoy, Norman Elzer, Harold Rosson', 'Paul Osborn', 'Clark Gable, Lana Turner, Anne Baxter, John Hodiak, Ray Collins, Gladys Cooper, Cameron Mitchell, Marshall Thompson', 'NR', 'Self-absorbed Dr. Lee Johnson enlists with the Army medical corps during World War II, more out of a feeling that it''s "the thing to do" rather than deep-seated patriotism. On his first day, he''s put into place by ''Snapshot'', a sassy and attractive nurse. Their initial antagonism blossoms into romance. Lee then finds himself torn with guilt over being unfaithful to his wife, Penny, who''s waiting for him back home.', 'Self-absorbed Dr. Lee Johnson enlists with the Army medical corps during World War II, more out of a feeling that it''s "the thing to do" rather than deep-seated patriotism. On his first day, he''s put into place by ''Snapshot'', a sassy and attractive nurse. Their initial antagonism blossoms into romance. Lee then finds himself torn with guilt over being unfaithful to his wife, Penny, who''s waiting for him back home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rkrIGWsQQmHTqoc5zdGrCgI7Xwt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:102026'),
