  ('988758674445267437', 'Homer and Eddie', 1989, 'Comedy, Crime, Mystery', 'Andrei Konchalovsky, Lajos Koltai', 'Patrick Cirillo', 'Jim Belushi, Whoopi Goldberg, John Waters, Robert Glaudini, James Thiel, Jeff Thiel, Andy Jarrell, Anne Ramsey', 'R', 'A mentally disabled man gets help from a sociopath when he tries to reunite with his dying father, who years earlier disowned him.', 'A mentally disabled man gets help from a sociopath when he tries to reunite with his dying father, who years earlier disowned him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b4gM4Yh40QnYXkXiFao6nDFomjL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46786'),
  ('149432163165331005', 'Homerun', 2003, 'Family, Drama', 'Jack Neo', 'Jack Neo', 'Jack Neo, Mark Lee, Chung Yiu-Nam, Shawn Lee, Megan Zheng Zhi-Yun, Marcus Chin, M.C. King, Patricia Mok', null, 'A remake of the award-winning Iranian film Children of Heaven, Homerun is a drama about two poor siblings and their adventures over a lost pair of shoes.', 'A remake of the award-winning Iranian film Children of Heaven, Homerun is a drama about two poor siblings and their adventures over a lost pair of shoes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9ZeDMtjtGIbM6bysmH9bXf7X0HW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:195763'),
  ('986542667216721236', 'Homesick', 2015, 'Drama', 'Anne Sewitsky, Daniel Voldheim, Binne Thoresen', 'Anne Sewitsky, Ragnhild Tronvoll', 'Ine Marie Wilmann, Simon J. Berger, Silje Storstein, Anneke von der Lippe, Oddgeir Thune, Kari Onstad Winge, Terje Strømdahl, Ida Marianne Vassbotn Klasson', null, 'When Charlotte, 27, meets her brother Henrik, 35, for the first time as an adult, it becomes an encounter without boundaries, between two people who don''t know what a normal family is. How does sibling love manifest itself if you have never experienced it before? Homesick is an unusual family drama about seeking a family, and breaking every rule to be one.', 'When Charlotte, 27, meets her brother Henrik, 35, for the first time as an adult, it becomes an encounter without boundaries, between two people who don''t know what a normal family is. How does sibling love manifest itself if you have never experienced it before? Homesick is an unusual family drama about seeking a family, and breaking every rule to be one.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cuO7fTeecF5ngAVOvGmKFKd3W7H.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:308403'),
  ('577531138677007325', 'Homestay', 2018, 'Drama, Thriller, Fantasy', 'Naruphol Chokanapitak, Parkpoom Wongpoom, Songphon Jantharasom', 'Eakasit Thairaat, Abhichoke Chandrasen, Thodsapon Thiptinnakorn', 'Teeradon Supapunpinyo, Cherprang Areekul, Saruda Kiatwarawut, Suquan Bulakul, Roj Kwantham, Nathasit Kotimanuswanich, Atom Samphanthaphap, Nopachai Jayanama', null, 'When a spirit inhabits the body of a teen named Min, he begins to settle into his life until he''s forced to find out who caused Min''s mysterious death.', 'When a spirit inhabits the body of a teen named Min, he begins to settle into his life until he''s forced to find out who caused Min''s mysterious death.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/heSIBApD96i1WtQK6xnfVrMX3kv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:549432'),
  ('955919238973496323', 'Homestay', 2022, 'Drama, Mystery, Fantasy', 'Natsuki Seta', 'Tomoe Kanno', 'Kento Nagao, Anna Yamada, Rikako Yagi, Kuranosuke Sasaki, Hikari Ishida, Ayumu Mochizuki, Daichi Watanabe, Kiyohiko Shibukawa', null, 'Upon reaching the train station to death, a dejected soul is informed that he is "lucky" and will have another chance at life. He is placed in the body of a 14-year-old boy named Makoto Kobayashi, who just died, and needs to figure out the cause of his death.', 'Upon reaching the train station to death, a dejected soul is informed that he is "lucky" and will have another chance at life. He is placed in the body of a 14-year-old boy named Makoto Kobayashi, who just died, and needs to figure out the cause of his death.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1ljGmV5aJBUJP45BsHNsvYKk5l1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:899686'),
  ('911059668761137708', 'Homestead', 2024, 'Drama', 'Ben Smallbone, Matthew Rivera, Jennie Morris', 'Jason Ross', 'Dawn Olivieri, Neal McDonough, Susan Misner, Bailey Chase, Jesse Hutch, Kevin Lawson, Kearran Giovanni, Currie Graham', 'PG-13', 'A nuclear bomb is detonated in Los Angeles, and the nation devolves into unprecedented chaos. Ex-Green Beret Jeff Eriksson and his family escape to The Homestead, an eccentric prepper’s fortress nestled in the mountains. As violent threats and apocalyptic conditions creep toward their borders, the residents of The Homestead are left to wonder: how long can a group of people resist both the dangers of human nature and the bloodshed at their doorstep?', 'A nuclear bomb is detonated in Los Angeles, and the nation devolves into unprecedented chaos. Ex-Green Beret Jeff Eriksson and his family escape to The Homestead, an eccentric prepper’s fortress nestled in the mountains. As violent threats and apocalyptic conditions creep toward their borders, the residents of The Homestead are left to wonder: how long can a group of people resist both the dangers of human nature and the bloodshed at their doorstep?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fKts7WTTP7KWvI6N7WYIuEhmgXP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1217690'),
  ('726996921277835960', 'Homesteader Droopy', 1954, 'Animation, Western, Comedy', 'Tex Avery', null, 'Bill Thompson, Paul Frees', null, 'Droopy and family head west to start a new homestead, but have to defend it against Dishonest Dan the cattle man.', 'Droopy and family head west to start a new homestead, but have to defend it against Dishonest Dan the cattle man.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oaTfnn5k1sckvixAWFI0pWJQy5p.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84888'),
  ('1046270347878259479', 'Homevideo', 2011, 'Drama', 'Kilian Riedhof, Benedict Neuenfels', 'Jan Braren', 'Jonas Nay, Wotan Wilke Möhring, Nicole Marischka, Sophia Boehme, Jannik Schümann, Petra Kelling, Anett Heilfort, Willi Gerk', null, 'Shy, sensitive high school outsider Jakob Moormann is miserably lacking immaterial support at home, where his strict father, uniformed cop Claas, and selfish mother are too busy breaking up to be there for him. Jakob focuses on class dream-girl Hannah, without much luck. His secret recording of himself masturbating gets into class bullies Henry and Erik''s hands through the mother''s thoughtlessness. The rascals blackmail Jakob and post the video on the Internet. After a raging lecture phase, dad stands up for Jakob, but his life is already wrecked more than anyone realizes.', 'Shy, sensitive high school outsider Jakob Moormann is miserably lacking immaterial support at home, where his strict father, uniformed cop Claas, and selfish mother are too busy breaking up to be there for him. Jakob focuses on class dream-girl Hannah, without much luck. His secret recording of himself masturbating gets into class bullies Henry and Erik''s hands through the mother''s thoughtlessness. The rascals blackmail Jakob and post the video on the Internet. After a raging lecture phase, dad stands up for Jakob, but his life is already wrecked more than anyone realizes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4tbyRMlETn7RwobflixlZ1uz0f4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:79016'),
  ('827168748853882532', 'Homeward', 2020, 'Animation, Adventure, Comedy, Family, Fantasy', 'Michael Johnson', 'Aaron Witlin', 'Joey Lawrence, James Cullen Bressack, Kim Little, D. C. Douglas, Tammy Klein, Audrey Latt, Tom Green, Joyce Tatler', 'G', 'A boastful elf and his prank-happy orc brother must learn to work together to stop a fiendish orc gang from retrieving a magical stone that will give them the power to take over the world.', 'A boastful elf and his prank-happy orc brother must learn to work together to stop a fiendish orc gang from retrieving a magical stone that will give them the power to take over the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eBfo1wKsE6qIbhKMFg2gJbG2QAt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:674942'),
  ('507413183764599457', 'Homeward Bound II: Lost in San Francisco', 1996, 'Adventure, Comedy, Drama, Family', 'David R. Ellis, Jack Conroy', 'Julie Hickson, Chris Hauty', 'Michael J. Fox, Sally Field, Ralph Waite, Robert Hays, Kim Greist, Michael Bell, Tisha Campbell, Al Michaels', 'G', 'When the pets accidentally get separated from their vacationing owners, Chance, Shadow, and Sassy navigate the mean streets of San Francisco, trying to find their home across the Golden Gate Bridge. But the road is blocked by a series of hazards, both man and beast.', 'When the pets accidentally get separated from their vacationing owners, Chance, Shadow, and Sassy navigate the mean streets of San Francisco, trying to find their home across the Golden Gate Bridge. But the road is blocked by a series of hazards, both man and beast.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kfYawa9SF9MQ3ae0TXAfhDLFGv7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25059'),
  ('914204319844897971', 'Homeward Bound: The Incredible Journey', 1993, 'Adventure, Comedy, Family', 'Reed Smoot, Duwayne Dunham', 'Caroline Thompson, Linda Woolverton', 'Michael J. Fox, Sally Field, Don Ameche, Kevin Chevalia, Benj Thall, Veronica Lauren, Kim Greist, Robert Hays', 'G', 'Before the Seavers leave for a family vacation to San Francisco, they drop off their pets -- Chance, an adventurous American bulldog; Shadow, a wise golden retriever; and Sassy, a cautious cat -- at a friend''s ranch. But when the animals start to worry that they''ve been left for good, the three embark together on a treacherous and thrilling journey to find their way back home through the California wilderness.', 'Before the Seavers leave for a family vacation to San Francisco, they drop off their pets -- Chance, an adventurous American bulldog; Shadow, a wise golden retriever; and Sassy, a cautious cat -- at a friend''s ranch. But when the animals start to worry that they''ve been left for good, the three embark together on a treacherous and thrilling journey to find their way back home through the California wilderness.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/el6dJEpK97OJRQiQhuiSGk2jkV5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:6878'),
  ('267764601626288643', 'Homework', 1982, 'Comedy, Drama', 'James Beshears', 'Maurice Peterson, Don Safran', 'Joan Collins, Michael Morgan, Shell Kepler, Lanny Horn, Erin Donovan, Lee Purcell, Carrie Snodgress, Wings Hauser', 'R', 'Good-looking but virginal "rockstar" teen Tommy tries to score with some of the local high school girls. But a classmate''s mom decides to make a man out of him.', 'Good-looking but virginal "rockstar" teen Tommy tries to score with some of the local high school girls. But a classmate''s mom decides to make a man out of him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fIgGU39q3h4n1f2GhWp1kAneAZ7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30412'),
