  ('777307489707268649', 'Homework', 1991, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Jaime Humberto Hermosillo, Toni Kuhn', 'Jaime Humberto Hermosillo', 'María Rojo, José Alonso', null, 'Virginia is taking a class at film school, and has decided on her solo project for the class. She will secretly film herself and her ex-husband Marcelo with a candid camera while they make love.', 'Virginia is taking a class at film school, and has decided on her solo project for the class. She will secretly film herself and her ex-husband Marcelo with a candid camera while they make love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2SZ3Bf5ctcMVLxoc2uNv4xY3Z8N.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:205763'),
  ('677289389593150400', 'Homewrecker', 2020, 'Comedy, Horror', 'Zach Gayne', 'Precious Chong, Alex Essoe, Zach Gayne', 'Alex Essoe, Precious Chong, Kris Siddiqi, Tony Matthews', null, 'Michelle is an interior designer and newlywed to Robert. Linda lives alone and fills her days with painting and exercise classes. Seeking a new friend, Linda coerces the reserved, deferential Michelle into visiting her home for a spontaneous interior design consultation. Once inside, it quickly becomes clear that Linda has something far more sinister on her mind than throw pillows.', 'Michelle is an interior designer and newlywed to Robert. Linda lives alone and fills her days with painting and exercise classes. Seeking a new friend, Linda coerces the reserved, deferential Michelle into visiting her home for a spontaneous interior design consultation. Once inside, it quickly becomes clear that Linda has something far more sinister on her mind than throw pillows.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l8Y2DMYfwDoAVXJyb1UJwQi6bOT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:611642'),
  ('64578052043942489', 'Homicidal', 1961, 'Horror, Thriller', 'William Castle, Burnett Guffey, Al Shenberg', 'Robb White', 'Glenn Corbett, Patricia Breslin, Eugenie Leontovich, Alan Bunce, Richard Rust, James Westerfield, Gilbert Green, Joan Marshall', null, 'A woman named Emily checks into a hotel and offers the bellboy $2000 to temporarily marry her. We soon find out Emily is the caretaker of a wheelchair-bound mute named Helga, who was the childhood guardian of a pair of siblings: Miriam Webster and her half-brother, Warren, who is about to inherit the estate of their late father. Who is the mysterious Emily and what are her intentions?', 'A woman named Emily checks into a hotel and offers the bellboy $2000 to temporarily marry her. We soon find out Emily is the caretaker of a wheelchair-bound mute named Helga, who was the childhood guardian of a pair of siblings: Miriam Webster and her half-brother, Warren, who is about to inherit the estate of their late father. Who is the mysterious Emily and what are her intentions?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vlZQlwdGJSRopkokReMPpqUNBjj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29394'),
  ('790765181511244658', 'Homicide', 1991, 'Drama, Crime, Mystery, Thriller', 'David Mamet, Roger Deakins', 'David Mamet', 'Joe Mantegna, William H. Macy, Vincent Guastaferro, J.J. Johnston, Jack Wallace, Lionel Mark Smith, Rebecca Pidgeon, Ving Rhames', null, 'While investigating the ruthless murder of an elderly woman, a Jewish police detective unravels a bizarre conspiracy involving a Zionist organization.', 'While investigating the ruthless murder of an elderly woman, a Jewish police detective unravels a bizarre conspiracy involving a Zionist organization.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1CywcTyQ2Dbh7LA0Lcf13iaC1ig.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22828'),
  ('286683505407516355', 'Homicide: The Movie', 2000, 'Drama, Crime, TV Movie', 'Jean de Segonzac, Jean de Segonzac', 'Eric Overmyer, Tom Fontana, James Yoshimura', 'Daniel Baldwin, Ned Beatty, Richard Belzer, Andre Braugher, Reed Diamond, Giancarlo Esposito, Michelle Forbes, Peter Gerety', null, 'Retired police lieutenant Al Giardello is running for mayor when he is suddenly shot at a press conference. All of the detectives, past and present, clamor for an opportunity to help find the shooter.', 'Retired police lieutenant Al Giardello is running for mayor when he is suddenly shot at a press conference. All of the detectives, past and present, clamor for an opportunity to help find the shooter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4L8vCP1Bp6U25JVa1jUm6VzHgBa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31006'),
  ('316837151062603140', 'Homme Fatale', 2019, 'Comedy, Romance, History', 'Han Ki-eop, Nam Dae-joong, Na Seung-yong', 'Nam Dae-joong', 'Lee Jun-ho, Jung So-min, Choi Gwi-hwa, Ye Ji-won, Gong Myoung, Lee Il-hwa, Ha Jae-sook, Jeon No-min', null, 'When Huh Saek decides to become a male gisaeng, he captivates countless women with his looks and talents but doubts the existence of true love — until he meets a girl with progressive ideas.', 'When Huh Saek decides to become a male gisaeng, he captivates countless women with his looks and talents but doubts the existence of true love — until he meets a girl with progressive ideas.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pgcNkpbbfA1RpB0FV6bVejR4T1t.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:598440'),
  ('356372284950407516', 'Homo Argentum', 2025, 'Comedy', 'Mariano Cohn, Gastón Duprat, Leo Resende Ferreira', 'Mariano Cohn, Gastón Duprat, Andrés Duprat', 'Guillermo Francella, Marcelo Melingo, Sabrina Olmedo, Fernanda Lanusse, Juan Bruchou, Virginia Lagarrigue, Fernando Ariel Menghi, Alberto Damián Fusaro', null, 'The film consists of 16 shorts that explore, with humor and social criticism, the characteristics of the Argentine identity.', 'The film consists of 16 shorts that explore, with humor and social criticism, the characteristics of the Argentine identity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/21WlZtv1GZgiD2qAVHOkg63LRmU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1471345'),
  ('657057074330834106', 'Homo Erectus', 2007, 'Comedy', 'Adam Rifkin, Scott Billups, Meg Beatty', 'Adam Rifkin', 'Adam Rifkin, Ali Larter, Talia Shire, Hayes MacArthur, Gary Busey, Giuseppe Andrews, Miles Dougal, Tom Hodges', 'R', 'Ishbo is a caveman living in the prehistoric age who thinks there''s more to life than hunting and gathering. He tries to better the lives of those in his tribe by inventing things like spoons and the toothbrush, which leave everyone, including his parents, unimpressed. He also has a thing for cavewoman Fardart, but she only has eyes for his brother Thudnik. Can Ishbo prove his worth when a rival clan attacks?', 'Ishbo is a caveman living in the prehistoric age who thinks there''s more to life than hunting and gathering. He tries to better the lives of those in his tribe by inventing things like spoons and the toothbrush, which leave everyone, including his parents, unimpressed. He also has a thing for cavewoman Fardart, but she only has eyes for his brother Thudnik. Can Ishbo prove his worth when a rival clan attacks?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xSq1sUbExLnA6WY2FDyDTBzz2By.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14641'),
  ('706725666264089947', 'Homo sapiens', 2005, 'Documentary, History', 'Jacques Malaterre, Chip Proser', 'Yves Coppens, Frédéric Fougea, Pierre Pelot', null, null, 'Two hundred and fifty thousand years ago, the first direct representative of our species appeared on earth: Homo Sapiens... From 400,000 to 20,000 BC, we follow the destiny of Homo Erectus, Neanderthal and Sapiens. We will thus discover the appearance of language, art, cults, agriculture, and breeding.', 'Two hundred and fifty thousand years ago, the first direct representative of our species appeared on earth: Homo Sapiens... From 400,000 to 20,000 BC, we follow the destiny of Homo Erectus, Neanderthal and Sapiens. We will thus discover the appearance of language, art, cults, agriculture, and breeding.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cL9Srs7u1mY3BjdJd0gnpxgRm0G.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:61945'),
  ('989329583154489144', 'Homo Sapiens', 2016, 'Documentary', 'Nikolaus Geyrhalter, Nikolaus Geyrhalter', 'Nikolaus Geyrhalter', null, null, 'HOMO SAPIENS is visionary documentarian Nikolaus Geyrhalter''s exploration of the finiteness and fragility of human existence, the end of the industrial age, and what it means to be a human being. What will remain of our lives after we''re gone? Empty spaces, ruins, cities, increasingly overgrown with vegetation, crumbling asphalt: the areas we currently inhabit, now abandoned and decaying, gradually reclaimed by nature. Comprised of a succession of eerily depopulated, dystopian landscapes from across the world, HOMO SAPIENS offers an at once mesmerizing and chilling vision of what a posthuman future might look like.', 'HOMO SAPIENS is visionary documentarian Nikolaus Geyrhalter''s exploration of the finiteness and fragility of human existence, the end of the industrial age, and what it means to be a human being. What will remain of our lives after we''re gone? Empty spaces, ruins, cities, increasingly overgrown with vegetation, crumbling asphalt: the areas we currently inhabit, now abandoned and decaying, gradually reclaimed by nature. Comprised of a succession of eerily depopulated, dystopian landscapes from across the world, HOMO SAPIENS offers an at once mesmerizing and chilling vision of what a posthuman future might look like.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/evpIbLI8ebs0jMLntcMt6tv1yc1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:382212'),
  ('82941724055314067', 'Homolka and Pocketbook', 1972, 'Comedy', 'J. Sejk, Miroslav Ondříček, Milan Kadlec', 'Jaroslav Papoušek', 'Josef Šebánek, Marie Motlová, Helena Růžičková, František Husák, Petr Forman, Matěj Forman, Jiří Hrzán, Iva Janžurová', null, 'The husband and wife Ludva and Hedus Homolkas with their twins Péta and Máta and Ludva''s parents - the granny and grandpa - arrive in the snowy Spindleruv Mlýn for a holiday. They promise to each other that they will not spoil the quite expensive holiday by quarrels. If somebody hurts the other one he/she will kneel as a punishment.', 'The husband and wife Ludva and Hedus Homolkas with their twins Péta and Máta and Ludva''s parents - the granny and grandpa - arrive in the snowy Spindleruv Mlýn for a holiday. They promise to each other that they will not spoil the quite expensive holiday by quarrels. If somebody hurts the other one he/she will kneel as a punishment.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m18J21Fw9XvnehKa0rRKf7ilRjw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:142726'),
  ('259071052273637766', 'Homophobia', 2012, 'Drama', 'Gregor Schmidinger', 'Gregor Schmidinger', 'Michael Glantschnig, Josef Mohamed, Günther Sturmlechner, Harald Bodingbauer', null, 'An adolescent boy, who serves the military forces, experiences homosexual feelings towards one of his comrades. The suppressed conflict bubbles up during their last night at the border, socially isolated and armed with loaded weapons.', 'An adolescent boy, who serves the military forces, experiences homosexual feelings towards one of his comrades. The suppressed conflict bubbles up during their last night at the border, socially isolated and armed with loaded weapons.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6horVe37A6UVKnuTWRoiqYmgZbO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:115604'),
  ('442472274502249579', 'Homoti', 1987, 'Science Fiction, Comedy, Fantasy, Adventure', 'Müjdat Gezen', 'Müjdat Gezen', 'Müjdat Gezen, Perran Kutman, Bahar Öztan, Altan Erbulak, Demet Akbağ, Savaş Dinçel, Suat Sungur, Ahmet Kostarika', null, 'Ali is a journalist who conducts unsubstantiated interviews. While taking photographs for a story about aliens, he comes across a flying saucer. Out of it comes Homoti from the planet Homon. Homoti does not want Ali to report on him because he does not want to be recognized in the world. However, when journalists soon learn of his existence, they compete for the news. Homoti will have to use her special powers.', 'Ali is a journalist who conducts unsubstantiated interviews. While taking photographs for a story about aliens, he comes across a flying saucer. Out of it comes Homoti from the planet Homon. Homoti does not want Ali to report on him because he does not want to be recognized in the world. However, when journalists soon learn of his existence, they compete for the news. Homoti will have to use her special powers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1chWW0T9nOD6YebDLSoy05jIdbd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:86567'),
  ('659245016080898430', 'Homunculus', 2021, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Jun Fukumoto, Takashi Shimizu, Yuki Kishizuka', 'Eisuke Naito, Takashi Shimizu, Naruki Matsuhisa', 'Go Ayano, Ryo Narita, Yukino Kishii, Anna Ishii, Seiyo Uchino, Yumiko Nakamura', 'NR', 'A homeless man meets a medical school student who pays him to volunteer for a surgical procedure known as trepanation, drilling a hole in his skull, which ends up giving him the ability to communicate with the dark side of people’s subconscious minds.', 'A homeless man meets a medical school student who pays him to volunteer for a surgical procedure known as trepanation, drilling a hole in his skull, which ends up giving him the ability to communicate with the dark side of people’s subconscious minds.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fnqmGW6N9fxEyPEylC2qT4bbUmd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:741434'),
  ('1122257271060190794', 'Hondo', 1953, 'Western', 'John Farrow, Archie Stout, Robert Burks', 'James Edward Grant', 'John Wayne, Geraldine Page, Ward Bond, Michael Pate, James Arness, Rodolfo Acosta, Leo Gordon, Tom Irish', 'NR', 'Army despatch rider Hondo Lane discovers a woman and her son living in the midst of warring Apaches, and he becomes their protector.', 'Army despatch rider Hondo Lane discovers a woman and her son living in the midst of warring Apaches, and he becomes their protector.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ziHGGNGd9SEcrPgd1sdxJ9JPHWO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:6529'),
  ('999679577644913492', 'Honest Candidate', 2020, 'Comedy', 'Choi Chul-su, Jang Yoo-jung, Park Yong-su', 'Heo Sung-hye, Kim Sun, Jang Yoo-jung', 'Ra Mi-ran, Kim Moo-yul, Na Moon-hee, Yoon Kyung-ho, Song Young-chang, On Ju-wan, Cho Han-cheul, Son Jong-hak', null, 'Sang-sook is a competent politician who captivates the public with all kinds of nice words. One day, Sang-sook visits her grandmother who lives in the isolated house. But when she returns home, she finds out that she is not able to lie anymore.', 'Sang-sook is a competent politician who captivates the public with all kinds of nice words. One day, Sang-sook visits her grandmother who lives in the isolated house. But when she returns home, she finds out that she is not able to lie anymore.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/J3ZZ8tSw2Lid3e8frpGVFmdEeQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:605193'),
  ('142058718295152435', 'Honest Candidate 2', 2022, 'Comedy', 'Yoo Il-seung, Lee Jun-il, Kim Yong-u', 'Park Ha-na', 'Ra Mi-ran, Kim Moo-yul, Yoon Kyung-ho, Seo Hyun-woo, Park Jin-joo, Yoon Doo-joon, Kim Yong-rim, Bae Hae-seon', null, 'As a politician, Joo Sang-Sook (Ra Mi-Ran) attempted to run for the fourth time as a member of the nationally assembly. After visiting her grandmother, Joo Sang-Sook was unable to tell a lie. Now, Joo Sang-Sook attempts to return to the political world.', 'As a politician, Joo Sang-Sook (Ra Mi-Ran) attempted to run for the fourth time as a member of the nationally assembly. After visiting her grandmother, Joo Sang-Sook was unable to tell a lie. Now, Joo Sang-Sook attempts to return to the political world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/twEdG9NGbnSOZxEm7e0BF6h5FL5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:795276'),
  ('1099980180467574269', 'Honest Thief', 2020, 'Thriller, Action, Crime', 'Mark Williams, Shelly Johnson, Nicholas Mastandrea', 'Mark Williams, Steve Allrich', 'Liam Neeson, Kate Walsh, Jai Courtney, Jeffrey Donovan, Anthony Ramos, Robert Patrick, Jasmine Cephas Jones, Devon Diep', 'PG-13', 'A bank robber tries to turn himself in because he''s falling in love and wants to live an honest life...but when he realizes the Feds are more corrupt than him, he must fight back to clear his name.', 'A bank robber tries to turn himself in because he''s falling in love and wants to live an honest life...but when he realizes the Feds are more corrupt than him, he must fight back to clear his name.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zeD4PabP6099gpE0STWJrJrCBCs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:553604'),
  ('913922557532272918', 'Honestly, I''m Fine', 2026, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Anne de Clercq, Ezra Reverda, Susanne Groen', 'Anne de Clercq, Eva Aben, Lineke van den Boezem, Myrthe Van Der Meer', 'Gaite Jansen, Jonas Smulders, Gijs Blom, Ariane Schluter, Peter Blok', null, 'Emma is sure that she is happy. She has a successful career, a sweet boyfriend, loving parents, until she ends up in the psychiatric ward of a hospital. This must be a huge mistake. After all, she is a perfectly normal person. Right?', 'Emma is sure that she is happy. She has a successful career, a sweet boyfriend, loving parents, until she ends up in the psychiatric ward of a hospital. This must be a huge mistake. After all, she is a perfectly normal person. Right?', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FjcUdSzPfI006lKYmolzcsy6g8B0.jpg', 'plex:movie:paaz'),
  ('893990769294943740', 'Honey', 1981, 'Drama', 'Gianfranco Angelucci, Jaime Deu Casas, Federico Canudas', 'Enrique U. Herrera', 'Clio Goldsmith, Catherine Spaak, Fernando Rey, Donatella Damiani, Nieves Navarro, Lino Troisi, Adriana Russo, Giuseppe Pennese', 'R', 'A surreal erotic fantasy about a young woman who checks into a bizarre, labyrinthine hotel.', 'A surreal erotic fantasy about a young woman who checks into a bizarre, labyrinthine hotel.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i8DSB20bvAhn8WgpQJIhLbNW9Yj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:339331'),
  ('463861677133466060', 'Honey', 2003, 'Music, Drama, Romance', 'John R. Leonetti, Bille Woodruff, Marcei A. Brubaker Brown', 'Alonzo Brown, Kim Watson', 'Jessica Alba, Mekhi Phifer, Romeo, Joy Bryant, David Moscow, Lonette McKee, Zachary Isaiah Williams, Christian Monzon', 'PG-13', 'Honey Daniels dreams of making a name for herself as a hip-hop choreographer. When she''s not busy hitting downtown clubs with her friends, she teaches dance classes at a nearby community center in Harlem, N.Y., as a way to keep kids off the streets. Honey thinks she''s hit the jackpot when she meets a hotshot director casts her in one of his music videos. But, when he starts demanding sexual favors from her, Honey makes a decision that will change her life.', 'Honey Daniels dreams of making a name for herself as a hip-hop choreographer. When she''s not busy hitting downtown clubs with her friends, she teaches dance classes at a nearby community center in Harlem, N.Y., as a way to keep kids off the streets. Honey thinks she''s hit the jackpot when she meets a hotshot director casts her in one of his music videos. But, when he starts demanding sexual favors from her, Honey makes a decision that will change her life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gnY6d7BoddAAQ8s42fxCJK8lL1A.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10028'),
  ('964197518925433776', 'Honey', 2010, 'Drama', 'Semih Kaplanoğlu, Barış Özbiçer', 'Semih Kaplanoğlu, Orçun Köksal', 'Bora Altaş, Erdal Beşikçioğlu, Tülin Özen, Alev Uçarer, Selami Gökce', null, 'In the remote and undeveloped eastern Black Sea region, a six-year-old boy (Yusuf) wanders through the woods searching for his lost father, trying to make sense of his life.His father is a beekeeper whose bees have disappeared unexpectedly, threatening his livelihood. A bizarre accident kills the father.There is little dialogue or music in the film. The three main characters (Yusuf and his parents) are all fairly taciturn, and the soundtrack is filled out with the sounds of the forest and the creatures that live there.The environment is a recurring theme.', 'In the remote and undeveloped eastern Black Sea region, a six-year-old boy (Yusuf) wanders through the woods searching for his lost father, trying to make sense of his life.His father is a beekeeper whose bees have disappeared unexpectedly, threatening his livelihood. A bizarre accident kills the father.There is little dialogue or music in the film. The three main characters (Yusuf and his parents) are all fairly taciturn, and the soundtrack is filled out with the sounds of the forest and the creatures that live there.The environment is a recurring theme.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1zeG8HGIJI4ae9SI7SGHhHc7pzG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44160'),
  ('236292356216838471', 'Honey', 2013, 'Drama', 'Valeria Golino', 'Francesca Marciano, Valeria Golino, Valia Santella', 'Jasmine Trinca, Carlo Cecchi, Libero De Rienzo, Vinicio Marchioni, Iaia Forte, Roberto De Francesco, Barbara Ronchi, Massimiliano Iacolucci', null, 'Irene, nicknamed ''Miele'', has devote herself to people looking for help, and tries to alleviate their suffering even when they make extreme decisions. One day she has to cope with Grimaldi and his invisible malaise.', 'Irene, nicknamed ''Miele'', has devote herself to people looking for help, and tries to alleviate their suffering even when they make extreme decisions. One day she has to cope with Grimaldi and his invisible malaise.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s7QhAAnHcwc9w45pGQLrBUJwdxh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:186988'),
  ('361528323332733580', 'Honey', 2018, 'Drama, Romance', 'Kōji Shintoku', 'Amu Meguro, Junpei Yamaoka', 'Yuna Taira, Sho Hirano, Ryusei Yokohama, Kaho Mizutani, Nana Asakawa, Gaku Sano, Yu Takahashi, Asami Usuda', null, 'Kogure Nao is a shy and cute high school student. One day, Onise Taiga asks her "would you like to date with me on the promise that we will get married?" Nao is unable to turn down his proposal because she is scared of him. Taiga has red hair and piercing eyes. His appearance gives off the impression that he is a bad boy, but he is actually considerate to others and good at cooking. After getting to know Taiga, Nao begins to have feelings for him.', 'Kogure Nao is a shy and cute high school student. One day, Onise Taiga asks her "would you like to date with me on the promise that we will get married?" Nao is unable to turn down his proposal because she is scared of him. Taiga has red hair and piercing eyes. His appearance gives off the impression that he is a bad boy, but he is actually considerate to others and good at cooking. After getting to know Taiga, Nao begins to have feelings for him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/TsGNfQ5TEIVntNiRa1jE4ruh8s.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:515596'),
  ('777214955397568734', 'Honey', 2026, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Karuna Kumar, Nagesh Bannel', 'Karuna Kumar', 'Naveen Chandra, Divya Pillai, Divi Vadthya, Raja Ravindra, Nalla Sreedhar Reddy Gabbar', null, 'A broken family,a forbidden ritual,and a girl caught between the real and the unreal.Honey is a haunting tale of systemic abuse,spiritual delusion,and the invisible horrors inflicted on children,where the darkest monsters aren''t imaginary.', 'A broken family,a forbidden ritual,and a girl caught between the real and the unreal.Honey is a haunting tale of systemic abuse,spiritual delusion,and the invisible horrors inflicted on children,where the darkest monsters aren''t imaginary.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FaiDE86ihhMcoDpcCLCHvuUDm0en.jpg', 'plex:movie:honey-2026-1'),
  ('1031182097032844734', 'Honey 2', 2011, 'Music, Comedy, Drama', 'Bille Woodruff, David Klein, Todd Hilyard', 'Alyson Fouse, Blayne Weaver', 'Kat Graham, Randy Wayne, Seychelle Gabriel, Audrina Patridge, Brittany Perry-Russell, Melissa Molinaro, Christopher Martinez, Casper Smart', 'PG-13', 'After a brush with the law, Maria has returned to her gritty Bronx roots to rebuild her life with nothing but a talent for street dance and a burning ambition to prove herself.', 'After a brush with the law, Maria has returned to her gritty Bronx roots to rebuild her life with nothing but a talent for street dance and a burning ambition to prove herself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qQnWrF7khfYvpWdEeKhSuoDCGA5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63710'),
  ('597561487284350464', 'Honey 3: Dare to Dance', 2016, 'Music, Drama, Family, Romance', 'Bille Woodruff, Michael Cleary', 'Catherine Cyran', 'Cassie Ventura, Kenny Wormald, Dena Kaplan, Bobby Lockwood, Sibongile Mlambo, Sivuyile Ngesi, Clayton Evertson, Adrian Galley', 'PG-13', 'While attending college in Cape Town, Melea Martin feels constrained by the school''s strict policies, and decides to set out on her own. Searching for a way to use her talents as a dancer and inspire the community around her, Melea rents a failing theater in order to put on a Hip-Hop Romeo and Juliet performance. But much like the Capulets and Montagues, conflicts between cast members threaten to bring the whole performance to a halt...', 'While attending college in Cape Town, Melea Martin feels constrained by the school''s strict policies, and decides to set out on her own. Searching for a way to use her talents as a dancer and inspire the community around her, Melea rents a failing theater in order to put on a Hip-Hop Romeo and Juliet performance. But much like the Capulets and Montagues, conflicts between cast members threaten to bring the whole performance to a halt...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m4K7iMnPRL6wGpwrGuFtCFv8h3M.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:412519'),
  ('158365602115323793', 'Honey and Clover', 2006, 'Drama, Romance', 'Masahiro Takata, Keiji Hasegawa', 'Masahiko Kawahara, Masahiro Takata', 'Sho Sakurai, Yu Aoi, Yūsuke Iseya, Ryo Kase, Megumi Seki, Masato Sakai, Naomi Nishida, Gin Pun Chou', null, 'Adapted from the popular manga of the same name, director Masahiro Takada''s coming of age drama follows five Hama Art College students as they prepare to venture out into the real world on a great voyage of self-discovery.', 'Adapted from the popular manga of the same name, director Masahiro Takada''s coming of age drama follows five Hama Art College students as they prepare to venture out into the real world on a great voyage of self-discovery.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bBoOIXIhbqszK2iu81m1IhofaKl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:72592'),
  ('879596774221112136', 'Honey Boy', 2019, 'Drama', 'Sean Vawter, Colin Flaherty, Zak Faust', 'Shia LaBeouf', 'Shia LaBeouf, Lucas Hedges, Noah Jupe, Byron Bowers, Laura San Giacomo, FKA twigs, Natasha Lyonne, Maika Monroe', 'R', 'The story of a child star attempting to mend his relationship with his law-breaking, alcohol-abusing father over the course of a decade, loosely based on Shia LaBeouf’s life.', 'The story of a child star attempting to mend his relationship with his law-breaking, alcohol-abusing father over the course of a decade, loosely based on Shia LaBeouf’s life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3BZ2rBn31kWER45ZMj7OTe9keMm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:512263'),
  ('825117440851859748', 'Honey Bunch', 2026, 'Fantasy, Horror, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Madeleine Sims-Fewer, Dusty Mancinelli, Jessie Frost', 'Madeleine Sims-Fewer, Dusty Mancinelli', 'Grace Glowicki, Ben Petrie, Jason Isaacs, Kate Dickie, Julian Richings, Jesse LaVercombe, Sarah Kolasky, India Brown', null, 'Diana''s husband is taking her to an experimental trauma facility deep in the wilderness, but she can''t remember why... As her memories begin to creep back in so do some unwelcome sinister truths about her marriage.', 'Diana''s husband is taking her to an experimental trauma facility deep in the wilderness, but she can''t remember why... As her memories begin to creep back in so do some unwelcome sinister truths about her marriage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rR6zS2sPpcjND92cCLmsuMNok7M.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1339173'),
  ('684535609644896922', 'Honey Cigar', 2020, 'Drama', 'Kamir Aïnouz, Jeanne Lapoirie', 'Kamir Aïnouz', 'Zoé Adjani, Amira Casar, Lyes Salem, Louis Peres, Idir Chender, Jud Bengana, Rym Takoucht, Fatima Hachache', null, 'Paris, 1993. Selma, 17, lives in a bourgeois and secular Berber family. When she meets and is strongly attracted to Julien, a dashing young man, she realizes for the first time the heavy rules of her patriarchal family and how they affect her intimacy. As Islamism takes over her country of origin and her family crumbles, Selma discovers the power of her own desire. She must resist and fight. Through the strength of her people, she starts walking down the path of what it means to become a free woman.', 'Paris, 1993. Selma, 17, lives in a bourgeois and secular Berber family. When she meets and is strongly attracted to Julien, a dashing young man, she realizes for the first time the heavy rules of her patriarchal family and how they affect her intimacy. As Islamism takes over her country of origin and her family crumbles, Selma discovers the power of her own desire. She must resist and fight. Through the strength of her people, she starts walking down the path of what it means to become a free woman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q9rDfm0Sq649U6CIZbHdR5Gbz3M.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:661932'),
  ('259428109957002570', 'Honey Don''t!', 2025, 'Comedy, Crime, Mystery, Thriller', 'Ari Wegner, Ethan Coen, Amy Lauritsen', 'Ethan Coen, Tricia Cooke', 'Margaret Qualley, Aubrey Plaza, Chris Evans, Lera Abova, Jacnier, Gabby Beans, Talia Ryder, Charlie Day', 'R', 'Honey O''Donahue, a small-town private investigator, delves into a series of strange deaths tied to a mysterious church.', 'Honey O''Donahue, a small-town private investigator, delves into a series of strange deaths tied to a mysterious church.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fJm3kmd9NLZWypMas7g34oNFgbk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1149504'),
  ('290723429328969357', 'Honey Harvester', 1949, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Jack Hannah', null, 'Clarence Nash', 'NR', 'Donald is working in his greenhouse when he notices a bee harvesting nectar (well, actually, it appears to already be honey). Donald tries various approaches to find the hive, which despite the bee''s best efforts to throw him off, he eventually discovers in the radiator of an old car. He drains the honey and starts to leave when the bee spots him and mounts an attack. The bee adds a cactus needle to extend his stinger. Donald relents and returns the honey all but one jar, until the bee spots him.', 'Donald is working in his greenhouse when he notices a bee harvesting nectar (well, actually, it appears to already be honey). Donald tries various approaches to find the hive, which despite the bee''s best efforts to throw him off, he eventually discovers in the radiator of an old car. He drains the honey and starts to leave when the bee spots him and mounts an attack. The bee adds a cactus needle to extend his stinger. Donald relents and returns the honey all but one jar, until the bee spots him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iRqqT8Ni87OKdZzC12uQTt0eHST.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:66879'),
  ('584784802239096065', 'Honey Lemon Soda', 2021, 'Romance, Comedy, Drama', 'Kōji Shintoku', 'Nami Kikkawa', 'Raul, Ai Yoshikawa, Mayu Hotta, Tatsuomi Hamada, Ryota Bando, Natsumi Okamoto, Yurina Yanagi, Miki Yanagi', null, 'Ishimori Uka is very shy and has a hard time making friends. When she was a middle school student, students made fun of her by calling her "stone". Around that time, she met Miura Kai with lemon color hair. Because of him, she entered the same high school. Uka now wants to overcome her shyness and have friends. Kai is a popular student at the school, but he doesn''t talk much or seem interested in others. He doesn''t know why, but he becomes concerned with Uka. Uka has admired Kai, and she now has feelings for him. Kai has a secret, which no one knows.', 'Ishimori Uka is very shy and has a hard time making friends. When she was a middle school student, students made fun of her by calling her "stone". Around that time, she met Miura Kai with lemon color hair. Because of him, she entered the same high school. Uka now wants to overcome her shyness and have friends. Kai is a popular student at the school, but he doesn''t talk much or seem interested in others. He doesn''t know why, but he becomes concerned with Uka. Uka has admired Kai, and she now has feelings for him. Kai has a secret, which no one knows.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eKeiezkF0GOfwsNZvnEiF1Wmveh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:853821'),
  ('249287136041551109', 'Honey Money Phony', 2024, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Su Biao, Li Yueliu', 'Yang Yuting, Su Biao', 'Jin Chen, Sunny Sun, Li Xueqin, Wang Hao, David Wang, Liu Yan, Song Muzi, Tong Mo-nan', null, 'A working girl accidentally incurs a massive debt. She crosses paths with a con man. Amidst lies and deceit, they navigate a tumultuous journey, questioning their paths in life.', 'A working girl accidentally incurs a massive debt. She crosses paths with a con man. Amidst lies and deceit, they navigate a tumultuous journey, questioning their paths in life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8Fe3E8qkL0oru2B8Z8ll2de3pOY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1273472'),
  ('902920971038125420', 'Honey PuPu', 2011, 'Drama', 'Yu Jing-pin, Chen Hung-i', 'Monica & Shaballe, Chen Hung-i, Yi-chun Tsai', 'Zaizai Lin, Nikki Hsieh, Prince Chiu, Daqi Li, Lawrence Ko Yu-Luen, Peggy Tseng, Ralf Chiu, Bridget Dennison', null, 'A woman searches for her boyfriend who disappeared on New Year''s day. She goes through his website he created missing.com/ing and encounters others along the way...', 'A woman searches for her boyfriend who disappeared on New Year''s day. She goes through his website he created missing.com/ing and encounters others along the way...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mDYj46Ky0PeMK9RUHytdiWaBKfZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:134769'),
  ('1081031978849416079', 'Honey, I Blew Up the Kid', 1992, 'Adventure, Comedy, Family, Science Fiction', 'Randal Kleiser, John Hora, Frank Capra III', 'Garry Goodrow, Thom Eberhardt, Peter Elbling', 'Rick Moranis, Marcia Strassman, Robert Oliveri, Daniel Shalikar, Joshua Shalikar, Lloyd Bridges, John Shea, Keri Russell', 'PG', 'Wayne Szalinski is at it again. But instead of shrinking things, he tries to make a machine that can make things grow. As in the first one, his machine isn''t quite accurate. But when he brings Nick & his toddler son Adam to see his invention, the machine unexpectedly starts working. And when Adam comes right up to the machine, he gets zapped along with his stuffed bunny.', 'Wayne Szalinski is at it again. But instead of shrinking things, he tries to make a machine that can make things grow. As in the first one, his machine isn''t quite accurate. But when he brings Nick & his toddler son Adam to see his invention, the machine unexpectedly starts working. And when Adam comes right up to the machine, he gets zapped along with his stuffed bunny.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4EGqDo2pP2ZL0TCcYDGnwsU8liQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11158'),
  ('920147370476648077', 'Honey, I Shrunk the Kids', 1989, 'Adventure, Comedy, Family, Science Fiction', 'Hiro Narita, Joe Johnston, Betsy Magruder', 'Ed Naha, Tom Schulman', 'Rick Moranis, Matt Frewer, Marcia Strassman, Kristine Sutherland, Thomas Wilson Brown, Jared Rushton, Amy O''Neill, Robert Oliveri', 'PG', 'The scientist father of a teenage girl and boy accidentally shrinks his and two other neighborhood teens to the size of insects. Now the teens must fight diminutive dangers as the father searches for them.', 'The scientist father of a teenage girl and boy accidentally shrinks his and two other neighborhood teens to the size of insects. Now the teens must fight diminutive dangers as the father searches for them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/omQOzahi2NIeiYznNxHFDvNbvo6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9354'),
  ('189173727524112905', 'Honey, We Shrunk Ourselves', 1997, 'Adventure, Comedy, Family, Science Fiction', 'Dean Cundey, Raymond Stella, Stephen Lofaro', 'Karey Kirkpatrick, Nell Scovell, Joel Hodgson', 'Rick Moranis, Bug Hall, Allison Mack, Robin Bartlett, Stuart Pankin, Eve Gordon, Mila Kunis, Theodore Borders', 'PG', 'The joke''s on absent-minded scientist Wayne Szalinski when his troublesome invention shrinks him, his brother and their wives so effectively that their children think they''ve completely disappeared. Of course, this gives the kids free rein to do anything they want, unaware that their parents are watching every move.', 'The joke''s on absent-minded scientist Wayne Szalinski when his troublesome invention shrinks him, his brother and their wives so effectively that their children think they''ve completely disappeared. Of course, this gives the kids free rein to do anything they want, unaware that their parents are watching every move.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nbU3UgIjxNTrSSe2gcOSGQjf55a.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11425'),
  ('1022488610902149498', 'Honey: Rise Up and Dance', 2018, 'Music, Drama', 'Bille Woodruff', 'Robert Adetuyi', 'Teyana Taylor, Bryshere Y. Gray, Sierra Aylina McClain, Charmin Lee, Joel Rush, Lawrence Kao, Kwajalyn Brown, Josh Ventura', 'PG-13', 'Street dancer Skyler comes out of the shadow of her trained dancer sister, Tosha, & joins a dance competition with the Honey dance studio; the prize is a college scholarship.', 'Street dancer Skyler comes out of the shadow of her trained dancer sister, Tosha, & joins a dance competition with the Honey dance studio; the prize is a college scholarship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gzxUNGk79dHk2mUb5HrhvooHScV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:515114'),
  ('542602850193128031', 'Honey''s Money', 1962, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Friz Freleng', null, 'Mel Blanc, June Foray, Billy Booth', null, 'Yosemite Sam marries a wealthy widow for her money.', 'Yosemite Sam marries a wealthy widow for her money.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iamGTPyvuO2eUZbTPprOwClxpqm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:234535'),
  ('73997074673013495', 'Honeycomb', 1969, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Francisco J. Querejeta, José Luis Ruiz Marcos, Salvador Augustín', 'Rafael Azcona, Geraldine Chaplin, Carlos Saura', 'Geraldine Chaplin, Per Oscarsson, Teresa del Río, Julia Peña, Emiliano Redondo, María Elena Flores, Jesús Nieto, Gloria Berrocal', null, 'Teresa and Peter settle down in their new home after the wedding. Things are going well until her childhood furniture arrives, sending Teresa into horrible flashbacks of turmoil from memories of her youth.', 'Teresa and Peter settle down in their new home after the wedding. Things are going well until her childhood furniture arrives, sending Teresa into horrible flashbacks of turmoil from memories of her youth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/28oVPn9wufUXIwtBXiTJ7wCwosL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:268652'),
  ('724451301871124989', 'Honeydew', 2021, 'Horror', 'Dan Kennedy, Devereux Milburn', 'Devereux Milburn', 'Sawyer Spielberg, Malin Barr, Barbara Kingsley, Jamie Bradley, Lena Dunham, Stephen D''Ambrose, Joshua Patrick Dudley, Rachel Alexandria Arnold', null, 'Strange cravings and hallucinations befall a young couple after seeking shelter in the home of an aging farmer and her peculiar son.', 'Strange cravings and hallucinations befall a young couple after seeking shelter in the home of an aging farmer and her peculiar son.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r3Dy8RTD8M5j9e1uaRMxZK235aB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:675575'),
  ('956342292955341161', 'Honeydripper', 2007, 'Drama, Music', 'John Sayles, Cas Donovan, Paul Schneider', 'John Sayles', 'Danny Glover, LisaGay Hamilton, Yaya DaCosta, Charles S. Dutton, Vondie Curtis-Hall, Gary Clark Jr., Mable John, Stacy Keach', null, 'In 1950s Alabama, the owner of the Honeydripper juke joint finds his business dropping off and against his better judgment, hires a young electric guitarist in a last ditch effort to draw crowds during harvest time.', 'In 1950s Alabama, the owner of the Honeydripper juke joint finds his business dropping off and against his better judgment, hires a young electric guitarist in a last ditch effort to draw crowds during harvest time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x1L0yIPOKWL8KVx6oWlPRl4ExaC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14414'),
  ('960774439525775467', 'Honeyland', 2019, 'Documentary', 'Ljubomir Stefanov, Tamara Kotevska, Samir Ljuma', 'Tamara Kotevska, Ljubomir Stefanov', 'Hatidzhe Muratova, Nazife Muratova, Hussein Sam, Ljutvie Sam', null, 'When nomadic beekeepers break Honeyland’s basic rule (take half of the honey, but leave half to the bees), the last female beehunter in Europe must save the bees and restore natural balance.', 'When nomadic beekeepers break Honeyland’s basic rule (take half of the honey, but leave half to the bees), the last female beehunter in Europe must save the bees and restore natural balance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3IxGhQEzLWOxkZlcNMAIiYlOT8D.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:566213'),
  ('273568126311778412', 'Honeymoon', 1985, 'Thriller, Horror', 'Patrick Jamain', null, 'Nathalie Baye, John Shea, Richard Berry, Marla Lukofsky, Michel Beaune, Peter Donat, Alf Humphreys, Cec Linder', null, 'A Frenchwoman in Manhattan, in danger of being deported because of her relationship with a recently arrested drug offender, enters into a marriage of convenience with a stranger that is arranged through an agency. But even though the two are not supposed to even meet, her new husband starts taking his faux wedding vows entirely too seriously.', 'A Frenchwoman in Manhattan, in danger of being deported because of her relationship with a recently arrested drug offender, enters into a marriage of convenience with a stranger that is arranged through an agency. But even though the two are not supposed to even meet, her new husband starts taking his faux wedding vows entirely too seriously.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pO2eCgU4m4gFEAEqPWXy0EQ9vP5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:89736'),
  ('111135891733472236', 'Honeymoon', 2014, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Leigh Janiak, Kyle Klutz, Jack Grimmett', 'Phil Graziadei, Leigh Janiak', 'Rose Leslie, Harry Treadaway, Ben Huber, Hanna Brown, John Lauterbach, Peter Leo', 'R', 'On her honeymoon, a young bride sleepwalks into the woods surrounding a secluded cabin. When she returns, she looks the same—but something about her is terrifyingly different.', 'On her honeymoon, a young bride sleepwalks into the woods surrounding a secluded cabin. When she returns, she looks the same—but something about her is terrifyingly different.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8XPGgvhsJxFvmVH9xAm9q9J7Coy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:254191'),
  ('1120274970941230240', 'Honeymoon', 2015, 'Thriller, Horror', 'Diego Cohen, Aram Díaz', 'Marco Tarditi Ortega', 'Paulina Ahmed, Alberto Agnesi, Hector Kotsifakis, Dunia Alexandra, Diego Cohen, Stephanie de la Cruz, Santiago Ortega', null, 'A psychotic doctor kidnaps his neighbor and locks her in a dungeon, where he uses twisted conditioning methods to make her submit to being his wife.', 'A psychotic doctor kidnaps his neighbor and locks her in a dungeon, where he uses twisted conditioning methods to make her submit to being his wife.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qGssl9DdwSrv26u3n7zxP8acni9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:295466'),
  ('77110062358994580', 'Honeymoon', 2024, 'Drama', 'Enrique Otero', 'Enrique Otero, Roberto G. Méndez', 'Javier Gutiérrez, Nathalie Poza, María Vázquez, Fernando Albizu, Pablo Derqui, Silvia Zhou, Antonio Durán ''Morris''', null, 'Eva and Carlos are a marriage in destruction. Only Jonah, the son they once had together, keeps them together. Now Jonás has just died in an accident thousands of miles from home during a visit to his paternal grandparents, and nothing unites Eva and Carlos anymore. Without the resources to bring Jonah back, but without the heart not to do so, they will try to get the money they need to recover their son''s body at any price.', 'Eva and Carlos are a marriage in destruction. Only Jonah, the son they once had together, keeps them together. Now Jonás has just died in an accident thousands of miles from home during a visit to his paternal grandparents, and nothing unites Eva and Carlos anymore. Without the resources to bring Jonah back, but without the heart not to do so, they will try to get the money they need to recover their son''s body at any price.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hERiiDwQqg6LQsrIbxI5YvROjic.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1104071'),
  ('389089105091269338', 'Honeymoon Academy', 1989, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Gene Quintano, John Cabrera', 'Gene Quintano, Jerry Lazarus', 'Kim Cattrall, Robert Hays, Leigh Taylor-Young, Jonathan Banks, Christopher Lee, Charles Rocket, Doris Roberts, Gordon Jump', 'PG-13', 'A honeymooning couple become entangled in a plot to recover plates for counterfeiting US dollars. SHE thinks she''s just retired from a government ''dirty jobs'' department, but her superiors have other ideas. HE thinks she''s a retired travel agent.', 'A honeymooning couple become entangled in a plot to recover plates for counterfeiting US dollars. SHE thinks she''s just retired from a government ''dirty jobs'' department, but her superiors have other ideas. HE thinks she''s a retired travel agent.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sNBlel6T9jT9TmMXjlqsBQHL4lH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:165401'),
  ('163823973597886314', 'Honeymoon Crasher', 2025, 'Comedy', 'Nicolas Cuche, Jérôme Alméras', 'Nicolas Cuche, Laurent Turner, Laure Hennequart', 'Michèle Laroque, Julien Frison, Rossy de Palma, Gilbert Melki, Margot Bancilhon, Kad Merad, Jake Francois, Camille Aguilar', 'R', 'When his fiancée dumps him at the altar for her ex, a young man is left with no alternative but to go on his romantic honeymoon with his mother.', 'When his fiancée dumps him at the altar for her ex, a young man is left with no alternative but to go on his romantic honeymoon with his mother.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7mrmqaoFKx61MzyYzaI4sO6VLuc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1361622'),
  ('244391339631833286', 'Honeymoon For Three', 1976, 'Comedy', 'Carlo Vanzina, Giorgio Basile, Alberto Spagnoli', 'Carlo Vanzina, Enrico Vanzina', 'Renato Pozzetto, Vincent Gardenia, Stefania Casini, Harry Reems, Felice Andreasi, Massimo Boldi, Cochi Ponzoni, Kirsten Gille', null, 'A newlywed couple sets off on their honeymoon expecting romance and privacy, but their plans are quickly disrupted when an unexpected third companion joins them. As jealousy, misunderstandings, and awkward situations pile up, the dream getaway turns into a chaotic and comedic test of their relationship.', 'A newlywed couple sets off on their honeymoon expecting romance and privacy, but their plans are quickly disrupted when an unexpected third companion joins them. As jealousy, misunderstandings, and awkward situations pile up, the dream getaway turns into a chaotic and comedic test of their relationship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kxSwCZZ8UiuDquOPhvNZ42d8mlm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:167869'),
  ('29241583112148656', 'Honeymoon Horror', 1982, 'Horror', 'Harry Preston', 'Harry Preston', 'Cheryl Black, Bob Wagner, Bill Pecchi, James Caskey, Leslie McKinley, Kari Addington, Philip Thompson, Megan Ready', null, 'Imagine every newlywed''s fantasy, a rustic secluded lover''s paradise -- Honeymoon Island. What starts as a weekend of love turns into a nightmare of blood and terror for three young innocent couples. What lurks in the shadows of Honeymoon Lodge? Is it the caretaker, or perhaps something more fiendish and deadly? Honeymoon Island, where newlyweds joined in holy matrimony spend their wedding night screaming in terror!', 'Imagine every newlywed''s fantasy, a rustic secluded lover''s paradise -- Honeymoon Island. What starts as a weekend of love turns into a nightmare of blood and terror for three young innocent couples. What lurks in the shadows of Honeymoon Lodge? Is it the caretaker, or perhaps something more fiendish and deadly? Honeymoon Island, where newlyweds joined in holy matrimony spend their wedding night screaming in terror!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xO7D8atV6oxueOUTBvheG9guGvT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85197'),
  ('465132703099524385', 'Honeymoon in Vegas', 1992, 'Comedy, Romance', 'William A. Fraker, Andrew Bergman, Yudi Bennett', 'Andrew Bergman', 'Nicolas Cage, Sarah Jessica Parker, James Caan, Pat Morita, Johnny Williams, John Capodice, Robert Costanzo, Anne Bancroft', 'PG-13', 'On her deathbed, a mother makes her son promise never to get married, which scars him with psychological blocks to a commitment with his girlfriend. They finally decide to tie the knot in Vegas, but a wealthy gambler arranges for the man to lose $65K in a poker game and offers to clear the debt for a weekend with his fiancée.', 'On her deathbed, a mother makes her son promise never to get married, which scars him with psychological blocks to a commitment with his girlfriend. They finally decide to tie the knot in Vegas, but a wealthy gambler arranges for the man to lose $65K in a poker game and offers to clear the debt for a weekend with his fiancée.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qZPay0VF5Bq2PiUvC09WwM5blmj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12518'),
