  ('185216372692776251', 'Honor and Glory', 1992, 'Action', 'Godfrey Ho, Donna Jason', null, 'Cynthia Rothrock, Donna Jason, John Miller, Chuck Jeffreys, Gerald Klein, Robin Shou, Richard Yuen, Hang Yip Yim', 'R', 'FBI agent Tracey Pride is on a mission to capture businessman Jason Slade, who is involved in extortion and murder. Teaming up with her is her sister, Joyce, a news reporter; Dragon Lee, Tracey''s partner in Hong Kong, and Jake, a bodyguard who worked for Slade. Can they stop Slade before it''s too late?', 'FBI agent Tracey Pride is on a mission to capture businessman Jason Slade, who is involved in extortion and murder. Teaming up with her is her sister, Joyce, a news reporter; Dragon Lee, Tracey''s partner in Hong Kong, and Jake, a bodyguard who worked for Slade. Can they stop Slade before it''s too late?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ePG6GU0CYhJoDeqbYmgFsO9peGU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84415'),
  ('1044108467482498279', 'Honor Society', 2022, 'Comedy', 'Topher Osborn, Oran Zegman, Joanne Gerein', 'David A. Goodman', 'Angourie Rice, Gaten Matarazzo, Christopher Mintz-Plasse, Armani Jackson, Amy Keum, Ben Jackson Walker, Kelcey Mawema, Avery Konrad', 'R', 'Honor is an ambitious high school senior whose sole focus is getting into Harvard, assuming she can first score the coveted recommendation from her guidance counselor, Mr. Calvin. Willing to do whatever it takes, Honor concocts a Machiavellian-like plan to take down her top three student competitors, until things take a turn when she unexpectedly falls for her biggest competition, Michael.', 'Honor is an ambitious high school senior whose sole focus is getting into Harvard, assuming she can first score the coveted recommendation from her guidance counselor, Mr. Calvin. Willing to do whatever it takes, Honor concocts a Machiavellian-like plan to take down her top three student competitors, until things take a turn when she unexpectedly falls for her biggest competition, Michael.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/61CZ4JxyaI462sFfLPhtyzRg4vv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:929170'),
  ('962997952002955321', 'Honour of the Knights', 2006, 'Drama', 'Albert Serra, Christophe Farnarier, Jordi Ribas', 'Albert Serra, Jimmy Gimferrer, Montse Triola', 'Lluís Carbó, Lluís Serrat, Albert Pla, Glynn Bruce', null, 'Trusting in fate, Don Quixote and Sancho pursue their travels in search of adventure day and night. They ride through fields, talking about subjects as varied as spirituality, chivalry and daily life. A growing bond of friendship unites them.', 'Trusting in fate, Don Quixote and Sancho pursue their travels in search of adventure day and night. They ride through fields, talking about subjects as varied as spirituality, chivalry and daily life. A growing bond of friendship unites them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yfZQrNmU7eKVuuhPJx4Sn0TIMEj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85461'),
