  ('454979480040911709', 'Hood Witch', 2023, 'Thriller, Horror, Action, Drama', 'Saïd Belktibia, Gabriel Levy, Gaëtan Moineau', 'Saïd Belktibia, Louis Penicaut', 'Golshifteh Farahani, Amine Zariouhi, Denis Lavant, Alexis Manenti, Karim Belkhadra, Issaka Sawadogo, Jérémy Ferrari, Fareda Mouffok', null, 'A woman earns a living by smuggling exotic animals and illegal goods, developing a mobile app that links users with mystical marabout healers, but one of the user''s consultations takes a tragic turn facing a violent backlash.', 'A woman earns a living by smuggling exotic animals and illegal goods, developing a mobile app that links users with mystical marabout healers, but one of the user''s consultations takes a tragic turn facing a violent backlash.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m6FVnp3f1sk65x5uHYsbh9uvbxQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1018634'),
  ('1002715908680763573', 'Hoodlum', 1997, 'Crime, Drama', 'Bill Duke, Tyrone L. Mason, Anthony Mason', 'Chris Brancato', 'Laurence Fishburne, Tim Roth, Vanessa Williams, Andy Garcia, Cicely Tyson, Chi McBride, Clarence Williams III, Richard Bradford', 'R', 'In 1934, the second most lucrative business in New York City was running ''the numbers''. When Madam Queen—the powerful woman who runs the scam in Harlem—is arrested, Ellsworth ''Bumpy'' Johnson takes over the business and must resist an invasion from a merciless mobster.', 'In 1934, the second most lucrative business in New York City was running ''the numbers''. When Madam Queen—the powerful woman who runs the scam in Harlem—is arrested, Ellsworth ''Bumpy'' Johnson takes over the business and must resist an invasion from a merciless mobster.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hZrwqVXLyxxsNJHVc6bJKSUDkXA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22073'),
  ('641533770116850386', 'Hoodlum Empire', 1952, 'Crime', 'Joseph Kane, Reggie Lanning', 'Bruce Manning, Robert Considine', 'Brian Donlevy, Claire Trevor, Forrest Tucker, Vera Ralston, Luther Adler, John Russell, Gene Lockhart, Grant Withers', null, 'It''s a deadly play for power when a Mafia chieftain''s top gun goes straight and threatens to testify against the big boss and his cruel, nationwide network of crime. The picture, which was shot in a semi-documentary style, was inspired by the Kefauver investigations of 1950-51.', 'It''s a deadly play for power when a Mafia chieftain''s top gun goes straight and threatens to testify against the big boss and his cruel, nationwide network of crime. The picture, which was shot in a semi-documentary style, was inspired by the Kefauver investigations of 1950-51.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jgx8JpiAtUlrIghrV5HxQgKPDs4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26294'),
  ('1039855194673746299', 'Hoodwinked Too! Hood VS. Evil', 2011, 'Comedy, Animation, Family', 'Mike Disa', 'Michael Ludy', 'Hayden Panettiere, Glenn Close, Patrick Warburton, David Ogden Stiers, Joan Cusack, Bill Hader, Amy Poehler, Cory Edwards', 'PG', 'Red Riding Hood is training in the group of Sister Hoods, when she and the Wolf are called to examine the sudden mysterious disappearance of Hansel and Gretel.', 'Red Riding Hood is training in the group of Sister Hoods, when she and the Wolf are called to examine the sudden mysterious disappearance of Hansel and Gretel.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3ofAJDO8A7ulJwgMGKcwEOPNWV3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:57089'),
  ('785200817509261184', 'Hoodwinked!', 2005, 'Animation, Comedy, Family, Crime, Mystery', 'Cory Edwards, Todd Edwards, Tony Leech', 'Cory Edwards, Todd Edwards, Tony Leech', 'Anne Hathaway, Glenn Close, Patrick Warburton, Jim Belushi, David Ogden Stiers, Xzibit, Anthony Anderson, Chazz Palminteri', 'PG', 'Little Red Riding Hood: A classic story, but there''s more to every tale than meets the eye. Before you judge a book by its cover, you''ve got to flip through the pages. In the re-telling of this classic fable, the story begins at the end of the tale and winds its way back. Chief Grizzly and Detective Bill Stork investigate a domestic disturbance at Granny''s cottage, involving a karate-kicking Red Riding Hood, a sarcastic wolf and an oafish Woodsman.', 'Little Red Riding Hood: A classic story, but there''s more to every tale than meets the eye. Before you judge a book by its cover, you''ve got to flip through the pages. In the re-telling of this classic fable, the story begins at the end of the tale and winds its way back. Chief Grizzly and Detective Bill Stork investigate a domestic disturbance at Granny''s cottage, involving a karate-kicking Red Riding Hood, a sarcastic wolf and an oafish Woodsman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tjuMvHg7NJmE9hqKD3p86kW2Jvk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10982'),
  ('447626381993872550', 'Hook', 1991, 'Adventure, Fantasy, Comedy, Family', 'Dean Cundey, Steven Spielberg, Bruce Cohen', 'Malia Scotch Marmo, James V. Hart', 'Dustin Hoffman, Robin Williams, Julia Roberts, Bob Hoskins, Maggie Smith, Caroline Goodall, Charlie Korsmo, Amber Scott', 'PG', 'The boy who wasn''t supposed to grow up—Peter Pan—does just that, becoming a soulless corporate lawyer whose workaholism could cost him his wife and kids. During his trip to see Granny Wendy in London, the vengeful Capt. Hook kidnaps Peter''s kids and forces Peter to return to Neverland.', 'The boy who wasn''t supposed to grow up—Peter Pan—does just that, becoming a soulless corporate lawyer whose workaholism could cost him his wife and kids. During his trip to see Granny Wendy in London, the vengeful Capt. Hook kidnaps Peter''s kids and forces Peter to return to Neverland.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a6rB1lGXoGms7gWxRfJneQmAjNV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:879'),
  ('397139800481065626', 'Hook, Line and Sinker', 1930, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Edward F. Cline, Fred Fleck, Nicholas Musuraca', 'Tim Whelan, Ralph Spence', 'Bert Wheeler, Robert Woolsey, Dorothy Lee, Jobyna Howland, Natalie Moorhead, Hugh Herbert, George F. Marion, William B. Davidson', null, 'Two fast-talking insurance salesmen meet Mary, who is running away from her wealthy mother, and they agree to help her run a hotel that she owns. When they find out that the hotel is run down and nearly abandoned, they launch a phony PR campaign that presents the hotel as a resort favored by the rich. Their advertising succeeds too well, and many complications soon arise.', 'Two fast-talking insurance salesmen meet Mary, who is running away from her wealthy mother, and they agree to help her run a hotel that she owns. When they find out that the hotel is run down and nearly abandoned, they launch a phony PR campaign that presents the hotel as a resort favored by the rich. Their advertising succeeds too well, and many complications soon arise.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oYSMP7O7iiwWOUsE5UrS9WUWmWL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36789'),
  ('969133925390152023', 'Hook, Line and Sinker', 1969, 'Comedy', 'George Marshall, W. Wallace Kelley, Hal Bell', 'Rod Amateau', 'Jerry Lewis, Peter Lawford, Anne Francis, Pedro Gonzalez Gonzalez, Jennifer Edwards, Jimmy Miller, Eleanor Audley, Henry Corden', 'G', 'Told he is terminally ill, an insurance executive goes on a credit-card spending spree--and then learns his medical diagnosis was a mistake.', 'Told he is terminally ill, an insurance executive goes on a credit-card spending spree--and then learns his medical diagnosis was a mistake.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cZfTCXyXvZwIxRje508NWJ4N3tL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:109014'),
  ('498521134378549660', 'Hook, Line and Stinker', 1958, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Chuck Jones', null, 'Paul Julian', null, 'Wile E. Coyote hopes to catch the Road Runner using a mallet, a cooking pan, a TNT stick, a balloon, and a piano dropped from a precipice. The last of these results in Wile E. falling to the road below along with the piano and ending up with 88 teeth.', 'Wile E. Coyote hopes to catch the Road Runner using a mallet, a cooking pan, a TNT stick, a balloon, and a piano dropped from a precipice. The last of these results in Wile E. falling to the road below along with the piano and ending up with 88 teeth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y1NAlRjZs3TJYkdTwSEgQ9ToU4u.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:146648'),
  ('763218089779099272', 'Hook, Lion and Sinker', 1950, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Jack Hannah', null, 'Clarence Nash', null, 'A mangy Mountain Lion and his cub try to scrounge Donald''s good looking catch of fish.', 'A mangy Mountain Lion and his cub try to scrounge Donald''s good looking catch of fish.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fgyJkmy1H5hIvxPioEV2RLuMyJz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:66880'),
  ('759332630040028230', 'Hooked Bear', 1956, 'Animation', 'Jack Hannah', null, 'James MacDonald, Bill Thompson', 'NR', 'Humphrey the bear isn''t having much luck with his fishing; every time he catches some nice fish, he gets distracted and drops them. So he goes after the catches of the local anglers instead. But ranger Woodlore frowns on this, insisting the bear fish like one.', 'Humphrey the bear isn''t having much luck with his fishing; every time he catches some nice fish, he gets distracted and drops them. So he goes after the catches of the local anglers instead. But ranger Woodlore frowns on this, insisting the bear fish like one.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/37H2LSpVes7ztyfpjDHhgcKTegH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:68406'),
  ('931804643691915323', 'Hooked on the Game', 2009, 'Action, Science Fiction', 'Pavel Sanaev, Valeriy Derkach, Vladislav Gurtchin', 'Pavel Sanaev, Aleksandr Chubaryan', 'Sergey Chirkov, Pavel Priluchnyy, Agniya Ditkovskite, Viktor Verzhbitskiy, Igor Sklyar, Mikhail Gorevoy, Marina Petrenko, Evgeniy Kharlanov', null, 'After a stunning victory at a cyber sport tournament, the winning gamers are awarded CDs with a brand new game. After playing this game, each of them is affected with some force, turning their gaming abilities into real ones. They each become the best fighters, shooters and racers in real life. However, this does not go unnoticed. Through blackmail, cheating and bribes, authorities offer the gamers a "job". But as soon as the lies are revealed it becomes clear that they are not heroes saving their country but nothing more than paid assassins. Moreover, the producer of the game is keeping many more of the same CDs, so many more "heroes" like themselves could also be produced. Now the gamers have to find the CDs and either destroy them or create an army of gamers and rule over all. The team becomes divided into two, each pitted against the other', 'After a stunning victory at a cyber sport tournament, the winning gamers are awarded CDs with a brand new game. After playing this game, each of them is affected with some force, turning their gaming abilities into real ones. They each become the best fighters, shooters and racers in real life. However, this does not go unnoticed. Through blackmail, cheating and bribes, authorities offer the gamers a "job". But as soon as the lies are revealed it becomes clear that they are not heroes saving their country but nothing more than paid assassins. Moreover, the producer of the game is keeping many more of the same CDs, so many more "heroes" like themselves could also be produced. Now the gamers have to find the CDs and either destroy them or create an army of gamers and rule over all. The team becomes divided into two, each pitted against the other', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9vmzJQXiuA8DnrlbsvbOdP7dzSe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37656'),
  ('172415562858131225', 'Hooking Up', 2009, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Vincent Scordia, Turnwall, M.P. Cherkowsky', 'Jeff Siegel', 'Corey Feldman, Brian O''Halloran, Bronson Pinchot, Parker Croft, Jim DeProphetis, Allyson Muñoz, Ted Sangalis, Leah Viens-Gordon', null, 'After "hooking up" with a series of guys at a house party, April is the talk of her high school.', 'After "hooking up" with a series of guys at a house party, April is the talk of her high school.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uWLoODORHZMjHvy8HW7HsUw3B74.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20983'),
  ('1037462692387483021', 'Hooking Up', 2020, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Cydney Cox, Nico Raineau, Jeff Bierman', 'Nico Raineau, Lauren Schacher', 'Sam Richardson, Brittany Snow, Vivica A. Fox, Jordana Brewster, Richard Jackson, Amy Pietz, Rob Moran, Alexis G. Zall', null, 'Bailey and Darla embark upon a misguided and mutually deceitful form of therapy, one in which they must drive across the country, re-enacting Darla''s colorful history as a sex addict. As their true motivations for the road trip come to light, the unlikely pair force one another to confront their issues, discovering that there might actually be more to love than just sex.', 'Bailey and Darla embark upon a misguided and mutually deceitful form of therapy, one in which they must drive across the country, re-enacting Darla''s colorful history as a sex addict. As their true motivations for the road trip come to light, the unlikely pair force one another to confront their issues, discovering that there might actually be more to love than just sex.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y5QXP7qdwtPRiZy6cQTjRoaTXuW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:673159'),
  ('506315339269570297', 'Hoop Dreams', 1994, 'Documentary', 'Steve James, Peter Gilbert', 'Frederick Marx, Steve James', 'William Gates, Arthur Agee, Gene Pingatore, Steve James, Dick Vitale, Bobby Knight, Spike Lee, Isiah Thomas', 'PG-13', 'Every school day, African-American teenagers William Gates and Arthur Agee travel 90 minutes each way from inner-city Chicago to St. Joseph High School in Westchester, Illinois, a predominately white suburban school well-known for the excellence of its basketball program. Gates and Agee dream of NBA stardom, and with the support of their close-knit families, they battle the social and physical obstacles that stand in their way. This acclaimed documentary was shot over the course of five years.', 'Every school day, African-American teenagers William Gates and Arthur Agee travel 90 minutes each way from inner-city Chicago to St. Joseph High School in Westchester, Illinois, a predominately white suburban school well-known for the excellence of its basketball program. Gates and Agee dream of NBA stardom, and with the support of their close-knit families, they battle the social and physical obstacles that stand in their way. This acclaimed documentary was shot over the course of five years.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gLzHl2XBtVwycl8DxdOXRHPm8G3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14275'),
  ('81557870968932208', 'Hooper', 1978, 'Action, Comedy', 'Hal Needham, Bobby Byrne, Bill Scott', 'James Best', 'Burt Reynolds, Jan-Michael Vincent, Sally Field, Brian Keith, John Marley, Robert Klein, James Best, Adam West', 'PG', 'Legendary stunt man Sonny Hooper remains one of the top men in his field, but due to too many stressful impacts to the spine and the need to pop painkillers several times a day, he knows he should get out of the industry before he ends up permanently disabled.', 'Legendary stunt man Sonny Hooper remains one of the top men in his field, but due to too many stressful impacts to the spine and the need to pop painkillers several times a day, he knows he should get out of the industry before he ends up permanently disabled.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3qYgqCIrcKyq7eis9cOjIlGWRDE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16214'),
  ('832862191755555697', 'Hooray for Divorce!', 1982, 'Comedy', 'Juan Bosch, Leopoldo Villaseñor', 'Juan Bosch', 'Fernando Esteso, Rafael Alonso, Ricardo Merino, María Salerno, Nadine Rochex, Vanessa Hidalgo, Manuel Alexandre, María Luisa Ponte', null, 'David is married and has no children. However, outside of marriage, he has longstanding relationships with Susi and Laly, with whom he has had a child with each. He has promised both of then, separately of course, that when the divorce is permitted in Spain he will separate from his wife and regularize his situation with them. Divorce law is approved and conflicts begin. He cannot marry the two together.', 'David is married and has no children. However, outside of marriage, he has longstanding relationships with Susi and Laly, with whom he has had a child with each. He has promised both of then, separately of course, that when the divorce is permitted in Spain he will separate from his wife and regularize his situation with them. Divorce law is approved and conflicts begin. He cannot marry the two together.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b3PSnmPwIIFPah2y8rW2HW431nh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:60037'),
  ('73410929169601790', 'Hoosiers', 1986, 'Drama, Family', 'David Anspaugh, Fred Murphy', 'Angelo Pizzo', 'Gene Hackman, Barbara Hershey, Dennis Hopper, Sheb Wooley, Fern Persons, Chelcie Ross, Robert Swan, Michael O''Guinne', 'PG', 'Failed college coach Norman Dale gets a chance at redemption when he is hired to coach a high school basketball team in a tiny Indiana town. After a teacher persuades star player Jimmy Chitwood to quit and focus on his long-neglected studies, Dale struggles to develop a winning team in the face of community criticism for his temper and his unconventional choice of assistant coach: Shooter, a notorious alcoholic.', 'Failed college coach Norman Dale gets a chance at redemption when he is hired to coach a high school basketball team in a tiny Indiana town. After a teacher persuades star player Jimmy Chitwood to quit and focus on his long-neglected studies, Dale struggles to develop a winning team in the face of community criticism for his temper and his unconventional choice of assistant coach: Shooter, a notorious alcoholic.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dHpjZQXEdoi1xNLubM1rPmTHJYz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:5693'),
  ('198494647854582630', 'Hoot', 2006, 'Family, Adventure', 'Wil Shriner, Michael Chapman, Richard Fojo', 'Wil Shriner', 'Luke Wilson, Logan Lerman, Brie Larson, Tim Blake Nelson, Cody Linley, Neil Flynn, Clark Gregg, Kiersten Warren', 'PG', 'A young man moves from Montana to Florida with his family, where he''s compelled to engage in a fight to protect a population of endangered owls.', 'A young man moves from Montana to Florida with his family, where he''s compelled to engage in a fight to protect a population of endangered owls.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l3gbiQkSLXPRkJnH7QInA5zrk6n.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18276'),
  ('786900448365469177', 'Hop', 2011, 'Animation, Comedy, Family', 'Peter Lyons Collister, Tim Hill, David Mendoza', 'Cinco Paul, Brian Lynch, Ken Daurio', 'Russell Brand, James Marsden, Kaley Cuoco, Hank Azaria, Elizabeth Perkins, Gary Cole, Hugh Laurie, David Hasselhoff', 'PG', 'E.B., the Easter Bunny''s teenage son, heads to Hollywood, determined to become a drummer in a rock ''n'' roll band. In L.A., he''s taken in by Fred after the out-of-work slacker hits E.B. with his car.', 'E.B., the Easter Bunny''s teenage son, heads to Hollywood, determined to become a drummer in a rock ''n'' roll band. In L.A., he''s taken in by Fred after the out-of-work slacker hits E.B. with his car.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qgYzapTlgnIG6CAH3Pjgp44nxgS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50359'),
  ('868330607652720759', 'Hop, Look and Listen', 1948, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Robert McKimson', null, 'Mel Blanc', null, 'A baby kangaroo hops out of his zoo cage and roams into the surrounding city. The kangaroo stops at Sylvester Cat''s home while Sylvester is hunting for mice with a fishing rod. When Sylvester "reels in" the kangaroo, he thinks he has caught a giant mouse and makes a humiliatingly unsuccessful attempt to catch him.', 'A baby kangaroo hops out of his zoo cage and roams into the surrounding city. The kangaroo stops at Sylvester Cat''s home while Sylvester is hunting for mice with a fishing rod. When Sylvester "reels in" the kangaroo, he thinks he has caught a giant mouse and makes a humiliatingly unsuccessful attempt to catch him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mdZFThApCPsV1aqaeK5IADcbwU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:237279'),
