  ('329114710050561175', 'Hope', 1970, 'Drama', 'Yılmaz Güney, Şerif Gören, Kaya Ererez', 'Yılmaz Güney', 'Yılmaz Güney, Gülşen Alnıaçık, Tuncel Kurtiz, Osman Alyanak, Enver Dönmez, Sema Engin, Nizam Ergüden, Hicret Gürson', null, 'After losing one of his horses in an accident, an illiterate horse cab driver sets out into the desert in a quest for a mythical lost treasure.', 'After losing one of his horses in an accident, an illiterate horse cab driver sets out into the desert in a quest for a mythical lost treasure.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2tPiQTXcdRanUcsvwB0RWmIgfdq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52104'),
