  ('1128121385863665080', 'Hope', 2019, 'Drama, Romance', 'Dominique Delany, Maria Sødahl, Manuel Alberto Claro', 'Maria Sødahl', 'Andrea Bræin Hovig, Stellan Skarsgård, Elli Rhiannon Müller Osborne, Daniel Storm Forthun Sandbye, Alfred Vatne, Eirik Hallert, Steinar Klouman Hallert, Dina Enoksen Elvehaug', null, 'Together for 20 years, a couple that has grown apart over time receives difficult news that will impact the entire family. As they try to make sense of the changes, they end up rediscovering their love for one another.', 'Together for 20 years, a couple that has grown apart over time receives difficult news that will impact the entire family. As they try to make sense of the changes, they end up rediscovering their love for one another.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/GmsHT0ssqeJceSoxfmoMYBZWQu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:616561'),
