  ('32573710381809444', 'Hope Floats', 1998, 'Romance, Drama, Comedy', 'Forest Whitaker, Caleb Deschanel, Keith P. Cunningham', 'Steven Rogers', 'Sandra Bullock, Harry Connick Jr., Gena Rowlands, Mae Whitman, Michael Paré, Cameron Finley, Kathy Najimy, Bill Cobbs', 'PG-13', 'Birdee Pruitt has been humiliated on live television by her best friend, Connie, who''s been sleeping with Birdee''s husband, Bill. Birdee tries starting over with her daughter, Bernice, by returning to her small Texas hometown, but she''s faced with petty old acquaintances who are thrilled to see Birdee unhappy -- except for her friend Justin. As he helps Birdee get back on her feet, love begins to blossom.', 'Birdee Pruitt has been humiliated on live television by her best friend, Connie, who''s been sleeping with Birdee''s husband, Bill. Birdee tries starting over with her daughter, Bernice, by returning to her small Texas hometown, but she''s faced with petty old acquaintances who are thrilled to see Birdee unhappy -- except for her friend Justin. As he helps Birdee get back on her feet, love begins to blossom.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6PRFM09xjGSWpXObW87CT5JELGJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9715'),
  ('901287580539243530', 'Hope Frozen: A Quest To Live Twice', 2018, 'Documentary', 'Pailin Wedel, Mark Dobbin, Mark Oltmanns', 'Pailin Wedel, Nina Ijäs', 'Nareerat Naovaratpong, Sahatorn Naovaratpong, Matrix Naovaratpong, Max More', null, 'A Buddhist scientist from Bangkok decides to cryo-preserve his daughter''s brain. As scandal swirls around the family, they struggle to grieve a child that, in their view, is suspended between death and a future reawakening.', 'A Buddhist scientist from Bangkok decides to cryo-preserve his daughter''s brain. As scandal swirls around the family, they struggle to grieve a child that, in their view, is suspended between death and a future reawakening.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/co5OvO1gICmqpqmhhpiIYpo5xRw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:594676'),
  ('85139671396629310', 'Hope Gap', 2019, 'Drama', 'Thomas Bassett, Amber Tordoff-Gibson, Catherine Goldschmidt', 'William Nicholson', 'Annette Bening, Bill Nighy, Josh O''Connor, Aiysha Hart, Ryan McKen, Joe Citro, Sally Rogers, Nicholas Burns', 'PG-13', 'Grace lives an idyllic life in a British seaside town, but her world soon comes crashing down when her husband of 29 years tells her he''s leaving her for another woman. Through stages of shock, disbelief and anger -- and with support from her son -- Grace ultimately regains her footing while learning it''s never too late to be happy.', 'Grace lives an idyllic life in a British seaside town, but her world soon comes crashing down when her husband of 29 years tells her he''s leaving her for another woman. Through stages of shock, disbelief and anger -- and with support from her son -- Grace ultimately regains her footing while learning it''s never too late to be happy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rR34zm5VWanjG44BWrHmh5NFDNu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:537140'),
  ('18520408468014538', 'Hope Lost', 2015, 'Drama, Thriller', 'David Petrucci', 'Francesco Trento, Francesco Teresi, Damiano Giacomelli', 'Francesca Agostini, Mischa Barton, Michael Madsen, Alessia Navarro, Andrey Chernyshov, Danny Trejo, Daniel Baldwin, Diego Pagotto', null, 'A Romanian girl dreams of living the glamorous life she sees in Italian soap operas.', 'A Romanian girl dreams of living the glamorous life she sees in Italian soap operas.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dLx7wNVDYohHUGUg00boKw6V51g.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:298031'),
  ('788014035829965668', 'Hope Springs', 2003, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Mark Herman, Ashley Rowe', 'Mark Herman', 'Colin Firth, Heather Graham, Minnie Driver, Mary Steenburgen, Frank Collison, Oliver Platt, Mary Black, Chad Faust', 'PG-13', 'British artist Colin Ware discovers that his fiancée, Vera, is going to marry another man. Distraught and despondent, he gets on a plane for America and ends up in the tiny town of Hope in New England. At first, Colin is depressed, but he soon finds more than a shoulder to cry on when his innkeepers introduce him to Mandy, a beautiful nurse. All''s going well and Colin has almost forgotten his old flame until Vera shows up with a surprise of her own.', 'British artist Colin Ware discovers that his fiancée, Vera, is going to marry another man. Distraught and despondent, he gets on a plane for America and ends up in the tiny town of Hope in New England. At first, Colin is depressed, but he soon finds more than a shoulder to cry on when his innkeepers introduce him to Mandy, a beautiful nurse. All''s going well and Colin has almost forgotten his old flame until Vera shows up with a surprise of her own.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wWRh4buz7yp7CinH7jGVvFkgUdN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21544'),
  ('827192762324923125', 'Hope Springs', 2012, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'David Frankel, Florian Ballhaus', 'Vanessa Taylor', 'Meryl Streep, Tommy Lee Jones, Steve Carell, Jean Smart, Marin Ireland, Ben Rappaport, Brett Rice, Becky Ann Baker', 'PG-13', 'After thirty years of marriage, a middle-aged couple attends an intense, week-long counseling session to work on their relationship.', 'After thirty years of marriage, a middle-aged couple attends an intense, week-long counseling session to work on their relationship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mHEca5NntVHtUPfBiQ3ZVFBRixe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:82696'),
  ('43140649238747953', 'Hopeless', 2023, 'Crime, Drama', 'Kim Chang-hoon, Lee Jae-geon, Lee Jae-woo', 'Kim Chang-hoon', 'Hong Xa-bin, Song Joong-ki, BIBI, Jeong Jae-kwang, You Seong-joo, Park Bo-kyung, Kim Jong-soo, Seo Dong-gab', null, 'Yeon-gyu is a teenage boy who wants to escape his hometown where violence is commonly enacted among neighbors. He only hopes to have a peaceful life with his mother. However, the world never allows him to have a dream nor hope for life. When Yeon-gyu needs a hand from grown-ups, Chi-geon, a thug of the town, offers a favor. The simple favor leads Yeon-gyu to explore the world of Chi-geon. It ironically results Yeon-gyu gradually falling into Chi-geon''s life. Grasping hope to run away from where he is, he struggles between the border. Can he escape from the town at the end?', 'Yeon-gyu is a teenage boy who wants to escape his hometown where violence is commonly enacted among neighbors. He only hopes to have a peaceful life with his mother. However, the world never allows him to have a dream nor hope for life. When Yeon-gyu needs a hand from grown-ups, Chi-geon, a thug of the town, offers a favor. The simple favor leads Yeon-gyu to explore the world of Chi-geon. It ironically results Yeon-gyu gradually falling into Chi-geon''s life. Grasping hope to run away from where he is, he struggles between the border. Can he escape from the town at the end?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/IPyXuP15FKQ6aECKeN9dl2t81l.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1028684'),
