  ('1073149859484595025', 'Hopelessly Lost', 1973, 'Family, Adventure', 'Georgiy Daneliya, Vadim Yusov, Avtandil Kvirikashvili', 'Georgiy Daneliya, Viktoriya Tokareva', 'Roman Madyanov, Evgeni Leonov, Vakhtang Kikabidze, Feliks Imokuede, Irina Skobtseva, Ivan Ryzhov, Vladimir Basov, Andrey Fayt', null, 'Soviet adventure comedy film based on Mark Twain''s Adventures of Huckleberry Finn.', 'Soviet adventure comedy film based on Mark Twain''s Adventures of Huckleberry Finn.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/79wdwyuC6Oo9sKUPGZFo3W8YoWx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27923'),
  ('114033856263578813', 'Hoppers', 2026, 'Animation, Family, Science Fiction, Comedy, Adventure', 'Daniel Chong, Jeremy Lasky, Ian Megibben', 'Jesse Andrews', 'Piper Curda, Bobby Moynihan, Jon Hamm, Kathy Najimy, Dave Franco, Eduardo Franco, Aparna Nancherla, Tom Law', 'PG', 'Scientists have discovered how to ''hop'' human consciousness into lifelike robotic animals, allowing people to communicate with animals as animals. Animal lover Mabel seizes an opportunity to use the technology, uncovering mysteries within the animal world beyond anything she could have imagined.', 'Scientists have discovered how to ''hop'' human consciousness into lifelike robotic animals, allowing people to communicate with animals as animals. Animal lover Mabel seizes an opportunity to use the technology, uncovering mysteries within the animal world beyond anything she could have imagined.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xjtWQ2CL1mpmMNwuU5HeS4Iuwuu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1327819'),
  ('133017267414953688', 'Hoppy-Go-Lucky', 1952, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Robert McKimson', null, 'Mel Blanc, Stan Freberg', null, 'Sylvester Cat and his dopey, brawny feline friend, Benny, hunt mice in a warehouse because Benny wants one as a pet. Hippety Hopper, the baby kangaroo, is in the warehouse, and the two cats, of course, think he''s a giant mouse. Benny wants him and obliges Sylvester to try and catch the fleet-of-foot Hippety.', 'Sylvester Cat and his dopey, brawny feline friend, Benny, hunt mice in a warehouse because Benny wants one as a pet. Hippety Hopper, the baby kangaroo, is in the warehouse, and the two cats, of course, think he''s a giant mouse. Benny wants him and obliges Sylvester to try and catch the fleet-of-foot Hippety.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1ULPw4SwDflubNhubSGbG5n9rpW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:235931'),
  ('313322741929101363', 'Hopscotch', 1980, 'Comedy, Adventure', 'Ronald Neame, Arthur Ibbetson', 'Bryan Forbes, Brian Garfield', 'Walter Matthau, Glenda Jackson, Sam Waterston, Ned Beatty, Herbert Lom, David Matthau, George Baker, Ivor Roberts', 'R', 'When CIA operative Miles Kendig deliberately lets KGB agent Yaskov get away, his boss threatens to retire him. Kendig beats him to it, however, destroying his own records and traveling to Austria where he begins work on a memoir that will expose all his former agency''s covert practices. The CIA catches wind of the book and sends other agents after him, initiating a frenetic game of cat and mouse that spans the globe.', 'When CIA operative Miles Kendig deliberately lets KGB agent Yaskov get away, his boss threatens to retire him. Kendig beats him to it, however, destroying his own records and traveling to Austria where he begins work on a memoir that will expose all his former agency''s covert practices. The CIA catches wind of the book and sends other agents after him, initiating a frenetic game of cat and mouse that spans the globe.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7ZTasNoTehrypra0X97zh8Amk3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32030'),
  ('726616285779354142', 'Horizon Line', 2020, 'Thriller, Adventure, Action', 'Flavio Martínez Labiano, Mikael Marcimain, Sophie Kenny', 'Josh Campbell, Matthew Stuecken', 'Allison Williams, Alexander Dreymon, Keith David, Pearl Mackie, Jumayn Hunter, Privilege Magezi, Amanda Khan, Anouchka Massoudy', 'PG-13', 'A couple flying on a small plane to attend a tropical island wedding must fight for their lives after their pilot suffers a heart attack.', 'A couple flying on a small plane to attend a tropical island wedding must fight for their lives after their pilot suffers a heart attack.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vWGkIHeCLw9wWvPXnPTOM9d5GiK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:602654'),
  ('403429391516089887', 'Horizon: An American Saga - Chapter 1', 2024, 'Western, Drama', 'Robert Legato, Tobijah Tyler, Ryan McDowell', 'Jon Baird, Kevin Costner', 'Kevin Costner, Sienna Miller, Sam Worthington, Jena Malone, Abbey Lee, Michael Rooker, Danny Huston, Luke Wilson', 'R', 'In 1859, families discover the lure of the Old West as they settle in territories from Wyoming to Kansas. Meanwhile, a gruff cowboy finds himself on the run with a prostitute and a young boy after killing a fellow gunman.', 'In 1859, families discover the lure of the Old West as they settle in territories from Wyoming to Kansas. Meanwhile, a gruff cowboy finds himself on the run with a prostitute and a young boy after killing a fellow gunman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/posWMQwX1HCIK26TGL3niJp5fg0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:932086'),
  ('770075583706713131', 'Horizon: An American Saga - Chapter 2', 2024, 'Western, Drama', 'Philip A. Patterson, Frederic Roth, Béla Temesváry', 'Kevin Costner, Jon Baird', 'Kevin Costner, Sienna Miller, Sam Worthington, Giovanni Ribisi, Abbey Lee, Michael Rooker, Danny Huston, Luke Wilson', null, 'Explore the lure of the Old West and how it was won—and lost—through the blood, sweat and tears of many. Spanning 15 years before, during, and following the Civil War, from 1859 to 1874, embark on an emotional journey across a country at war with itself, experienced through the lens of families, friends and foes all attempting to discover what it truly means to be the United States of America.', 'Explore the lure of the Old West and how it was won—and lost—through the blood, sweat and tears of many. Spanning 15 years before, during, and following the Civil War, from 1859 to 1874, embark on an emotional journey across a country at war with itself, experienced through the lens of families, friends and foes all attempting to discover what it truly means to be the United States of America.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2Ot7mpKYgqZfkGRaeV2kaHqKFkS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1120368'),
  ('454676087396760182', 'Horizons West', 1952, 'Western', 'Charles P. Boyle, Budd Boetticher, Joseph Gershenson', 'Louis Stevens', 'Robert Ryan, Julie Adams, Rock Hudson, Judith Braun, John McIntire, Raymond Burr, James Arness, Dennis Weaver', 'NR', 'Brothers Dan and Neil Hammond return to Texas after the Civil War. Ambitious Dan turns to rustling and then shady land deals to build an empire. Being held for a murder, he is rescued from a lynch mob by Neil, who is now the Marshal, but there is eventually a falling out between the brothers, good triumphing over evil.', 'Brothers Dan and Neil Hammond return to Texas after the Civil War. Ambitious Dan turns to rustling and then shady land deals to build an empire. Being held for a murder, he is rescued from a lynch mob by Neil, who is now the Marshal, but there is eventually a falling out between the brothers, good triumphing over evil.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rFV5wxIQTWytlZQksRJMceEhV1L.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:60535'),
  ('305159854193855905', 'Hormones', 2008, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Songyos Sugmakanan, Niramon Ross, Nontra Kumwong', 'Prasert Vijitpawan', 'Focus Jirakul, Charlie Trairat, Sirachuch Chienthaworn, Ungsumalynn Sirapatsakmetha, Ratchu Surajaras, Chutima Teepanat, Thaniya Ummaritchoti, Chantavit Dhanasevi', null, 'Students pursue love affairs some destined to be and some doomed during a break from school in this ensemble romance.', 'Students pursue love affairs some destined to be and some doomed during a break from school in this ensemble romance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cAeJZQhceDjrdtOT8XtjWeiEWtW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43296'),
  ('459614475663664163', 'Horn of Plenty', 2008, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Juan Carlos Tabío, Hans Burmann', 'Arturo Arango, Juan Carlos Tabío', 'Jorge Perugorría, Enrique Molina, Paula Ali, Yoima Valdés, Laura de la Uz, Annia Bu Maure, Vladimir Cruz, Mirta Ibarra', null, 'An unclaimed fortune, grown for centuries in a British bank account, becomes a potential windfall for Bernadito Castiñeiras and the residents of the tiny village of Yaragüey, Cuba. To receive his massive inheritance check, Bernadito must prove his lineage to the Castiñeiras nuns who first populated the region. In an isolated and impoverished town where many residents share the same surname, a feud breaks out between the "Castiñeiras" and "Castiñeyras" families.', 'An unclaimed fortune, grown for centuries in a British bank account, becomes a potential windfall for Bernadito Castiñeiras and the residents of the tiny village of Yaragüey, Cuba. To receive his massive inheritance check, Bernadito must prove his lineage to the Castiñeiras nuns who first populated the region. In an isolated and impoverished town where many residents share the same surname, a feud breaks out between the "Castiñeiras" and "Castiñeyras" families.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/53Sybw476mvPyqutIjNUByqaoPE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24814'),
