  ('730098674414537817', 'Horror Shark', 2020, 'Horror', 'Wang Liang', null, 'Alex Fong Lik-Sun, Cica Zhou, Wen Dongjun, Tara Clance, Wang Liang, Shen Meng-Sheng, 刘子晴', null, 'After a white shark, also known as an ogre shark, is injected with a GMO medicine, it turns into a dangerous bloodthirsty mutant that can outwit even the king of nature. A group of hapless lovers of playing with the laws of nature will have to stop the shark or die from its teeth. But no matter how terrible the vengeance of nature is, there is a much more terrible force, from whose punishment can not escape even a mutant who survived in battle with...', 'After a white shark, also known as an ogre shark, is injected with a GMO medicine, it turns into a dangerous bloodthirsty mutant that can outwit even the king of nature. A group of hapless lovers of playing with the laws of nature will have to stop the shark or die from its teeth. But no matter how terrible the vengeance of nature is, there is a much more terrible force, from whose punishment can not escape even a mutant who survived in battle with...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wJf8h95IWYopViygcwOrUzndAdT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:728590'),
  ('554104871305486755', 'Horror Stories', 2012, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Kim Sun, Lim Dae-Woong, Min Kyu-dong', 'Lim Dae-Woong, Kim Gok, Kim Sun', 'Kim Ji-won, Yoo Yeon-seok, Kim Hyeon-soo, No Kang-min, Um Tae-goo, Ra Mi-ran, No Hyeon-hee, Zin Tae-hyun', 'R', 'A teenager is abducted and forced to tell the scariest tales she knows, leading to this anthology of four stories: a brother and sister are under siege while home alone; a killer escapes police custody mid-flight; step-sisters take plastic surgery to nightmarishly macabre extremes; a paramedic and mother standoff over her infected young daughter.', 'A teenager is abducted and forced to tell the scariest tales she knows, leading to this anthology of four stories: a brother and sister are under siege while home alone; a killer escapes police custody mid-flight; step-sisters take plastic surgery to nightmarishly macabre extremes; a paramedic and mother standoff over her infected young daughter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/w58bHAw3fo8P46oHwpbPrUJjEPK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:133985'),
  ('975788504522773104', 'Horror Stories 2', 2013, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Kim Hwi, Kim Sung-ho, Min Kyu-dong', 'Park Sun, Kim Sung-ho, Min Kyu-dong', 'Sung Joon, Lee Soo-hyuk, Park Sung-woong, Lee Se-young, Go Kyung-pyo, Baek Jin-hee, Kim Seul-gi, Jung In-sun', null, 'In an insurance company, Yoon, who is an outsider, has a power to see people’s past and read their minds. Mr. Park, Yoon’s boss, assumes that she has some kind of special power, decides to test her ability. At very late night when everyone has gone home, Mr. Park brings Yoon to a storage room where there are full of case reports. Among them, Mr. Park picks three doubtful cases. He asks Yoon to tell him what exactly happened. Yoon, who senses some dark aura wandering around him, tells the story of each case. Every time Yoon finishes each case, the dark aura gets darker and bigger and Yoon tries to warn Mr. Park about it. Would Mr. Park able to escape from the dark aura?', 'In an insurance company, Yoon, who is an outsider, has a power to see people’s past and read their minds. Mr. Park, Yoon’s boss, assumes that she has some kind of special power, decides to test her ability. At very late night when everyone has gone home, Mr. Park brings Yoon to a storage room where there are full of case reports. Among them, Mr. Park picks three doubtful cases. He asks Yoon to tell him what exactly happened. Yoon, who senses some dark aura wandering around him, tells the story of each case. Every time Yoon finishes each case, the dark aura gets darker and bigger and Yoon tries to warn Mr. Park about it. Would Mr. Park able to escape from the dark aura?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4szXkJSK3dFhmBifIkqlrmjSnge.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:199771'),
  ('814453934540246159', 'Horror Stories 3', 2016, 'Thriller, Horror', 'Kim Sun, Kim Gok, Baek Seung-bin', 'Min Kyu-dong', 'Kim Su-an, Cha Ji-yeon, Im Seul-ong, Min Moo-je, Kim Jong-soo, Ji an, Park Jeong-min, Gyeong Su-jin', null, 'Three horror stories, with each set in the past, present and future.', 'Three horror stories, with each set in the past, present and future.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a4lFUvbsZV2NhCaVNW4Nf98ZqDR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:400990'),
  ('893155986353301095', 'Horror Story', 2013, 'Horror', 'Ayush Raina', 'Mohan Azaad, Vikram Bhatt', 'Aparnaa Bajpai, Ravish Desai, Karan Kundra, Nandini Vaid, Hassan Zaidi', null, 'A group of 7 youngsters decide to spend a night at a reportedly haunted hotel to celebrate the farewell of one of them leaving for the USA. Despite people''s warnings and other "signs" trying to ward them off from there, they enter the hotel, and then the truth dawns on them. Seven friends - Sam alias Samrat, Magesh, Achint, Neel, Neena, Sonia and Magi reunite after several years apart to celebrate the farewell of one of their friends, who is going abroad in order to pursue his career and fulfill his goals. The group soon learns about an abandoned hotel with strange stories around it. Much against warnings, they decide to spend a night at the hotel, and soon realize the mistake of their lives.', 'A group of 7 youngsters decide to spend a night at a reportedly haunted hotel to celebrate the farewell of one of them leaving for the USA. Despite people''s warnings and other "signs" trying to ward them off from there, they enter the hotel, and then the truth dawns on them. Seven friends - Sam alias Samrat, Magesh, Achint, Neel, Neena, Sonia and Magi reunite after several years apart to celebrate the farewell of one of their friends, who is going abroad in order to pursue his career and fulfill his goals. The group soon learns about an abandoned hotel with strange stories around it. Much against warnings, they decide to spend a night at the hotel, and soon realize the mistake of their lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/79qQhOqEJUuRdfGw5NQnylGnRNE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:242441'),
  ('617452768663892111', 'Horrors of Malformed Men', 1969, 'Horror, Mystery', 'Teruo Ishii, Shigeru Akatsuka, Etsuaki Masuda', 'Teruo Ishii, Masahiro Kakefuda', 'Teruo Yoshida, Yukie Kagawa, Teruko Yumi, Mitsuko Aoi, Michiko Kobata, Yumiko Katayama, Kei Kiyama, Reiko Mikasa', null, 'After escaping from an insane asylum, a medical student assumes the identity of a mysterious dead man, who appears to be his doppelganger, and gets lured to a sinister island ruled by a mad scientist and his malformed men.', 'After escaping from an insane asylum, a medical student assumes the identity of a mysterious dead man, who appears to be his doppelganger, and gets lured to a sinister island ruled by a mad scientist and his malformed men.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q1cgApkVjMPXSXVbJrfu1aPfbJZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39986'),
  ('256857319333265160', 'Horrors of Spider Island', 1960, 'Horror', 'Fritz Böttger, Georg Krause, Ilona Juranyi', 'Eldon Howard, Albert G. Miller, Fritz Böttger', 'Alexander D''Arcy, Barbara Valentin, Rainer Brandt, Harald Maresch, Elfie Wagner, Dorothee Parker, Helga Franck, Helga Neuner', 'NR', 'A bite from a giant spider turns a man into a creature that terrorizes a group of women who survived a plane crash.', 'A bite from a giant spider turns a man into a creature that terrorizes a group of women who survived a plane crash.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zeT4ZDY2TpUKY0rYijfzQh8HTUv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31392'),
  ('356084827979510868', 'Horrors of the Black Museum', 1959, 'Horror', 'Arthur Crabtree, Desmond Dickinson, Bill Shore', 'Herman Cohen, Aben Kandel', 'Michael Gough, June Cunningham, Graham Curnow, Shirley Anne Field, Geoffrey Keen, Gerald Andersen, John Warwick, Beatrice Varley', 'NR', 'A writer of murder mysteries finds himself caught up in a string of murders in London.', 'A writer of murder mysteries finds himself caught up in a string of murders in London.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uSCR1iZDIfTF6dbLzQe5IStRuA9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38823'),
  ('802446535933502533', 'Hors Service', 2001, 'Comedy', 'Jean-Paul Lilienfeld', null, 'François Berléand, Jackie Berroyer, Dieudonné, Claudia Gerini, Catherine Mouchet, Olivier Sitruk, Pascal Leguennec, Sandrine Laroche', null, 'Ils sont cinq tueurs. Francis, le chef, Louis le parano, Victor, l''accro aux series tele, M''sieur, fan de tamagochi et Marchand, dont la femme est la seule certitude. Elle le croit representant en chaussures. Jusqu''au jour ou elle decouvre la verite. Une discussion plus qu''orageuse suit, au cours de laquelle il lui balance un coup de poing d''une telle force qu''elle tombe dans le coma. Marchand est effondre. Il acquiert la conviction que, s''il se rachete, elle se reveillera. Il decide non seulement de raccrocher mais encore de sauver ses hypothetiques victimes.', 'Ils sont cinq tueurs. Francis, le chef, Louis le parano, Victor, l''accro aux series tele, M''sieur, fan de tamagochi et Marchand, dont la femme est la seule certitude. Elle le croit representant en chaussures. Jusqu''au jour ou elle decouvre la verite. Une discussion plus qu''orageuse suit, au cours de laquelle il lui balance un coup de poing d''une telle force qu''elle tombe dans le coma. Marchand est effondre. Il acquiert la conviction que, s''il se rachete, elle se reveillera. Il decide non seulement de raccrocher mais encore de sauver ses hypothetiques victimes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zh56PQ1TsHMXFw8OOG9u54gBdKA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52640'),
  ('567176846424984441', 'Horse Feathers', 1932, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Norman Z. McLeod, Ray June', 'Bert Kalmar, Harry Ruby, S.J. Perelman', 'Groucho Marx, Harpo Marx, Chico Marx, Zeppo Marx, Thelma Todd, David Landau, Bobby Barber, Reginald Barlow', 'NR', 'Quincy Adams Wagstaff, the new president of Huxley U, hires bumblers Baravelli and Pinky to help his school win the big football game against rival Darwin U.', 'Quincy Adams Wagstaff, the new president of Huxley U, hires bumblers Baravelli and Pinky to help his school win the big football game against rival Darwin U.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tyUVWm2zWMNp5PEJchvV1vJDuKr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13912'),
  ('1105697060282741615', 'Horse Fever', 1976, 'Comedy', 'Steno, Emilio Loffredo, Lodovico Gasparini', 'Steno, Enrico Vanzina, Alfredo Giannetti', 'Gigi Proietti, Enrico Montesano, Catherine Spaak, Mario Carotenuto, Francesco De Rosa, Maria Teresa Albani, Gigi Ballista, Nikki Gentile', null, 'Bruno Fioretti, known as "Mandrake", is an inveterate gambler who never misses a day at the horse racing track in Rome. He is doubly unlucky: he bets too much on one horse, and his wife is sleeping with his best friend because Mandrake is always at the track. Penniless and cuckolded, Mandrake decides to make one last bet.', 'Bruno Fioretti, known as "Mandrake", is an inveterate gambler who never misses a day at the horse racing track in Rome. He is doubly unlucky: he bets too much on one horse, and his wife is sleeping with his best friend because Mandrake is always at the track. Penniless and cuckolded, Mandrake decides to make one last bet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zprLOtwwjjTF84YOGIZxakRu9Mc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38528'),
  ('633361646382045645', 'Horse Fever: The Mandrake Sting', 2002, 'Comedy', 'Carlo Vanzina, Giorgio Melidoni, Claudio Zamarion', 'Carlo Vanzina, Enrico Vanzina', 'Gigi Proietti, Nancy Brilli, Rodolfo Laganà, Andrea Ascolese, Stefano Ambrogi, Emanuela Grimalda, Enrico Montesano, Carlo Buccirosso', null, 'Mandrake and his new friends still continue to bet (and lose a lot of money) on horse races. What will they invent for cheating money?', 'Mandrake and his new friends still continue to bet (and lose a lot of money) on horse races. What will they invent for cheating money?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wqQFslMnLKI42EEJAfWn5lFc53u.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38529'),
  ('880835076830319279', 'Horse Girl', 2020, 'Drama', 'Jeff Baena, Sean McElwee, Kyle Shea', 'Jeff Baena, Alison Brie', 'Alison Brie, Debby Ryan, John Reynolds, Molly Shannon, John Ortiz, Meredith Hagner, Jake Picking, David Paymer', 'R', 'A socially awkward woman with a fondness for arts and crafts, horses, and supernatural crime shows finds her increasingly lucid dreams trickling into her waking life.', 'A socially awkward woman with a fondness for arts and crafts, horses, and supernatural crime shows finds her increasingly lucid dreams trickling into her waking life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hNQ7st9dFXUXENMcsAuVxcrIBfA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:653601'),
