  ('539834558596423078', 'Horse Julius on the Throne and Three Heroes', 2021, 'Animation, Comedy, Adventure', 'Konstantin Feoktistov, Darina Shmidt, Konstantin Bronzit', 'Aleksandr Boyarsky, Aleksandra Shokha', 'Oleg Kulikovich, Valeri Solovyev, Dmitriy Bykovskiy-Romashov, Sergey Makovetskiy, Dmitry Vysotsky, Elizaveta Boyarskaya, Anatoli Petrov', null, 'As always, our beloved horse, Julius, is steeped in history. And at the same time he helped the Prince - they accidentally exchanged bodies, of course, not without the help of an old acquaintance - Baba Yaga and a little witchcraft. Now Julius is sitting in the palace and landscaping Kiev, and the Prince plows the field. These are the games of thrones. But this cannot go on for long, the fatherland is in danger! And as always, three heroes get down to business.', 'As always, our beloved horse, Julius, is steeped in history. And at the same time he helped the Prince - they accidentally exchanged bodies, of course, not without the help of an old acquaintance - Baba Yaga and a little witchcraft. Now Julius is sitting in the palace and landscaping Kiev, and the Prince plows the field. These are the games of thrones. But this cannot go on for long, the fatherland is in danger! And as always, three heroes get down to business.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rf60aet9oqigM4pVDCyyiMGt5Nb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:824184'),
  ('758734222843658874', 'Horse Money', 2014, 'Drama', 'Pedro Costa, Leonardo Simões', 'Pedro Costa', 'Ventura, Vitalina Varela, Tito Furtado, Antonio Santos, Gustavo Sumpta, André Guiomar, Benvindo Tavares, Alberto ''Lento'' Barros', null, 'While the young captains lead the revolution in the streets, the people of Fontainhas search for Ventura, lost in the woods.', 'While the young captains lead the revolution in the streets, the people of Fontainhas search for Ventura, lost in the woods.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ycvnKivsX5raJX1zEcg5jubbz2g.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:285697'),
  ('716456208232115581', 'Horse Sense', 1999, 'Drama, Family, TV Movie', 'Rodney Charters, Greg Beeman, Richard W. Abramitis', 'Chad Hayes, Carey Hayes', 'Joey Lawrence, Susan Walters, M.C. Gainey, Leann Hunley, Robin Thomas, Jolie Jenkins, Steve Reevis, Freda Foh Shen', 'G', 'After treating his rancher cousin shoddily in L.A. Michael Woods is sentenced by his parents to spending a month on the ranch with his cousin and aunt.', 'After treating his rancher cousin shoddily in L.A. Michael Woods is sentenced by his parents to spending a month on the ranch with his cousin and aunt.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ckdA057F1hpDIHedKG334vlRd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:6980'),
  ('1033329325505172040', 'Horse Trick Riders', 1895, 'Documentary', 'Louis Lumière', null, null, null, 'In the background is a house. In the foreground, a groom holds the reins of a sleek black horse that stands in profile. A tall man, dressed in a black uniform, demonstrates how to mount the horse then encourages and tries to assist a man in white. The man in white keeps falling, and soon it''s apparent that he''s an putting on a show. His pratfalls become more elaborate and stylish. The horse stands patient. The little groom laughs to see such sport. And finally, the man in white finds a comic accommodation. The story, though brief, has a beginning, middle, and end.', 'In the background is a house. In the foreground, a groom holds the reins of a sleek black horse that stands in profile. A tall man, dressed in a black uniform, demonstrates how to mount the horse then encourages and tries to assist a man in white. The man in white keeps falling, and soon it''s apparent that he''s an putting on a show. His pratfalls become more elaborate and stylish. The horse stands patient. The little groom laughs to see such sport. And finally, the man in white finds a comic accommodation. The story, though brief, has a beginning, middle, and end.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3aTqevKAt2XAZTkxuK7vrUw3Axp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:127157'),
  ('1070693564592583009', 'Horsehead', 2014, 'Fantasy, Horror', 'Romain Basset', 'Karim Chériguène, Romain Basset', 'Lilly-Fleur Pointeaux, Catriona MacColl, Fu''ad Aït Aattou, Shane Woodward, Gala Besson, Murray Head, Vernon Dobtcheff, Philippe Nahon', 'NR', 'Since her childhood, Jessica has been haunted by recurrent nightmares whose meaning escapes her. This peculiarity has led her to study the psychophysiology of dreams and to follow a therapy with Sean, her mentor and boyfriend, to try and understand the origin of her nightmares. Following the death of her maternal grandmother she hardly knew, Jessica reluctantly returns to the family home. Jessica then begins to wander in a nightmarish world inhabited by twisted versions of her family members. She gradually improves her skills as a lucid dreamer and investigates to solve the mystery that gnaws her and haunts the family home...', 'Since her childhood, Jessica has been haunted by recurrent nightmares whose meaning escapes her. This peculiarity has led her to study the psychophysiology of dreams and to follow a therapy with Sean, her mentor and boyfriend, to try and understand the origin of her nightmares. Following the death of her maternal grandmother she hardly knew, Jessica reluctantly returns to the family home. Jessica then begins to wander in a nightmarish world inhabited by twisted versions of her family members. She gradually improves her skills as a lucid dreamer and investigates to solve the mystery that gnaws her and haunts the family home...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zbRQXLN90LOs7iTnJzNq15WFDn5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:285549'),
  ('544118408760209214', 'Horsemen', 2009, 'Crime, Drama, Horror, Mystery, Thriller', 'Jonas Åkerlund, Richard Duffy, Larry Spittle', 'David Callaham', 'Dennis Quaid, Zhang Ziyi, Lou Taylor Pucci, Clifton Collins Jr., Barry Shabaka Henley, Patrick Fugit, Eric Balfour, Paul Dooley', 'R', 'A recently widowed detective still grieving over his wife''s death discovers a shocking connection between himself and the suspects in a serial killing spree linked to the Four Horsemen of the Apocalypse.', 'A recently widowed detective still grieving over his wife''s death discovers a shocking connection between himself and the suspects in a serial killing spree linked to the Four Horsemen of the Apocalypse.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sIVBGmRXsPuI1TES9sKUImMOw2Q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18476'),
  ('950292449291099320', 'Horseplay', 2023, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Marco Berger, Nahuel Berger', 'Marco Berger', 'Bruno Giganti, Agustín Machta, Franco de la Puente, Carlos Carneglia, Iván Masliah, Facundo Mas, Iván Díaz Benítez, Denis Corat', null, 'In the heat of the summer, Andy leaves the city in order to spend some time at a luxury villa with his best friends. As they party and goof around, their initial consensual horseplay reveals that they each have different personal boundaries.', 'In the heat of the summer, Andy leaves the city in order to spend some time at a luxury villa with his best friends. As they party and goof around, their initial consensual horseplay reveals that they each have different personal boundaries.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ubsC73ldy60iTA0XK0slwLmKoD6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:978415'),
  ('720067104056311528', 'Horses of God', 2013, 'Drama', 'Nabil Ayouch, Hichame Alaouié', 'Jamal Belmahi', 'Abdelhakim Rachid, Abdelilah Rachid, Hamza Souideq, Ahmed El Idrissi Amrani, Badr Chakir, Achraf Afir, Said El-Alami, Zouhair Sabri', null, 'The film follows two brothers over the course of a decade. While they begin as kids in search of thrills in the sprawling slums of Morocco’s Sidi Moumen, we witness their gradual, and ultimately shocking, radicalisation.', 'The film follows two brothers over the course of a decade. While they begin as kids in search of thrills in the sprawling slums of Morocco’s Sidi Moumen, we witness their gradual, and ultimately shocking, radicalisation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xtCYy7sfWIPH2zMUAcHAxxI4Cun.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:134908'),
  ('269781586517572306', 'Horses'' Collars', 1935, 'Comedy', 'Clyde Bruckman, John W. Boyle', 'Felix Adler', 'Moe Howard, Larry Fine, Curly Howard, Dorothea Kent, Fred Kohler, Slim Whitaker, Bob Callahan, Fred Kelsey', 'NR', 'The Stooges are private detectives in the Old West trying to help a girl recover an IOU from a bad guy. Their attempts to steal the IOU from the villain''s wallet and then from a safe meet with problems until Curly, who goes berserk whenever he sees a mouse, knocks out all the bad guys.', 'The Stooges are private detectives in the Old West trying to help a girl recover an IOU from a bad guy. Their attempts to steal the IOU from the villain''s wallet and then from a safe meet with problems until Curly, who goes berserk whenever he sees a mouse, knocks out all the bad guys.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uOMe4PvSJ8cwEjUIABRnVXfcaCT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:115034'),
  ('1034087667983512439', 'Horst Schlämmer - Isch kandidiere!', 2009, 'Comedy', 'Angelo Colagrossi, Frank Grunert', 'Angelo Colagrossi, Ludwig Berndl, Hape Kerkeling', 'Hape Kerkeling, Alexandra Kamp, Simon Gosejohann, Maren Kroymann, Norbert Heisterkamp, Thomas Loibl, Soogi Kang, Tung Mingh Nguyen', null, 'So far he has earned his living as deputy editor-in-chief at the Grevenbroicher Tagblatt, but actually Horst Schlämmer had always guessed: he was destined for something bigger - too much bigger. Without further ado, he therefore quits his old job, founds his very own party and thus starts his rush to the chancellor''s office. While the election machinery is quickly started and soon picks up speed, only two questions remain unanswered: Is Horst Schlämmer ready for Germany? And is Germany ready for him?', 'So far he has earned his living as deputy editor-in-chief at the Grevenbroicher Tagblatt, but actually Horst Schlämmer had always guessed: he was destined for something bigger - too much bigger. Without further ado, he therefore quits his old job, founds his very own party and thus starts his rush to the chancellor''s office. While the election machinery is quickly started and soon picks up speed, only two questions remain unanswered: Is Horst Schlämmer ready for Germany? And is Germany ready for him?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5rHIjPFK8iG8mabnguMJCWAS3ao.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27637'),
  ('217304031646310149', 'Horton Hatches the Egg', 1942, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Robert Clampett', null, 'Kent Rogers, Sara Berner, Mel Blanc, Frank Graham, Robert Clampett', null, 'Horton the elephant agrees to watch over lazy Maisie bird''s egg while she vacations. Much later, after...', 'Horton the elephant agrees to watch over lazy Maisie bird''s egg while she vacations. Much later, after...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gQjd7dBDZLg24cmSZ9KduwEwxAY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29020'),
  ('611276031995826532', 'Horton Hears a Who!', 1970, 'Animation, Family', 'Ben Washam, Chuck Jones', null, 'Hans Conried, June Foray, Chuck Jones, Thurl Ravenscroft', null, 'In this story, Horton discovers there is a microscopic community of intelligent beings called the Who''s living on a plant that only he can hear. Recognising the dangers they face, he resolves to keep them safe. However, the other animals around him think Horton has gone crazy thinking that there are such beings.', 'In this story, Horton discovers there is a microscopic community of intelligent beings called the Who''s living on a plant that only he can hear. Recognising the dangers they face, he resolves to keep them safe. However, the other animals around him think Horton has gone crazy thinking that there are such beings.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iYYMhLU7Q702XydshudAcyViJ9V.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29233'),
  ('95826900778295239', 'Horton Hears a Who!', 2008, 'Animation, Comedy, Family, Adventure, Fantasy', 'Jimmy Hayward, Steve Martino, David Esneault', 'Ken Daurio, Cinco Paul', 'Jim Carrey, Steve Carell, Carol Burnett, Will Arnett, Seth Rogen, Dan Fogler, Isla Fisher, Jonah Hill', 'G', 'An imaginative elephant named Horton hears a faint cry for help coming from a tiny speck of dust floating through the air. Horton suspects there may be life on that speck and despite a surrounding community, who thinks he has lost his mind, he is determined to save the tiny particle.', 'An imaginative elephant named Horton hears a faint cry for help coming from a tiny speck of dust floating through the air. Horton suspects there may be life on that speck and despite a surrounding community, who thinks he has lost his mind, he is determined to save the tiny particle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6k47Z3A5zI2rxubTMwiLyIqQLLr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12222'),
  ('990386970409931062', 'Horus: Prince of the Sun', 1968, 'Adventure, Drama, Animation, Fantasy', 'Mitsuru Takeda, Isao Takahata, Yasuo Otsuka', 'Kazuo Fukazawa', 'Hisako Ôkata, Etsuko Ichihara, Eijirō Tōno, Mikijiro Hira, Tadashi Yokouchi, Masao Mishima, Yukari Asai, Hiroshi Kamiyama', null, 'Young Horus lives in a mythical Scandinavia of the Iron Age. Recovering the stolen Sword of the Sun from a rock giant, he learns he must travel to the lands of his ancestors, encountering the beautiful but enigmatic Hilda as his journey leads to a series of adventures.', 'Young Horus lives in a mythical Scandinavia of the Iron Age. Recovering the stolen Sword of the Sun from a rock giant, he learns he must travel to the lands of his ancestors, encountering the beautiful but enigmatic Hilda as his journey leads to a series of adventures.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zFwoHHJgfJaNqao3L96vktnG7OJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52686'),
  ('353334725950883124', 'Hospital', 1970, 'Documentary', 'William Brayne, Frederick Wiseman', null, null, null, 'Daily activities of the Metropolitan Hospital in New York City, with emphasis on the emergency ward and outpatient clinics. The cases depicted illustrate how medical expertise, availability of resources, organizational considerations and the nature of communication among the staff and patients affect the delivery of health care.', 'Daily activities of the Metropolitan Hospital in New York City, with emphasis on the emergency ward and outpatient clinics. The cases depicted illustrate how medical expertise, availability of resources, organizational considerations and the nature of communication among the staff and patients affect the delivery of health care.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9zJVyNQCmJIly2Pet1XOQMpGNzN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:114390'),
