  ('296746741024121525', 'Hospital', 2020, 'Horror', 'Chia-Lin Chu', 'Chia-Lin Chu, Chang Yao-sheng', 'Austin Lin, Tai Bo, Li-chi Hsu, Jacqueline Zhu, Lei Hung, Samuel Ku, Yoko Yang, Eunice Lin', null, 'In an abandoned hospital in Tainan, a group of people came to try to communicate with the souls of their loved ones, only to be haunted by ominous supernatural phenomena.', 'In an abandoned hospital in Tainan, a group of people came to try to communicate with the souls of their loved ones, only to be haunted by ominous supernatural phenomena.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h3d6WGW5K6paeck2C2TAvSxoJu0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:761163'),
  ('618281844020964344', 'Hospital Fragment', 1999, null, 'Guy Maddin, Guy Maddin', 'Guy Maddin', 'Michael Gottli, Angela Heck, Darcy Fehr, Brent Neale', null, 'An impressionistic series of images inspired by "Tales From the Gimli Hospital".', 'An impressionistic series of images inspired by "Tales From the Gimli Hospital".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tDvlWwxMEtTsTnrMcCAm9fNWnpf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:143810'),
  ('41344335451809569', 'Hospital Massacre', 1981, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Boaz Davidson, Nicholas Josef von Sternberg', 'Marc Behm', 'Barbi Benton, Charles Lucia, Jon Van Ness, John Warner Williams, Den Surles, Gloria Jean Morrison, Karen Smith, Michael Frost', 'R', 'When Susan was a little girl, she rejected the Valentine of a lovestruck classmate. Decades later, she’s come to the hospital for a routine medical examination, and finds herself trapped in a bizarre nightmare, made all the worse as her vengeful childhood valentine, disguised among the hospital staff, begins murdering everyone in his path as a means of proving his undying ‘romantic’ obsession…', 'When Susan was a little girl, she rejected the Valentine of a lovestruck classmate. Decades later, she’s come to the hospital for a routine medical examination, and finds herself trapped in a bizarre nightmare, made all the worse as her vengeful childhood valentine, disguised among the hospital staff, begins murdering everyone in his path as a means of proving his undying ‘romantic’ obsession…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1ScSFs8uJA42eI5acIEo8n7YaDE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63590'),
  ('111012079690880450', 'Hospital of the Transfiguration', 1979, 'Drama, War, History', 'Edward Żebrowski, Witold Sobociński, Andrzej Domalik', 'Edward Żebrowski, Michał Komar', 'Piotr Dejmek, Jerzy Bińczycki, Henryk Bista, Ewa Dałkowska, Gustaw Holoubek, Zygmunt Hübner, Ryszard Kotys, Klaus Piontek', null, 'Shortly after the beginning of World War 2 a young idealist doctor is employed in a psychiatric hospital, where his notions of proper care for the patients are challenged by staff and the German occupation.', 'Shortly after the beginning of World War 2 a young idealist doctor is employed in a psychiatric hospital, where his notions of proper care for the patients are challenged by staff and the German occupation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fOh3aaqX7wb2LruV3urouKBgDO9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:288741'),
  ('718460169685569085', 'Hospitalité', 2011, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Koji Fukada, Kenichi Negishi', 'Koji Fukada', 'Kenji Yamauchi, Kiki Sugino, Kanji Furutachi, Bryerly Long, Erika Ono, Kumi Hyodo, Hiroko Matsuda, Tatsuya Kawamura', null, 'In this black comedy the lives of a timid small-time printer and his young wife are turned inside out by the arrival of a stranger who moves in and takes over their world. Set in a village-like outpost in the heart of Tokyo, this is a wry commentary on Japanese xenophobia. Kiki Sugino heads a spritely ensemble cast.', 'In this black comedy the lives of a timid small-time printer and his young wife are turned inside out by the arrival of a stranger who moves in and takes over their world. Set in a village-like outpost in the heart of Tokyo, this is a wry commentary on Japanese xenophobia. Kiki Sugino heads a spritely ensemble cast.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9W41v5d7unmm3if5JSOHyYpTKnh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:81633'),
  ('1107532774945969324', 'Hospitals: The White Mafia', 1973, 'Drama', 'Luigi Zampa, Giuseppe Ruzzolini, Tony Brandt', 'Dino Maiuri, Massimo De Rita', 'Enrico Maria Salerno, Gabriele Ferzetti, Senta Berger, Claudio Gora, Luciano Salce, Enzo Garinei, Tina Lattanzi, Antonella Steni', null, 'A famous surgeon earns enormous amounts of money by speculating on patients, although he is generally considered a great man and an excellent doctor. Only one of his colleagues rebels against the situation and tries to reveal the truth. But during a dramatic operation, the famous surgeon forces him to turn accomplice and the doctor must keep quiet. Not for long, however.', 'A famous surgeon earns enormous amounts of money by speculating on patients, although he is generally considered a great man and an excellent doctor. Only one of his colleagues rebels against the situation and tries to reveal the truth. But during a dramatic operation, the famous surgeon forces him to turn accomplice and the doctor must keep quiet. Not for long, however.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2EsXksYefPSyhMzHcFrQwNROpU0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:71776'),
  ('622446501181461583', 'Host', 2020, 'Horror', 'Rob Savage', 'Gemma Hurley, Rob Savage, Jed Shepherd', 'Haley Bishop, Jemma Moore, Emma Louise Webb, Radina Drandova, Caroline Ward, Edward Linard, Seylan Baxter, Alan Emrys', 'NR', 'Six friends hire a medium to hold a séance via Zoom during lockdown — but they get far more than they bargained for as things quickly go wrong. When an evil spirit starts invading their homes, they begin to realise they might not survive the night.', 'Six friends hire a medium to hold a séance via Zoom during lockdown — but they get far more than they bargained for as things quickly go wrong. When an evil spirit starts invading their homes, they begin to realise they might not survive the night.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h7dZpJDORYs5c56dydbrLFkEXpE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:723072'),
