  ('689200787867163532', 'Hot Acts of Love', 2005, 'Comedy, Action', 'Philippe de Chauveron', 'Philippe de Chauveron, Guy Laurent', 'Jean Dujardin, Pascal Elbé, Caterina Murino, Claude Brasseur, François Levantal, Ginie Van De Noort, Amy, Constantine Attia', null, 'Franck and Paul are working as team buddies in their Paris police unit. They are sent on a mission in Toulon to solve a drug traffic mystery, but things get out of hand when Paul learns that Franck has an affair with Valeria, his wife, who also happens to work in the police forces...', 'Franck and Paul are working as team buddies in their Paris police unit. They are sent on a mission in Toulon to solve a drug traffic mystery, but things get out of hand when Paul learns that Franck has an affair with Valeria, his wife, who also happens to work in the police forces...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zc5Mh8N3WSB08QX1vITDvrByGCX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13711'),
  ('366642682409785192', 'Hot Blooded', 2022, 'Crime, Action, Thriller', 'Kang Gook-hyun, Kim Hyo-seong, Seo Gyu-seok', 'Cheon Myeong-kwan', 'Jung Woo, Kim Kap-soo, Choi Moo-seong, Ji Seung-hyun, Kim Hae-gon, Yoon Ji-hye, Lee Hong-nae, Yoon Je-moon', null, 'A veteran gangster, Hee-su, is looking to retire from his crime family in the violent port town of Kuam, Korea. But an unexpected betrayal leads him down a bloody path where he gets caught in the middle of a mob war with deadly consequences.', 'A veteran gangster, Hee-su, is looking to retire from his crime family in the violent port town of Kuam, Korea. But an unexpected betrayal leads him down a bloody path where he gets caught in the middle of a mob war with deadly consequences.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/81D9Cvl8JbMJixD9ii9puwqyXK4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:599333'),
  ('226775875664249381', 'Hot Bot', 2016, 'Comedy, Science Fiction', 'Michael Polish, Michael Polish', 'Michael Polish, Mark Polish', 'Cynthia Kirchner, Doug Haley, Zack Pearlman, Larry Miller, Danny Masterson, Anthony Anderson, David Shackelford, Donald Faison', 'NR', 'Hot Bot is the hilarious journey of two sexually repressed and unpopular teenage geeks who accidentally discover a life-like super-model sex bot.', 'Hot Bot is the hilarious journey of two sexually repressed and unpopular teenage geeks who accidentally discover a life-like super-model sex bot.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fHUxi5HjpVjSpw5JKgGgiriVbGO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:385317'),
  ('766266008480603671', 'Hot Boyz', 2000, 'Action, Crime, Drama', 'Ken Blakey, Master P, Brian O''Sullivan', 'Master P', 'Gary Busey, Silkk The Shocker, Jeff Speakman, Snoop Dogg, C. Thomas Howell, David Brown, Master P, Anthony Johnson', 'R', 'Injustice begets a criminal. Kool is an artist without prospects, a black belt in karate, and in love with LaShawna, poised and college bound. One night she witnesses a stabbing and discovers the victim is a cop as he dies in her arms. She''s jailed for murder by the infamous Ramparts Division of the LAPD. Kool wants to prove her innocence, and Tully, the cynical detective in charge, ignores LaShawna''s case but uses Kool to break up an incipient crime operation. She''s in danger because the guilty parties fear that the officer talked before he died. While in jail awaiting a hearing and legal help, she''s beaten to death by a rogue cop. Kool vows revenge: the Hot Boyz are born.', 'Injustice begets a criminal. Kool is an artist without prospects, a black belt in karate, and in love with LaShawna, poised and college bound. One night she witnesses a stabbing and discovers the victim is a cop as he dies in her arms. She''s jailed for murder by the infamous Ramparts Division of the LAPD. Kool wants to prove her innocence, and Tully, the cynical detective in charge, ignores LaShawna''s case but uses Kool to break up an incipient crime operation. She''s in danger because the guilty parties fear that the officer talked before he died. While in jail awaiting a hearing and legal help, she''s beaten to death by a rogue cop. Kool vows revenge: the Hot Boyz are born.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nbSJ6eyOUcXQyfzloXxx5m8GGfS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36923'),
  ('472519788004645818', 'Hot Bubblegum', 1981, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Amnon Salomon, Boaz Davidson, Shaul Dishy', 'Boaz Davidson, Eli Tavor', 'Yftach Katzur, Jonathan Sagall, Zachi Noy, Rachel Steiner, Ariella Miniely, Orna Dagan, Menashe Warshavsky, Dvora Kedar', 'R', 'Further adventures of Bobby, Benji, and Huey in their pursuit of sex in the 50''s. While preparing for their final exams, they try to work out if it''s better to be going steady with one girl, and if changing girlfriends all the time leads to too many complications. This leads to frustrations with girls who wont go all the way, and problems with girls will go all the way with anyone!', 'Further adventures of Bobby, Benji, and Huey in their pursuit of sex in the 50''s. While preparing for their final exams, they try to work out if it''s better to be going steady with one girl, and if changing girlfriends all the time leads to too many complications. This leads to frustrations with girls who wont go all the way, and problems with girls will go all the way with anyone!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ls9gxg8tBPo1dnmqJNzVc9u51no.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10582'),
  ('1139672696049203565', 'Hot Cars', 1956, 'Action, Thriller', 'Don McDougall, William Margulies, Paul Wurtzel', 'Richard H. Landau, Don Martin', 'John Bromfield, Joi Lansing, Mark Dana, Carol Shannon, Ralph Clanton, Robert Osterloh, Dabbs Greer, Charles Keane', null, 'Story of a salesman lured into the "hot car" racket.', 'Story of a salesman lured into the "hot car" racket.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zAZ16WP0BWwAtdgfVGo1pFn8Ha4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38338'),
  ('1073865502472208533', 'Hot Chili', 1985, 'Comedy', 'William Sachs, Jorge Senyal', 'Menahem Golan, William Sachs', 'Charles Schillaci, Allan Kayser, Joe Rubbo, Chuck Hemingway, Louisa Moritz, Taaffe O''Connell, Victoria Barrett, Robert Riesel', 'R', 'A group of American teenage boys goes south of the border to work for the summer at a Mexican resort. There they encounter many wacky guests and have zany adventures involving a German dominatrix, a music teacher that gets hot when giving lessons, a buxom cook, and an uptight socialite that eventually thaws. More often than not they end up in bed with someone, but one of the teens is holding out for True Love.', 'A group of American teenage boys goes south of the border to work for the summer at a Mexican resort. There they encounter many wacky guests and have zany adventures involving a German dominatrix, a music teacher that gets hot when giving lessons, a buxom cook, and an uptight socialite that eventually thaws. More often than not they end up in bed with someone, but one of the teens is holding out for True Love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xT2JZT3W8rSfwvPWOTWwGCMXyX5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:88907'),
  ('1143793464537080549', 'Hot Chocolate Holiday', 2021, 'Romance, Comedy, TV Movie', 'Brian Brough', 'Brittany Wiscombe', 'Aubrey Reynolds, Jonny Swenson, Kelsie Elena, Susan Phelan, Madison Savoie, Brandan Ngo, Nathan Lesser, Shae Robins', null, 'Colette runs a coffee shop that is known for her secret and famous hot chocolate. When Marcus, a new dessert shop owner, starts to draw in Colette''s customers with his very own specialty hot chocolate that tastes exactly like the recipe from her beloved grandmother, she is determined to expose him. But as she gets to know Marcus, sparks fly between the cocoa connoisseurs.', 'Colette runs a coffee shop that is known for her secret and famous hot chocolate. When Marcus, a new dessert shop owner, starts to draw in Colette''s customers with his very own specialty hot chocolate that tastes exactly like the recipe from her beloved grandmother, she is determined to expose him. But as she gets to know Marcus, sparks fly between the cocoa connoisseurs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sVdHMMlbB2JaBs88mWEsfmxKS08.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:777405'),
  ('23503732483547194', 'Hot Coffee', 2011, 'Documentary', 'Susan Saladoff, Louis Fox, Martina Radwan', null, 'Joan Claybrook, Oliver Diaz, Joanne Doroshow, Al Franken, Colin Gourley, Connor Gourley, John Grisham, Jamie Leigh Jones', null, 'Most people think they know the "McDonald''s coffee case," but what they don''t know is that corporations have spent millions distorting the case to promote tort reform. HOT COFFEE reveals how big business, aided by the media, brewed a dangerous concoction of manipulation and lies to protect corporate interests. By following four people whose lives were devastated by the attacks on our courts, the film challenges the assumptions Americans hold about "jackpot justice."', 'Most people think they know the "McDonald''s coffee case," but what they don''t know is that corporations have spent millions distorting the case to promote tort reform. HOT COFFEE reveals how big business, aided by the media, brewed a dangerous concoction of manipulation and lies to protect corporate interests. By following four people whose lives were devastated by the attacks on our courts, the film challenges the assumptions Americans hold about "jackpot justice."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o6xUakTHVZgTCc6lBza20r38iMv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:68200'),
  ('1078754620995627327', 'Hot Cross Bunny', 1948, 'Animation, Comedy, Science Fiction', 'Robert McKimson', null, 'Mel Blanc', 'NR', 'At Eureka Experimental Hospital, a doctor plans to switch the characteristics of a chicken into the brain and a rabbit, into each other. Bugs Bunny was registered as the experimental rabbit, Number 46.', 'At Eureka Experimental Hospital, a doctor plans to switch the characteristics of a chicken into the brain and a rabbit, into each other. Bugs Bunny was registered as the experimental rabbit, Number 46.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/85YH8UoMYq5eabpwWD1TbNX4xbP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:146731'),
