  ('470460659713268248', 'Hot Pursuit', 1987, 'Comedy', 'Steven Lisberger, Frank Tidy', 'Steven W. Carabatsos', 'John Cusack, Robert Loggia, Jerry Stiller, Wendy Gazelle, Monte Markham, Shelley Fabares, Paul Bates, Keith David', 'PG-13', 'High school student Dan Bartlett misses the plane he was supposed to be on with his rich girlfriend and her family on the way to a Caribbean vacation during a school break. He flies there alone, and runs into a series of characters and misadventures as he tries to catch up.', 'High school student Dan Bartlett misses the plane he was supposed to be on with his rich girlfriend and her family on the way to a Caribbean vacation during a school break. He flies there alone, and runs into a series of characters and misadventures as he tries to catch up.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rCHL7yjawXxz9WLZ7Z5Q615OIHt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14464'),
  ('138667916114971580', 'Hot Pursuit', 2015, 'Action, Comedy', 'Anne Fletcher, Oliver Stapleton, E.J. Foerster', 'David Feeney, John Quaintance', 'Reese Witherspoon, Sofía Vergara, John Carroll Lynch, Robert Kazinsky, Richard T. Jones, Michael Mosley, Matthew Del Negro, Benny Nieves', 'PG-13', 'Straight-arrow policewoman Cooper is excited and thrilled about her next assignment. Her task is to escort Daniella Riva, a wisecracking Colombian beauty, from San Antonio to Dallas so both she and her husband can testify against a drug lord. Plans go awry when Mr. Riva gets ambushed, leaving Daniella a widow. Cooper and her witness must now use their wits to escape from crooked cops and murderous gunmen, while not killing each other in the process.', 'Straight-arrow policewoman Cooper is excited and thrilled about her next assignment. Her task is to escort Daniella Riva, a wisecracking Colombian beauty, from San Antonio to Dallas so both she and her husband can testify against a drug lord. Plans go awry when Mr. Riva gets ambushed, leaving Daniella a widow. Cooper and her witness must now use their wits to escape from crooked cops and murderous gunmen, while not killing each other in the process.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lobNOBHuJQCP9ZYAf86MBMwRrmZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:268920'),
  ('238718436090052113', 'Hot Resort', 1985, 'Comedy', 'John Robins, Frank P. Flynn', 'John Robins, Boaz Davidson, Norman Hudis', 'Tom Parsekian, Michael Berz, Bronson Pinchot, Dan Schneider, Marcy Walker, Debrah Kelly, Samm-Art Williams, Frank Gorshin', 'R', 'Several young American men go to St Kitts for a summer job at a resort hotel, hoping to earn money for college and meet women. They clash with a group of wealthy Ivy League rowers there to film a soup commercial.', 'Several young American men go to St Kitts for a summer job at a resort hotel, hoping to earn money for college and meet women. They clash with a group of wealthy Ivy League rowers there to film a soup commercial.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f3A1prVRnrbjWGfPTykxLymHvQ6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:93935'),
  ('660670104012418519', 'Hot Road', 2014, 'Drama', 'Takahiro Miki, Katsumi Ishikawa', 'Tomoko Yoshida', 'Non, Hiroomi Tosaka, Yoshino Kimura, Yukiyoshi Ozawa, Ryohei Suzuki, Haruka, Rina Ohta, Go Riju', null, 'Teenager Kazuki Miyaichi has always felt unloved by her mother due the circumstances surrounding her birth. Because she harbors anxiety and perceives herself as being worthless to others, she engages in acts of juvenile delinquency. One day, a transfer student from Yokohama named Eri introduces her to Hiroshi Haruyama, a reckless youth who’s a member of the “Nights” motorcycle gang. Kazuki finds herself increasingly drawn to Hiroshi over time, but he soon becomes leader of the Nights and gets caught up in a conflict with a rival gang.', 'Teenager Kazuki Miyaichi has always felt unloved by her mother due the circumstances surrounding her birth. Because she harbors anxiety and perceives herself as being worthless to others, she engages in acts of juvenile delinquency. One day, a transfer student from Yokohama named Eri introduces her to Hiroshi Haruyama, a reckless youth who’s a member of the “Nights” motorcycle gang. Kazuki finds herself increasingly drawn to Hiroshi over time, but he soon becomes leader of the Nights and gets caught up in a conflict with a rival gang.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lmXmKy3KTvbZZzT4T0JsSFagwXt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:300892'),
  ('592040496962040240', 'Hot Rod', 2007, 'Comedy, Action', 'Andrew Dunn, Akiva Schaffer, Nick Powell', 'Pam Brady', 'Andy Samberg, Jorma Taccone, Bill Hader, Danny McBride, Isla Fisher, Sissy Spacek, Ian McShane, Will Arnett', 'PG-13', 'For Rod Kimble, performing stunts is a way of life, even though he is rather accident-prone. Poor Rod cannot even get any respect from his stepfather, Frank, who beats him up in weekly sparring matches. When Frank falls ill, Rod devises his most outrageous stunt yet to raise money for Frank''s operation -- and then Rod will kick Frank''s butt.', 'For Rod Kimble, performing stunts is a way of life, even though he is rather accident-prone. Poor Rod cannot even get any respect from his stepfather, Frank, who beats him up in weekly sparring matches. When Frank falls ill, Rod devises his most outrageous stunt yet to raise money for Frank''s operation -- and then Rod will kick Frank''s butt.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jRkt03dXCVKnbvcQm3ygU1cjg9Y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10074'),
  ('911198315942307771', 'Hot Rod Girl', 1956, 'Action, Drama, Romance', 'Leslie H. Martinson', 'John McGreevey', 'Lori Nelson, Chuck Connors, John Smith, Mark Andrews, Roxanne Arlen, Frank Gorshin, Fred Essler, Eddie Ryder', 'NR', 'After his kid brother is killed in a street race, a champion drag-racer quits racing. However, a new kid comes to town determined to force him back into racing so he can take his title--and he''s already taken his girlfriend.When his younger brother, Steve, is killed racing a hot-rod, Jeff Northup blames himself for the accident since he had built the car for his brother and had encouraged him to race it, with other boys on a special course provided by police detective Ben Merrill, who is working to reduce the city''s hot-rod fatalities by providing supervision for the dangerous hobby. Jeff withdraws from participating in races on Merrill''s course and, without his leadership, reverts to racing on the streets. "Bronc" Talbott, a newcomer, makes a play for Jeff''s girlfriend, Lisa Vernon. Eventually, the taunting-Talbott forces Jeff into a race which results in the death of a bicycling child, and evidence seems to indicate Jeff was at fault.', 'After his kid brother is killed in a street race, a champion drag-racer quits racing. However, a new kid comes to town determined to force him back into racing so he can take his title--and he''s already taken his girlfriend.When his younger brother, Steve, is killed racing a hot-rod, Jeff Northup blames himself for the accident since he had built the car for his brother and had encouraged him to race it, with other boys on a special course provided by police detective Ben Merrill, who is working to reduce the city''s hot-rod fatalities by providing supervision for the dangerous hobby. Jeff withdraws from participating in races on Merrill''s course and, without his leadership, reverts to racing on the streets. "Bronc" Talbott, a newcomer, makes a play for Jeff''s girlfriend, Lisa Vernon. Eventually, the taunting-Talbott forces Jeff into a race which results in the death of a bicycling child, and evidence seems to indicate Jeff was at fault.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vPlPDMEwXzBItsSSnpIb5i7EnLF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54673'),
  ('828458847401119715', 'Hot Rods to Hell', 1967, 'Action, Thriller', 'John Brahm, Lloyd Ahern Sr.', 'Robert E. Kent', 'Dana Andrews, Jeanne Crain, Mimsy Farmer, Laurie Mock, Harry Hickox, Jeffrey Byron, Paul Bertoya, Gene Kirkwood', 'NR', 'While on a business trip, Tom Phillips is in a car accident caused by a reckless driver. Tom survives the accident with but a severe chronic back injury leaves him unable to continue with his career. The Phillips'' buy a motel in the California desert and Tom with his wife Peg and their two children, Tina and Jamie make the long road trip to their new home. As they approach their destination they are terrorized by reckless teenage hot-rodders looking for kicks.', 'While on a business trip, Tom Phillips is in a car accident caused by a reckless driver. Tom survives the accident with but a severe chronic back injury leaves him unable to continue with his career. The Phillips'' buy a motel in the California desert and Tom with his wife Peg and their two children, Tina and Jamie make the long road trip to their new home. As they approach their destination they are terrorized by reckless teenage hot-rodders looking for kicks.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oAOiM0noMMWKgRil6DX8YtC2Pbz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40485'),
  ('100880354509945017', 'Hot Saturday', 1932, 'Drama, Romance', 'William A. Seiter, Arthur L. Todd, Archie Hill', 'Seton I. Miller', 'Cary Grant, Nancy Carroll, Randolph Scott, Edward Woods, Lilian Bond, William Collier Sr., Jane Darwell, Stanley Smith', 'NR', 'A pretty but virtuous small-town bank clerk is the victim of a vicious rumor from an unsuccessful suitor that she spent the night with a notorious womanizer.', 'A pretty but virtuous small-town bank clerk is the victim of a vicious rumor from an unsuccessful suitor that she spent the night with a notorious womanizer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ItvxwGzzA3WZgb3MBRzO8zNRRJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52355'),
  ('724108436792697656', 'Hot Seat', 2022, 'Thriller, Action', 'James Cullen Bressack, Bryan Koss, Shayne Hartigan', 'Leon Langford, Collin Watts', 'Kevin Dillon, Mel Gibson, Shannen Doherty, Sam Asghari, Anna Harr, Michael Welch, Lydia Hull, Eddie Steeples', 'R', 'An ex-hacker is forced to break into high-level banking institutions, another man must try to penetrate the booby-trapped building to get the young man off the hot seat.', 'An ex-hacker is forced to break into high-level banking institutions, another man must try to penetrate the booby-trapped building to get the young man off the hot seat.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6zoA2yEfKs8hNFlk4AV28VpoT3I.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:888195'),
  ('969703929478334546', 'Hot Shots!', 1991, 'Action, Comedy, War', 'Jim Abrahams, Bill Butler, Tom Davies', 'Pat Proft, Jim Abrahams', 'Charlie Sheen, Cary Elwes, Valeria Golino, Lloyd Bridges, Kevin Dunn, Jon Cryer, William O''Leary, Kristy Swanson', 'PG-13', 'The gang that created Airplane! and The Naked Gun sets its sights on Top Gun in this spoof. Topper Harley is a talented but unstable fighter pilot with an axe to grind: clearing the family name. His mission is to avenge his father and save a mission sabotaged by greedy weapons manufacturers. He also gets involved in a relationship with Ramada Thompson, a woman with an unusually talented stomach. Hot Shots! makes fun of a variety of other films, from Dances with Wolves to The Fabulous Baker Boys.', 'The gang that created Airplane! and The Naked Gun sets its sights on Top Gun in this spoof. Topper Harley is a talented but unstable fighter pilot with an axe to grind: clearing the family name. His mission is to avenge his father and save a mission sabotaged by greedy weapons manufacturers. He also gets involved in a relationship with Ramada Thompson, a woman with an unusually talented stomach. Hot Shots! makes fun of a variety of other films, from Dances with Wolves to The Fabulous Baker Boys.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/koLIB5263emHxewmwgBBK26vjeS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9595'),
  ('614229258404197841', 'Hot Shots! Part Deux', 1993, 'Action, Comedy, War', 'Jim Abrahams, John R. Leonetti, Ernie F. Orsatti', 'Pat Proft, Jim Abrahams', 'Charlie Sheen, Lloyd Bridges, Valeria Golino, Richard Crenna, Rowan Atkinson, Miguel Ferrer, Brenda Bakke, Jerry Haleva', 'PG-13', 'Topper Harley is found to be working as an odd-job-man in a monastery. The CIA want him to lead a rescue mission into Iraq, to rescue the last rescue team, who went in to rescue the last rescue team—who went in to rescue hostages left behind after Desert Storm.', 'Topper Harley is found to be working as an odd-job-man in a monastery. The CIA want him to lead a rescue mission into Iraq, to rescue the last rescue team, who went in to rescue the last rescue team—who went in to rescue hostages left behind after Desert Storm.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zh9EGK970GHo10ETclWBOjZVUOK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9255'),
  ('487080438901922675', 'Hot Spirits', 1981, 'Horror, Comedy, Fantasy, Mystery', 'Giorgio Capitani, Silvano Ippoliti', 'Franco Marotta, Laura Toscano', 'Johnny Dorelli, Gloria Guida, Alessandro Haber, Lia Tanzi, Adriana Russo, Lory Del Santo, Francesca Romana Coluzzi, Geoffrey Copleston', null, 'Giovanni is a rich Italian aristocrat. He inherit a castle occupied by the ghost of an ancestor. Part of the inheritance is of a young beautiful blonde tourist, far relative of Giovanni. The two have to pay a ticket to the ghost to be free to own the castle. Guess what?', 'Giovanni is a rich Italian aristocrat. He inherit a castle occupied by the ghost of an ancestor. Part of the inheritance is of a young beautiful blonde tourist, far relative of Giovanni. The two have to pay a ticket to the ghost to be free to own the castle. Guess what?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yhIpTD3tvH1oT9g6yygFsShpxSq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:290619'),
  ('841155541167615609', 'Hot Spur', 1968, 'Western, Action, Drama', 'Lee Frost, Lee Frost', 'Lee Frost', 'James Arena, Virginia Gordon, Joseph Mascolo, Wes Bishop, John Alderman, Laura McLaughlin, Monique Heguy, Ellen Gaines', null, 'A deranged stablehand kidnaps the wife of a ranch owner to avenge the rape of his sister.', 'A deranged stablehand kidnaps the wife of a ranch owner to avenge the rape of his sister.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xHvmEh1oY39tzRlKp3iDiCF9bm3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:374427'),
  ('820647732637751340', 'Hot Stuff', 1979, 'Comedy', 'Dom DeLuise', 'Donald E. Westlake, Michael Kane', 'Dom DeLuise, Suzanne Pleshette, Jerry Reed, Ossie Davis, Luis Ávalos, Pat McCormick, Peter DeLuise, Rod Ball', 'PG', 'When a police department''s burglary task force is facing the possibility of being shut down because of their low conviction rate decides to try a new approach to apprehending their targets. They take over a pawn shop where thieves go to unload their merchandise. They record them as they bring stuff in and get them to tell them where they got it. Eventually they''re threatened by the mob.', 'When a police department''s burglary task force is facing the possibility of being shut down because of their low conviction rate decides to try a new approach to apprehending their targets. They take over a pawn shop where thieves go to unload their merchandise. They record them as they bring stuff in and get them to tell them where they got it. Eventually they''re threatened by the mob.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eeS2Fz3W9mHBRgORm4GqZQ4r4fR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:99977'),
  ('969917371683077647', 'Hot Summer', 1968, 'Comedy, Music', 'Roland Dressel, Joachim Hasler, Joachim Hasler', 'Joachim Hasler, Maurycy Janowski', 'Chris Doerk, Frank Schöbel, Regine Albrecht, Hanns-Michael Schmidt, Georg-Peter Welzel, Hans Mietzner, Norbert Speer, Gerd Nordheim', null, 'In this East German teen musical, a group of girls are planning to take their summer vacation together on the Baltic coast. When a loud and obnoxious group of boys intrudes on their holiday, the girls are horrified to learn that the boys have the same vacations plans as them. The two groups quarrel with each other and compete over a number of things, but gradually an attraction starts to form.', 'In this East German teen musical, a group of girls are planning to take their summer vacation together on the Baltic coast. When a loud and obnoxious group of boys intrudes on their holiday, the girls are horrified to learn that the boys have the same vacations plans as them. The two groups quarrel with each other and compete over a number of things, but gradually an attraction starts to form.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6yNh51Ayu6v4VfXDPNzRJCSXMaQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:933'),
  ('40704367651172603', 'Hot Summer Days', 2010, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Tony Chan, Shya Wing-Hong, Sion Michel', 'Lucretia Ho', 'Jacky Cheung Hok-Yau, René Liu, Nicholas Tse Ting-Fung, Vivian Hsu, Barbie Hsu, Daniel Wu, Jing Boran, AngelaBaby', null, 'In "Hot Summer Days" a hot summer heat wave engulfs the Chinese territory, while the movie covers the lives of various characters during that time. There''s chaffeur Wah who tries to woo foot masseur Li Yan via text messages, air conditioner repairman Ah Wai interested in biker girl Ding Dong, a master sushi chef who spurns the love of writer Wasabi, country hick Da Fu who tries to impress teddy bear factory worker Xiao Qi Angela Baby by standing out in the hot noon sun for 100 days, &amp; photographer Leslie Guan &amp; assistant attempting to track down a woman who they believed cursed the photographer into blindness ...', 'In "Hot Summer Days" a hot summer heat wave engulfs the Chinese territory, while the movie covers the lives of various characters during that time. There''s chaffeur Wah who tries to woo foot masseur Li Yan via text messages, air conditioner repairman Ah Wai interested in biker girl Ding Dong, a master sushi chef who spurns the love of writer Wasabi, country hick Da Fu who tries to impress teddy bear factory worker Xiao Qi Angela Baby by standing out in the hot noon sun for 100 days, &amp; photographer Leslie Guan &amp; assistant attempting to track down a woman who they believed cursed the photographer into blindness ...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dfGm5Q2MrCnGi3cpsfykPD7kQPA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37304'),
  ('86528545780586334', 'Hot Summer Nights', 2018, 'Drama, Crime', 'Stephen W. Moore, Rip Murray, Elijah Bynum', 'Elijah Bynum', 'Timothée Chalamet, Maika Monroe, Alex Roe, Maia Mitchell, Thomas Jane, Emory Cohen, William Fichtner, Jack Kesy', 'NR', 'In 1991, a sheltered teenager comes of age during a wild summer on Cape Cod, getting rich from selling pot to gangsters, falling in love for the first time, partying, and eventually realizing that he''s in way over his head.', 'In 1991, a sheltered teenager comes of age during a wild summer on Cape Cod, getting rich from selling pot to gangsters, falling in love for the first time, partying, and eventually realizing that he''s in way over his head.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kPfNAax3PbHj5pAYiO9mc9jDvzt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:347866'),
  ('353663637522944186', 'Hot Sweet Sour', 2017, 'Drama, Romance, Comedy', 'Andaç Haznedaroğlu, Ahmet Sesigürgil', 'Buğra Gülsoy', 'Buğra Gülsoy, Özge Özpirinçci, Yusuf Akgün, Gözde Türkpençe, Osman Alkaş, Füsun Demirel, Rahmi Dilligil, Somer Karvan', null, 'Murat and Duygu are deeply in love and when they graduate from College Murat takes the leap and asks Duygu for her hand in marriage but he doesn''t get the answer he was looking for. They both agree that if they''re both single in five years they will tie the knot, but life has other plans for them.', 'Murat and Duygu are deeply in love and when they graduate from College Murat takes the leap and asks Duygu for her hand in marriage but he doesn''t get the answer he was looking for. They both agree that if they''re both single in five years they will tie the knot, but life has other plans for them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/81kt2NES2LBx485Ftj63zEX6Aml.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:474720'),
  ('1050222839491988257', 'Hot Tamale', 2006, 'Action, Comedy, Crime, Thriller', 'Frederick Iannone, Michael Damian, Jim Simone', 'Janeen Damian, Michael Damian', 'Diora Baird, Carmen Electra, Jason Priestley, Mike Starr, Randy Spelling, James Best, Beth Grant, Richard Riehle', null, 'A road trip to Los Angeles inadvertently leads a young man from Wyoming into a wild maze of psychotic hit-men, racy women, jewel thieves and a salsa band.', 'A road trip to Los Angeles inadvertently leads a young man from Wyoming into a wild maze of psychotic hit-men, racy women, jewel thieves and a salsa band.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/waEUrsiaRf6RCbDqHJVMRZaAKe0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10026'),
  ('361469317602229414', 'Hot Times at Montclair High', 1989, 'Comedy', 'Jose Altonaga, F. Smith Martin, Peter Bohush', 'Jose Altonaga', 'Ross Hamilton, Kim Valentine, Johnathon Gorman, Troy Donahue, Kim Anderson, Brent Jasmer, Leslie Owen, Jonelle Goddard', 'R', 'It''s a new year at Montclair High and it''s about to become the most tumultuous time for this year''s senior crop. At Montclair High School, three different students bond with one another through a variety of comic, dramatic and episodic circumstances. Star jock Sean (Ross Hamilton) has it all, including the girl (Kim Valentine) and the scholarship. But when he fails an important exam and his girlfriend''s life is endangered by a sleazy musician, Sean enlists a class clown (Brent Jasmer) and a sex-starved computer geek (Jonathan Gorman) for the ultimate revenge.', 'It''s a new year at Montclair High and it''s about to become the most tumultuous time for this year''s senior crop. At Montclair High School, three different students bond with one another through a variety of comic, dramatic and episodic circumstances. Star jock Sean (Ross Hamilton) has it all, including the girl (Kim Valentine) and the scholarship. But when he fails an important exam and his girlfriend''s life is endangered by a sleazy musician, Sean enlists a class clown (Brent Jasmer) and a sex-starved computer geek (Jonathan Gorman) for the ultimate revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oDUw37GAkPU2dn7W5Na98tC6OOA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:192452'),
  ('720907659037408948', 'Hot to Trot', 1988, 'Comedy', 'Michael Dinner, Victor J. Kemper', 'Stephen Neigher, Hugo Gilbert, Charlie Peters', 'Bobcat Goldthwait, John Candy, Dabney Coleman, Virginia Madsen, Cindy Pickett, Jim Metzler, Gilbert Gottfried, James Hong', 'PG', 'Fred P. Chaney receives as inheritance after the death of his mother a speaking horse that also has good knowledge about the stock-market. With the help of this horse Fred gains a lot at the stock-market of Chicago.', 'Fred P. Chaney receives as inheritance after the death of his mother a speaking horse that also has good knowledge about the stock-market. With the help of this horse Fred gains a lot at the stock-market of Chicago.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6rkBnog30LqNXxw0QxJp9VBT7Wt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30690'),
  ('625363870177754499', 'Hot Tub Time Machine', 2010, 'Science Fiction, Comedy, Adventure', 'Steve Pink, Jack N. Green, John Alvarez', 'Josh Heald, Sean Anders, John Morris', 'John Cusack, Craig Robinson, Rob Corddry, Clark Duke, Sebastian Stan, Chevy Chase, Crispin Glover, Lyndsy Fonseca', 'R', 'Four pals are stuck in a rut in adulthood: Adam has just been dumped, Lou is a hopeless party animal, Nick is a henpecked husband, and Jacob does nothing but play video games in his basement. But they get a chance to brighten their future by changing their past after a night of heavy drinking in a ski-resort hot tub results in their waking up in 1986.', 'Four pals are stuck in a rut in adulthood: Adam has just been dumped, Lou is a hopeless party animal, Nick is a henpecked husband, and Jacob does nothing but play video games in his basement. But they get a chance to brighten their future by changing their past after a night of heavy drinking in a ski-resort hot tub results in their waking up in 1986.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wjzbVXAes1acbh6k4OO5xVfy5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:23048'),
  ('962039433714752126', 'Hot Tub Time Machine 2', 2015, 'Comedy', 'Steve Pink, Declan Quinn, Kelly Cantley-Kashima', 'Josh Heald', 'Rob Corddry, Craig Robinson, Clark Duke, Bianca Haase, Chevy Chase, Gillian Jacobs, Collette Wolfe, Adam Scott', 'R', 'After their first adventure with the Hot Tub Time Machine, Lou and Nick are living very well off their ill-gotten gains, while Jacob still cannot rely on Lou to be a positive role model. When an unknown assailant breaks into Lou''s mansion and shoots him, Nick and Jacob take him for another trip in the hot tub. They emerge in the year 2025, where they must figure out who shot Lou and prevent it from happening again.', 'After their first adventure with the Hot Tub Time Machine, Lou and Nick are living very well off their ill-gotten gains, while Jacob still cannot rely on Lou to be a positive role model. When an unknown assailant breaks into Lou''s mansion and shoots him, Nick and Jacob take him for another trip in the hot tub. They emerge in the year 2025, where they must figure out who shot Lou and prevent it from happening again.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lBroHetSm8RMI8zp7ThpFJsw9E1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:243938'),
  ('390529725420497372', 'Hot Water', 1924, 'Comedy', 'Sam Taylor, Fred C. Newmeyer, Robert A. Golden', null, 'Harold Lloyd, Jobyna Ralston, Josephine Crowell, Charles Stevenson, Mickey McBan', 'NR', 'Lloyd''s look at married life and the issues of the in-law. Adventures include a ride on a crowded trolley with a live turkey; A wild spin in a new auto with the in-laws in tow. Finally, a sequence in which Hubby accidentally chloroforms his mother-in-law and becomes convinced that he''s killed her!', 'Lloyd''s look at married life and the issues of the in-law. Adventures include a ride on a crowded trolley with a live turkey; A wild spin in a new auto with the in-laws in tow. Finally, a sequence in which Hubby accidentally chloroforms his mother-in-law and becomes convinced that he''s killed her!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pgnb43bbR1s5H72yN45bwN0YQUn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42367'),
  ('1058464018079301285', 'Hot Wheels AcceleRacers: Breaking Point', 2005, 'Animation, Family', 'Andrew Duncan', 'Mark Edward Edens', 'Andrew Francis, Kathleen Barr, Lisa Ann Beley, Dexter Bell, Michael Donovan, Brian Drummond, Andrew Duncan, John Payne', null, 'The two teams become even more strained when the Metal Maniacs get a new leader. Meanwhile, the Acceleracers and the Racing Drones face challenges while competing in the Racing Realms with a new, mysterious opponent.', 'The two teams become even more strained when the Metal Maniacs get a new leader. Meanwhile, the Acceleracers and the Racing Drones face challenges while competing in the Racing Realms with a new, mysterious opponent.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qlBHpAYSRH0D2mFViqbqLLNmYFE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39810'),
  ('610658279404164581', 'Hot Wheels AcceleRacers: Ignition', 2005, 'Science Fiction, Family, Animation, Action', 'Gino Nichele, Andrew Duncan', 'Mark Edward Edens', 'Adrian Holmes, Kevan Ohtsji, David Kaye, Will Sanderson, Dexter Bell, Andrew Francis, Brian Drummond, Kirby Morrow', 'G', 'Two rival race teams, the Teku and the Metal Maniacs, are recruited by Dr. Peter Tezla to race in the fantastic Racing Realms and retrieve the all-powerful AcceleChargers before they fall into the hands of the deadly Racing Drones. Our drivers race through the Storm and Swamp Realms.', 'Two rival race teams, the Teku and the Metal Maniacs, are recruited by Dr. Peter Tezla to race in the fantastic Racing Realms and retrieve the all-powerful AcceleChargers before they fall into the hands of the deadly Racing Drones. Our drivers race through the Storm and Swamp Realms.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i0k5Biew92QcBgrAW3ho8nXzsbI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:72720'),
  ('994283392527939552', 'Hot Wheels AcceleRacers: The Speed of Silence', 2005, 'Animation, Family', 'Andrew Duncan', 'Mark Edward Edens', 'Andrew Francis, Brian Drummond, Lisa Ann Beley, Adrian Holmes, Kevan Ohtsji, Venus Terzo, Dexter Bell, David Kaye', null, 'As Dr. Tezla works at unlocking the mystery of the Accelechargers, the Racing Drones unleash their most powerful weapon against the Acceleracers: the car-eating Drone Sweeper.', 'As Dr. Tezla works at unlocking the mystery of the Accelechargers, the Racing Drones unleash their most powerful weapon against the Acceleracers: the car-eating Drone Sweeper.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r38yDi0EnLENS7F5e8E6l3oYYty.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39811'),
  ('182870030081994662', 'Hot Wheels AcceleRacers: The Ultimate Race', 2005, 'Animation, Family', 'Andrew Duncan', 'Mark Edward Edens', 'Andrew Francis, Kathleen Barr, Lisa Ann Beley, Dexter Bell, Michael Donovan, Brian Drummond, Andrew Duncan, John Payne', null, 'The Teku and the Metal Maniacs put aside their usual competitive instincts and work together in order to save a fellow driver and the AcceleChargers, which are in danger of falling into the hands of the evil Racing Drones.', 'The Teku and the Metal Maniacs put aside their usual competitive instincts and work together in order to save a fellow driver and the AcceleChargers, which are in danger of falling into the hands of the evil Racing Drones.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sFT3KwgRJODCgcZQl9oFQnk9COU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:66587'),
  ('54117299225872309', 'Hot Wheels: World Race', 2003, 'Family, Animation, Action, Science Fiction', 'William Lau, Michael Donovan, Andrew Duncan', 'Jeff Gomez, Fabian Nicieza, Mark Edward Edens', 'Andrew Francis, Brian Drummond, Michael Benyaer, Kevan Ohtsji, Cusse Mankuma, Venus Terzo, Kasper Michaels, Michael Donovan', null, 'Recruited by the mysterious Dr. Tezla, the greatest race car drivers in the world roar onto the track - and into a mind-bending array of alternate dimensions - on a winner-take-all quest for thrills, danger and speed!', 'Recruited by the mysterious Dr. Tezla, the greatest race car drivers in the world roar onto the track - and into a mind-bending array of alternate dimensions - on a winner-take-all quest for thrills, danger and speed!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6YOhvfMt6irjUZ6hm4Hn92DOA4w.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47159'),
  ('541052809307292670', 'Hot Young Bloods', 2014, 'Romance, Drama, Comedy', 'Lee Yeon-woo, Kim Dong-cheon, Park Se-moon', 'Lee Yeon-woo', 'Park Bo-young, Lee Jong-suk, Lee Se-young, Kim Young-kwang, Kwon Hae-hyo, Kim Hie-won, Ra Mi-ran, Shin Hyun-tak', null, 'A comedy romance movie about the last generation of youths and their passionate romance based in Hongseong, Chungcheong Namdo in the 1980s.', 'A comedy romance movie about the last generation of youths and their passionate romance based in Hongseong, Chungcheong Namdo in the 1980s.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cgs8jEDecLuRVCM49qDbeBvGblC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:252067'),
  ('894024866950605917', 'Hot-Rod and Reel!', 1959, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Chuck Jones', null, null, null, 'Wile E. Coyote''s failed efforts to catch the Road Runner involve the use of roller skates, a gun in a camera, a trampoline, a dynamite stick on a crossbow, a bogus railroad crossing, and a jet-powered unicycle.', 'Wile E. Coyote''s failed efforts to catch the Road Runner involve the use of roller skates, a gun in a camera, a trampoline, a dynamite stick on a crossbow, a bogus railroad crossing, and a jet-powered unicycle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jqnb4r93hcdGN9uMYj3VqsNU9WW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:234817'),
  ('296159269728690378', 'Hotel', 1967, 'Drama', 'Mickey McCardle, Richard Quine, Charles Lang', null, 'Rod Taylor, Catherine Spaak, Karl Malden, Melvyn Douglas, Merle Oberon, Richard Conte, Michael Rennie, Kevin McCarthy', 'PG', 'This is the story of the clocklike movements of a giant, big city New Orleans hotel. The ambitious yet loyal manager wrestles with the round-the-clock drama of its guests. A brazen sneak thief, who nightly relieves the guests of their property, is chased through the underground passages of the hotel. The big business power play for control of the hotel and the VIP diplomat guest with a secret add to the excitement.', 'This is the story of the clocklike movements of a giant, big city New Orleans hotel. The ambitious yet loyal manager wrestles with the round-the-clock drama of its guests. A brazen sneak thief, who nightly relieves the guests of their property, is chased through the underground passages of the hotel. The big business power play for control of the hotel and the VIP diplomat guest with a secret add to the excitement.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fq83GS78zcvuQQ7KXsiPYFUKrDZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:77553'),
  ('916876467996517571', 'Hotel', 2001, 'Comedy', 'Mike Figgis, Patrick Alexander Stewart', null, 'Max Beesley, Fabrizio Bentivoglio, Brian Bovell, Saffron Burrows, Elisabetta Cavallotti, Valentina Cervi, George DiCenzo, Andrea Di Stefano', null, 'A sex worker, a hired killer, and a movie crew cross paths in a Venice hotel where human meat is on the menu.', 'A sex worker, a hired killer, and a movie crew cross paths in a Venice hotel where human meat is on the menu.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/D6ExKDN7RvMQHuVIP18woG70ZN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47232'),
  ('589248752143762621', 'Hotel', 2004, 'Horror, Drama, Mystery', 'Jessica Hausner, Martin Gschlacht', 'Jessica Hausner', 'Franziska Weisz, Birgit Minichmayr, Marlene Streeruwitz, Rosa Waissnix, Christopher Schärf, Regina Fritsch, Peter Strauss, Alfred Worel', null, 'When Irene takes a position at a hotel deep in the woods of the Austrian Alps, she soon discovers the girl she replaced vanished without a trace.', 'When Irene takes a position at a hotel deep in the woods of the Austrian Alps, she soon discovers the girl she replaced vanished without a trace.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5ppNGbpqXt6QPMHWSPE8AhKeN2k.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52251'),
  ('1048520817633030797', 'Hotel America', 1981, 'Romance, Drama', 'André Téchiné, Bruno Nuytten, Pascal Marti', 'André Téchiné, Gilles Taurand', 'Catherine Deneuve, Patrick Dewaere, Etienne Chicot, Sabine Haudepin, Dominique Lavanant, Josiane Balasko, François Perrot, Jean-Louis Vitrac', null, 'Helene, a pill-addicted anesthesiologist, is mourning the death of her boyfriend when, through a car accident she causes, she chances to meet the lethargic Gilles, a young man who lives for free at his mother''s hotel. Gilles pursues Helene romantically, and she eventually softens up. Gilles, however, is also devoted to Bernard, a petty crook who revels in mugging gay men. All three struggle with relationships that seem to be going nowhere.', 'Helene, a pill-addicted anesthesiologist, is mourning the death of her boyfriend when, through a car accident she causes, she chances to meet the lethargic Gilles, a young man who lives for free at his mother''s hotel. Gilles pursues Helene romantically, and she eventually softens up. Gilles, however, is also devoted to Bernard, a petty crook who revels in mugging gay men. All three struggle with relationships that seem to be going nowhere.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uJMKIDfHolHXSEy3Deoa8nk5C7z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:76821'),
  ('846642282182683224', 'Hotel Artemis', 2018, 'Science Fiction, Action, Crime, Thriller', 'Drew Pearce, Chung Chung-hoon, Gary McMonnies', 'Drew Pearce', 'Jodie Foster, Sterling K. Brown, Sofia Boutella, Jeff Goldblum, Brian Tyree Henry, Jenny Slate, Zachary Quinto, Charlie Day', 'R', 'Los Angeles, June 21st, 2028. While the streets are being torn apart by riots, the Nurse, who runs a clandestine hospital for criminals in the penthouse of the Artemis, a closed old hotel, has a rough night dealing with troublemaker clients: thieves, assassins, someone from the past and the one who owns the place and the whole city.', 'Los Angeles, June 21st, 2028. While the streets are being torn apart by riots, the Nurse, who runs a clandestine hospital for criminals in the penthouse of the Artemis, a closed old hotel, has a rough night dealing with troublemaker clients: thieves, assassins, someone from the past and the one who owns the place and the whole city.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vaZMpZOhhkKOYz0MHCx4vDABwgP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:406761'),
  ('276797068114713966', 'Hotel Atlântico', 2009, 'Drama', 'Suzana Amaral, José Roberto Eliezer', 'Suzana Amaral', 'Júlio Andrade, João Miguel, Mariana Ximenes, Gero Camilo, Luis Guilherme, Helena Ignez, Walter Breda, Lorena Lobato', null, 'A road movie that follows a solitary man as he sets of on a journey to the south of Brazil. The strange characters and absurd situations he encounters along the way present an extraordinary portrait of human relations.', 'A road movie that follows a solitary man as he sets of on a journey to the south of Brazil. The strange characters and absurd situations he encounters along the way present an extraordinary portrait of human relations.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oEdxPlDikgfiRJ8zUlOs3icPpA3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:250140'),
  ('1099749967242779987', 'Hotel Belgrade', 2020, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Konstantin Statskiy, Fedor Struchev, Ulugbek Khamraev', 'Anatoly Molchanov, Vyacheslav Zub, Vasily Kutsenko', 'Miloš Biković, Diana Pozharskaya, Ljubomir Bandović, Srđan ''Žika'' Todorović, Jelisaveta Sablić, Miodrag Radonjić, Boris Dergachev, Matea Milosavljević', null, 'Pasha, a Serbian womanizer and entertainer, owns a luxurious hotel in Belgrade. He lives carelessly until one day he accidentally breaks a mafia kingpin’s new collectable that is worth a few million. To cover the debt the mafia kingpin makes Pasha marry his daughter. While the girl is preparing to marry the charming hotelier, Pasha by chance meets his Russian love Dasha, who he has not seen for four years. Their love is about to flare up in the romantic atmosphere of the ancient city… if not for the future father-in-law, a real husband, a blind grandad, and a friend with no money.', 'Pasha, a Serbian womanizer and entertainer, owns a luxurious hotel in Belgrade. He lives carelessly until one day he accidentally breaks a mafia kingpin’s new collectable that is worth a few million. To cover the debt the mafia kingpin makes Pasha marry his daughter. While the girl is preparing to marry the charming hotelier, Pasha by chance meets his Russian love Dasha, who he has not seen for four years. Their love is about to flare up in the romantic atmosphere of the ancient city… if not for the future father-in-law, a real husband, a blind grandad, and a friend with no money.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A3bNX4gmaWTRMmRUDekWjm55iik.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:592717'),
  ('497999670606025628', 'Hotel Berlin', 1945, 'War, Drama', 'Peter Godfrey, Leo F. Forbstein, Carl E. Guthrie', 'Jo Pagano, Alvah Bessie', 'Faye Emerson, Helmut Dantine, Raymond Massey, Andrea King, Peter Lorre, Alan Hale, George Coulouris, Henry Daniell', 'NR', 'An assortment of diverse characters gather at the Hotel Berlin in World War II Germany as the Third Reich falls.', 'An assortment of diverse characters gather at the Hotel Berlin in World War II Germany as the Third Reich falls.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iRg3U3zRa6Ls1dn0WywSWujfQz9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:165300'),
  ('558795752498796265', 'Hotel Bitcoin', 2024, 'Comedy', 'Manuel Sanabria, Carlos Villaverde', 'Manuel Sanabria, Ángela Obón, Carlos Villaverde', 'Alejo Sauras, Marta Hazas, Pablo Chiapella, Canco Rodríguez, Vanesa Romero, Mauricio Ochmann, Leonor Lavado, Jorge Bosch', null, 'A group of friends have to survive a weekend in a hotel with a huge amount of virtual money to guard, putting their ingenuity to the test.', 'A group of friends have to survive a weekend in a hotel with a huge amount of virtual money to guard, putting their ingenuity to the test.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yGZfoYDHOIJbK9IQtXTlnshtuP6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1233083'),
  ('276448521409650867', 'Hotel by the River', 2019, 'Drama', 'Hong Sang-soo, Kim Hyung-koo, Shin Seok-ho', 'Hong Sang-soo', 'Ki Joo-bong, Kim Min-hee, Song Sun-mi, Kwon Hae-hyo, Yu Jun-sang, Shin Seok-ho, Park Ran', null, 'An aging poet summons his estranged sons to the hotel he is staying at because he feels his death is near; meanwhile, he encounters two women staying at the hotel.', 'An aging poet summons his estranged sons to the hotel he is staying at because he feels his death is near; meanwhile, he encounters two women staying at the hotel.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bmtaMIrNXtfst3YChMlMRKy07un.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:535550'),
  ('484211272596617198', 'Hotel Chevalier', 2007, 'Drama, Romance', 'Wes Anderson, Robert D. Yeoman, Emilie Cherpitel', 'Wes Anderson', 'Jason Schwartzman, Natalie Portman, Waris Ahluwalia, Michel Castejon', 'R', 'In a Paris hotel room, Jack Whitman lies on a bed. His phone rings; it''s a woman on her way to see him, a surprise. She arrives and the complications of their relationship emerge in bits and pieces. Will they make love? Is their relationship over? (A prequel to The Darjeeling Limited, 2007.)', 'In a Paris hotel room, Jack Whitman lies on a bed. His phone rings; it''s a woman on her way to see him, a surprise. She arrives and the complications of their relationship emerge in bits and pieces. Will they make love? Is their relationship over? (A prequel to The Darjeeling Limited, 2007.)', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fiWLuGIUAcJtu2hs7KlcZ0O2Ix3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:6418'),
  ('70477125479281601', 'Hotel Colonial', 1987, 'Adventure, Thriller', 'Cinzia TH Torrini, Giuseppe Rotunno', 'Enzo Monteleone', 'Massimo Troisi, Robert Duvall, John Savage, Rachel Ward, Anna Galiena, Claudio Báez, Zaide Silvia Gutiérrez, Tariq Hager', 'R', 'Marco Veniera goes to Bogotá, Colombia to find his brother, Luca who supposedly committed suicide. In his search, he meets fiery and exotic Irene Costa, who leads him into the depths of the Amazon jungle. But it''s every man for himself. And brotherly love turns to hate.', 'Marco Veniera goes to Bogotá, Colombia to find his brother, Luca who supposedly committed suicide. In his search, he meets fiery and exotic Irene Costa, who leads him into the depths of the Amazon jungle. But it''s every man for himself. And brotherly love turns to hate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9mX4WFt5ukYkjYipaWUAuQyDzG2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63056'),
  ('500838489548639841', 'Hotel Coppelia', 2021, 'Drama', 'José María Cabral, Hernan Herrera', 'José María Cabral', 'Lumy Lizardo, Nashla Bogaert, Ruth Emeterio, Cyndie Lundy, Jazz Vilá, Nick Searcy, Madison Diaz, Camila Santana', null, '1965, Dominican Republic. At a seaside brothel, the lives of a group of prostitutes take a dramatic turn when freedom fighters stage a revolutionary coup, making them realise they can have a better life and perhaps find love. But everything changes when the US army supresses the revolution and takes the brothel as a military base: the girls will have to face the dilemma of either sleeping with the enemy or protecting their dignity at all costs.', '1965, Dominican Republic. At a seaside brothel, the lives of a group of prostitutes take a dramatic turn when freedom fighters stage a revolutionary coup, making them realise they can have a better life and perhaps find love. But everything changes when the US army supresses the revolution and takes the brothel as a military base: the girls will have to face the dilemma of either sleeping with the enemy or protecting their dignity at all costs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f0Cgaivi2vsZxDoqfAlI76xgpdt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:676150'),
  ('199806479566809751', 'Hotel Deluxe', 2013, 'Comedy', 'Vincent Kok Tak-Chiu', 'Vincent Kok Tak-Chiu', 'Ronald Cheng Chung-Kei, Sandra Ng Kwan-Yu, Teresa Mo Shun-Kwan, Chapman To Man-Chat, Fiona Sit Hoi-Kei, Eric Kot Man-Fai, Jim Chim Sui-Man, Raymond Wong Pak-Ming', null, 'Hotel Deluxe is basically "All''s Well Ends Well 2013", with almost the same cast and crew, and some new faces added in. It tells the story of a team of hotel management trying their best to score a 5-star rating for their hotel, with some supporting characters and stories added in along the way.', 'Hotel Deluxe is basically "All''s Well Ends Well 2013", with almost the same cast and crew, and some new faces added in. It tells the story of a team of hotel management trying their best to score a 5-star rating for their hotel, with some supporting characters and stories added in along the way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gSMFlegVSW7rHrf6sEUIXFpTZc8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:168094'),
  ('1044538241514019556', 'Hôtel des Invalides', 1952, 'Documentary', 'Georges Franju, Marcel Fradetal', 'Georges Franju', 'Michel Simon', null, 'A short documentary tour of Paris’s Hôtel des Invalides that uses ironic narration and museum imagery to question the logic and legacy of war.', 'A short documentary tour of Paris’s Hôtel des Invalides that uses ironic narration and museum imagery to question the logic and legacy of war.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rAVIpNiRmY4B8HWrOBK7wWnehF4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:150838'),
  ('924029159568967460', 'Hotel Desire', 2011, 'Drama, Romance', 'Sergej Moya, Martin Kulhawy, Armin Franzen', 'Sergej Moya', 'Saralisa Volm, Clemens Schick, Jan-Gregor Kremp, Herbert Knaup, Palina Rojinski, Frederick Lau, Trystan Pütter, Carlo Ljubek', null, 'Antonia is a single mother who works as a hotel maid in Berlin. A normal hot summer day takes a dramatic turn when she crosses paths with a particular guest of the hotel, famous blind portrait painter Julius Pass.', 'Antonia is a single mother who works as a hotel maid in Berlin. A normal hot summer day takes a dramatic turn when she crosses paths with a particular guest of the hotel, famous blind portrait painter Julius Pass.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/myzQj8Rk178DrWsiZjVKjz7Kj9P.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:82023'),
  ('225908082398612603', 'Hôtel du Nord', 1938, 'Romance, Drama', 'Marcel Carné, Armand Thirard, Louis Née', 'Henri Jeanson, Jean Aurenche', 'Annabella, Jean-Pierre Aumont, Louis Jouvet, Arletty, Paulette Dubost, Andrex, André Brunot, Henri Bosc', null, 'A young couple''s suicide pact goes awry, leaving the woman to face her survival with a new admirer while pining for her lost love.', 'A young couple''s suicide pact goes awry, leaving the woman to face her survival with a new admirer while pining for her lost love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9gJXoE2kkyFUflet4VzjQbMMwV8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48369'),
  ('1016374149855395300', 'Hotel E', 1992, 'Animation', 'Ene Mänd, Merle Rajandu, Priit Pärn', 'Priit Pärn', 'Gita Kalmet, Arne Sirel, Timo Viljakainen, Egon Nuter, Kaie Mihkelson, Osmo Miettinen, Ulna Nomm, Maria Avdjuško', null, 'A confrontation of two worlds-- Two rooms, one of which is full of light and colors, the other a monotonous gray.', 'A confrontation of two worlds-- Two rooms, one of which is full of light and colors, the other a monotonous gray.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ticlh1aSGlvAGtYt6ML4GO1dkJp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85424'),
  ('806262555168708841', 'Hotel Exotica', 1999, 'Drama, Romance', 'Marcy Ronen, Gary Graver, Rochelle Fox', 'Dawn Pascual', 'Landon Hall, Ahmo Hight, Chris Johnston, Taylor St. Claire, Nikki Fritz, Steve Curtis, Everett Rodd, Leslie Olivan', 'R', 'A woman, her husband, her sister and the husband''s business partner visit a resort, where stale relationships are rekindled with the help of the hostess and her girls.', 'A woman, her husband, her sister and the husband''s business partner visit a resort, where stale relationships are rekindled with the help of the hostess and her girls.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xMMQaVipzRVGh31JzQsOt8Ujncs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:204890'),
  ('588609693578122369', 'Hotel Fear', 1978, 'Horror, Mystery, Drama', 'Francesco Barilli, Ignazio Agosta', 'Francisco Ariza, José Gutiérrez Maesso', 'Leonora Fani, Luc Merenda, Francisco Rabal, Jole Fierro, José María Prada, Lidia Biondi, Francesco Impeciati, Carlo Totti', null, 'A young girl and her mother run a hotel during the war. When the mother dies, the girl finds herself at the mercy of her sex-crazed guests. Soon enough, a cloaked figure starts killing off everyone that tries to harm her.', 'A young girl and her mother run a hotel during the war. When the mother dies, the girl finds herself at the mercy of her sex-crazed guests. Soon enough, a cloaked figure starts killing off everyone that tries to harm her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pzVW6vYVDJEwwlE1Yqz5viAzXYS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:105913'),
  ('572658484824178217', 'Hotel for Dogs', 2009, 'Comedy, Family', 'Thor Freudenthal, Greg Michael, Michael Grady', 'Mark McCorkle, Jeff Lowell, Bob Schooley', 'Emma Roberts, Jake T. Austin, Don Cheadle, Johnny Simmons, Kyla Pratt, Troy Gentile, Lisa Kudrow, Kevin Dillon', 'PG', 'Placed in a foster home that doesn''t allow pets, 16-year-old Andi and her younger brother, Bruce, turn an abandoned hotel into a home for their dog. Soon other strays arrive, and the hotel becomes a haven for every orphaned canine in town. But the kids have to do some quick thinking to keep the cops off their tails.', 'Placed in a foster home that doesn''t allow pets, 16-year-old Andi and her younger brother, Bruce, turn an abandoned hotel into a home for their dog. Soon other strays arrive, and the hotel becomes a haven for every orphaned canine in town. But the kids have to do some quick thinking to keep the cops off their tails.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xD2AssTeySNCamlGueai4yAZZfX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15189'),
  ('1150686332127412131', 'Hotel for the Holidays', 2022, 'Romance, Comedy, TV Movie', 'Ron Oliver, Russ Goozee', 'Maggie Lane, Margarita Matthews', 'Madelaine Petsch, Mena Massoud, Max Lloyd-Jones, Kayleigh Shikanai, Jamison Belushi, Jayne Eastwood, Neil Crone, Morgan David Jones', 'PG', 'Georgia is an ambitious young woman and the manager of the high-end hotel, which attracts guests of all kinds—including heartbroken singles, an infamous pop star, and a European ex-prince who recently abdicated his throne — all looking to escape from their everyday lives and come to the hotel as a sanctuary during the holiday season. Georgia’s work and personal life become entangled when she is caught between the charming hotel chef Luke and the sophisticated ex-prince staying at the hotel, Prince Raymond. The storylines of Georgia and the hotel’s eclectic guests twist, turn, and come together, as they unexpectedly find friendship, love, and inspiration.', 'Georgia is an ambitious young woman and the manager of the high-end hotel, which attracts guests of all kinds—including heartbroken singles, an infamous pop star, and a European ex-prince who recently abdicated his throne — all looking to escape from their everyday lives and come to the hotel as a sanctuary during the holiday season. Georgia’s work and personal life become entangled when she is caught between the charming hotel chef Luke and the sophisticated ex-prince staying at the hotel, Prince Raymond. The storylines of Georgia and the hotel’s eclectic guests twist, turn, and come together, as they unexpectedly find friendship, love, and inspiration.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1NOG8uPLzqLrpf5H5PZH658VjP1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1017339'),
  ('134382760123224170', 'Hotel Gagarin', 2018, 'Comedy', 'Simone Spada', 'Lorenzo Rossi Espagnet, Simone Spada', 'Giuseppe Battiston, Barbora Bobuľová, Luca Argentero, Silvia D''Amico, Claudio Amendola, Philippe Leroy, Caterina Shulha, Marco Todisco', null, 'An highly heterogeneous group of people go to Armenia to make a movie, all ignoring what will happen to each of them.', 'An highly heterogeneous group of people go to Armenia to make a movie, all ignoring what will happen to each of them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hCNrSYeWFvIMoyGDsGBQcCrVela.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:523281'),
  ('875136717445261001', 'Hotel Hibiscus', 2002, 'Comedy', 'Yuji Nakae, Masaharu Take, Kenji Takama', 'Yuji Nakae, Motoko Nakae', 'Honami Kurashita, Masao Teruya, Karim Ryuta Nesmith, Soko Wada, Seijin Noborikawa, Tomi Taira, Kimiko Yo, Jun Murakami', null, 'Hotel Hibiscus is the story of one very young energetic girl named Mieko and her international family who live in Okinawa. They live in a run down old hotel called Hotel Hibiscus with only one room for rent.', 'Hotel Hibiscus is the story of one very young energetic girl named Mieko and her international family who live in Okinawa. They live in a run down old hotel called Hotel Hibiscus with only one room for rent.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iw9LuW8PyBofG831nLgcPEZwXI5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30425'),
  ('735164585269074851', 'Hotel Inferno', 2013, 'Action, Horror', 'Giulio De Santi', 'Giulio De Santi', 'Michael Howe, Rayner Bourton, Jessica Carroll, Wilmar Zimosa, Santiago Ortaez, Monica Muñoz, Riccardo Valentini, Bonini Mino', 'NR', 'Contract killer Frank Zimosa has been hired for a ridiculously lucrative mission by the rich and powerful Jorge Mistrandia. The objective: kill a couple of people hiding in one of his European hotels. What would look like one of the simplest jobs Frank has ever had is about to turn into a living nightmare. He will soon realize he''s nothing more than prey for Mistrandia and his army of mutated henchmen that have been hiding in the hotel along with an ancient and unstoppable horror.', 'Contract killer Frank Zimosa has been hired for a ridiculously lucrative mission by the rich and powerful Jorge Mistrandia. The objective: kill a couple of people hiding in one of his European hotels. What would look like one of the simplest jobs Frank has ever had is about to turn into a living nightmare. He will soon realize he''s nothing more than prey for Mistrandia and his army of mutated henchmen that have been hiding in the hotel along with an ancient and unstoppable horror.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h6uT2GISxo8jlQkpjqH6WY61z5G.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:256742'),
  ('66937407798528304', 'Hotel Lux', 2011, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Leander Haußmann, Hagen Bogdanski', 'Leander Haußmann', 'Michael Herbig, Jürgen Vogel, Thekla Reuten, Alexander Senderovich, Valeriy Grishko, Juraj Kukura, Friedrich Karl Praetorius, Thomas Thieme', null, 'In 1938 Hans Zeisig, an apolitical comedian, impersonator and cabaret actor, flees with a Russian passport (instead of American, which he would have preferred) from Nazi-Berlin, and finds himself in the legendary Hotel Lux, the ''lost paradise'' of the Comintern, in Moscow. Everyone believes that Zeisig is a man named Hansen, Hitler''s personal astrologer. But Zeisig quickly realizes that he''s gone from the frying pan into the fire. In the Hotel Lux he meets his friends Frida and later Meyer again, still passionate communists. For the three idealists an adventure between love and death begins to run his course.', 'In 1938 Hans Zeisig, an apolitical comedian, impersonator and cabaret actor, flees with a Russian passport (instead of American, which he would have preferred) from Nazi-Berlin, and finds himself in the legendary Hotel Lux, the ''lost paradise'' of the Comintern, in Moscow. Everyone believes that Zeisig is a man named Hansen, Hitler''s personal astrologer. But Zeisig quickly realizes that he''s gone from the frying pan into the fire. In the Hotel Lux he meets his friends Frida and later Meyer again, still passionate communists. For the three idealists an adventure between love and death begins to run his course.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pOrN7RADnZ9COqMQX9Cd9LMJVJ3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:76175'),
  ('301649993977304659', 'Hotel Magnezit', 1980, 'Documentary', 'Béla Tarr', 'Béla Tarr', null, null, 'Documentary about a hostel for workers. An old worker suspected of stealing a motor gets fired from the factory and must leave the hostel.', 'Documentary about a hostel for workers. An old worker suspected of stealing a motor gets fired from the factory and must leave the hostel.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8Ov6sVP250KPGlazEqRdJIDopl8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:128044'),
  ('1101361590729692240', 'Hotel Monterey', 1973, 'Documentary', 'Chantal Akerman, Babette Mangolte', 'Chantal Akerman', null, null, 'New York City''s Monterey is a residence hotel, whose inhabitants are older and primarily live alone. The camera, usually stationery, observes the lobby. No score, the lobby is clean with granite floors, men wear hats, people enter and exit an elevator, the camera looks out from within the elevator as doors open and close. People sit alone and motionless in their apartments. There are long shots of empty halls. Paint peels. The flooring on upper levels is linoleum. Hall lights are florescent. Doors open a crack then close.', 'New York City''s Monterey is a residence hotel, whose inhabitants are older and primarily live alone. The camera, usually stationery, observes the lobby. No score, the lobby is clean with granite floors, men wear hats, people enter and exit an elevator, the camera looks out from within the elevator as doors open and close. People sit alone and motionless in their apartments. There are long shots of empty halls. Paint peels. The flooring on upper levels is linoleum. Hall lights are florescent. Doors open a crack then close.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j7MhnnCY3eK9SquOAEjJLKlSLDe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:108831'),
  ('599280022305516385', 'Hotel Mumbai', 2019, 'Thriller, History, Drama, Action', 'Anthony Maras, Nick Remy Matthews', 'Anthony Maras, John Collee', 'Dev Patel, Armie Hammer, Nazanin Boniadi, Tilda Cobham-Hervey, Anupam Kher, Jason Isaacs, Suhail Nayyar, Amandeep Singh', 'R', 'Mumbai, India, November 26, 2008. While several terrorists spread hatred and death through the city, others attack the Taj Mahal Palace Hotel. Both hotel staff and guests risk their lives, making unthinkable sacrifices to protect themselves and keep everyone safe while help arrives.', 'Mumbai, India, November 26, 2008. While several terrorists spread hatred and death through the city, others attack the Taj Mahal Palace Hotel. Both hotel staff and guests risk their lives, making unthinkable sacrifices to protect themselves and keep everyone safe while help arrives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v32SC4HFZtlDRWXMaR2V2dWqAXJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:416144'),
  ('1129320989480614787', 'Hotel Noir', 2012, 'Crime, Drama', 'Sebastian Gutierrez', 'Sebastian Gutierrez', 'Carla Gugino, Danny DeVito, Malin Åkerman, Rufus Sewell, Robert Forster, Rosario Dawson, Mandy Moore, Kevin Connolly', null, 'Los Angeles, 1958: a detective holes up in a downtown hotel awaiting killers to come get him. During the course of one night he will meet various occupants of the hotel and the truth of how he came to be in his present situation will be revealed.', 'Los Angeles, 1958: a detective holes up in a downtown hotel awaiting killers to come get him. During the course of one night he will meet various occupants of the hotel and the truth of how he came to be in his present situation will be revealed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mM7lFpYA2IEpXluO3XB7UU5aZ7i.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:135047'),
  ('664832530227584856', 'Hôtel Normandy', 2013, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Charles Nemes, Robert Alazraki', 'Stéphane Ben Lahcene, Jean-Paul Bathany', 'Éric Elmosnino, Héléna Noguerra, Ary Abittan, Frédérique Bel, Anne Girouard, Annelise Hesme, Alice Belaïdi, Jean-Marie Lamour', null, 'At 40, Alice has everything a woman of her age could want - everything except one vital accessory: a man. Since her husband was killed in a road accident a few years ago, she has resisted all attempts to start a relationship with another man, despite the best efforts of her closest friends Pénélope and Isabelle. As a last resort, the latter decide to offer Alice a stay at the Hôtel Normandy, the ideal place for her to turn over a new leaf...', 'At 40, Alice has everything a woman of her age could want - everything except one vital accessory: a man. Since her husband was killed in a road accident a few years ago, she has resisted all attempts to start a relationship with another man, despite the best efforts of her closest friends Pénélope and Isabelle. As a last resort, the latter decide to offer Alice a stay at the Hôtel Normandy, the ideal place for her to turn over a new leaf...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AhTDXgDPb0ooliFaLgzt10X3u8b.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:190824'),
  ('1083596097424083052', 'Hotel Pacific', 1975, 'Drama, History', 'Janusz Majewski, Halina Garus, Miroslav Balajka', 'Pavel Hajný', 'Marek Kondrat, Roman Wilhelmi, Roman Skamene, Čestmír Řanda, Michał Pawlicki, Martin Hron, Stanisława Celińska, Joanna Kasperska', null, 'Set in the early 1930s, a young man finds a job as a dishwasher in a hotel and quickly works his way up the ladder. Loosely based on the novel by Henryk Worcell.', 'Set in the early 1930s, a young man finds a job as a dishwasher in a hotel and quickly works his way up the ladder. Loosely based on the novel by Henryk Worcell.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kdk7Kf7RQ49XxhBOuTLpFxvTmCI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:208309'),
  ('469510096406386522', 'Hotel Paradise', 1980, 'Drama, Action, Adventure', 'Edoardo Mulargia, Manuel Mateos, Gilberto Galimberti', 'Sergio Chiusi, Gil Carretero', 'Anthony Steffen, Ajita Wilson, Cristina Lay, Stelio Candelli, Luciano Rossi, Aldo Minandri, Gota Gobert, Zaira Zoccheddu', null, 'At a female prison located deep within the deadly South American jungles, a group of woman are forced to mine for valuable emeralds for the local corrupt government. A group of new prisoners on the way to the jail are ambushed and are convinced to join a group of revolutionaries seeking to overthrow the prison guards and take the treasure of jewels for themselves.', 'At a female prison located deep within the deadly South American jungles, a group of woman are forced to mine for valuable emeralds for the local corrupt government. A group of new prisoners on the way to the jail are ambushed and are convinced to join a group of revolutionaries seeking to overthrow the prison guards and take the treasure of jewels for themselves.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pVnYvbVvxxqfw0KBWNYr9gBlb7r.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:141820'),
  ('628964243109706446', 'Hotel Paradiso', 1966, 'Comedy', 'Peter Glenville, Henri Decaë', 'Georges Feydeau, Peter Glenville, Maurice Desvallières', 'Alec Guinness, Gina Lollobrigida, Robert Morley, Peggy Mount, Ann Beach, Douglas Byng, Derek Fowlds, David Battley', 'NR', 'Monsieur Feydeau has writer''s block and he needs a new play, so he takes an opportunity to observe his upper class neighbors of 1900 Paris. There is Monsieur Boniface with hard domineering wife Angelique; also, Monsieur Cotte with beautiful but neglected wife Marcelle. Henri Cotte traces architectural anomalies (mostly "ghost" sounds in the drain pipes) and plans a night at the Hotel Paradiso, which happens to be the chosen romantic rendezvous spot of Marcelle and Monsieur Boniface. One wife, two husbands, a nephew, and the perky Boniface maid, all at this ''by the hour'' hotel and consummation of the affair is, to say the least, severely compromised (not the least by a police raid). All of this is under Feydeau''s eye, and his play is the ''success fou'' of the next season.', 'Monsieur Feydeau has writer''s block and he needs a new play, so he takes an opportunity to observe his upper class neighbors of 1900 Paris. There is Monsieur Boniface with hard domineering wife Angelique; also, Monsieur Cotte with beautiful but neglected wife Marcelle. Henri Cotte traces architectural anomalies (mostly "ghost" sounds in the drain pipes) and plans a night at the Hotel Paradiso, which happens to be the chosen romantic rendezvous spot of Marcelle and Monsieur Boniface. One wife, two husbands, a nephew, and the perky Boniface maid, all at this ''by the hour'' hotel and consummation of the affair is, to say the least, severely compromised (not the least by a police raid). All of this is under Feydeau''s eye, and his play is the ''success fou'' of the next season.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fdq2lqPhQV5FJlSR4QsUhOWpyQm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:117360'),
  ('406705898835784411', 'Hotel Reserve', 1944, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Lance Comfort, Mutz Greenbaum, Anthony Hearne', 'John Davenport', 'James Mason, Lucie Mannheim, Raymond Lovell, Julien Mitchell, Herbert Lom, Martin Miller, Clare Hamilton, Frederick Valk', 'NR', 'A hunt for a spy in a hotel in the South of France just before World War Two.', 'A hunt for a spy in a hotel in the South of France just before World War Two.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/22bRyjSpaCt0HbQokTKz8Tm7rJb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:102419'),
  ('194375208687733083', 'Hotel Rock''n''Roll', 2016, 'Comedy', 'Michael Ostrowski, Helmut Köpping, Wolfgang Thaler', 'Michael Glawogger, Michael Ostrowski', 'Michael Ostrowski, Gerald Votava, Pia Hierzegger, Georg Friedrich, Detlev Buck, Hilde Dalik, Johannes Zeiler, Jayney Klimek', null, 'Mao inherits her uncle Waberl’s – a former icon of Sex, Drugs and Rock’n’Roll – hotel on the countryside. With the help of her friends Max (a wannabe entertainer with brilliant concepts but lacking structure) and Jerry (a skilled Guitarrero but less skilled chef) they try to put together a hotel band to save Rock’n’Roll as well as their bankrupt hotel.', 'Mao inherits her uncle Waberl’s – a former icon of Sex, Drugs and Rock’n’Roll – hotel on the countryside. With the help of her friends Max (a wannabe entertainer with brilliant concepts but lacking structure) and Jerry (a skilled Guitarrero but less skilled chef) they try to put together a hotel band to save Rock’n’Roll as well as their bankrupt hotel.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uBtd0HVKb84ikUBUkxxHWF2BUUe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:418393'),
  ('492680348627647846', 'Hotel Salvation', 2016, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Shubhashish Bhutiani', 'Shubhashish Bhutiani, Asad Hussain', 'Adil Hussain, Lalit Behl, Geetanjali Kulkarni, Palomi Ghosh, Navnindra Behl, Anil Rastogi', null, 'An ominous dream convinces 77-year-old Dayanand Kumar that his end could be near. He takes the news to his son Rajiv, knowing he wants to breathe his last in the holy city of Varanasi and end the cycle of rebirth, by attaining salvation. Being the dutiful son he is, Rajiv is left with no choice but to drop everything and make the journey with his stubborn father. Daya and Rajiv check into Mukti Bhawan (Hotel Salvation) in Varanasi, a guesthouse devoted to people who want to die there. But as the days go by, Rajiv struggles to juggle his responsibilities back home, while Daya starts to bloom in the hotel. Rajiv gives his father a shot at salvation but as family bonds are tested, he finds himself torn, and not knowing what he must do to keep his life together.', 'An ominous dream convinces 77-year-old Dayanand Kumar that his end could be near. He takes the news to his son Rajiv, knowing he wants to breathe his last in the holy city of Varanasi and end the cycle of rebirth, by attaining salvation. Being the dutiful son he is, Rajiv is left with no choice but to drop everything and make the journey with his stubborn father. Daya and Rajiv check into Mukti Bhawan (Hotel Salvation) in Varanasi, a guesthouse devoted to people who want to die there. But as the days go by, Rajiv struggles to juggle his responsibilities back home, while Daya starts to bloom in the hotel. Rajiv gives his father a shot at salvation but as family bonds are tested, he finds himself torn, and not knowing what he must do to keep his life together.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d6IjizWfXAxwUXdwoUWyF4qrMss.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:413727'),
  ('121268125109820604', 'Hotel Splendide', 2000, 'Comedy', 'Terence Gross, Matthew Baker, Max Keene', 'Terence Gross', 'Toni Collette, Daniel Craig, Katrin Cartlidge, Stephen Tompkinson, Hugh O''Conor, Helen McCrory, Peter Vaughan, Joerg Stadler', null, 'A chef seeks reconciliation with her brother by helping him run a decaying resort and health spa.', 'A chef seeks reconciliation with her brother by helping him run a decaying resort and health spa.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/td1G4qqhCnOQ4ZliPU3BnWVbRrG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67252'),
  ('222079370642987395', 'Hôtel Terminus: The Life and Times of Klaus Barbie', 1988, 'War, Documentary', 'Marcel Ophüls, Reuben Aaronson', 'Marcel Ophüls', 'Klaus Barbie, Marcel Ophüls, Serge Klarsfeld, Beate Klarsfeld, Claude Lanzmann, Daniel Cohn-Bendit, Günter Grass, Jacques Vergès', 'NR', 'Marcel Ophuls'' riveting film details the heinous legacy of the Gestapo head dubbed "The Butcher of Lyon." Responsible for over 4,000 deaths in occupied France during World War II, Barbie would escape—with U.S. help—to South America in 1951, where he lived until a global manhunt led to his 1983 arrest and subsequent trial.', 'Marcel Ophuls'' riveting film details the heinous legacy of the Gestapo head dubbed "The Butcher of Lyon." Responsible for over 4,000 deaths in occupied France during World War II, Barbie would escape—with U.S. help—to South America in 1951, where he lived until a global manhunt led to his 1983 arrest and subsequent trial.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gyU6I5h7K4M59QxFLCPJTMSzkDC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41954'),
  ('880936424344233205', 'Hotel Transylvania', 2012, 'Animation, Comedy, Family, Fantasy', 'Genndy Tartakovsky', 'Peter Baynham, Robert Smigel', 'Adam Sandler, Andy Samberg, Selena Gomez, Kevin James, Fran Drescher, Steve Buscemi, Molly Shannon, David Spade', 'PG', 'Welcome to Hotel Transylvania, Dracula''s lavish five-stake resort, where monsters and their families can live it up and no humans are allowed. One special weekend, Dracula has invited all his best friends to celebrate his beloved daughter Mavis''s 118th birthday. For Dracula catering to all of these legendary monsters is no problem but the party really starts when one ordinary guy stumbles into the hotel and changes everything!', 'Welcome to Hotel Transylvania, Dracula''s lavish five-stake resort, where monsters and their families can live it up and no humans are allowed. One special weekend, Dracula has invited all his best friends to celebrate his beloved daughter Mavis''s 118th birthday. For Dracula catering to all of these legendary monsters is no problem but the party really starts when one ordinary guy stumbles into the hotel and changes everything!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eJGvzGrsfe2sqTUPv5IwLWXjVuR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:76492'),
  ('505294177708463560', 'Hotel Transylvania 2', 2015, 'Animation, Comedy, Family, Fantasy', 'Genndy Tartakovsky', 'Robert Smigel, Adam Sandler', 'Adam Sandler, Andy Samberg, Selena Gomez, Kevin James, Steve Buscemi, David Spade, Keegan-Michael Key, Asher Blinkoff', 'PG', 'When the old-old-old-fashioned vampire Vlad arrives at the hotel for an impromptu family get-together, Hotel Transylvania is in for a collision of supernatural old-school and modern day cool.', 'When the old-old-old-fashioned vampire Vlad arrives at the hotel for an impromptu family get-together, Hotel Transylvania is in for a collision of supernatural old-school and modern day cool.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3nFnrivNgipSKZ8LZJJbRSlAcTR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:159824'),
  ('412059678533733360', 'Hotel Transylvania 3: Summer Vacation', 2018, 'Animation, Comedy, Family, Fantasy', 'Genndy Tartakovsky', 'Michael McCullers, Genndy Tartakovsky', 'Adam Sandler, Andy Samberg, Selena Gomez, Kathryn Hahn, Jim Gaffigan, Kevin James, Fran Drescher, Steve Buscemi', 'PG', 'Dracula, Mavis, Johnny and the rest of the Drac Pack take a vacation on a luxury Monster Cruise Ship, where Dracula falls in love with the ship’s captain, Ericka, who’s secretly a descendant of Abraham Van Helsing, the notorious monster slayer.', 'Dracula, Mavis, Johnny and the rest of the Drac Pack take a vacation on a luxury Monster Cruise Ship, where Dracula falls in love with the ship’s captain, Ericka, who’s secretly a descendant of Abraham Van Helsing, the notorious monster slayer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lzE5BwGQea1nek7TPXUuC5AZ6rq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:400155'),
  ('1101765601797614693', 'Hotel Transylvania: Transformania', 2022, 'Animation, Comedy, Family, Adventure, Fantasy', 'Derek Drymon, Jennifer Kluska', 'Amos Vernon, Nunzio Randazzo, Genndy Tartakovsky', 'Andy Samberg, Selena Gomez, Kathryn Hahn, Jim Gaffigan, Steve Buscemi, Molly Shannon, David Spade, Keegan-Michael Key', 'PG', 'When Van Helsing''s mysterious invention, the "Monsterfication Ray," goes haywire, Drac and his monster pals are all transformed into humans, and Johnny becomes a monster. In their new mismatched bodies, Drac and Johnny must team up and race across the globe to find a cure before it''s too late, and before they drive each other crazy.', 'When Van Helsing''s mysterious invention, the "Monsterfication Ray," goes haywire, Drac and his monster pals are all transformed into humans, and Johnny becomes a monster. In their new mismatched bodies, Drac and Johnny must team up and race across the globe to find a cure before it''s too late, and before they drive each other crazy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/teCy1egGQa0y8ULJvlrDHQKnxBL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:585083'),
  ('819855797481970847', 'Hotel Very Welcome', 2007, 'Drama', 'Nikolai von Graevenitz, Sonja Heiss', 'Nikolai von Graevenitz, Sonja Heiss', 'Svenja Steinfelder, Eva Löbau, Chris O''Dowd, Ricky Champ, Gareth Llewelyn, Jinde Khan, Martin Löschmann, Zorana Musikic', null, 'Five young Europeans (German, English, and Irish) try to find answers to life''s questions in India and Thailand.', 'Five young Europeans (German, English, and Irish) try to find answers to life''s questions in India and Thailand.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2pggTkAPvpkK0hp91vpvaLlkiUD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4344'),
