  ('41395416566377774', 'Hotspot 2 Much', 2026, 'Comedy, Romance, Drama', 'Vignesh Karthick, Jagdeesh Ravichandran, Joseph paul, Kishore Sankar', 'Vignesh Karthick', 'Priya Bhavani Shankar, Rakshan, Aditya Baskar, Brigida Saga, Bhavani Sre', null, 'The film is about an aspiring Director, who pitches her three different stories, that depict some pressing ideological and social issues in the society, to a producer with whom she also has an hidden agenda.', 'The film is about an aspiring Director, who pitches her three different stories, that depict some pressing ideological and social issues in the society, to a producer with whom she also has an hidden agenda.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fmetadata-static.plex.tv%2Ff%2Fgracenote%2Ffe9bab544dc30287f4c54147cb246e97.jpg', 'plex:movie:hotspot-2-much'),
  ('949099661231990766', 'Hotsunlight', 2021, 'Drama, War, Action', 'Mikhail Vasserbaum, Maxim Brius, Firs Mikhaylov', 'Vladimir Izmaylov', 'Vladimir Ilin, Aleksandr Bukharov, Aleksei Kravchenko, Maxim Dakhnenko, Marina Denisova, Andrey Terentyev, Svetlana Terentyeva, Gleb Borisov', null, 'Lugansk region, May 2014. The Novozhilov family, by chance, finds itself in the thick of events in Lugansk. Vlad Novozhilov is a former participant in the war in Afghanistan. He knows firsthand what war is. Having seen enough of the horrors of war in his time, in principle he does not even want to touch a weapon. In a situation, he sees only one way out - to leave the country. But you can''t run away from the war, the border is already closed. To save his family, he will have to make difficult moral choices.', 'Lugansk region, May 2014. The Novozhilov family, by chance, finds itself in the thick of events in Lugansk. Vlad Novozhilov is a former participant in the war in Afghanistan. He knows firsthand what war is. Having seen enough of the horrors of war in his time, in principle he does not even want to touch a weapon. In a situation, he sees only one way out - to leave the country. But you can''t run away from the war, the border is already closed. To save his family, he will have to make difficult moral choices.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lwDO0JCUWyxlSIrFHSZVkBrfiR8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:855096'),
  ('17411012699995271', 'Hotte in Paradise', 2003, 'Drama', 'Dominik Graf, Hanno Lentz', 'Rolf Basedow', 'Mišel Matičević, Nadeshda Brennicke, Birge Schade, Isabell Gerschke, Stefanie Stappenbeck, Oliver Stritzel, Sven Martinek, Dirk Borchardt', null, 'Hotte, a Berlin-based pimp with only modest turnovers, suddenly becomes a big player in the prostitution business. He has three girls on the streets: Rosa is in love with Hotte and is working hard for him. Jenny, the new girl, is an unconventional prostitute but nevertheless much sought-after by her clients. And the third girl, Yvonne, also brings in a large turn-out. So, Hotte’s proceeds are more than sufficient to buy expensive accessoires and to boost his reputation with the other pimps. But when Yvonne quits her job and Jenny starts to work for another pimp, Hotte’s rise comes to a sudden end', 'Hotte, a Berlin-based pimp with only modest turnovers, suddenly becomes a big player in the prostitution business. He has three girls on the streets: Rosa is in love with Hotte and is working hard for him. Jenny, the new girl, is an unconventional prostitute but nevertheless much sought-after by her clients. And the third girl, Yvonne, also brings in a large turn-out. So, Hotte’s proceeds are more than sufficient to buy expensive accessoires and to boost his reputation with the other pimps. But when Yvonne quits her job and Jenny starts to work for another pimp, Hotte’s rise comes to a sudden end', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xLNJFvOqcdX3qJllNUvUANK13xX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:62337'),
  ('252758121482603457', 'HOUBA! On the Trail of the Marsupilami', 2012, 'Family, Adventure, Comedy', 'Alain Chabat, Laurent Dailland, Bastien Laurent', 'Alain Chabat, Jeremy Doner', 'Alain Chabat, Jamel Debbouze, Fred Testot, Lambert Wilson, Patrick Timsit, Géraldine Nakache, Liya Kebede, Aïssa Maïga', 'PG-13', 'When reporter Dan Geraldo (Alain Chabat) arrives in Palombia to hunt for a scoop, he never suspects that he is about to make an incredible discovery... With his resourceful local guide Pablito (Jamel Debbouze), D an has one surprise after another during a thrilling adventure that allows him to bring the world some spectacular news: the Marsupilami, a mythical and mischievous animal, really does exist! You too will believe in furry tails!', 'When reporter Dan Geraldo (Alain Chabat) arrives in Palombia to hunt for a scoop, he never suspects that he is about to make an incredible discovery... With his resourceful local guide Pablito (Jamel Debbouze), D an has one surprise after another during a thrilling adventure that allows him to bring the world some spectacular news: the Marsupilami, a mythical and mischievous animal, really does exist! You too will believe in furry tails!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yn3ydorp7YigPcnEZgNMvdNHPaF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:102207'),
  ('922423742683166073', 'Houdini', 1953, 'Drama, Romance, History', 'George Marshall, Ernest Laszlo', 'Philip Yordan', 'Tony Curtis, Janet Leigh, Torin Thatcher, Angela Clarke, Stefan Schnabel, Ian Wolfe, Sig Ruman, Michael Pate', 'NR', 'By the early 1900s, the extraordinary Houdini earned an international reputation for his theatrical tricks and daring feats of extrication from shackles, ropes, handcuffs and... Scotland Yard''s jails.', 'By the early 1900s, the extraordinary Houdini earned an international reputation for his theatrical tricks and daring feats of extrication from shackles, ropes, handcuffs and... Scotland Yard''s jails.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9Qz3v7IgaGrSmYfMGyPAPbEJvnV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43192'),
