  ('481529420320181570', 'Hounds', 2023, 'Crime, Thriller, Drama', 'Kamal Lazraq, Amine Berrada, Abdessamad Bounasser', 'Kamal Lazraq', 'Ayoub Elaid, Abdellatif Masstouri, Mohamed Hmimsa, Abdellah Lebkiri, Lahcen Zaimouzen, Salah Bensalah, Mohamed Kharbouchi, Amine Arakhisis', null, 'A father and son, live from day to day by carrying out petty crimes for the local mafia. Hired to kidnap a man and to deliver him across town seems simple enough until the man dies in the trunk of their car. What follows is a panicked after-hours odyssey with the police looking for them, the mafia expecting a live delivery, a dead body rotting in their trunk and they have no idea what awaits them next…', 'A father and son, live from day to day by carrying out petty crimes for the local mafia. Hired to kidnap a man and to deliver him across town seems simple enough until the man dies in the trunk of their car. What follows is a panicked after-hours odyssey with the police looking for them, the mafia expecting a live delivery, a dead body rotting in their trunk and they have no idea what awaits them next…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6K0Mv57PWzEuuVN5jYEnnRwy9VK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1000130'),
