  ('179638263525127410', 'House of Angels', 1992, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Colin Nutley, Jens Fischer', 'Colin Nutley', 'Helena Bergström, Rikard Wolff, Sven Wollter, Reine Brynolfsson, Ernst Günther, Viveka Seldahl, Per Oscarsson, Tord Peterson', 'R', 'In a small village in Västergötland, everything is turned upside-down when the local loner dies and his cottage is inherited by his unknown relative Fanny. She rides into town on a big black motorcycle with her androgynous boyfriend Zack, wearing black leather and spikes. When they decide to stay, Flogfält''s plans to buy the cottage are upset.', 'In a small village in Västergötland, everything is turned upside-down when the local loner dies and his cottage is inherited by his unknown relative Fanny. She rides into town on a big black motorcycle with her androgynous boyfriend Zack, wearing black leather and spikes. When they decide to stay, Flogfält''s plans to buy the cottage are upset.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zKHeZrgRuMso9MWvqBQlNYSHTka.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34683'),
  ('466096656939134594', 'House of Angels: The Second Summer', 1994, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Colin Nutley, Jens Fischer', 'Colin Nutley', 'Helena Bergström, Rikard Wolff, Ernst Günther, Tord Peterson, Sven Wollter, Viveka Seldahl, Ron Dean, Reine Brynolfsson', null, 'Fanny and Zack is back, after she inherited Änglagård last year. Everytone looks forward to their new stay. Axel has told Fanny he is her father, but who else? Ivar also thinks he is her father. Be ready for expectations and confusions.', 'Fanny and Zack is back, after she inherited Änglagård last year. Everytone looks forward to their new stay. Axel has told Fanny he is her father, but who else? Ivar also thinks he is her father. Be ready for expectations and confusions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7w4pcBKfrWvyAyWF57mIf3NvV4a.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44965'),
  ('811682109858209651', 'House of Bamboo', 1955, 'Crime, Drama', 'Joseph MacDonald, Samuel Fuller', 'Harry Kleiner', 'Robert Ryan, Robert Stack, Yoshiko Yamaguchi, Cameron Mitchell, Brad Dexter, Sessue Hayakawa, Biff Elliot, Sandro Giglio', 'NR', 'Eddie Kenner is given a special assignment by the Army to get the inside story on Sandy Dawson, a former GI who has formed a gang of fellow servicemen and Japanese locals.', 'Eddie Kenner is given a special assignment by the Army to get the inside story on Sandy Dawson, a former GI who has formed a gang of fellow servicemen and Japanese locals.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7LxWQZA0PCSJ0jGcZ7KYq1uFupL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20942'),
  ('932901863468504559', 'House of Bones', 2010, 'Horror, TV Movie', 'Jeffery Scott Lando', 'Anthony C. Ferrante, Jay Frasco', 'Charisma Carpenter, Corin Nemec, Marcus Lyle Brown, Ricky Wayne, Collin Galyean, Kyle Clements, Stephanie Honoré, Gregory Campo', 'NR', 'Psychic Heather Burton and a team of TV ghost hunters travel to investigate a haunted house surrounded by rumors of paranormal activity.', 'Psychic Heather Burton and a team of TV ghost hunters travel to investigate a haunted house surrounded by rumors of paranormal activity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hQhYefeuo645iFUeusHmvRhVpvi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50288'),
  ('568909090796335234', 'House of Boys', 2009, 'Drama, Romance', 'Jean-Claude Schlim, Carlo Thiel', 'Jean-Claude Schlim', 'Layke Anderson, Benn Northover, Udo Kier, Stephen Fry, Steven Webb, Chris McHallem, Vicky Krieps, Harry Ferrier', null, 'It is 1984. Frank is a determined English teenager who runs away from high school to find an alternative gay lifestyle in Amsterdam. He finds a home and a job at the "House of Boys", a bar-cum-brothel run by a strict Madame who has an eye for what his punters crave. Frank works his way up from barman to on-stage dancer and falls in love with some of his housemates, Jake. The first intimations of what is described as ''the gay cancer'', casts a long shadow over Frank''s tight-knit group of friends. Yet despite the troubles that cloud the hopes and dreams of young Frank, his perseverance, along with support from a willing doctor, will carry him through.', 'It is 1984. Frank is a determined English teenager who runs away from high school to find an alternative gay lifestyle in Amsterdam. He finds a home and a job at the "House of Boys", a bar-cum-brothel run by a strict Madame who has an eye for what his punters crave. Frank works his way up from barman to on-stage dancer and falls in love with some of his housemates, Jake. The first intimations of what is described as ''the gay cancer'', casts a long shadow over Frank''s tight-knit group of friends. Yet despite the troubles that cloud the hopes and dreams of young Frank, his perseverance, along with support from a willing doctor, will carry him through.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ggbRpkmQ52gdsfqrjzTSdqhmAYo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51935'),
  ('672930129068066624', 'House of Cards', 1968, 'Drama, Thriller', 'John Guillermin', 'Harriet Frank Jr., Irving Ravetch', 'George Peppard, Inger Stevens, Orson Welles, Perrette Pradier, Keith Michell, Geneviève Cluny, Maxine Audley, Ralph Michael', null, 'In 1960s Paris, an American boxer stumbles upon an international fascist conspiracy that aims to create a new world order.', 'In 1960s Paris, an American boxer stumbles upon an international fascist conspiracy that aims to create a new world order.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bjcpPPIuvDYBJCaV7P9OKZCOY1t.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4930'),
  ('934746233741599534', 'House of Cards', 1993, 'Drama', 'Michael Lessac, Victor Hammer', 'Michael Lessac', 'Tommy Lee Jones, Asha Menina, Kathleen Turner, Shiloh Strong, Esther Rolle, Park Overall, Michael Horse, Anne Pitoniak', 'PG-13', 'When Ruth Matthews''s husband is killed in a fall at an archaeological dig, her daughter Sally handles her father''s death in a very odd manner. As Sally''s condition worsens, Ruth takes her to see Jake, an expert in childhood autism. Jake attempts to bring Sally out of her mental disarray through traditional therapy methods, but Ruth takes a different route. She risks her own sanity by attempting to enter her daughter''s mind and make sense of the seemingly bizarre things that Sally does, including building a wondrous house of cards', 'When Ruth Matthews''s husband is killed in a fall at an archaeological dig, her daughter Sally handles her father''s death in a very odd manner. As Sally''s condition worsens, Ruth takes her to see Jake, an expert in childhood autism. Jake attempts to bring Sally out of her mental disarray through traditional therapy methods, but Ruth takes a different route. She risks her own sanity by attempting to enter her daughter''s mind and make sense of the seemingly bizarre things that Sally does, including building a wondrous house of cards', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cmZTyKkjlchMjhgzvnpfkxIglqJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47095'),
  ('409892963426615436', 'House of Chains', 2022, 'Drama, TV Movie, Thriller', 'Stephen Tolkin, Tina Gerussi, William Smith', 'Stephen Tolkin', 'Mena Suvari, Greyston Holt, Carina Battrick, Natalie Jane, Aias Dalman, Madeleine Kane, Callum McAllister, Hudson Robert Wurster', null, 'It follows a troubled married couple as they imprison their six children due to their intense religious ideology.', 'It follows a troubled married couple as they imprison their six children due to their intense religious ideology.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cLFLZdjstkX2oC0DxrORKV4NohD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1007442'),
  ('772695299570510301', 'House of D', 2004, 'Comedy, Drama', 'David Duchovny, Michael Chapman, Todd Pfeiffer', 'David Duchovny', 'Anton Yelchin, Téa Leoni, David Duchovny, Robin Williams, Erykah Badu, Frank Langella, Magali Amadei, Claire Lautier', 'PG-13', 'In the present, artist Tom Warshaw recalls his traumatic coming of age. As a 13-year-old growing up in New York City in 1973, Tom hangs out with Pappass, a mentally disabled man. With Tom''s mother battling depression after the death of her husband, the young boy is left to his own devices. When Tom develops a crush on schoolmate Melissa, Pappass feels abandoned and begins behaving erratically.', 'In the present, artist Tom Warshaw recalls his traumatic coming of age. As a 13-year-old growing up in New York City in 1973, Tom hangs out with Pappass, a mentally disabled man. With Tom''s mother battling depression after the death of her husband, the young boy is left to his own devices. When Tom develops a crush on schoolmate Melissa, Pappass feels abandoned and begins behaving erratically.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oVBMJQKHVTbXM8vEph3RhS4mKgr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24363'),
  ('413186629414678899', 'House of Dark Shadows', 1970, 'Drama, Horror, Thriller', 'Dan Curtis, Arthur J. Ornitz, William C. Gerrity', 'Sam Hall, Gordon Russell', 'Jonathan Frid, Grayson Hall, Kathryn Leigh Scott, Nancy Barrett, John Karlen, Roger Davis, Thayer David, Louis Edmonds', 'PG', 'Barnabas Collins searches for a cure for vampirism in order to marry a woman resembling his long-lost fiancée Josette.', 'Barnabas Collins searches for a cure for vampirism in order to marry a woman resembling his long-lost fiancée Josette.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uI2bfcqbuF4gowoqYx9422PzoS4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:71943'),
  ('43946685294002336', 'House of Darkness', 2022, 'Horror, Thriller, Comedy, Mystery', 'Neil LaBute, Daniel Katz', 'Neil LaBute', 'Justin Long, Kate Bosworth, Gia Crovatin, Lucy Walters', 'R', 'Driving home to her secluded estate after meeting at a local bar, a player out to score thinks his beautiful, mysterious date will be another casual hook-up. While getting acquainted, their flirtation turns playful, sexy and sinister. Hoping to get lucky, his luck may have just run out.', 'Driving home to her secluded estate after meeting at a local bar, a player out to score thinks his beautiful, mysterious date will be another casual hook-up. While getting acquainted, their flirtation turns playful, sexy and sinister. Hoping to get lucky, his luck may have just run out.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1udlXpDFZ4Rc52cX4jmYlOzQecH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:942890'),
  ('1071889086649239637', 'House of Dracula', 1945, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Erle C. Kenton, Bernard B. Brown, George Robinson', 'Edward T. Lowe Jr.', 'John Carradine, Onslow Stevens, Lon Chaney Jr., Martha O''Driscoll, Jane Adams, Lionel Atwill, Glenn Strange, Ludwig Stössel', null, 'A scientist working on cures for rare afflictions, such as a bone softening agent made from molds to allow him to correct the spinal deformity of his nurse, finds the physical causes of lycanthropy in wolf-man Larry Talbot and of vampirism in Count Dracula, but himself becomes afflicted with homicidal madness while exchanging blood with Dracula.', 'A scientist working on cures for rare afflictions, such as a bone softening agent made from molds to allow him to correct the spinal deformity of his nurse, finds the physical causes of lycanthropy in wolf-man Larry Talbot and of vampirism in Count Dracula, but himself becomes afflicted with homicidal madness while exchanging blood with Dracula.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x2HZq0CjGJbU90Q8Bm7jDKBM7ZG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30793'),
  ('751792822688937371', 'House of Fears', 2007, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Ryan Little, Jason Allred, Ryan Little', 'John Lyde, Steven A. Lee', 'Corri English, Sandra McCoy, Michael J. Pagan, Corey Sevier, Alice Greczyn, Eliot Schwartz, Mark David Christenson, Kelvin Clayton', 'R', 'The night before a local haunted house opens for Halloween, six friends sneak in for a few hours of fun. Soon after entering, they find themselves trapped inside with no way out.', 'The night before a local haunted house opens for Halloween, six friends sneak in for a few hours of fun. Soon after entering, they find themselves trapped inside with no way out.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mQmq6QsLSvpeFkqNRMxe3G5paKP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45102'),
  ('1124988261701684831', 'House of Flames', 1979, 'Animation, Drama', 'Kihachiro Kawamoto, Minoru Tamura', 'Kihachiro Kawamoto', 'Tetsunojo Kanze', null, 'Through puppets and animation, a traveler tells his story of walking through Settsu, coming to the town of Ikuta. He asks if someone can show him the Seeker''s Mound. Late that day, a solitary maiden says she will lead him there.', 'Through puppets and animation, a traveler tells his story of walking through Settsu, coming to the town of Ikuta. He asks if someone can show him the Seeker''s Mound. Late that day, a solitary maiden says she will lead him there.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vF43aSUWo2se9QLIwfPdo4We5We.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:150458'),
  ('901376641994191453', 'House of Flying Daggers', 2004, 'Adventure, Drama, Action', 'Zhang Yimou, Han Zhong, Zhao Xiaoding', 'Feng Li, Wang Bin, Zhang Yimou', 'Takeshi Kaneshiro, Andy Lau, Zhang Ziyi, Song Dandan, Zhao Hongfei, Guo Jun, Zhang Shu, Wang Jiusheng', 'PG-13', 'In 9th century China, a corrupt government wages war against a rebel army called the Flying Daggers. A romantic warrior breaks a beautiful rebel out of prison to help her rejoin her fellows, but things are not what they seem.', 'In 9th century China, a corrupt government wages war against a rebel army called the Flying Daggers. A romantic warrior breaks a beautiful rebel out of prison to help her rejoin her fellows, but things are not what they seem.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/93feGsGiCtG5ymrRcErUgBsdo6v.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9550'),
  ('996356667519114178', 'House of Fools', 2002, 'Drama, Romance, War', 'Andrei Konchalovsky, Sergei Kozlov, Valentina Brusnika', 'Andrei Konchalovsky', 'Yuliya Vysotskaya, Evgeny Mironov, Vladas Bagdonas, Marina Politseymako, Anatoli Adoskin, Sultan Islamov, Stanislav Varkki, Elena Fomina', null, 'The war film that''s not a war film. A film about the mental institution which backdrop is the Chechen war. A story about the patients living in an institution during the war on the border of Chechnia and Russia during the war. The patients have to continue living their day to day life after being invaded twice over, and they have to deal with their sicknesses.', 'The war film that''s not a war film. A film about the mental institution which backdrop is the Chechen war. A story about the patients living in an institution during the war on the border of Chechnia and Russia during the war. The patients have to continue living their day to day life after being invaded twice over, and they have to deal with their sicknesses.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p3q9U27s7czWbynaxkCvcYWBfPQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:72996'),
  ('487802674338691478', 'House of Frankenstein', 1944, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Erle C. Kenton, George Robinson, Bernard B. Brown', 'Edward T. Lowe Jr.', 'Boris Karloff, Lon Chaney Jr., J. Carrol Naish, John Carradine, Anne Gwynne, Peter Coe, Lionel Atwill, George Zucco', null, 'Deranged scientist, Gustav Niemann, escapes from prison and overtakes the director of a traveling chamber of horrors, soon reviving the infamous Count Dracula, the frozen Frankenstein Monster, and the Wolf Man.', 'Deranged scientist, Gustav Niemann, escapes from prison and overtakes the director of a traveling chamber of horrors, soon reviving the infamous Count Dracula, the frozen Frankenstein Monster, and the Wolf Man.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9HPcPasdgxjlSMlnyzIWrnGodOz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:3103'),
  ('972098164384825168', 'House of Fury', 2005, 'Action, Comedy, Family', 'Stephen Fung', 'Stephen Fung, Law Yiu-Fai', 'Anthony Wong Chau-Sang, Stephen Fung, Gillian Chung, Charlene Choi Chuek-Yin, Daniel Wu, Michael Wong, Wu Ma, Winnie Leung Man-Yee', null, 'Teddy Yu is a former secret agent turned chiropractor who thought he left his past behind. He teaches martial arts to his two kids. However, his past catches up to him as a rogue agent demands to know the whereabouts of an agent known as Dragon. Now, father and children must team up to stop the rogue agent and his goons.', 'Teddy Yu is a former secret agent turned chiropractor who thought he left his past behind. He teaches martial arts to his two kids. However, his past catches up to him as a rogue agent demands to know the whereabouts of an agent known as Dragon. Now, father and children must team up to stop the rogue agent and his goons.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/faRREdm64qKYE2BHO4EGtlmHXYr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28366'),
  ('632665427264711526', 'House of Ga''a', 2024, 'Action, History', 'Bolanle Austen-Peters', 'Tunde Babalola', 'Femi Branch, Mike Afolarin, Funke Akindele, Femi Adebayo, Ibrahim Chatta, Toyin Abraham, Jide ''JBlaze'' Oyegbile, Bimbo Manuel', 'R', 'At the height of the Oyo Empire, the ferocious Bashorun Ga''a became more powerful than the kings he enthroned, only to be undone by his own blood.', 'At the height of the Oyo Empire, the ferocious Bashorun Ga''a became more powerful than the kings he enthroned, only to be undone by his own blood.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fVSbkXzeTrNGfMBvZcIFk6fdxK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1311550'),
  ('85780405694008628', 'House of Games', 1987, 'Crime, Thriller, Drama', 'David Mamet, Juan Ruiz Anchía, Michael Hausman', 'David Mamet', 'Lindsay Crouse, Joe Mantegna, Mike Nussbaum, Lilia Skala, J.T. Walsh, Steven Goldstein, Jack Wallace, Ricky Jay', 'R', 'A psychiatrist comes to the aid of a compulsive gambler and is led by a smooth-talking grifter into the shadowy but compelling world of stings, scams, and con men.', 'A psychiatrist comes to the aid of a compulsive gambler and is led by a smooth-talking grifter into the shadowy but compelling world of stings, scams, and con men.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4i27Ut4cIoLbcNpW7aeuUQErEPE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26719'),
  ('1057193953515089566', 'House of Gucci', 2021, 'Drama, Crime, History', 'Dariusz Wolski, Cristina Onori, Silvia Colafranceschi', 'Becky Johnston, Roberto Bentivegna', 'Lady Gaga, Adam Driver, Al Pacino, Jeremy Irons, Jared Leto, Jack Huston, Salma Hayek Pinault, Alexia Murray', 'R', 'When Patrizia Reggiani, an outsider from humble beginnings, marries into the Gucci family, her unbridled ambition begins to unravel the family legacy and triggers a reckless spiral of betrayal, decadence, revenge, and ultimately… murder.', 'When Patrizia Reggiani, an outsider from humble beginnings, marries into the Gucci family, her unbridled ambition begins to unravel the family legacy and triggers a reckless spiral of betrayal, decadence, revenge, and ultimately… murder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oJCQjD2byiVF1EG408F9dBn9ndU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:644495'),
  ('651241017808023767', 'House of Horrors', 1946, 'Horror, Crime, Thriller', 'Jean Yarbrough, Maury Gertsman', 'George Bricker', 'Rondo Hatton, Martin Kosleck, Robert Lowery, Virginia Grey, Bill Goodwin, Joan Shawlee, Alan Napier, Howard Freeman', 'NR', 'An unsuccessful sculptor saves a madman named "The Creeper" from drowning. Seeing an opportunity for revenge, he tricks the psycho into murdering his critics.', 'An unsuccessful sculptor saves a madman named "The Creeper" from drowning. Seeing an opportunity for revenge, he tricks the psycho into murdering his critics.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/TP8SJiSVE3sVkLQvCiAD1GFVvq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84419'),
  ('613776103501537979', 'House of Hummingbird', 2019, 'Drama', 'Kim Se-in, Hong Ji-su, Baek Sohee', 'Kim Bora', 'Park Ji-hu, Kim Sae-byuk, Seol Hye-in, Jeong In-gi, Lee Seung-yeon, Park Soo-yeon, Son Sang-yeon, Kil Hae-yeon', null, '14-year-old Eun-hee moves through life like a hummingbird searching for a taste of sweetness wherever she may find it. Ignored by her parents and abused by her brother, she finds her escape by roaming the neighborhood with her best friend, going on adventures, and exploring young love.', '14-year-old Eun-hee moves through life like a hummingbird searching for a taste of sweetness wherever she may find it. Ignored by her parents and abused by her brother, she finds her escape by roaming the neighborhood with her best friend, going on adventures, and exploring young love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ugWlKFgLnv8W6MmRmk0jnaJUSra.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:547404'),
  ('809161278587621006', 'House of Ka', 2026, 'Horror, Mystery, Thriller', 'Josie Eli Herman', 'Michael Alan Herman, Josie Eli Herman', 'Alvaro Aparicio Pajares, Michael Alan Herman, Allison Megroet, Jeffrey Shawn Miller', null, 'After her father contracts a supernatural illness, a young aristocrat named Margaret Trelawny and a gentleman lawyer unravel a deadly mystery to save her father''s life.', 'After her father contracts a supernatural illness, a young aristocrat named Margaret Trelawny and a gentleman lawyer unravel a deadly mystery to save her father''s life.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FnsBCtLZhc9eH56sFoRwgFckRosw.jpg', 'plex:movie:house-of-ka'),
  ('1108640187985255996', 'House of Mortal Sin', 1976, 'Horror', 'Pete Walker, Peter Jessop, Brian Lawrence', 'David McGillivray', 'Anthony Sharp, Susan Penhaligon, Stephanie Beacham, Norman Eshley, Sheila Keith, Hilda Barry, Stewart Bevan, Julia McCarthy', 'R', 'A troubled young girl goes to confession at the local church. Unfortunately, the sexually frustrated priest she confesses to becomes obsessed with her. At first, the priest stalks the girl, but later it is revealed that he will stop at nothing, including blackmail and murder, just to get close to her.', 'A troubled young girl goes to confession at the local church. Unfortunately, the sexually frustrated priest she confesses to becomes obsessed with her. At first, the priest stalks the girl, but later it is revealed that he will stop at nothing, including blackmail and murder, just to get close to her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rkzPQVQZcHy2h3T63pRTINAd1v6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:106679'),
  ('485297459406125659', 'House of Mystery', 1934, 'Comedy, Horror, Thriller', 'William Nigh', 'Albert DeMond', 'Ed Lowry, Verna Hillie, John Sheehan, Brandon Hurst, Joyzelle Joyner, Fritzi Ridgeway, Clay Clement, George ''Gabby'' Hayes', null, 'Out of the Mystic Temples of Old India crept this terrible Monster to wreak vengeance of the Hindu Gods. One by one its victims fell with not a trace of the bloody assassin.', 'Out of the Mystic Temples of Old India crept this terrible Monster to wreak vengeance of the Hindu Gods. One by one its victims fell with not a trace of the bloody assassin.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/17NQYgQOOfszLHN94veGW98ZiHj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41027'),
