  ('870815881911630821', 'House of Pleasure for Women', 1976, 'Comedy, Music', 'Pupi Avati, Ricky Tognazzi, Erico Menczer', 'Maurizio Costanzo, Antonio Avati, Gianni Cavina', 'Al Lettieri, Gigi Proietti, Christian De Sica, Gianni Cavina, Vincent Gardenia, Taryn Power, Vladek Sheybal, George Eastman', null, 'The United States of America, after the great success of Vietnam, Watergate and so on, have decided to expand their activities in Italy. Mr. Chips has chosen Eddie Mordace to open the Italian branch of the multinational American Love Company. So Eddie opens in Milan a small branch of the Company whose purpose is to comfort women. Eddie hires Simbad, Adone and later, when business starts to go well, Ugolino, a real Count, and Ivanoe, a raper, who becames the attraction of the House.', 'The United States of America, after the great success of Vietnam, Watergate and so on, have decided to expand their activities in Italy. Mr. Chips has chosen Eddie Mordace to open the Italian branch of the multinational American Love Company. So Eddie opens in Milan a small branch of the Company whose purpose is to comfort women. Eddie hires Simbad, Adone and later, when business starts to go well, Ugolino, a real Count, and Ivanoe, a raper, who becames the attraction of the House.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jkR7ZVDl5YIcr88FQFIyFxqq1TR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:272955'),
  ('1152382987169397298', 'House of Pleasures', 2011, 'Drama', 'Bertrand Bonello, Elsa Amiel, Clément Comet', 'Bertrand Bonello', 'Noémie Lvovsky, Hafsia Herzi, Céline Sallette, Jasmine Trinca, Adèle Haenel, Alice Barnole, Iliana Zabeth, Judith Lou Lévy', 'NR', 'The dawn of the 20th century: L’Apollonide, a luxurious and traditional brothel in Paris, is living its last days. In this closed world, where some men fall in love and others become viciously harmful, the women share their secrets, their fears, their joys and their pains.', 'The dawn of the 20th century: L’Apollonide, a luxurious and traditional brothel in Paris, is living its last days. In this closed world, where some men fall in love and others become viciously harmful, the women share their secrets, their fears, their joys and their pains.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/adkiqkEOKW8nMlfF8hVcaPWTAwB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84427'),
  ('883695213277119003', 'House of Sand and Fog', 2003, 'Drama', 'Roger Deakins, Vadim Perelman, Nithya Shrinivasan', 'Shawn Lawrence Otto, Vadim Perelman', 'Jennifer Connelly, Ben Kingsley, Ron Eldard, Frances Fisher, Kim Dickens, Shohreh Aghdashloo, Jonathan Ahdout, Navi Rawat', 'R', 'Behrani, an Iranian immigrant buys a California bungalow, thinking he can fix it up, sell it again, and make enough money to send his son to college. However, the house is the legal property of former drug addict Kathy. After losing the house in an unfair legal dispute with the county, she is left with nowhere to go. Wanting her house back, she hires a lawyer and befriends a police officer. Neither Kathy nor Behrani have broken the law, so they find themselves involved in a difficult moral dilemma.', 'Behrani, an Iranian immigrant buys a California bungalow, thinking he can fix it up, sell it again, and make enough money to send his son to college. However, the house is the legal property of former drug addict Kathy. After losing the house in an unfair legal dispute with the county, she is left with nowhere to go. Wanting her house back, she hires a lawyer and befriends a police officer. Neither Kathy nor Behrani have broken the law, so they find themselves involved in a difficult moral dilemma.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hLxSOukLfC4j5pNbdE7lqaw8KgL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11093'),
  ('463954849902318417', 'House of Sayuri', 2024, 'Horror', 'Koji Shiraishi, Miyuki Wakamatsu, Maki Ito', 'Mari Asato, Koji Shiraishi', 'Ryoka Minamide, Hana Kondo, Zen Kajihara, Fusako Urabe, Kitaro, Kokoro Morita, Ray Inomata, Toshie Negishi', null, 'A family moves into a house, but discover that it is haunted by a murdered girl.', 'A family moves into a house, but discover that it is haunted by a murdered girl.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b3ZlT121rjvwtUfmyF83hZ5n6te.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1265800'),
  ('291305800409863280', 'House of Spoils', 2024, 'Horror, Mystery', 'Bridget Savage Cole, Danielle Krudy, Eric Lin', 'Bridget Savage Cole, Danielle Krudy', 'Ariana DeBose, Barbie Ferreira, Arian Moayed, Marton Csokas, Amara Karan, Mikkel Bratt Silset, Gabriel Drake, Imola Gáspár', 'R', 'An ambitious chef opens a restaurant on a remote estate where she battles kitchen chaos, crushing self doubts… and a haunting presence who threatens to sabotage her at every turn.', 'An ambitious chef opens a restaurant on a remote estate where she battles kitchen chaos, crushing self doubts… and a haunting presence who threatens to sabotage her at every turn.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/udfMAdiyKhgAS47dRXEnXo6tHt6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1014661'),
  ('89197524705313305', 'House of Strangers', 1949, 'Drama, Crime, Thriller', 'Joseph L. Mankiewicz, Milton Krasner', 'Philip Yordan', 'Edward G. Robinson, Susan Hayward, Richard Conte, Luther Adler, Paul Valentine, Efrem Zimbalist Jr., Debra Paget, Hope Emerson', 'NR', 'Ruthless Italian-American banker Gino Monetti is engaged in a number of criminal activities. Three of his four grown sons refuse to help their father stay out of prison after he''s arrested for his questionable business practices. Three of them take over the business but kick their father out. Max, a lawyer, is the only son that remains loyal.', 'Ruthless Italian-American banker Gino Monetti is engaged in a number of criminal activities. Three of his four grown sons refuse to help their father stay out of prison after he''s arrested for his questionable business practices. Three of them take over the business but kick their father out. Max, a lawyer, is the only son that remains loyal.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/BrhMI1iWT4arbn7mcDkHTc0Gy6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20003'),
  ('1036404450984811948', 'House of Terror', 1960, 'Science Fiction, Horror, Comedy', 'Gilberto Martínez Solares', 'Gilberto Martínez Solares, Juan García, Fernando de Fuentes', 'Lon Chaney Jr., Germán Valdés, Yolanda Varela, Yerye Beirute, Alfredo Wally Barrón, Agustín Fernández, Óscar Ortiz de Pinedo, Consuelo Guerrero de Luna', null, 'Casimiro, night watchman at a wax museum of horrors, is even more sleepy than his usual laziness makes him - because his boss, the Professor, is secretly draining blood from him while he dozes to use in experiments in raising the dead. These haven''t worked so far, and the bodies have been waxened and placed on display in the museum to cover his crimes. His big chance seems to come, however, when he learns that the mummified body of a modern man has been found in an Egyptian sarcophagus. The professor and his two henchmen steal the body and take it back to his lab - where the experiment flops again.', 'Casimiro, night watchman at a wax museum of horrors, is even more sleepy than his usual laziness makes him - because his boss, the Professor, is secretly draining blood from him while he dozes to use in experiments in raising the dead. These haven''t worked so far, and the bodies have been waxened and placed on display in the museum to cover his crimes. His big chance seems to come, however, when he learns that the mummified body of a modern man has been found in an Egyptian sarcophagus. The professor and his two henchmen steal the body and take it back to his lab - where the experiment flops again.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zLJZdq87wBFzw9KOjlb6zK8cGeb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:199674'),
  ('701146523806941008', 'House of Terrors', 1965, 'Horror', 'Hajime Sato, Shoei Nishikawa, Katsuhiko Taguchi', 'Hajime Takaiwa', 'Kō Nishimura, Masumi Harukawa, Keiko Yumi, Yukiko Kuwahara, Yoko Hayama, Yūko Kusunoki, Takeshi Katō, Kazuo Katō', null, 'A hunchbacked caretaker presides over a forlorn mansion inhabited by the ghosts of his previous masters. An unbelieving trio (a doctor, his assistant and his niece) fail to heed the caretaker''s warnings and are slaughtered horribly by the jealous occupants.', 'A hunchbacked caretaker presides over a forlorn mansion inhabited by the ghosts of his previous masters. An unbelieving trio (a doctor, his assistant and his niece) fail to heed the caretaker''s warnings and are slaughtered horribly by the jealous occupants.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bU2HuvAaMIEOugcjRJbTe1EEIPB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:246943'),
  ('544247528195207198', 'House of the Black Death', 1965, 'Horror', 'Harold Daniels, Murray De Atley, Richard Dixon', 'Richard Mahoney', 'John Carradine, Lon Chaney Jr., Tom Drake, Dolores Faith, Andrea King, Jerome Thor, Margaret Shinn, George Mitchell André', null, 'Two brothers, both of whom are warlocks, use their powers and covens of witches to battle over the family fortune.', 'Two brothers, both of whom are warlocks, use their powers and covens of witches to battle over the family fortune.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a8EARm6x4jOubVGIqEgfszSbMiK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:108132'),
  ('21188231495854179', 'House of the Damned', 1963, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Maury Dexter', 'Harry Spalding', 'Ron Foster, Merry Anders, Richard Crane, Dal McKennon, Erika Peters, Georgia Schmidt, Stacey Winters, Richard Kiel', 'NR', 'An architect and his wife are staying in an empty castle in California. They are joined by an unhappily married lawyer and his wife. Things start getting strange when they spot a half man/half beast prowling around the house and keep seeing a headless woman wandering the grounds.', 'An architect and his wife are staying in an empty castle in California. They are joined by an unhappily married lawyer and his wife. Things start getting strange when they spot a half man/half beast prowling around the house and keep seeing a headless woman wandering the grounds.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5nRzVF9Ly1VQcMNAuSnIlDJuGoq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:98216'),
  ('326951732354873317', 'House of the Damned', 1996, 'Horror, TV Movie', 'Scott P. Levy', 'Brendan Broderick', 'Alexandra Paul, Greg Evigan, Briana Evigan, Eamonn Draper, Dick Donaghue, Mary Kate Ryan', null, 'Will and Maura, despite their marital problems, decide to come to Ireland and live on Maura''s ancestral estate, bringing with them their daughter Aubrey. But soon weird happenings around the house lead a local priest to confess that Maura''s ancestors practiced black magic, and Maura''s own insecurities threaten to bring her into the evil fold.', 'Will and Maura, despite their marital problems, decide to come to Ireland and live on Maura''s ancestral estate, bringing with them their daughter Aubrey. But soon weird happenings around the house lead a local priest to confess that Maura''s ancestors practiced black magic, and Maura''s own insecurities threaten to bring her into the evil fold.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aB2OcE6EA52WWAtbcib4xFUiFOi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:222882'),
  ('405915236580689386', 'House of the Dead', 2003, 'Horror, Action, Thriller', 'Mathias Neumann, Uwe Boll, Tara Arnett', 'Dave Parker, Mark A. Altman', 'Jonathan Cherry, Tyron Leitso, Clint Howard, Ona Grauer, Sonya Salomaa, Ellie Cornell, Erica Durance, Michael Eklund', 'R', 'On an island off the coast, a techno rave party attracts a diverse group of college coeds and a Coast Guard officer. Soon, they discover that their X-laced escapades are to be interrupted by zombies and monsters that attack them on the ground, from the air, and in the sea, ruled by an evil entity.', 'On an island off the coast, a techno rave party attracts a diverse group of college coeds and a Coast Guard officer. Soon, they discover that their X-laced escapades are to be interrupted by zombies and monsters that attack them on the ground, from the air, and in the sea, ruled by an evil entity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4x337Nt4cq6OO1Rb3HDvUofT9F0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11059'),
  ('887808942838854631', 'House of the Dead 2', 2006, 'Action, Horror, Thriller', 'Michael Hurst, Jeffrey D. Smith, Andy Hurst', 'Mark A. Altman, Peter Scheerer, Michael Roesch', 'Emmanuelle Vaugier, Ed Quinn, Sticky Fingaz, Victoria Pratt, Theo Rossi, Steve Monroe, James Parks, Dan Southworth', 'R', 'At Guesta Verde University, deranged Professor Curien is trying to revive the dead, killing students for the experiment. As such, there''s an outbreak of zombies, and the government sends a NSA medical research team, formed by Dr. Alexandra ''Nightingale'' Morgan and Lt. Ellis, with a special force leaded by Lt. Dalton, trying to get the zero sample from the first generation zombie. The team has little time to accomplish and depart before missiles are sent to destroy the area.', 'At Guesta Verde University, deranged Professor Curien is trying to revive the dead, killing students for the experiment. As such, there''s an outbreak of zombies, and the government sends a NSA medical research team, formed by Dr. Alexandra ''Nightingale'' Morgan and Lt. Ellis, with a special force leaded by Lt. Dalton, trying to get the zero sample from the first generation zombie. The team has little time to accomplish and depart before missiles are sent to destroy the area.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r95UYIFeCjIVKZ1MPxZwEHITAhg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29293'),
  ('105099352408392299', 'House of the Disappeared', 2017, 'Horror, Mystery, Thriller', 'Lim Dae-Woong', 'Jang Jae-hyun', 'Yunjin Kim, Ok Taec-yeon, Jo Jae-yun, Lee Han-wi, Park Jun-myun, Yoo In-na, Park Won-ho, Park Soo-oh', null, 'After being wrongly imprisoned for murdering her husband, a woman returns to the house where the incident occurred to solve the mystery of his death.', 'After being wrongly imprisoned for murdering her husband, a woman returns to the house where the incident occurred to solve the mystery of his death.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7zmyuKp5gqoz7bCYJGtLELumtoS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:438070'),
  ('1074909477017801888', 'House of the Long Shadows', 1983, 'Horror, Comedy, Mystery', 'Pete Walker, Paul Carney, Glynn Purcell', 'Michael Armstrong', 'Vincent Price, Christopher Lee, Peter Cushing, Desi Arnaz Jr., John Carradine, Sheila Keith, Julie Peasgood, Richard Todd', 'PG', 'An American writer goes to a remote Welsh manor on a $20,000 bet that he can write a classic novel like ''Wuthering Heights'' in 24 hours. However, upon his arrival he discovers that the apparently empty manor has several rather odd inhabitants.', 'An American writer goes to a remote Welsh manor on a $20,000 bet that he can write a classic novel like ''Wuthering Heights'' in 24 hours. However, upon his arrival he discovers that the apparently empty manor has several rather odd inhabitants.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/21ZGFNeqOSeDNhbQCuCpUupqy1U.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39164'),
  ('429320919128951560', 'House of the Rising Sun', 2011, 'Action, Thriller, Crime, Drama', 'Brian A. Miller', 'Chuck Hustmyre', 'Dave Bautista, Amy Smart, Dominic Purcell, Danny Trejo, Debra Harrison-Lowe, Ambyr Childers, Craig Fairbrass, Brian Vander Ark', 'R', 'Ray, an ex-cop, is starting a new life looking to stay out of trouble. One evening, on Ray''s watch, the nightclub he works for is robbed and the owner''s son is shot dead. As his criminal past is exposed Ray hunts for the person responsible for this crime in an effort to clear his own name. Ray must get to the bottom of this as both the mob and cops start to close in on him as their target suspect.', 'Ray, an ex-cop, is starting a new life looking to stay out of trouble. One evening, on Ray''s watch, the nightclub he works for is robbed and the owner''s son is shot dead. As his criminal past is exposed Ray hunts for the person responsible for this crime in an effort to clear his own name. Ray must get to the bottom of this as both the mob and cops start to close in on him as their target suspect.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cZLgk8f51582QUHOQpSH72sotoL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:68472'),
  ('1068888823638511489', 'House of the Sleeping Beauties', 2006, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Vadim Glowna', 'Vadim Glowna', 'Vadim Glowna, Angela Winkler, Maximilian Schell, Birol Ünel, Mona Glass, Marina Weis, Peter Luppa, Jacqueline Le Saunier', null, 'Edmond, a man in his sixties whose wife has recently passed away, is told about a secret establishment where men can spend an entire night in bed alongside beautiful, sleeping young women, who stretch, roll over and dream, but never awaken. Bedazzled by their seductive yet innocent tenderness, but distressed about the reason for their deep sleep, he delves into the mystery of the house of sleeping beauties.', 'Edmond, a man in his sixties whose wife has recently passed away, is told about a secret establishment where men can spend an entire night in bed alongside beautiful, sleeping young women, who stretch, roll over and dream, but never awaken. Bedazzled by their seductive yet innocent tenderness, but distressed about the reason for their deep sleep, he delves into the mystery of the house of sleeping beauties.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/myzmLGcvh442NhvSauKZxNdOdV5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:134018'),
  ('451528411137947291', 'House of the Witch', 2017, 'Horror, TV Movie', 'Dane Lawing, Alex Merkin', 'Neil Elman', 'Emily Bader, Michelle Randolph, Jules Hartley, Arden Belle, Grace Balbo, Jesse Pepe, Joseph Curtis Callender, Joel Nagle', null, 'A group of high-school kids set out to play a Halloween prank at an abandoned house, but once they enter they become victims of a demonic witch who has set her wrath upon them.', 'A group of high-school kids set out to play a Halloween prank at an abandoned house, but once they enter they become victims of a demonic witch who has set her wrath upon them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fSvhp22gCoHgFMDSnyhrmlo3M0k.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:480157'),
  ('359424877191342660', 'House of Traps', 1982, 'Action', 'Chang Cheh, Chiang Sheng, Cho Wai-Kei', 'Chang Cheh, Ni Kuang', 'Chin Siu-Ho, Lung Tien-hsiang, Ai Fei, Sun Chien, Phillip Kwok Chui, Chiang Sheng, Wong Lik, Ricky Cheng Tien-Chi', null, 'It all started with The Five Venoms, the internationally loved kung-fu thriller. It continued through more than a dozen bloody good entertainments featuring the same actors in different roles. This is considered the last official "Venoms" movie, but what a film it is. There''s one plasma-spurting attack after another as heroes and rogues alike try to solve the secrets of this hell house. The core Venoms themselves choreograph the gory fun in this fond farewell to their worldwide film series sensation!', 'It all started with The Five Venoms, the internationally loved kung-fu thriller. It continued through more than a dozen bloody good entertainments featuring the same actors in different roles. This is considered the last official "Venoms" movie, but what a film it is. There''s one plasma-spurting attack after another as heroes and rogues alike try to solve the secrets of this hell house. The core Venoms themselves choreograph the gory fun in this fond farewell to their worldwide film series sensation!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zCydcsdGsxbjMjQUojap0WkCWHm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64260'),
  ('202855701310327928', 'House of Usher', 1960, 'Horror, Drama', 'Floyd Crosby, Roger Corman, Jack Bohrer', 'Richard Matheson', 'Vincent Price, Mark Damon, Myrna Fahey, Harry Ellerbe, David Andar, Bill Borzage, Mario Bellini, Eleanor LeFaber', 'NR', 'Convinced that his family is tainted by generations of evil, Roderick Usher is hellbent on stopping his sister Madeline’s wedding to prevent the cursed Usher bloodline from expanding. When her fiancé Philip Winthrop arrives at the crumbling estate to claim his bride, Roderick goes to ruthless—even deadly—lengths to keep them apart.', 'Convinced that his family is tainted by generations of evil, Roderick Usher is hellbent on stopping his sister Madeline’s wedding to prevent the cursed Usher bloodline from expanding. When her fiancé Philip Winthrop arrives at the crumbling estate to claim his bride, Roderick goes to ruthless—even deadly—lengths to keep them apart.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jEzZOrGSWpl0jKOIXoY3OnEabLQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:23439'),
  ('952343454075858296', 'House of Voices', 2004, 'Horror, Mystery, Drama', 'Pascal Laugier, Pablo Rosso', 'Pascal Laugier', 'Virginie Ledoyen, Lou Doillon, Catriona MacColl, Dorina Lazăr, Virginie Darmon, Jérôme Soufflet, Marie Herry, Eric Prat', 'R', 'In 1958, in the French Alp, the young servant Anna Jurin arrives in Saint Ange Orphanage to work with Helena while the orphans moved to new families. Anna, who is secretly pregnant, meets the last orphan, Judith, left behind because of her mental problems, and they become closer when Anna find that Judith also hear voices and footsteps of children.', 'In 1958, in the French Alp, the young servant Anna Jurin arrives in Saint Ange Orphanage to work with Helena while the orphans moved to new families. Anna, who is secretly pregnant, meets the last orphan, Judith, left behind because of her mental problems, and they become closer when Anna find that Judith also hear voices and footsteps of children.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2d1JogvQG3Hcay30wo8261otfZ6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21198'),
  ('181078263068189065', 'House of Wax', 1953, 'Horror, Crime', 'André de Toth, James McMahon, Bert Glennon', 'Crane Wilbur', 'Vincent Price, Frank Lovejoy, Phyllis Kirk, Carolyn Jones, Paul Picerni, Roy Roberts, Angela Clarke, Paul Cavanagh', null, 'A sculptor opens a wax museum to showcase the likenesses of famous historical figures, but quickly runs into trouble when his business partner demands the exhibits become more extreme in order to increase profits.', 'A sculptor opens a wax museum to showcase the likenesses of famous historical figures, but quickly runs into trouble when his business partner demands the exhibits become more extreme in order to increase profits.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5Di30K5NzAtYMjBSAABwgZHV0Ro.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18573'),
  ('275596367280258827', 'House of Wax', 2005, 'Horror, Thriller, Mystery', 'Jaume Collet-Serra, Stephen F. Windon, Marc Spicer', 'Charles S. Belden', 'Elisha Cuthbert, Chad Michael Murray, Brian Van Holt, Paris Hilton, Jon Abrahams, Jared Padalecki, Robert Ri''chard, Damon Herriman', 'R', 'A group of unwitting teens are stranded near a strange wax museum and soon must fight to survive and keep from becoming the next exhibit.', 'A group of unwitting teens are stranded near a strange wax museum and soon must fight to survive and keep from becoming the next exhibit.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aCLSgw1DaqkRvosYc3YUttBTtpT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10066'),
  ('756029615568568934', 'House of Whipcord', 1974, 'Horror', 'Pete Walker, Peter Jessop, Brian Lawrence', 'David McGillivray', 'Barbara Markham, Patrick Barr, Ray Brooks, Ann Michelle, Karan David, Sheila Keith, Penny Irving, Dorothy Gordon', null, 'Somewhere in the middle of the English countryside a former judge and a group of former prison warders, including his lover, run their own prison for young women who have not been held properly to account for their crimes. Here they mete out their own form of justice and ensure that the girls never return to their old ways.', 'Somewhere in the middle of the English countryside a former judge and a group of former prison warders, including his lover, run their own prison for young women who have not been held properly to account for their crimes. Here they mete out their own form of justice and ensure that the girls never return to their old ways.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yTqBvDPRoF0d1RnDXjg9GDNW0Jc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:86643'),
  ('748787889109265784', 'House on Bare Mountain', 1962, 'Comedy, Horror', 'Lee Frost, Wes Bishop, Gregory Sandor', 'Denver Scott', 'Bob Cresse, Laine Carlin, Leticia Cooper, Laura Eden, Connie Hudson, Dan Hyland, William Kirk, Ingrid Lind', 'NR', 'The Wolfman, Dracula and Frankenstein spy on a girls'' school in the mountains, where most of the girls spend their time sunbathing in the nude, nude exercises and nude art classes. The monsters finally invade the school…', 'The Wolfman, Dracula and Frankenstein spy on a girls'' school in the mountains, where most of the girls spend their time sunbathing in the nude, nude exercises and nude art classes. The monsters finally invade the school…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vMk57IXfVDm7aq81JmXZXSmhNjB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67795'),
