  ('125671775198662487', 'House on Haunted Hill', 1959, 'Horror, Mystery', 'William Castle, Carl E. Guthrie, Jack R. Berne', 'Robb White', 'Vincent Price, Carol Ohmart, Richard Long, Alan Marshal, Carolyn Craig, Elisha Cook Jr., Julie Mitchum, Leona Anderson', 'NR', 'Frederick Loren invites five strangers to the party of a lifetime and offers each of them $10,000 if they can stay the night in the reportedly haunted house. Armed with a gun for protection, each guest arrives in a hearse and will either leave in it much richer…Or dead.', 'Frederick Loren invites five strangers to the party of a lifetime and offers each of them $10,000 if they can stay the night in the reportedly haunted house. Armed with a gun for protection, each guest arrives in a hearse and will either leave in it much richer…Or dead.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g5kdFt3piV3w1pG65W9sSToJ7HB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15856'),
