  ('936377555310162316', 'House Specialty', 1978, 'Comedy', 'Sophie Tatischeff', 'Sophie Tatischeff', 'Dominique Lavanant, Gilberte Géniat', null, 'Sophie Tatischeff''s short film set in the small town of Sainte-Sévère-sur-Indre, three decades after its use in her father''s film ''Jour de Fête''. The conversation from a typical village bar is transplanted to a patisserie with particularly tempting tartlets: ''No reason for us not to have another'' says one habitué; ''no more for me thanks,'' says another. ''A shortbread at this time of day?'' asks the woman behind the counter.', 'Sophie Tatischeff''s short film set in the small town of Sainte-Sévère-sur-Indre, three decades after its use in her father''s film ''Jour de Fête''. The conversation from a typical village bar is transplanted to a patisserie with particularly tempting tartlets: ''No reason for us not to have another'' says one habitué; ''no more for me thanks,'' says another. ''A shortbread at this time of day?'' asks the woman behind the counter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zHSrMtJ5L9OBiAL7J4QPn7XoJrc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:283079'),
