  ('1114835379642986974', 'Housewarming', 2005, 'Comedy', 'Brigitte Roüan, Christophe Pollock', 'Éric Besnard, Philippe Galland, Jean-François Goyet', 'Carole Bouquet, Jean-Pierre Castaldi, Didier Flamand, Françoise Brion, Aldo Maccione, Marcial Di Fonzo Bo, Alvaro Llanos, Carlos Gasca', null, 'Chantal, an advocate involved in defending homeless illegal immigrant, decides to refurbish her flat. Following her convictions she calls Columbian workers led by an unforeseeable architect. In the mean time a former client decides he is in love with her, her son and daughter are becoming nearly homeless since the flat''s walls are demolished, the architect has new plans every day, an irregular workers fall in love with Chantal too and dance with her daughter, Martin (the son) still continue to roller blade around... Could the works go forward in this mess?', 'Chantal, an advocate involved in defending homeless illegal immigrant, decides to refurbish her flat. Following her convictions she calls Columbian workers led by an unforeseeable architect. In the mean time a former client decides he is in love with her, her son and daughter are becoming nearly homeless since the flat''s walls are demolished, the architect has new plans every day, an irregular workers fall in love with Chantal too and dance with her daughter, Martin (the son) still continue to roller blade around... Could the works go forward in this mess?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2Df7GRfppR57GJ5BB5Sf7Dtm7nW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:57714'),
  ('374756774613742313', 'Housewife', 1934, 'Drama', 'Alfred E. Green, William Rees', 'Manuel Seff, Lillie Hayward', 'George Brent, Ann Dvorak, Bette Davis, John Halliday, Ruth Donnelly, Hobart Cavanaugh, Robert Barrat, Joseph Cawthorn', null, 'Nan Reynolds encourages her copywriter husband Bill to open his own agency. Nearly out of business, he finally gets a client. Former girlfriend Patricia Berkeley writes a very successful commercial for the client and neats up their old romance. Wife and girlfriend struggle over Bill.', 'Nan Reynolds encourages her copywriter husband Bill to open his own agency. Nearly out of business, he finally gets a client. Former girlfriend Patricia Berkeley writes a very successful commercial for the client and neats up their old romance. Wife and girlfriend struggle over Bill.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6vm8bDG8wr8adyG5V0pWFWm826G.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:173267'),
  ('175426135879562447', 'Housing Problems', 1935, 'Documentary', 'Edgar Anstey, Arthur Elton, John Taylor', null, 'Mrs. Reddington', null, 'The problem of slum dwellings in the 1930s.', 'The problem of slum dwellings in the 1930s.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ygbeuldnaU8fcnKxbSWPh1zFQOY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:128231'),
  ('914454580502484860', 'Hovering Over the Water', 2013, 'Drama, Romance', 'João César Monteiro, Pedro Ruivo, Acácio de Almeida', 'João César Monteiro', 'Laura Morante, Philip J. Spinelli, Manuela de Freitas, Georges Claisse, Teresa Villaverde, Sérgio Antunes, Rita Figueiredo, Frederick Ooms', null, 'Laura Rossellini, a widow from Rome, vacations on the Algarve coast one hot summer. One day while sunbathing, she finds a wounded man named Robert drifting in the surf on a rubber raft. She takes him home, and, after he is revived, learns his story. As they talk, their mutual attraction grows, until a group of armed men suddenly arrive looking for Robert.', 'Laura Rossellini, a widow from Rome, vacations on the Algarve coast one hot summer. One day while sunbathing, she finds a wounded man named Robert drifting in the surf on a rubber raft. She takes him home, and, after he is revived, learns his story. As they talk, their mutual attraction grows, until a group of armed men suddenly arrive looking for Robert.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8yeXvrsrLUIlg96YDFveC3Lm1h2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:83229'),
  ('483652605471219723', 'How a Mosquito Operates', 1912, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Winsor McCay', 'Winsor McCay', null, null, 'A hungry mosquito spots and follows a man on his way home. The mosquito slips into the room where the man is sleeping, and gets ready for a meal. His first attempts startle the man and wake him up, but the mosquito is very persistent.', 'A hungry mosquito spots and follows a man on his way home. The mosquito slips into the room where the man is sleeping, and gets ready for a meal. His first attempts startle the man and wake him up, but the mosquito is very persistent.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oTUF1sxnYGpDemxzafxNegH8kRt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:128973'),
  ('1067665198028331505', 'How a Sausage Dog Works', 1972, 'Animation', 'Julian Józef Antonisz, Jan Tkaczyk', 'Julian Józef Antonisz', null, null, 'Polish animated short film that uses unconventional film techniques such as cut-out, drawing, filming miscible fluids and scratched images. Also uses non-camera technique such as drawing directly on film. The film is a humorous lecture on the internal structure of a dachshund. Parodying popular lectures at the same time, it contains a message about the superiority of the products of living organisms'' techniques and calls for respect for the environment.', 'Polish animated short film that uses unconventional film techniques such as cut-out, drawing, filming miscible fluids and scratched images. Also uses non-camera technique such as drawing directly on film. The film is a humorous lecture on the internal structure of a dachshund. Parodying popular lectures at the same time, it contains a message about the superiority of the products of living organisms'' techniques and calls for respect for the environment.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xaquneuagUdzx8IfWlRX12813xV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:291224'),
  ('688919354594629408', 'How About Adolf?', 2018, 'Comedy', 'Sönke Wortmann, Jo Heim', 'Alexander Dydyna, Claudius Pläging', 'Christoph Maria Herbst, Florian David Fitz, Caroline Peters, Justus von Dohnányi, Janina Uhse, Iris Berben, Serkan Kaya', null, 'The family dinner at Stephan and Elisabeth could have been wonderful. But when Thomas announces that he and his pregnant girlfriend Anna are going to call their son Adolf, the hosts and the family friend René are stuck in the throat.', 'The family dinner at Stephan and Elisabeth could have been wonderful. But when Thomas announces that he and his pregnant girlfriend Anna are going to call their son Adolf, the hosts and the family friend René are stuck in the throat.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uJ8MvRQdlCIvqKiRBwW9Zxxa9N7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:514124'),
