  ('476470415833457096', 'How Angels are Born', 1996, 'Drama, Crime', 'Murilo Salles, César Charlone', 'Jorge Durán, Murilo Salles, Aguinaldo Silva', 'Priscila Assum, Sílvio Guindane, Larry Pine, Ryan Massey, André Mattos, Enrique Díaz, Fernando Almeida, Maria Silvia', null, 'Two children flee together with a grown up from a slum in Rio because this man had problems with the local drug lord. They end up in the house where a rich American citizen lives with his daughter.', 'Two children flee together with a grown up from a slum in Rio because this man had problems with the local drug lord. They end up in the house where a rich American citizen lives with his daughter.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5YfWlTKCvl7YKbqNgA0llBgPIIR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:231223'),
  ('48858096681074686', 'How Awful About Allan', 1970, 'Thriller, TV Movie, Horror', 'Curtis Harrington, Fleet Southcott', null, 'Anthony Perkins, Julie Harris, Joan Hackett, Kent Smith, Robert H. Harris, Molly Dodd, Billy Bowles, Bill Erwin', 'PG', 'After an eight-month stay in a mental hospital, a tormented man comes home to live with his sister; but a mysterious boarder may be trying to kill him.', 'After an eight-month stay in a mental hospital, a tormented man comes home to live with his sister; but a mysterious boarder may be trying to kill him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cr6HZiuYl733T5a7ekzXgS16hz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:71944'),
  ('834415461978116320', 'How Bruce Lee Changed the World', 2009, 'Documentary', 'Steve Webb, James Mathers', 'Steve Webb', 'Bruce Lee, Linda Lee Cadwell, Charles Parnell, Shannon Lee, Jackie Chan, Donnie Yen, Yuen Wah, John Woo', null, 'More than just a biography, this film explores Bruce Lee''s global impact to see how he has influenced all areas of popular culture including fitness, cinema, music, sport, dance, video games and philosophy. A journey across the United States, Asia and Europe, takes Shannon Lee on a trip back to her father''s roots in Hong Kong and China. With unique access to the family''s photographic archive, home movies and all material owned by the Bruce Lee Foundation.', 'More than just a biography, this film explores Bruce Lee''s global impact to see how he has influenced all areas of popular culture including fitness, cinema, music, sport, dance, video games and philosophy. A journey across the United States, Asia and Europe, takes Shannon Lee on a trip back to her father''s roots in Hong Kong and China. With unique access to the family''s photographic archive, home movies and all material owned by the Bruce Lee Foundation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7Ogaw7mCHBPocOzYCl0Rc6UAAc3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40572'),
  ('967969201020690549', 'How Do I Know It''s Sunday', 1934, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Friz Freleng', null, 'Rochelle Hudson', null, 'Inside a general store, the products all come to life and happily sing the title song. An Eskimo falls for a cookie and has to come to the rescue when a swarm of flies invades.', 'Inside a general store, the products all come to life and happily sing the title song. An Eskimo falls for a cookie and has to come to the rescue when a swarm of flies invades.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gSg1flzmA1wJxrOdeBONYUugrBS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:174506'),
  ('956245100547697196', 'How Do You Know', 2010, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'James L. Brooks, Aldric La''Auli Porter, Maggie Murphy', 'James L. Brooks', 'Reese Witherspoon, Paul Rudd, Owen Wilson, Jack Nicholson, Kathryn Hahn, Molly Price, Shelley Conn, Tony Shalhoub', 'PG-13', 'After being cut from the USA softball team and feeling a bit past her prime, Lisa finds herself evaluating her life and in the middle of a love triangle, as a corporate guy in crisis competes with her current, baseball-playing beau.', 'After being cut from the USA softball team and feeling a bit past her prime, Lisa finds herself evaluating her life and in the middle of a love triangle, as a corporate guy in crisis competes with her current, baseball-playing beau.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jbOnp79eUZxQHgcdnTIRlxel1dE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42888'),
  ('1136100296733787576', 'How Do You Measure a Year?', 2021, 'Documentary', 'Thomas Logoreci, Jay Rosenblatt, Jay Rosenblatt', null, 'Ella Rosenblatt, Jay Rosenblatt', 'G', 'For 17 years, filmmaker Jay Rosenblatt filmed his daughter Ella on her birthday in the same spot, asking her the same questions. In just 29 minutes, we watch her grow from a toddler to a young woman with all the beautiful and sometimes awkward stages in between. Each phase is captured fleetingly but makes an indelible mark. Her responses to her father’s questions are just a backdrop for a deeper story of parental love, acceptance, and ultimately, independence.', 'For 17 years, filmmaker Jay Rosenblatt filmed his daughter Ella on her birthday in the same spot, asking her the same questions. In just 29 minutes, we watch her grow from a toddler to a young woman with all the beautiful and sometimes awkward stages in between. Each phase is captured fleetingly but makes an indelible mark. Her responses to her father’s questions are just a backdrop for a deeper story of parental love, acceptance, and ultimately, independence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hoe1yeyRXbDFZXCxCQCxClGgh5y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:846854'),
  ('718929560113515599', 'How Far, How Near', 1972, 'Drama', 'Tadeusz Konwicki, Mieczysław Jahoda, Krystyna Krupska-Wysocka', 'Tadeusz Konwicki', 'Andrzej Łapicki, Gustaw Holoubek, Maja Komorowska, Anna Dymna, Alicja Jachiewicz, Ewa Krzyżewska, Ewa Lemańska, Jerzy Cnota', null, 'A middle-aged man sets out on a symbolic journey through past, present, and future to learn why an old friend committed suicide, and learns much about his own life along the way.', 'A middle-aged man sets out on a symbolic journey through past, present, and future to learn why an old friend committed suicide, and learns much about his own life along the way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A5mbpfJ5kxHfyf4hW5UWFmDzy2z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:259645'),
  ('271381101698688105', 'How Fernando Pessoa Saved Portugal', 2018, 'Comedy', 'Eugène Green, Raphaël O''Byrne, Patrick Mendes', 'Eugène Green', 'Carloto Cotta, Manuel Mozos, Diogo Dória, Alexandre Pieroni Calado, Ricardo Gross, Mia Tomé, Eugène Green, Zé Branco', null, 'Lisbon, Portugal, 1927. The writer and journalist Fernando Pessoa accepts from his boss the commission to create an advertising slogan for the drink Coca-Louca; but conservative government authorities consider the new drink as revolutionary as it is diabolical.', 'Lisbon, Portugal, 1927. The writer and journalist Fernando Pessoa accepts from his boss the commission to create an advertising slogan for the drink Coca-Louca; but conservative government authorities consider the new drink as revolutionary as it is diabolical.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kG9nHXLLgZ0Y7uwntFtXI9h66kg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:537109'),
  ('395937754382339283', 'How Funny Can Sex Be?', 1973, 'Comedy', 'Alfio Contini, Dino Risi', 'Ruggero Maccari, Dino Risi', 'Giancarlo Giannini, Laura Antonelli, Alberto Lionello, Duilio Del Prete, Paola Borboni, Carla Mancini, Lino Puglisi, Cinzia Romanazzi', 'R', 'A nine-episode anthology film about love, sex, and marriage in contemporary, mid-''70s Italy.', 'A nine-episode anthology film about love, sex, and marriage in contemporary, mid-''70s Italy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ma8qHcjM5d2HPLrzYDsmH6YrAiS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:180719'),
  ('388541377567248484', 'How Good to See You Alive', 1989, 'Drama, Documentary, History', 'Lúcia Murat, Adolfo Orico Rosenthal, Walter Carvalho', 'Lúcia Murat', 'Irene Ravache, Maria do Carmo Brito, Estrela Bohadana, Maria Luiza Garcia Rosa, Rosalina Santa Cruz, Criméia Almeida, Regina Toscano, Jessie Jane', null, 'Four years after a military coup overthrew the Brazilian government in 1964, all civil rights were suspended and torture became a systematic practice. Using a mix of fiction and documentary this extraordinary film is a searing record of personal memory, political repression and the will to survive. Interviews with eight women who were political prisoners during the military dictatorship are framed by the fantasies and imaginings of an anonymous character, portrayed by actress Irene Ravache.', 'Four years after a military coup overthrew the Brazilian government in 1964, all civil rights were suspended and torture became a systematic practice. Using a mix of fiction and documentary this extraordinary film is a searing record of personal memory, political repression and the will to survive. Interviews with eight women who were political prisoners during the military dictatorship are framed by the fantasies and imaginings of an anonymous character, portrayed by actress Irene Ravache.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mXfLm8yQfjytKmgDkzoXGdCx43H.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:262623'),
  ('120760573997316007', 'How Green Was My Valley', 1941, 'Drama', 'John Ford, Arthur C. Miller, Gene Bryant', 'Philip Dunne', 'Walter Pidgeon, Maureen O''Hara, Anna Lee, Donald Crisp, Roddy McDowall, John Loder, Sara Allgood, Barry Fitzgerald', 'NR', 'Huw Morgan, the academically inclined youngest son in a proud family of Welsh coal miners, witnesses the tumultuous events of his young life during a period of rapid social change. At the dawn of the 20th-century, a miners'' strike divides the Morgans: the sons demand improvements, and the father doesn''t want to rock the boat.', 'Huw Morgan, the academically inclined youngest son in a proud family of Welsh coal miners, witnesses the tumultuous events of his young life during a period of rapid social change. At the dawn of the 20th-century, a miners'' strike divides the Morgans: the sons demand improvements, and the father doesn''t want to rock the boat.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8N7OmxBqjRVUrqergUduGgr6exy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43266'),
  ('913141908493401478', 'How He Missed His Train', 1900, 'Comedy', 'Georges Méliès', null, null, null, 'A man misses his train due to his clothes turning into other types of clothes.', 'A man misses his train due to his clothes turning into other types of clothes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1tiLrYzpktFOTLc0XDAcwIz716R.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:106815'),
  ('247427173316875685', 'How High', 2001, 'Comedy', 'Jesse Dylan, Francis Kenny, Mark Anthony Little', 'Dustin Lee Abraham', 'Method Man, Redman, Obba Babatundé, Mike Epps, Anna Maria Horsford, Fred Willard, Jeffrey Jones, Héctor Elizondo', 'R', 'Jamal and Silas, two ordinary guys who smoke something magical, pass their college entrance exams with flying colors and end up at Harvard. Ivy League ways are strange but Silas and Jamal take it in a stride -- until their supply of supernatural smoke runs dry. That''s when they have to start living by their wits and rely on their natural resources to make the grade.', 'Jamal and Silas, two ordinary guys who smoke something magical, pass their college entrance exams with flying colors and end up at Harvard. Ivy League ways are strange but Silas and Jamal take it in a stride -- until their supply of supernatural smoke runs dry. That''s when they have to start living by their wits and rely on their natural resources to make the grade.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qWF784YqUZE8KhbBfuqhMSzmUPs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8386'),
  ('65120369287412260', 'How High 2', 2019, 'Comedy, TV Movie', 'Bruce Leddy, Mathew Rudenberg', 'Shawn Ries, Neel Shah, Artie Johann', 'D.C. Young Fly, Lil Yachty, Alyssa Goss, DeRay Davis, Anya Monzikova, Justine Skye, Nathan Anderson, Chris Cavalier', 'NR', 'When two jobless friends discover a hidden weed bible and the ultimate bud, they think that they’ve got it made…with ''seed'' money to start a new snack delivery app. But, when nearly all of their stash and weed bible are stolen, the two potpreneurs set off on an outrageous, mind-bending adventure through Atlanta to find them. Stoned with supernatural powers, they search ''high'' and low, stopping at nothing to recover their ticket to starting a legit business.', 'When two jobless friends discover a hidden weed bible and the ultimate bud, they think that they’ve got it made…with ''seed'' money to start a new snack delivery app. But, when nearly all of their stash and weed bible are stolen, the two potpreneurs set off on an outrageous, mind-bending adventure through Atlanta to find them. Stoned with supernatural powers, they search ''high'' and low, stopping at nothing to recover their ticket to starting a legit business.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7eYIWzBQGdB955PnHyPxXrseXFK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:532327'),
  ('911988064862021024', 'How High Is Up?', 1940, 'Comedy', 'Del Lord', 'Elwood Ullman', 'Curly Howard, Larry Fine, Moe Howard, Bruce Bennett, Edmund Cobb, Vernon Dent, Marjorie Kane, Sam Lufkin', null, 'The stooges are the ''Minute Menders'', three tinkers who live under their car. The boys decide to drum up some business by punching holes in the unattended lunch boxes of some workmen. When they''re caught in the act, they escape and accidentally get hired as riveters on a new building, working on the 97th floor. Their ineptitude and lousy workmanship screw up construction of the building and they must parachute off the building to escape the wrath of the boss.', 'The stooges are the ''Minute Menders'', three tinkers who live under their car. The boys decide to drum up some business by punching holes in the unattended lunch boxes of some workmen. When they''re caught in the act, they escape and accidentally get hired as riveters on a new building, working on the 97th floor. Their ineptitude and lousy workmanship screw up construction of the building and they must parachute off the building to escape the wrath of the boss.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o6NJZeMi9KLQkhs6LgLEIFhll02.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:114630'),
  ('853607641384166441', 'How I Became a Gangster', 2019, 'Crime, Action', 'Bartek Cierlica, Gniewko Falana, Maciej Kawulski', 'Krzysztof Gureczny', 'Marcin Kowalczyk, Tomasz Włosok, Natalia Szroeder, Natalia Siwiec, Jan Frycz, Adam Woronowicz, Adam Bobik, Piotr Rogucki', null, 'The action of the film begins in the 1970s – even then, the young protagonist knows that adrenaline tastes better than powdered milk. Over time, he also discovers a desire for money, power, and being above the law. A transformation begins, and his gangster talent blossoms. Together with a friend, they build their own army.', 'The action of the film begins in the 1970s – even then, the young protagonist knows that adrenaline tastes better than powdered milk. Over time, he also discovers a desire for money, power, and being above the law. A transformation begins, and his gangster talent blossoms. Together with a friend, they build their own army.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oEvk45mBpE6s6wmIjvCTbdaMMpB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:660033'),
  ('399193439614745865', 'How I Became a Superhero', 2020, 'Science Fiction, Adventure, Action, Comedy, Thriller', 'Nicolas Loir, Douglas Attal', 'Cédric Anger, Douglas Attal, Charlotte Sanson', 'Pio Marmaï, Vimala Pons, Benoît Poelvoorde, Leïla Bekhti, Swann Arlaud, Gilles Cohen, Léonie Souchaud, Camille Japy', null, 'Paris 2020. While superheroes have assimilated into the Parisian society, they discover a new drug that gives themselves personal superpowers to mere mortals. Lieutenants Moreau and Schaltzmann are investigating the case with the support of two ex-superheroes, Monte Carlo and Callista. They''ll do whatever it takes to dismantle the traffic. But Moreau''s past resurfaces, and the investigation becomes more complicated.', 'Paris 2020. While superheroes have assimilated into the Parisian society, they discover a new drug that gives themselves personal superpowers to mere mortals. Lieutenants Moreau and Schaltzmann are investigating the case with the support of two ex-superheroes, Monte Carlo and Callista. They''ll do whatever it takes to dismantle the traffic. But Moreau''s past resurfaces, and the investigation becomes more complicated.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d0wn9YtEnmbucx8ZUsT918ctoiK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:641501'),
  ('204070774339603155', 'How I Ended This Summer', 2010, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Pavel Kostomarov, Alexey Popogrebsky, Vladimir Golovnitsky', 'Alexey Popogrebsky', 'Grigoriy Dobrygin, Sergey Puskepalis, Artyom Tsukanov, Igor Chernevich, Ilya Sobolev', null, 'A polar station on a desolate island in the Arctic Ocean. Sergei, a seasoned meteorologist, and Pavel, a recent college graduate, are spending months in complete isolation on the once strategic research base. Pavel receives an important radio message and is still trying to find the right moment to tell Sergei, when fear, lies and suspicions start poisoning the atmosphere...', 'A polar station on a desolate island in the Arctic Ocean. Sergei, a seasoned meteorologist, and Pavel, a recent college graduate, are spending months in complete isolation on the once strategic research base. Pavel receives an important radio message and is still trying to find the right moment to tell Sergei, when fear, lies and suspicions start poisoning the atmosphere...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vQIyeQ4l1jcJwylA0u0zsNoeEj3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38325'),
  ('684093660783732775', 'How I Fell in Love with a Gangster', 2022, 'Crime, Action, Drama', 'Maciej Kawulski, Bartek Cierlica, Joanna Ślesicka', 'Krzysztof Gureczny, Maciej Kawulski', 'Tomasz Włosok, Aleks Kurdzielewicz, Antoni Królikowski, Agnieszka Grochowska, Magdalena Lamparska, Krystyna Janda, Klaudiusz Kaufmann, Eryk Lubos', 'NR', 'A mysterious woman recounts the rise and fall of Nikodem "Nikoś" Skotarczak, one of the biggest gangsters in Poland''s history. Inspired by a true story.', 'A mysterious woman recounts the rise and fall of Nikodem "Nikoś" Skotarczak, one of the biggest gangsters in Poland''s history. Inspired by a true story.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9RnGB9eX6zEF4GDfYTvWHznyBUZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:809972'),
  ('152964313647890852', 'How I Got Into College', 1989, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Savage Steve Holland, Robert Elswit', 'Terrel Seltzer', 'Anthony Edwards, Corey Parker, Lara Flynn Boyle, Finn Carter, Charles Rocket, Christopher Rydell, Gary Owens, Brian Doyle-Murray', 'PG-13', 'High school senior Marlon Bowne is smitten with overachieving classmate Jessica Kailo. But, if he wants to have a shot with her, he''ll have to find a way to get into Ramsey College, Jessica''s top choice of schools. It won''t be easy, since the college is highly selective and Marlon''s grades are hardly impressive. That means the lovelorn teen will have to find a way to score high on the SATs and win over the college admissions committee.', 'High school senior Marlon Bowne is smitten with overachieving classmate Jessica Kailo. But, if he wants to have a shot with her, he''ll have to find a way to get into Ramsey College, Jessica''s top choice of schools. It won''t be easy, since the college is highly selective and Marlon''s grades are hardly impressive. That means the lovelorn teen will have to find a way to score high on the SATs and win over the college admissions committee.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hm2sHodii3Av5OLRKFr1m3hdPzw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27307'),
  ('621042592186962019', 'How I Killed My Father', 2001, 'Drama', 'Anne Fontaine, Jean-Marc Fabre', 'Jacques Fieschi, Anne Fontaine', 'Michel Bouquet, Charles Berling, Natacha Régnier, Amira Casar, Stéphane Guillon, François Berléand, Hubert Koundé, Karole Rocher', null, 'When his long-time disappeared father is entering his life again, Jean-Luc, a successful doctor, has no option but to face his own life story. Will he ever be able to forget and forgive?', 'When his long-time disappeared father is entering his life again, Jean-Luc, a successful doctor, has no option but to face his own life story. Will he ever be able to forget and forgive?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cdTmOhfLMMTJn4mSXhX01pvxPlM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:60608'),
  ('252949574595194171', 'How I Live Now', 2013, 'Drama, Romance, Science Fiction', 'Kevin Macdonald, Franz Lustig', 'Jeremy Brock, Penelope Skinner, Tony Grisoni', 'Saoirse Ronan, George MacKay, Tom Holland, Harley Bird, Danny McEvoy, Anna Chancellor, Corey Johnson, Darren Morfitt', 'R', 'An American girl, sent to the English countryside to stay with relatives, finds love and purpose while fighting for her survival as war envelops the world around her.', 'An American girl, sent to the English countryside to stay with relatives, finds love and purpose while fighting for her survival as war envelops the world around her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/63TMTCmz6Z0qpE21CDgwwTrZAzI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:162215'),
  ('48976356267942048', 'How I Met Your Father', 2008, 'Comedy', 'Álex Montoya', 'Álex Montoya', 'Irene Anula, Iñaki Ardanaz', null, 'Every couple has two stories: the one they tell their children... and the real one.', 'Every couple has two stories: the one they tell their children... and the real one.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1QJ2ooSZ6Ij6oPVyYtp7HLieW6f.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:316866'),
  ('696926421823645663', 'How I Taught Myself to Be a Child', 2019, 'Adventure, Family, Drama, Comedy', 'Rupert Henning', 'Uli Brée, Rupert Henning', 'Karl Markovics, Sabine Timoteo, André Wilms, Valentin Hagg, Udo Samel, Harald Schrott, Stefan Puntigam, Christian Schiesser', null, 'Paul Silberstein, youngest son of an urbane but deeply strange old Austrian dynasty of confectionery millionaires, discovers the power of love and humor - and also his own extraordinary ability to shape his realities. Based on the motives of the short story with the same name by André Heller.', 'Paul Silberstein, youngest son of an urbane but deeply strange old Austrian dynasty of confectionery millionaires, discovers the power of love and humor - and also his own extraordinary ability to shape his realities. Based on the motives of the short story with the same name by André Heller.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jNkUZa5axEacxgUEXZ0ZvBNZBQX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:591350'),
  ('825967785588872773', 'How I Unleashed World War II, Part I: The Escape', 1970, 'Comedy, War, Adventure', 'Tadeusz Chmielewski, Jerzy Stawicki, Romuald Staszkiewicz', 'Tadeusz Chmielewski', 'Marian Kociniak, Janina Borońska, Adam Cyprian, Wirgiliusz Gryń, Zdzisław Kuźniar, Józef Łodyński, Jarosław Skulski, Tomasz Zaliwski', null, 'On the night of August 31, 1939, Dolas, from a platoon reinforcing a train station on the German border, falls asleep in a train car and unknowingly crosses into Germany. The moment he shoots a German, who he thinks is a saboteur, the German invasion of Poland begins, and Dolas is convinced it was his fault. He is taken to Stalag POW camp, the first destination in his odyssey around Europe.', 'On the night of August 31, 1939, Dolas, from a platoon reinforcing a train station on the German border, falls asleep in a train car and unknowingly crosses into Germany. The moment he shoots a German, who he thinks is a saboteur, the German invasion of Poland begins, and Dolas is convinced it was his fault. He is taken to Stalag POW camp, the first destination in his odyssey around Europe.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2smM51Pz6Bt2jjabd7UPyVkM4wu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:75011'),
  ('155067813779888270', 'How I Unleashed World War II, Part II: Following the Arms', 1970, 'Comedy, Adventure, War', 'Tadeusz Chmielewski, Jerzy Stawicki, Halina Chmielewska', 'Tadeusz Chmielewski', 'Marian Kociniak, Krystyna Borowicz, Anna Gębicka, Piotr Fronczewski, Wacław Kowalski, Kazimierz Rudzki, Jan Świderski, Leonard Andrzejewski', null, 'After escaping across Europe from Stalag camp, Dolas''s ride to Cyprus is stopped when his ship in sunk by an Italian submarine. Although he and some of his fellow sailors are rescued by an Allied ship, they find themselves conscripted into the French Foreign Legion in Beirut, Dolas becoming a cook.', 'After escaping across Europe from Stalag camp, Dolas''s ride to Cyprus is stopped when his ship in sunk by an Italian submarine. Although he and some of his fellow sailors are rescued by an Allied ship, they find themselves conscripted into the French Foreign Legion in Beirut, Dolas becoming a cook.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wefaG7zZ5ivfGkDSwk1r9rqPwJ3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16238'),
  ('163759919812767671', 'How I Unleashed World War II, Part III: Among Friends', 1970, 'Comedy, Adventure, War', 'Tadeusz Chmielewski, Jerzy Stawicki, Konrad Paradowski', 'Tadeusz Chmielewski', 'Marian Kociniak, Joanna Jędryka, Małgorzata Pritulak, Wirgiliusz Gryń, Kazimierz Fabisiak, Konrad Morawski, Zygmunt Zintel, Halina Buyno-Łoza', null, 'Disguised as an Italian medic, Dolas finds himself on a ship evacuating wounded Axis soldiers to Italy. He leaves the ship disguised as a Nazi soldier, but is found out, declared a deserter and sent to the Eastern Front. However, on the flight to Russia, he is able to escape with a parachute, and finds himself back in Poland, now occupied by Nazis.', 'Disguised as an Italian medic, Dolas finds himself on a ship evacuating wounded Axis soldiers to Italy. He leaves the ship disguised as a Nazi soldier, but is found out, declared a deserter and sent to the Eastern Front. However, on the flight to Russia, he is able to escape with a parachute, and finds himself back in Poland, now occupied by Nazis.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3UaRR9vc4vgXWldQtE0aoBcPuRQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:75015'),
  ('635560492788066257', 'How I Won the War', 1967, 'Comedy, War', 'Richard Lester, José López Rodero, David Watkin', 'Charles Wood', 'Michael Crawford, John Lennon, Roy Kinnear, Lee Montague, Jack MacGowran, Michael Hordern, Jack Hedley, Ronald Lacey', 'NR', 'An inept British WWII commander leads his troops to a series of misadventures in North Africa and Europe.', 'An inept British WWII commander leads his troops to a series of misadventures in North Africa and Europe.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m3m6WC9JEKpCNht26OcFEDVU3V1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29048'),
  ('973621169767707741', 'How Ikea Plunders the Planet', 2024, 'Documentary', 'Xavier Deleu, Marianne Kerfriden', 'Xavier Deleu, Robert Schmidt, Alexander Abdelilah', 'Gabriel Paun, Jean Vocat', null, 'Investigative journalists working for Disclose spent over a year investigating the production chain of the furniture giant which generated a 44.6 billion euros revenue in 2022 and attracts over 5 billion visitors to its stores and website every year. From the boreal forests of Sweden to Brazilian plantations and New Zealand coastlines, they uncovered how IKEA intensively exploits wood around the world, fuels the illegal trafficking of this resource and threatens the last precious European forests. Long overlooked, intensive logging is now sparking outrage and anger among citizens in Poland and the Baltic countries, who are increasingly concerned about the fate of their countries'' public forest domains and biodiversity loss. In Romania, where IKEA owns 50,000 hectares of forests, activists are risking their lives mobilizing against the timber mafia. This film tells the expansion of a discreet forest predator, grappling with the limits of the planet''s resources.', 'Investigative journalists working for Disclose spent over a year investigating the production chain of the furniture giant which generated a 44.6 billion euros revenue in 2022 and attracts over 5 billion visitors to its stores and website every year. From the boreal forests of Sweden to Brazilian plantations and New Zealand coastlines, they uncovered how IKEA intensively exploits wood around the world, fuels the illegal trafficking of this resource and threatens the last precious European forests. Long overlooked, intensive logging is now sparking outrage and anger among citizens in Poland and the Baltic countries, who are increasingly concerned about the fate of their countries'' public forest domains and biodiversity loss. In Romania, where IKEA owns 50,000 hectares of forests, activists are risking their lives mobilizing against the timber mafia. This film tells the expansion of a discreet forest predator, grappling with the limits of the planet''s resources.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1PY4C4VbxHeQPN3rdFVaNFQYmkj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1239993'),
  ('331172448887383960', 'How It Ends', 2018, 'Science Fiction, Thriller, Mystery, Action, Adventure', 'David M. Rosenthal, Peter Flinckenberg', 'Brooks McLaren', 'Theo James, Forest Whitaker, Kat Graham, Kerry Bishé, Grace Dove, Mark O''Brien, Nicole Ari Parker, Nancy Sorel', null, 'A desperate father tries to return home to his pregnant wife after a mysterious apocalyptic event turns everything to chaos.', 'A desperate father tries to return home to his pregnant wife after a mysterious apocalyptic event turns everything to chaos.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/prdFM08mGvVDA6uQxKJh8n8Vek1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:475210'),
  ('1010239941093764915', 'How It Ends', 2021, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Daryl Wein, Zoe Lister-Jones, Tyler Beus', 'Zoe Lister-Jones, Daryl Wein', 'Zoe Lister-Jones, Cailee Spaeny, Whitney Cummings, Tawny Newsome, Finn Wolfhard, Nick Kroll, Logan Marshall-Green, Bobby Lee', 'R', 'Liza scores an invite to one last wild party before the world ends. But making it there won''t be easy, as her car has been stolen, and the clock is ticking on her plan to tie up loose ends with friends and family. Accompanied by her younger self, Liza embarks on a hilarious journey across Los Angeles, running into an eclectic cast of characters.', 'Liza scores an invite to one last wild party before the world ends. But making it there won''t be easy, as her car has been stolen, and the clock is ticking on her plan to tie up loose ends with friends and family. Accompanied by her younger self, Liza embarks on a hilarious journey across Los Angeles, running into an eclectic cast of characters.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h4FQ8H77z6rIY82HzR5wgOYoxCA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:776559'),
  ('145373829535199993', 'How Kids Roll', 2024, 'Drama', 'Loris Lai, Shane Seigler', 'Loris Lai, Dahlia Heyman', 'Marwan Hamdan, Mikhael Fridel, Tom Rhys Harries, Lyna Khoudri, Ruth Rosenfeld, Husam Chadat, Eyad Hourani, Qassim Shareef Gdah', null, 'In the midst of the war in Gaza during the Second Intifada in 2003, two 12-year-old boys, one Palestinian and one Israeli, along with a former surfing champion, form a friendship united by the love of water and learn from each other.', 'In the midst of the war in Gaza during the Second Intifada in 2003, two 12-year-old boys, one Palestinian and one Israeli, along with a former surfing champion, form a friendship united by the love of water and learn from each other.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8EGxYlHZFTScQZ2KpkDwR8rvU8h.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1047869'),
  ('948171608886828445', 'How Long Is the Adventure', 1987, 'Comedy', 'Flavio Mogherini, Alessandro Metz, Carlo Carlini', 'Flavio Mogherini, Domenico Saverni, Alessandro Bencivenni', 'Paolo Villaggio, Lino Banfi, Gastone Moschin, Flavio Bucci, Alessandro Haber, Brigitta Boccoli', null, 'In order to get some money Gianni Zappi tries to organize an insurance fraud by drowning his yacht.', 'In order to get some money Gianni Zappi tries to organize an insurance fraud by drowning his yacht.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AeOEjBmEzHQf3qfELrgZ3fprf7F.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:121481'),
  ('397598988833997652', 'How Long Will I Love U', 2018, 'Comedy, Romance, Drama, Mystery, Fantasy', 'Su Lun', 'Su Lun', 'Lei Jiayin, Tong Liya, Wang Zhengjia, Fan Ming, Xu Zheng, Li Nian, Li Guangjie, Yang Di', 'PG-13', 'Gu Xiaojiao, a young girl from 2018 and Lu Ming, a man from 1999, discover that they have both woken up in the same bed at the same space-time. More surprisingly, they realize that they can time travel by exiting the bedroom door. The fun begins when they start to plan a number of changes within these two eras. However, they do not know that their destiny is in the hands of a mysterious person.', 'Gu Xiaojiao, a young girl from 2018 and Lu Ming, a man from 1999, discover that they have both woken up in the same bed at the same space-time. More surprisingly, they realize that they can time travel by exiting the bedroom door. The fun begins when they start to plan a number of changes within these two eras. However, they do not know that their destiny is in the hands of a mysterious person.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ud0N7ot24votfoMAu6BxjPGXqOV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:522921'),
  ('321154870083307081', 'How Mom Turned to Armed Robbery', 2019, 'TV Movie, Drama', 'Alexandre Castagnetti', 'Clara Bourreau, Cécile Lugiez', 'Cécile Rebboah, Claire Nadeau, Medi Sadoun, Catherine Allégret, Pascal Demolon, Jules Houplain, Simon Aouizerate, Cécile Arnaud', null, 'Despite her best intentions and hard work, a single mom with two sons just can''t make ends meet and is forced to depend upon credit just to get by. Desperate, she can see only one solution left to save her family: stage a hold-up.', 'Despite her best intentions and hard work, a single mom with two sons just can''t make ends meet and is forced to depend upon credit just to get by. Desperate, she can see only one solution left to save her family: stage a hold-up.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sRjoUQKfuAoHzrVGKipeOPfAofE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:647211'),
  ('503604018453700722', 'How Monsieur Takes His Bath', 1903, 'Comedy', 'Alice Guy-Blaché, Ferdinand Zecca', null, null, null, 'A hapless man tries to get undressed only to find himself magically layered in even more clothes. There is no credited director for this film. Modern attributions go to either Alice Guy or Ferdinand Zecca, according to the PG archives.', 'A hapless man tries to get undressed only to find himself magically layered in even more clothes. There is no credited director for this film. Modern attributions go to either Alice Guy or Ferdinand Zecca, according to the PG archives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mQbR7GFFWeA3GTBzylP6ksffggU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:119983'),
  ('536505351378112718', 'How Most Things Work', 2015, 'Drama', 'Fernando Salem, Georgina Pretto, Germán Castelnuovo', 'Esteban Garelli, Fernando Salem', 'Verónica Gerez, Pilar Gamboa, Esteban Bigliardi, Vicente Esquerre, Miriam Odorico, Marilú Marini, Rafael Spregelburd, María Ucedo', null, 'Celina works at a remote tollbooth on a desert road, few days before Christmas, her father dies and Celina becomes a door-to-door encyclopedia saleswoman so she can earn enough money to travel to Italy and find her mom.', 'Celina works at a remote tollbooth on a desert road, few days before Christmas, her father dies and Celina becomes a door-to-door encyclopedia saleswoman so she can earn enough money to travel to Italy and find her mom.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/90KQw1lwSHVmx1ZlrgCURmfwURy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:374764'),
  ('736314084588644845', 'How Much Do You Love Me?', 2005, 'Comedy, Drama', 'François Catonné, Bertrand Blier', 'Bertrand Blier', 'Monica Bellucci, Bernard Campan, Gérard Depardieu, Jean-Pierre Darroussin, François Rollin, Jean Barney, Baptiste Roussillon, Valérie Karsenti', null, 'After winning the lottery, François goes to a bar in Pigalle and offers one hundred thousand Euros per month to a prostitute named Daniela to live with him as his wife until his money runs out.', 'After winning the lottery, François goes to a bar in Pigalle and offers one hundred thousand Euros per month to a prostitute named Daniela to live with him as his wife until his money runs out.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jD18aRBrHtr9YnwJoLdqPntxDGr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:5070'),
  ('584665168465295798', 'How Much Does the Trojan Horse Weigh?', 2008, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Juliusz Machulski, Witold Adamek', 'Juliusz Machulski', 'Ilona Ostrowska, Maciej Marczewski, Robert Więckiewicz, Danuta Szaflarska, Sylwia Dziorek, Katarzyna Kwiatkowska, Michał Zieliński, Magdalena Waligórska', null, 'At 40, Zosia has a happy second marriage, a well-adjusted daughter, a good career, and a comfortable home in Warsaw. But as she and her family usher in the year 2000, she wishes some things in her youth had happened differently, and she''s magically transported back to 1987, when she was still married to her womanizing first husband, Darek and lived in the People''s Republic of Poland.', 'At 40, Zosia has a happy second marriage, a well-adjusted daughter, a good career, and a comfortable home in Warsaw. But as she and her family usher in the year 2000, she wishes some things in her youth had happened differently, and she''s magically transported back to 1987, when she was still married to her womanizing first husband, Darek and lived in the People''s Republic of Poland.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pW13PFxuWVYmVheOpy76VhbeVb0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38941'),
  ('30708829138021087', 'How Much Further', 2006, 'Drama', 'Tania Hermida, Armando Salazar', 'Tania Hermida', 'Cecilia Vallejo, Tania Martínez, Francisco Aguirre, Fausto Miño, Elena Torres, Alfredo Espinosa', null, 'A cynical college student and an optimistic tourist, stranded on a bus by a national strike, form an unlikely bond as they decide to hitchhike together to reach their individual destinations, discovering shared lessons and unexpected friendship along the way.', 'A cynical college student and an optimistic tourist, stranded on a bus by a national strike, form an unlikely bond as they decide to hitchhike together to reach their individual destinations, discovering shared lessons and unexpected friendship along the way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nTc8u95NGRnbmjpE3jGLpIVGYFa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:118895'),
  ('155552180046186467', 'How Much Wood Would a Woodchuck Chuck', 1976, 'Documentary', 'Werner Herzog, Thomas Mauch', null, 'Werner Herzog, Steve Liptay, Scott McKain, Ralph Wade, Alan Ball, Abe Diffenbach', null, 'A documentary short examining the language and performance of auctioneering, filmed at the World Livestock Auctioneer Championship in Pennsylvania.', 'A documentary short examining the language and performance of auctioneering, filmed at the World Livestock Auctioneer Championship in Pennsylvania.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e2wojbzoxifA1F6EtGd8E1Ijkqp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:100224'),
  ('1015296094770181501', 'How Petryk Pyatochkin Counted Little Elephants', 1984, 'Animation', 'Oleksandr Viken, Anatolii Havrylov, Izrail Moizhes', 'Natalia Huzieieva', 'Nataliya Rozhkova', null, 'Petryk Pyatochkin goes to kindergarten and loves to play around. One day he counted elephants so that he could fall asleep with the other children during quiet time. And when he succeeded, Petryk got to Africa in an amazing kindergarten, where he had to take care of baby elephants, who did not miss the opportunity to have fun.', 'Petryk Pyatochkin goes to kindergarten and loves to play around. One day he counted elephants so that he could fall asleep with the other children during quiet time. And when he succeeded, Petryk got to Africa in an amazing kindergarten, where he had to take care of baby elephants, who did not miss the opportunity to have fun.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uvxHcmtDpjwb58WKjThyIaI51Ln.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:322622'),
  ('859815354766070232', 'How Poets Are Enjoying Their Lives', 1988, 'Comedy', 'Dušan Klein, Magdalena Mikešová, Jiří Moravčík', 'Ladislav Pecháček, Dušan Klein', 'Pavel Kříž, David Matásek, Eva Vejmělková, Jana Hlaváčová, Rudolf Hrušínský, Blažena Holišová, Karel Roden, Václav Svoboda', null, 'While Kendy returns to his hometown as an assistant director to film a thirteen-part series with a television crew, Štěpán Šafránek, equipped with his mother''s advice after graduation, takes up his first position - as an intern at the local hospital. However, his inadaptability to local conditions and his sense of ethics in his chosen profession do not suit his other established colleagues. While they are amused by his zeal and responsibility, Štěpán has increasing problems with his superiors, until he is finally transferred to the position of rural district doctor, which everyone rejects. In Bezdíkov, however, he meets a new, perhaps permanent and reciprocated love, with whom he eventually decides to live and work in northern Bohemia.', 'While Kendy returns to his hometown as an assistant director to film a thirteen-part series with a television crew, Štěpán Šafránek, equipped with his mother''s advice after graduation, takes up his first position - as an intern at the local hospital. However, his inadaptability to local conditions and his sense of ethics in his chosen profession do not suit his other established colleagues. While they are amused by his zeal and responsibility, Štěpán has increasing problems with his superiors, until he is finally transferred to the position of rural district doctor, which everyone rejects. In Bezdíkov, however, he meets a new, perhaps permanent and reciprocated love, with whom he eventually decides to live and work in northern Bohemia.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qysGWIQEzjcm6rkVQ5GenpU4llT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:65918'),
  ('219489386874260377', 'How Poets Are Losing Their Illusions', 1985, 'Comedy', 'Dušan Klein, Josef Vaniš, Milan Klacek', 'Ladislav Pecháček, Dušan Klein', 'Pavel Kříž, David Matásek, Adriana Tarábková, Joseph Dielle, Václav Svoboda, Karel Roden, Míla Myslíková, Josef Somr', null, 'A story about a young medical school student and his adventures.', 'A story about a young medical school student and his adventures.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1qZEfpKBUTAGT5W0nn6vUheAGcj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84047'),
  ('163881101678413967', 'How Sarah Got Her Wings', 2015, 'Drama, Fantasy, TV Movie', 'Gary Entin, Edmund Entin, Matthew Irving', 'Damon Tod Hill', 'Melanie Liburd, Kathleen Rose Perkins, Derek Theler, Charles Robinson, Lindsey Gort, Caleel Harris, Jeremy Luke, Daniel Di Tomasso', null, 'Good Samaritan Sarah Fitzpatrick has a fatal accident just before Christmas, and finds herself in the lobby before the gates of Heaven. Certain that she will be let in, she is shocked to find that her name is not on the reservation list. However, she is granted the chance to return to Earth as an "angel in training" with the requirement to help a soul in need. Sarah has the 12 days before Christmas to secure her place on the list leaving her in the race for her after-life.', 'Good Samaritan Sarah Fitzpatrick has a fatal accident just before Christmas, and finds herself in the lobby before the gates of Heaven. Certain that she will be let in, she is shocked to find that her name is not on the reservation list. However, she is granted the chance to return to Earth as an "angel in training" with the requirement to help a soul in need. Sarah has the 12 days before Christmas to secure her place on the list leaving her in the race for her after-life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/elhXcxDrYUbVH7p5dTMv2k5JlDm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:369059'),
  ('858138654959067416', 'How She Move', 2008, 'Drama', 'Ian Iqbal Rashid, André Pienaar', 'Annmarie Morais', 'Rutina Wesley, Dwain Murphy, Boyd Banks, Clé Bennett, Melanie Nicholls-King, Conrad Coates, Tristan D. Lalla, Ardon Bess', 'PG-13', 'After the death of Raya Green''s sister, she gets out from her classes at school, and sees a stomp crew practicing. She meets Bishop which is the dance crew leader. She then meets Michelle and does a stomp battle with her. They become enemies then friends later on. Her uptight mom pushes her to pass the test to get into Medical school, but she thinks she failed....', 'After the death of Raya Green''s sister, she gets out from her classes at school, and sees a stomp crew practicing. She meets Bishop which is the dance crew leader. She then meets Michelle and does a stomp battle with her. They become enemies then friends later on. Her uptight mom pushes her to pass the test to get into Medical school, but she thinks she failed....', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xbQnpPZZXfuYcYs4n1AgH0Tjgi6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16988'),
  ('476177791124300372', 'How Some Jellyfish Are Born', 1960, 'Documentary', 'Jean Painlevé, Geneviève Hamon', null, null, null, 'At a marine biology station, a clump of algae reveals polyps, stomachs with limbs, limbs with buds, buds with poison cells. This animal reproduces by buds, which we watch close up in time-lapse images. In another kind of jellyfish, the buds grow inside then live outside for a few days until being on their own. Another produces eggs, sometimes self-fertilized. Some single eggs become buds with colonies. Another clump gathered at low tide consists of filaments of a colony - plumes with poison ends. In images taking 72 hours, we see filaments grow and produce a feeding organ from which a plume emerges. New jellyfish emerge from buds twice a day at set times to form a new colonies.', 'At a marine biology station, a clump of algae reveals polyps, stomachs with limbs, limbs with buds, buds with poison cells. This animal reproduces by buds, which we watch close up in time-lapse images. In another kind of jellyfish, the buds grow inside then live outside for a few days until being on their own. Another produces eggs, sometimes self-fertilized. Some single eggs become buds with colonies. Another clump gathered at low tide consists of filaments of a colony - plumes with poison ends. In images taking 72 hours, we see filaments grow and produce a feeding organ from which a plume emerges. New jellyfish emerge from buds twice a day at set times to form a new colonies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3PWCYsLTvWlj4ytI4A6xlgP5bGD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:117594'),
  ('530259376308182044', 'How Stella Got Her Groove Back', 1998, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Kevin Rodney Sullivan, Jeffrey Jur, Steve Danton', 'Terry McMillan, Ronald Bass', 'Angela Bassett, Taye Diggs, Whoopi Goldberg, Regina King, Suzzanne Douglas, Michael J. Pagan, Sicily Johnson, Richard Lawson', 'R', 'Through good times and bad, Stella and Delilah have always had each other. Now, Stella''s so busy building a life that she''s forgotten how to really live. But Delilah is about to change all that. What starts as a quick trip to Jamaica, ends as an exhilarating voyage of self discovery as Stella learns to open her heart and find love – even if it''s with a man 20 years her junior.', 'Through good times and bad, Stella and Delilah have always had each other. Now, Stella''s so busy building a life that she''s forgotten how to really live. But Delilah is about to change all that. What starts as a quick trip to Jamaica, ends as an exhilarating voyage of self discovery as Stella learns to open her heart and find love – even if it''s with a man 20 years her junior.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ygmuaJDLYxWJo8eNhq0A63hagrQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33644'),
  ('909971935528996932', 'How Strange to be Named Federico', 2013, 'Drama', 'Ettore Scola, Luciano Tovoli', 'Ettore Scola, Paola Scola, Silvia Scola', 'Vittorio Viviani, Federico Fellini, Tommaso Lazotti, Giacomo Lazotti, Sergio Rubini, Emiliano De Martino, Andrea Salerno, Miriam Dalmazio', null, 'On the 20th anniversary of Federico Fellini''s death, Ettore Scola, a devoted admirer of the incomparable maestro, commemorates the lesser-known aspects of his personality, employing interviews, photographs, behind-the-scenes footage as well as his drawings and film clips.', 'On the 20th anniversary of Federico Fellini''s death, Ettore Scola, a devoted admirer of the incomparable maestro, commemorates the lesser-known aspects of his personality, employing interviews, photographs, behind-the-scenes footage as well as his drawings and film clips.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/48EFlkQqofm0Q6qDhOdov5Huc3c.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:215741'),
  ('1147126027824235498', 'How Sweet It Is!', 1968, 'Comedy', 'Jerry Paris, Lucien Ballard', 'Jerry Belson, Garry Marshall', 'James Garner, Debbie Reynolds, Maurice Ronet, Terry-Thomas, Paul Lynde, Marcel Dalio, Gino Conforti, Donald Losby', 'NR', 'All-American couple who try to bridge the generation gap with their free-spirited son on a trip, frisky business and misunderstandings galore ensue, all funny, vibrant and charming.', 'All-American couple who try to bridge the generation gap with their free-spirited son on a trip, frisky business and misunderstandings galore ensue, all funny, vibrant and charming.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mPah9Fmm8NSTEGWbsgKlI7jSZwx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:242097'),
  ('452013341216171978', 'How Tasty Was My Little Frenchman', 1971, 'Comedy, Adventure, History', 'Nelson Pereira dos Santos, Carlos Alberto Camuyrano, Luiz Carlos Lacerda', 'Nelson Pereira dos Santos', 'Arduíno Colassanti, Ana Maria Magalhães, Eduardo Imbassahy Filho, Manfredo Colassanti, José Kleber, Gabriel Arcanjo, Luiz Carlos Lacerda, Jorge Rodrigues da Silva', null, 'In 1594 Brazil, a frenchman becomes a prisoner of the Tupinambás. While waiting to be executed, the foreigner learns the habits of the indigenous people and joins a woman who tries to help him escape.', 'In 1594 Brazil, a frenchman becomes a prisoner of the Tupinambás. While waiting to be executed, the foreigner learns the habits of the indigenous people and joins a woman who tries to help him escape.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yls9gNguacmJa0UWnBD59u8pC4E.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:105347'),
  ('884778973111190300', 'How the Cossacks Became Olympians', 1978, 'Animation, Comedy, Adventure', 'Anatolii Havrylov, Ihor Pohon, Volodymyr Dakhno', 'Eduard Kyrych, Volodymyr Dakhno', null, null, 'The Cossacks become involved in a dispute between the gods Zeus and Mars. Zeus wants to set up the Olympic games, while Mars wants to undermine him and start more wars. The Kozaks help Zeus and challenge Mars at the Games.', 'The Cossacks become involved in a dispute between the gods Zeus and Mars. Zeus wants to set up the Olympic games, while Mars wants to undermine him and start more wars. The Kozaks help Zeus and challenge Mars at the Games.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/t7tSDmdiYnUfY2o7S9bMuFj4hI5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:210155'),
  ('1067235004805492646', 'How the Cossacks Bought Salt', 1975, 'Adventure, Animation, Comedy', 'Anatolii Havrylov, Iryna Chefranova, Volodymyr Dakhno', 'Volodymyr Kapustian, Volodymyr Dakhno', null, null, 'Cossacks cooked borscht, but ran out of salt, and what kind of taste without salt? They go to the fair, where they find out that the Chumaks who traded the salt, were robbed by the Evil Pan (local feudal lord). In this series, the Cossacks, fighting off the Evil Pan and his servants, try to bring the stolen salt to the bazaar in order to transfer it to the hands of the rightful owners - the Chumaks.', 'Cossacks cooked borscht, but ran out of salt, and what kind of taste without salt? They go to the fair, where they find out that the Chumaks who traded the salt, were robbed by the Evil Pan (local feudal lord). In this series, the Cossacks, fighting off the Evil Pan and his servants, try to bring the stolen salt to the bazaar in order to transfer it to the hands of the rightful owners - the Chumaks.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mfl7wYqMXD6TiCsBEDr0AeQAITo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:210152'),
  ('669259889465404864', 'How the Cossacks Celebrated a Wedding', 1984, 'Animation, Comedy, Fantasy', 'Anatolii Havrylov, Viktor Hruzdiev, Volodymyr Dakhno', 'Leonid Anichkin, Volodymyr Vaskovtsev, Volodymyr Dakhno', 'Davyd Babaiev', null, 'Tur regrets being single until he meets a charming maiden to whom he promises a new pair of boots. He gets trapped at a witch’s sabbath hosted by the devil, who promises him a pair of boots in exchange for his soul.', 'Tur regrets being single until he meets a charming maiden to whom he promises a new pair of boots. He gets trapped at a witch’s sabbath hosted by the devil, who promises him a pair of boots in exchange for his soul.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nu0ph2wZ99YzUAQn6ycTjBZzBUO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:210158'),
  ('33249960780912550', 'How the Cossacks Helped Musketeers', 1979, 'Adventure, Animation, Comedy', 'Anatolii Havrylov, Ihor Pohon, Volodymyr Dakhno', 'Volodymyr Dakhno', 'Eduard Nazarov', null, 'Cossacks help the French musketeers to deliver the portrait of daughter of the Turkish sultan to the Dutch prince, that could marry her. Insidious cardinal Richelieu wants to blow off the plans of queen and equips pursuit.', 'Cossacks help the French musketeers to deliver the portrait of daughter of the Turkish sultan to the Dutch prince, that could marry her. Insidious cardinal Richelieu wants to blow off the plans of queen and equips pursuit.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tAtIs3yvLdGPY5dqBCbnNv1l1ul.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:210157'),
  ('1100494742026275053', 'How the Cossacks Met Aliens', 1987, 'Adventure, Animation, Comedy', 'Viktor Hruzdiev, Anatolii Havrylov, Volodymyr Dakhno', 'Volodymyr Vaskovtsev, Volodymyr Dakhno, Alexander Kostinsky', null, null, 'Hraï, Oko and Tour come across extraterrestrials in search of oil to repair their saucer and be able to return home. Together, they cross Europe, find themselves defending Bulgaria invaded by enemies, discover an aqueduct in Italy and narrowly escape the Inquisition in Spain.', 'Hraï, Oko and Tour come across extraterrestrials in search of oil to repair their saucer and be able to return home. Together, they cross Europe, find themselves defending Bulgaria invaded by enemies, discover an aqueduct in Italy and narrowly escape the Inquisition in Spain.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gFmuMXC2gaMHU6WuuI7JEjDN9o1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:210159'),
  ('767478910774983843', 'How the Cossacks Played Football', 1970, 'Adventure, Animation, Comedy', 'Anatolii Havrylov, Leonid Moroz, Volodymyr Dakhno', 'Volodymyr Kapustian', null, null, 'A group of cossacks travels around Europe, playing football against the teams of different countries, each of which has their very unique playing style.', 'A group of cossacks travels around Europe, playing football against the teams of different countries, each of which has their very unique playing style.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/57iYq6SOAPL24LXlixcybtP5AKJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:210140'),
  ('512331247719328868', 'How the Cossacks Played Hockey', 1995, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Viktor Hruzdiev, Anatolii Havrylov, Yurii Nechesa', 'Eduard Kyrych', null, null, 'The final episode, released after the fall of the Soviet Union, features the Cossacks as the parents of an entire children’s hockey team. While hosting the Canadian hockey team, they have to thwart their former pirate enemies once again.', 'The final episode, released after the fall of the Soviet Union, features the Cossacks as the parents of an entire children’s hockey team. While hosting the Canadian hockey team, they have to thwart their former pirate enemies once again.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7bZ8P5W2lp61surjQytilHzLgOt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:210161'),
