  ('315732602864847786', 'How the Cossacks Were Cooking Kulish', 1967, 'Adventure, Animation, Comedy', 'Volodymyr Dakhno, Anatolii Havrylov, Ihor Pohon', 'Volodymyr Dakhno, V. Bratenshi', null, null, 'Three Cossacks preparing for a meal and gather to smoke their pipes as their meal cooks. Out of tobacco, one of them goes off to investigate smoke on the horizon. He is captured by foreign invaders and must be rescued by his friends.', 'Three Cossacks preparing for a meal and gather to smoke their pipes as their meal cooks. Out of tobacco, one of them goes off to investigate smoke on the horizon. He is captured by foreign invaders and must be rescued by his friends.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zFQGjuqYsihmnNBGMXQRKXXZBgr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:150949'),
  ('1092136724286409576', 'How the Grinch Stole Christmas', 2000, 'Family, Comedy, Fantasy', 'Ron Howard, Donald Peterman, Janet Hirshenson', 'Jeffrey Price, Peter S. Seaman', 'Jim Carrey, Taylor Momsen, Jeffrey Tambor, Christine Baranski, Bill Irwin, Molly Shannon, Clint Howard, Josh Ryan Evans', 'PG', 'The Grinch decides to rob Whoville of Christmas - but a dash of kindness from little Cindy Lou Who and her family may be enough to melt his heart...', 'The Grinch decides to rob Whoville of Christmas - but a dash of kindness from little Cindy Lou Who and her family may be enough to melt his heart...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1WZbbPApEivA421gCOluuzMMKCk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8871'),
  ('53919879466938009', 'How the Grinch Stole Christmas!', 1966, 'Animation, Family, Comedy', 'Chuck Jones, Ben Washam', null, 'Boris Karloff, June Foray, Dal McKennon, Thurl Ravenscroft', 'G', 'Bitter and hateful, the Grinch is irritated at the thought of a nearby village having a happy time celebrating Christmas. Disguised as Santa Claus, with his dog made to look like a reindeer, he decides to raid the village to steal all the Christmas things.', 'Bitter and hateful, the Grinch is irritated at the thought of a nearby village having a happy time celebrating Christmas. Disguised as Santa Claus, with his dog made to look like a reindeer, he decides to raid the village to steal all the Christmas things.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7ir0iRuPK9OEuH569cp0nF5CJce.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13377'),
  ('592700311889824238', 'How the Gringo Stole Christmas', 2023, 'Comedy', 'Angel Gracia, Michael Brouphy', 'Ezequiel Martinez Jr.', 'George López, Mariana Treviño, Emily Tosta, Jack Kilmer, Romy Peniche, Alma Martinez, Justice Alexander, Jairo Orozco', 'PG-13', 'Bennie''s daughter is on her way home for the holidays. However she surprises him by arriving with her brand new boyfriend - an uninvited gringo.', 'Bennie''s daughter is on her way home for the holidays. However she surprises him by arriving with her brand new boyfriend - an uninvited gringo.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5CxPcjyhg6Krn2PY5qhYgZSWHXQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1201640'),
