  ('716090319680056377', 'How the Toys Saved Christmas', 1996, 'Family, Animation, Fantasy', 'Enzo D''Alò', 'Enzo D''Alò, Umberto Marino', 'Lella Costa, Dario Fo, Alida Milana, Luigi Ferraro, Alessio De Filippis, Laura Cosenza, Laura Cosenza, Monica Bertolotti', null, 'When Santa''s helper La Befana falls ill and must take off a Christmas Eve, she recruits Scarafoni to help deliver all the toys. No one but the toys knows is that Scarafoni plans to auction off the toys to the highest bidder, which means the toys won''t make it to the children who have been good all year and deserve them. The toys decide to deliver themselves, and the story follows them as they struggle to avoid the heartless Scarafoni and to find their true homes.', 'When Santa''s helper La Befana falls ill and must take off a Christmas Eve, she recruits Scarafoni to help deliver all the toys. No one but the toys knows is that Scarafoni plans to auction off the toys to the highest bidder, which means the toys won''t make it to the children who have been good all year and deserve them. The toys decide to deliver themselves, and the story follows them as they struggle to avoid the heartless Scarafoni and to find their true homes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pWm9Ikd8vwYzDnviUFaU2iN6s9F.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52989'),
  ('770885482050360481', 'How the War Started on My Island', 1997, 'Comedy, War', 'Vinko Brešan', 'Ivo Brešan, Vinko Brešan', 'Vlatko Dulić, Ivan Brkić, Božidar Orešković, Matija Prskalo, Goran Navojec, Ljubomir Kerekeš, Ivica Vidović, Senka Bulić', null, 'At the beginning of 1991, Yugoslav army did not acknowledge Croatian''s independence, and still holding few military barracks in Croatia. Gajski travels to an island to get his son out of the army. Locals have besieged the barracks and organized a festival to try with singing and recitals to get major Aleksa and his soldiers to surrender, but Aleksa has explosives thru the barracks and wants to blow up the island.', 'At the beginning of 1991, Yugoslav army did not acknowledge Croatian''s independence, and still holding few military barracks in Croatia. Gajski travels to an island to get his son out of the army. Locals have besieged the barracks and organized a festival to try with singing and recitals to get major Aleksa and his soldiers to surrender, but Aleksa has explosives thru the barracks and wants to blow up the island.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/alWqkJk397BIutEhkMmw0dRIf5b.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40890'),
  ('30976366485342015', 'How the West Was Fun', 1994, 'Family, Western, Drama, TV Movie', 'Richard Leiterman, Stuart Margolin', 'Jurgen Wolff', 'Mary-Kate Olsen, Ashley Olsen, Martin Mull, Michele Greene, Patrick Cassidy, Ben Cardinal, Peg Phillips, Leon Pownall', null, 'Twin sisters help a woman save her dude ranch from developers who would like to turn the property into a theme park.', 'Twin sisters help a woman save her dude ranch from developers who would like to turn the property into a theme park.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x7Kkp6ZXMSeKMYqTgh81eBTuMKS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50326'),
  ('583723582828661900', 'How the West Was Won', 1962, 'Western', 'Henry Hathaway, John Ford, William H. Daniels', 'John Gay, James R. Webb', 'Carroll Baker, Lee J. Cobb, Henry Fonda, Carolyn Jones, Karl Malden, Gregory Peck, George Peppard, Robert Preston', 'G', 'The epic tale of the development of the American West from the 1830s through the Civil War to the end of the century, as seen through the eyes of one pioneer family.', 'The epic tale of the development of the American West from the 1830s through the Civil War to the end of the century, as seen through the eyes of one pioneer family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rmwc89VMQR4rUSDfakd0Z6GyF6q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11897'),
  ('223062041845022509', 'How the World Is Losing Poets', 1982, 'Comedy', 'Dušan Klein, Milan Klacek, Zdeněk Fiala', 'Dušan Klein', 'Pavel Kříž, David Matásek, Miroslava Šafránková, Míla Myslíková, Josef Somr, Slávka Španková, Oldřich Navrátil, Lenka Kořínková', null, 'Inseparable friends Štěpán and Kendy are students in their final year of high school. When they are in the principal''s office after the trouble with the rather scandalous song "On the Carpet", the school principal gives them the idea of ​​rehearsing a theater performance. They decide on Tyl''s Forest Maiden in a rather unconventional version - with music, singing, and several unusual props. While Kendy sees the theater as not only an opportunity to enjoy himself, for Štěpán it is a chance to get closer to the charming Marcela Borůvková. What was originally just a student recession soon starts to get out of hand for both authors, not only because of the quirky cast but also because of information in the press, which is taken care of by the father of one of the classmates. The business is gaining in size, and even a television station is contacted, which shows an interest in making a program about the performance. At that moment, the disaster seems inevitable to Štěpán and Kendy.', 'Inseparable friends Štěpán and Kendy are students in their final year of high school. When they are in the principal''s office after the trouble with the rather scandalous song "On the Carpet", the school principal gives them the idea of ​​rehearsing a theater performance. They decide on Tyl''s Forest Maiden in a rather unconventional version - with music, singing, and several unusual props. While Kendy sees the theater as not only an opportunity to enjoy himself, for Štěpán it is a chance to get closer to the charming Marcela Borůvková. What was originally just a student recession soon starts to get out of hand for both authors, not only because of the quirky cast but also because of information in the press, which is taken care of by the father of one of the classmates. The business is gaining in size, and even a television station is contacted, which shows an interest in making a program about the performance. At that moment, the disaster seems inevitable to Štěpán and Kendy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ceb0tvoLtmh3naW9gO70to7jaen.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84045'),
  ('10689185663690642', 'How They Get There', 1997, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Spike Jonze, Lance Acord', 'Spike Jonze, Mark Gonzales', 'Rico Bueno, Lauren Curry, Mark Gonzales', null, 'A guy and a girl play copycat with each other from opposite sides of the street.', 'A guy and a girl play copycat with each other from opposite sides of the street.', null, 'tmdb:movie:137014'),
  ('918365996953403253', 'How to Be', 2008, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Oliver Irving, Paul Swann', 'Oliver Irving', 'Robert Pattinson, Powell Jones, Johnny White, Mike Pearce, Jeremy Hardy, Rebecca Pidgeon, Michael Irving, Gary Moore', 'NR', 'A young man having an existential crisis convinces a Canadian self-help guru to come to London and become his personal life coach.', 'A young man having an existential crisis convinces a Canadian self-help guru to come to London and become his personal life coach.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rHjC31upOGARPBQvvo7ke04AZEy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19713'),
  ('844822150831972340', 'How to Be a Detective', 1952, 'Animation', 'Jack Kinney', null, 'Pinto Colvig, Billy Bletcher, June Foray', null, 'Goofy is "Johnny Eyeball, Private Eye" who gets mixed up in a surreal whodunnit involving a classy dame, a cop, weasels, and the mysterious missing Al.', 'Goofy is "Johnny Eyeball, Private Eye" who gets mixed up in a surreal whodunnit involving a classy dame, a cop, weasels, and the mysterious missing Al.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fXuWKUstRunI7z5zyQWgWxm4wIf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:66882'),
  ('740837543935933035', 'How to Be a Good Wife', 2020, 'Comedy', 'Guillaume Schiffman, Juliette Maillard, Martin Provost', 'Séverine Werba, Martin Provost', 'Juliette Binoche, Yolande Moreau, Noémie Lvovsky, Édouard Baer, François Berléand, Marie Zabukovec, Anamaria Vartolomei, Lily Taïeb', null, 'Paulette Van Der Beck and her husband have been running the housekeeping school of Bitche in Alsace for many years. Their mission is to train teenage girls to become the perfect housewives at a time when women were expected to be subservient to their husband. After the sudden death of her husband, Paulette discovers that the school is on the verge of bankruptcy and has to take her responsibilities. But while preparations are underway for the best housekeeping competition TV show, she and her lively students start questioning their beliefs as the nation-wide protests of May 1968 transform society around them. Reunited with her first love, André, and with the help of her eccentric stepsister Gilberte and strict nun Marie-Therese, Paulette joins forces with the schoolgirls to overcome their suppressed status and become liberated women.', 'Paulette Van Der Beck and her husband have been running the housekeeping school of Bitche in Alsace for many years. Their mission is to train teenage girls to become the perfect housewives at a time when women were expected to be subservient to their husband. After the sudden death of her husband, Paulette discovers that the school is on the verge of bankruptcy and has to take her responsibilities. But while preparations are underway for the best housekeeping competition TV show, she and her lively students start questioning their beliefs as the nation-wide protests of May 1968 transform society around them. Reunited with her first love, André, and with the help of her eccentric stepsister Gilberte and strict nun Marie-Therese, Paulette joins forces with the schoolgirls to overcome their suppressed status and become liberated women.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/CHOlO9KitnyFxw7nZi6vxn2Tp3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:575291'),
  ('575260471485726552', 'How to Be a Latin Lover', 2017, 'Comedy', 'Ken Marino, John Bailey, Phil DeSanti', 'Chris Spain, Jon Zack', 'Eugenio Derbez, Salma Hayek Pinault, Raphael Alejandro, Rob Lowe, Kristen Bell, Mckenna Grace, Raquel Welch, Linda Lavin', 'PG-13', 'An aging Latin lover gets dumped by his sugar mama and must fend for himself in a harsh world.', 'An aging Latin lover gets dumped by his sugar mama and must fend for himself in a harsh world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tjCDa24gNZGhpsFRhKnN9x83rTj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:425134'),
  ('669280890961030179', 'How to Be a Man', 2013, 'Comedy', 'Chadd Harbold', 'Bryan Gaynor, Chadd Harbold, Gavin McInnes', 'Gavin McInnes, Liam Aiken, Megan Neuringer, Helen Rogers, Marisa Redanty, Paulo Costanzo, Brian Petsos, Nigel DeFriez', null, 'When former comedian Mark McCarthy is faced with a rare form of cancer, he hires a young, impressionable cameraman to document his crude and comical lessons on what it means to be a man for his unborn son.', 'When former comedian Mark McCarthy is faced with a rare form of cancer, he hires a young, impressionable cameraman to document his crude and comical lessons on what it means to be a man for his unborn son.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9X9wf40QWAc7K6VDAGv49ifk4uh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:213417'),
  ('514708387855742768', 'How to Be a Modern Man', 2023, 'Comedy', 'Paz Jiménez, Eva Díaz', 'Marta Sánchez', 'Leo Harlem, Stéphanie Magnin, María Morales, Daniel Pérez Prada, Julián Villagrán, Maribel Salas, Santi Ugalde, Pepín Tre', null, 'Andres Cuadrado is an old-fashioned civil servant. Conservative and somewhat macho, he takes his job at the Ministry of Finance very seriously. He considers himself above all a person "as God commands" and, consequently, he takes it for granted that everything responds to a natural, hierarchical and immovable order. After an unfortunate confrontation with a colleague, Andrés is disciplined and transferred to the Ministry of Equality. There everything is totally new to him: there are no assigned places, no schedules, and everyone is a vegan. Andres will have a lot of catching up to do to adapt to this new order of things.', 'Andres Cuadrado is an old-fashioned civil servant. Conservative and somewhat macho, he takes his job at the Ministry of Finance very seriously. He considers himself above all a person "as God commands" and, consequently, he takes it for granted that everything responds to a natural, hierarchical and immovable order. After an unfortunate confrontation with a colleague, Andrés is disciplined and transferred to the Ministry of Equality. There everything is totally new to him: there are no assigned places, no schedules, and everyone is a vegan. Andres will have a lot of catching up to do to adapt to this new order of things.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kI2wF5PNWjAmh6uqpPxTt8PWOcq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1064103'),
  ('56840339827674615', 'How to Be a Player', 1997, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Lionel C. Martin', 'Mark Brown, Demetria Johnson', 'Bill Bellamy, Lark Voorhies, Amber Smith, Natashia Williams, Mari Morrow, Bernie Mac, Elise Neal, Jazsmin Lewis', 'R', 'Dray is a young playboy whose only objective in life seems to be to have sex with as many girls as he can without getting caught by his girlfriend Lisa. Dray''s sister Jenny and her friend Katrina plan to show him that the way he lives is wrong and organize a party in Malibu, inviting all of his girlfriends.', 'Dray is a young playboy whose only objective in life seems to be to have sex with as many girls as he can without getting caught by his girlfriend Lisa. Dray''s sister Jenny and her friend Katrina plan to show him that the way he lives is wrong and organize a party in Malibu, inviting all of his girlfriends.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1BFKMh1ogtWzGOjKTzxCD2tG0K3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28353'),
  ('735849735745114889', 'How to Be a Sailor', 1944, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Jack Kinney', null, 'Pinto Colvig, John McLeish', 'NR', 'Goofy provides a history of ships and sailing.', 'Goofy provides a history of ships and sailing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y1cV3lDKjOQvULynGeamuJLMBVA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64662'),
  ('549507641603467767', 'How to Be a Serial Killer', 2009, 'Comedy, Horror, Crime', 'Luke Ricci, Alexander Asher Brown, Aaron Steele-Nicholson', 'Luke Ricci', 'Dameon Clarke, Matthew Gray Gubler, Laura Regan, Gonzalo Menendez, Mary Jo Catlett, George Wyner, Shadoe Stevens, Ari Welkom', 'R', 'HOW TO BE A SERIAL KILLER is the story of Mike Wilson, a charismatic, educated, and articulate young man who has found his life''s purpose in exterminating people. Mike is determined to spread his message about the joy of serial killing and recruits a lost soul named Bart to be his pupil. Mike leads Bart through the ethics of serial killing as well as teaching him various lessons in disposing corp', 'HOW TO BE A SERIAL KILLER is the story of Mike Wilson, a charismatic, educated, and articulate young man who has found his life''s purpose in exterminating people. Mike is determined to spread his message about the joy of serial killing and recruits a lost soul named Bart to be his pupil. Mike leads Bart through the ethics of serial killing as well as teaching him various lessons in disposing corp', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u1I4MbZi1LWKLrNVQRtV3at5BYq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:23532'),
  ('556168019117041540', 'How to Be a Woman and Not Die in the Attempt', 1991, 'Comedy', 'Ana Belén, Manuel Gómez Pereira, Gilles Ortion', 'Carmen Rico-Godoy', 'Carmen Maura, Antonio Resines, Carmen Conesa, Juanjo Puigcorbé, Miguel Rellán, Tina Sainz, Asunción Balaguer, Enriqueta Carballeira', null, 'Carmen, a journalist with two children, is on her third marriage, to Antonio, a record producer. Over the course of a year, we follow her through her discontents: Antonio''s lateness, his fatigue when she wants to make love, his insistence on her company when she prefers solitude, his treating her work as less important than his, his casual and cruel dismissal of her opinions, her boss assigning her an incompetent editor, bartenders ignoring her, her passage into middle age. She can be feisty and edgy, which sometimes gets in the way of what would make her happy. And she regularly threatens to leave Antonio. Will she, and on what terms? What will he do?', 'Carmen, a journalist with two children, is on her third marriage, to Antonio, a record producer. Over the course of a year, we follow her through her discontents: Antonio''s lateness, his fatigue when she wants to make love, his insistence on her company when she prefers solitude, his treating her work as less important than his, his casual and cruel dismissal of her opinions, her boss assigning her an incompetent editor, bartenders ignoring her, her passage into middle age. She can be feisty and edgy, which sometimes gets in the way of what would make her happy. And she regularly threatens to leave Antonio. Will she, and on what terms? What will he do?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e1cwOcr14KXdeYsd33JHGBCVoFy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:158112'),
  ('185141728465827952', 'How to Be Loved', 1963, 'Drama', 'Wojciech Has, Stefan Matyjaszkiewicz, Karol Dąbrowski', 'Kazimierz Brandys', 'Barbara Krafftówna, Zbigniew Cybulski, Artur Młodnicki, Wieńczysław Gliński, Wiesław Gołas, Wiesława Kwaśniewska, Zdzisław Maklakiewicz, Tadeusz Kalinowski', null, 'An actress travels from Warsaw to Paris and during the trip reflects on the last few years of her life. It goes back to the German occupation and her hiding of a fellow actor who has supposedly killed a collaborator.', 'An actress travels from Warsaw to Paris and during the trip reflects on the last few years of her life. It goes back to the German occupation and her hiding of a fellow actor who has supposedly killed a collaborator.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/27xAo4nQ458IM57Tas3Fz4INAvi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:129659'),
  ('838242894319908735', 'How to Be Really Bad', 2018, 'Comedy', 'Marco Petry', 'Rochus Hahn, Marco Petry', 'Emma Bading, Janina Fautz, Ludwig Simon, Samuel Finzi, Emilio Sakraya, Oliver Korittke, Alwara Höfels, Matilda März', null, 'The life of 14-year-old Lilith is similar to that of a normal teenager, but there is a peculiarity: she is the daughter of the devil and lives with him in hell. Because she is totally bored there and also wants to have fun and explore the world, she makes a pact with her father: she is allowed to go to earth for a week - but she has to convert a good person to evil there. If she succeeds in this challenge, she may stay on earth forever, otherwise she''ll be waving a hell of a boring job in the bookkeeping of the underworld.', 'The life of 14-year-old Lilith is similar to that of a normal teenager, but there is a peculiarity: she is the daughter of the devil and lives with him in hell. Because she is totally bored there and also wants to have fun and explore the world, she makes a pact with her father: she is allowed to go to earth for a week - but she has to convert a good person to evil there. If she succeeds in this challenge, she may stay on earth forever, otherwise she''ll be waving a hell of a boring job in the bookkeeping of the underworld.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uj6hz7PTYrYqVhKAzZ7mLkqOffu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:456616'),
  ('427395829242786422', 'How to Be Single', 2016, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Christian Ditter, Bruce Jones, Patrick Capone', 'Abby Kohn, Marc Silverstein, Dana Fox', 'Dakota Johnson, Rebel Wilson, Leslie Mann, Alison Brie, Damon Wayans Jr., Anders Holm, Nicholas Braun, Jake Lacy', 'R', 'New York City is full of lonely hearts seeking the right match, and what Alice, Robin, Lucy, Meg, Tom and David all have in common is the need to learn how to be single in a world filled with ever-evolving definitions of love.', 'New York City is full of lonely hearts seeking the right match, and what Alice, Robin, Lucy, Meg, Tom and David all have in common is the need to learn how to be single in a world filled with ever-evolving definitions of love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a4Ce3qHqIyHM3QfGsiVTAu3YADJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:259694'),
  ('1102648795719774635', 'How to Beat the High Cost of Living', 1980, 'Comedy', 'Robert Scheerer, James Crabe', 'Robert Kaufman', 'Susan Saint James, Jane Curtin, Jessica Lange, Richard Benjamin, Eddie Albert, Cathryn Damon, Dabney Coleman, Fred Willard', 'PG', 'In order to beat inflation and subsidize their alimony checks, three suburban housewives plot to steal $1 million from a large plastic ball which is displayed in a local shopping center.', 'In order to beat inflation and subsidize their alimony checks, three suburban housewives plot to steal $1 million from a large plastic ball which is displayed in a local shopping center.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rLsM8mUxPfuEl5M86VL82YiVTK7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:119617'),
  ('1051525778191058272', 'How to Become Myself', 2007, 'Drama', 'Jun Ichikawa, Kazuhiro Suzuki, Toshihisa Yamada', 'Madoka Hosotani', 'Riko Narumi, Atsuko Maeda, Mariko Ishihara, Yoshizumi Ishihara, Yoshimasa Kondo, Kaoru Okunuki, Tomorowo Taguchi, Sousuke Takaoka', null, 'Juri, an elementary school girl, loses sight of her true self while acting out a false self to play along with her friends. Kanako, a classmate who used to be the popular girl but has been bullied lately, tells Juri that the girl she is now is not her true self, and Juri sympathizes.', 'Juri, an elementary school girl, loses sight of her true self while acting out a false self to play along with her friends. Kanako, a classmate who used to be the popular girl but has been bullied lately, tells Juri that the girl she is now is not her true self, and Juri sympathizes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eIOGdokXTuIXs1w2bPGwPQhgvoL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:94790'),
