  ('217455268495619894', 'How to Date Billy Walsh', 2024, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Alex Pillai, Hamish Doyne-Ditmas, Sarah Miles', 'Alexander J. Farrell, Greer Taylor Ellison', 'Sebastian Croft, Charithra Chandran, Tanner Buchanan, Kunal Nayyar, Nick Frost, Guz Khan, Lucy Punch, Tim Downie', 'NR', 'Archie has been in love with his best friend Amelia for as long as he can remember. Just when he builds up the courage to declare his feelings, she falls head over heels for Billy Walsh, a new American transfer student.', 'Archie has been in love with his best friend Amelia for as long as he can remember. Just when he builds up the courage to declare his feelings, she falls head over heels for Billy Walsh, a new American transfer student.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5qcHcoJL3otMwJPKnbV5M3a1jQd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1017633'),
  ('931987685591328995', 'How to Deal', 2003, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Clare Kilner, Eric Alan Edwards', 'Neena Beber', 'Mandy Moore, Trent Ford, Allison Janney, Alexandra Holden, Dylan Baker, Nina Foch, Mary Catherine Garrison, Connie Ray', 'PG-13', 'For teenager Halley, love seems like an alien concept. Her mother is divorcing her father, who is dating a younger woman Halley can''t stand. Her sister is about to get married and doesn''t realize that her fiancé is not the man of her dreams. And her best friend has fallen madly in love for the first time, leaving Halley to feel even more alone. But, when she meets edgy Macon, she learns what love is really all about.', 'For teenager Halley, love seems like an alien concept. Her mother is divorcing her father, who is dating a younger woman Halley can''t stand. Her sister is about to get married and doesn''t realize that her fiancé is not the man of her dreams. And her best friend has fallen madly in love for the first time, leaving Halley to feel even more alone. But, when she meets edgy Macon, she learns what love is really all about.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pD87iTm4MP7JNcxIUssAbpri8nF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17403'),
