  ('41557258869087400', 'How to Keep the Red Lamp Burning', 1965, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Gilles Grangier, Georges Lautner, Robert Lefebvre', 'Albert Simonin, Albert Kantoff', 'Bernard Blier, Dominique Davray, Henri Virlogeux, Frank Villard, Jacques Marin, Yori Bertin, Michèle Bardollet, Jean Lefebvre', null, 'The film consists of three novels. The film begins with the fact that the Bernard Blier hero removes a lantern from the entrance to a brothel. The second part is about how the lantern and jewelery were stolen from a young baroness. And in the third part the hero of Louis de Funes hangs a lantern at the entrance to his house.', 'The film consists of three novels. The film begins with the fact that the Bernard Blier hero removes a lantern from the entrance to a brothel. The second part is about how the lantern and jewelery were stolen from a young baroness. And in the third part the hero of Louis de Funes hangs a lantern at the entrance to his house.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qbS1C9Zc1RbQIUs2tzVhyPwQNUl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:78534'),
  ('412173286984153061', 'How to Kill a Judge', 1975, 'Thriller, Crime, Drama', 'Damiano Damiani, Mario Maffei, Mario Vulpiani', 'Damiano Damiani, Fulvio Gicca Palli, Enrico Ribulsi', 'Franco Nero, Françoise Fabian, Pierluigi Aprà, Giancarlo Badessi, Ennio Balbo, Luciano Catenacci, Giorgio Cerioni, Tano Cimarosa', null, 'A filmmaker''s popular movie about a corrupt judge who is killed by the Mafia seemingly foretells the murder of a magistrate who orders the film''s seizure.', 'A filmmaker''s popular movie about a corrupt judge who is killed by the Mafia seemingly foretells the murder of a magistrate who orders the film''s seizure.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8xgeWbVtJvzgsUPGPlcAkUV70Hc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:118876'),
  ('1078503671496243938', 'How to Kill Your Neighbor''s Dog', 2002, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Michael Kalesniko, Mark D. Currie, Hubert Taczanowski', 'Michael Kalesniko', 'Kenneth Branagh, Robin Wright, Suzi Hofrichter, Lynn Redgrave, Jared Harris, Peter Riegert, David Krumholtz, Johnathon Schaech', 'R', 'The story of Peter McGowan, a chain-smoking, impotent, insomniac playwright who lives in Los Angeles. Once very successful, he is now in the tenth year of a decade-long string of production failures. He finds himself bonding with a new neighbor''s lonely young daughter who has mild cerebral palsy; and during one of his middle-of-the-night strolls, he encounters his oddball doppelgänger.', 'The story of Peter McGowan, a chain-smoking, impotent, insomniac playwright who lives in Los Angeles. Once very successful, he is now in the tenth year of a decade-long string of production failures. He finds himself bonding with a new neighbor''s lonely young daughter who has mild cerebral palsy; and during one of his middle-of-the-night strolls, he encounters his oddball doppelgänger.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6SnhJrYar2gedIdyIqlLwagBmCr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13791'),
  ('297407624133524065', 'How to Kiss', 1988, 'Comedy, Animation', 'Bill Plympton', 'Bill Plympton', 'Chris Hoffman', null, 'As a brave couple demonstrates, the narrator uses quotes, examples and advice to help us all reach the highest heights in the art of kissing.', 'As a brave couple demonstrates, the narrator uses quotes, examples and advice to help us all reach the highest heights in the art of kissing.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xNkqn27sJpbULN650FovmfBDlBK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:146523'),
  ('719304075971324583', 'How to Live in This World', 2019, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Ryu Si-moon, Shin Yang-joong', 'Shin Yang-joong', 'Kim In-kwon, Lee Na-ra, Seo Tae-hwa, Jang Ga-hyun, Park Soo-in, Lee Seo-yi, Lee Ja-eun', null, 'Young-wook and Yeon-kyung have been married for 10 years and are slightly worried about their estranged relationship. With their love life decreasing, the two begin to seek attraction elsewhere. Yeon-kyung meets Min-sik, a gallery customer, and falls in love with his charm. Meanwhile, Young-wook meets a debtor''s ex-wife in search of a dormant debtor and cannot resist the temptation to sleep with her. In the end, they both find themselves examining love and will the two recover their happiness as when they were first married?', 'Young-wook and Yeon-kyung have been married for 10 years and are slightly worried about their estranged relationship. With their love life decreasing, the two begin to seek attraction elsewhere. Yeon-kyung meets Min-sik, a gallery customer, and falls in love with his charm. Meanwhile, Young-wook meets a debtor''s ex-wife in search of a dormant debtor and cannot resist the temptation to sleep with her. In the end, they both find themselves examining love and will the two recover their happiness as when they were first married?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8vWLuwmK2Jm7ggeJepRboaJAisf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:617285'),
  ('1060110556276810367', 'How to Lose a Guy in 10 Days', 2003, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Donald Petrie, John Bailey, Ellen H. Schwartz', 'Brian Regan, Kristen Buckley, Burr Steers', 'Kate Hudson, Matthew McConaughey, Kathryn Hahn, Annie Parisse, Adam Goldberg, Thomas Lennon, Michael Michele, Shalom Harlow', 'PG-13', 'It''s the battle of wills, as Andie needs to prove she can dump a guy in 10 days, whereas Ben needs to prove he can win a girl in 10 days. Now, the clock is ticking—and the wildly entertaining comedy smash is off and running in this irresistible tale of sex, lies and outrageous romantic fireworks!', 'It''s the battle of wills, as Andie needs to prove she can dump a guy in 10 days, whereas Ben needs to prove he can win a girl in 10 days. Now, the clock is ticking—and the wildly entertaining comedy smash is off and running in this irresistible tale of sex, lies and outrageous romantic fireworks!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2dlftyPz7mTYbrsPvTogyFmYd7d.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9919'),
  ('131932117966766886', 'How to Lose a Popularity Contest', 2026, 'Comedy, Romance, Drama', 'Stephen S. Campanelli, Stephen Maier', 'Kaitlin Reilly, Dorian Keyes', 'Chase Hudson, Sara Waisglass, Lillian Doucet-Roche, Graham Verchere, Ecstasia Sanders', null, 'A rebellious student and a perfectionist overachiever form an unlikely alliance in their race for student body president, discovering unexpected feelings along the way.', 'A rebellious student and a perfectionist overachiever form an unlikely alliance in their race for student body president, discovering unexpected feelings along the way.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fmetadata-static.plex.tv%2Fc%2Fgracenote%2Fc3dc5d57fbb9cc7a6608d44e8e83b7b3.jpg', 'plex:movie:how-to-lose-a-popularity-contest-2026'),
  ('125454408582037373', 'How to Lose a Wife and Find a Lover', 1978, 'Comedy', 'Pasquale Festa Campanile, Giuseppe Ruzzolini', 'Roberto Leoni, Luigi Malerba, Franco Bucceri', 'Johnny Dorelli, Barbara Bouchet, Carlo Bagno, Elsa Vazzoler, Felice Andreasi, Anny Papa, Gino Pernice, Ugo Maria Morosi', null, 'Alberto deceived by his wife, goes to some place in the mountains to escape. There he meets a woman who was there for the same reasons that he was.', 'Alberto deceived by his wife, goes to some place in the mountains to escape. There he meets a woman who was there for the same reasons that he was.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pOhvjrzpOUuhHo4lPk6yqkE8CL7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:81835'),
  ('84082212771941399', 'How to Lose Friends & Alienate People', 2008, 'Comedy, Romance, Drama', 'Robert B. Weide, Oliver Stapleton, Matthew Penry-Davey', 'Peter Straughan', 'Simon Pegg, Kirsten Dunst, Danny Huston, Megan Fox, Jeff Bridges, Gillian Anderson, Max Minghella, Jefferson Mays', 'R', 'Sidney Young is a down-on-his-luck journalist. Thanks to a stint involving a pig and a glitzy awards ceremony, Sidney turns his fortunes around, attracting the attention of Clayton Harding, editor of New York-based glossy magazine ''Sharps'', and landing the holy grail of journalism jobs. The Brit jets off to the Big Apple and moves from one blunder to the next.', 'Sidney Young is a down-on-his-luck journalist. Thanks to a stint involving a pig and a glitzy awards ceremony, Sidney turns his fortunes around, attracting the attention of Clayton Harding, editor of New York-based glossy magazine ''Sharps'', and landing the holy grail of journalism jobs. The Brit jets off to the Big Apple and moves from one blunder to the next.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8Xd1mO861aK2OirTbxZrODNhihW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13092'),
  ('885385702593421674', 'How to Make a Killing', 2025, 'Comedy, Thriller, Crime', 'Franck Dubosc, Alain Braconnier, Marine Guérard', 'Franck Dubosc, Sarah Kaminsky', 'Franck Dubosc, Laure Calamy, Benoît Poelvoorde, Joséphine de Meaux, Kim Higelin, Mehdi Meskar, Emmanuelle Devos, Anne Le Ny', null, 'Michel and Cathy, wed for longer than they can remember, lead a quiet but monotonous life in the mountains. When a bear bursts out in front of Michel’s car, accidentally killing two drug dealers and revealing a €2 million loot in the process, their life takes an unpredictable turn, especially when they decide to cover up the incident and keep the money! But their plan leads them to stumble upon an unexplained trail of dead bodies. More used to being honest than crooked, Michel and Cathy’s clumsy cover-up efforts soon put an interfering inspector hot on their trail.', 'Michel and Cathy, wed for longer than they can remember, lead a quiet but monotonous life in the mountains. When a bear bursts out in front of Michel’s car, accidentally killing two drug dealers and revealing a €2 million loot in the process, their life takes an unpredictable turn, especially when they decide to cover up the incident and keep the money! But their plan leads them to stumble upon an unexplained trail of dead bodies. More used to being honest than crooked, Michel and Cathy’s clumsy cover-up efforts soon put an interfering inspector hot on their trail.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oovadj4TsgCuAGfd5LhDP19ZCYD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1210732'),
  ('101532623995344869', 'How to Make a Killing', 2026, 'Comedy, Thriller', 'John Patton Ford, Todd Banhazl, Shelley Lankovits', 'Robert Hamer, John Dighton, John Patton Ford', 'Glen Powell, Margaret Qualley, Jessica Henwick, Bill Camp, Zach Woods, Topher Grace, Ed Harris, Raff Law', 'R', 'Disowned at birth by his obscenely wealthy family, blue-collar Becket Redfellow will stop at nothing to reclaim his inheritance, no matter how many relatives stand in his way.', 'Disowned at birth by his obscenely wealthy family, blue-collar Becket Redfellow will stop at nothing to reclaim his inheritance, no matter how many relatives stand in his way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yQ7OP2HYxl9YmkWNMkuUA2YaF5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:467905'),
  ('1090514870738289711', 'How to Make a Monster', 1958, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Maury Gertsman, Herbert L. Strock', 'Herman Cohen, Aben Kandel', 'Robert H. Harris, Paul Brinegar, Gary Conway, Gary Clarke, Malcolm Atterbury, Dennis Cross, Morris Ankrum, Walter Reed', null, 'When master monster make-up man Pete Dumond is fired by the new bosses of American International studios, he uses his creations to exact revenge.', 'When master monster make-up man Pete Dumond is fired by the new bosses of American International studios, he uses his creations to exact revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pE77WtghHXdDbLb0gCj8e28Fuxo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:116327'),
  ('601328866363520913', 'How to Make a Monster', 2001, 'TV Movie, Horror, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'George Huang, Steven Finestone', 'George Huang', 'Clea DuVall, Steven Culp, Tyler Mane, Jason Marsden, Karim Prince, Julie Strain, Danny Masterson, Colleen Camp', 'R', 'Video game developer Clayton Software enlists the talents of a misfit group of programmers to develop the scariest computer combat game: EVILUTION. With four weeks to bring the game to market and a million-dollar bonus on the line, they utilize a telemetry suit to render a 3-D version of the onscreen player. But when a power surge gives the hard drive a mind of its own, the suit comes to life to play the game for real and the programming team find themselves in the middle of a chilling virtual nightmare beyond their wildest imagination.', 'Video game developer Clayton Software enlists the talents of a misfit group of programmers to develop the scariest computer combat game: EVILUTION. With four weeks to bring the game to market and a million-dollar bonus on the line, they utilize a telemetry suit to render a 3-D version of the onscreen player. But when a power surge gives the hard drive a mind of its own, the suit comes to life to play the game for real and the programming team find themselves in the middle of a chilling virtual nightmare beyond their wildest imagination.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1SYUhLRAe2hgw47aBWMxUG7f97X.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38510'),
  ('968490660634576383', 'How to Make an American Quilt', 1995, 'Drama, Romance', 'Jocelyn Moorhouse, Janusz Kamiński, P.J. Hogan', 'Jane Anderson', 'Winona Ryder, Anne Bancroft, Ellen Burstyn, Kate Nelligan, Jean Simmons, Maya Angelou, Alfre Woodard, Dermot Mulroney', 'PG-13', 'Soon-to-be-wed graduate student Finn Dodd develops cold feet when she suspects her fiancé is cheating on her. In order to clear her head, Finn visits her grandmother, Hy, and great aunt, Glady Joe Cleary, in Grasse, Calif. There, Finn learns that Hy and Glady Joe are members of a group of passionate quilters, and over the course of her visit she is regaled with tales of love and life by women who have collected rich experiences and much wisdom.', 'Soon-to-be-wed graduate student Finn Dodd develops cold feet when she suspects her fiancé is cheating on her. In order to clear her head, Finn visits her grandmother, Hy, and great aunt, Glady Joe Cleary, in Grasse, Calif. There, Finn learns that Hy and Glady Joe are members of a group of passionate quilters, and over the course of her visit she is regaled with tales of love and life by women who have collected rich experiences and much wisdom.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pI9UAemlWgdrnjRgYJsbTk8BSJc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11861'),
  ('904665590406775222', 'How to Make Good When One Is a Jerk and a Crybaby', 1974, 'Comedy', 'Michel Audiard, Maurice Fellous', 'Jean-Marie Poiré, Michel Audiard', 'Jean Carmet, Stéphane Audran, Jane Birkin, Jean-Pierre Marielle, Jean Rochefort, Evelyne Buyle, Féodor Atkine, Laurence Badie', null, 'A story about a guy who still lives with his mother and sells some really awful alcohol to bartenders. The only way for him to do this is to cry and invent himself an awful life. Then he meets the beautiful woman whose goal in life is to sleep with the less exciting guys on Earth.', 'A story about a guy who still lives with his mother and sells some really awful alcohol to bartenders. The only way for him to do this is to cry and invent himself an awful life. Then he meets the beautiful woman whose goal in life is to sleep with the less exciting guys on Earth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kkOTA9pXA1P5y0gPeShEBoEGUWB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:74143'),
  ('735360236173806807', 'How to Make Love to a Woman', 1996, 'Animation, Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Bill Plympton', 'Bill Plympton', 'Daniel Kaufman', null, 'An animated look at the 11 essential steps to make the pilgrim''s progess from finding a woman to making love to her. Along the way, our prototypical man gets advice about her eyes, her hair, her neck, her nostrils (and how they will flare as she becomes excited), the kiss, disrobing her (be subtle yet have authority), the hug, her nipples, and kinky accessories. At every turn, even as the exultant strains of Handel''s Hallelujah Chorus signal that success is upon him, there are dangers and pitfalls. The journey requires steely resolve.', 'An animated look at the 11 essential steps to make the pilgrim''s progess from finding a woman to making love to her. Along the way, our prototypical man gets advice about her eyes, her hair, her neck, her nostrils (and how they will flare as she becomes excited), the kiss, disrobing her (be subtle yet have authority), the hug, her nipples, and kinky accessories. At every turn, even as the exultant strains of Handel''s Hallelujah Chorus signal that success is upon him, there are dangers and pitfalls. The journey requires steely resolve.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8XgfzAIcTtrTp9deUgwYr5gipHg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:69131'),
  ('1089466329331467539', 'How to Make Love to a Woman', 2010, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Scott Culver, Dallas Sterling', 'Dennis Kao', 'Josh Meyers, Krysten Ritter, Jenna Jameson, Ian Somerhalder, James Hong, Catherine Reitman, Raviv Ullman, Ike Barinholtz', 'R', 'When Andy hears his girlfriend Lauren sigh after sex, he panics. But even with the help of his friends, porn stars and tantric experts, he continues to stumble in the bedroom, finally realizing that in order to give Lauren the ''O'' word, he first needs to say the ''L'' word. Starring Josh Meyers, Krysten Ritter, Ian Somerhalder, Jenna Jameson and Ken Jeong.', 'When Andy hears his girlfriend Lauren sigh after sex, he panics. But even with the help of his friends, porn stars and tantric experts, he continues to stumble in the bedroom, finally realizing that in order to give Lauren the ''O'' word, he first needs to say the ''L'' word. Starring Josh Meyers, Krysten Ritter, Ian Somerhalder, Jenna Jameson and Ken Jeong.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A3LppVfwslUokTyETpclKwGAXSM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40722'),
  ('456859653673459118', 'How to Make Money Selling Drugs', 2012, 'Documentary', 'Matthew Cooke, Matthew Cooke', 'Matthew Cooke', 'Matthew Cooke, Woody Harrelson, Susan Sarandon, Barry Cooper, Eminem, 50 Cent, David Simon, Arianna Huffington', 'NR', 'Ten easy steps show you how to make money from drugs, featuring a series of interviews with drug dealers, prison employees, and lobbyists arguing for tougher drug laws.', 'Ten easy steps show you how to make money from drugs, featuring a series of interviews with drug dealers, prison employees, and lobbyists arguing for tougher drug laws.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sssykN580AHcU2F1W4LBgo5DJvi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:124071'),
  ('871852069095053121', 'How to Make Out', 2020, 'Comedy', 'Julien Hirsch, Adeline Picault', 'Adeline Picault', 'Paul Kircher, Inès d''Assomption, Ramzy Bedia, Vincent Macaigne, Sophie-Marie Larrouy, Renely Alfred, Max Fidèle, Théo Gross', null, 'Arthur, 15, has a crush on Ouassima, who does not even look at him... While he has never been upset, she goes out with Matt, the handsome kid from college. To get closer to her, Arthur gathers a group of single losers and offers to give them lessons in fishing, at 10 euros per lesson. In the changing rooms of the swimming pool, a long intimate and collective learning begins on "girls and love: instructions for use".', 'Arthur, 15, has a crush on Ouassima, who does not even look at him... While he has never been upset, she goes out with Matt, the handsome kid from college. To get closer to her, Arthur gathers a group of single losers and offers to give them lessons in fishing, at 10 euros per lesson. In the changing rooms of the swimming pool, a long intimate and collective learning begins on "girls and love: instructions for use".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ePyiJKlXgxroMvVRXsZ0rRFLkzF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:711321'),
  ('828183892463257404', 'How to Marry a Millionaire', 1953, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Jean Negulesco, Joseph MacDonald, F.E. ''Johnny'' Johnston', 'Nunnally Johnson', 'Marilyn Monroe, Lauren Bacall, Betty Grable, David Wayne, Rory Calhoun, Cameron Mitchell, Alexander D''Arcy, Fred Clark', null, 'Three women set out to find eligible millionaires to marry, but find true love in the process.', 'Three women set out to find eligible millionaires to marry, but find true love in the process.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dFwefYyEOOZaWVn15xGY6CbYYJ2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10297'),
  ('339565464371458890', 'How to Meet the Lucky Stars', 1996, 'Action, Comedy', 'Frankie Chan Fan-Kei, Anthony Pun Yiu-Ming, Ricky Lau', 'Ivy Lee Mo-King', 'Sammo Hung Kam-Bo, Stanley Fung Shui-Fan, Eric Tsang Chi-Wai, Richard Ng Yiu-Hon, Michael Miu Kiu-Wai, Françoise Yip, Diana Pang Dan, Natalis Chan Pak-Cheung', null, 'How to Meet the Lucky Stars is a 1996 Hong Kong film and the final film in the Lucky Stars film series. Featuring the "Lucky Stars" Sammo Hung (in a supporting role and another role as a cop), Eric Tsang, Stanley Fung, Richard Ng, Michael Miu and new cast member Vincent Lau as Hung''s younger cousin. Also featuring a number of guest appearances including Françoise Yip, Natalis Chan, Chen Kuan Tai, Cheng Pei-pei, Chan Hung Lit and Nora Miao. Produced by Eric Tsang, directed by Frankie Chan with action choreography by Yuen Cheung-Yan and Mars.The film was released as a benefit film for the famous Hong Kong film director, Lo Wei, who died in 1996.', 'How to Meet the Lucky Stars is a 1996 Hong Kong film and the final film in the Lucky Stars film series. Featuring the "Lucky Stars" Sammo Hung (in a supporting role and another role as a cop), Eric Tsang, Stanley Fung, Richard Ng, Michael Miu and new cast member Vincent Lau as Hung''s younger cousin. Also featuring a number of guest appearances including Françoise Yip, Natalis Chan, Chen Kuan Tai, Cheng Pei-pei, Chan Hung Lit and Nora Miao. Produced by Eric Tsang, directed by Frankie Chan with action choreography by Yuen Cheung-Yan and Mars.The film was released as a benefit film for the famous Hong Kong film director, Lo Wei, who died in 1996.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sFlAvMekpxwVehblFlGaZBuZd0G.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63033'),
