  ('979606641840689814', 'How to Murder Your Husband: The Nancy Brophy Story', 2023, 'TV Movie, Thriller', 'Stephen Tolkin', 'Stephen Tolkin', 'Cybill Shepherd, Steve Guttenberg, Lisa Durupt, Camille Mitchell, Sandy Minh Abley, Kate Mitchell, Jesse Irving, Hilary Jardine', null, 'Author Nancy Crampton-Brophy often writes stories about female protagonists who fantasize about killing their own husbands. In a shocking and ironic turn of events, Brophy faces accusations of doing the same thing in real life.', 'Author Nancy Crampton-Brophy often writes stories about female protagonists who fantasize about killing their own husbands. In a shocking and ironic turn of events, Brophy faces accusations of doing the same thing in real life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vvyB5dIkRH1OJ0iOtxG88nY16hn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1064390'),
  ('940859116798719668', 'How to Murder Your Wife', 1965, 'Comedy', 'Richard Quine, Harry Stradling Sr., Angelo Laiacona', 'George Axelrod', 'Jack Lemmon, Virna Lisi, Terry-Thomas, Eddie Mayehoff, Claire Trevor, Sidney Blackmer, Max Showalter, Jack Albertson', 'NR', 'Stanley Ford leads an idyllic bachelor life. He is a nationally syndicated cartoonist whose Bash Brannigan series provides him with a luxury townhouse and a full-time valet, Charles. When he wakes up the morning after the night before - he had attended a friend''s stag party - he finds that he is married to the very beautiful woman who popped out of the cake - and who doesn''t speak a word of English. Despite his initial protestations, he comes to like married life and even changes his cartoon character from a super spy to a somewhat harried husband.', 'Stanley Ford leads an idyllic bachelor life. He is a nationally syndicated cartoonist whose Bash Brannigan series provides him with a luxury townhouse and a full-time valet, Charles. When he wakes up the morning after the night before - he had attended a friend''s stag party - he finds that he is married to the very beautiful woman who popped out of the cake - and who doesn''t speak a word of English. Despite his initial protestations, he comes to like married life and even changes his cartoon character from a super spy to a somewhat harried husband.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1lwxAeN3OGXkoPH9DzZrRtA7XK0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26685'),
  ('806151908161254257', 'How to Plan an Orgy in a Small Town', 2015, 'Drama, Comedy', 'D. Gregor Hagey, Jeremy LaLonde', 'Jeremy LaLonde', 'Jewel Staite, Ennis Esmer, Tommie-Amber Pirie, Jonas Chernick, Katharine Isabelle, Mark O''Brien, Lauren Lee Smith, Kristian Bruun', 'NR', 'In high school Cassie Cranston was slut-shamed out of the wholesome and repressed town of Beaver’s Ridge following a humiliating attempt at losing her virginity. Now, years later, a big city sex columnist, Cassie returns home to bury her mother and finds a chance for revenge when her prudish childhood nemesis insists she helps her old friends plan an orgy.', 'In high school Cassie Cranston was slut-shamed out of the wholesome and repressed town of Beaver’s Ridge following a humiliating attempt at losing her virginity. Now, years later, a big city sex columnist, Cassie returns home to bury her mother and finds a chance for revenge when her prudish childhood nemesis insists she helps her old friends plan an orgy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f7poipkBYz3cBF0rMdzYtzVWtdO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:356300'),
  ('710152874314320397', 'How to Play Baseball', 1942, 'Comedy, Animation', 'Jack Kinney, Louis Debney', null, 'George Johnson, Fred Shields', 'NR', 'Goofy shows us the national pastime. After a brief overview, we have a demonstration of the many possible pitches. On to the World Series, where we go through an eventful inning, culminating in a baseball that disintegrates when being hit.', 'Goofy shows us the national pastime. After a brief overview, we have a demonstration of the many possible pitches. On to the World Series, where we go through an eventful inning, culminating in a baseball that disintegrates when being hit.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uyDzmQhrBWO7BV6joFb6dn23lUy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:66983'),
