  ('279155005280128248', 'How to Rob a Bank', 2024, 'Documentary, Crime', 'Seth Porges, Stephen Robert Morse', 'Maxim Gertler-Jaffe, Stephen Robert Morse, Seth Porges', 'Jordan Burtchett, Mark Biggins, Susan Dodd, Ellen Glasser, Steven Harper, Deborah Horne, Shawn Johnson, David Kerley', 'R', 'In this true-crime documentary, a charismatic rebel in 1990s Seattle pulls off an unprecedented string of bank robberies straight out of the movies.', 'In this true-crime documentary, a charismatic rebel in 1990s Seattle pulls off an unprecedented string of bank robberies straight out of the movies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vhBQOgig0bXCXIgHHyO8ipG47J9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1291143'),
