  ('445224356880654703', 'How to Stuff a Wild Bikini', 1965, 'Comedy, Music, Romance', 'William Asher, Floyd Crosby, Dale Hutchinson', 'William Asher, Leo Townsend', 'Annette Funicello, Dwayne Hickman, Brian Donlevy, Harvey Lembeck, Beverly Adams, John Ashley, Jody McCrea, Marianne Gaba', 'NR', 'When he''s stationed in Tahiti, a sailor hires a witch doctor to keep an eye on his girlfriend.', 'When he''s stationed in Tahiti, a sailor hires a witch doctor to keep an eye on his girlfriend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/285efVjhE5xMnKWVJDRieEcBqQd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26879'),
  ('962495642394622779', 'How to Succeed at Losing', 2023, 'Comedy', 'Rodrigo Triana, Mariano Diluch', 'Dago García', 'Andres Sandoval, María Elisa Camargo, Jacqueline Arenal, Roberto Cano, Felipe Botero, Jefferson Carabali, Bernardo García, Carlos-Manuel Vesga', null, 'Miguel, a successful man, ends up in jail, unjustly accused of money laundering. His sentence completed, with empty pockets and nowhere to go, Miguel returns to his old neighborhood. There, he encounters his childhood friends, who continue playing futsal, never winning a match. Miguel decides to coach them, leading them to victory. On the way, he discovers the unexpected consequences of success.', 'Miguel, a successful man, ends up in jail, unjustly accused of money laundering. His sentence completed, with empty pockets and nowhere to go, Miguel returns to his old neighborhood. There, he encounters his childhood friends, who continue playing futsal, never winning a match. Miguel decides to coach them, leading them to victory. On the way, he discovers the unexpected consequences of success.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d45rHJsby26TSakc5ahkdmE72YH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1221118'),
  ('185516780313159179', 'How to Succeed in Business Without Really Trying', 1967, 'Comedy, Romance', 'David Swift, Burnett Guffey, John D. Bloss', 'David Swift', 'Robert Morse, Michele Lee, Rudy Vallee, Scooter Teague, Maureen Arthur, John Myhers, Carol Worthington, Kathryn Reynolds', 'NR', 'A young but bright former window cleaner rises to the top of his company by following the advice of a book about ruthless advancement in business.', 'A young but bright former window cleaner rises to the top of his company by following the advice of a book about ruthless advancement in business.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nxjgAm7fDMqUjbEbMKNYasEgAjB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22682'),
  ('381854093681826789', 'How to Survive a Plague', 2012, 'Documentary, History', 'David France, Derek Wiesehahn', 'Woody Richman, David France, Tyler H. Walk', 'Peter Staley, Larry Kramer, Iris Long, Bob Rafsky, Mark Harrington, Anthony Fauci', 'NR', 'A story of two coalitions – ACT UP and TAG (Treatment Action Group) – whose activism and innovation turned AIDS from a death sentence into a manageable condition. Despite having no scientific training, these self-made activists infiltrated the pharmaceutical industry and helped identify promising new drugs, moving them from experimental trials to patients in record time.', 'A story of two coalitions – ACT UP and TAG (Treatment Action Group) – whose activism and innovation turned AIDS from a death sentence into a manageable condition. Despite having no scientific training, these self-made activists infiltrated the pharmaceutical industry and helped identify promising new drugs, moving them from experimental trials to patients in record time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/azlN2LO5OtJVeSokkK408xMtt1n.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84286'),
  ('1065896974796646833', 'How to Survive Without Mum', 2023, 'Comedy, Family', 'Ludovic Bernard, Louise Delécaut, Vincent Richard-Marquis', 'Mathieu Oullion, Ludovic Bernard', 'Franck Dubosc, Aure Atika, Alexis Michalik, Héléna Noguerra, Violette Guillon, Evan Paturel, Ilan Debrabant, Swan Joulin', null, 'After Antoine was fired from his job, he became a stay-at-home dad taking care of his four children, while his wife Isabelle restarts her career as a lawyer. For Antoine, the family''s upcoming ski vacation is a godsend: he can finally take a break from parenthood and enjoy a luxury ski resort! But just as they are about to step on the train, Isabelle is called back to work for an emergency and Antoine has to deal, on his own, with his four mischievous kids going wild on the slopes and in the fancy hotel, as the trip turns into total chaos…', 'After Antoine was fired from his job, he became a stay-at-home dad taking care of his four children, while his wife Isabelle restarts her career as a lawyer. For Antoine, the family''s upcoming ski vacation is a godsend: he can finally take a break from parenthood and enjoy a luxury ski resort! But just as they are about to step on the train, Isabelle is called back to work for an emergency and Antoine has to deal, on his own, with his four mischievous kids going wild on the slopes and in the fancy hotel, as the trip turns into total chaos…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a9XGEeB8skClVlzRrRxujB7sFN4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:898994'),
  ('550668117805321936', 'How to Swim', 1942, 'Animation, Comedy, Family', 'Jack Kinney', null, 'George Johnson, John McLeish', 'NR', 'Goofy''s plans to give a swimming lesson and enjoy a day at the beach go awry.', 'Goofy''s plans to give a swimming lesson and enjoy a day at the beach go awry.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7kPrqirhoy2zIKwhti7xFwUBrIE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:66986'),
  ('779646874584366142', 'How to Talk to Girls at Parties', 2017, 'Comedy, Music, Romance, Science Fiction', 'John Cameron Mitchell, Frankie DeMarco, Adam Lock', 'Neil Gaiman', 'Elle Fanning, Alex Sharp, Nicole Kidman, Matt Lucas, Ruth Wilson, Abraham Lewis, Ethan Lawrence, Edward Petherbridge', 'R', 'In 1970s London, a teenage outsider named Enn falls in love with a rebellious alien girl named Zan, who has come to Earth for a party. Together, they navigate the complexities of intergalactic culture and the trials of first love.', 'In 1970s London, a teenage outsider named Enn falls in love with a rebellious alien girl named Zan, who has come to Earth for a party. Together, they navigate the complexities of intergalactic culture and the trials of first love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v6mPfyGshwXd1R6kQlMEyZ8Zu2s.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:341689'),
  ('548092630145449809', 'How to Train Your Dragon', 2010, 'Fantasy, Adventure, Animation, Family', 'Dean DeBlois, Chris Sanders, Tom Molet', 'Dean DeBlois, Chris Sanders, William Davies', 'Jay Baruchel, Gerard Butler, Craig Ferguson, America Ferrera, Jonah Hill, Christopher Mintz-Plasse, T.J. Miller, Kristen Wiig', 'PG', 'As the son of a Viking leader on the cusp of manhood, shy Hiccup Horrendous Haddock III faces a rite of passage: he must kill a dragon to prove his warrior mettle. But after downing a feared dragon, he realizes that he no longer wants to destroy it, and instead befriends the beast – which he names Toothless – much to the chagrin of his warrior father.', 'As the son of a Viking leader on the cusp of manhood, shy Hiccup Horrendous Haddock III faces a rite of passage: he must kill a dragon to prove his warrior mettle. But after downing a feared dragon, he realizes that he no longer wants to destroy it, and instead befriends the beast – which he names Toothless – much to the chagrin of his warrior father.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ygGmAO60t8GyqUo9xYeYxSZAR3b.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10191'),
  ('937340021607021058', 'How to Train Your Dragon', 2025, 'Fantasy, Family, Action, Adventure', 'Dean DeBlois, Bill Pope, Lucy Bevan', 'Dean DeBlois', 'Mason Thames, Nico Parker, Gerard Butler, Nick Frost, Gabriel Howell, Julian Dennison, Bronwyn James, Harry Trevaldwyn', 'PG', 'On the rugged isle of Berk, where Vikings and dragons have been bitter enemies for generations, Hiccup stands apart, defying centuries of tradition when he befriends Toothless, a feared Night Fury dragon. Their unlikely bond reveals the true nature of dragons, challenging the very foundations of Viking society.', 'On the rugged isle of Berk, where Vikings and dragons have been bitter enemies for generations, Hiccup stands apart, defying centuries of tradition when he befriends Toothless, a feared Night Fury dragon. Their unlikely bond reveals the true nature of dragons, challenging the very foundations of Viking society.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/41dfWUWtg1kUZcJYe6Zk6ewxzMu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1087192'),
  ('796906408776587068', 'How to Train Your Dragon 2', 2014, 'Fantasy, Action, Adventure, Animation, Family', 'Dean DeBlois, Gaurav Shenai, Nathan Loofbourrow', 'Dean DeBlois', 'Jay Baruchel, Cate Blanchett, Gerard Butler, Craig Ferguson, America Ferrera, Jonah Hill, Christopher Mintz-Plasse, T.J. Miller', 'PG', 'Five years after uniting the dragons and Vikings of Berk, Hiccup and Toothless soar beyond their homeland, charting the vast unknown. During one of their adventures, the pair discover a secret cave that houses hundreds of wild dragons -- and a mysterious dragon rider with a startling connection to Hiccup. And as the ruthless dragon conqueror Drago Bludvist rises to seize control of both dragons and people alike, Hiccup must step into his role as a true leader and, alongside his friends and Toothless, protect Berk from a devastating war.', 'Five years after uniting the dragons and Vikings of Berk, Hiccup and Toothless soar beyond their homeland, charting the vast unknown. During one of their adventures, the pair discover a secret cave that houses hundreds of wild dragons -- and a mysterious dragon rider with a startling connection to Hiccup. And as the ruthless dragon conqueror Drago Bludvist rises to seize control of both dragons and people alike, Hiccup must step into his role as a true leader and, alongside his friends and Toothless, protect Berk from a devastating war.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d13Uj86LdbDLrfDoHR5aDOFYyJC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:82702'),
  ('520840321169912239', 'How to Train Your Dragon: The Hidden World', 2019, 'Animation, Family, Adventure', 'Dean DeBlois, Jennifer J. Pan, Gil Zimmerman', 'Dean DeBlois', 'Jay Baruchel, America Ferrera, F. Murray Abraham, Cate Blanchett, Gerard Butler, Craig Ferguson, Jonah Hill, Christopher Mintz-Plasse', 'PG', 'As Hiccup fulfills his dream of creating a peaceful dragon utopia, Toothless’ discovery of an untamed, elusive mate draws the Night Fury away. When danger mounts at home and Hiccup’s reign as village chief is tested, both dragon and rider must make impossible decisions to save their kind.', 'As Hiccup fulfills his dream of creating a peaceful dragon utopia, Toothless’ discovery of an untamed, elusive mate draws the Night Fury away. When danger mounts at home and Hiccup’s reign as village chief is tested, both dragon and rider must make impossible decisions to save their kind.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xvx4Yhf0DVH8G4LzNISpMfFBDy2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:166428'),
  ('465464872480614952', 'How to Train Your Husband', 2018, 'Romance, Comedy, TV Movie', 'Brian Totoro, Isaac Alongi, Sandra L. Martin', 'Sandra L. Martin', 'Julie Gonzalo, Jonathan Chase, Karla Mosley, Jordan Monaghan, Luciana Faulhaber, Matt Walton, Andre Hall, Forbes Riley', null, 'A marriage therapist attempts to fix her own marriage by focusing on how to change her husband.', 'A marriage therapist attempts to fix her own marriage by focusing on how to change her husband.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zld9o6ENdIUX4uVzkO98tA05dol.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:531712'),
  ('385382711089244621', 'How to Undress in Front of Your Husband', 1937, 'Comedy', 'Dwain Esper', null, 'Elaine Barrie, Trixie Friganza, Hal Richardson, Albert Van Antwerp', null, 'A "Peeping Tom" likes to look through windows at women undressing. We see him as he sneaks a peek at two subjects. The first, a woman dressed in lingerie, is young, shapely and attractive. The second, to be charitable, isn''t. That doesn''t stop him, and the viewer, from getting an eyeful.', 'A "Peeping Tom" likes to look through windows at women undressing. We see him as he sneaks a peek at two subjects. The first, a woman dressed in lingerie, is young, shapely and attractive. The second, to be charitable, isn''t. That doesn''t stop him, and the viewer, from getting an eyeful.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gXDZL5f2shoZlFpqh15ee45aRVm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:232527'),
  ('995893217131167676', 'How to Use Guys with Secret Tips', 2013, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Kim Sung-han, Lee Won-suk, Kim Sun-ryung', 'Noh Hye-young, Ha Soo-jin, Lee Won-suk', 'Lee Si-young, Oh Jung-se, Park Young-kyu, Kim Jung-tae, Lee Won-jong, Bae Sung-woo, Jun Kim, Kim Min-jae', null, 'An overworked woman tries to improve her standing with men using a self-help video.', 'An overworked woman tries to improve her standing with men using a self-help video.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/25vTPNVDpG7f6XzzuPWX7svZ971.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:189150'),
  ('1009361185603969177', 'How to Wake a Princess', 1978, 'Fantasy, Family', 'Václav Vorlíček, Jaroslav Pour, Bohumil Koška', 'Bohumila Zelenková', 'Jiří Sovák, Milena Dvorská, Marie Horáková, Vladimír Menšík, František Filipovský, Jan Hrušínský, Jan Kraus, Stella Zázvorková', null, 'At long last, King Dalimil and Queen Eliška have produced an heir, Princess Růženka. Consumed with envy, Eliška’s sister Melánie casts a curse: On the day Růženka turns seventeen, she will prick her finger and fall into a deep sleep together with the entire kingdom.', 'At long last, King Dalimil and Queen Eliška have produced an heir, Princess Růženka. Consumed with envy, Eliška’s sister Melánie casts a curse: On the day Růženka turns seventeen, she will prick her finger and fall into a deep sleep together with the entire kingdom.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hkRlXThlAbotzRm7mHszQ3pSE6y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50774'),
  ('700063031023609750', 'How to Win at Checkers (Every Time)', 2015, 'Drama', 'Pom Bunsermvicha, Josh Kim, Pises Wongsathianchai', 'Josh Kim', 'Ingkarat Damrongsakkul, Theerachai Wimolchaireuk, Thira Chutikul, Jinna Navarat, Natarat Lakha, Vatanya Thamdee, Anawat Patanawanichkul, Warattha Kaew-on', null, 'An 11-year-old boy steals money for bribes to remove his gay older brother from Thai military conscription rolls, unaware of the ramifications.', 'An 11-year-old boy steals money for bribes to remove his gay older brother from Thai military conscription rolls, unaware of the ramifications.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xjygaMlmIwhIQFoeAsSTPBhET96.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:333968'),
  ('816997905004744604', 'How to Win Enemies', 2015, 'Thriller, Mystery, Comedy', 'Gabriel Lichtmann', 'Gabriel Lichtmann', 'Martín Slipak, Javier Drolas, Inés Palombo, Eugenia Capizzano, Sagrado Sebakis, Fabián Arenillas, Ezequiel Rodríguez, Charo López', null, 'Lucas, a young lawyer obsessed with crime novels, turns a chance encounter with a beautiful woman into a date ending in his bed. But when he wakes up alone, missing a secret stash of cash, the game’s afoot. Inspired by his favorite gumshoes, Lucas looks for clues. What was once a love story becomes the caper to end all capers.', 'Lucas, a young lawyer obsessed with crime novels, turns a chance encounter with a beautiful woman into a date ending in his bed. But when he wakes up alone, missing a secret stash of cash, the game’s afoot. Inspired by his favorite gumshoes, Lucas looks for clues. What was once a love story becomes the caper to end all capers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dW6GY0QjzVA7AoCQgmLDPHxgWGT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:361078'),
  ('318202091768754397', 'How Viktor "The Garlic" Took Alexey "The Stud" to the Nursing Home', 2017, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Alexandr Khant, Denis Tsukanov, Larisa Chaykovskaya', 'Alexey Borodachev', 'Evgeniy Tkachuk, Aleksey Serebryakov, Andrey Smirnov, Nataliya Vdovina, Olga Ozollapinya, Olga Lapshina, Alina Nasibullina, Georgiy Kudrenko', null, 'Viktor spends his free time trawling bars with ladies of questionable repute, from where he is picked up by a wife he doesn’t love, the mother of a child they never planned. Viktor himself was abandoned by his own father, his mother then committed suicide, and he was left to grow up in an orphanage. Years later, his errant dad returns, now a disabled felon, and Viktor discovers a timely legacy is in the offing – his father’s apartment. The documentation for securing dad’s move into an old people’s home is signed in a flash. Nevertheless, the only one that can take him is miles away and, what’s more, the invalid starts to recuperate during the journey, which is when their real problems begin.', 'Viktor spends his free time trawling bars with ladies of questionable repute, from where he is picked up by a wife he doesn’t love, the mother of a child they never planned. Viktor himself was abandoned by his own father, his mother then committed suicide, and he was left to grow up in an orphanage. Years later, his errant dad returns, now a disabled felon, and Viktor discovers a timely legacy is in the offing – his father’s apartment. The documentation for securing dad’s move into an old people’s home is signed in a flash. Nevertheless, the only one that can take him is miles away and, what’s more, the invalid starts to recuperate during the journey, which is when their real problems begin.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j9SEegY3YsTVDykqVueVfY7zXS9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:466287'),
  ('553019383137880548', 'How Wang-Fo Was Saved', 1987, 'Drama, Animation, Fantasy', 'René Laloux', 'René Laloux', 'Olivier Cruveiller, Jean-Claude Dreyfus', null, 'Wang Fo, the greatest master of medieval China, aided by his assistant who has given up everything to follow him, desperately seeks aesthetic perfection. A day comes when he thinks he has achieved it. But his genius arouses both the curiosity and the jealousy of the Emperor. Wang Fo will be able to escape the Emperor''s vindictiveness only by going to the limit of his talents.', 'Wang Fo, the greatest master of medieval China, aided by his assistant who has given up everything to follow him, desperately seeks aesthetic perfection. A day comes when he thinks he has achieved it. But his genius arouses both the curiosity and the jealousy of the Emperor. Wang Fo will be able to escape the Emperor''s vindictiveness only by going to the limit of his talents.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kWy2TeloMvHIwfDCavzyvoxcjvU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:69328'),
  ('892231373076415750', 'How We Got the Italian Movie Business Into Trouble: The True Story of Franco and Ciccio', 2004, 'Documentary', 'Daniele Ciprì, Daniele Ciprì, Franco Maresco', 'Franco Maresco, Daniele Ciprì, Tatti Sanguineti', 'Franco Franchi, Ciccio Ingrassia, Lino Banfi, Pippo Baudo, Bernardo Bertolucci, Giulio Andreotti, Mike Bongiorno, Lando Buzzanca', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m66h5gMDJjLblEkvlnCiPuLF95f.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:60017'),
  ('279866531446436350', 'How we made Asterix & Obelix: Mission Cleopatra', 2002, 'Documentary, Comedy', 'Alain Chabat, David Hertzog Dessites', 'Alain Chabat', 'Alain Chabat, Laurent Dailland, Hoang Thanh At, Tanino Liberatore, Philippe Guillotel, Thomas Duval, Yves Domenjoud, Les Versaillais', null, 'Behind the scenes of Chabat''s take on Asterix.', 'Behind the scenes of Chabat''s take on Asterix.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jdAWJpSjSsROflDE5e7fgxJu2KW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1094579'),
  ('768901000524350276', 'How We Robbed the Bank of Italy', 1966, 'Crime, Comedy', 'Lucio Fulci, Fausto Rossi', 'Lucio Fulci, Roberto Gianviti, Amedeo Sollazzo', 'Franco Franchi, Ciccio Ingrassia, Lena von Martens, Mirella Maravidi, Mario Pisu, Piero Morgia, Maria Luisa Rispoli, Adriana Ambesi', null, 'Dim-wits Franco and Cicco try to come up with a plan to rob the safes of the Bank of Italy, but with one muddle after another, they find themselves empty-handed after each attempt to do so.', 'Dim-wits Franco and Cicco try to come up with a plan to rob the safes of the Bank of Italy, but with one muddle after another, they find themselves empty-handed after each attempt to do so.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/x95ybIKl0AQ4MUKKH255n2c9i2Y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:107097'),
  ('875375988781090414', 'How We Stole the Atomic Bomb', 1968, 'Comedy', 'Lucio Fulci, Giovanni Fago, Fausto Rossi', 'Sandro Continenza, Roberto Gianviti, Amedeo Sollazzo', 'Franco Franchi, Ciccio Ingrassia, Julie Menard, Youssef Wahby, Eugenia Litrel, Adel Adham, Mario Guizzardi, Franco Bonvicini', null, 'Franco, an Italian fisherman, witnesses a U.S. Air Force plane crash in the Mediterranean off Egypt carrying a nuclear weapon, and he is then persued by shady spy, named Ciccio, working for a spy organization led by the sinister Dr. Si (Yes) to find the atom bomb before anyone else does to blackmail the world, which leads to Franco and Ciccio forming an unlikely alliance to get the bomb for themselves.', 'Franco, an Italian fisherman, witnesses a U.S. Air Force plane crash in the Mediterranean off Egypt carrying a nuclear weapon, and he is then persued by shady spy, named Ciccio, working for a spy organization led by the sinister Dr. Si (Yes) to find the atom bomb before anyone else does to blackmail the world, which leads to Franco and Ciccio forming an unlikely alliance to get the bomb for themselves.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qE0lwl7THFx2qXrPAc8aFg0t2Tk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:107113'),
  ('122443839632465475', 'How Wings Are Attached to the Backs of Angels', 1996, 'Animation', 'Craig Welch, Lynda Pelley, Pierre Landry', 'Craig Welch', 'Louise Leroux', null, 'Black and white drawings blended with photographic images depict an old man, with various tiny gadgets, trying to find the anatomy of the wings of an angel.', 'Black and white drawings blended with photographic images depict an old man, with various tiny gadgets, trying to find the anatomy of the wings of an angel.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yIxYlL7W6XEPUdcU5JcHH0xREba.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:181845'),
  ('694060483486722812', 'How''s It Going?', 1978, 'Drama', 'Jean-Luc Godard, Anne-Marie Miéville, William Lubtchansky', 'Jean-Luc Godard, Anne-Marie Miéville', 'Michel Marot, Anne-Marie Miéville, Christian Fenouillat, Catherine Floriet, Jean-Luc Godard', null, 'During the making of a video film about a communist printing press, a union member and a leftist activist discuss how to present their information, especially how to caption two specific images: one of a protest in Portugal, the other of a strike in France. One of them decides to write to his son, a manual worker living outside of Paris with his girlfriend, telling the young man about his troubles.', 'During the making of a video film about a communist printing press, a union member and a leftist activist discuss how to present their information, especially how to caption two specific images: one of a protest in Portugal, the other of a strike in France. One of them decides to write to his son, a manual worker living outside of Paris with his girlfriend, telling the young man about his troubles.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nlN7pDv58qXXo8sBINDhaymMrie.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:248319'),
  ('967725913086933935', 'Howard', 2018, 'Documentary, Music', 'Don Hahn', null, 'Howard Ashman, Alan Menken, Bill Lauch, Don Hahn, Sarah Gillespie, Shirley Ashman, Kyle Renick, Nancy Parent', 'PG', 'Though legendary lyricist Howard Ashman died far too young, his impact on Broadway, movies, and the culture at large were incalculable. Told entirely through rare archival footage and interviews with Ashman’s family, friends, associates, and longtime partner Bill Lauch, Howard is an intimate tribute to a once-in-a-generation talent and a rousing celebration of musical storytelling itself.', 'Though legendary lyricist Howard Ashman died far too young, his impact on Broadway, movies, and the culture at large were incalculable. Told entirely through rare archival footage and interviews with Ashman’s family, friends, associates, and longtime partner Bill Lauch, Howard is an intimate tribute to a once-in-a-generation talent and a rousing celebration of musical storytelling itself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kTMIYVGKeXsIcVumZvyapkhvQiY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:512191'),
  ('63495486441676934', 'Howard the Duck', 1986, 'Fantasy, Comedy, Action, Adventure, Romance, Science Fiction', 'Richard H. Kline, Willard Huyck, John Liberti', 'Willard Huyck, Gloria Katz', 'Lea Thompson, Jeffrey Jones, Tim Robbins, Ed Gale, Chip Zien, Tim Rose, Steve Sleap, Peter Baird', 'PG', 'A scientific experiment unknowingly brings extraterrestrial life forms to the Earth through a laser beam. First is the cigar-smoking drake, Howard, from the duck''s planet. A few kids try to keep him from the greedy scientists and help him back to his planet, but then a much less friendly being arrives through the beam...', 'A scientific experiment unknowingly brings extraterrestrial life forms to the Earth through a laser beam. First is the cigar-smoking drake, Howard, from the duck''s planet. A few kids try to keep him from the greedy scientists and help him back to his planet, but then a much less friendly being arrives through the beam...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eU0dWo8PJgsSAZFbcyHiUpuLSyW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10658'),
  ('663814229272258414', 'Howard Zinn: You Can''t Be Neutral on a Moving Train', 2004, 'Documentary', 'Deb Ellis, Denis Mueller', null, 'Matt Damon, Howard Zinn, Alice Walker, Noam Chomsky, Daniel Ellsberg, Marian Wright Edelman, Tom Hayden', null, 'You Can''t Be Neutral documents the life and times of the historian, activist and author of the best selling classic "A People''s History of the United States". Featuring rare archival materials, interviews with Howard Zinn as well as colleagues and friends including Noam Chomsky, Marian Wright Edelman, Daniel Ellsberg, Tom Hayden and Alice Walker.', 'You Can''t Be Neutral documents the life and times of the historian, activist and author of the best selling classic "A People''s History of the United States". Featuring rare archival materials, interviews with Howard Zinn as well as colleagues and friends including Noam Chomsky, Marian Wright Edelman, Daniel Ellsberg, Tom Hayden and Alice Walker.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/haeDX5PjOYpI0xsbwcKjsQvAyNY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:33150'),
  ('194946380142674721', 'Howard’s Mill', 2021, 'Horror, Mystery, Crime', 'Shannon Houchins, Justin Hughes', 'Shannon Houchins, Kathryn Lyn', 'Reegus Flenory, Josefina Boneo, Jeremy Childs, Jessejames Locorriere, Justin Prince Moy, Mark Cabus, Santiago Cirilo, Tiffany Montgomery', null, 'An abandoned piece of farmland in rural Tennessee may hold the key to multiple missing person cases spanning over forty years.', 'An abandoned piece of farmland in rural Tennessee may hold the key to multiple missing person cases spanning over forty years.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4LaLcDXB3sbAinszQtkR3qbwOeZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:832257'),
  ('1110864551108886450', 'Howards End', 1992, 'Drama, Romance', 'James Ivory, Tony Pierce-Roberts', 'Ruth Prawer Jhabvala', 'Emma Thompson, Helena Bonham Carter, Anthony Hopkins, Samuel West, Vanessa Redgrave, Adrian Ross Magenty, Prunella Scales, James Wilby', 'PG', 'A saga of class relations and changing times in an Edwardian England on the brink of modernity, the film centers on liberal Margaret Schlegel, who, along with her sister Helen, becomes involved with two couples: wealthy, conservative industrialist Henry Wilcox and his wife Ruth, and the downwardly mobile working-class Leonard Bast and his mistress Jackie.', 'A saga of class relations and changing times in an Edwardian England on the brink of modernity, the film centers on liberal Margaret Schlegel, who, along with her sister Helen, becomes involved with two couples: wealthy, conservative industrialist Henry Wilcox and his wife Ruth, and the downwardly mobile working-class Leonard Bast and his mistress Jackie.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1009nhfj28VhhQnVadtjkOacduX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8293'),
  ('713353877799858063', 'Howl', 2010, 'Drama', 'Rob Epstein, Jeffrey Friedman, Edward Lachman', 'Rob Epstein, Jeffrey Friedman', 'James Franco, Todd Rotondi, Jon Prescott, Aaron Tveit, David Strathairn, Jon Hamm, Andrew Rogers, Bob Balaban', 'R', 'It''s San Francisco in 1957, and an American masterpiece is put on trial. Howl, the film, recounts this dark moment using three interwoven threads: the tumultuous life events that led a young Allen Ginsberg to find his true voice as an artist, society''s reaction (the obscenity trial), and mind-expanding animation that echoes the startling originality of the poem itself. All three coalesce in a genre-bending hybrid that brilliantly captures a pivotal moment-the birth of a counterculture.', 'It''s San Francisco in 1957, and an American masterpiece is put on trial. Howl, the film, recounts this dark moment using three interwoven threads: the tumultuous life events that led a young Allen Ginsberg to find his true voice as an artist, society''s reaction (the obscenity trial), and mind-expanding animation that echoes the startling originality of the poem itself. All three coalesce in a genre-bending hybrid that brilliantly captures a pivotal moment-the birth of a counterculture.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4gy0rUIaaao1nx6pr1Dj1WpslcO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38568'),
  ('220231064365459476', 'Howl', 2015, 'Horror', 'Paul Hyett, Adam Biddle, Patrick James Stephens', 'Nick Ostler, Mark Huckerby', 'Ed Speleers, Shauna Macdonald, Elliot Cowan, Holly Weston, Amit Shah, Rosie Day, Ryan Oliva, Sam Gittins', null, 'When passengers on a train are attacked by a creature, they must band together in order to survive until morning.', 'When passengers on a train are attacked by a creature, they must band together in order to survive until morning.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/XcwP3VGTRVHjc4doNP8w1fdOJ7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:301846'),
  ('1073299515444278735', 'Howl''s Moving Castle', 2004, 'Fantasy, Animation, Adventure', 'Atsushi Okui, Hayao Miyazaki, Kitaro Kosaka', 'Hayao Miyazaki', 'Chieko Baisho, Takuya Kimura, Akihiro Miwa, Tatsuya Gashûin, Ryunosuke Kamiki, Mitsunori Isaki, Yo Oizumi, Akio Otsuka', 'PG', 'Sophie, a young milliner, is turned into an elderly woman by a witch who enters her shop and curses her. She encounters a wizard named Howl and gets caught up in his resistance to fighting for the king.', 'Sophie, a young milliner, is turned into an elderly woman by a witch who enters her shop and curses her. She encounters a wizard named Howl and gets caught up in his resistance to fighting for the king.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/13kOl2v0nD2OLbVSHnHk8GUFEhO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4935'),
  ('248309013133807686', 'Howlers of the Dock', 1960, 'Music, Comedy', 'Lucio Fulci, Piero Vivarelli, Gianni Di Venanzo', 'Giovanni Addessi, Lucio Fulci, Vittorio Vighi', 'Adriano Celentano, Mina, Joe Sentieri, Elke Sommer, Chet Baker, Giuliano Mancini, Lino Banfi, Giacomo Furia', null, 'Follows the adventures of a group of friends, teddy boys and rock and roll chicks whose crazy, fun-loving habits inspire jiving from some of Rome''s citizens, and bitter complants from others which inspire a group of corrupt officials determined to a bring the group down.', 'Follows the adventures of a group of friends, teddy boys and rock and roll chicks whose crazy, fun-loving habits inspire jiving from some of Rome''s citizens, and bitter complants from others which inspire a group of corrupt officials determined to a bring the group down.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d6KiuxlRr6GBuQqwEFsEttrV5EE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:101800'),
  ('306775591342602562', 'Howling', 2012, 'Mystery, Thriller', 'Kang Dae-hui, Yoo Ha', 'Yoo Ha', 'Song Kang-ho, Lee Na-young, Lee Sung-min, Shin Jung-keun, Lim Hyun-sung, Jeong In-gi, Nam Bo-ra, Jo Young-jin', null, 'A beat cop and his rookie partner investigate a series of killings that seem to be carried out by a mysterious wolfdog.', 'A beat cop and his rookie partner investigate a series of killings that seem to be carried out by a mysterious wolfdog.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eVxXzYqOXblLVI7nVOAupxTme6D.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:116227'),
  ('1051026862270018187', 'Howling II: Stirba - Werewolf Bitch', 1985, 'Thriller, Horror, Comedy', 'Philippe Mora, Geoffrey Stephenson', 'Gary Brandner, Robert Sarno', 'Christopher Lee, Annie McEnroe, Reb Brown, Marsha Hunt, Sybil Danning, Jimmy Nail, Judd Omen, Ferdy Mayne', 'R', 'When a young journalist dies in violent circumstances, her brother soon learns, by way of the mysterious Stefan Crosscoe, that his sister has succumbed to the werewolf curse.', 'When a young journalist dies in violent circumstances, her brother soon learns, by way of the mysterious Stefan Crosscoe, that his sister has succumbed to the werewolf curse.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e72qjJ4Qf6zuQCqpwdjH5IZ5WH5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29794'),
  ('115934130442374620', 'Howling III: The Marsupials', 1987, 'Horror', 'Philippe Mora, Adam Spencer, John Titley', 'Philippe Mora', 'Barry Otto, Max Fairchild, Imogen Annesley, Lee Biolos, Dagmar Bláhová, Ralph Cotterill, Frank Thring, Michael Pate', 'PG-13', 'A strange race of human-like marsupials appear suddenly in Australia, and a sociologist who studies these creatures falls in love with a female one. Is this a dangerous combination?', 'A strange race of human-like marsupials appear suddenly in Australia, and a sociologist who studies these creatures falls in love with a female one. Is this a dangerous combination?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jzYXHaEe8fnOXC3kn2SZnv2Dv2h.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32595'),
  ('361473152258428678', 'Howling IV: The Original Nightmare', 1988, 'Horror', 'John Hough', 'Clive Turner, Freddie Rowe', 'Romy Walthall, Michael T. Weiss, Antony Hamilton, Susanne Severeid, Lamya Derval, Norman Anstey, Maxine John, Greg Latter', 'R', 'An author who was sent to the town Drakho, because of a nervous breakdown, gets wound up in a mystery revolving around demons and werewolves. She starts seeing ghosts and dismisses them as her own imagination, but when they turn out to be real she becomes suspicious of the odd town and of its past.', 'An author who was sent to the town Drakho, because of a nervous breakdown, gets wound up in a mystery revolving around demons and werewolves. She starts seeing ghosts and dismisses them as her own imagination, but when they turn out to be real she becomes suspicious of the odd town and of its past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5CKiGsex1lz6hPTK47QRnqgZH3M.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38500'),
  ('440465217089020701', 'Howling V: The Rebirth', 1989, 'Horror', 'Neal Sundstrom', 'Clive Turner, Freddie Rowe', 'Phil Davis, Victoria Catlin, Ben Cole, Mary Stavin, William Shockley, Elizabeth Shé, Mark Sivertsen, Stephanie Faulkner', 'R', 'When a group of people from different walks of life converge in a Hungarian castle situated in Budapest which has been sealed for 500 years, they bring with them a werewolf which slowly begins to cut their numbers down.', 'When a group of people from different walks of life converge in a Hungarian castle situated in Budapest which has been sealed for 500 years, they bring with them a werewolf which slowly begins to cut their numbers down.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/irbRWCwIB1AONKlA4VzsYRkGmrK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:35945'),
  ('282556490670433200', 'Howling VI: The Freaks', 1991, 'Horror', 'Hope Perello, Douglas Aarniokoski, Edward J. Pei', 'Kevin Rock', 'Brendan Hughes, Michele Matheson, Sean Sullivan, Antonio Fargas, Carol Lynley, Jered Barclay, Bruce Payne, Gary Carlos Cervantes', 'R', 'A villainous carnival owner traps a young werewolf to include in his growing menagerie of inhuman exhibits.', 'A villainous carnival owner traps a young werewolf to include in his growing menagerie of inhuman exhibits.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jDgHuRD6R4I9oJ27znO0CUQ5FrV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36421'),
  ('179098370978578887', 'Howling Village', 2020, 'Horror, Mystery', 'Takashi Shimizu, Jun Fukumoto', 'Daisuke Hosaka, Takashi Shimizu', 'Ayaka Miyoshi, Ryota Bando, Rinka Otani, Tsuyoshi Furukawa, Hina Miyano, Renji Ishibashi, Takamasa Suga, Megumi Okina', 'NR', 'After her brother goes missing, a young psychologist visits an infamous haunted and cursed location known as ‘Howling Village’ to investigate his disappearance and uncover her family’s dark history.', 'After her brother goes missing, a young psychologist visits an infamous haunted and cursed location known as ‘Howling Village’ to investigate his disappearance and uncover her family’s dark history.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/doM8q4gqgLSFDbajjvJTlng4ZkN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:635199'),
  ('108664105582983816', 'Howling: New Moon Rising', 1995, 'Horror', 'Clive Turner, Andreas Kossak', 'Gary Brandner, Clive Turner', 'John Ramsden, Ernest Kester, Clive Turner, Jack Huff, Elizabeth Shé, Jaqueline Armitage, Jim Lozano, Sally Harkham', 'R', 'A number of vicious murders occur in a small California town after a motorcycle-riding stranger arrives. The gruesome slayings look disturbingly like the work of a werewolf. Meanwhile, in another nearby town, police are hot on the trail of a killer they believe is a werewolf.', 'A number of vicious murders occur in a small California town after a motorcycle-riding stranger arrives. The gruesome slayings look disturbingly like the work of a werewolf. Meanwhile, in another nearby town, police are hot on the trail of a killer they believe is a werewolf.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8WLL0VBw7fFSYfnurhPgNIbGjgS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38499'),
  ('910228599476800200', 'Hridayam', 2022, 'Romance, Drama', 'Viswajith Odukkathil, Vishak Nair, Vineeth Sreenivasan', 'Vineeth Sreenivasan', 'Pranav Mohanlal, Darshana Rajendran, Kalyani Priyadarshan, Aswath Lal, Vijayaraghavan, Arun Kurian, Aju Varghese, Athul Ram Kumar', null, 'Arun and Darshana are first-year engineering students and they fall in love soon after their college begins. And just as how things work generally in teenage, the road ahead isn''t too easy for them. Life offers many twists and turns that they least expect.', 'Arun and Darshana are first-year engineering students and they fall in love soon after their college begins. And just as how things work generally in teenage, the road ahead isn''t too easy for them. Life offers many twists and turns that they least expect.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rMNzpbruCuBmYPWhaNLrKOlNKcu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:653221'),
  ('792509458790236222', 'HU', 2012, 'Documentary', 'Joana Traub Csekö, Pedro Urano, Edson Secco', 'Joana Traub Csekö, Pedro Urano', null, null, 'A symmetrically divided building: on one side, an important public hospital, on the other, a bewildering ruin. On the horizon, Rio de Janeiro, public health, education and Brazil’s aged modern project. Shot entirely in the monumental and only partially occupied modernist edifice of the University Hospital of UFRJ. A material metaphor of the Brazilian public sphere and its political maze. A synthesis architecturally expressed of the modernist utopia/dystopia.', 'A symmetrically divided building: on one side, an important public hospital, on the other, a bewildering ruin. On the horizon, Rio de Janeiro, public health, education and Brazil’s aged modern project. Shot entirely in the monumental and only partially occupied modernist edifice of the University Hospital of UFRJ. A material metaphor of the Brazilian public sphere and its political maze. A synthesis architecturally expressed of the modernist utopia/dystopia.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7NfpoYfVmSrM2p056gSRlUzUcgq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:508074'),
