  ('87861812303170694', 'Hubert und Staller - Die ins Gras beißen', 2013, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Wilhelm Engelhardt', 'Oliver Mielke', 'Christian Tramitz, Helmfried von Lüttichau, Michael Brandner, Annett Fleischer, Karin Thaler, Carin C. Tietze, Hannes Ringlstetter, Jochen Nickel', null, 'Hubert and Staller find the first body in the forest, the second practically falls into their laps. The trail leads to a retirement home, of all places. The old men finance their retirement by growing cannabis, and they have also been blackmailed, but that doesn''t make them murderers. Or does it? Meanwhile, precinct manager Girwidz is hoping for a promotion: his old boss has announced his arrival. However, the police director is in Upper Bavaria for a completely different reason.', 'Hubert and Staller find the first body in the forest, the second practically falls into their laps. The trail leads to a retirement home, of all places. The old men finance their retirement by growing cannabis, and they have also been blackmailed, but that doesn''t make them murderers. Or does it? Meanwhile, precinct manager Girwidz is hoping for a promotion: his old boss has announced his arrival. However, the police director is in Upper Bavaria for a completely different reason.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xx9ce5oQSPtQCjem8BzNHmEXtTi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:238145'),
  ('42269699380201991', 'Hubert und Staller - Unter Wölfen', 2016, 'Crime, Comedy', 'Jan Markus Linhof', null, 'Helmfried von Lüttichau, Michael Brandner, Christian Tramitz, Annett Fleischer, Karin Thaler, Carin C. Tietze, Hannes Ringlstetter, Paul Sedlmeir', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AnE8u6s00nbDbPJkA4gNDFSWD7h.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:378782'),
  ('571343543400481892', 'Hubie Halloween', 2020, 'Comedy, Horror, Mystery', 'Christina Fong, Steven Brill, Seamus Tierney', 'Adam Sandler, Tim Herlihy', 'Adam Sandler, Kevin James, Julie Bowen, Ray Liotta, Steve Buscemi, Rob Schneider, Maya Rudolph, Tim Meadows', 'PG-13', 'Hubie Dubois, despite his devotion to his hometown of Salem, Massachusetts (and its legendary Halloween celebration), is a figure of mockery for kids and adults alike. But this year, something really is going bump in the night, and it’s up to Hubie to save Halloween.', 'Hubie Dubois, despite his devotion to his hometown of Salem, Massachusetts (and its legendary Halloween celebration), is a figure of mockery for kids and adults alike. But this year, something really is going bump in the night, and it’s up to Hubie to save Halloween.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dbhC6qRydXyRmpUdcl9bL9rARya.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:617505'),
  ('138676227913400387', 'Huckleberry Finn', 1974, 'Music, Family, Adventure', 'J. Lee Thompson, László Kovács, Newt Arnold', 'Robert B. Sherman, Richard M. Sherman', 'Jeff East, Paul Winfield, Harvey Korman, David Wayne, Arthur O''Connell, Gary Merrill, Natalie Trundy, Lucille Benson', 'G', 'Huckleberry Finn is a 15-year-old boy who has had a difficult relationship with his often violent father for a long time. When Dad tried to kidnap him, Huck decides to run away from home, and heads out of town on a raft. Huck is soon joined by Jim, a runaway slave who is no more eager to see his master than Huck is to see his father. As the two friends make their way down the Mississippi, they''re faced with a variety of challenges and adventures.', 'Huckleberry Finn is a 15-year-old boy who has had a difficult relationship with his often violent father for a long time. When Dad tried to kidnap him, Huck decides to run away from home, and heads out of town on a raft. Huck is soon joined by Jim, a runaway slave who is no more eager to see his master than Huck is to see his father. As the two friends make their way down the Mississippi, they''re faced with a variety of challenges and adventures.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g4yl5xXpz8Yf0BUc1K42qOZop0H.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:75141'),
  ('284783547349718967', 'Hud', 1963, 'Drama, Western', 'Martin Ritt, James Wong Howe, Charles C. Coleman', 'Harriet Frank Jr., Irving Ravetch', 'Paul Newman, Melvyn Douglas, Patricia Neal, Brandon De Wilde, Whit Bissell, Crahan Denton, John Ashley, Val Avery', 'NR', 'Hud Bannon is a ruthless young man who tarnishes everything and everyone he touches. Hud represents the perfect embodiment of alienated youth, out for kicks with no regard for the consequences. There is bitter conflict between the callous Hud and his stern and highly principled father, Homer. Hud''s nephew Lon admires Hud''s cheating ways, though he soon becomes too aware of Hud''s reckless amorality to bear him anymore. In the world of the takers and the taken, Hud is a winner. He''s a cheat, but, he explains, "I always say the law was meant to be interpreted in a lenient manner."', 'Hud Bannon is a ruthless young man who tarnishes everything and everyone he touches. Hud represents the perfect embodiment of alienated youth, out for kicks with no regard for the consequences. There is bitter conflict between the callous Hud and his stern and highly principled father, Homer. Hud''s nephew Lon admires Hud''s cheating ways, though he soon becomes too aware of Hud''s reckless amorality to bear him anymore. In the world of the takers and the taken, Hud is a winner. He''s a cheat, but, he explains, "I always say the law was meant to be interpreted in a lenient manner."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A168bF52vmAIGkC2Qafj7M2EmaE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24748'),
  ('42210785469540924', 'Huda''s Salon', 2022, 'Thriller', 'Ehab Assal, Hany Abu-Assad', 'Hany Abu-Assad', 'Maisa Abd Elhadi, Ali Suliman, Manal Awad, Samer Bisharat, Omar Abu Amer, Kamel El Basha, Jalal Masrwa, Angham Khalil', 'R', 'Based on real events, Huda’s Salon is a heart-racing, entertaining feminist thriller, where two women fight for their freedom. Reem, a young mother who is married to a jealous man, goes to Huda’s salon in Bethlehem for a haircut and an attentive ear. However, this ordinary visit turns sour after Huda puts Reem in a shameful situation, blackmails her to work for the secret service of the occupiers and betrays her people.', 'Based on real events, Huda’s Salon is a heart-racing, entertaining feminist thriller, where two women fight for their freedom. Reem, a young mother who is married to a jealous man, goes to Huda’s salon in Bethlehem for a haircut and an attentive ear. However, this ordinary visit turns sour after Huda puts Reem in a shameful situation, blackmails her to work for the secret service of the occupiers and betrays her people.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1YygInxVfEC5Be7f8H7UDLFi2Ti.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:782648'),
  ('249974570278056188', 'Huddersfield', 2007, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Ivan Živković', 'Dejan Kraljačić, Uglješa Šajtinac', 'Goran Šušljik, Nebojša Glogovac, Damjan Kecojević, Vojin Ćetković, Suzana Lukić, Josif Tatić, Predrag Laković, Predrag ''Miki'' Manojlović', null, 'Rasa is 30, lives with his alcoholic father and trying, and failing, to make ends meet by giving literature lessons to teenage girls and hosting a program on the local radio, presenting new books and interviewing authors. Ivan, a promising judo fighter in his teenage years, has since had a history of neurosis, psychotic episodes, hospitalization, being heavily medicated, involvement in various occult groups and practices, prior to having been baptized in the Orthodox Church.', 'Rasa is 30, lives with his alcoholic father and trying, and failing, to make ends meet by giving literature lessons to teenage girls and hosting a program on the local radio, presenting new books and interviewing authors. Ivan, a promising judo fighter in his teenage years, has since had a history of neurosis, psychotic episodes, hospitalization, being heavily medicated, involvement in various occult groups and practices, prior to having been baptized in the Orthodox Church.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gKGxKRGrFvmb5RAYJARwNEteUIX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63840'),
  ('567484624611333706', 'Hudson Hawk', 1991, 'Action, Adventure, Comedy', 'Michael Lehmann, Dante Spinotti, Robert V. Girolami', 'Steven E. de Souza, Daniel Waters', 'Bruce Willis, Danny Aiello, Andie MacDowell, James Coburn, Richard E. Grant, Sandra Bernhard, David Caruso, Frank Stallone Jr.', 'R', 'Eddie Hawkins, called Hudson Hawk has just been released from ten years of prison and is planning to spend the rest of his life honestly. But then the crazy Mayflower couple blackmail him to steal some of the works of Leonardo da Vinci. If he refuses, they threaten to kill his friend Tommy.', 'Eddie Hawkins, called Hudson Hawk has just been released from ten years of prison and is planning to spend the rest of his life honestly. But then the crazy Mayflower couple blackmail him to steal some of the works of Leonardo da Vinci. If he refuses, they threaten to kill his friend Tommy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2AiR7HZuIOUdJp6LYOEOA8z7pF3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9292'),
  ('478427129845056008', 'Hudson''s Bay', 1940, 'Adventure, History', 'Irving Pichel, J. Peverell Marley, George Barnes', 'Lamar Trotti', 'Paul Muni, John Sutton, Laird Cregar, Gene Tierney, Vincent Price, Nigel Bruce, Virginia Field, Morton Lowry', null, 'Highly fictionalized early history of Canada. Trapper/explorer Radisson imagines an empire around Hudson''s Bay. He befriends the Indians, fights the French, and convinces King Charles II to sponsor an expedition of conquest.', 'Highly fictionalized early history of Canada. Trapper/explorer Radisson imagines an empire around Hudson''s Bay. He befriends the Indians, fights the French, and convinces King Charles II to sponsor an expedition of conquest.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o05LY31NCEjxSgbJ3x5SG7AAlHp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:141651'),
  ('336998526671859784', 'Hue and Cry', 1947, 'Comedy, Crime, Adventure', 'Charles Crichton, Douglas Slocombe', 'T. E. B. Clarke', 'Alastair Sim, Jack Warner, Valerie White, Jack Lambert, Harry Fowler, Douglas Barr, Stanley Escane, Ian Dawson', 'NR', 'A gang of street boys foil a master crook who sends commands for robberies by cunningly altering a comic strip''s wording each week, unknown to writer and printer. The first of the Ealing comedies.', 'A gang of street boys foil a master crook who sends commands for robberies by cunningly altering a comic strip''s wording each week, unknown to writer and printer. The first of the Ealing comedies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/odxsRtigwwQlHcUwn582qdSNdRy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:37193'),
  ('286925621674904089', 'Huesera: The Bone Woman', 2023, 'Horror, Mystery, Drama', 'Michelle Garza Cervera, Nur Rubio Sherwell', 'Michelle Garza Cervera, Abia Castillo', 'Natalia Solián, Alfonso Dosal, Mayra Batalla, Mercedes Hernández, Sonia Couoh, Aida López, Anahí Allue, Martha Claudia Moreno', 'NR', 'Valeria''s joy at becoming a first-time mother is quickly taken away when she''s cursed by a sinister entity. As danger closes in, she''s forced deeper into a chilling world of dark magic that threatens to consume her.', 'Valeria''s joy at becoming a first-time mother is quickly taken away when she''s cursed by a sinister entity. As danger closes in, she''s forced deeper into a chilling world of dark magic that threatens to consume her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zgpj76z9byUgcWnxLDmtZ3XqfvN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:772515'),
  ('487072559573718677', 'Huevos: Little Rooster''s Egg-Cellent Adventure', 2015, 'Animation, Adventure, Comedy, Family', 'Gabriel Riva Palacio Alatriste, Rodolfo Riva Palacio Alatriste', 'Rodolfo Riva Palacio Alatriste', 'Bruno Bichir, Maite Perroni, Carlos Espejel, Angélica Vale, Omar Chaparro, José Lavat, Sergio Sendel, Ninel Conde', null, 'Toto has grown and now is a young cock. An evil rancher tricks the female owner of the ranch where they live and forces her to bet the property in a cockfight in the arena. Toto is the only option to defend their home, so he must train in just one week and win the championship of the arena.', 'Toto has grown and now is a young cock. An evil rancher tricks the female owner of the ranch where they live and forces her to bet the property in a cockfight in the arena. Toto is the only option to defend their home, so he must train in just one week and win the championship of the arena.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6ZkiGjyBcP1KAbpBYHwdVclpYqa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:264419'),
  ('30279099444257439', 'HUG! PreCure Futari wa Pretty Cure: All Star Memories', 2018, 'Animation, Fantasy, Action, Comedy, Adventure, Family', 'Hiroshi Miyamoto, Yoshiyuki Anzai, Yasuhiro Kato', 'Junko Komura', 'Rie Hikisaka, Yoko Honna, Rina Honnizumi, Yui Ogura, Nao Tamura, Yukari Tamura, Yukana, Konomi Tada', null, 'A vengeful teru teru bozu-like monster called Miden is stealing all of the Cures'' magical powers and memories, turning them into helpless infants, barring Nagisa Misumi and Hana Nono. They must help the affected Cures to regain their abilities and fight off this new menance.', 'A vengeful teru teru bozu-like monster called Miden is stealing all of the Cures'' magical powers and memories, turning them into helpless infants, barring Nagisa Misumi and Hana Nono. They must help the affected Cures to regain their abilities and fight off this new menance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nJ5TxNLkIA3iOf8tzVHGkgBzjhq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:551591'),
  ('961542457237476441', 'Huge Shark', 2021, 'Horror', 'Huang Zhaosheng', 'Wang Po-Song', 'Zhao Yihuan, Hong Shuang, Huang Tao, Luan Mingyuan, Xie Yiqing, Katarina Mahan', null, 'A sea party turns deadly when Dr. Shen Xin and three friends are attacked by bloodthirsty sharks.', 'A sea party turns deadly when Dr. Shen Xin and three friends are attacked by bloodthirsty sharks.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/twaDfsmea5qqx739kI8Xr1G1wqO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:805639'),
  ('497682765540918630', 'Hugo', 2008, 'Fantasy', 'Nicholas Verso', null, 'Georgia Flood, Tessa James, André Jewson, Sianoa Smit-McPhee', null, 'Lonely schoolgirl Desma is determined to win the school science competition and beat her arch-rival, Celestine. When Desma discovers an incredible creature, an insect-boy endowed with a pair of moth-wings, she thinks victory is hers. But can Desma ignore her attacks of conscience and condemn the vulnerable moth-boy to win a competition? Or will she forfeit her dreams of glory and suffer another humiliating loss to Celestine? An enchanting short film about human connection, ruthless ambition and entomology.', 'Lonely schoolgirl Desma is determined to win the school science competition and beat her arch-rival, Celestine. When Desma discovers an incredible creature, an insect-boy endowed with a pair of moth-wings, she thinks victory is hers. But can Desma ignore her attacks of conscience and condemn the vulnerable moth-boy to win a competition? Or will she forfeit her dreams of glory and suffer another humiliating loss to Celestine? An enchanting short film about human connection, ruthless ambition and entomology.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pRJGYrfsMeHruoH7QCE69w9QEpr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:412368'),
  ('195457593863201446', 'Hugo', 2011, 'Adventure, Drama, Family', 'Martin Scorsese, Robert Richardson, David Warren', 'John Logan', 'Asa Butterfield, Ben Kingsley, Chloë Grace Moretz, Sacha Baron Cohen, Ray Winstone, Emily Mortimer, Christopher Lee, Helen McCrory', 'PG', 'Orphaned and alone except for an uncle, Hugo Cabret lives in the walls of a train station in 1930s Paris. Hugo''s job is to oil and maintain the station''s clocks, but to him, his more important task is to protect a broken automaton and notebook left to him by his late father. Accompanied by the goddaughter of an embittered toy merchant, Hugo embarks on a quest to solve the mystery of the automaton and find a place he can call home.', 'Orphaned and alone except for an uncle, Hugo Cabret lives in the walls of a train station in 1930s Paris. Hugo''s job is to oil and maintain the station''s clocks, but to him, his more important task is to protect a broken automaton and notebook left to him by his late father. Accompanied by the goddaughter of an embittered toy merchant, Hugo embarks on a quest to solve the mystery of the automaton and find a place he can call home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1dxRq3o3l3bVWNRvvSb7rRf68qp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44826'),
  ('270456314440016709', 'Hugo', 2026, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Pascal Bonitzer, Justinien Schricke, Yves Angelo', 'Sophie Fillières', 'Fabrice Luchini, Chiara Mastroianni, Louise Orry-Diquéro, Suzanne De Baecque, Marie Narbonne, Lauretta Trefeu, Iris Bry, Naidra Ayadi', null, 'Imbued with Victor Hugo, the actor Robert Zucchini searches for his place between the stage and life. Every evening, he fills theaters by sharing his love of words. Until the day his daughter, whom he hasn’t seen grow up, reappears.', 'Imbued with Victor Hugo, the actor Robert Zucchini searches for his place between the stage and life. Every evening, he fills theaters by sharing his love of words. Until the day his daughter, whom he hasn’t seen grow up, reappears.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sYRssxFzHMr3Rz0VTEF21m6iVDU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1454680'),
  ('1026753680373262572', 'Hugo and Josephine', 1967, 'Family, Comedy, Drama', 'Kjell Grede, Lasse Björne', 'Maria Gripe, Kjell Grede', 'Fredrik Becklén, Marie Öhman, Beppe Wolgers, Inga Landgré, Helena Brodin, Bellan Roos, Tord Stål', null, 'Josefin is a six year old girl who lives isolated in the countryside, where her father is a priest. She has no friends until she meets Hugo. He is a carefree boy who''d rather walk in the forest than go to school. Together with the gardener, they make up fun things to do.', 'Josefin is a six year old girl who lives isolated in the countryside, where her father is a priest. She has no friends until she meets Hugo. He is a carefree boy who''d rather walk in the forest than go to school. Together with the gardener, they make up fun things to do.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rLMUUfzLIAHL0fWlJPqUn4g1SZQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:115527'),
  ('657446496150033569', 'Hugo Pool', 1997, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Robert Downey Sr., David A. Armstrong, Joseph Montgomery', 'Robert Downey Sr., Laura Ernst', 'Alyssa Milano, Patrick Dempsey, Cathy Moriarty, Malcolm McDowell, Robert Downey Jr., Mark Boone Junior, Sean Penn, Richard Lewis', 'R', 'Hugo Pool is a quirky tale of a Los Angeles pool cleaner who falls in love with a young man dying of Lou Gerhig''s Disease.', 'Hugo Pool is a quirky tale of a Los Angeles pool cleaner who falls in love with a young man dying of Lou Gerhig''s Disease.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sVVdjinglTAShsEYlYkPNQ0SQGv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32332'),
  ('139753809375931548', 'Hugo Sánchez, the Goal and the Glory', 2022, 'Documentary, History', 'Francisco Javier Padilla', 'Francisco Javier Padilla', 'Hugo Sánchez, Julio César Chávez, Rafael Márquez, Cuauhtémoc Blanco, Jorge Valdano, Guillermo Ríos, Jorge Campos, Alex Lora', null, 'The definitive chronicle of the best Mexican athlete in history. From his beginnings in Mexico''s university team, his transcendental time in Spain''s Real Madrid, his international falls and his very personal obsession for success.', 'The definitive chronicle of the best Mexican athlete in history. From his beginnings in Mexico''s university team, his transcendental time in Spain''s Real Madrid, his international falls and his very personal obsession for success.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/86fx2ZBkzTFmHDIj6mNt0NIB2e.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1051785'),
  ('410467940384189305', 'Hugo the Hippo', 1975, 'Animation, Family, Adventure', 'Bill Feigenbaum, József Gémes, Mária Neményi', 'Thomas Baum', 'Ferenc Bessenyei, László Márkus, Tamás Major, István Szatmári, Gábor Berkes, István Bujtor, György Györffy, Kati Kovács', 'G', 'The Sultan of Zanzibar has a harbor infested with sharks, which makes it impossible for ships to trade with him. In an attempt to fix the problem, he brings twelve hippos into the harbor to keep the sharks away. His idea works well enough, but once the hippos are no longer a novelty and the people no longer feed them, they begin to starve. After the hungry hippos rampage through the city looking for food, Aban-Khan, the king''s adviser, slaughters all the hippos except one, a little hippo named Hugo.', 'The Sultan of Zanzibar has a harbor infested with sharks, which makes it impossible for ships to trade with him. In an attempt to fix the problem, he brings twelve hippos into the harbor to keep the sharks away. His idea works well enough, but once the hippos are no longer a novelty and the people no longer feed them, they begin to starve. After the hungry hippos rampage through the city looking for food, Aban-Khan, the king''s adviser, slaughters all the hippos except one, a little hippo named Hugo.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vEqDSWGfwoIrdXfoKPpUSNKuQs4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85955'),
  ('16250529097344672', 'Hugo the Movie Star', 1996, 'Animation, Family', 'Flemming Quist Møller, Stefan Fjeldmark, Jørgen Lerdam', 'Flemming Quist Møller', 'Jesper Klein, Kaya Brüel, Søs Egelind, Ditte Gråbøl, Ole Fick, Kirsten Lehfeldt, Helle Ryslinge', null, 'Hugo, the one-of-a-kind jungle animal, is snatched away from his home for a second time in another attempt for him to become an animal actor. Meanwhile, he''s reunited with Rita the kind, streetwise fox. Finding that life in front of and behind the camera isn''t so bad, he grows more unaccustomed to wild life once he escapes and slowly weakens his relationship with Rita.', 'Hugo, the one-of-a-kind jungle animal, is snatched away from his home for a second time in another attempt for him to become an animal actor. Meanwhile, he''s reunited with Rita the kind, streetwise fox. Finding that life in front of and behind the camera isn''t so bad, he grows more unaccustomed to wild life once he escapes and slowly weakens his relationship with Rita.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tknW4nxWaLU30Wbv3AqdFWqIvMw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46314'),
  ('810980523419216319', 'Hugo, the Jungle Creature', 1993, 'Animation, Family', 'Stefan Fjeldmark, Flemming Quist Møller', 'Flemming Quist Møller', 'Jesper Klein, Kaya Brüel, Søs Egelind, Jytte Abildstrøm, Mark Camacho, Anne Marie Ottersen', 'NR', 'This film introduces us to Hugo, a one-of-a-kind animal who lives in a jungle. Youthful and carefree, Hugo is prone to playing practical jokes on his friends, Zig and Zag the monkeys. His idyllic lifestyle is interrupted when he is captured by CEO of a famed movie company, Conrad Cupmann, to be co-star in a Hollywood-style film. In order to return from Copenhagen to his jungle home, he must escape with the help of a newly found friend, Rita the fox.', 'This film introduces us to Hugo, a one-of-a-kind animal who lives in a jungle. Youthful and carefree, Hugo is prone to playing practical jokes on his friends, Zig and Zag the monkeys. His idyllic lifestyle is interrupted when he is captured by CEO of a famed movie company, Conrad Cupmann, to be co-star in a Hollywood-style film. In order to return from Copenhagen to his jungle home, he must escape with the help of a newly found friend, Rita the fox.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9QT6XZ9eDpAgMJZECSjGPfygp1K.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36323'),
  ('1106518280457414231', 'Huguette', 2019, 'TV Movie, Comedy, Drama', 'Antoine Garceau, Antoine Roch', 'Perrine Margaine, Antoine Garceau, Perrine Margaine', 'Line Renaud, Romane Bohringer, Caroline Piette, Oudesh Rughooputh, François Rabette, Norbert Ferrer, Romann Berrux', null, 'When Huguette, a 78-year-old former school principal, ends up homeless because she did not pay her rent, her neighbor Marion offers her a deal: a roof in exchange of her help to prevent the teenager she is raising alone, Rémi, from failing school.', 'When Huguette, a 78-year-old former school principal, ends up homeless because she did not pay her rent, her neighbor Marion offers her a deal: a roof in exchange of her help to prevent the teenager she is raising alone, Rémi, from failing school.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pBIyVjqY9M7v3G3qEknC9fh6kHV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:650961'),
  ('433723813826541174', 'Hui Buh and the Witch''s Castle', 2022, 'Family, Fantasy, Adventure, Comedy, Animation', 'Sebastian Niemann, Gerhard Schirlo, Bernd Nalbach', 'Dirk Ahner, Sebastian Niemann', 'Michael Herbig, Christoph Maria Herbst, Rick Kavanian, Mina Tander, Nelly Hoffmann, Veronika Bellová, Leona Skleničková, Manou Lubowski', null, 'For over 500 years now, the castle ghost Hui Buh has been stirring things up at Castle Burgeck. His friend and owner of the castle, King Julius is not the only one who finds Hui Buh''s poor attempts at scary hauntings terribly annoying. The chaotic atmosphere at the castle reaches an all-time high when the young witch Ophelia appears at the castle gates out of nowhere, claiming to be Hui Buh''s long lost niece. Ophelia is in possession of the Necronomicon, an ancient book of spells that is as evil as it is powerful. Hui Buh, realizing the possibilities that the book would open up for him, is dying to get his hands on the book...', 'For over 500 years now, the castle ghost Hui Buh has been stirring things up at Castle Burgeck. His friend and owner of the castle, King Julius is not the only one who finds Hui Buh''s poor attempts at scary hauntings terribly annoying. The chaotic atmosphere at the castle reaches an all-time high when the young witch Ophelia appears at the castle gates out of nowhere, claiming to be Hui Buh''s long lost niece. Ophelia is in possession of the Necronomicon, an ancient book of spells that is as evil as it is powerful. Hui Buh, realizing the possibilities that the book would open up for him, is dying to get his hands on the book...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6pFimosDngknypmNIFg8E0zcVhz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:754158'),
  ('750525509515504571', 'Hui Buh: The Castle Ghost', 2006, 'Animation, Fantasy, Adventure, Comedy', 'Sebastian Niemann, Gerhard Schirlo, Simone Kraus Townsend', 'Sebastian Niemann, Dirk Ahner', 'Michael Herbig, Christoph Maria Herbst, Heike Makatsch, Ellenie Salvo González, Hans Clarin, Rick Kavanian, Nick Brimble, Martin Kurz', null, 'After 500 years, castle ghost Hui Buh finally has some royal residents to haunt, but he soon loses his license to scare and must get recertified.', 'After 500 years, castle ghost Hui Buh finally has some royal residents to haunt, but he soon loses his license to scare and must get recertified.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dQsaHfaa1og6HQ2kO4cB8D6wcCO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11651'),
  ('419232941661034879', 'Huie''s Sermon', 1983, 'Documentary, TV Movie', 'Werner Herzog, Thomas Mauch', null, 'Huie Rogers', null, 'Reverend Huie Rogers is a preacher at the Bible Way Church of Our Lord Jesus Christ in Brooklyn. He is the topic of this short film, during which launches into an epic call-and-response denunciation of human hubris, greed, corruption and failure. The use of lengthy shots present it less like a sermon and more a performance, and induce an almost trance-like state.', 'Reverend Huie Rogers is a preacher at the Bible Way Church of Our Lord Jesus Christ in Brooklyn. He is the topic of this short film, during which launches into an epic call-and-response denunciation of human hubris, greed, corruption and failure. The use of lengthy shots present it less like a sermon and more a performance, and induce an almost trance-like state.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pkzB4LxBQbbsLrRTVFiLxlr0KMs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:113255'),
  ('36993724668734905', 'Hukkle', 2002, 'Crime, Drama, Mystery', 'György Pálfi, Gergely Pohárnok', 'György Pálfi, Zsófia Ruttkay', 'Ferec Bandi, Józsefné Rácz, Ági Margitai, Eszter Ónodi, Attila Kaszás, Ildikó Kovács', null, 'Using almost no dialogue, the film follows a number of residents (both human and animal) of a small rural community in Hungary – an old man with hiccups, a shepherdess and her sheep, an old woman who may or may not be up to no good, some folk-singers at a wedding, etc. While most of the film is a series of vignettes, there is a sinister and often barely perceptible subplot involving murder.', 'Using almost no dialogue, the film follows a number of residents (both human and animal) of a small rural community in Hungary – an old man with hiccups, a shepherdess and her sheep, an old woman who may or may not be up to no good, some folk-singers at a wedding, etc. While most of the film is a series of vignettes, there is a sinister and often barely perceptible subplot involving murder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nngXEPKlfA9PfCrscN4Xjvwx0W.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:35848'),
  ('426899619026603832', 'Hula', 1927, 'Romance, Drama', 'Victor Fleming, William Marshall', 'Ethel Doherty, Doris Anderson', 'Clara Bow, Clive Brook, Arlette Marchal, Arnold Kent, Miss DuPont, Albert Gran, Agostino Borgato, Duke Kahanamoku', 'NR', 'The daughter of a pineapple plantation owner in Hawaii sets her sights on a married English engineer.', 'The daughter of a pineapple plantation owner in Hawaii sets her sights on a married English engineer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gEskzGO4SWt5PyoC8zJxditmQL3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:189677'),
  ('221161531654611262', 'Hula Fulla Dance', 2021, 'Animation, Drama, Comedy', 'Eriko Kimura, Kosuke Shimotori, Tatsuya Akitsu', 'Reiko Yoshida', 'Haruka Fukuhara, Karen Miyama, Miu Tomita, Kaori Maeda, Emiri Suyama, Saori Hayami, Risa Aizawa, Sumire Uesaka', 'NR', 'Hiwa Natsunagi is a high school student living in Iwaki City, Fukushima Prefecture. Worried about what to do with her life after graduation, she spots a poster for Spa Resort Hawaiians the “Hawaii of Tohoku” the place where her sister Mari used to work and applies to their new dancer (hula girl) campaign on a whim. Despite her lack of experience, Hiwa is accepted for the job, and starts on the path towards becoming a Hula Girl with her classmates, Kanna, Ranko, ''ohana and Shion. However, unable to keep in step with one another due to their differing personalities, their first stage ends in disaster. Called the “most pitiful rookies ever” the girls are disheartened, but they learn to share the good and bad...and strengthen their bond despite the occasional fumble. With their hearts and minds firmly set, the girls grace the stage once more.', 'Hiwa Natsunagi is a high school student living in Iwaki City, Fukushima Prefecture. Worried about what to do with her life after graduation, she spots a poster for Spa Resort Hawaiians the “Hawaii of Tohoku” the place where her sister Mari used to work and applies to their new dancer (hula girl) campaign on a whim. Despite her lack of experience, Hiwa is accepted for the job, and starts on the path towards becoming a Hula Girl with her classmates, Kanna, Ranko, ''ohana and Shion. However, unable to keep in step with one another due to their differing personalities, their first stage ends in disaster. Called the “most pitiful rookies ever” the girls are disheartened, but they learn to share the good and bad...and strengthen their bond despite the occasional fumble. With their hearts and minds firmly set, the girls grace the stage once more.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4UjIm4cidAXwT17gKS8G7vbKySj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:760765'),
  ('171007453135844378', 'Hula Girls', 2006, 'Comedy, Drama, Family', 'Sang-il Lee, Hideo Yamamoto, Taiichi Sugiyama', 'Daisuke Habara, Sang-il Lee', 'Yu Aoi, Yasuko Matsuyuki, Etsushi Toyokawa, Shizuyo Yamasaki, Shoko Ikezu, Eri Tokunaga, Hiroki Miyake, Susumu Terajima', null, 'Young women in a small Japanese town look to revive their home''s declining fortunes by building a Hawaiian village tourist attraction.', 'Young women in a small Japanese town look to revive their home''s declining fortunes by building a Hawaiian village tourist attraction.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xzYLnSkLtqukcmsHhAaz5OcRMvP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38305'),
  ('29516159589144790', 'Hulchul', 2004, 'Comedy, Romance, Action', 'Priyadarshan, Jeeva', 'Neeraj Vora', 'Akshaye Khanna, Kareena Kapoor Khan, Amrish Puri, Suniel Shetty, Arshad Warsi, Paresh Rawal, Jackie Shroff, Arbaaz Khan', null, 'A man and woman from feuding families each pretend to fall in love, as part of a revenge plot. Chaos ensues when their fake romance becomes a reality.', 'A man and woman from feuding families each pretend to fall in love, as part of a revenge plot. Chaos ensues when their fake romance becomes a reality.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ve6YjkjNAbY2r2djFxrw6v9IXfy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20364'),
  ('111649125021964216', 'Hulk', 2003, 'Science Fiction, Adventure, Action', 'Frederick Elmes, Mariko Braswell, Alex Jaeger', 'John Turman, Michael France, James Schamus', 'Eric Bana, Jennifer Connelly, Sam Elliott, Josh Lucas, Nick Nolte, Paul Kersey, Todd Tesen, Cara Buono', 'PG-13', 'Bruce Banner, a genetics researcher with a tragic past, suffers massive radiation exposure in his laboratory that causes him to transform into a raging green monster when he gets angry.', 'Bruce Banner, a genetics researcher with a tragic past, suffers massive radiation exposure in his laboratory that causes him to transform into a raging green monster when he gets angry.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/UllIft2jLSBaay3zQyMV4GNdfy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1927'),
  ('680025917641003985', 'Hulk vs. Thor', 2009, 'Action, Animation, Fantasy, Science Fiction', 'Sam Liu', 'Christopher L. Yost', 'Fred Tatasciore, Graham McTavish, Matthew Wolf, Grey DeLisle, Bryce Johnson, Kari Wahlgren, Janyse Jaud, Jay Brazeau', 'PG-13', 'For ages, Odin has protected his kingdom of Asgard. But every winter, the All-Father must rest and regain his strength for one week. During this time, all of Asgard''s foes (including trolls, giants, dark elves, and demons) try to claim the realm for their own, but they are always stopped by Odin''s son, the mighty Thor, albeit with the loss of many brave Asgardian warriors. Loki, god of mischief, has kidnapped Dr. Bruce Banner and brought him to Asgard with the help of Amora, once Thor''s lover, now the supervillain known as the Enchantress. Loki makes Banner angry and he changes into the Hulk. The Enchantress then casts a spell over the Hulk which separates Banner from his monstrous alter-ego and grants Loki control over the Hulk''s body.', 'For ages, Odin has protected his kingdom of Asgard. But every winter, the All-Father must rest and regain his strength for one week. During this time, all of Asgard''s foes (including trolls, giants, dark elves, and demons) try to claim the realm for their own, but they are always stopped by Odin''s son, the mighty Thor, albeit with the loss of many brave Asgardian warriors. Loki, god of mischief, has kidnapped Dr. Bruce Banner and brought him to Asgard with the help of Amora, once Thor''s lover, now the supervillain known as the Enchantress. Loki makes Banner angry and he changes into the Hulk. The Enchantress then casts a spell over the Hulk which separates Banner from his monstrous alter-ego and grants Loki control over the Hulk''s body.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4NS7L9xtGEOsZA0gnqdQBI7QiXu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:101907'),
  ('817257946660660318', 'Hulk vs. Wolverine', 2009, 'Animation, Action, Science Fiction, Adventure, Fantasy', 'Frank Paur', 'Craig Kyle, Christopher L. Yost', 'Fred Tatasciore, Bryce Johnson, Steve Blum, Nolan North, Tom Kane, Janyse Jaud, Nicole Oliver, Mark Acheson', 'PG-13', 'Department H sends in Wolverine to track down a mysterious beast known by the US Military as the Hulk, who is rampaging across the Canadian wilderness. Surveying the extent of the damage to a destroyed town, Wolverine notices a toxic scent as well as the smell of gunpowder. He is then deployed to the wilderness to resume tracking the creature.', 'Department H sends in Wolverine to track down a mysterious beast known by the US Military as the Hulk, who is rampaging across the Canadian wilderness. Surveying the extent of the damage to a destroyed town, Wolverine notices a toxic scent as well as the smell of gunpowder. He is then deployed to the wilderness to resume tracking the creature.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p8PZfkrCuXanfYr3k6xAS6WzN8Y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15257'),
  ('123168937542728393', 'Hulk: Where Monsters Dwell', 2016, 'Action, Animation, Fantasy, Science Fiction', 'Mitch Schauer', 'Marty Isenberg, Dave McDermott', 'Fred Tatasciore, Liam O''Brien, Jesse Burch, Edward Bosco, Chiara Zanni, Mike Vaughn, Jon Olson, Matthew Waterson', 'PG', 'This All Hallows’ Eve, Nightmare is bent on conquering our waking world by crossing through the Dream Dimension, and converting each dreamer into a monster. Can Dr. Strange, Hulk and the Howling Commandos hold the line and put an end to his nefarious scheme?', 'This All Hallows’ Eve, Nightmare is bent on conquering our waking world by crossing through the Dream Dimension, and converting each dreamer into a monster. Can Dr. Strange, Hulk and the Howling Commandos hold the line and put an end to his nefarious scheme?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/udUnSnQKzYddDpU6WNdTMB5XVEE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:422153'),
  ('515516312041046316', 'Hum', 1991, 'Romance, Action', 'Mukul Anand, W. B. Rao', 'Mohan Kaul', 'Amitabh Bachchan, Rajinikanth, Govinda, Kimi Katkar, Deepa Sahi, Shilpa Shirodkar, Danny Denzongpa, Anupam Kher', null, 'Tiger works for the local Don Bhaktawar but never hesitates to revolt against him if he harms his friends or family. When his girlfriend Jumma''s brother Gonsalves is killed by Bhakhtawar for revolting against him, Tiger promises revenge.', 'Tiger works for the local Don Bhaktawar but never hesitates to revolt against him if he harms his friends or family. When his girlfriend Jumma''s brother Gonsalves is killed by Bhakhtawar for revolting against him, Tiger promises revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/blnhL1cIxjjLgNdlDA8tIbvbCCO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:65954'),
  ('1040577984633226189', 'Hum', 2021, 'Thriller', 'Henry Johnston', 'Henry Johnston', 'Tyler Ross, Andrew Oliveri, Sonaz Izadi, Sierra Miller, Bradley Grant Smith, Peter DeFaria, Amelia McClain, Callie Hartz', null, 'When a mysterious and impenetrable Chest opens for the first time, a young man becomes inexplicably trapped in the woods along with his spiteful mentor and a strange woman with ties to a local cult.', 'When a mysterious and impenetrable Chest opens for the first time, a young man becomes inexplicably trapped in the woods along with his spiteful mentor and a strange woman with ties to a local cult.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wbsQL6uodqJdzbY1dcUHVIOKiv6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:849281'),
  ('822736374170419471', 'Hum Aapke Dil Mein Rehte Hain', 1999, 'Family, Drama, Romance', 'Satish Kaushik, Habieb Naseer, Kabir Lal', 'Habieb Naseer', 'Anil Kapoor, Kajol, Anupam Kher, Shakti Kapoor, Parmeet Sethi, Johny Lever, Mink Brar, Satish Kaushik', null, 'Vishwanath is a multi-millionaire industrialist, who lives in a palatial house, with his only chid, a son named Vijay. Vijay has been literally born with a silver spoon in his mouth, and indulges in life''s temptations and weaknesses to the extreme. Vishwanath would like his son to get married and be responsible. Vijay agrees to get married on condition that his future bride sign an agreement that the marriage is on a trial basis for one year, and thereafter is Vijay does not fall in love with her, the marriage gets annulled. Vishwanath asks his personal assistant, Megha, to quit her job and marry Vijay, but Megha refuses. Megha comes from a poor family, consisting of her mom, two other sisters, and one brother. Written by Shrikant', 'Vishwanath is a multi-millionaire industrialist, who lives in a palatial house, with his only chid, a son named Vijay. Vijay has been literally born with a silver spoon in his mouth, and indulges in life''s temptations and weaknesses to the extreme. Vishwanath would like his son to get married and be responsible. Vijay agrees to get married on condition that his future bride sign an agreement that the marriage is on a trial basis for one year, and thereafter is Vijay does not fall in love with her, the marriage gets annulled. Vishwanath asks his personal assistant, Megha, to quit her job and marry Vijay, but Megha refuses. Megha comes from a poor family, consisting of her mom, two other sisters, and one brother. Written by Shrikant', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/imN87wvGiqaXJ8ia5pi8Iqil4cJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52860'),
  ('304407303144978888', 'Hum Aapke Hain Koun..!', 1994, 'Drama, Romance, Music, Family', 'Sooraj Barjatya, Rajan Kinagi, Sanjay Dhabade', 'Sooraj Barjatya', 'Salman Khan, Madhuri Dixit, Mohnish Behl, Renuka Shahane, Anupam Kher, Reema Lagoo, Laxmikant Berde, Priya Arun Berde', null, 'Prem and Nisha meet and fall in love at the wedding of their elder siblings, but their plans to be together are put in jeopardy when Nisha''s sister dies, leaving behind a baby.', 'Prem and Nisha meet and fall in love at the wedding of their elder siblings, but their plans to be together are put in jeopardy when Nisha''s sister dies, leaving behind a baby.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v5CutZgZgai1if2U2CPssiig7VW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46387'),
  ('1103562934810201795', 'Hum Dil De Chuke Sanam', 1999, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Anil Mehta, Sanjay Leela Bhansali, Vikramaditya Motwane', 'Sanjay Leela Bhansali', 'Ajay Devgn, Salman Khan, Aishwarya Rai Bachchan, Vikram Gokhale, Smita Jaykar, Zohra Sehgal, Rajeev Verma, Sheeba Chaddha', 'PG', 'A newly-wed man discovers that his wife is in love with another man and decides to unite them. Ignoring the ridicule he might have to face for this, he takes his wife to Italy in search of her love.', 'A newly-wed man discovers that his wife is in love with another man and decides to unite them. Ignoring the ridicule he might have to face for this, he takes his wife to Italy in search of her love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kuoJvw45TobVp5QcyV16nK26NFx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:5319'),
  ('281666238464077852', 'Hum Do Hamare Do', 2021, 'Comedy, Drama, Family', 'Anmol Ahuja, Abhishek Banerjee, Amalendu Chaudhary', 'Prashant Jha', 'Rajkummar Rao, Kriti Sanon, Paresh Rawal, Ratna Pathak Shah, Aparshakti Khurana, Manu Rishi Chadha, Prachee Shah, Mazel Vyas', null, 'Self-made man Dhruv and social media star Anya fall in love and decide to marry. Just one problem - he''s an orphan because Anya will only marry a guy, who has an adorable family, so the only solution - arrange a ''fake'' set of parents.', 'Self-made man Dhruv and social media star Anya fall in love and decide to marry. Just one problem - he''s an orphan because Anya will only marry a guy, who has an adorable family, so the only solution - arrange a ''fake'' set of parents.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hzBUHsALNaxnoIyUij2qsN71iIh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:798159'),
  ('1150866717844906381', 'Hum Hain Rahi Pyar Ke', 1993, 'Family, Comedy, Romance, Drama', 'Mahesh Bhatt', 'Robin Bhatt', 'Aamir Khan, Juhi Chawla Mehta, Master Sharokh, Kunal Khemu, Baby Ashrafa, Tiku Talsania, Dalip Tahil, Navneet Nishan', null, 'Rahul has his hands full taking care of his late sister’s three children. He faces a new challenge when the kids sneak a runaway bride into the house.', 'Rahul has his hands full taking care of his late sister’s three children. He faces a new challenge when the kids sneak a runaway bride into the house.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ocEQInlignEoa8ztW7CSVSnsty3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54814'),
  ('1123089054729133159', 'Hum Kisi Se Kum Nahin', 2002, 'Comedy, Action, Romance, Drama', 'David Dhawan', 'Javed Siddiqui', 'Ajay Devgn, Sanjay Dutt, Amitabh Bachchan, Aishwarya Rai Bachchan, Paresh Rawal, Satish Kaushik, Annu Kapoor, Mukesh Rishi', null, 'When Munna Bhai, a notorious gangster, meets Komal, he is immediately smitten. However, he must first confront her protective brother, Dr. Rastogi and her current boyfriend, Raja.', 'When Munna Bhai, a notorious gangster, meets Komal, he is immediately smitten. However, he must first confront her protective brother, Dr. Rastogi and her current boyfriend, Raja.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nzbPBEd26aJg6aLUF4eMWePWr9o.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:97437'),
  ('866593227841876499', 'Hum Saath Saath Hain', 1999, 'Romance, Family, Drama', 'Sooraj Barjatya, Rajan Kinagi, B. Vittal', 'Sooraj Barjatya', 'Mohnish Behl, Salman Khan, Saif Ali Khan, Tabu, Sonali Bendre, Karisma Kapoor, Alok Nath, Reema Lagoo', null, 'A wealthy businessman''s traditional family celebrate their togetherness when his three sons get married, but slowly find themselves growing apart after a misunderstanding.', 'A wealthy businessman''s traditional family celebrate their togetherness when his three sons get married, but slowly find themselves growing apart after a misunderstanding.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lEAEzpAfSyBZc5sw1NBnWr5TeZU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:62883'),
  ('715058916410917723', 'Hum Tum', 2004, 'Romance, Family, Comedy, Drama', 'Kunal Kohli, Sunil Patel', 'Siddharth Anand, Kunal Kohli', 'Rani Mukerji, Saif Ali Khan, Kirron Kher, Rati Agnihotri, Rishi Kapoor, Jimmy Shergill, Abhishek Bachchan, Shenaz Treasury', null, 'The encounters of two people who run into each other on several occasions under circumstances ranging from friendly to hostile to loving. Along many years and countless run-ins, the two despise each other, befriend each other, and fall in love with each other—in no particular order.', 'The encounters of two people who run into each other on several occasions under circumstances ranging from friendly to hostile to loving. Along many years and countless run-ins, the two despise each other, befriend each other, and fall in love with each other—in no particular order.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u4ctCNPq6qfwnUyZzAfxEzdJ0Lq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4253'),
  ('969624391518885812', 'Hum Tumhare Hain Sanam', 2002, 'Romance, Drama, Comedy', 'K. S. Adiyaman, Esai Vanan, Nirdesh Lawrence', null, 'Shah Rukh Khan, Salman Khan, Madhuri Dixit, Atul Agnihotri, Suman Ranganathan, Alok Nath, Aruna Irani, Laxmikant Berde', null, 'Radha and Suraj have been friends since childhood. Gopal has been in love with Radha ever since they spent a few years together as kids. Years later, Gopal''s guardian proposes to Radha a marriage with Gopal, and she accepts.', 'Radha and Suraj have been friends since childhood. Gopal has been in love with Radha ever since they spent a few years together as kids. Years later, Gopal''s guardian proposes to Radha a marriage with Gopal, and she accepts.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/46IXH3NtlWv2i7IeFigT5yb5T5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:90634'),
  ('677810428555295638', 'Human', 2015, 'Documentary', 'Yann Arthus-Bertrand, Florent Gilard, Bruno Cusa', null, null, null, 'A collection of stories about and images of our world, offering an immersion to the core of what it means to be human. Through these stories full of love and happiness, as well as hatred and violence, it brings us face to face with the Other, making us reflect on our lives. From stories of everyday experiences to accounts of the most unbelievable lives, these poignant encounters share a rare sincerity and underline who we are – our darker side, but also what is most noble in us, and what is universal. Our Earth is shown at its most sublime through never-before-seen aerial images accompanied by soaring music, resulting in an ode to the beauty of the world, providing a moment to draw breath and for introspection. This film is a politically engaged work which allows us to embrace the human condition and to reflect on the meaning of our existence.', 'A collection of stories about and images of our world, offering an immersion to the core of what it means to be human. Through these stories full of love and happiness, as well as hatred and violence, it brings us face to face with the Other, making us reflect on our lives. From stories of everyday experiences to accounts of the most unbelievable lives, these poignant encounters share a rare sincerity and underline who we are – our darker side, but also what is most noble in us, and what is universal. Our Earth is shown at its most sublime through never-before-seen aerial images accompanied by soaring music, resulting in an ode to the beauty of the world, providing a moment to draw breath and for introspection. This film is a politically engaged work which allows us to embrace the human condition and to reflect on the meaning of our existence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l02W63OGQKYugJrs3Uw8nA9gii4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:359364'),
  ('559105723226888178', 'Human Animals', 1983, 'Science Fiction, Drama', 'Eligio Herrero', 'Eligio Herrero', 'Carole Kirkham, Geir Indvard, José Yepes', null, 'After several nuclear explosions, two men and one woman wake up in the middle of a desert and begin a journey of survival and self-discovery.', 'After several nuclear explosions, two men and one woman wake up in the middle of a desert and begin a journey of survival and self-discovery.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yki4tywOYENaInMvsIzfHF4cG4h.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:300990'),
  ('61328116458349247', 'Human Animals', 2020, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Ernesto Herrera, Lex Ortega', 'Miguel García Moreno', 'Adriana Louvier, Antonio de la Vega, Néstor Rodulfo, Aroa Gimeno, Roberto Duarte, Roberto Duarte, Francisco Rubio', null, 'The harmony of a seemingly idyllic neighborhood is disrupted when a dog attacks a young girl.', 'The harmony of a seemingly idyllic neighborhood is disrupted when a dog attacks a young girl.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5Ba51RwONmbrotqX1FgHELYtffU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:676839'),
  ('251990782920388476', 'Human Capital', 2013, 'Drama', 'Miguel Lombardi, Jérôme Alméras, Elena Casnati', 'Francesco Bruni, Francesco Piccolo, Paolo Virzì', 'Valeria Bruni Tedeschi, Fabrizio Bentivoglio, Valeria Golino, Fabrizio Gifuni, Luigi Lo Cascio, Giovanni Anzaldo, Matilde Gioli, Guglielmo Pinelli', null, 'The destinies of two families are irrevocably tied together after a cyclist is hit off the road by a jeep in the night before Christmas Eve.', 'The destinies of two families are irrevocably tied together after a cyclist is hit off the road by a jeep in the night before Christmas Eve.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nQxQ2N2wXksZnHa2ZzdwCbDtmkE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:244088'),
  ('1025872041626022257', 'Human Capital', 2020, 'Crime, Drama', 'Marc Meyers, Kat Westergaard, Ben Kahn', 'Oren Moverman', 'Liev Schreiber, Marisa Tomei, Peter Sarsgaard, Maya Hawke, Alex Wolff, Betty Gabriel, Aasif Mandvi, Paul Sparks', null, 'Ian begins a relationship with Drew''s daughter, who works in the financial sector. The couple gets involved in a tragic accident that will change their lives forever. At the same time, the accident has a major impact on both their families who, despite the class difference, cross paths.', 'Ian begins a relationship with Drew''s daughter, who works in the financial sector. The couple gets involved in a tragic accident that will change their lives forever. At the same time, the accident has a major impact on both their families who, despite the class difference, cross paths.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d85nI1P0dYKVzWHjM5QVyi0zkfD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:569711'),
  ('1057843090258096749', 'Human Desire', 1954, 'Crime, Drama, Romance', 'Fritz Lang, Burnett Guffey, Milton Feldman', 'Alfred Hayes', 'Glenn Ford, Gloria Grahame, Broderick Crawford, Edgar Buchanan, Kathleen Case, Peggy Maley, Diane DeLaire, Grandon Rhodes', null, 'A Korean War vet returns to his job as a railroad engineer and becomes involved in a sordid affair with a co-worker''s wife and murder. Preserved by the Academy Film Archive, in partnership with Sony Pictures Entertainment, in 1997.', 'A Korean War vet returns to his job as a railroad engineer and becomes involved in a sordid affair with a co-worker''s wife and murder. Preserved by the Academy Film Archive, in partnership with Sony Pictures Entertainment, in 1997.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jENxUySE0H3XUUIP1mitESyhjEK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21564'),
  ('639332591172082489', 'Human Desires', 1997, 'Thriller, Crime', 'Ellen Earnshaw, Charles Schner, Clinton Canada', 'Todd Michael Smith', 'Shannon Tweed, Dawn Ann Billings, Christian Noble, Ashby Adams, Peggy Trentini, Stack Pierce, Duke Stroud, Victor Campos', 'R', 'Alicia Royale is a fashion mogul who decides to have a large pajama themed party as a promotion for her new line of clothing...', 'Alicia Royale is a fashion mogul who decides to have a large pajama themed party as a promotion for her new line of clothing...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2BgX4IUMTNgfB7VDQTAS4SIx2Uh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:57765'),
  ('416676639120343161', 'Human Experiments', 1979, 'Horror, Crime', 'Gregory Goodell, João Fernandes', 'Richard Rothstein', 'Linda Haynes, Geoffrey Lewis, Ellen Travolta, Lurene Tuttle, Mercedes Shirley, Darlene Craviotto, Marie O''Henry, Wesley Marie Tackitt', 'R', 'A demented prison doctor performs gruesome shock therapy experiments on inmates.', 'A demented prison doctor performs gruesome shock therapy experiments on inmates.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rizflW3YRMOTKkiYnwjUAnEGjne.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:72444'),
  ('1093113757032664683', 'Human Factors', 2022, 'Drama, Mystery', 'Klemens Hufnagl, Ronny Trocker', 'Ronny Trocker', 'Mark Waschke, Sabine Timoteo, Wanja Valentin Kube, Jule Hermann, Marthe Schneider, Hassan Akkouch, Spencer Bogaert, Karen Margrethe Gotfredsen', null, 'To escape mounting tensions at the advertising agency they co-own, French-German couple Nina and Jan whisk their kids, Max and Emma, away to their seaside vacation home. The couple has signed a new politically charged client, forcing them to confront their clashing priorities. But what’s meant to be an idyllic off-season retreat turns sinister when burglars tear through the house, unseen by anyone except Nina. Though at first the aftermath brings the family closer, it’s short-lived once Max reveals he glimpsed his father hiding during the break-in. As the police investigate and the evidence doesn’t add up, the account of what took place begins to unravel alongside the couple’s faith in each other.', 'To escape mounting tensions at the advertising agency they co-own, French-German couple Nina and Jan whisk their kids, Max and Emma, away to their seaside vacation home. The couple has signed a new politically charged client, forcing them to confront their clashing priorities. But what’s meant to be an idyllic off-season retreat turns sinister when burglars tear through the house, unseen by anyone except Nina. Though at first the aftermath brings the family closer, it’s short-lived once Max reveals he glimpsed his father hiding during the break-in. As the police investigate and the evidence doesn’t add up, the account of what took place begins to unravel alongside the couple’s faith in each other.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ox67XlWtneQqQG1v1mJMCnHRxd4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:776542'),
  ('12638836494853000', 'Human Flow', 2017, 'Documentary', 'Ai Weiwei, Johannes Waltermann, Wenhai Huang', 'Boris Cheshirkov, Chin-Chin Yap, Tim Finch', 'Boris Cheshirkov, Marin Din Kajdomcaj, Princess Dana Firas of Jordan, Abeer Khalid', null, 'More than 65 million people around the world have been forced from their homes to escape famine, climate change and war, the greatest displacement since World War II. Filmmaker Ai Weiwei examines the staggering scale of the refugee crisis and its profoundly personal human impact. Over the course of one year in 23 countries, Weiwei follows a chain of urgent human stories that stretch across the globe, including Afghanistan, France, Greece, Germany and Iraq.', 'More than 65 million people around the world have been forced from their homes to escape famine, climate change and war, the greatest displacement since World War II. Filmmaker Ai Weiwei examines the staggering scale of the refugee crisis and its profoundly personal human impact. Over the course of one year in 23 countries, Weiwei follows a chain of urgent human stories that stretch across the globe, including Afghanistan, France, Greece, Germany and Iraq.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tx01l9cmbYWk1NmwkLb0VfY80GG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:468213'),
  ('155553607741914605', 'Human Form', 2014, 'Horror, Science Fiction, Drama', 'Noh Do-yeon, Ahn Byung-rae, Seul Ki Kim', 'Noh Do-yeon', 'Si Yeon Kim, Lee Ye-eun, Jinseon Son, Sun Hee Kang, Hong Seung-il, Ae-Jin Kim, Sun Wha Koo, Heo Jeong-do', null, 'Feeling alone in a world where everyone looks exactly the same, a young girl decides to take extreme measures to change her appearance.', 'Feeling alone in a world where everyone looks exactly the same, a young girl decides to take extreme measures to change her appearance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cI5FBjNKdycLKtIQ1xHGH2YCgOp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:420835'),
  ('218210595216295790', 'Human Highway', 1982, 'Science Fiction, Comedy, Drama', 'Neil Young, Dean Stockwell, David Myers', 'Neil Young, Dean Stockwell, Jeanne Field', 'Neil Young, Dean Stockwell, Dennis Hopper, Sally Kirkland, Russ Tamblyn, Charlotte Stewart, Pegi Young, Mark Mothersbaugh', null, 'The new owner of a roadside diner stuck in a town built around an always leaking nuclear power plant plans to torch the place to collect insurance. However, an assortment of bizarre characters and weird events (such as spaceships flying around) gets in his way.', 'The new owner of a roadside diner stuck in a town built around an always leaking nuclear power plant plans to torch the place to collect insurance. However, an assortment of bizarre characters and weird events (such as spaceships flying around) gets in his way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wRMMPYCRzT756uKKpMPeTDbcdZJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:70011'),
  ('859783822378569131', 'Human Lanterns', 1982, 'Horror, Action', 'Sun Chung, Cho On-Sun', 'Sun Chung, Ni Kuang', 'Tony Liu Tian-jue, Chen Kuan-Tai, Lo Lieh, Tanny Tien-Ni, Choh Seung-Wan, Lam Sau-Kwan, Lo Meng, Sun Chien', null, 'A psychotic craftsman pits two rival Kung-Fu masters against each other while designing special lanterns from a disturbing source.', 'A psychotic craftsman pits two rival Kung-Fu masters against each other while designing special lanterns from a disturbing source.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v5a25FBIPqzVvLqhrBhUvMoB7mk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64992'),
  ('880777240461371901', 'Human Lost', 2019, 'Action, Animation, Science Fiction', 'Fuminori Kizaki, Akira Hirabayashi, Hiroshi Otake', 'Kenji Tobori', 'Mamoru Miyano, Kana Hanazawa, Takahiro Sakurai, Jun Fukuyama, Kenichirou Matsuda, Rikiya Koyama, Miyuki Sawashiro, Haruka Chisuga', null, 'In the year 2036 mankind has revolutionized the medical field. Scientist have conquered death via the use of internal nanomachines and the “Shell System,” however, only the richest can afford to partake. Yozo Oba has been troubled by strange dreams and one day joins his friend’s biker gang. They embark to the “The Inside,” where society’s elite live, however, this begins a terrifying journey of discovery that will change Yozo’s life forever.', 'In the year 2036 mankind has revolutionized the medical field. Scientist have conquered death via the use of internal nanomachines and the “Shell System,” however, only the richest can afford to partake. Yozo Oba has been troubled by strange dreams and one day joins his friend’s biker gang. They embark to the “The Inside,” where society’s elite live, however, this begins a terrifying journey of discovery that will change Yozo’s life forever.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2ucqzh23UieFrgnDQVtPj1GrRGq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:593240'),
  ('100543062449754301', 'Human Nature', 2001, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Tim Maurice-Jones, Michel Gondry', 'Charlie Kaufman', 'Tim Robbins, Patricia Arquette, Rhys Ifans, Miranda Otto, Mary Kay Place, Robert Forster, Peter Dinklage, Rosie Perez', 'R', 'Obsessive scientist Nathan and his lover, the naturalist Lila, discover Puff: a man born and raised in the wild. As Nathan trains the wild man in the civilized ways of the world, Lila fights to preserve the man’s natural state. In the power struggle that ensues, an unusual love triangle emerges.', 'Obsessive scientist Nathan and his lover, the naturalist Lila, discover Puff: a man born and raised in the wild. As Nathan trains the wild man in the civilized ways of the world, Lila fights to preserve the man’s natural state. In the power struggle that ensues, an unusual love triangle emerges.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eyEgsPIwsr9bUV9n9INH46L5KuM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:441'),
  ('559067038463980325', 'Human Remains', 1998, 'Documentary', 'Jay Rosenblatt', null, 'Eva Braun, Francisco Franco, Adolf Hitler, Vladimir Lenin, Mao Zedong, Benito Mussolini, Joseph Stalin, Leon Trotsky', null, 'Human Remains is a haunting documentary which illustrates the banality of evil by creating intimate portraits of five of the 20th century''s most reviled dictators. The film unveils the personal lives of Adolf Hitler, Benito Mussolini, Joseph Stalin, Francisco Franco and Mao Tse Tung. We learn the private and mundane details of their everyday lives -- their favorite foods, films, habits and sexual preferences. There is no mention of their public lives or of their place in history. The intentional omission of the horrors for which these men were responsible hovers over the film.', 'Human Remains is a haunting documentary which illustrates the banality of evil by creating intimate portraits of five of the 20th century''s most reviled dictators. The film unveils the personal lives of Adolf Hitler, Benito Mussolini, Joseph Stalin, Francisco Franco and Mao Tse Tung. We learn the private and mundane details of their everyday lives -- their favorite foods, films, habits and sexual preferences. There is no mention of their public lives or of their place in history. The intentional omission of the horrors for which these men were responsible hovers over the film.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kr2NV52BGpyPV88PtRo0wFPHKgq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:154802'),
  ('432702576291115593', 'Human Resources', 1999, 'Drama', 'Laurent Cantet, Matthieu Poirot-Delpech, Rafaele Ravinet-Virbel', 'Laurent Cantet, Gilles Marchand', 'Jalil Lespert, Jean-Claude Vallod, Didier Emile-Woldemard, Chantal Barré, Véronique de Pandelaère, Michel Begnez, Lucien Longueville, Danielle Mélador', null, '"Good son" Franck returns to his hometown to do a trainee managerial internship in the Human Resources department of the factory where his anxious, taciturn father has worked for 23 years.', '"Good son" Franck returns to his hometown to do a trainee managerial internship in the Human Resources department of the factory where his anxious, taciturn father has worked for 23 years.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i2BdbtsCeRCHhczCDEV3mFt4uF0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46831'),
  ('1005656157954362819', 'Human Traffic', 1999, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Justin Kerrigan, Dave Bennett, Gary Howe', 'Justin Kerrigan', 'John Simm, Shaun Parkes, Nicola Reynolds, Lorraine Pilkington, Danny Dyer, Dean Davies, Andrew Lincoln, Terence Beesley', 'R', 'For Jip, Lulu, Koop, Nina and Moff, the dead-end jobs they endure during the week just kill the time until Friday night. That''s when they cut very loose and get on the rollercoaster ride that takes them right through to Monday morning.', 'For Jip, Lulu, Koop, Nina and Moff, the dead-end jobs they endure during the week just kill the time until Friday night. That''s when they cut very loose and get on the rollercoaster ride that takes them right through to Monday morning.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cHwnYGZh1fVuVWqT28GpCN0usYF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11129'),
  ('1105648425318884602', 'Human Voice', 2014, 'Romance, Drama', 'Edoardo Ponti, Rodrigo Prieto', 'Erri De Luca, Edoardo Ponti', 'Sophia Loren, Enrico Lo Verso, Alessandra Bonarota, Virginia Da Brescia', null, 'Based on Jean Cocteau''s iconic one-woman play of the same name; set against the backdrop of 1950 Naples, Angela is a woman in her twilight years, who rides the emotional rollercoaster of her last telephone conversation with the man she loves as he is leaving her for another woman.', 'Based on Jean Cocteau''s iconic one-woman play of the same name; set against the backdrop of 1950 Naples, Angela is a woman in her twilight years, who rides the emotional rollercoaster of her last telephone conversation with the man she loves as he is leaving her for another woman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jq1AN44XaOueKlU03MZ4Gl1GKh9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:296680'),
  ('858297774397150969', 'Human Zoo', 2020, 'Horror, Thriller', 'John E Seymore', 'John E Seymore, John D. Crawford, Selfin Morose', 'Robert Carradine, Jose Rosete, Rachel Amanda Bryant, Jessica Cameron, Megan Le, John D. Crawford, Heather Dorff, Robert Catrini', null, 'Contestants on a reality TV show must stay in solitary confinement to win a $1 million prize.', 'Contestants on a reality TV show must stay in solitary confinement to win a $1 million prize.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bzTV8zQyqFOwIaU9TqlfOjOpL6s.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:449753'),
  ('1111540376606208296', 'Human, Space, Time and Human', 2018, 'Drama', 'Kim Ki-duk', 'Kim Ki-duk', 'Mina Fujii, Jang Keun-suk, Ahn Sung-ki, Lee Sung-jae, Ryoo Seung-bum, Joe Odagiri, Sung Ki-yoon, Yeo Min-jeong', null, 'A group of very different people set sail on an old warship. The passengers include a senator with his son, a newly-wed couple, a mysterious old man, a group of sex workers and a gang of violent criminals. At first the aggressive behaviour of the thugs and their leader is directed at the first class passengers, but then more and more indiscriminately against the rest of those on board. Rape is followed by murder and it’s not long before the first of numerous and increasingly brutal mutinies takes place.', 'A group of very different people set sail on an old warship. The passengers include a senator with his son, a newly-wed couple, a mysterious old man, a group of sex workers and a gang of violent criminals. At first the aggressive behaviour of the thugs and their leader is directed at the first class passengers, but then more and more indiscriminately against the rest of those on board. Rape is followed by murder and it’s not long before the first of numerous and increasingly brutal mutinies takes place.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bpWpzpnU5wSZIpIri6CNzpS8WbY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:459267'),
  ('636156284010615401', 'Humane', 2024, 'Horror, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Caitlin Cronenberg, Douglas Koch, Billy Gridley', 'Michael Sparaga', 'Jay Baruchel, Emily Hampshire, Sebastian Chacon, Alanna Bale, Sirena Gulamgaus, Uni Park, Martin Roach, Blessing Adedijo', 'R', 'In the wake of an environmental collapse that has forced humanity to shed 20% of its population, a family dinner erupts into chaos when a father''s plan to enlist in the government''s new euthanasia program goes horribly awry.', 'In the wake of an environmental collapse that has forced humanity to shed 20% of its population, a family dinner erupts into chaos when a father''s plan to enlist in the government''s new euthanasia program goes horribly awry.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ecOvKaoM1hwQbp0uTnULGrSV32e.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:914215'),
  ('214549420202926254', 'Humanist Vampire Seeking Consenting Suicidal Person', 2023, 'Romance, Comedy, Fantasy, Horror', 'Gabrielle Gingras, Morgane Pinel, Ariane Louis-Seize', 'Ariane Louis-Seize, Christine Doyon', 'Sara Montpetit, Félix-Antoine Bénard, Steve Laplante, Sophie Cadieux, Noémie O''Farrell, Arnaud Vachon, Marie Brassard, Madeleine Péloquin', null, 'Sasha is a young vampire with a serious problem: she''s too sensitive to kill. When her exasperated parents cut off her blood supply, Sasha''s life is in jeopardy. Luckily, she meets Paul, a lonely teenager with suicidal tendencies who is willing to give his life to save hers. But their friendly agreement soon becomes a nocturnal quest to fulfill Paul''s last wishes before day breaks.', 'Sasha is a young vampire with a serious problem: she''s too sensitive to kill. When her exasperated parents cut off her blood supply, Sasha''s life is in jeopardy. Luckily, she meets Paul, a lonely teenager with suicidal tendencies who is willing to give his life to save hers. But their friendly agreement soon becomes a nocturnal quest to fulfill Paul''s last wishes before day breaks.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m5OItLBY5T38ew1YI4VSIXjl5G2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:988402'),
  ('798210727020203487', 'Humanité', 1999, 'Drama, Mystery', 'Bruno Dumont, Yves Cape, Xavier Christiaens', 'Bruno Dumont', 'Emmanuel Schotté, Séverine Caneele, Philippe Tullier, Ghislain Ghesquère, Ginette Allègre, Darius, Arnaud Brejon de la Lavergnee, Daniel Petillon', null, 'In a quiet little French town, two detectives are tasked with investigating the brutal rape and murder of a preteen girl.', 'In a quiet little French town, two detectives are tasked with investigating the brutal rape and murder of a preteen girl.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fEEVsOpI21ZDY64tKMh4T3FZzCp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:65296'),
  ('1135268762956131666', 'Humanity and Paper Balloons', 1937, 'Drama, History', 'Sadao Yamanaka, Akira Mimura, Ishirō Honda', 'Shintarō Mimura', 'Chōjūrō Kawarasaki, Kan''emon Nakamura, Shizue Kawarazaki, Noboru Kiritachi, Sensho Ichikawa, Kō Mihashi, Tsuruzo Nakamura, Sukezō Sukedakaya', null, 'In a slum in Edo Japan, a ronin hopes that his deceased father''s former master will hire him while a disgraced hairdresser attempts to regain his pride by kidnapping the daughter of a wealthy pawnbroker, who is set to be married.', 'In a slum in Edo Japan, a ronin hopes that his deceased father''s former master will hire him while a disgraced hairdresser attempts to regain his pride by kidnapping the daughter of a wealthy pawnbroker, who is set to be married.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/55qYigH3aum9wRZuaGKqMPUFq5F.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84237'),
  ('683407997309403675', 'Humanity''s End', 2009, 'Science Fiction', 'Neil Johnson', 'Neil Johnson, Michael Jonathan Smith', 'Jay Laisne, Rochelle Vallese, Cynthia Ickes, William David Tulin', 'R', 'The year is 3313. Mankind is being systematically massacred throughout the galaxy by an invading species. All hope is lost until the last strand of pure human DNA is found on a remote planet in the far reaches of the galaxy. Now, an epic battle will be waged across time and space to save and protect the last of the human race.', 'The year is 3313. Mankind is being systematically massacred throughout the galaxy by an invading species. All hope is lost until the last strand of pure human DNA is found on a remote planet in the far reaches of the galaxy. Now, an epic battle will be waged across time and space to save and protect the last of the human race.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dPu1nyFsS76ROPbzzmBrkjgdKTZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21836'),
  ('658999371981376254', 'Humanoids from the Deep', 1980, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Daniel Lacambre, Barbara Peeters, Jimmy T. Murakami', 'William Martin', 'Doug McClure, Ann Turkel, Vic Morrow, Cindy Weintraub, Anthony Pena, Denise Galik, Lynn Theel, Meegan King', 'R', 'After a new cannery introduces scientifically augmented salmon to a seaside town in the Pacific Northwest, a species of mysterious, mutated sea creatures begin killing the men and raping the women.', 'After a new cannery introduces scientifically augmented salmon to a seaside town in the Pacific Northwest, a species of mysterious, mutated sea creatures begin killing the men and raping the women.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jVqNWDvTIwjcHsMyNSUT0sfGrq9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29343'),
  ('591041495273050224', 'Humanoids from the Deep', 1996, 'Science Fiction, Thriller, TV Movie, Horror', 'Jeff Yonis, Christopher Baffa, Nils Erickson', 'Jeff Yonis', 'Emma Samms, Mark Rolston, Justin Walker, Danielle Weeks, Clint Howard, Kaz Garas, Warren Burton, Bert Remsen', null, 'A secret government experiment turns nightmarish when genetically altered fish, bred as amphibious weapons, escape. Scientists believe them dead after a biohazardous chemical spill. Far from it, the creatures thrive as bloodthirtsy killers, threatening to annihilate a small coastal town by slaughtering the men and abducting the women for mating! Government scientists attempt to keep the creatures'' origin a secret while trying to destroy them.', 'A secret government experiment turns nightmarish when genetically altered fish, bred as amphibious weapons, escape. Scientists believe them dead after a biohazardous chemical spill. Far from it, the creatures thrive as bloodthirtsy killers, threatening to annihilate a small coastal town by slaughtering the men and abducting the women for mating! Government scientists attempt to keep the creatures'' origin a secret while trying to destroy them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8Egjh8I1YhXeErXtwBj6NMnSkWR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:53060'),
  ('566284393521646732', 'Humans', 2009, 'Adventure, Thriller, Horror', 'Pierre-Olivier Thevenin, Jacques-Olivier Molon, Aleksander Kaufmann', 'Dominique Néraud, Frédérique Henri, Jean-Armand Bougrelle', 'Sara Forestier, Lorànt Deutsch, Dominique Pinon, Manon Tournier, Élise Otzenberger, Philippe Nahon, Christian Kmiotek, Marie-Paule von Roesgen', null, 'A team of several researchers travel to the Swiss Alps to investigate a scientific discovery on human evolution. The trip, however, turns into a deadly fight for survival when the team crash into a gully and find themselves falling prey to someone...or something.', 'A team of several researchers travel to the Swiss Alps to investigate a scientific discovery on human evolution. The trip, however, turns into a deadly fight for survival when the team crash into a gully and find themselves falling prey to someone...or something.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5bA0KY80E0qyam9awVBfuhxwrte.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17408'),
  ('623351791194157699', 'Humboldt County', 2008, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Darren Grodsky, Danny Jacobs, Ernest Holzman', 'Darren Grodsky, Danny Jacobs', 'Jeremy Strong, Fairuza Balk, Peter Bogdanovich, Vicky Monroe, Tarek Zohdy, Lawrence Bridges, John Murdock, Lenny Pettinelli', 'R', 'Peter is a medical student about to graduate and begin his residency. When his professor fails him, he winds up in bed with an actress and singer named Bogart rolling through Los Angeles. He accompanies her to the redwoods of northern California, where he encounters her eccentric family of pot farmers. But when Bogart runs away without a word, Peter is thrust into the picturesque and bizarre world.', 'Peter is a medical student about to graduate and begin his residency. When his professor fails him, he winds up in bed with an actress and singer named Bogart rolling through Los Angeles. He accompanies her to the redwoods of northern California, where he encounters her eccentric family of pot farmers. But when Bogart runs away without a word, Peter is thrust into the picturesque and bizarre world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o5x5YXmXOtW9Kk9FH9MNbdEIfq5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14232'),
  ('408060793701424995', 'Humdrum', 1999, 'Comedy, Animation', 'Peter Peake', null, 'Moray Hunter, Jack Docherty', null, 'Two very bored shadowy characters try to think of something to do--and end up playing "Shadow Puppets."', 'Two very bored shadowy characters try to think of something to do--and end up playing "Shadow Puppets."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iRIUUQXZ3rTuika8IxRHWl28MMR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:209969'),
  ('442916200054979912', 'Humiliated and Insulted', 1990, 'Drama, Romance', 'Andrey Eshpay, Sergey Yurizditskiy, Aleksandr Kazarenskov', 'Aleksandr Volodin', 'Nastassja Kinski, Nikita Mikhalkov, Viktor Rakov, Aleksandr Abdulov, Boris Romanov, Anastasiya Vyazemskaya, Sergey Perelygin, Lyudmila Polyakova', null, 'Based on the Fyodor Dostoevsky novel about a young woman who leaves her family to live with her lover whose father dead set on keeping them apart.', 'Based on the Fyodor Dostoevsky novel about a young woman who leaves her family to live with her lover whose father dead set on keeping them apart.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d6YiC3bFhcVc69VtclYsE23CQTa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:290591'),
  ('379313530395206167', 'Humint', 2026, 'Thriller, Action, Drama', 'Ryoo Seung-wan, Yang Hyun-suk, Kim Seok-young', 'Ryoo Seung-wan', 'Zo In-sung, Park Jeong-min, Park Hae-joon, Shin Sae-kyeong, Robert Maaser, Jung Yoo-jin, Park Myung-shin, Lee Shin-ki', null, 'A South Korean agent hunts a drug ring in Russia and goes head-to-head with a North Korean operative — pulling both into peril and tangled secrets.', 'A South Korean agent hunts a drug ring in Russia and goes head-to-head with a North Korean operative — pulling both into peril and tangled secrets.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/82bX2GK4PhaJQtfkTnfmd2P7erG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1268127'),
  ('274480385118833141', 'Humko Deewana Kar Gaye', 2006, 'Drama, Romance', 'Raj Kanwar', null, 'Akshay Kumar, Katrina Kaif, Anil Kapoor, Bipasha Basu, Bhagyashree, Shernaz Patel, Vivek Shauq, Helen', 'PG-13', 'Aditya, an engineer, travels to Canada for training. There he meets Jia, a beautiful woman from an influential family. Fate keeps pushing the pair together, and even though both are already betrothed to others, Adi and Jia fall in love.', 'Aditya, an engineer, travels to Canada for training. There he meets Jia, a beautiful woman from an influential family. Fate keeps pushing the pair together, and even though both are already betrothed to others, Adi and Jia fall in love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5Pe8sACQOQ6Ht6mPR5tUNwpGHgy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48569'),
  ('503203943934661333', 'Humko Tumse Pyaar Hai', 2006, 'Romance, Thriller', 'Bunty Soorma', 'Ashok Roy, Javed Siddiqui, Bunty Soorma', 'Arjun Rampal, Ameesha Patel, Bobby Deol, Achint Kaur, Anang Desai, Beena Banerjee, Asha Sharma, Suhasini Mulay', null, 'Jaipur-based Durga has been blind as far as she can remember, and helps her dad make clay statues of Hindu Gods and Goddesses. When her dad passes away, she and her mom continue making clay statues to make a living. Then one day Durga is involved in an accident and is rescued by a young man named Babu. Both of them fall in love with each and want to get married. But before that could happen, Dubai returned Rana, another man who wants to marry Durga, kills her mom and then Babu himself. A devastated Durga undergoes eye surgery through Swiss-based Dr. R.K. Prasad and regains her sight. Dr. Prasad takes her with him to live in Switzerland and this is where multi-millionaire Raj enters her life and wants to marry her.', 'Jaipur-based Durga has been blind as far as she can remember, and helps her dad make clay statues of Hindu Gods and Goddesses. When her dad passes away, she and her mom continue making clay statues to make a living. Then one day Durga is involved in an accident and is rescued by a young man named Babu. Both of them fall in love with each and want to get married. But before that could happen, Dubai returned Rana, another man who wants to marry Durga, kills her mom and then Babu himself. A devastated Durga undergoes eye surgery through Swiss-based Dr. R.K. Prasad and regains her sight. Dr. Prasad takes her with him to live in Switzerland and this is where multi-millionaire Raj enters her life and wants to marry her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5bY3aUkH6fEGjyJAFHaaiSXCT5K.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:369843'),
  ('976351363642849941', 'Hummingbird', 2013, 'Action, Thriller', 'Steven Knight, Chris Menges, Martin Harrison', 'Steven Knight', 'Jason Statham, Agata Buzek, Vicky McClure, Benedict Wong, Ger Ryan, Youssef Kerkour, Anthony Morris, Victoria Bewick', 'R', 'Homeless and on the run from a military court martial, a damaged ex-special forces soldier navigating London''s criminal underworld seizes an opportunity to assume another man''s identity, transforming into an avenging angel in the process.', 'Homeless and on the run from a military court martial, a damaged ex-special forces soldier navigating London''s criminal underworld seizes an opportunity to assume another man''s identity, transforming into an avenging angel in the process.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bN2aGUOxHRwGms68WTDr2MHzkKa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:136418'),
  ('774029741462130400', 'Humongous', 1982, 'Horror', 'Brian R.R. Hebb, Paul Lynch, Carol Spier', 'William Gray', 'Janet Julian, David Wallace, John Wildman, Janit Baldwin, Joy Boushel, Layne Coleman, Shay Garner, Page Fletcher', 'R', 'The monstrous offspring of a violent crime grows up in seclusion on a remote island, where a boatful of hapless teens have shipwrecked, unaware of what''s lurking in the woods.', 'The monstrous offspring of a violent crime grows up in seclusion on a remote island, where a boatful of hapless teens have shipwrecked, unaware of what''s lurking in the woods.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i5JtRqH6RZI1Hn1v0mU9DWKVW6G.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30670'),
  ('574433923661413609', 'Humoresque', 1920, 'Drama', 'Frank Borzage, Gilbert Warrenton', 'William LeBaron, Frances Marion', 'Gaston Glass, Vera Gordon, Alma Rubens, Dore Davidson, Bobby Connelly, Helen Connelly, Ann Wallack, Sidney Carlyle', null, 'Young Leon Kanter dreams of being a great violinist. His parents scrape up the money for a violin and for lessons, and Leon rewards them by becoming a great player. But as an adult, Leon finds that people want more from him than just music.', 'Young Leon Kanter dreams of being a great violinist. His parents scrape up the money for a violin and for lessons, and Leon rewards them by becoming a great player. But as an adult, Leon finds that people want more from him than just music.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/56JT45OHQe3TV7ZD6nK6qcdEbNf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:175319'),
  ('154599180807901681', 'Humoresque', 1947, 'Drama, Romance', 'Leo F. Forbstein, Jean Negulesco, Ernest Haller', 'Zachary Gold, Clifford Odets', 'Joan Crawford, John Garfield, Oscar Levant, J. Carrol Naish, Joan Chandler, Tom D''Andrea, Peggy Knudsen, Ruth Nelson', null, 'A classical musician from a working class background is sidetracked by his love for a wealthy, neurotic socialite.', 'A classical musician from a working class background is sidetracked by his love for a wealthy, neurotic socialite.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tJCIfxap0C7maxpjKtzNrj29dHW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26701'),
  ('693642467903406158', 'Humorous Phases of Funny Faces', 1906, 'Comedy, Animation', 'J. Stuart Blackton', null, 'J. Stuart Blackton', null, 'A cartoonist draws faces and figures on a blackboard - and they come to life.', 'A cartoonist draws faces and figures on a blackboard - and they come to life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8foOxJVSbWzr0p2vBDJN3M6syzT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:134750'),
  ('395834692349067465', 'Humpday', 2009, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Lynn Shelton, Benjamin Kasulke, Jennifer Maas', 'Lynn Shelton', 'Mark Duplass, Joshua Leonard, Alycia Delmore, Lynn Shelton, Trina Willard, Olivia, Stellan Mathiesen, Steven Schardt', 'R', 'Imagine your life is somewhat complete with a house, job, and wife but then your best friend from college comes knocking at your door at 2 AM. During a pot-induced hedonistic party, a plan is hatched between the two friends to create an Art Film of “two really straight men having sex.” If they only knew how much this would affect all of their lives.', 'Imagine your life is somewhat complete with a house, job, and wife but then your best friend from college comes knocking at your door at 2 AM. During a pot-induced hedonistic party, a plan is hatched between the two friends to create an Art Film of “two really straight men having sex.” If they only knew how much this would affect all of their lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y0Fkgopbb3OfslHYkAEiaDONmGl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:23720'),
  ('480912331230660344', 'Humpty Sharma Ki Dulhania', 2014, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Shashank Khaitan, Neha Parti Matiyani', 'Shashank Khaitan', 'Varun Dhawan, Alia Bhatt, Ashutosh Rana, Sidharth Shukla, Aditya Sharma, Deepika Amin, Gaurav Pandey, Sahil Vaid', null, 'A girl from Ambala, Kavya Pratap Singh, is about to be married. When she visits Delhi to shop for her ''dhai lakh ka Ghagra''(wedding dress worth Rs. 2.5 Lakh), she meets Humpty Sharma, a carefree Delhiite, and falls in love with him.', 'A girl from Ambala, Kavya Pratap Singh, is about to be married. When she visits Delhi to shop for her ''dhai lakh ka Ghagra''(wedding dress worth Rs. 2.5 Lakh), she meets Humpty Sharma, a carefree Delhiite, and falls in love with him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kiqZEW6ZmFducXGeikKI5WcQZEI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:276928'),
  ('68561309890040787', 'Humraaz', 2002, 'Action, Romance, Thriller', 'Abbas Alibhai Burmawalla, Mustan Alibhai Burmawalla', 'Shyam Goel, Shiraz Ahmed', 'Bobby Deol, Akshaye Khanna, Ameesha Patel, Suhasini Mulay, Dinesh Hingoo, Johny Lever, Dilip Joshi, Sheela Sharma', null, 'A wealthy industrialist and business man named Raj Singhania lives in Bombay, India. He reaches up with a music band in which Karan Malhotra is the leader and Priya is his right-hand and sweetheart. Karan finds that it is not easy to achieve one''s merit. A contract made between the two for his band to sing on a crusade for Raj. He agrees to do so and later on conspire with his girlfriend Priya to take over Raj vast estate by setting up his girlfriend to marry Raj fakely. On a chance encounter one day Raj and Priya both meet, where by Raj fall head over heals in love with Priya.', 'A wealthy industrialist and business man named Raj Singhania lives in Bombay, India. He reaches up with a music band in which Karan Malhotra is the leader and Priya is his right-hand and sweetheart. Karan finds that it is not easy to achieve one''s merit. A contract made between the two for his band to sing on a crusade for Raj. He agrees to do so and later on conspire with his girlfriend Priya to take over Raj vast estate by setting up his girlfriend to marry Raj fakely. On a chance encounter one day Raj and Priya both meet, where by Raj fall head over heals in love with Priya.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wYHShqkkup1WjTVBiNdRbfWzvki.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:165404'),
  ('944256317583797246', 'Humshakals', 2014, 'Comedy', 'Sajid Khan, Ameet Dhanwani, Siddhartha Banerjee', 'Robin Bhatt, Akarsh Khurana', 'Saif Ali Khan, Riteish Deshmukh, Ram Kapoor, Bipasha Basu, Tamannaah Bhatia, Esha Gupta, Nawab Shah, Satish Shah', null, 'A comedy centered around three people who each have a lookalike of a lookalike, all with the same name.', 'A comedy centered around three people who each have a lookalike of a lookalike, all with the same name.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jl2BKSOuCH5g1a6Yt4FmbOujEe7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:273505'),
  ('216683621855986824', 'Hunan: The Other World of Avatar', 2015, 'Documentary', 'Laurence Thiriat', null, null, null, 'How China''s magical Zhangjiajie National Park attracted director James Cameron, who came seeking inspiration for a mysterious fictional planet.', 'How China''s magical Zhangjiajie National Park attracted director James Cameron, who came seeking inspiration for a mysterious fictional planet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aCwF72gto2ADsQK28j7S9tE4xDa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:829860'),
  ('720192110275961310', 'Hunchback of the Morgue', 1973, 'Horror', 'Javier Aguirre, Raúl Pérez Cubero', 'Javier Aguirre, Alberto S. Insúa, Paul Naschy', 'Paul Naschy, Rosanna Yanni, Víctor Barrera, María Elena Arpón, Manuel de Blas, Antonio Pica, Kino Pueyo, Ángel Menéndez', 'R', 'A hunchback working in a morgue falls in love with a sick woman. He goes berserk when she dies and seeks help from a scientist to bring her back from the dead.', 'A hunchback working in a morgue falls in love with a sick woman. He goes berserk when she dies and seeks help from a scientist to bring her back from the dead.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rhZFmQLYrhzuA9PT6kW9XARUB0G.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28409'),
  ('170136351406269090', 'Hundra', 1983, 'Adventure, Fantasy, Action, Science Fiction', 'Matt Cimber, John Cabrera', 'José Truchado, Matt Cimber, John F. Goff', 'Laurene Landon, Jahangir Ghaffari, María Casal, Luis Lorenzo, Tamara, Victor Gans, Cristina Torres, Bettina Brenner', 'NR', 'Born in a tribe of fierce warrior women, Hundra has been raised to despise the influence of men. An archer, fighter and sword fighter, Hundra is superior to any male. Hundra finds her family slain and takes a vow of revenge until one day she meets her match.', 'Born in a tribe of fierce warrior women, Hundra has been raised to despise the influence of men. An archer, fighter and sword fighter, Hundra is superior to any male. Hundra finds her family slain and takes a vow of revenge until one day she meets her match.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2A1kb3iJel9RZ0X3VJpXAQ4aWzC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48242'),
  ('1076791915313050659', 'Hundred Years', 1999, 'Drama, Music', 'Ninì Grassia, Luigi Ciccarese', 'Ninì Grassia', 'Gigi D''Alessio, Mario Merola, Cristina Parovel, Giorgio Mastrota, Alessandra Monti, George Hilton', null, 'Gigi, an orphan boy adopted by Mario Merola, works as a clerk in a clothing store but cultivates within himself the dream of becoming a famous singer. Gigi is in love with the girlfriend of his employer.', 'Gigi, an orphan boy adopted by Mario Merola, works as a clerk in a clothing store but cultivates within himself the dream of becoming a famous singer. Gigi is in love with the girlfriend of his employer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z80afd8e1OLu6vcxH5eyvrN93Go.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:88991'),
  ('351299460237397034', 'Hundreds of Beavers', 2024, 'Comedy, Adventure, Action', 'Mike Cheslik, Quinn Hester, Erick West', 'Mike Cheslik, Ryland Brickson Cole Tews', 'Ryland Brickson Cole Tews, Olivia Graves, Doug Mancheski, Wes Tank, Luis Rico, Brendan Steere, Jon Truei, Jay Brown', 'NR', 'In the 19th century, a drunken applejack salesman must go from zero to hero and become North America''s greatest fur trapper by defeating hundreds of beavers.', 'In the 19th century, a drunken applejack salesman must go from zero to hero and become North America''s greatest fur trapper by defeating hundreds of beavers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jBg64OA2QEWL0zaOFMoAGipeGjJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1019939'),
  ('1130234236047328170', 'Hungama', 2003, 'Comedy', 'Thyagarajan Master, S. Thirunavukkarasu, Priyadarshan', 'Priyadarshan', 'Akshaye Khanna, Aftab Shivdasani, Rimi Sen, Paresh Rawal, Shoma Anand, Shakti Kapoor, Rajpal Yadav, Tiku Talsania', null, 'A case of mistaken identities featuring a young woman, an electronics business owner and an aspiring musician which leads to chaotic yet hilarious situations.', 'A case of mistaken identities featuring a young woman, an electronics business owner and an aspiring musician which leads to chaotic yet hilarious situations.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oLmPYAufnpoqlkfzyeWWcsVcc0F.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21184'),
  ('291630158618083865', 'Hungama 2', 2021, 'Comedy', 'Ravi Thyagarajan, N K Ekambaram, Priyadarshan', 'Yunus Sajawal', 'Paresh Rawal, Shilpa Shetty Kundra, Meezaan Jafri, Pranitha Subhash, Ashutosh Rana, Tiku Talsania, Rajpal Yadav, Johny Lever', null, 'A farcical comedy involving two families. Kapoors are headed by Colonel, who stays with his younger son, while Tiwaris are a childless couple. The lives of Kapoors and Tiwaris were as neat and perfect until one day a woman shows up at the door with an illegitimate child. Who is the father of this child?', 'A farcical comedy involving two families. Kapoors are headed by Colonel, who stays with his younger son, while Tiwaris are a childless couple. The lives of Kapoors and Tiwaris were as neat and perfect until one day a woman shows up at the door with an illegitimate child. Who is the father of this child?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1cB0Zml2lfsbeGrLo1YoFpu5HdH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:658075'),
  ('642688998683006232', 'Hunger', 1966, 'Drama', 'Henning Carlsen, Henning Kristiansen', 'Henning Carlsen, Peter Seeberg', 'Per Oscarsson, Gunnel Lindblom, Birgitte Federspiel, Knud Rex, Hans W. Petersen, Henki Kolstad, Roy Bjørnstad, Sverre Hansen', null, 'In 1890, Pontus, the starving writer, wanders the streets of Christiania, in search of love and a chance to get his work published. All he meets is defeat and suffering while his sense of reality is withering. One moment he is delighted and the next he curses everybody. All the time he manages to maintain human dignity and pride.', 'In 1890, Pontus, the starving writer, wanders the streets of Christiania, in search of love and a chance to get his work published. All he meets is defeat and suffering while his sense of reality is withering. One moment he is delighted and the next he curses everybody. All the time he manages to maintain human dignity and pride.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yyMiQ6YoxvySq3bjZLh0TaNd5C1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:76235'),
  ('783391387986877761', 'Hunger', 1974, 'Animation', 'Peter Foldès', null, null, null, '16mm. In one of the first films to use computer animation, director Peter Foldès depicts one man’s descent into greed and gluttony. Combining traditional and computer animation (one of the first to use it!), Peter Foldes, through clever metamorphosing images and powerful line drawings, provides a moralistic tale of one man’s enormous appetite and selfish consumerism. Growing more corpulent and repulsive, his indigestion leads to a nightmare where he is consumed in a hell of emaciated bodies. By extension, this film indicts affluent nations and individuals in a world where many starve.', '16mm. In one of the first films to use computer animation, director Peter Foldès depicts one man’s descent into greed and gluttony. Combining traditional and computer animation (one of the first to use it!), Peter Foldes, through clever metamorphosing images and powerful line drawings, provides a moralistic tale of one man’s enormous appetite and selfish consumerism. Growing more corpulent and repulsive, his indigestion leads to a nightmare where he is consumed in a hell of emaciated bodies. By extension, this film indicts affluent nations and individuals in a world where many starve.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9McTS3W9k5CaAj0CzPXNrOz0oRG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:129067'),
  ('68833170603100553', 'Hunger', 2008, 'Drama, History', 'Sean Bobbitt, Steve McQueen, Mark Fenn', 'Enda Walsh, Steve McQueen', 'Michael Fassbender, Stuart Graham, Liam Cunningham, Helena Bereen, Laine Megaw, Brian Milligan, Liam McMahon, Karen Hassan', 'NR', 'The story of Bobby Sands, the IRA member who led the 1981 hunger strike during The Troubles in which Irish Republican prisoners tried to win political status.', 'The story of Bobby Sands, the IRA member who led the 1981 hunger strike during The Troubles in which Irish Republican prisoners tried to win political status.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/84HdTM39G2MzyTl8N9R0wVU9I5b.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10360'),
  ('264743418114500587', 'Hunger', 2009, 'Horror', 'Steven Hentges, John Sawyer', 'L.D. Goffigan', 'Lori Heuring, Linden Ashby, Joe Egender, Lea Kohl, Julian Rojas, Bjorn Johnson, Britton Partain, Laura Albyn', 'R', 'Five strangers face the unthinkable when they wake up and find themselves trapped. With no idea how they got there they frantically try to figure out how to escape. The disoriented group quickly realise the truth about their situation when they discover another room containing enough water to survive for 30 days… and a razor sharp surgical knife. The intention becomes quite clear. Whoever put them in this place wants to see just how long it will take before the hunger makes them commit unspeakable acts and cross a very deadly line.', 'Five strangers face the unthinkable when they wake up and find themselves trapped. With no idea how they got there they frantically try to figure out how to escape. The disoriented group quickly realise the truth about their situation when they discover another room containing enough water to survive for 30 days… and a razor sharp surgical knife. The intention becomes quite clear. Whoever put them in this place wants to see just how long it will take before the hunger makes them commit unspeakable acts and cross a very deadly line.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c90ogtGY5k90D38ynTUBu3KWWMp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:173672'),
  ('87824268270712465', 'Hunger', 2023, 'Drama', 'Sitisiri Mongkolsiri, T-Thawat Taifayongvichit, Surasak Wongthai', 'Kongdej Jaturanrasmee', 'Chutimon Chuengcharoensukying, Nopachai Jayanama, Gunn Svasti, Bhumibhat Thavornsiri, Varit Hongsananda, Prachan Vong-uthaiphan, Ratchawat Vichianrat, Pattarawit Junthai', 'R', 'A talented young street-food cook pushes herself to the limit after accepting an invitation to train under an infamous and ruthless chef.', 'A talented young street-food cook pushes herself to the limit after accepting an invitation to train under an infamous and ruthless chef.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rNYHsKHFP3AY2PIDZgz3AuY7QoC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1071806'),
  ('856874863579845871', 'Hunger for Love', 1968, 'Drama', 'Nelson Pereira dos Santos, Dib Lutfi', 'Nelson Pereira dos Santos', 'Leila Diniz, Arduíno Colassanti, Irene Stefânia, Paulo Porto, Manfredo Colassanti, Neville D''Almeida, Lia Rossi, Olga Danitch', null, 'An extended research tour of US university film programs introduced dos Santos to the American avant-garde filmmakers, among them Jonas Mekas and Stan Brakhage, who would directly inspire his formally radical adaptation of an allegorical short story about adultery and colonialism by Guilherme de Figueiredo. Filmed in both Manhattan and Brazil and set against the background of the Vietnam War and its protests, Hunger for Love uses a rigorously abstract soundtrack and narrative structure to evoke the acute paranoia of the period building up to the December 1968 military coup that tipped Brazil perilously close to a conservative dictatorship. With its harsh critique of the decadent tendencies of the Sixties counterculture, Hunger for Love offers a key expression of the self-consciously “ideological” phase of Cinema Novo. -Harvard Film Archive', 'An extended research tour of US university film programs introduced dos Santos to the American avant-garde filmmakers, among them Jonas Mekas and Stan Brakhage, who would directly inspire his formally radical adaptation of an allegorical short story about adultery and colonialism by Guilherme de Figueiredo. Filmed in both Manhattan and Brazil and set against the background of the Vietnam War and its protests, Hunger for Love uses a rigorously abstract soundtrack and narrative structure to evoke the acute paranoia of the period building up to the December 1968 military coup that tipped Brazil perilously close to a conservative dictatorship. With its harsh critique of the decadent tendencies of the Sixties counterculture, Hunger for Love offers a key expression of the self-consciously “ideological” phase of Cinema Novo. -Harvard Film Archive', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3hUB8DmVijVUIXng6HwzHB4DzIM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:147872'),
  ('606900418672419768', 'Hungerford', 2014, 'Action, Horror, Science Fiction', 'Drew Casson', 'Jess Cleverly, Drew Casson', 'Georgia Bradley, Sam Carter, Drew Casson, Mark Cusack, James Haslam, Matthew Jackson, Lee Kelly, Nigel Morgan', null, 'The lives of a group of teenagers are turned upside down when their town is taken over by sinister forces.', 'The lives of a group of teenagers are turned upside down when their town is taken over by sinister forces.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hmSXjAbZ0rbXTnk3dHQFKfq3x7L.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:268229'),
  ('251058275771004104', 'Hungry Hearts', 2015, 'Drama', 'Inna Braude, Anne Marie Dentici, Andreas O''Donohue Villaggio', 'Saverio Costanzo', 'Adam Driver, Alba Rohrwacher, Roberta Maxwell, Brandon Reiss, Joshua Reiss, Jake Weber, Victoria Cartagena, Al Roffe', null, 'The relationship of a couple who meet by chance in New York City is put to the test when they encounter a life or death circumstance.', 'The relationship of a couple who meet by chance in New York City is put to the test when they encounter a life or death circumstance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pSLlzA8bJWaLjrm7F7IAhJiHNVi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:283698'),
  ('1117296063527179270', 'Hungry Wives', 1972, 'Horror, Drama', 'George A. Romero, George A. Romero', 'George A. Romero', 'Jan White, Raymond Laine, Ann Muffly, Joedda McClain, Bill Thunhurst, Neil Fisher, S. William Hinzman, Esther Lapidus', 'R', 'An unhappy suburban housewife gets mixed up in witchcraft with unexpected consequences.', 'An unhappy suburban housewife gets mixed up in witchcraft with unexpected consequences.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hhBfST0YjRpTrLbB6XH0HXoXmkA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29424'),
  ('1058850442543150979', 'Hunk', 1987, 'Fantasy, Comedy', 'Lawrence Bassoff, R.B. Graham, Coni Lancaster', 'Lawrence Bassoff', 'John Allen Nelson, Steve Levitt, Rebeccah Bush, Robert Morse, Avery Schreiber, Deborah Shelton, James Coco, Cynthia Szigeti', 'PG', 'A "devilish" tale about an ordinary guy who is visited by a beautiful apparition promising him popularity and drop-dead good looks in exchange for his soul. Transformed overnight into a "hunk," he soon discovers there may be hell to pay for his new lifestyle!', 'A "devilish" tale about an ordinary guy who is visited by a beautiful apparition promising him popularity and drop-dead good looks in exchange for his soul. Transformed overnight into a "hunk," he soon discovers there may be hell to pay for his new lifestyle!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3a6kcPgxU7yTxEJ0MZoYqzJ2FOa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32227'),
  ('490646176743827381', 'HUNKS vs. The Hurricanes', 2026, 'Documentary', 'Aaron White', null, 'Denis Philips, Jane Castor, Nick Friedman, Omar Soliman, Mario Martinez', null, 'When Tampa was struck by back to back hurricanes, local teams like College Hunks stepped up in a major way. Clearing debris, delivering supplies, and helping rebuild lives. What started with a single call from Mayor Jane Castor became a citywide movement powered by compassion and hustle. This film is more than a disaster response doc, it’s a tribute to the strength of Tampa and the people who refused to back down.', 'When Tampa was struck by back to back hurricanes, local teams like College Hunks stepped up in a major way. Clearing debris, delivering supplies, and helping rebuild lives. What started with a single call from Mayor Jane Castor became a citywide movement powered by compassion and hustle. This film is more than a disaster response doc, it’s a tribute to the strength of Tampa and the people who refused to back down.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6DfcA1a4KSnXdJwfF5P4x6i5CLc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1662754'),
  ('334259625160945732', 'Hunky and Spunky', 1938, 'Animation', 'Dave Fleischer', null, 'Jack Mercer', null, 'A short film about a mother and her son, she teaches him life skills later on the son gets niked by a man so the young donkey can be his work slave and his mother saves him. Preserved by the Academy Film Archive in partnership with the UCLA Film and Television Archive in 2013.', 'A short film about a mother and her son, she teaches him life skills later on the son gets niked by a man so the young donkey can be his work slave and his mother saves him. Preserved by the Academy Film Archive in partnership with the UCLA Film and Television Archive in 2013.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qNrLgwd5oYghpOHGkDRO6EqQyON.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:235653'),
  ('694011063088950139', 'Hunt', 2022, 'Action, Mystery, Drama', 'Lee Mo-gae, Lee Seong-hwan, Park Sin-woong', 'Lee Jung-jae, Jo Seung-hee', 'Lee Jung-jae, Jung Woo-sung, Jeon Hye-jin, Heo Sung-tae, Go Youn-jung, Kim Jong-soo, Jeong Man-sik, Lim Hyung-kook', null, 'After a high-ranking North Korean official requests asylum, KCIA Foreign Unit chief Park Pyong-ho and Domestic Unit chief Kim Jung-do are tasked with uncovering a North Korean spy, known as Donglim, who is deeply embedded within their agency. When the spy begins leaking top secret intel that could jeopardize national security, the two units are each assigned to investigate each other.', 'After a high-ranking North Korean official requests asylum, KCIA Foreign Unit chief Park Pyong-ho and Domestic Unit chief Kim Jung-do are tasked with uncovering a North Korean spy, known as Donglim, who is deeply embedded within their agency. When the spy begins leaking top secret intel that could jeopardize national security, the two units are each assigned to investigate each other.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tDe5eLxAbeK7sYckUn5aH3ngWnn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:727340'),
  ('304368299258324106', 'Hunt Club', 2023, 'Action, Thriller, Horror', 'Elizabeth Blake-Thomas, Abbie Georganna, Duncan Johnson', 'John Saunders, David Lipper', 'Mena Suvari, Casper Van Dien, Maya Stojan, Will Peltz, Mickey Rourke, Kipp Tribble, Jessica Belkin, Jason London', null, 'Follows a group of male hunters who regularly lure women to their island with the chance to win 100K in a hunt, only to discover that they are the hunted, but this time they mess with the wrong girls and must deal with the consequences.', 'Follows a group of male hunters who regularly lure women to their island with the chance to win 100K in a hunt, only to discover that they are the hunted, but this time they mess with the wrong girls and must deal with the consequences.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qmMazCTqdQNaqeCVeKysT6I3uz4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1064178'),
  ('553014151181311960', 'Hunt Her, Kill Her', 2023, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Greg Swinson, Ryan Thiessen', 'Greg Swinson', 'Natalie Terrazzino, JC Oakley III, Larry Bunton, Philip Zimny, Olivia Graves, Georgia Kate Haege, Reece Griffin', null, 'A desperate young mother, Karen, takes a job as the night shift janitor at a large furniture factory. She is told that she is the only one working at this time. But, after seeing a strange vehicle idling in the parking lot and finding a door to the factory ajar, she gets the feeling she might not be alone after all.', 'A desperate young mother, Karen, takes a job as the night shift janitor at a large furniture factory. She is told that she is the only one working at this time. But, after seeing a strange vehicle idling in the parking lot and finding a door to the factory ajar, she gets the feeling she might not be alone after all.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m3M6en7aLaNotQAHrwyKXwmtZSN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:989872'),
  ('38737893097346317', 'Hunt the Man Down', 1950, 'Mystery, Crime', 'George Archainbaud, Nicholas Musuraca', 'DeVallon Scott', 'Gig Young, Lynne Roberts, Mary Anderson, Willard Parker, Carla Balenda, Gerald Mohr, James Anderson, John Kellogg', 'NR', 'A lawyer uncovers secrets behind a 12-year-old murder case.', 'A lawyer uncovers secrets behind a 12-year-old murder case.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7LwYP3brAdkXT0XXLnK8fYq6hpW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:65991'),
  ('19459712962564991', 'Hunt the Wicked', 2024, 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 'Chris Huo Suiqiang, Ma Erkang', 'Ma Lao', 'Xie Miao, Andy On Chi-Kit, Andrew Lin Hoi, Hong Shuang, Gu Jing, Anson Leung Chun-Yat, Han Rui, Liu Sasa', null, 'The film tells the story of narcotics police officer Huang Mingjin and the "mysterious figure" Wei Yunzhou. Through completely different means and methods, in the process of calculating and wrestling with each other, they tear apart the facade of urban tranquility, exposing the underground drug network woven by the hidden hand "Long Wang", and ultimately eradicate the darkness with the sword of justice, revealing the dawn of light.', 'The film tells the story of narcotics police officer Huang Mingjin and the "mysterious figure" Wei Yunzhou. Through completely different means and methods, in the process of calculating and wrestling with each other, they tear apart the facade of urban tranquility, exposing the underground drug network woven by the hidden hand "Long Wang", and ultimately eradicate the darkness with the sword of justice, revealing the dawn of light.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m5UBHbEjQJx3AkRZWRY6A4l4ZDT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1240475'),
  ('604350093582266796', 'Hunt to Kill', 2010, 'Action, Adventure, Thriller', 'Keoni Waxman, C. Kim Miles, Thomas M. Harting', 'Frank Hannah', 'Steve Austin, Eric Roberts, Emilie Ullerup, Marie Avgeropoulos, Gil Bellows, Gary Daniels, Brent Stait, Michael Eklund', 'R', 'U.S. Border Patrol agent Jim Rhodes is a tough divorcée mourning the loss of his murdered partner while struggling to raise his rebellious daughter in the mountains of Montana. But when a crew of trigger-happy fugitives takes Rhodes and his daughter hostage, the rugged wilderness will explode in all-terrain vengeance. Is there any wounded animal more dangerous than a lawman left for dead?', 'U.S. Border Patrol agent Jim Rhodes is a tough divorcée mourning the loss of his murdered partner while struggling to raise his rebellious daughter in the mountains of Montana. But when a crew of trigger-happy fugitives takes Rhodes and his daughter hostage, the rugged wilderness will explode in all-terrain vengeance. Is there any wounded animal more dangerous than a lawman left for dead?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7o8O0Cfi8S5XHZfwfSQ0c2mH0uM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46713'),
