  ('1108671208722972931', 'Hunted', 2021, 'Action, Horror, Thriller', 'Vincent Paronnaud, David Janssens, Barney Roberts', 'Léa Pernollet, Vincent Paronnaud', 'Lucie Debay, Arieh Worthalter, Ciaran O''Brien, Ryan Brodie, Simone Milsdochter, Gilles Vandeweerd, Christian Bronchart, Jean-Mathias Pondant', null, 'A woman flees two serial killers who are hot on her heels in a forest.', 'A woman flees two serial killers who are hot on her heels in a forest.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ytCQyuhipANedA1to4EKAOv10xv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:660335'),
  ('1012979589258686787', 'Hunter × Hunter Pilot', 1998, 'Animation, Action, Adventure, Fantasy', 'Masaya Onishi, Noriyuki Abe', 'Hiroshi Hashimoto', 'Rica Matsumoto, Noriko Hidaka, Nobutoshi Canna, Shigeru Nakahara, Akemi Okamura, Kenji Utsumi, Shizuka Okohira', null, 'The stand-alone pilot OVA which was shown as part of the "Jump Super Anime Tour" of 1998. Shortly before the TV series, a summary is presented of the story of Gon who wants to become a hunter and the friends he makes in the process.', 'The stand-alone pilot OVA which was shown as part of the "Jump Super Anime Tour" of 1998. Shortly before the TV series, a summary is presented of the story of Gon who wants to become a hunter and the friends he makes in the process.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Aw4XNtFlLS3DbirjjG7gycBUQLv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:583315'),
  ('8650932044076327', 'Hunter Hunter', 2020, 'Horror, Thriller, Mystery', 'Ryan Cooper, Roman Buchok, Shawn Linden', 'Shawn Linden', 'Camille Sullivan, Summer H. Howell, Devon Sawa, Nick Stahl, Gabriel Daniels, Lauren Cochrane, Jade Michael, Erik Athavale', 'NR', 'A fur trapper leaves his wife and daughter behind to kill a rogue wolf in the remote wilderness, but they soon become increasingly worried when their peaceful existence is disrupted.', 'A fur trapper leaves his wife and daughter behind to kill a rogue wolf in the remote wilderness, but they soon become increasingly worried when their peaceful existence is disrupted.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/j52lKBGoHGmUJNUMsDV5kHOkMfC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:759902'),
  ('327784267275886545', 'Hunter in the Dark', 1979, 'Action, Adventure, Drama, Crime', 'Hideo Gosha, Tadashi Sakai', 'Kaneo Ikegami', 'Tatsuya Nakadai, Keiko Kishi, Ayumi Ishida, Makoto Fujita, Isao Natsuyagi, Kayo Matsuo, Ai Kanzaki, Tatsuo Umemiya', null, 'Yataro Tanigawa, a one-eyed hired assassin, impresses yakuza boss Gomyo Kiyoemon with his skill. Gomyo hires Tanigawa as his bodyguard, or yojimbo, to protect him during an inter-clan conflict. Tanigawa quickly rises in stature in the clan, but finds his boss''s enemies almost overwhelming.', 'Yataro Tanigawa, a one-eyed hired assassin, impresses yakuza boss Gomyo Kiyoemon with his skill. Gomyo hires Tanigawa as his bodyguard, or yojimbo, to protect him during an inter-clan conflict. Tanigawa quickly rises in stature in the clan, but finds his boss''s enemies almost overwhelming.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9IGnWLi94THXKUHodkzVe0uUzvw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:63411'),
  ('194085587719580900', 'Hunter Killer', 2018, 'Action, Adventure, Thriller', 'Donovan Marsh, Stanimir Stamatov, Tom Marais', 'Jamie Moss, Arne Schmidt', 'Gerard Butler, Gary Oldman, Toby Stephens, Common, Linda Cardellini, David Gyasi, Gabriel Chavarria, Ryan McPartlin', 'R', 'Captain Glass of the USS Arkansas discovers that a coup d''état is taking place in Russia, so he and his crew join an elite group working on the ground to prevent a war.', 'Captain Glass of the USS Arkansas discovers that a coup d''état is taking place in Russia, so he and his crew join an elite group working on the ground to prevent a war.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ng7ukqGaSHOuJZ4GwLJP6AH9ixc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:399402'),
  ('546640533738607300', 'Hunter Prey', 2010, 'Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Sandy Collora', 'Nick Damon, Sandy Collora', 'Isaac C. Singleton, Jr., Clark Bartram, Damion Poitier, Simon Potter, Erin Gray', null, 'The Prometheus has dropped out of orbit. Communications and life support systems are down. Situation Critical: Status of Crew and Prisoner unknown. With orders to catch their Alien Prisoner alive the surviving crew of the spaceship Prometheus pursue a dangerous game of cat-and-mouse with their escaped prisoner on a deserted and barren planet. But, who is the hunter and who is its prey?', 'The Prometheus has dropped out of orbit. Communications and life support systems are down. Situation Critical: Status of Crew and Prisoner unknown. With orders to catch their Alien Prisoner alive the surviving crew of the spaceship Prometheus pursue a dangerous game of cat-and-mouse with their escaped prisoner on a deserted and barren planet. But, who is the hunter and who is its prey?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5kv2w3ZjXQx5MEMdn3cBfRuLAca.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41360'),
  ('1021915572400957528', 'Hunter Will Get You', 1976, 'Action, Crime, Thriller', 'Philippe Labro, Jean Penzer', 'Philippe Labro, Jacques Lanzmann', 'Jean-Paul Belmondo, Bruno Cremer, Jean Négroni, Patrick Fierry, Jean-Pierre Jorris, Victor Garrivier, Claude Brosset, Marcel Imhoff', null, 'L''Alpagueur is a free-lance spy from the French secret agency. He''s put on the investigation about L''epervier, a serial-killer who employs young boys to help him robbing banks before killing them.', 'L''Alpagueur is a free-lance spy from the French secret agency. He''s put on the investigation about L''epervier, a serial-killer who employs young boys to help him robbing banks before killing them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2JmSWZVcK9gQAbIY5ni53oCvkp1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11512'),
  ('1019274695742781288', 'Hunter x Hunter: Phantom Rouge', 2013, 'Animation, Adventure, Fantasy, Action', 'Shigeki Asakawa, Yuzo Sato', 'Yuzo Sato', 'Megumi Han, Mariya Ise, Miyuki Sawashiro, Keiji Fujiwara, Mamoru Miyano, Aya Hirano, Umika Kawashima, Daisuke Namikawa', 'PG-13', 'One day, Kurapika spots a child who looks very similar to his childhood friend, Pyro. However, when he catches up to him, the boy steals Kurapika''s eyes with some kind of magical power. Gon, Leorio, and Killua promise to help find who took his eyes and get them back, but Killua is having his own problems when he is forced to face his past and whether he really is worthy to have Gon as a friend.', 'One day, Kurapika spots a child who looks very similar to his childhood friend, Pyro. However, when he catches up to him, the boy steals Kurapika''s eyes with some kind of magical power. Gon, Leorio, and Killua promise to help find who took his eyes and get them back, but Killua is having his own problems when he is forced to face his past and whether he really is worthy to have Gon as a friend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tBbr1LJn5rrP08Y16jJAKwLEECf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:211755'),
  ('640658307796634799', 'Hunter x Hunter: The Last Mission', 2013, 'Adventure, Animation, Action, Fantasy', 'Chiaki Yamada, Tamaki Nakatsu, Keiichiro Kawaguchi', 'Nobuaki Kishima', 'Megumi Han, Ichiro Nagai, Mariya Ise, Miyuki Sawashiro, Keiji Fujiwara, Ichitaro Ai, Kotono Mitsuishi, Ryuuzaburou Ootomo', 'PG-13', 'Isaac Netero is the chairman of the Hunter Association. Decades ago he sealed away Jed, a Hunter who had mastered the use of On, the dark "shadow" of Nen. Now On users have reappeared at the Heaven''s Arena "Battle Olympia" tournament. For Netero, this is the last mission: to protect the Association and the world from a threat driven by hatred and the thirst for revenge. And he''s going to need all the help he can get in order to succeed.', 'Isaac Netero is the chairman of the Hunter Association. Decades ago he sealed away Jed, a Hunter who had mastered the use of On, the dark "shadow" of Nen. Now On users have reappeared at the Heaven''s Arena "Battle Olympia" tournament. For Netero, this is the last mission: to protect the Association and the world from a threat driven by hatred and the thirst for revenge. And he''s going to need all the help he can get in order to succeed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zbmRzkxKeDjoYh5757d7RXiX2by.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:239523'),
  ('379308170698890990', 'Hunter''s Blood', 1986, 'Horror, Action, Thriller', 'Robert C. Hughes, Richard Kanter', 'Emmett Alston', 'Sam Bottoms, Kim Delaney, Clu Gulager, Ken Swofford, Joey Travolta, Mayf Nutter, Lee de Broux, Bruce Glover', null, 'Five "city boys" travel to the country to relax by doing some hunting, drinking Bud, and generally having good time. However, the local inbred backwoods psychos turn the hunters to be the hunted, and they need all the ammo and wits they have to get out of the woods alive.', 'Five "city boys" travel to the country to relax by doing some hunting, drinking Bud, and generally having good time. However, the local inbred backwoods psychos turn the hunters to be the hunted, and they need all the ammo and wits they have to get out of the woods alive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kXKlUWNYKOyonascvi3F31Mw5Vc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:39932'),
  ('757516287439595003', 'Hunter''s Moon', 2020, 'Thriller, Horror, Crime', 'Michael Caissie, Ben Kufrin, Edd Lukas', 'Michael Caissie', 'Thomas Jane, Jay Mohr, Sean Patrick Flanery, Katrina Bowden, Amanda Wyss, India Ennenga, Spencer Daniels, Will Carlson', 'R', 'A trio of young sisters are attacked by local thugs. Then a force inhabiting the orchard exacts its revenge.', 'A trio of young sisters are attacked by local thugs. Then a force inhabiting the orchard exacts its revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pgsqkck2iPtyTSeZ6JVs5EMEaCK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:458673'),
  ('665902472102033610', 'Hunterrr', 2015, 'Drama, Romance', 'Harshavardhan Kulkarni, John Jacob Payyapalli, Prateek Vats', null, 'Gulshan Devaiah, Radhika Apte, Sai Tamhankar, Sagar Deshmukh, Vaibhav Tatwawadi, Suraj Jagan, Kiran Khoje', null, 'An ordinary bachelor pursues girls like a hunter, but not with the intention of settling down in life.', 'An ordinary bachelor pursues girls like a hunter, but not with the intention of settling down in life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2NEEd6vpnLjPP2LaiT4WDcMvxZ9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:325892'),
  ('28776927445101447', 'Hunters', 2021, 'Action', 'Justin Lee, Eamon Long', 'Justin Lee', 'Phil Burke, Ed Morrone, Ian Ziering, Sanford Worth, Nicole Craner, Brandon Thompson, Eamon Long, Samantha Kuester', null, 'As John T. Wrecker continues his task of protecting a group of refugees from a virus, the threat of something new and even more dangerous grows ever closer in the form of monstrous mutants.', 'As John T. Wrecker continues his task of protecting a group of refugees from a virus, the threat of something new and even more dangerous grows ever closer in the form of monstrous mutants.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3UKlVa1CBeQkRksHV5OfFTO52qd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:873972'),
  ('1102632829205765630', 'Hunting & Gathering', 2007, 'Romance, Drama', 'Agnès Godard, Claude Berri', 'Claude Berri', 'Audrey Tautou, Guillaume Canet, Laurent Stocker, Françoise Bertin, Danièle Lebrun, Marie-France Mignal, Bernard Dhéran, Firmine Richard', null, 'When Camille falls ill, she is forced to live with Philibert and Franck.', 'When Camille falls ill, she is forced to live with Philibert and Franck.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dNgTyFxp84SWeOkgdWeZDiXsADG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2882'),
  ('583723144464007804', 'Hunting Ava Bravo', 2022, 'Thriller, Action', 'Mercedes Williamson, Gary Auerbach', 'Julie Auerbach, Kevin Tavolaro', 'Kate del Castillo, Marc Blucas, Julio Lazarte, Halem Medina, Bryce Fernelius', null, 'Billionaire sportsman Buddy King unwinds by hunting human captives on his remote mountain estate. But his latest victim, Ava Bravo, is no easy target.', 'Billionaire sportsman Buddy King unwinds by hunting human captives on his remote mountain estate. But his latest victim, Ava Bravo, is no easy target.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/etc6HKBEhNySNnYU2nRgbSeIyoW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:927341'),
  ('1099180721292257944', 'Hunting Daze', 2024, 'Mystery, Thriller, Drama', 'Annick Blanc, Vincent Gonneville, Catherine Kirouac', 'Annick Blanc', 'Nahéma Ricci, Bruno Marcil, Frédéric Millaire-Zouvi, Marc Beaupré, Alexandre Landry, Maxime Genois, Noubi Ndiaye, Mattis Savard-Verhoeven', null, 'Nina, a young and headstrong exotic dancer, finds herself stranded in the far North. She convinces her recent customers, five men on a bachelor hunting trip, to put her up for a few days. In this masculine microsociety, by turns hilarious and philosophical, Cynthia starts to feel a sense of belonging she never has before. But a mysterious stranger’s arrival changes the course of this improvised holiday forever. Both raw and dreamlike, Hunting Daze offers up a unique universe where humour, horror, the uncanny, and the sensual combine.', 'Nina, a young and headstrong exotic dancer, finds herself stranded in the far North. She convinces her recent customers, five men on a bachelor hunting trip, to put her up for a few days. In this masculine microsociety, by turns hilarious and philosophical, Cynthia starts to feel a sense of belonging she never has before. But a mysterious stranger’s arrival changes the course of this improvised holiday forever. Both raw and dreamlike, Hunting Daze offers up a unique universe where humour, horror, the uncanny, and the sensual combine.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lKsegvN2Xc1XCI1V7QoKWsEO9LZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1184233'),
  ('1056707908543254817', 'Hunting Down the Nazis', 2007, 'Documentary, History, War, TV Movie', 'Isabelle Clarke, Daniel Costelle', 'Isabelle Clarke, Daniel Costelle', 'Mathieu Kassovitz, Simon Wiesenthal, Serge Klarsfeld, Beate Klarsfeld', null, 'For the first time, a film recounts the story of the long pursuit of Nazis in hiding from 1945 to the present day. Sixty years of investigations, set-backs trials and dramas, brought about principally by three extraordinary individuals—the Austrian Simon Wiesenthal, and the German-French couple, Beate and Serge Klarsfeld.', 'For the first time, a film recounts the story of the long pursuit of Nazis in hiding from 1945 to the present day. Sixty years of investigations, set-backs trials and dramas, brought about principally by three extraordinary individuals—the Austrian Simon Wiesenthal, and the German-French couple, Beate and Serge Klarsfeld.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4R9A41Dd5Q99Z4GtIvsWrW1IcZR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:79492'),
  ('725392392666409212', 'Hunting Emma', 2017, 'Thriller, Action', 'Byron Davis, William Collinson', 'Deon Meyer', 'Leandie du Randt, Neels Van Jaarsveld, Tim Theron, Bouwer Bosch, Luan Jacobs, Tertius Meintjes, Albert Maritz, Danie Putter', null, 'Emma le Roux just wants to go home for the holidays. Gentle, beautiful, pacifist Emma. She''s made the trip to her father''s farm a thousand times. Piece of cake. But not today. Today she will cross paths with members of a violent drug syndicate. Everything starts falling apart, and fast. At first they were driven by hate and revenge. Suddenly, it''s survival.', 'Emma le Roux just wants to go home for the holidays. Gentle, beautiful, pacifist Emma. She''s made the trip to her father''s farm a thousand times. Piece of cake. But not today. Today she will cross paths with members of a violent drug syndicate. Everything starts falling apart, and fast. At first they were driven by hate and revenge. Suddenly, it''s survival.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sPPOiZbyIOgx2jZegAPk447k64g.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:444608'),
  ('460834573746370651', 'Hunting Flies', 1969, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Zygmunt Samosiuk, Daniel Olbrychski, Stanisław Wohl', 'Janusz Głowacki', 'Zygmunt Malanowicz, Małgorzata Braunek, Hanna Skarżanka, Ewa Skarżanka, Józef Pieracki, Daniel Olbrychski, Irena Dziedzic, Leszek Drogosz', null, 'Włodek is a middle-aged man stuck in a dead-end job at the local library who lives with his harridan wife and critical in-laws in a small apartment. When Włodek draws the interest of a library patron, the beautiful young woman encourages him to strive for better things in his life and professional career. Together, the two take off for a three-day affair, but surprises could await Włodek upon his return home.', 'Włodek is a middle-aged man stuck in a dead-end job at the local library who lives with his harridan wife and critical in-laws in a small apartment. When Włodek draws the interest of a library patron, the beautiful young woman encourages him to strive for better things in his life and professional career. Together, the two take off for a three-day affair, but surprises could await Włodek upon his return home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3PHJj56FnuMvhTg0L1dAMUFqwCC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:198669'),
