  ('451136259384472171', 'Husband Factor', 2015, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Kıvanç Baruönü, Efe Mehmet Özbay, Merve Kuzeyli', 'Şebnem Burcuoğlu', 'Ezgi Mola, Murat Yildirim, Nevra Serezli, Gülenay Kalkan, Ebru Cündübeyoğlu, Eda Ece, Begüm Öner, Gül Arici', null, 'A traditional Turkish woman tries to find love and is forced by her family members to get married.', 'A traditional Turkish woman tries to find love and is forced by her family members to get married.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oNVxifvq27gXnN2agCDZePTp1Ay.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:332788'),
  ('958243642345795310', 'Husband Factor: Resurrection', 2016, 'Comedy', 'Kıvanç Baruönü', 'Kıvanç Baruönü, Utku Gürtunca, Şebnem Burcuoğlu', 'Ezgi Mola, Murat Yildirim, Nevra Serezli, Hümeyra, Gülenay Kalkan, Nilgün Kasapbaşoğlu, İsmail İncekara, Hakan Salınmış', null, 'A girl tries to manage the demands of her traditional family''s wishes and her own as she embarks on a journey to marry the love of her life.', 'A girl tries to manage the demands of her traditional family''s wishes and her own as she embarks on a journey to marry the love of her life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uIA4o67iG0aeC2Hqy98IEfkTTZi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:376436'),
  ('539319363357905693', 'Husbands', 1970, 'Comedy, Drama', 'John Cassavetes, Philip Mead, Alan Hopkins', 'John Cassavetes', 'Ben Gazzara, Peter Falk, John Cassavetes, Jenny Runacre, Jenny Lee Wright, Noelle Kao, John Kullers, Meta Shaw Stevens', 'PG-13', 'A common friend''s sudden death brings three men, married with children, to reconsider their lives and ultimately leave the country together. But mindless enthusiasm for regained freedom will be short-lived.', 'A common friend''s sudden death brings three men, married with children, to reconsider their lives and ultimately leave the country together. But mindless enthusiasm for regained freedom will be short-lived.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/482OpzSoSeAVx7KDJlWupLNIf0r.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52105'),
  ('327120349686276874', 'Husbands and Lovers', 1991, 'Drama', 'Mauro Bolognini, Andrea Bolognini, Giuseppe Lanci', 'Sergio Bazzini', 'Julian Sands, Joanna Pacula, Tchéky Karyo, Lara Wendel, Marco Di Stefano, Jeanne Valérie, Ines Nobili, Sonia Topazio', 'R', 'Stefan finds that he can no longer tolerate the arrangement of his cheating wife ... he, the husband, gets her during the week and her lover gets her on the weekends. At the same time the wife finds herself increasingly drawn to the violence of her lover versus the adoration of her husband.', 'Stefan finds that he can no longer tolerate the arrangement of his cheating wife ... he, the husband, gets her during the week and her lover gets her on the weekends. At the same time the wife finds herself increasingly drawn to the violence of her lover versus the adoration of her husband.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zFvUXQ0QcILwPyoUqqcv6pwpuuT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:91258'),
  ('136198859769541069', 'Husbands and Wives', 1992, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Carlo Di Palma, Woody Allen, Richard Patrick', 'Woody Allen', 'Woody Allen, Mia Farrow, Judy Davis, Sydney Pollack, Juliette Lewis, Liam Neeson, Lysette Anthony, Cristi Conaway', 'R', 'When their best friends announce that they''re separating, a professor and his wife discover the faults in their own marriage.', 'When their best friends announce that they''re separating, a professor and his wife discover the faults in their own marriage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mb6Hmns0PP2Me9TYpLE9M3GHt7v.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28384'),
  ('790242885181705967', 'Hush', 1998, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Jonathan Darby, Andrew Dunn', 'Jonathan Darby, Jane Rusconi', 'Jessica Lange, Gwyneth Paltrow, Johnathon Schaech, Nina Foch, Debi Mazar, Kaiulani Lee, David Thornton, Hal Holbrook', 'PG-13', 'Jackson and Helen are in love and about to have their first child when they move in with Jackson''s mother, Martha, in order to take care of the family estate. But all is not well in this household. Martha is jealous of her son''s affection for Helen, and, despite her Southern smile, she''s starting to act strangely. As Helen tries to create a happy home life, Martha attempts to divide the family so that Jackson will become hers alone.', 'Jackson and Helen are in love and about to have their first child when they move in with Jackson''s mother, Martha, in order to take care of the family estate. But all is not well in this household. Martha is jealous of her son''s affection for Helen, and, despite her Southern smile, she''s starting to act strangely. As Helen tries to create a happy home life, Martha attempts to divide the family so that Jackson will become hers alone.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/muUx7SqlYE9kb1W4xzK7AaJueeN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17941'),
  ('492112698834217414', 'Hush', 2008, 'Thriller, Horror, Action', 'Mark Tonderai', 'Mark Tonderai', 'William Ash, Christine Bottomley, Andreas Wisniewski, Claire Keelan, Stuart McQuarrie, Robbie Gee, Peter Wyatt, Sheila Reid', null, 'A young couple on a motorway journey are drawn into a game of cat and mouse with a truck driver when they see something disturbing in the back of his vehicle.', 'A young couple on a motorway journey are drawn into a game of cat and mouse with a truck driver when they see something disturbing in the back of his vehicle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lJH4yVlQuMwqgZM6UOTVzfqFSp4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20034'),
  ('1077471929691117749', 'Hush', 2016, 'Horror, Thriller', 'James Grayford, Rico Savage, Mike Flanagan', 'Mike Flanagan, Kate Siegel', 'John Gallagher Jr., Kate Siegel, Michael Trucco, Samantha Sloyan, Emma Graves', 'R', 'A deaf woman is stalked by a psychotic killer in her secluded home.', 'A deaf woman is stalked by a psychotic killer in her secluded home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zHzBTd502IZf60x8n2g0TB01vPF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:376570'),
  ('652149641471228437', 'Hush Hush Baby', 2004, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Albert Ter Heerdt', 'Albert Ter Heerdt', 'Mimoun Oaïssa, Salah Eddine Benmoussa, Zohra ''Flifla'' Slimani, Najib Amhali, Iliass Ojja, Tanja Jess, Frank Lammers, Touriya Haoud', null, 'Abdullah ''Ap'' Bentarek is happy that, unlike his Uncle Yusuf who stayed in the ancestral Moroccan mountain village, his father Ali moved to the Netherlands – even though it does mean that he’ll have to deal with lousy friends and unrealistic expectations at the employment office. A light-hearted portrait of the immigrant experience and the ubiquitous intolerance of the unfamiliar in Dutch society.', 'Abdullah ''Ap'' Bentarek is happy that, unlike his Uncle Yusuf who stayed in the ancestral Moroccan mountain village, his father Ali moved to the Netherlands – even though it does mean that he’ll have to deal with lousy friends and unrealistic expectations at the employment office. A light-hearted portrait of the immigrant experience and the ubiquitous intolerance of the unfamiliar in Dutch society.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vO3O4ZYTWqAqk1gDRZD1V4Gtkfw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21022'),
  ('909282524483547981', 'Hush!', 2001, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Shogo Ueno, Ryosuke Hashiguchi, Kazuo Yabe', 'Ryosuke Hashiguchi', 'Reiko Kataoka, Kazuya Takahashi, Seiichi Tanabe, Yoko Akino, Manami Fuji, Ken Mitsuishi, Tsugumi, Tetsu Sawaki', null, 'Naoya and Katsuhiro are boyfriends, new in their relationship. Things are uneven at first—Naoya is open and free while Katsuhiro is cautious and closeted—but nothing compares to the chaos that arrives when Asako, a troubled woman with a history of psychiatric problems, abortions, and casual sex, asks Katsuhiro to conceive a child with her.', 'Naoya and Katsuhiro are boyfriends, new in their relationship. Things are uneven at first—Naoya is open and free while Katsuhiro is cautious and closeted—but nothing compares to the chaos that arrives when Asako, a troubled woman with a history of psychiatric problems, abortions, and casual sex, asks Katsuhiro to conceive a child with her.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gJU1ZofpsbtoeAlNuEqE5yilkje.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26895'),
  ('991873243184080184', 'Hush... Hush, Sweet Charlotte', 1964, 'Horror, Mystery, Thriller', 'Robert Aldrich, Joseph F. Biroc, William McGarry', 'Henry Farrell, Lukas Heller', 'Bette Davis, Olivia de Havilland, Joseph Cotten, Agnes Moorehead, Cecil Kellaway, Victor Buono, Mary Astor, Wesley Addy', null, 'An aging, reclusive Southern belle plagued by a horrifying family secret descends into madness after the arrival of a lost relative.', 'An aging, reclusive Southern belle plagued by a horrifying family secret descends into madness after the arrival of a lost relative.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hwVGNaVXFblluLwUjGcJ7RgW1rV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10299'),
  ('54487528343926629', 'Hush...Hush, Nellie Oleson!', 2019, 'Documentary', 'Kelly Hughes', null, 'Alison Arngrim, Jason Stuart, Betty Marshall, Ernest Rhoads, Jennifer True', null, 'After shooting a low-budget horror film, director Kelly Hughes gets a chance to work with his childhood idol Alison Arngrim, the actress who played the scheming Nellie Oleson on TV''s Little House on the Prairie. But fitting Arngrim into the finished product becomes an exercise in futility as Hughes shoots increasingly absurd (and gory) scenes with Arngrim that don''t have much to do with the original plot. Featuring extensive interviews with the cast and vivid film clips, "Hush...Hush, Nellie Oleson!" is a love letter to low-budget filmmakers and the former child stars who enable them.', 'After shooting a low-budget horror film, director Kelly Hughes gets a chance to work with his childhood idol Alison Arngrim, the actress who played the scheming Nellie Oleson on TV''s Little House on the Prairie. But fitting Arngrim into the finished product becomes an exercise in futility as Hughes shoots increasingly absurd (and gory) scenes with Arngrim that don''t have much to do with the original plot. Featuring extensive interviews with the cast and vivid film clips, "Hush...Hush, Nellie Oleson!" is a love letter to low-budget filmmakers and the former child stars who enable them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l91DtIBgpIZlyp6MeLGRFdW94Ae.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1489465'),
  ('816651940545132002', 'Husk', 2011, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Brett Simmons, Marco Fargnoli, Jeff Dolen', 'Brett Simmons', 'Devon Graye, Wes Chatham, C.J. Thomason, Tammin Sursok, Ben Easter, Josh Skipworth, Nick Toussaint, Michael Cornelison', 'R', 'A group of friends stranded near a desolate cornfield find shelter in an old farmhouse, though they soon discover the dwelling is the center of a supernatural ritual.', 'A group of friends stranded near a desolate cornfield find shelter in an old farmhouse, though they soon discover the dwelling is the center of a supernatural ritual.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/UEPf0BcMkicqn7y20MzXKWj75c.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56906'),
  ('972333778897549505', 'Hussy', 1980, 'Drama, Romance', 'Matthew Chapman, Keith Goddard, Gino Marotta', 'Matthew Chapman', 'Helen Mirren, John Shea, Murray Salem, Paul Angelis, Jenny Runacre, Patti Boulaye, Marika Rivera, Daniel Chasin', 'R', 'Beaty, a prostitute, and Emory, a lighting/sound technician, fall in love while working at the same London cabaret, but their relationship isn''t easy.', 'Beaty, a prostitute, and Emory, a lighting/sound technician, fall in love while working at the same London cabaret, but their relationship isn''t easy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/AjSAjAXCpvTahHabHPg2Xmu6MqD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:86706'),
  ('632455892568998835', 'Hustle', 1975, 'Crime, Thriller', 'Robert Aldrich, Joseph F. Biroc, Phil Ball', 'Steve Shagan', 'Burt Reynolds, Catherine Deneuve, Ben Johnson, Paul Winfield, Eileen Brennan, Eddie Albert, Ernest Borgnine, Catherine Bach', 'R', 'The body of teenager Gloria Hollinger is found dead on a Los Angeles beach, and Lt. Phil Gaines is in charge of the investigation. Gaines learns that the girl, a stripper and prostitute, committed suicide, but he ignores the connection between her and a powerful mob lawyer, Leo Sellers. Hollinger''s father, however, is not satisfied with Gaines''s results, and attempts to investigate the case on his own.', 'The body of teenager Gloria Hollinger is found dead on a Los Angeles beach, and Lt. Phil Gaines is in charge of the investigation. Gaines learns that the girl, a stripper and prostitute, committed suicide, but he ignores the connection between her and a powerful mob lawyer, Leo Sellers. Hollinger''s father, however, is not satisfied with Gaines''s results, and attempts to investigate the case on his own.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n52YsqFEkHDL1nbg6LLAWdR9G43.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4990'),
  ('452796520477298770', 'Hustle & Flow', 2005, 'Crime, Drama, Music', 'Craig Brewer, Amy Vincent, Van Hayden', 'Craig Brewer', 'Terrence Howard, Anthony Anderson, Taryn Manning, Taraji P. Henson, DJ Qualls, Ludacris, Paula Jai Parker, Elise Neal', 'R', 'With help from his friends, a Memphis pimp in a mid-life crisis attempts to become a successful hip-hop emcee.', 'With help from his friends, a Memphis pimp in a mid-life crisis attempts to become a successful hip-hop emcee.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yO5QTMZ2Oex6mwsgJuwRuINGuOQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10476'),
  ('854276292241818278', 'Hustle and Heat', 2003, 'Action, Thriller, Crime', 'Craig Ross Jr.', 'Duane Martin, Jay Wolcott', 'Duane Martin, Vivica A. Fox, Meagan Good, Michael Taliferro, Jadakiss, Geoffrey Blake, Daniel Dae Kim, Sticky Fingaz', 'R', 'A slick private eye set out to investigate the death of a young rapper, only to find himself knee-deep in drugs, guns, and double crosses.', 'A slick private eye set out to investigate the death of a young rapper, only to find himself knee-deep in drugs, guns, and double crosses.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cGxOcqIKgME1aWxXfVGm6UpR0iM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:72790'),
  ('463272892798332944', 'Hustlers', 2019, 'Drama, Comedy, Crime', 'Lorene Scafaria, Todd Banhazl, Colin MacLellan', 'Lorene Scafaria', 'Constance Wu, Jennifer Lopez, Julia Stiles, Keke Palmer, Lili Reinhart, Mercedes Ruehl, Cardi B, Lizzo', 'R', 'A crew of savvy former strip club employees band together to turn the tables on their Wall Street clients.', 'A crew of savvy former strip club employees band together to turn the tables on their Wall Street clients.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zBhv8rsLOfpFW2M5b6wW78Uoojs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:540901'),
  ('72002298105893228', 'Hustling', 1975, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Joseph Sargent, Henry Lange, Bill Butler', 'Fay Kanin', 'Lee Remick, Jill Clayburgh, Monte Markham, Alex Rocco, Melanie Mayron, Beverly Hope Atkinson, Dick O''Neill, Burt Young', 'NR', 'Based on Gail Sheehy''s book, this film chronicles how a reporter for a New York City magazine decided to investigate the city''s prostitution industry to find out just who was making all the money. What she found out caused a firestorm of controversy--that many of the city''s richest and most powerful families and corporations benefited directly and indirectly from the illegal sex business.', 'Based on Gail Sheehy''s book, this film chronicles how a reporter for a New York City magazine decided to investigate the city''s prostitution industry to find out just who was making all the money. What she found out caused a firestorm of controversy--that many of the city''s richest and most powerful families and corporations benefited directly and indirectly from the illegal sex business.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nPAwCj5Q6Qd0RBqk6KHZnYm8bJg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:133148'),
  ('333160622783705305', 'Hut in the Woods', 2011, 'Drama', 'Hans Weingartner', 'Hans Weingartner', 'Peter Schneider, Henrike von Kuick, Timur Massold, Andreas Leupold, Julia Jentsch, Eleonore Weisgerber, Robert Schupp, Hans Brückner', null, 'Two misfit males, one man-child, one boy, find each other, building a small cabin in the woods to create a new life. Their daily struggle for survival creates a strong bond between them until the hut is destroyed and one of the boys carted off. The former psychiatric patient is told that his friend was just a figment of his imagination, but this provokes him to fight back and prove the boy''s existence.', 'Two misfit males, one man-child, one boy, find each other, building a small cabin in the woods to create a new life. Their daily struggle for survival creates a strong bond between them until the hut is destroyed and one of the boys carted off. The former psychiatric patient is told that his friend was just a figment of his imagination, but this provokes him to fight back and prove the boy''s existence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qay7wuhnBscxtwbAjn8J3RBcUmZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:86377'),
  ('168728154317270174', 'Hwang Jin Yi', 2007, 'Drama, Romance, History', 'Chang Youn-hyun, Lim Jae-young', 'Kim Hyeon-jeong', 'Song Hye-kyo, Yoo Ji-tae, Kim Eung-soo, Jeong Yu-mi, Ryu Seung-ryong, Oh Tae-kyung, Kim Yoo-jung, Lee Hyun-woo', null, 'Although born a daughter of an aristocratic family, Jin-yi discovers the secret behind her birth and enters into a life in a brothel as a gisaeng.', 'Although born a daughter of an aristocratic family, Jin-yi discovers the secret behind her birth and enters into a life in a brothel as a gisaeng.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r2Eoa4OKOvFRQASs53oUeETLX7P.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56247'),
