  ('1103488305636681341', 'HWY: An American Pastoral', 1970, 'Drama', 'Frank Lisciandro, Babe Hill, Jim Morrison', 'Jim Morrison, Paul Ferrara', 'Jim Morrison', null, 'HWY: An American Pastoral is a film by Jim Morrison, Frank Lisciandro, Paul Ferrara, and Babe Hill and stars Morrison as a hitchhiker. It is a 50-minute experimental film in Direct Cinema style. It was shot during the spring and summer of 1969 in the Mojave Desert and in Los Angeles.', 'HWY: An American Pastoral is a film by Jim Morrison, Frank Lisciandro, Paul Ferrara, and Babe Hill and stars Morrison as a hitchhiker. It is a 50-minute experimental film in Direct Cinema style. It was shot during the spring and summer of 1969 in the Mojave Desert and in Los Angeles.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9HOa8mJCKj05r558HFMkFmhBGFn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:69029'),
  ('194101443430290101', 'Hyas and Stenorhynchus', 1929, 'Documentary', 'Jean Painlevé, André Raymond, Maurice Jaubert', null, null, null, 'In close-ups and extreme close-ups, we watch two small species of marine crustaceans, the slender long-legged stenorhynchus and the clumsy, short-legged hyas. To blend in, both cover themselves with found objects, such as algae and sponges. We watch them move, eat, greet each other, and fight. They have small mandibles and large claws. Near them are spirograph worms, 6 inches long, with a plume of branchiae that fan out like exploding fireworks. We see vibrating cilia, 0.001 mm long, on the branchiae, sending food toward the mouth at the plume''s center. Chopin''s music and an off-screen narrator suggest we''re watching a ballet.', 'In close-ups and extreme close-ups, we watch two small species of marine crustaceans, the slender long-legged stenorhynchus and the clumsy, short-legged hyas. To blend in, both cover themselves with found objects, such as algae and sponges. We watch them move, eat, greet each other, and fight. They have small mandibles and large claws. Near them are spirograph worms, 6 inches long, with a plume of branchiae that fan out like exploding fireworks. We see vibrating cilia, 0.001 mm long, on the branchiae, sending food toward the mouth at the plume''s center. Chopin''s music and an off-screen narrator suggest we''re watching a ballet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ez5u2xd7QqNp2HONGghKDuVipkN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:117588'),
  ('233662423779720837', 'Hybrids', 2017, 'Animation, Science Fiction', 'Kim Tailhades, Yohan Thireau, Romain Thirion', null, null, null, 'When marine wildlife has to adapt to the pollution surrounding it, the rules of survival change.', 'When marine wildlife has to adapt to the pollution surrounding it, the rules of survival change.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hl1YoRgcpq7qYU4ahCOpHk7OU8F.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:513153'),
