  ('58073269714625189', 'Hyde and Hare', 1955, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Friz Freleng', null, 'Mel Blanc', null, 'Bugs Bunny manages to get himself adopted by kindly Dr. Jekyll, but is surprised when his benefactor turns into the horrible Mr. Hyde after drinking a potion.', 'Bugs Bunny manages to get himself adopted by kindly Dr. Jekyll, but is surprised when his benefactor turns into the horrible Mr. Hyde after drinking a potion.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9FV7qebdiPNUC3rxOZosQfV8b4l.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84589'),
