  ('380534431573122862', 'Hydration', 2020, 'Documentary, Music', 'Mimi Valdés', null, 'Pharrell Williams, Tyler, The Creator, Anderson .Paak, Sean Combs, J Balvin, Missy Elliott, A$AP Ferg, Jay-Z', null, 'Taking audiences backstage and behind the scenes of Pharrell''s ground-breaking Something in the Water festival, using music to bring together his divided hometown of Virginia Beach.', 'Taking audiences backstage and behind the scenes of Pharrell''s ground-breaking Something in the Water festival, using music to bring together his divided hometown of Virginia Beach.', null, 'tmdb:movie:693768'),
  ('358797690850287799', 'Hydro-Puzzle', 1971, 'Crime, Comedy, TV Movie, Science Fiction', 'Andrzej Kondratiuk, Zygmunt Samosiuk, Bogumiła Byczkowska', 'Andrzej Kondratiuk, Andrzej Bonarski', 'Józef Nowak, Zdzisław Maklakiewicz, Roman Kłosowski, Wiesław Gołas, Wiesław Michnikowski, Iga Cembrzyńska, Wiesława Mazurkiewicz, Emilia Nowak', null, 'Warsaw is mysteriously running out of water during the summer heat wave. This mystery can only be solved by a Polish superhero known as As.', 'Warsaw is mysteriously running out of water during the summer heat wave. This mystery can only be solved by a Polish superhero known as As.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7GI9e4JXjuhUt0dnTFPW70u1odW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31856'),
  ('683786498496027739', 'Hyena', 2015, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Gerard Johnson, Benjamin Kračun', 'Gerard Johnson', 'Peter Ferdinando, Stephen Graham, Neil Maskell, Elisa Lasowski, MyAnna Buring, Richard Dormer, Tony Pitts, Thomas Craig', 'NR', 'Good policing doesn''t necessarily mean doing everything by the book. But as the business of crime in London turns to favour the Albanians and Turks, how does a "good" policeman survive?', 'Good policing doesn''t necessarily mean doing everything by the book. But as the business of crime in London turns to favour the Albanians and Turks, how does a "good" policeman survive?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hxMgW8vJPIhXUyWF7rs5VJw47Y5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:277237'),
  ('1080690859665512486', 'Hyena Road', 2015, 'War, Drama, Thriller, Action', 'Paul Gross, Karim Hussain, Harrison Yurkiw', 'Paul Gross', 'Paul Gross, Rossif Sutherland, Clark Johnson, Allan Hawco, Christine Horne, Jennifer Pudavick, David Richmond-Peck, Nikki Duval', 'R', 'Three different men, three different worlds, three different wars – all stand at the intersection of modern warfare – a murky world of fluid morality where all is not as it seems. A unique and dramatic look at the Canadian Army in Afghanistan.', 'Three different men, three different worlds, three different wars – all stand at the intersection of modern warfare – a murky world of fluid morality where all is not as it seems. A unique and dramatic look at the Canadian Army in Afghanistan.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zdn34Jx3rRkhDGsD0qcB0cA1HzB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:316042'),
  ('289184032902400055', 'Hyenas', 1992, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Djibril Diop Mambéty, Matthias Kälin', 'Djibril Diop Mambéty', 'Djibril Diop Mambéty, Mansour Diouf, Ami Diakhate, Makhouredia Gueye, Calgou Fall, Faly Gueye, Issa Samb, Omar Bah', null, 'A now-rich woman returns to her poor desert hometown to propose a deal to the populace: her fortune, in exchange for the death of the man who years earlier abandoned her and left her with his child.', 'A now-rich woman returns to her poor desert hometown to propose a deal to the populace: her fortune, in exchange for the death of the man who years earlier abandoned her and left her with his child.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/or2P5W4SHTOYS40F2LifY8wm1e4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:124085'),
  ('519894378707813199', 'Hyouka: Forbidden Secrets', 2017, 'Drama, Mystery', 'Mari Asato, Yuta Tsukinaga', 'Mari Asato', 'Kento Yamazaki, Alice Hirose, Fujiko Kojima, Amane Okayama, Kanata Hongo, Yuki Saito, Shihori Kanjiya, Nazuki Amano', null, 'Energy-conservative high school student Houtarou Oreki ends up with more than he bargained for when he signs up for the Classics Club at his sister''s behest—especially when he realizes how deep-rooted the club''s history really is. Begrudgingly, Oreki is dragged into an investigation concerning the 45-year-old mystery that surrounds the club room. Accompanied by his fellow club members, the knowledgeable Satoshi Fukube, the stern but benign Mayaka Ibara, and the ever-curious Eru Chitanda, Oreki must combat deadlines and lack of information with resourcefulness and hidden talent, in order to not only find the truth buried beneath the dust of works created years before them, but of other small side cases as well.', 'Energy-conservative high school student Houtarou Oreki ends up with more than he bargained for when he signs up for the Classics Club at his sister''s behest—especially when he realizes how deep-rooted the club''s history really is. Begrudgingly, Oreki is dragged into an investigation concerning the 45-year-old mystery that surrounds the club room. Accompanied by his fellow club members, the knowledgeable Satoshi Fukube, the stern but benign Mayaka Ibara, and the ever-curious Eru Chitanda, Oreki must combat deadlines and lack of information with resourcefulness and hidden talent, in order to not only find the truth buried beneath the dust of works created years before them, but of other small side cases as well.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/82aujfdMhUFIvJfTFu8nU4x29yv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:437619'),
  ('616177162110409681', 'Hype!', 1996, 'Documentary, Music', 'Doug Pray, Robert Bennett', null, 'Jeff Ament, Mark Arm, Kurt Cobain, Chris Cornell, Dale Crover, Dave Grohl, Krist Novoselic, Valerie M. Agnew', null, 'This documentary examines the Seattle scene as it became the focus of a merging of punk rock, heavy metal, and innovation. Building from the grass roots, self-promoted and self-recorded until break-out success of bands like Nirvana brought the record industry to the Pacific Northwest, a phenomenon was born.', 'This documentary examines the Seattle scene as it became the focus of a merging of punk rock, heavy metal, and innovation. Building from the grass roots, self-promoted and self-recorded until break-out success of bands like Nirvana brought the record industry to the Pacific Northwest, a phenomenon was born.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vfR9veCwZMZXfpCF5QlnaLFoSr1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30180'),
  ('1028664103040952731', 'Hyper-Reality', 2016, 'Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Keiichi Matsuda', null, 'Natalia Tamayo, Catalina Villegas, Wu Yu Zhou, Juliana Ospina Henao, Camilo Suárez, Juliana Vélez, Juanita Agudelo Arbeláez, Jose Kerguelen', null, 'Hyper-Reality presents a provocative and kaleidoscopic new vision of the future, where physical and virtual realities have merged, and the city is saturated in media.', 'Hyper-Reality presents a provocative and kaleidoscopic new vision of the future, where physical and virtual realities have merged, and the city is saturated in media.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8Cpq1r8SAxzrb5S6ZshCr8DZZKP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:398415'),
  ('485562088872242689', 'Hyperland', 2021, 'Science Fiction', 'Hajo Schomerus, Mario Sixtus', 'Mario Sixtus', 'Gerti Drassl, Lorna Ishema, Samuel Schneider, Maximilian Pekrul, Reza Brojerdi, Daniel Bohrer, Michelle Coenen, David Daria', null, 'In this dystopian world set in the near future, everyone’s reputation is measured and visible. Your “Karma count” defines you, as Cee soon discovers. Victim of a sexual assault that goes viral on social media, the young graphic designer becomes more ostracised as she fights back.', 'In this dystopian world set in the near future, everyone’s reputation is measured and visible. Your “Karma count” defines you, as Cee soon discovers. Victim of a sexual assault that goes viral on social media, the young graphic designer becomes more ostracised as she fights back.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hlGqOQt3AQfhsDeQjcyZCiHjfb6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:893304'),
  ('223818576496979802', 'HyperNormalisation', 2016, 'Documentary', 'Adam Curtis', 'Adam Curtis', 'Adam Curtis, Donald Trump, Vladimir Putin, Ronald Reagan, Henry Kissinger, Gordon Brown, Jane Fonda, Ivana Trump', null, 'We live in a world where the powerful deceive us. We know they lie. They know we know they lie. They do not care. We say we care, but we do nothing, and nothing ever changes. It is normal. Welcome to the post-truth world. How we got to where we are now…', 'We live in a world where the powerful deceive us. We know they lie. They know we know they lie. They do not care. We say we care, but we do nothing, and nothing ever changes. It is normal. Welcome to the post-truth world. How we got to where we are now…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tTqI2xoB7cGO7HASB22Sss6x44J.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:419546'),
  ('1009620769052376839', 'Hypersleep', 2022, 'Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Alberto Mascia, Matteo Vieille Rivara', 'Enrico Saccà, Alberto Mascia', 'Stefano Accorsi, Caterina Shulha, Astrid Meloni, Andrea Germani, Alessandro Gazale, Paolo Pierobon, Toni Laudadio, Giordano De Plano', null, 'The old and overcrowded penitentiaries are just a memory. Inmates now serve their sentence in a state of deep sleep that renders them harmless, and has drastically reduced recidivism. Until one day, a psychologist in charge of monitoring the mental state of inmates finds himself confronted with a prisoner over whom he''s lost all control.', 'The old and overcrowded penitentiaries are just a memory. Inmates now serve their sentence in a state of deep sleep that renders them harmless, and has drastically reduced recidivism. Until one day, a psychologist in charge of monitoring the mental state of inmates finds himself confronted with a prisoner over whom he''s lost all control.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rjOKPY90tPPd3mZFuL2IOaBpRXg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1001840'),
  ('378822104271353140', 'Hypersomnia', 2017, 'Mystery, Thriller, Horror, Fantasy', 'Gabriel Grieco', 'Sebastián Rotstein, Gabriel Grieco', 'Yamila Saud, Gerardo Romano, Jimena Barón, Vanesa González, Florencia Torrente, Nazareno Casero, Sofía Gala Castiglione, Fabiana Cantilo', null, 'A young actress rehearsing for a play about human trafficking begins to relive terrifying scenes that may be dreams -- or an alternate reality.', 'A young actress rehearsing for a play about human trafficking begins to relive terrifying scenes that may be dreams -- or an alternate reality.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4IXuIIUHmH2Uvo586DJb9JA3MNy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:451654'),
  ('620538653189313403', 'Hyperspace', 1984, 'Science Fiction, Comedy', 'Todd Durham', 'Todd Durham', 'Alan Marx, Paula Poundstone, Chris Elliott, Robert Bloodworth, R.C. Nanney, Lisa Huss, Gordon Petersen, Susan Gellner', 'NR', 'Because of a small navigation mistake Lord Buckethead lands on Earth instead of "in a galaxy far, far away". But he is still looking for the princess and the secret transmissions.', 'Because of a small navigation mistake Lord Buckethead lands on Earth instead of "in a galaxy far, far away". But he is still looking for the princess and the secret transmissions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4xGrQCv8cNryvDNxYSFHBVIk1k2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:159411'),
  ('556751022295584911', 'Hypnosis', 1962, 'Drama, Horror, Thriller', 'Eugenio Martín, Lore Meyer-Döhner, Francisco Sempere', 'Helmut Harun, Gerhard Schmidt, Giuseppe Mangione', 'Jean Sorel, Eleonora Rossi Drago, Götz George, Heinz Drache, Margot Trooger, Werner Peters, Mara Cruz, Massimo Serato', null, 'Erik, in love with Magda, the fiancée of Georg, his boss, secretly sends her roses every night.', 'Erik, in love with Magda, the fiancée of Georg, his boss, secretly sends her roses every night.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ilqZWwrvSKlPksrIWwpBqjz02B9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:191429'),
  ('486847752307510423', 'Hypnosis', 1999, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Masayuki Ochiai, Masaaki Tezuka, Osamu Fujiishi', 'Yasushi Fukuda, Masayuki Ochiai', 'Goro Inagaki, Miho Kanno, Takeshi Masu, Yuki Watanabe, Ken Utsui, Shigemitsu Ogi, Kenta Satoi, Noborou Shirai', null, 'Three apparently unrelated suicides occur on the same day in Tokyo. One involves a young athlete, one a groom at his wedding reception, and the third an elderly man celebrating his wife''s birthday. A middle aged detective investigating one of the cases begins to suspect a connection between the three when he discovers that each person mentioned a "green monkey" before they died. With the help of a young psychiatrist he formulates the theory that hypnosis is somehow involved. In the mean time other bizarre "suicides" are reported and the mystery intensifies. Who will be next? What is the truth? Can more deaths be prevented?', 'Three apparently unrelated suicides occur on the same day in Tokyo. One involves a young athlete, one a groom at his wedding reception, and the third an elderly man celebrating his wife''s birthday. A middle aged detective investigating one of the cases begins to suspect a connection between the three when he discovers that each person mentioned a "green monkey" before they died. With the help of a young psychiatrist he formulates the theory that hypnosis is somehow involved. In the mean time other bizarre "suicides" are reported and the mystery intensifies. Who will be next? What is the truth? Can more deaths be prevented?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tOgHDgk4GAHCf1zFnyFaapo1eiA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:68477'),
  ('226322421126064943', 'Hypnotic', 2021, 'Thriller, Drama, Horror', 'Matt Angel, Suzanne Coote, Adam McCarthy', 'Richard D''Ovidio', 'Kate Siegel, Jason O''Mara, Dulé Hill, Lucie Guest, Jaime M. Callica, Darien Martin, Luc Roderique', null, 'A young woman seeking self-improvement enlists the help of a renowned hypnotist but, after a handful of intense sessions, discovers unexpected and deadly consequences.', 'A young woman seeking self-improvement enlists the help of a renowned hypnotist but, after a handful of intense sessions, discovers unexpected and deadly consequences.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/miEj4kNc4efZ5WbPJqWl1UXWrvS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:864873'),
  ('259919727117443334', 'Hypnotic', 2023, 'Mystery, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Robert Rodriguez, Pablo Berron, Derek Franzese', 'Robert Rodriguez, Max Borenstein', 'Ben Affleck, Alice Braga, William Fichtner, J. D. Pardo, Hala Finley, Ionie Olivia Nieves, Dayo Okeniyi, Kelly Frye', 'R', 'A detective becomes entangled in a mystery involving his missing daughter and a secret government program while investigating a string of reality-bending crimes.', 'A detective becomes entangled in a mystery involving his missing daughter and a secret government program while investigating a string of reality-bending crimes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m0mYmlN9AewOGSOl7Q1ZgZvEeUU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:536437'),
  ('492806100620116311', 'Hypnotized', 2004, 'Thriller, Romance, Mystery', 'Kim In-shik, Kim Woo-hyung, Kim Jun-su', 'Kim In-shik', 'Kim Hye-soo, Kim Tae-woo, Kim Young-Ae, Cho Dong-hyuk, Han Jung-soo, Suh Yun-a, Do Yong-gu, Chang Yun', null, 'A psychiatrist fails to help a mental patient during her stay in hospital. The doctor becomes obsessed with his former patient, seeks her on the outside and uses hypnosis to fulfill his sexual desires.', 'A psychiatrist fails to help a mental patient during her stay in hospital. The doctor becomes obsessed with his former patient, seeks her on the outside and uses hypnosis to fulfill his sexual desires.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/swkb0yDBbgDDpvGJu5o6pOhJO2w.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:57474'),
  ('801292875732320319', 'Hypnotized and Hysterical (Hairstylist Wanted)', 2002, 'Comedy', 'Claude Duty, Bruno Romiguière', 'Pascale Faure, Claude Duty, Jean-Philippe Barrau', 'Amira Casar, Marina Foïs, Olivia Bonamy, Charles Berling, Sergi López, Léa Drucker', null, 'Claude Duty''s feature-length debut Filles Perdues, Cheveux Gras (Hypnotized and Hysterical, (Hairstylist Wanted)) is an offbeat comedy about three women. Elodi (Olivia Bonamy) is a struggling single mother. Natacha (Marina Fois) is an upbeat alcoholic hair stylist whose beloved pet cat has disappeared. Marianne (Amira Casar) is drawn to a roguish, sexually adventurous art dealer. Their lives intertwine in a variety of ways. Song and dance numbers, as well as animated sequences, punctuate the film.', 'Claude Duty''s feature-length debut Filles Perdues, Cheveux Gras (Hypnotized and Hysterical, (Hairstylist Wanted)) is an offbeat comedy about three women. Elodi (Olivia Bonamy) is a struggling single mother. Natacha (Marina Fois) is an upbeat alcoholic hair stylist whose beloved pet cat has disappeared. Marianne (Amira Casar) is drawn to a roguish, sexually adventurous art dealer. Their lives intertwine in a variety of ways. Song and dance numbers, as well as animated sequences, punctuate the film.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1Zfqk57dr28DX7eYfEpwxWMhTse.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:59508'),
  ('434908876757904790', 'Hypochondriac', 1979, 'Comedy', 'Tonino Cervi, Armando Nannuzzi, Fulvio Marcolin', 'Alberto Sordi, Tonino Cervi, Cesare Frugoni', 'Alberto Sordi, Laura Antonelli, Giuliana De Sio, Stefano Satta Flores, Carlo Bagno, Vittorio Caprioli, Christian De Sica, Ettore Manni', null, 'During the year 1673, Rome was besieged by poverty and violence. The rich Mr. Argante has two servants to look after him, while his wife is only waiting to see him dead to inherit.', 'During the year 1673, Rome was besieged by poverty and violence. The rich Mr. Argante has two servants to look after him, while his wife is only waiting to see him dead to inherit.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vjygIFBYcFDXan3la3Zxpm0z53.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:71778'),
  ('641206809515593755', 'Hypothermia', 2012, 'Horror', 'James Felix McKenney, Eric Branco', 'James Felix McKenney', 'Michael Rooker, Blanche Baker, Greg Finley, Amy Chang, Asa Liebmann, Benjamin Forster, Don Wood, Larry Fessenden', 'NR', 'Two families'' idyllic ice-fishing vacation turns deadly when they awaken a creature beneath the frozen lake, forcing them to rely on each other if they want to make it safely back to land.', 'Two families'' idyllic ice-fishing vacation turns deadly when they awaken a creature beneath the frozen lake, forcing them to rely on each other if they want to make it safely back to land.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hu1GQ12zpKf6jCcgsjmHjfmCcns.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:132250'),
  ('156457334731193039', 'Hyppolit, the Butler', 1931, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Steve Sekely, F.W. Dustmann, László Angyal', 'Károly Nóti, István Zágon', 'Gyula Csortos, Gyula Kabos, Mici Haraszti, Éva Fenyvessy, Gyula Gózon, Pál Jávor, Sándor Góth, Mici Erdélyi', null, 'Evergreen comedy about a typical parvenu, an ignorant transportation entrepreneur who has suddenly found himself very rich. Despite their humble origins, his wife strives to live a sophisticated lifestyle. When she engages a butler, Hyppolit, their whole life is turned upside down. It has remained one of the most viewed Hungarian comedies of all time: it is shown regularly and is still extremely popular', 'Evergreen comedy about a typical parvenu, an ignorant transportation entrepreneur who has suddenly found himself very rich. Despite their humble origins, his wife strives to live a sophisticated lifestyle. When she engages a butler, Hyppolit, their whole life is turned upside down. It has remained one of the most viewed Hungarian comedies of all time: it is shown regularly and is still extremely popular', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k3u3KwdYsQyZE6EItJZxsgp5zzw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41062'),
  ('1055854733966398390', 'Hysteria', 1965, 'Mystery, Thriller, Crime, Horror', 'Freddie Francis, John Wilcox', 'Jimmy Sangster', 'Robert Webber, Anthony Newlands, Jennifer Jayne, Maurice Denham, Lelia Goldoni, Peter Woodthorpe, Sandra Boize, Sue Lloyd', 'NR', 'An American wakes in an English hospital, unable to remember anything prior to a recent car accident. With only a newspaper photograph as a guide, and an unknown benefactor, he attempts to unravel what increasingly looks like a bizarre murder.', 'An American wakes in an English hospital, unable to remember anything prior to a recent car accident. With only a newspaper photograph as a guide, and an unknown benefactor, he attempts to unravel what increasingly looks like a bizarre murder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9cMsvAnrRJkXEsYH9uuiL7YjYXr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56530'),
  ('362991415616849544', 'Hysteria', 1997, 'Science Fiction, Horror, Thriller', 'René Daalder, Josée Drolet, Allison Johnston', 'René Daalder', 'Patrick McGoohan, Amanda Plummer, Joanne Vannicola, Emmanuelle Vaugier, Gregory Hlady, Joseph Wynne, Ralph Allison, Louis Di Bianco', null, 'Legendary actor Patrick McGoohan turns his famous character from THE PRISONER upside down as the psychiatrist in charge of an insane asylum. He has connected his inmates into a group mind where they share each other''s psychoses, dreams and sexuality with all the scary and titillating implications imaginable! Like his highly acclaimed cult classic MASSACRE AT CENTRAL HIGH, director Rene Daalders provocative excursion into sci fi-horror filmmaking looks at first glance like a classic grindhouse movie, but it is up to much more. In addition to its operatic mayhem, HYSTERIA is a mind-expanding reflection on individual vs. group consciousness, power, control, and freedom.', 'Legendary actor Patrick McGoohan turns his famous character from THE PRISONER upside down as the psychiatrist in charge of an insane asylum. He has connected his inmates into a group mind where they share each other''s psychoses, dreams and sexuality with all the scary and titillating implications imaginable! Like his highly acclaimed cult classic MASSACRE AT CENTRAL HIGH, director Rene Daalders provocative excursion into sci fi-horror filmmaking looks at first glance like a classic grindhouse movie, but it is up to much more. In addition to its operatic mayhem, HYSTERIA is a mind-expanding reflection on individual vs. group consciousness, power, control, and freedom.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xXTsXYwRoZYmxbZ4gvpXlZlHoxu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:258006'),
  ('418787566214459718', 'Hysteria', 2011, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Sean Bobbitt, Tanya Wexler, Bill Crutcher', 'Stephen Dyer, Jonah Lisa Dyer', 'Maggie Gyllenhaal, Hugh Dancy, Jonathan Pryce, Felicity Jones, Rupert Everett, Ashley Jensen, Sheridan Smith, Gemma Jones', 'R', 'Two doctors in Victorian England use manual stimulation of female genitalia to cure their patients'' ills, leading to the invention of the vibrator.', 'Two doctors in Victorian England use manual stimulation of female genitalia to cure their patients'' ills, leading to the invention of the vibrator.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ziWnXi2VyNDD9qPi5wmOuolOCIu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:75802'),
  ('251069930633041879', 'Hysteria', 2025, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Mehmet Akif Büyükatalay, Christian Kochmann, Kerstin Neuwirth', 'Mehmet Akif Büyükatalay', 'Devrim Lingnau, Mehdi Meskar, Serkan Kaya, Nicolette Krebitz, Aziz Çapkurt, Nazmi Kırık, Lola Klamroth, Sahin Eryilmaz', null, 'A film shoot takes a dark turn when the burning of a Quran throws the crew into turmoil. Caught in accusations, intern Elif is drawn into a dangerous game of secrets and lies, finding herself at the heart of an all-absorbing conspiracy.', 'A film shoot takes a dark turn when the burning of a Quran throws the crew into turmoil. Caught in accusations, intern Elif is drawn into a dangerous game of secrets and lies, finding herself at the heart of an all-absorbing conspiracy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7UOVLIlPm5RmSJ8Y0kbOKVqzNfO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1399696'),
  ('387359165273337576', 'Hysteria: The Def Leppard Story', 2001, 'Drama, Music', 'Robert Mandel', 'Carolyn Shelby, Christopher Ames', 'Nick Bagnall, Karl Geary, Adam MacDonald, Esteban Powell, Orlando Seale, Tat Whalley, Dean McDermott, Anthony Michael Hall', null, 'A dramatization of the early years of the hard rock band, Def Leppard, the group faces both success and personal tragedies such as drummer, Rick Allen losing his arm in a car accident and guitarist Steve Clark''s alcohol addiction.', 'A dramatization of the early years of the hard rock band, Def Leppard, the group faces both success and personal tragedies such as drummer, Rick Allen losing his arm in a car accident and guitarist Steve Clark''s alcohol addiction.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fMgeiw7AHkogdP1GEFSeJHKYUbP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25320'),
  ('830301214523406800', 'Hysterical', 1982, 'Horror, Comedy, Fantasy, Family', 'Chris Bearde, Donald M. Morgan, James Simons', 'Bill Hudson, Brett Hudson, Mark Hudson', 'Bill Hudson, Mark Hudson, Brett Hudson, Cindy Pickett, Richard Kiel, Julie Newmar, Robert Donner, Murray Hamilton', 'PG', 'Frederic Lansing is a writer who hopes to find inspiration while vacationing in Hellview, Oregon; however, the lighthouse in which he''s staying is haunted by the ghost of Venetia, who had killed herself 100 years ago and now wants to use Lansing as a vessel for her dead husband, Captain Howdy. When Howdy''s ghost starts killing people, two bumbling scientists are brought in to investigate the history of the lighthouse and solve the case.', 'Frederic Lansing is a writer who hopes to find inspiration while vacationing in Hellview, Oregon; however, the lighthouse in which he''s staying is haunted by the ghost of Venetia, who had killed herself 100 years ago and now wants to use Lansing as a vessel for her dead husband, Captain Howdy. When Howdy''s ghost starts killing people, two bumbling scientists are brought in to investigate the history of the lighthouse and solve the case.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4ztOHqMNAS2jh1WTA6IRyr1BLLz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:73626'),
  ('996956399486539242', 'Hysterical Blindness', 2002, 'Drama, TV Movie', 'Declan Quinn, Mira Nair', 'Laura Cahill', 'Uma Thurman, Gena Rowlands, Juliette Lewis, Justin Chambers, Ben Gazzara, Anthony DeSando, Jolie Peters, Callie Thorne', null, 'Two friends lament their unhappy single lives while searching for Mr. Right in 1980s New Jersey.', 'Two friends lament their unhappy single lives while searching for Mr. Right in 1980s New Jersey.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3NcBAGkB4Iqh9AYCfIQHW3YQJiu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45069'),
  ('394040271981273913', 'I', 1987, 'Drama, Romance', 'Walter Hugo Khouri', 'Walter Hugo Khouri', 'Tarcísio Meira, Bia Seidl, Nicole Puzzi, Monique Lafond, Christiane Torloni, Walter Forster, Sônia Clara, Moacyr Deriquém', null, 'Powerful and insatiable millionaire hides in his own private island for the weekend, in search of answers for his feeling of personal dissatisfaction. But he is not alone on the beautiful beach: he''s surrounded by the women he cares for, especially his daughter, for whom he nurtures an almost incestuous desire.', 'Powerful and insatiable millionaire hides in his own private island for the weekend, in search of answers for his feeling of personal dissatisfaction. But he is not alone on the beautiful beach: he''s surrounded by the women he cares for, especially his daughter, for whom he nurtures an almost incestuous desire.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/LUrKtRWSLIvCRupdA75vhMgQ9K.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:195498'),
  ('153617118784806634', 'I', 2015, 'Thriller, Action, Romance', 'Shankar, P. C. Sreeram, Vishnu l Bhaskaran', 'Shankar', 'Vikram, Amy Jackson, Suresh Gopi, Upen Patel, Ramkumar Ganesan, Santhanam, Ojas Rajani, T. K. Kala', null, 'A deformed hunchback kidnaps a bride and holds her hostage while his connection to her and his targets is revealed in a series of flashbacks that unfold as he starts seeking revenge.', 'A deformed hunchback kidnaps a bride and holds her hostage while his connection to her and his targets is revealed in a series of flashbacks that unfold as he starts seeking revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/itDqpdxcI5urnL9KJGJiOusn5g9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:263471'),
  ('911732708083678695', 'I ♥ Huckabees', 2004, 'Comedy, Romance', 'David O. Russell, Peter Deming, Mary Ellen Woods', 'David O. Russell, Jeff Baena', 'Jason Schwartzman, Isabelle Huppert, Dustin Hoffman, Lily Tomlin, Jude Law, Mark Wahlberg, Naomi Watts, Angela Grillo', 'R', 'A husband-and-wife team play detective, but not in the traditional sense. Instead, the happy duo helps others solve their existential issues, the kind that keep you up at night, wondering what it all means.', 'A husband-and-wife team play detective, but not in the traditional sense. Instead, the happy duo helps others solve their existential issues, the kind that keep you up at night, wondering what it all means.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h27ytqXyOrAB6KmRx2abOp8p2W.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1599'),
  ('953256761491026901', 'I 2 deputati', 1969, 'Comedy', 'Giovanni Grimaldi, Lanfranco Ceccarelli, Alessandro Metz', 'Giovanni Grimaldi', 'Franco Franchi, Ciccio Ingrassia, Gabriella Giorgelli, Franca Maria Giardina, Alfredo Rizzo, Umberto D''Orsi, Ignazio Leone, Enzo Andronico', null, 'Francesco and Franco are brothers in law but, since their respective wives can''t stand each other, are always arguing. When Francesco decides to run for Parliament, Franco is kidnapped by his opposing party and forced to run as well. The clashes between the two in-laws will continue in Parliament.', 'Francesco and Franco are brothers in law but, since their respective wives can''t stand each other, are always arguing. When Francesco decides to run for Parliament, Franco is kidnapped by his opposing party and forced to run as well. The clashes between the two in-laws will continue in Parliament.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6LZi5RkteGDE4lsPNuheuoSXvTp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:121330'),
  ('52577187040286231', 'I Accuse', 1919, 'War, Drama', 'Abel Gance, Marc Bujard, Maurice Forster', 'Abel Gance', 'Romuald Joubé, Séverin-Mars, Maryse Dauvray, Maxime Desjardins, Angèle Guys, Mancini, Elizabeth Nizan, Pierre Danis', 'NR', 'The story of two men, one married, the other the lover of the other''s wife, who meet in the trenches of the First World War, and how their tale becomes a microcosm for the horrors of war.', 'The story of two men, one married, the other the lover of the other''s wife, who meet in the trenches of the First World War, and how their tale becomes a microcosm for the horrors of war.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9vZK9ZoVrAiquPCktZkqMXV3Mq5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:70804'),
  ('660095218346449541', 'I Accuse', 1938, 'War, Drama', 'Abel Gance, Roger Hubert', 'Abel Gance, Steve Passeur', 'Victor Francen, Line Noro, Sylvie Gance, Jean-Max, Paul Amiot, Marcel Delaître, Georges Saillard, Renée Devillers', null, 'After serving in the trenches of World War I, Jean Diaz recoils with such horror that he renounces love and personal pleasure to immerse himself in scientific research, seeking a machine to prevent war. He thinks he has succeeded, but the government subverts his discovery, and Europe slides with seeming inevitability toward World War II. In desperation, Diaz summons the ghosts of the war dead from the graves and fields of France to give silent, accusing protest.', 'After serving in the trenches of World War I, Jean Diaz recoils with such horror that he renounces love and personal pleasure to immerse himself in scientific research, seeking a machine to prevent war. He thinks he has succeeded, but the government subverts his discovery, and Europe slides with seeming inevitability toward World War II. In desperation, Diaz summons the ghosts of the war dead from the graves and fields of France to give silent, accusing protest.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/myXoQpxPwIjOIzMIkGGpPFSpcUz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:130633'),
  ('1116283859121846697', 'I Accuse', 2003, 'Thriller, TV Movie', 'John Ketcham', 'Charles Wilkinson', 'Estella Warren, John Hannah, John Kapelos, Brad Grass, Andrea Menard, Aaron Pearl, Daniel MacDonald, Velvette Neumann', null, 'Kimberly Jansen is a single mother who lives in a small Canadian town. After cutting her hand at a party, she visits the hospital to seek what she assumes will be routine treatment. Instead, she falls victim to a predator in a white coat: Dr. Richard Darian, who drugs her and rapes her while she is asleep. Kimberly attempts to press charges, but the townsfolk and the local police, who regard her as a tramp and respect the doctor, dismiss her accusations.', 'Kimberly Jansen is a single mother who lives in a small Canadian town. After cutting her hand at a party, she visits the hospital to seek what she assumes will be routine treatment. Instead, she falls victim to a predator in a white coat: Dr. Richard Darian, who drugs her and rapes her while she is asleep. Kimberly attempts to press charges, but the townsfolk and the local police, who regard her as a tramp and respect the doctor, dismiss her accusations.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mGZPrMGSnoRJd8arXaSHJgLUQpb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:73646'),
  ('418372892738776318', 'I Accuse My Parents', 1944, 'Drama, Crime', 'Sam Newfield, Robert E. Cline, Melville De Lay', 'Marjorie Dudley, Harry L. Fraser', 'Mary Beth Hughes, Robert Lowell, John Miljan, Vivienne Osborne, George Meeker, Edward Earle, George Lloyd, Patricia Knox', 'NR', 'Ignored by his alcoholic parents, Jimmy Wilson starts hanging around with some shady characters. After falling in love with a lounge singer, Jimmy tries to impress her by doing jobs for her shady boss. After one of these jobs goes bad, Jimmy ends up on the run. Eventually, he must confront the truth, his past, and his parents. The judge cites parental neglect in the case of a teenager (John Miljan) charged with murder.', 'Ignored by his alcoholic parents, Jimmy Wilson starts hanging around with some shady characters. After falling in love with a lounge singer, Jimmy tries to impress her by doing jobs for her shady boss. After one of these jobs goes bad, Jimmy ends up on the run. Eventually, he must confront the truth, his past, and his parents. The judge cites parental neglect in the case of a teenager (John Miljan) charged with murder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A4IdQ6lI1cPylgwNhMNgTnGZIzN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31282'),
  ('1024429485108365154', 'I Ain''t Playin', 2026, 'Comedy', null, 'Bruce Bruce', 'Bruce Bruce', null, 'Bruce Bruce returns after 14 years with his Netflix debut "I Ain''t Playin''" - observing generational chaos and life''s craziness through personal stories.', 'Bruce Bruce returns after 14 years with his Netflix debut "I Ain''t Playin''" - observing generational chaos and life''s craziness through personal stories.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FevZxpA5suqQpfO5Mh2MRakMkQyz.jpg', 'plex:movie:i-aint-playin'),
  ('1144367177284705032', 'I Always Wanted to Be a Gangster', 2008, 'Drama, Comedy, Crime', 'Pierre Aïm, Samuel Benchetrit', null, 'Anna Mouglalis, Édouard Baer, Jean Rochefort, Jean-Pierre Kalfon, Laurent Terzieff, Venantino Venantini, Roger Dumas, Alain Bashung', null, 'Told in four vignettes, this existential comedy relates the exploits of four aspiring criminals who hope to improve their lot, but find that they might not have what it takes for a life of crime.', 'Told in four vignettes, this existential comedy relates the exploits of four aspiring criminals who hope to improve their lot, but find that they might not have what it takes for a life of crime.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4SAADo3TZ7quY7GSrmoYdEIxeBN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8281'),
  ('988428644597247931', 'I Am', 2011, 'Documentary', 'Tom Shadyac, Nick Middleton', null, 'Marc Ian Barasch, Coleman Barks, Noam Chomsky, John Francis, Lynne McTaggart, Tom Shadyac, Desmond Tutu, Howard Zinn', null, 'I AM is an utterly engaging and entertaining non-fiction film that poses two practical and provocative questions: what’s wrong with our world, and what can we do to make it better? The filmmaker behind the inquiry is Tom Shadyac, one of Hollywood’s leading comedy practitioners and the creative force behind such blockbusters as “Ace Ventura,” “Liar Liar,” “The Nutty Professor,” and “Bruce Almighty.” However, in I AM, Shadyac steps in front of the camera to recount what happened to him after a cycling accident left him incapacitated, possibly for good. Though he ultimately recovered, he emerged with a new sense of purpose, determined to share his own awakening to his prior life of excess and greed, and to investigate how he as an individual, and we as a race, could improve the way we live and walk in the world.', 'I AM is an utterly engaging and entertaining non-fiction film that poses two practical and provocative questions: what’s wrong with our world, and what can we do to make it better? The filmmaker behind the inquiry is Tom Shadyac, one of Hollywood’s leading comedy practitioners and the creative force behind such blockbusters as “Ace Ventura,” “Liar Liar,” “The Nutty Professor,” and “Bruce Almighty.” However, in I AM, Shadyac steps in front of the camera to recount what happened to him after a cycling accident left him incapacitated, possibly for good. Though he ultimately recovered, he emerged with a new sense of purpose, determined to share his own awakening to his prior life of excess and greed, and to investigate how he as an individual, and we as a race, could improve the way we live and walk in the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7ArmQ4I8QUs6TZjON5cmfMn9VUt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:82932'),
  ('907838238307319675', 'I Am a Camera', 1955, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Henry Cornelius, Guy Green, Muir Mathieson', 'John Collier', 'Julie Harris, Laurence Harvey, Shelley Winters, Ron Randell, Lea Seidl, Anton Diffring, Jean Gargoet, Ina De La Haye', null, 'Just before the Nazis ascend to power in Berlin, Chris, an aspiring novelist from England, meets flamboyant cabaret entertainer Sally Bowles and an unusual friendship is born. As Sally feeds her extravagant tastes, Chris goes along for the ride, until their Jewish pal, Fritz, encounters trouble.', 'Just before the Nazis ascend to power in Berlin, Chris, an aspiring novelist from England, meets flamboyant cabaret entertainer Sally Bowles and an unusual friendship is born. As Sally feeds her extravagant tastes, Chris goes along for the ride, until their Jewish pal, Fritz, encounters trouble.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r0giZnOk75uOC1oyokpkZyJ1W29.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:83119'),
  ('834794147506545842', 'I Am a Fugitive from a Chain Gang', 1932, 'Drama, Crime', 'Sol Polito, Mervyn LeRoy, Al Alleborn', 'Howard J. Green, Sheridan Gibney, Brown Holmes', 'Paul Muni, Glenda Farrell, Helen Vinson, Noel Francis, Preston Foster, Allen Jenkins, Berton Churchill, Edward Ellis', 'NR', 'A World War I veteran’s dreams of becoming a master architect evaporate in the cold light of economic realities. Things get even worse when he’s falsely convicted of a crime and sent to work on a chain gang.', 'A World War I veteran’s dreams of becoming a master architect evaporate in the cold light of economic realities. Things get even worse when he’s falsely convicted of a crime and sent to work on a chain gang.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jer6lim61i8V6a5HOZq2i07UQQf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29740'),
  ('9052972652236401', 'I Am a Groupie', 1970, 'Drama', 'Derek Ford, Alan Berry, Adrian Hughes', 'Derek Ford, Suzanne Mercer', 'Billy Boyle, Richard Shaw, Donald Sumpter, James Beck, Esme Johns, Bobby Parr, Eliza Terry, Paul Bacon', 'R', 'A bored teenage girl decides that she wants to meet rock stars, and the best way to do that is to become a groupie. She finds herself going on the road with a rock band called Opal Butterfly, and soon discovers that being a rock band''s groupie isn''t as glamorous or exciting as she thought it would be.', 'A bored teenage girl decides that she wants to meet rock stars, and the best way to do that is to become a groupie. She finds herself going on the road with a rock band called Opal Butterfly, and soon discovers that being a rock band''s groupie isn''t as glamorous or exciting as she thought it would be.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gyRll6rrHxVS59mGEbTRwndi8Qt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:110408'),
  ('207952392300424055', 'I Am a Hero', 2016, 'Action, Horror, Drama', 'Shinsuke Fujimoto, Shinsuke Sato, Kohei Chida', 'Akiko Nogi', 'Yo Oizumi, Kasumi Arimura, Masami Nagasawa, Hisashi Yoshizawa, Yoshinori Okada, Yuu Tokui, Nana Katase, Makita Sports', 'R', 'A man witnesses a fatal traffic accident on his way home from work, and the victim is clearly killed on impact. A moment later, when the corpse stands up and walks away, it could be a hallucination or something far more extraordinary.', 'A man witnesses a fatal traffic accident on his way home from work, and the victim is clearly killed on impact. A moment later, when the corpse stands up and walks away, it could be a hallucination or something far more extraordinary.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4RnmHtCLtbBHD9jagVlcSzJTWX6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:276624'),
  ('223177397741122601', 'I Am a Nymphomaniac', 1971, 'Drama', 'Max Pécas, Robert Lefebvre, Gaston Muller', 'Max Pécas', 'Sandra Julien, Janine Reynaud, Yves Vincent, Patrick Verde, Michel Lemoine, Alain Hitier, Bob Ingarao, Michel Charrel', null, 'A young woman falls down a staircase, and suddenly becomes... a nymphomaniac.', 'A young woman falls down a staircase, and suddenly becomes... a nymphomaniac.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5NjSrYBT42RIhbQVLBb91Rhsv1I.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:107767'),
  ('606876414419167884', 'I Am a Plaything', 2025, 'Drama, Romance', 'Lee Jung-hwan', null, 'Seung Ha, Woo Yeol, Do Hee', null, 'Hyo-min, who became a prostitute by choice, undergoes sex training to serve clients under the supervision of Kyeong-seop, the manager of the establishment. She services countless men and even learns advanced techniques directly from Kyeong-mi, who works with her. Meanwhile, Kyeong-seop gradually opens his heart as he discovers the reason behind Hyo-min''s decision to enter prostitution.', 'Hyo-min, who became a prostitute by choice, undergoes sex training to serve clients under the supervision of Kyeong-seop, the manager of the establishment. She services countless men and even learns advanced techniques directly from Kyeong-mi, who works with her. Meanwhile, Kyeong-seop gradually opens his heart as he discovers the reason behind Hyo-min''s decision to enter prostitution.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gcGlIas1pRkzNDzYklwvzaGCzzA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1501204'),
  ('1110104968050860666', 'I Am a Sex Addict', 2006, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Caveh Zahedi', 'Caveh Zahedi', 'Caveh Zahedi, Rebecca Lord, Valentine Fillol-Cordier, Alexandra Guerineaud, Anastasia Gershman, Lindsey Tjian, Bruna Matsin, Thomas Logoreci', null, 'Just moments before his third wedding, Zahedi relates with utter sincerity and astonishing candor his obsession with prostitutes. He retraces his romantic and sexual history, including his ideological commitment to open relationships, that led to two disastrous marriages and several very pissed off ex-girlfriends.', 'Just moments before his third wedding, Zahedi relates with utter sincerity and astonishing candor his obsession with prostitutes. He retraces his romantic and sexual history, including his ideological commitment to open relationships, that led to two disastrous marriages and several very pissed off ex-girlfriends.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/D9pZcSfKvUQij7x83DeIlDic1P.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17628'),
  ('554700756268944693', 'I Am a Soldier', 2015, 'Drama', 'Laurent Larivière, David Chizallet', 'Laurent Larivière, François Decodts', 'Louise Bourgoin, Jean-Hugues Anglade, Laurent Capelluto, Anne Benoît, Nina Meurisse, Nathanaël Maïni, Angelo Bison, Thomas Scimeca', null, 'A social drama about a woman who is obligated to return to her parents’ home and agrees to work for her uncle in a doghouse.', 'A social drama about a woman who is obligated to return to her parents’ home and agrees to work for her uncle in a doghouse.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uRQ8bFgYQ8o1HygTKZtKHDFHtbo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:336207'),
  ('1112133699177150495', 'I Am Afraid', 1977, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Damiano Damiani, Luigi Kuveiller', 'Nicola Badalucco, Damiano Damiani', 'Gian Maria Volonté, Erland Josephson, Mario Adorf, Angelica Ippolito, Paola Arduini, Giorgio Cerioni, Bruno Corazzari, Laura De Marchi', null, 'During a wave of political violence in Italy, a policeman who''s already survived an assassination is assigned to act as a bodyguard to a morally upright judge. He feels increasingly fearful as the links of the upper echelons of police and government to the violence become clear.', 'During a wave of political violence in Italy, a policeman who''s already survived an assassination is assigned to act as a bodyguard to a morally upright judge. He feels increasingly fearful as the links of the upper echelons of police and government to the violence become clear.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g0m6VlAczY8AoN0bOYCRUcgwt6v.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:92853'),
  ('72949577053027061', 'I Am Alfred Hitchcock', 2021, 'Documentary', 'Joel Ashton McCarthy', null, 'Alfred Hitchcock, Edgar Wright, Eli Roth, John Landis, Alexandre O. Philippe, Ann Todd, Teresa Wright, James Stewart', null, 'Interviews and archival footage weave together to tell the story of the Master of Suspense, one of the most influential and studied filmmakers in the history of cinema.', 'Interviews and archival footage weave together to tell the story of the Master of Suspense, one of the most influential and studied filmmakers in the history of cinema.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7sbUIc1pfKfjfoX3xI940oMMqXy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:826263'),
  ('584908863733352014', 'I Am Ali', 2014, 'Documentary', 'Clare Lewins, Stuart Luck', 'Clare Lewins', 'Muhammad Ali, Jim Brown, George Foreman, Tom Jones, Mike Tyson, Muhammad Ali Jnr, Hana Ali, Maryum Ali', 'PG', 'Unprecedented access to Muhammad Ali''s personal archive of "audio journals" as well as interviews and testimonials from his inner circle of family and friends are used to tell the legend''s life story.', 'Unprecedented access to Muhammad Ali''s personal archive of "audio journals" as well as interviews and testimonials from his inner circle of family and friends are used to tell the legend''s life story.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tWUhh4v5NEMQwsXMtxlCUFtMfre.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:293262'),
  ('765873323827895824', 'I Am All Girls', 2021, 'Drama, Mystery, Thriller, Crime', 'Donovan Marsh, Trevor Calverley', 'Marcell Greeff, Wayne Fitzjohn, Emile Leuvennink', 'Erica Wessels, Deon Lotz, Masasa Mbangeni, Hlubi Mboya, Lizz Meiring, Israel Makoe, Brendon Daniels, Mothusi Magano', 'NR', 'A special crimes investigator forms an unlikely bond with a serial killer to bring down a global child sex trafficking syndicate.', 'A special crimes investigator forms an unlikely bond with a serial killer to bring down a global child sex trafficking syndicate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m6bUeV4mczG3z2YXXr5XDKPsQzv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:823855'),
  ('864205074881169261', 'I Am an ESP', 1985, 'Comedy', 'Sergio Corbucci, Sergio D''Offizi, Mimmola Girosi', 'Sergio Corbucci, Bernardino Zapponi, Alberto Sordi', 'Alberto Sordi, Claudio Gora, Eleonora Brigliadori, Maurizio Micheli, Gianni Bonagura, Pippo Baudo, Elsa Martinelli, Donald Hodson', null, 'Roberto Razzi, skeptical and convinced atheist, is the conductor of the Futuro program, in which he unmasks the most common tricks and deceptions that make the miracle cry out to everyone.', 'Roberto Razzi, skeptical and convinced atheist, is the conductor of the Futuro program, in which he unmasks the most common tricks and deceptions that make the miracle cry out to everyone.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cYsejVoXtgKAY0rkEDudaNDQUxt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:59105'),
  ('1131549283739615893', 'I Am an S+M Writer', 2000, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Ryuichi Hiroki, Kazuhiro Suzuki', 'Hitoshi Ishikawa', 'Ren Osugi, Yôko Hoshi, Eri Yamazaki, Kiriko Shimizu, Jun Murakami', null, 'Kurosaki is an erotic novelist who uses his editor and a hired model to act out scenarios in his living room to use for inspiration in his writing. His wife Shizuko calls him a pervert but on the inside, she feels physically neglected. She tries to make him jealous, while also going after what she desires with someone else.', 'Kurosaki is an erotic novelist who uses his editor and a hired model to act out scenarios in his living room to use for inspiration in his writing. His wife Shizuko calls him a pervert but on the inside, she feels physically neglected. She tries to make him jealous, while also going after what she desires with someone else.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oTiTmR5EsiIrhDBtWDYcN6NH4vN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:186047'),
  ('901038410489862554', 'I Am Bolt', 2016, 'Documentary', 'Gabe Turner, Ben Turner', null, 'Usain Bolt, Neymar, Serena Williams', 'PG', 'Fully authorized, access-all-areas feature doc on the hugely charismatic and globally adored Usain Bolt – officially the fastest man alive. With never-before-seen archive footage of his youth in Jamaica, through to original footage that will be captured at his fourth and final Olympic Games in Rio, where he will compete for the gold in both the 100 and 200 metres races, for a third straight Games before his retirement in 2017. I AM BOLT will reveal the man and define the legacy of this incredible athlete.', 'Fully authorized, access-all-areas feature doc on the hugely charismatic and globally adored Usain Bolt – officially the fastest man alive. With never-before-seen archive footage of his youth in Jamaica, through to original footage that will be captured at his fourth and final Olympic Games in Rio, where he will compete for the gold in both the 100 and 200 metres races, for a third straight Games before his retirement in 2017. I AM BOLT will reveal the man and define the legacy of this incredible athlete.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ak7IufApenKjfbe2Xbg0NsuPPRa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:422469'),
  ('278914835079230786', 'I Am Bruce Lee', 2012, 'Documentary', 'Pete McCormack, Ian Kerr', 'Pete McCormack', 'Bruce Lee, Linda Lee Cadwell, Shannon Lee, Dan Inosanto, Diana Lee Inosanto, Kobe Bryant, Stephan Bonnar, Gina Carano', 'PG', 'Bruce Lee is universally recognized as the pioneer who elevated martial arts in film to an art form, and this documentary will reveal why Bruce Lee''s flame burns brighter now than the day he died over three decades ago. The greatest martial artists, athletes, actors, directors, and producers in the entertainment business today will share their feelings about the one who started it all. We will interview the people whose lives, careers, and belief systems were forever altered by the legendary "Father of Martial Arts Cinema". Rarely seen archival footage and classic photos will punctuate the personal testimonials. Prepare to be inspired.', 'Bruce Lee is universally recognized as the pioneer who elevated martial arts in film to an art form, and this documentary will reveal why Bruce Lee''s flame burns brighter now than the day he died over three decades ago. The greatest martial artists, athletes, actors, directors, and producers in the entertainment business today will share their feelings about the one who started it all. We will interview the people whose lives, careers, and belief systems were forever altered by the legendary "Father of Martial Arts Cinema". Rarely seen archival footage and classic photos will punctuate the personal testimonials. Prepare to be inspired.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xBHjCyv80m1BMHfvKi6lYqc2tk3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84383'),
  ('697277479327755314', 'I Am Chris Farley', 2015, 'Documentary', 'Brent Hodge, Derik Murray, Shaun Lawless', 'Steve Burgess', 'Chris Farley, Christina Applegate, Tom Arnold, Dan Aykroyd, Lorri Bagley, Bo Derek, Barbara Farley, John Farley', 'R', 'I am Chris Farley tells his hilarious, touching and wildly entertaining story - from his early days in Madison, Wisconsin, to his time at Second City and Saturday Night Live, then finally his film career (which included hits like Tommy Boy and Black Sheep). The film showcases his most memorable characters and skits from film and television and also includes interviews and insights from his co-stars, family and friends - including the likes of Christina Applegate, Dan Aykroyd, Mike Myers, Bob Odenkirk, Bob Saget and Adam Sandler.', 'I am Chris Farley tells his hilarious, touching and wildly entertaining story - from his early days in Madison, Wisconsin, to his time at Second City and Saturday Night Live, then finally his film career (which included hits like Tommy Boy and Black Sheep). The film showcases his most memorable characters and skits from film and television and also includes interviews and insights from his co-stars, family and friends - including the likes of Christina Applegate, Dan Aykroyd, Mike Myers, Bob Odenkirk, Bob Saget and Adam Sandler.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r3sfUmkcwGFBsToq295DjvWt6fq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:345944'),
  ('1046388236657080311', 'I Am Cuba', 1964, 'Drama', 'Mikhail Kalatozov, Sergei Urusevsky', 'Enrique Pineda Barnet, Yevgeny Yevtushenko', 'Sergio Corrieri, Salvador Wood, José Gallardo, Raúl García, Luz María Collazo, Jean Bouise, Alberto Morgan, Fausto Mirabal', null, 'Four vignettes on the lives of pre-revolutionary era Cuban people; in Havana, Maria is ashamed when a man she loves discovers how she makes a living. Pedro, an old farmer, discovers that the land he cultivates is being sold to an American company. A student sees his friends attacked by the police while they distribute leaflets supporting Fidel Castro. Finally, a peasant family is threatened by Batista''s army.', 'Four vignettes on the lives of pre-revolutionary era Cuban people; in Havana, Maria is ashamed when a man she loves discovers how she makes a living. Pedro, an old farmer, discovers that the land he cultivates is being sold to an American company. A student sees his friends attacked by the police while they distribute leaflets supporting Fidel Castro. Finally, a peasant family is threatened by Batista''s army.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qQxv27Lae6Uph7iOEzyZ5BOZxJh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32015'),
  ('1106713518213985245', 'I Am Cuba, the Siberian Mammoth', 2005, 'Documentary, History', 'Vicente Ferraz, Tareq Daoud, Vicente Ferraz', 'Vicente Ferraz', 'Othon Bastos, Alexander Calzatti, Fidel Castro, Luz María Collazo, Sergio Corrieri, Maurício do Valle, Yevgeny Yevtushenko, Vicente Ferraz', null, 'Contemporary film critics regard the epic film I Am Cuba as a modern masterpiece. The 1964 Cuban/Soviet coproduction marked a watershed moment of cultural collaboration between two nations. Yet the film never found a mass audience, languishing for decades until its reintroduction as a "classic" in the 1990s. Vicente Ferraz explores the strange history of this cinematic tour de force, and the deeper meaning for those who participated in its creation.', 'Contemporary film critics regard the epic film I Am Cuba as a modern masterpiece. The 1964 Cuban/Soviet coproduction marked a watershed moment of cultural collaboration between two nations. Yet the film never found a mass audience, languishing for decades until its reintroduction as a "classic" in the 1990s. Vicente Ferraz explores the strange history of this cinematic tour de force, and the deeper meaning for those who participated in its creation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gEsrTlSQotjxaVSbfIEsIG38Ax2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:78129'),
  ('374465825823424635', 'I Am Curious (Blue)', 1968, 'Drama', 'Vilgot Sjöman', 'Vilgot Sjöman', 'Maj Hultén, Vilgot Sjöman, Lena Nyman, Börje Ahlstedt, Sonja Lindgren, Bertil Wikström, Gunnel Broström, Hans Hellberg', null, 'The same movie with the same characters, cast and crew as I am Curious (Yellow), but with some different scenes and a different political slant. The political focus in Blue is personal relationships, religion, prisons and sex. Blue omits much of the class consciousness and non-violence interviews of the first version. Yellow and Blue are the colors of the Swedish flag.', 'The same movie with the same characters, cast and crew as I am Curious (Yellow), but with some different scenes and a different political slant. The political focus in Blue is personal relationships, religion, prisons and sex. Blue omits much of the class consciousness and non-violence interviews of the first version. Yellow and Blue are the colors of the Swedish flag.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tUXUQEbxf7MVZR9MnvQ63dnTE4h.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45690'),
  ('651581969026303699', 'I Am Curious (Yellow)', 1967, 'Drama', 'Vilgot Sjöman', 'Vilgot Sjöman', 'Lena Nyman, Vilgot Sjöman, Börje Ahlstedt, Peter Lindgren, Chris Wahlström, Magnus Nilsson, Ulla Lyttkens, Marie Göranzon', null, 'Lena, aged twenty, wants to know all she can about life and reality. She collects information on everyone and everything, storing her findings in an enormous archive. She experiments with relationships, political activism, and meditation. Meanwhile, the actors, director and crew are shown in a humorous parallel plot about the making of the film and their reactions to the story and each other. Nudity, explicit sex, and controversial politics kept this film from being shown in the US while its seizure by Customs was appealed.', 'Lena, aged twenty, wants to know all she can about life and reality. She collects information on everyone and everything, storing her findings in an enormous archive. She experiments with relationships, political activism, and meditation. Meanwhile, the actors, director and crew are shown in a humorous parallel plot about the making of the film and their reactions to the story and each other. Nudity, explicit sex, and controversial politics kept this film from being shown in the US while its seizure by Customs was appealed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oE6AI3yXNLjpt8OqmnWZNQhmoqA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42695'),
  ('166364996912817897', 'I Am David', 2003, 'Drama, Adventure', 'Paul Feig, Roman Osin', 'Paul Feig', 'Ben Tibber, Jim Caviezel, Joan Plowright, Hristo Shopov, Silvia De Santis, Paco Reconti, Roberto Attias, Francesco De Vito', 'PG', 'A 12-year-old boy manages to flee a Communist concentration camp on his own, through sheer will and determination. All he has in his possession is a loaf of bread, a letter to deliver to someone in Denmark, and a compass to help get him there.', 'A 12-year-old boy manages to flee a Communist concentration camp on his own, through sheer will and determination. All he has in his possession is a loaf of bread, a letter to deliver to someone in Denmark, and a compass to help get him there.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cPoiPR15ylyBCNIr9zmUAzEb1Jm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:15397'),
  ('990112646605360760', 'I Am Dina', 2002, 'Drama', 'Ole Bornedal, Dan Laustsen', 'Jonas Cornell, Ole Bornedal', 'Maria Bonnevie, Gérard Depardieu, Christopher Eccleston, Bjørn Floberg, Pernilla August, Amanda Jean Kvakland, Hans Matheson, Jørgen Langhelle', null, 'In Northern Norway during the 1860s, a little girl named Dina accidentally causes her mother''s death. Overcome with grief, her father refuses to raise her, leaving her in the care of the household servants. Dina grows up wild and unmanageable, with her only friend being the stable boy, Tomas. She summons her mother''s ghost and develops a strange fascination with death as well as a passion for living.', 'In Northern Norway during the 1860s, a little girl named Dina accidentally causes her mother''s death. Overcome with grief, her father refuses to raise her, leaving her in the care of the household servants. Dina grows up wild and unmanageable, with her only friend being the stable boy, Tomas. She summons her mother''s ghost and develops a strange fascination with death as well as a passion for living.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hXNkYhRm1JjxYNRylGwhHKqICmY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36561'),
  ('664156943996901221', 'I Am Divine', 2014, 'Documentary', 'Marsha Kahm, Jeffrey Schwarz', null, 'Divine, John Waters, Ricki Lake, Lisa Jane Persky, Bruce Vilanch, Mink Stole, John C. Epperson, Tab Hunter', null, 'Harris Glenn Milstead, aka Divine (1945-1988) was the ultimate outsider turned underground hero. Spitting in the face of the status quos of body image, gender identity, sexuality, and preconceived notions of beauty, Divine succeeded in becoming an internationally recognized icon, recording artist, and character actor of stage and screen. Glenn went from the often-mocked, schoolyard fat kid to underdog royalty, standing up for millions of gay men and women, drag queens and punk rockers, and countless other socially ostracized misfits and freaks. With a completely committed in-your-face style, he blurred the line between performer and personality, and revolutionized pop culture.', 'Harris Glenn Milstead, aka Divine (1945-1988) was the ultimate outsider turned underground hero. Spitting in the face of the status quos of body image, gender identity, sexuality, and preconceived notions of beauty, Divine succeeded in becoming an internationally recognized icon, recording artist, and character actor of stage and screen. Glenn went from the often-mocked, schoolyard fat kid to underdog royalty, standing up for millions of gay men and women, drag queens and punk rockers, and countless other socially ostracized misfits and freaks. With a completely committed in-your-face style, he blurred the line between performer and personality, and revolutionized pop culture.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dVu4I4UPVJOY8LuW6fPojgSQUpL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:171910'),
  ('608941509345181583', 'I Am Dragon', 2015, 'Fantasy, Romance', 'Indar Dzhendubaev, Simon Finley, Igor Tsay', 'Roman Nepomnyashchiy, Serhiy Dyachenko, Marina Dyachenko', 'Mariya Poezzhaeva, Matvey Lykov, Stanislav Lyubshin, Pyotr Romanov, Andrey Lebedinsky, Aleksandr Luchinin, Viktoriya Runtsova, Marta Timofeeva', 'NR', 'In the midst of the wedding princess Miroslava is kidnapped by a dragon and carried away into his castle on the remote island. Mira left everything behind in the past - family, friends and groom. Now the only things she had were a stone cage and a mysterious young man named Arman ... but who is he and what is he doing on that island? Miroslava will know the truth too late: loving a dragon will reveal the bitter truth - love is scary.', 'In the midst of the wedding princess Miroslava is kidnapped by a dragon and carried away into his castle on the remote island. Mira left everything behind in the past - family, friends and groom. Now the only things she had were a stone cage and a mysterious young man named Arman ... but who is he and what is he doing on that island? Miroslava will know the truth too late: loving a dragon will reveal the bitter truth - love is scary.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9R9mwkXs0W78WMzh4M1yFP7v7RP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:370964'),
  ('528002774641157980', 'I Am Frankelda', 2025, 'Animation, Family, Fantasy, Horror', 'Arturo Ambriz, Roy Ambriz, Fernanda G. Manzur', 'Roy Ambriz, Arturo Ambriz', 'Mireya Mendoza, Arturo Mercado Jr., Luis Leonardo Suarez, Gaby Cárdenas, Beto Castillo, Magda Giner, Carlos Segundo, Idzi Dutkiewicz', null, 'Frankelda, a frustrated young Mexican writer from the 19th Century, travels in the form of a ghost to a kingdom of her own invention inhabited by Spooks, which are all the monstrous characters she created in her horror tales. Her guide is Herneval, the Prince of Spooks, who takes her to help him save the balance between the Realm of Fiction and the Realm of Existence by using her talent as a writer.', 'Frankelda, a frustrated young Mexican writer from the 19th Century, travels in the form of a ghost to a kingdom of her own invention inhabited by Spooks, which are all the monstrous characters she created in her horror tales. Her guide is Herneval, the Prince of Spooks, who takes her to help him save the balance between the Realm of Fiction and the Realm of Existence by using her talent as a writer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hDzllxB1TQ7uUxVvjnGHirJJovt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1119090'),
  ('1052203379951055356', 'I Am Free', 1959, 'Drama', 'Mahmoud Nasr, Salah Abu Seif, Ahmed El-Sabawy', 'Naguib Mahfouz', 'Lobna Abdel Aziz, Shoukry Sarhan, Zouzou Nabil, Hussein Reyaad, Kamal Yasseen, Layla Karim, Hassan Youssef, Mohamed Abdel Koudouss', null, 'Part of a trilogy by Salah Abu Seif about women’s empowerment. The film takes place in late 1940s / early 1950s urban Egypt, and tells the story of a young woman’s search for personal freedom and a fulfilling identity as a young modern Egyptian.', 'Part of a trilogy by Salah Abu Seif about women’s empowerment. The film takes place in late 1940s / early 1950s urban Egypt, and tells the story of a young woman’s search for personal freedom and a fulfilling identity as a young modern Egyptian.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yN2JHQylYQSs8aG7cqK40BjzKde.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:327811'),
  ('199159851025731903', 'I Am Frigid... Why?', 1972, 'Drama', 'Max Pécas, Robert Renzulli, Robert Lefebvre', 'Max Pécas', 'Sandra Julien, Marie-Georges Pascal, Catherine Wagener, Jean-Luc Terrade, Anne Kerylen, Thierry Murzeau, Virginie Vignon, Robert Lombard', 'NR', 'Sultry Sandra Julien stars as a teenage virgin who is traumatized after being raped by her 2 "friends", a young man and his sister, leaving her with no interest in sex. Discouraged, she embarks on a journey of sexual awakening in hopes of curing herself.', 'Sultry Sandra Julien stars as a teenage virgin who is traumatized after being raped by her 2 "friends", a young man and his sister, leaving her with no interest in sex. Discouraged, she embarks on a journey of sexual awakening in hopes of curing herself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iAIGe7ulMb9BXExxfLyAaKj55wb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:214377'),
  ('234800395436175012', 'I Am Greta', 2020, 'Documentary', 'Nathan Grossman, Nathan Grossman', 'Nathan Grossman', 'Greta Thunberg, Svante Thunberg, Niclas Svenningsen, Arnold Schwarzenegger, António Guterres, Kyra Gantois, Adélaïde Charlier, Anuna De Wever', null, 'Greta Thunberg, a 15-year-old student in Sweden, started a school strike for the climate as her question for adults was, if you don’t care about my future on earth, why should I care about my future in school? Within months, her strike evolved into a global movement as the quiet teenage girl on the autism spectrum becomes a world-famous activist.', 'Greta Thunberg, a 15-year-old student in Sweden, started a school strike for the climate as her question for adults was, if you don’t care about my future on earth, why should I care about my future in school? Within months, her strike evolved into a global movement as the quiet teenage girl on the autism spectrum becomes a world-famous activist.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xTCduzgBJ57ZzMM9MOyBPpauB9t.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:728123'),
  ('1014898247381023234', 'I Am Guilty', 2005, 'Drama', 'Christoph Hochhäusler, Bernhard Keller', 'Christoph Hochhäusler', 'Constantin von Jascheroff, Manfred Zapatka, Victoria Trauttmansdorff, Nora Waldstätten, Devid Striesow, Florian Panzner, Thomas Dannemann, Laura Tonke', null, 'Armin Steeb is adrift: just finished with school, living with his middle-class parents, clueless about finding work. He tries connecting with a girl, he engages in risky sex with strangers in public toilets, he goes to job interviews. He also sends an anonymous letter to a local Munich newspaper, claiming responsibility for a fatal road accident. He fitfully pursues notoriety as he goes through life nearly without affect. What will it take to get Armin to smile?', 'Armin Steeb is adrift: just finished with school, living with his middle-class parents, clueless about finding work. He tries connecting with a girl, he engages in risky sex with strangers in public toilets, he goes to job interviews. He also sends an anonymous letter to a local Munich newspaper, claiming responsibility for a fatal road accident. He fitfully pursues notoriety as he goes through life nearly without affect. What will it take to get Armin to smile?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zjLHv41CbjgusaWgppUoAqNg2Ok.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64509'),
  ('295812424464851512', 'I Am Happiness on Earth', 2014, 'Drama', 'Julián Hernández', 'Julián Hernández, Ulises Pérez Mancilla', 'Hugo Catalán, Alan Ramírez, Emilio von Sternerfels, Gerardo del Razo, Gabino Rodríguez, Andrea Portal, Iván Álvarez, Rocío Reyes', 'NR', 'Emiliano looks at his life with the eyes of a film director, mixing the objective reality with the processes of the artistic creation. The story he is filming flounders with his daily life, until his world is trapped in the lens of his camera. Confused, always alone and in front of a screen, now become a transfigured reality, but at the same time a measurable, controllable and manipulable one, he listens in loop to a song: one of those songs you sing or repeat as a prayer and forcing you to remember, believe and convince yourself.', 'Emiliano looks at his life with the eyes of a film director, mixing the objective reality with the processes of the artistic creation. The story he is filming flounders with his daily life, until his world is trapped in the lens of his camera. Confused, always alone and in front of a screen, now become a transfigured reality, but at the same time a measurable, controllable and manipulable one, he listens in loop to a song: one of those songs you sing or repeat as a prayer and forcing you to remember, believe and convince yourself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cQTvikCzdArLcDDhPRZK4g6OkKZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:202456'),
  ('20554049997499863', 'I Am Heath Ledger', 2017, 'Documentary', 'Derik Murray, Shaun Lawless, Adrian Buitenhuis', 'Hart Snider', 'Heath Ledger, Kate Ledger, Kim Ledger, Olivia Ledger, Ben Mendelsohn, Naomi Watts, Djimon Hounsou, Catherine Hardwicke', null, 'The life and career of an actor, artist, and icon. His own journey through his own camera.', 'The life and career of an actor, artist, and icon. His own journey through his own camera.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/96ScsrVx2tAlWuiZYgqwcuGYdYK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:450945'),
  ('871866306502801618', 'I Am Here', 2015, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Anders Morgenthaler, Sturla Brandth Grøvlen', 'Anders Morgenthaler', 'Kim Basinger, Jordan Prentice, Sebastian Schipper, Peter Stormare, Robert Hunger-Bühler, Anouk Wagener, Nina Fog, Norman Hacker', null, 'Successful businesswoman Maria has achieved everything except what she wants the most - a baby of her own. She decides to deal with the matter by herself and embarks on a desperate and dangerous journey in order to make her dream come true.', 'Successful businesswoman Maria has achieved everything except what she wants the most - a baby of her own. She decides to deal with the matter by herself and embarks on a desperate and dangerous journey in order to make her dream come true.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yA06Duc3TgvDvIJn72sOB0G19mH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:289191'),
  ('208941114023848454', 'I Am Here....Now', 2009, 'Fantasy, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Neil Breen', 'Neil Breen', 'Neil Breen, Joy Senn, Elizabeth Sekora, Tommie Vegas, George Gingerelli, Maraud Ford, Gunter Nezhoda, Eduard Osipov', 'NR', 'An Alien Being from another universe lands on earth and is angered at how the human species live in a world of greed, corruption, lies, violence and a disregard for the natural environment. The Being takes it upon itself to eliminate the politicians, lawyers, criminals, corporate leaders, and others who disrespect the planet... That The Being has created as a planetary experiment. This thought provoking supernatural film is filled with surprising mystical metaphors, exciting twists... And a stunning dramatic conclusion.', 'An Alien Being from another universe lands on earth and is angered at how the human species live in a world of greed, corruption, lies, violence and a disregard for the natural environment. The Being takes it upon itself to eliminate the politicians, lawyers, criminals, corporate leaders, and others who disrespect the planet... That The Being has created as a planetary experiment. This thought provoking supernatural film is filled with surprising mystical metaphors, exciting twists... And a stunning dramatic conclusion.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fV8ki6kE70yjlJTLoO87Fj6xTui.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:99847'),
  ('1107870726614202208', 'I Am Jane Doe', 2017, 'Crime, Documentary', 'Mary Mazzio, Joe Grasso', 'Mary Mazzio', 'Jessica Chastain', 'NR', 'Chronicles the epic battle that several American mothers are waging on behalf of their middle-school daughters, victims of sex-trafficking on Backpage.com, the adult classifieds section that for years was part of the Village Voice.', 'Chronicles the epic battle that several American mothers are waging on behalf of their middle-school daughters, victims of sex-trafficking on Backpage.com, the adult classifieds section that for years was part of the Village Voice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cQw2jh60Ey3zY90B8965JRclKQ2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:430448'),
  ('1073147921587183141', 'I Am Jonas', 2018, 'Drama, Romance, TV Movie', 'Pierre Baboin, Christophe Charrier', 'Christophe Charrier', 'Félix Maritaud, Nicolas Bauwens, Tommy Lee Baïk, Aure Atika, Ilian Bergala, Marie Denarnaud, Pierre Cartonnet, Nicolas Sartous', null, 'When Jonas was 14 he met the charismatic but mysterious Nathan. In addition to guiding him in grappling with his sexuality, Jonas soon confronts something dark and even dangerous about his new friend. Now an attractive, sexually assured adult, memories from this time still haunt Jonas.', 'When Jonas was 14 he met the charismatic but mysterious Nathan. In addition to guiding him in grappling with his sexuality, Jonas soon confronts something dark and even dangerous about his new friend. Now an attractive, sexually assured adult, memories from this time still haunt Jonas.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3UwFTMoxyOIbuzaxhB205bN2oxc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:548537'),
  ('1131478425274758855', 'I Am Kalam', 2010, 'Comedy, Drama, Family', 'Nila Madhab Panda', 'Deepak Venkateshan, Sanjay Chauhan, Nila Madhab Panda', 'Gulshan Grover, Harsh Mayar, Hussan Saad, Pitobash, Beatrice Ordeix', null, 'The film celebrates the survival of the human spirit against overwhelming odds and highlights the need for underprivileged children''s education. Its a film based on former indian president A.P.J. Abdul Kalam and is aimed at inspiring the poor to educate their children. Written by DaGambit Chhotu''s peasant village is ruined by drought, so his ma drops the boy with uncle Bhati, who runs a tea stand at the city outskirts. Clever Chottu, who calls himself Kalam after the self-made Indian president, soon outsmarts uncle''s adult assistant and makes friends with the loneliest boy in the palace, now a hotel, a prince his age.', 'The film celebrates the survival of the human spirit against overwhelming odds and highlights the need for underprivileged children''s education. Its a film based on former indian president A.P.J. Abdul Kalam and is aimed at inspiring the poor to educate their children. Written by DaGambit Chhotu''s peasant village is ruined by drought, so his ma drops the boy with uncle Bhati, who runs a tea stand at the city outskirts. Clever Chottu, who calls himself Kalam after the self-made Indian president, soon outsmarts uncle''s adult assistant and makes friends with the loneliest boy in the palace, now a hotel, a prince his age.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zCl7XBbx8MfPFngcREwGH35J4yo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:71562'),
  ('643588289541897334', 'I Am Keiko', 1997, 'Drama', 'Sion Sono, Won Onling, Noriaki Nagashima', 'Sion Sono', 'Keiko Suzuki', null, 'Keiko Suzuki is a lonely waitress in Tokyo. Her father passes away of cancer and she becomes obsessed with the passage of time. And so, three weeks before her 22nd birthday, she decides to record this period of time in the most accurate way possible, regardless of how lonely or banal this record ends up being.', 'Keiko Suzuki is a lonely waitress in Tokyo. Her father passes away of cancer and she becomes obsessed with the passage of time. And so, three weeks before her 22nd birthday, she decides to record this period of time in the most accurate way possible, regardless of how lonely or banal this record ends up being.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hFJmuSMTz6loVlAGEaey7SEAtp6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:119332'),
  ('165142630649556558', 'I Am Legend', 2007, 'Drama, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Francis Lawrence, Andrew Lesnie, Jeffrey Wetzel', 'Joyce Hooper Corrington, John William Corrington', 'Will Smith, Alice Braga, Charlie Tahan, Dash Mihok, Salli Richardson-Whitfield, Willow Smith, Emma Thompson, Darrell Foster', 'PG-13', 'Robert Neville is a scientist who was unable to stop the spread of the terrible virus that was incurable and man-made. Immune, Neville is now the last human survivor in what is left of New York City and perhaps the world. For three years, Neville has faithfully sent out daily radio messages, desperate to find any other survivors who might be out there. But he is not alone.', 'Robert Neville is a scientist who was unable to stop the spread of the terrible virus that was incurable and man-made. Immune, Neville is now the last human survivor in what is left of New York City and perhaps the world. For three years, Neville has faithfully sent out daily radio messages, desperate to find any other survivors who might be out there. But he is not alone.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iPDkaSdKk2jRLTM65UOEoKtsIZ8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:6479'),
  ('332716457061010151', 'I Am Legend 2', null, 'Science Fiction, Thriller', null, 'Mark Protosevich', 'Will Smith, Michael B. Jordan', null, 'A sequel to the 2007 film. Plot TBA.', 'A sequel to the 2007 film. Plot TBA.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pbanWJqAMYHisP1P0RRKMqxccwG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:945956'),
  ('1083275637243948402', 'I Am Lisa', 2020, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Patrick Rea', 'Eric Winkler', 'Kristen Vaganos, Manon Halliburton, Carmen Anello, Jennifer Seward-DeRock, Chris Bylsma, Cinnamon Schultz, Sarah McGuire', null, 'A vicious and corrupt small-town sheriff and her deputies brutalise Lisa and leave her for dead in the nearby woods. There she is bitten by a werewolf and bestowed with supernatural abilities. Can Lisa retain her humanity as she exacts revenge and cedes herself more and more to the wolf side of her personality?', 'A vicious and corrupt small-town sheriff and her deputies brutalise Lisa and leave her for dead in the nearby woods. There she is bitten by a werewolf and bestowed with supernatural abilities. Can Lisa retain her humanity as she exacts revenge and cedes herself more and more to the wolf side of her personality?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eJNGwVjAJtKXp9SqEJY9rmMlFqN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:728773'),
  ('1067131198174349367', 'I Am Love', 2010, 'Drama, Romance', 'Luca Guadagnino, Yorick Le Saux, Ferdinando Cito Filomarino', 'Luca Guadagnino, Barbara Alberti, Ivan Cotroneo', 'Tilda Swinton, Flavio Parenti, Edoardo Gabbriellini, Alba Rohrwacher, Pippo Delbono, Maria Paiato, Diane Fleri, Waris Ahluwalia', 'R', 'Emma has left Russia to live with her husband in Italy. Now a member of a powerful industrial family, she is the respected mother of three, but feels unfulfilled. One day, Antonio, a talented chef and her son''s friend, makes her senses kindle.', 'Emma has left Russia to live with her husband in Italy. Now a member of a powerful industrial family, she is the respected mother of three, but feels unfulfilled. One day, Antonio, a talented chef and her son''s friend, makes her senses kindle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ss57QaZX5OE3YxoTZeKW5Y6U83S.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41110'),
  ('122654931716333527', 'I Am Mary Jo Buttafuoco', 2026, 'Biography, Drama, Thriller, TV Movie, Crime', 'Heather Hawthorn-Doyle, Diego Lozano, Heather Hawthorn Doyle', 'Greg McBride', 'Chloe Lanier, Dillon Casey, Amara Sanoy, Indy Lesage, Madelyn Grace', 'Not Rated', 'For the first time ever, Mary Jo Buttafuoco tells her story in her own words. In May 1992, outside her Long Island home, Mary Jo was shot in the head by 17-year-old Amy Fisher - the mistress of her husband, Joey Buttafuoco.', 'For the first time ever, Mary Jo Buttafuoco tells her story in her own words. In May 1992, outside her Long Island home, Mary Jo was shot in the head by 17-year-old Amy Fisher - the mistress of her husband, Joey Buttafuoco.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fmetadata-static.plex.tv%2F7%2Fgracenote%2F74ed605dcd7720ef102df48dd433dc25.jpg', 'plex:movie:i-am-mary-jo-buttafuoco'),
  ('119161392435669712', 'I Am Michael', 2015, 'Drama', 'Justin Kelly, Christopher Blauvelt', 'Justin Kelly, Stacey Miller, Benoit Denizet Lewis', 'James Franco, Zachary Quinto, Emma Roberts, Daryl Hannah, Lesley Ann Warren, Avan Jogia, Charlie Carver, Devon Graye', null, 'The controversial true story of a gay activist who rejects his homosexuality and becomes a Christian pastor.', 'The controversial true story of a gay activist who rejects his homosexuality and becomes a Christian pastor.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sO9Z55Js4sEuXXe9qQjCULiPjg8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:291869'),
  ('132210503469120388', 'I Am Mortal', 2021, 'Science Fiction, Fantasy, Drama', 'Tony Aloupis', 'Tony Aloupis', 'Sean Gunn, Lauren Lindsey Donzis, Nina Kiri, Abraham Lewis, Eloise Smyth, Jan Uddin, Nash Grier', null, 'Set 200 years in the future, a small band of rebels face off against the status quo where humans have achieved immortality through genetic engineering', 'Set 200 years in the future, a small band of rebels face off against the status quo where humans have achieved immortality through genetic engineering', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3ZNbjTwJ36alybDWu7yKyMwXhGp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:919269'),
  ('810669493036628331', 'I Am Mother', 2019, 'Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Kelvin Munro, Grant Sputore, Sophie Calver', 'Michael Lloyd Green', 'Clara Rugaard, Rose Byrne, Hilary Swank, Luke Hawker, Tahlia Sturzaker, Maddie Lenton, Hazel Sandery, Summer Lenton', 'PG-13', 'A teenage girl is raised underground by a robot "Mother", designed to repopulate the earth following an extinction event. But their unique bond is threatened when an inexplicable stranger arrives with alarming news.', 'A teenage girl is raised underground by a robot "Mother", designed to repopulate the earth following an extinction event. But their unique bond is threatened when an inexplicable stranger arrives with alarming news.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ayPSqlpYIbeq1RiDekx6W9WUqrL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:505948'),
  ('653826234953756475', 'I Am Nevenka', 2024, 'Drama, History', 'Icíar Bollaín, Gris Jordana, Guadalupe Balaguer Trelles', 'Icíar Bollaín, Isa Campo', 'Mireia Oriol, Urko Olazábal, Ricardo Gómez, Lucía Veiga, Font García, Martxelo Rubio, Carlos Serrano, Luis Moreno', null, 'In the year 2000, Nevenka Fernández, 24 years old, Councilor for Finance in the Ponferrada City Council, suffered relentless persecution, both sentimental and professional, by the mayor, a man accustomed to doing his will politically and personally. She never decides to report, although she knows that she will have to pay a very high price: her environment does not support her, the society of Ponferrada turns its back on her and the media subjects her to a public trial. A story inspired by real events that turns its protagonist into a pioneer by taking an influential and popular politician to court for sexual and workplace harassment for the first time.', 'In the year 2000, Nevenka Fernández, 24 years old, Councilor for Finance in the Ponferrada City Council, suffered relentless persecution, both sentimental and professional, by the mayor, a man accustomed to doing his will politically and personally. She never decides to report, although she knows that she will have to pay a very high price: her environment does not support her, the society of Ponferrada turns its back on her and the media subjects her to a public trial. A story inspired by real events that turns its protagonist into a pioneer by taking an influential and popular politician to court for sexual and workplace harassment for the first time.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aE2lnlUhXaD3enmbxAmgGjb3MPS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1235922'),
  ('790035345086714634', 'I Am Not a Serial Killer', 2016, 'Horror, Mystery, Crime', 'Billy O''Brien, Robbie Ryan', 'Billy O''Brien, Christopher Hyde', 'Max Records, Christopher Lloyd, Laura Fraser, Christina Baldwin, Karl Geary, Dee Noah, Lucy Lawton, Anna Sundberg', 'NR', 'In a small Midwestern town, a troubled teen with homicidal tendencies must hunt down and destroy a supernatural killer while keeping his own inner demons at bay.', 'In a small Midwestern town, a troubled teen with homicidal tendencies must hunt down and destroy a supernatural killer while keeping his own inner demons at bay.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/KXLopjRCCGRaKPMUndVoT9zKsl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:381034'),
  ('806971924985298499', 'I Am Not a Witch', 2017, 'Drama', 'Rungano Nyoni, David Gallego', 'Rungano Nyoni', 'Maggie Mulubwa, Henry B.J. Phiri, Gloria Huwiler, Nellie Munamonga, Dyna Mufuni, Nancy Murilo, Ritah Mubanga, Chileshe Kalimamukwento', null, 'Convicted of witchcraft, 8-year-old Shula is brought to live in a penal colony where witches do hard labour in service of the government.', 'Convicted of witchcraft, 8-year-old Shula is brought to live in a penal colony where witches do hard labour in service of the government.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tWkbuUHugbckItwcyCf8uq1utOJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:449757'),
  ('1042727029764031252', 'I Am Not an Easy Man', 2018, 'Comedy, Fantasy', 'Pénélope Pourriat, Marie Doller, Jérôme Roumagne', 'Ariane Fert, Eléonore Pourriat', 'Vincent Elbaz, Marie-Sophie Ferdane, Pierre Bénézit, Blanche Gardin, Christèle Tual, Rémi Gérard, Olivier Pajot, Moon Dailly', null, 'The chauvinist Damien wakes up in a world where women and men have their roles reversed in society, and everything is dominated by women.', 'The chauvinist Damien wakes up in a world where women and men have their roles reversed in society, and everything is dominated by women.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fPPT1MDkvY4XvzbHTd2DsL7qH7S.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:515841'),
  ('173483795197743938', 'I Am Not Him', 2013, 'Drama', 'Tayfun Pirselimoğlu, Andreas Sinanos', 'Tayfun Pirselimoğlu', 'Ercan Kesal, Maryam Zaree, Rıza Akın, Nihat Alptekin, Mehmet Avcı, Sencar Sağdıç, Nikos Moustakas', null, 'Nihat, an introverted employee in a hospital cafeteria, is confused by Ayşe, a mysterious woman who just started working there as a dishwasher. Her obvious seductive approaches embarrass Nihat and make him nervous at the same time. Despite the rumors about her husband having been sentenced to many years in jail, Nihat reluctantly accepts Ayşe’s invitation to dinner at her house. This is the beginning of a strange and dangerous liaison. When Nihat discovers a picture of the woman’s husband and realizes that he looks astoundingly like him, the relation becomes even more toxic.', 'Nihat, an introverted employee in a hospital cafeteria, is confused by Ayşe, a mysterious woman who just started working there as a dishwasher. Her obvious seductive approaches embarrass Nihat and make him nervous at the same time. Despite the rumors about her husband having been sentenced to many years in jail, Nihat reluctantly accepts Ayşe’s invitation to dinner at her house. This is the beginning of a strange and dangerous liaison. When Nihat discovers a picture of the woman’s husband and realizes that he looks astoundingly like him, the relation becomes even more toxic.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/minH3mw9tCgLovJCMi45gESmlr8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:241187'),
  ('290259128365299960', 'I Am Not Madame Bovary', 2016, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Feng Xiaogang, Luo Pan', 'Liu Zhenyun', 'Fan Bingbing, Zhang Jiayi, Guo Tao, Dong Chengpeng, Zhang Yi, Yu Hewei, Li Zonghan, Tian Xiaojie', null, 'Li Xuelian, a woman from the countryside is falsely accused by her husband of having an affair. To defend herself, Li moves from her small town to the big city until she reached the capital.', 'Li Xuelian, a woman from the countryside is falsely accused by her husband of having an affair. To defend herself, Li moves from her small town to the big city until she reached the capital.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hc8OG5TGeyFhbezPNKNgmEUhWK3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:400114'),
  ('1019680125600656563', 'I Am Not That', 2024, 'Comedy, Romance', 'María Ripoll, Joan Bordera, Elisa Sirvent', 'Olga Iglesias, María Ripoll', 'Verónica Echegui, Silma López, Adam Jezierski, Olivia Molina, Ángela Molina, Daniel Grao, Anna Alarcón, Mara Reina', null, 'Susana wakes up after 20 years in a coma. Now a 90s teenager in a 21st century woman''s body, Susana will have to navigate a world in which nothing is familiar to her and she will have to learn to live in it.', 'Susana wakes up after 20 years in a coma. Now a 90s teenager in a 21st century woman''s body, Susana will have to navigate a world in which nothing is familiar to her and she will have to learn to live in it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/boO67d8MCPwtLR9fRFWfDjMvpz9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1235913'),
  ('982949961500991284', 'I Am Not What I Am - The Tragedy of Othello by W. Shakespeare', 2024, 'Drama', 'Marco Bassano, Edoardo Leo', 'Edoardo Leo', 'Edoardo Leo, Javad Moraqib, Ambrosia Caldarelli, Antonia Truppo, Matteo Olivetti, Michael Schermi, Vittorio Viviani', null, 'Shakespeare’s Othello is revisited exactly as it was written, brought into the present through the power of dialect alone. Iago, Othello, and Desdemona are regrettably still among us, in contemporary events told through a great classic. Set in the early 2000s, it is a timeless story where good and evil intertwine in a maelstrom of deceit, betrayal and mad jealousy.', 'Shakespeare’s Othello is revisited exactly as it was written, brought into the present through the power of dialect alone. Iago, Othello, and Desdemona are regrettably still among us, in contemporary events told through a great classic. Set in the early 2000s, it is a timeless story where good and evil intertwine in a maelstrom of deceit, betrayal and mad jealousy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/osOS0h8I7wnwtWq66yiy0E1fjt7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:802312'),
  ('1041522650498786175', 'I Am Not Your Negro', 2017, 'Documentary', 'Raoul Peck, Bill Ross, Henry Adebonojo', 'James Baldwin, Raoul Peck', 'Samuel L. Jackson, JoeyStarr, Arnold Schwarzenegger, Billy Dee Williams, Rod Steiger', 'R', 'Working from the text of James Baldwin’s unfinished final novel, director Raoul Peck creates a meditation on what it means to be Black in the United States.', 'Working from the text of James Baldwin’s unfinished final novel, director Raoul Peck creates a meditation on what it means to be Black in the United States.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zwd0Zti7BvY1mO0mTPzM0fRrtc6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:411019'),
  ('886361806813951147', 'I Am Number Four', 2011, 'Action, Thriller, Science Fiction, Adventure', 'D.J. Caruso, Guillermo Navarro, Allen Kupetsky', 'Alfred Gough, Miles Millar, Marti Noxon', 'Alex Pettyfer, Dianna Agron, Teresa Palmer, Timothy Olyphant, Kevin Durand, Callan McAuliffe, Jake Abel, Garrett M. Brown', 'PG-13', 'A teenage fugitive with an incredible secret races to stay one step ahead of the mysterious forces seeking destroy him in this sci-fi action thriller. With three dead and one on the run, the race to find the elusive Number Four begins. Outwardly normal teen John Smith never gets too comfortable in the same identity, and along with his guardian, Henri, he is constantly moving from town to town. With each passing day, John gains a stronger grasp on his extraordinary new powers, and his bond to the beings that share his fantastic fate grows stronger.', 'A teenage fugitive with an incredible secret races to stay one step ahead of the mysterious forces seeking destroy him in this sci-fi action thriller. With three dead and one on the run, the race to find the elusive Number Four begins. Outwardly normal teen John Smith never gets too comfortable in the same identity, and along with his guardian, Henri, he is constantly moving from town to town. With each passing day, John gains a stronger grasp on his extraordinary new powers, and his bond to the beings that share his fantastic fate grows stronger.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2NrP3h3GEsrPXX60bmjKuYWAvl9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46529'),
  ('706322621111961693', 'I Am Omega', 2007, 'Action, Horror, Science Fiction', 'Griff Furst, Alexander Yellen', 'Geoff Meed', 'Mark Dacascos, Geoff Meed, Jennifer Lee Wiggins, Ryan Lloyd, Joshua Schlegel, Gregory Paul Smith, Lara Jean Chorostecki', 'PG-13', 'In post apocalyptic LA, being rampaged by zombie like cannibals humans that have some kind of genetic infection, local man Renchard is forced to live a daily struggle as he tries to locate radio signals and find a cure.', 'In post apocalyptic LA, being rampaged by zombie like cannibals humans that have some kind of genetic infection, local man Renchard is forced to live a daily struggle as he tries to locate radio signals and find a cure.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dIAI4G7E8bS5Ofbwkjclm1WMpUX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30778'),
  ('53372010033553547', 'I Am Paul Walker', 2018, 'Documentary', 'Adrian Buitenhuis', 'Adrian Buitenhuis', 'Paul Walker, Tyrese Gibson, Cody Walker, Caleb Walker, Rob Cohen, Erik MacArthur, Oakley Lehman, Wayne Kramer', null, 'Exploring the life and legacy of actor Paul Walker, the Southern California native who cut his teeth as child actor before breaking out in the blockbuster Fast and Furious franchise.', 'Exploring the life and legacy of actor Paul Walker, the Southern California native who cut his teeth as child actor before breaking out in the blockbuster Fast and Furious franchise.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nTBWHgO4GPpxxDv9vgz9C1Ib2ym.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:538161'),
  ('1057908642072093727', 'I Am Rage', 2023, 'Action', 'David Ryan Keith, Jon Schweigart, Travis Brown', 'David Ryan Keith, Stephen Durham', 'Hannaj Bang Bendz, Marta Svetek, Derek Nelson, Antonia Whillans, Jamie B. Chambers, Luke Aquilina, Debbie Sheridan, Niko Foster', null, 'An ancient cult embroiled in a sinister blood trade makes the deadly mistake of abducting a young woman with a violent, shocking past.', 'An ancient cult embroiled in a sinister blood trade makes the deadly mistake of abducting a young woman with a violent, shocking past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tnsioPDTf5qXWFIkMvFc1HtKaHz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1135229'),
  ('1108189902725313035', 'I Am Ready, Warden', 2024, 'Documentary', 'Rafael Roy, Smriti Mundhra', null, 'John Henry Ramirez, Aaron Castro, Jan Trujillo, Mark Gonzalez', null, 'In the days leading up to his execution, Texas death row prisoner John Henry Ramirez seeks redemption from his victim''s son; an elegy about the death penalty where a prisoner seeks forgiveness.', 'In the days leading up to his execution, Texas death row prisoner John Henry Ramirez seeks redemption from his victim''s son; an elegy about the death penalty where a prisoner seeks forgiveness.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6ZxytXnqptGAwOrUNMHHaFXJYHy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1300245'),
  ('888645710367692771', 'I Am Sam', 2001, 'Drama', 'Jessie Nelson, Lisa Demaine, Elliot Davis', 'Jessie Nelson, Kristine Johnson', 'Sean Penn, Michelle Pfeiffer, Dianne Wiest, Dakota Fanning, Richard Schiff, Loretta Devine, Marin Hinkle, Laura Dern', 'PG-13', 'Sam, a neurodivergent man, has a daughter with a homeless woman who abandons them when they leave the hospital, leaving Sam to raise Lucy on his own. But as Lucy grows up, Sam''s limitations as a parent start to become a problem and the authorities take her away. Sam convinces high-priced lawyer Rita to take his case pro bono and in turn teaches her the value of love and family.', 'Sam, a neurodivergent man, has a daughter with a homeless woman who abandons them when they leave the hospital, leaving Sam to raise Lucy on his own. But as Lucy grows up, Sam''s limitations as a parent start to become a problem and the authorities take her away. Sam convinces high-priced lawyer Rita to take his case pro bono and in turn teaches her the value of love and family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8n8BTMIRPKT0KZKSa0nACG9cQ8O.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10950'),
  ('800394224616582603', 'I Am Santa Claus', 2021, 'Comedy', 'Maurizio Calvesi, Edoardo Falcone', 'Edoardo Falcone', 'Marco Giallini, Gigi Proietti, Barbara Ronchi, Daniele Pecci, Antonio Gerardi, Massimo Vanni, Simone Colombari, Natalia Magni', null, 'Ettore has spent the last five years in jail for a robbery. Once out of prison, he has nowhere to go, his wife broke up with him and doesn’t want him to meet their little daughter who was born right before he was arrested. Alone and desperate, Ettore roams the streets of Rome and meets a strange old man, Nicola. He decides to take advantage of him and rob him. But after breaking into his house, Ettore realizes Nicola doesn’t have anything worth stealing and furthermore, the old man tells him a rather stranger thing: he affirms to be Santa Claus…', 'Ettore has spent the last five years in jail for a robbery. Once out of prison, he has nowhere to go, his wife broke up with him and doesn’t want him to meet their little daughter who was born right before he was arrested. Alone and desperate, Ettore roams the streets of Rome and meets a strange old man, Nicola. He decides to take advantage of him and rob him. But after breaking into his house, Ettore realizes Nicola doesn’t have anything worth stealing and furthermore, the old man tells him a rather stranger thing: he affirms to be Santa Claus…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z0i7kOzu4z6tx8tsqpwwjQBjofp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:658287'),
  ('599758414089875575', 'I Am Sartana Your Angel of Death', 1969, 'Western, Mystery', 'Giuliano Carnimeo', 'Enzo Dell''Aquila, Tito Carpi', 'Gianni Garko, Klaus Kinski, Frank Wolff, Gordon Mitchell, Ettore Manni, Sal Borgese, Renato Baldini, Federico Boido', null, 'Sartana is falsely accused of robbing a bank, and must find the real robbers and clear his name.', 'Sartana is falsely accused of robbing a bank, and must find the real robbers and clear his name.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aYBBwWdGATZ5xb4GppCiPvuP8YV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:64650'),
  ('251986172646396413', 'I Am Self-Sufficient', 1976, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Nanni Moretti, Fabio Sposini, Andrea Parlatore', 'Nanni Moretti', 'Nanni Moretti, Simona Frosi, Andrea Pozzi, Fabio Traversa, Beniamino Placido, Giorgio Viterbo, Paolo Zaccagnini', null, 'Michele Apicella lives in Rome, in an apartment paid for by his father. Abandoned by his wife and his son Andrea, he occupies his time acting in an experimental theater company under the artistic direction of his friend Fabio.', 'Michele Apicella lives in Rome, in an apartment paid for by his father. Abandoned by his wife and his son Andrea, he occupies his time acting in an experimental theater company under the artistic direction of his friend Fabio.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/brlPnZ9PiGeGFVCsC4aSrszsHEB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54313'),
