  ('850963540408962975', 'I Am Soldier', 2014, 'Action, Thriller, War', 'Ronnie Thompson, Tim Sidell', 'Ronnie Thompson', 'Noel Clarke, Philip Desmeules, Duncan Casey, Lee Charles, Jordan Long, Allistair McNab, Josh Myers, Ian Pirie', null, 'Mickey Tomlinson, a military chef, attempts the most dangerous military selection known to man: The Special Air Service (S.A.S.) selection. The S.A.S. Is the United Kingdom''s most renowned Special Forces Regiment, tasked with life threatening missions in some of the most dangerous places on the planet. Mickey has more military experience than simply being a chef, something he doesn''t let on to the other candidates... Mickey is smashed by this selection process - his mind, body and soul scream for mercy as he endures torturous speed-marches over the steepest mountains, running for his life during ''Escape and Evasion'' and then facing the most evil interrogation possible, during the deadly phase known as: ''Tactical Questioning.'' Even after everything, there is still only one way you can really prove yourself: in combat... Many try to get into the S.A.S. Only the elite make it.', 'Mickey Tomlinson, a military chef, attempts the most dangerous military selection known to man: The Special Air Service (S.A.S.) selection. The S.A.S. Is the United Kingdom''s most renowned Special Forces Regiment, tasked with life threatening missions in some of the most dangerous places on the planet. Mickey has more military experience than simply being a chef, something he doesn''t let on to the other candidates... Mickey is smashed by this selection process - his mind, body and soul scream for mercy as he endures torturous speed-marches over the steepest mountains, running for his life during ''Escape and Evasion'' and then facing the most evil interrogation possible, during the deadly phase known as: ''Tactical Questioning.'' Even after everything, there is still only one way you can really prove yourself: in combat... Many try to get into the S.A.S. Only the elite make it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/55pSWVVX3uJL4JlPemkDf5d2VPN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:259453'),
  ('250944876178281352', 'I Am Somebody', 1970, 'Documentary', 'Madeline Anderson', null, 'Ralph Abernathy, Coretta Scott King, Andrew Young, Claire Brown', null, 'Madeline Anderson’s documentary brings viewers to the front lines of the civil rights movement during the 1969 Charleston hospital workers’ strike, when 400 poorly paid Black women went on strike to demand union recognition and a wage increase, only to find themselves in confrontation with the National Guard and the state government. Anderson personally participated in the strike, along with such notable figures as Coretta Scott King, Ralph Abernathy and Andrew Young, all affiliated with Martin Luther King’s Southern Christian Leadership Conference. Anderson’s film shows the courage and resiliency of the strikers and the support they received from the local black community. It is an essential filmed record of this important moment in the history of civil and women’s rights. The film is also notable as arguably the first televised documentary on civil rights directed by a woman of color, solidifying its place in American film history.', 'Madeline Anderson’s documentary brings viewers to the front lines of the civil rights movement during the 1969 Charleston hospital workers’ strike, when 400 poorly paid Black women went on strike to demand union recognition and a wage increase, only to find themselves in confrontation with the National Guard and the state government. Anderson personally participated in the strike, along with such notable figures as Coretta Scott King, Ralph Abernathy and Andrew Young, all affiliated with Martin Luther King’s Southern Christian Leadership Conference. Anderson’s film shows the courage and resiliency of the strikers and the support they received from the local black community. It is an essential filmed record of this important moment in the history of civil and women’s rights. The film is also notable as arguably the first televised documentary on civil rights directed by a woman of color, solidifying its place in American film history.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ea7V3R85ufb6TxBwAjcCY1LQK9y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:349003'),
  ('432972757156773079', 'I Am Somebody', 2015, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Derek Yee', 'Derek Yee, Miao Li', 'Wan Guopeng, Daniel Wu, Kai Shen, Bao Xiaoping, Yue Dongfeng, Wang Ting, Xu Xiaoqin, Stephen Fung', null, 'A young man travels from his hometown to Hengdian, the place where the country''s biggest movies are filmed. Like many others, his dream is to become a movie star. However, the life of an actor proves to be very harsh, and only a select few will ever be anything more than extras.', 'A young man travels from his hometown to Hengdian, the place where the country''s biggest movies are filmed. Like many others, his dream is to become a movie star. However, the life of an actor proves to be very harsh, and only a select few will ever be anything more than extras.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5RnL7uxoJ3tOfxWFgw7vV5VNI7z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:345669'),
  ('1082516297042035146', 'I Am Sono Sion!', 1985, 'Documentary', 'Sion Sono', 'Sion Sono', 'Sion Sono, Issei Ooka, Roko Nakagawa, Kyosuke Hanahata', null, 'Sono''s first film, 30 minutes long and shot on 8mm. A free-wheeling intimate cinematic journal in which the artist contemplates his life as he approaches his birthday.', 'Sono''s first film, 30 minutes long and shot on 8mm. A free-wheeling intimate cinematic journal in which the artist contemplates his life as he approaches his birthday.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fInq4OmT9pRu4WQbPVGU5XV0me5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:127611'),
  ('70679123134434464', 'I Am Sun Mu', 2015, 'Animation, Documentary', 'Adam Sjöberg', 'Adam Sjöberg', 'Sun Mu, Angeline, Cui Xianji, Liang Kegang, Ho Bin, Il Gon, Liang Xiao Me, Liang Ji Yen', null, 'Operating under a pseudonym which means ''no boundaries'' - North Korean defector Sun Mu creates political pop art based on his life, homeland, and hope for a future united Korea. His hidden identity is nearly compromised when a massive historical exhibit in Beijing is shuttered by Chinese and North Korean authorities.', 'Operating under a pseudonym which means ''no boundaries'' - North Korean defector Sun Mu creates political pop art based on his life, homeland, and hope for a future united Korea. His hidden identity is nearly compromised when a massive historical exhibit in Beijing is shuttered by Chinese and North Korean authorities.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i7JOKsZmg8KELBrnfvNO6jpqqkx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:383353'),
  ('169870560271852937', 'I Am the Abyss', 2022, 'Thriller, Crime', 'Donato Carrisi, Claudio Cofrancesco', 'Donato Carrisi', 'Michela Cescon, Gabriel Montesi, Sara Ciocca, Giordana Faggiano, Sergio Albelli, Lidiya Liberman, Andrea Gherpelli, Katia Fellin', null, 'The Man Who Cleans knows you can find a lot of secrets in trash. People tend to lie but their trash never does. The Man Who Cleans thought he was invisible, until he met the Girl with the Purple Hair Lock. Girl with the Purple Hair Lock breaks into his tidy life because only an evil angel can save her now. Meanwhile, the Huntress knows somebody is killing blonds out there. Nobody believes her, but she knows. What she doesn''t know, though, is that evil is hiding behind the green door. The truth lies at the bottom of a dark, deep abyss.', 'The Man Who Cleans knows you can find a lot of secrets in trash. People tend to lie but their trash never does. The Man Who Cleans thought he was invisible, until he met the Girl with the Purple Hair Lock. Girl with the Purple Hair Lock breaks into his tidy life because only an evil angel can save her now. Meanwhile, the Huntress knows somebody is killing blonds out there. Nobody believes her, but she knows. What she doesn''t know, though, is that evil is hiding behind the green door. The truth lies at the bottom of a dark, deep abyss.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/grarRx57AFkQGuyY856Ex8RMkQp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:852758'),
  ('6377693490282605', 'I Am the Beauty of Your Beauty, I Am the Fear of Your Fear', 2024, 'Drama, Action', 'Tan Chui Mui, Lim Han Loong', null, 'Dany Lee, Jo Kukathas, Jean Seizure, Zhiny Ooi, Pete Teo, Fran Kee, Samantra', null, 'Gita, a young woman in search of a life purpose, leaves her hometown in China for Malaysia. As she struggles to come to terms with her past and identity, Gita devotes herself to an intense martial arts training course—turning inwards and arriving to groundbreaking epiphanies about herself.', 'Gita, a young woman in search of a life purpose, leaves her hometown in China for Malaysia. As she struggles to come to terms with her past and identity, Gita devotes herself to an intense martial arts training course—turning inwards and arriving to groundbreaking epiphanies about herself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nNm0CbiRViZMNECdVxXhtrK1ZDR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1256174'),
  ('802503874532619672', 'I Am the End of the World', 2025, 'Comedy', 'Gennaro Nunziante, Massimiliano Kuveiller, Marco Limberti', 'Angelo Duro, Gennaro Nunziante', 'Angelo Duro, Giorgio Colangeli, Matilde Piana, Marilù Pipitone, Evelyn Famà, Carlo Ferreri, Simone Montedoro, Maximiliano Ulivieri', null, 'Forced to come back to Palermo to take care of his elderly parents, a deadpan driver-for-hire takes advantage of the situation to get back at the rigid authority figures who ruined his teenage years.', 'Forced to come back to Palermo to take care of his elderly parents, a deadpan driver-for-hire takes advantage of the situation to get back at the rigid authority figures who ruined his teenage years.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5nDR8pgRvFmnhgpJnREdYQKYbys.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1386877'),
  ('870683382736185203', 'I Am the Keeper', 2014, 'Drama, Romance', 'Sabine Boss', 'Pedro Lenz, Sabine Boss, Jasmine Hoch', 'Marcus Signer, Sonja Riesen, Michael Neuenschwander, Pascal Ulli, Andreas Matti, Rebecca Indermaur, Christian Liniger', null, 'Goalie has just been released from prison after spending a year inside for keeping his mouth shut for his best buddy Ueli. He heads for his hometown of Schummertal, a small town where everyone knows you. He''s going to start over, without drugs. Meanwhile, Ueli has gotten ever deeper into drugs, can''t understand why Goalie suddenly wants to be a square. Although they''ve been friends since childhood, everything is different now. Goalie wants a new life but finds his past.', 'Goalie has just been released from prison after spending a year inside for keeping his mouth shut for his best buddy Ueli. He heads for his hometown of Schummertal, a small town where everyone knows you. He''s going to start over, without drugs. Meanwhile, Ueli has gotten ever deeper into drugs, can''t understand why Goalie suddenly wants to be a square. Although they''ve been friends since childhood, everything is different now. Goalie wants a new life but finds his past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6vNs8uVauAE0zw3RGzDsEZoe6oQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:285752'),
  ('1127990645175490608', 'I Am the Law', 1938, 'Crime, Drama', 'Alexander Hall, Henry Freulich', 'Jo Swerling', 'Edward G. Robinson, Barbara O''Neil, John Beal, Wendy Barrie, Otto Kruger, Arthur Loft, Marc Lawrence, Douglas Wood', 'NR', 'With the aid of his former law students, a professor-turned-prosecutor battles corruption and organized crime.', 'With the aid of his former law students, a professor-turned-prosecutor battles corruption and organized crime.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tWDGDvHKGFj1djFIlES1ptbxnDj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:109711'),
  ('38859849549619078', 'I Am the Law', 1977, 'Drama, History, Thriller', 'Pasquale Squitieri, Silvano Ippoliti, Roberto Pariante', 'Arrigo Petacco, Ugo Pirro', 'Giuliano Gemma, Claudia Cardinale, Stefano Satta Flores, Massimo Mollica, Rossella Rusconi, Rik Battaglia, Lina Sastri, Enzo Fisichella', null, 'Sicily, Fascist Italy, 1925. Dictator Benito Mussolini appoints Cesare Mori, a man as tough as he is honest, as the new police prefect of Palermo and entrusts him with the arduous task of putting an end to the Mafia, a sinister criminal organization that has sown terror on the island for centuries.', 'Sicily, Fascist Italy, 1925. Dictator Benito Mussolini appoints Cesare Mori, a man as tough as he is honest, as the new police prefect of Palermo and entrusts him with the arduous task of putting an end to the Mafia, a sinister criminal organization that has sown terror on the island for centuries.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8pgQcmL7jtGlInQYPy9mPM71MUV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:150191'),
  ('248219866610824209', 'I Am the Other Woman', 2006, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Axel Block, Margarethe von Trotta', 'Pea Fröhlich, Peter Märthesheimer', 'Katja Riemann, August Diehl, Armin Mueller-Stahl, Karin Dor, Barbara Auer, Dieter Laser, Bernadette Heerwagen, Peter Lerchbaumer', null, 'Successful architect Robert has a one-night stand with a mysterious lady in red. The next day they meet again, but Carolin is now a corporate lawyer working on a major contract for Robert ...', 'Successful architect Robert has a one-night stand with a mysterious lady in red. The next day they meet again, but Carolin is now a corporate lawyer working on a major contract for Robert ...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2YP5YNoe5vZwcSAz65TSlghCFL0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:5640'),
  ('370429858920512649', 'I Am the Pretty Thing That Lives in the House', 2016, 'Horror, Mystery', 'Osgood Perkins, Julie Kirkwood', 'Osgood Perkins', 'Ruth Wilson, Paula Prentiss, Bob Balaban, Lucy Boynton, Brad Milne, Daniel Chichagov, Erin Boyes, Beatrix Perkins', null, 'A young nurse takes care of an elderly author who lives in a haunted house.', 'A young nurse takes care of an elderly author who lives in a haunted house.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lq8ktDO2uqJFgV0jRlMQlPSmNm8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:407559'),
  ('23962709318774629', 'I Am Toxic', 2018, 'Drama, Horror, Science Fiction', 'Pablo Parés, Néstor Sánchez Sotelo, Pablo Sala', 'Paulo Soria, Daniel de la Vega, Pablo Parés', 'Esteban Prol, Horacio Fontova, Fini Bocchino, Sergio Podeley, Gastón Cocchiarale, Verónica Intile, Goyo Escardó, Demián Salomón', null, 'Province of Buenos Aires, Argentina, 2101. The world has been ravaged by a biological warfare. A man wakes up in the desert, unable to remember anything of his previous life.', 'Province of Buenos Aires, Argentina, 2101. The world has been ravaged by a biological warfare. A man wakes up in the desert, unable to remember anything of his previous life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kYg0wEWXiVVy2FXfopUcvek7WIk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:567691'),
  ('193063535755220240', 'I Am Trash', 2016, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Lee Sang-woo', null, 'Kwon Beom-taek, Lee Sang-woo, Yang Myeong-heon, Yoo So-hyeon, Jo Yong-seok, Park Hyeong-bin', null, 'Three grown sons have struggled to achieve some sort of normal routine after their father was sent off to prison for sexual assault on an underaged girl. Their lives are thrown into radical disarray when dad finishes his time and returns to the family home. The fact that the victim’s father is awaiting the return outside their door with a knife is certainly not any help to their situation... but it’s not like things are going so well otherwise, with the three sons, a virtual compendium of sexual dysfunctions in their own right.', 'Three grown sons have struggled to achieve some sort of normal routine after their father was sent off to prison for sexual assault on an underaged girl. Their lives are thrown into radical disarray when dad finishes his time and returns to the family home. The fact that the victim’s father is awaiting the return outside their door with a knife is certainly not any help to their situation... but it’s not like things are going so well otherwise, with the three sons, a virtual compendium of sexual dysfunctions in their own right.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hX824wPKZ1C08f8WhCq9HxqwfdO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:289193'),
  ('480517393667081825', 'I Am Twenty', 1965, 'Drama', 'Marlen Khutsiyev, Margarita Pilikhina, Polina Poznanskaya', 'Gennady Shpalikov, Marlen Khutsiyev', 'Valentin Popov, Nikolai Gubenko, Stanislav Lyubshin, Marianna Vertinskaya, Zinaida Zinovyeva, Svetlana Starikova, Lev Prygunov, Tatyana Bogdanova', null, 'Having returned from the army, 20-year-old Sergei settles down at the thermal power station and merges into ordinary life. Every day he meets and spends time with childhood friends — the young family man Slava and the merry fellow Nikolai, and once at first sight he falls in love with a stranger on the bus. A lyrical story about a generation of young people entering adulthood, a reappraisal of values, life principles, traditions in culture and art.', 'Having returned from the army, 20-year-old Sergei settles down at the thermal power station and merges into ordinary life. Every day he meets and spends time with childhood friends — the young family man Slava and the merry fellow Nikolai, and once at first sight he falls in love with a stranger on the bus. A lyrical story about a generation of young people entering adulthood, a reappraisal of values, life principles, traditions in culture and art.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mvGm5MyJeKe8DPks3rOLsNFuwmD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:148782'),
  ('626553800575703779', 'I Am Vanessa Guillen', 2022, 'Documentary', 'Christy Wegener, Zac Manuel, Nausheen Dadabhoy', null, 'Vanessa Guillén, Jackie Speier, Jack Reed, Joni Ernst', 'PG-13', 'Vanessa Guillen was 20 years old when she was found murdered at a US Army base. Rather than submit to silence, her family fought for justice and change.', 'Vanessa Guillen was 20 years old when she was found murdered at a US Army base. Rather than submit to silence, her family fought for justice and change.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cUhmtPP9L8BBnuquyPE4zOU2RTg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1030323'),
