  ('135976274930812669', 'I Am Vengeance: Retaliation', 2020, 'Action', 'Ross Boyask', 'Ross Boyask', 'Stuart Bennett, Vinnie Jones, Jessica-Jane Stafford, Katrina Durden, Sam Benjamin, Lee Charles, Josh Myers, Joe Egan', 'R', 'A former special-forces soldier is given the opportunity to bring the man who betrayed his team on their final mission in Eastern Europe several years ago - to justice.', 'A former special-forces soldier is given the opportunity to bring the man who betrayed his team on their final mission in Eastern Europe several years ago - to justice.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fshqvFBihzipvA5l9hwHQVuZCNG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:661227'),
  ('208349948655093372', 'I Am Waiting', 1957, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Koreyoshi Kurahara, Kuratarō Takamura, Akinori Matsuo', 'Shintarō Ishihara', 'Yūjirō Ishihara, Mie Kitahara, Isamu Kosugi, Kōjirō Kusanagi, Hideaki Nitani, Kenjiro Uemura, Keisuke Tate, Masayuki Kawamura', null, 'A former boxer gets involved with a club hostess trying to escape the clutches of her gangster employer.', 'A former boxer gets involved with a club hostess trying to escape the clutches of her gangster employer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1JINVk7OBVb3JsGfezP3Iql8g05.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:71719'),
  ('163492881855226376', 'I Am What I Am', 2021, 'Animation, Comedy, Action, Drama', 'Sun Haipeng, Wang Yuanying', 'Li Zelin', 'Li Xin, Yexiong Chen, Hao Guo, Meng Li, Li Jiasi, Cai Zhuangzhuang', null, 'By a fortunate coincidence, Gyun is inspired and encouraged by a girl with the same name. Therefore, he decides to form a lion dance troupe with his friends, Kat and Doggie, to break the constraints of reality and fight for themselves for once.', 'By a fortunate coincidence, Gyun is inspired and encouraged by a girl with the same name. Therefore, he decides to form a lion dance troupe with his friends, Kat and Doggie, to break the constraints of reality and fight for themselves for once.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/901NqAyWFcMoY7o1IJzl8QLbxxU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:839803'),
  ('488560607908696953', 'I Am What I Am', 2022, 'Drama', 'Shinya Tamada, Kei Nakase', 'Atsushi Asada', 'Toko Miura, Atsuko Maeda, Marika Ito, Maki Sakai, Hiroki Miyake, Reiko Tajima, Kuu Izima, Kou Maehara', null, 'Kasumi doesn''t know what love is and she doesn''t have any feeling of romance. Due to her sister''s marriage, her mother arranged a formal marriage arrangement without her permission. At the meeting, she met a man who is just seeking a friend.', 'Kasumi doesn''t know what love is and she doesn''t have any feeling of romance. Due to her sister''s marriage, her mother arranged a formal marriage arrangement without her permission. At the meeting, she met a man who is just seeking a friend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xqEoRyaQFoO1SbC9Xz5RQWjOy6Y.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1014644'),
  ('884770542199659976', 'I Am What I Am 2', 2024, 'Animation, Action, Comedy', 'Sun Haipeng, Wang Yuanying, Wang Ruijie', 'Sun Haipeng, Shen Cheng, Zhang Ting', 'Li Xin, Hao Guo, Yexiong Chen, Cai Xinran, Wang Yilang, Ajie, Lin Su, Cai Zhuangzhuang', null, 'Gyun, an unknown person who came to Shanghai to work, agreed to represent the declining Chuanwu Boxing Gym to participate in the "Shanghai Fight Night" martial arts competition in order to earn money to treat his father''s illness. To do so, he must overcome all the experts, prejudices, and himself.', 'Gyun, an unknown person who came to Shanghai to work, agreed to represent the declining Chuanwu Boxing Gym to participate in the "Shanghai Fight Night" martial arts competition in order to earn money to treat his father''s illness. To do so, he must overcome all the experts, prejudices, and himself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aPEJWSwOlg1zmIAIUZdjHLum0ii.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1154478'),
  ('582729655690369279', 'I Am Woman', 2020, 'Drama, Music', 'Unjoo Moon, Dion Beebe', 'Emma Jensen', 'Tilda Cobham-Hervey, Danielle Macdonald, Evan Peters, Chris Parnell, David Lyons, Matthew Cardarople, Dusty Sorg, Coco Greenstone', null, 'In 1966, Helen Reddy landed in New York with her three year old daughter, a suitcase, and $230 in her pocket. Within weeks, she was broke. Within months, she was in love. Within five years, she was one of the biggest superstars of her time and an icon of the 1970s feminist movement who wrote a song which galvanized a generation of women to fight for change.', 'In 1966, Helen Reddy landed in New York with her three year old daughter, a suitcase, and $230 in her pocket. Within weeks, she was broke. Within months, she was in love. Within five years, she was one of the biggest superstars of her time and an icon of the 1970s feminist movement who wrote a song which galvanized a generation of women to fight for change.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gpAkNeMzrSTJX2YIYcuwfqBrEqS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:531033'),
  ('85017859607041791', 'I Am Wrath', 2016, 'Action, Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Chuck Russell, Andrzej Sekula, David Allen Cluck', 'Paul Sloan', 'John Travolta, Christopher Meloni, Amanda Schull, Sam Trammell, Patrick St. Esprit, Rebecca De Mornay, Asante Jones, Paul Sloan', 'R', 'A man is out for justice after a group of corrupt police officers are unable to catch his wife''s killer.', 'A man is out for justice after a group of corrupt police officers are unable to catch his wife''s killer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6NvLA3BP5ktLaZ1qdLY0oHsaqwD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:332411'),
  ('767641011568572730', 'I Am Your Father', 2015, 'Documentary', 'Marcos Cabotá, Toni Bestard, Daniel Torrelló', 'Marcos Cabotá, Toni Bestard', 'David Prowse, Marcos Cabotá, Marcus Hearn, Jonathan Rigby, Lou Ferrigno, Kenny Baker, Gary Kurtz, Robert Watts', null, 'David Prowse is an eighty years old actor, who has lived behind Darth Vader''s mask during three decades. A group of Star Wars fans find out why he has been apparently forgotten by Lucasfilm during thirty years, and decide to give him back the glory he never had. This is their last opportunity.', 'David Prowse is an eighty years old actor, who has lived behind Darth Vader''s mask during three decades. A group of Star Wars fans find out why he has been apparently forgotten by Lucasfilm during thirty years, and decide to give him back the glory he never had. This is their last opportunity.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/skaTUxPbcFQz9gvYmdWBBTjQ1wx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:362610'),
  ('60637985057977098', 'I Am Zlatan', 2021, 'Drama', 'Jens Sjögren, Gösta Reiland', 'Zlatan Ibrahimović, David Lagercrantz, Jakob Beckman', 'Granit Rushiti, Dominic Andersson Bajraktati, Cedomir Glisovic, Merima Dizdarević, Håkan Bengtsson, Selma Mesanovic, Linda Haziri, Emmanuele Aita', null, 'Coming-of-age story depicting Zlatan Ibrahimovic''s upbringing in a rough Swedish suburb. Born to Balkan immigrants, football was Zlatan''s release in a tough environment where his remarkable talent and self-reliance catapulted him against all odds to the top of international football playing for clubs like Ajax Amsterdam, Juventus, Inter, Milan, Barcelona, Paris Saint-Germain and Manchester United.', 'Coming-of-age story depicting Zlatan Ibrahimovic''s upbringing in a rough Swedish suburb. Born to Balkan immigrants, football was Zlatan''s release in a tough environment where his remarkable talent and self-reliance catapulted him against all odds to the top of international football playing for clubs like Ajax Amsterdam, Juventus, Inter, Milan, Barcelona, Paris Saint-Germain and Manchester United.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4PTCd7jeylZdj6PZXqUlHWfKu9V.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:763109'),
  ('113140834754481808', 'I Am: Celine Dion', 2024, 'Documentary, Music', 'Irene Taylor, Nick Midwig', 'Irene Taylor', 'Céline Dion, Nelson Angélil, Eddy Angélil, Natalie Hamel-Roy, René Angélil, René-Charles Angélil, André Coutu, Claude ''Mégo'' Lemay', 'PG', 'A raw and honest behind-the-scenes look at the iconic superstar''s struggle with a life-altering illness. Serving as a love letter to her fans, this inspirational documentary highlights the music that has guided her life while also showcasing the resilience of the human spirit.', 'A raw and honest behind-the-scenes look at the iconic superstar''s struggle with a life-altering illness. Serving as a love letter to her fans, this inspirational documentary highlights the music that has guided her life while also showcasing the resilience of the human spirit.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v0zvMBdwzgSAj9xCufxDuq1WoJO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:879805'),
  ('345708300279958309', 'I And Others', 1971, 'Documentary', 'Feliks Sobolev, Leonid Moroz, Leonid Priadkin', 'Yurii Alikov', null, null, 'How independent are we in our judgments? How do other people influence us? Being like everyone else is a natural desire of a child. He often succumbs to suggestion and passes out someone else''s opinion for his own. But for an adult, this is a loss of personality, adaptability, conformism, which forms the psychology of a slave.', 'How independent are we in our judgments? How do other people influence us? Being like everyone else is a natural desire of a child. He often succumbs to suggestion and passes out someone else''s opinion for his own. But for an adult, this is a loss of personality, adaptability, conformism, which forms the psychology of a slave.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7xFTuwngjzSF6Noorz9Kew5sNKT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:158192'),
  ('1137057616404751605', 'I And the Stupid Boy', 2021, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Antoine Héberlé, Kaouther Ben Hania, Marie Fischer', 'Kaouther Ben Hania', 'Oulaya Amamra, Sandor Funtek', null, 'Nora is a striking young girl in new love. We see her dancing around her bedroom, lip-synching, testing outfits, in between sending heart emojis, and more, to the special boy. All dressed up, she takes a short cut through an abandoned building, on the way for her hot date. Kevin pulls up in the background on his scooter. He''s Nora''s recent ex, jilted and jealous. Kevin grabs Nora''s phone, and what ensues is a now universal 21st century story of male-female power, sexuality and shame with a biting, feminist twist.', 'Nora is a striking young girl in new love. We see her dancing around her bedroom, lip-synching, testing outfits, in between sending heart emojis, and more, to the special boy. All dressed up, she takes a short cut through an abandoned building, on the way for her hot date. Kevin pulls up in the background on his scooter. He''s Nora''s recent ex, jilted and jealous. Kevin grabs Nora''s phone, and what ensues is a now universal 21st century story of male-female power, sexuality and shame with a biting, feminist twist.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h5K2GaA3FSo4NzzY3w0YM4lR7jr.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:856400'),
  ('733053404365654450', 'I Are You, You Am Me', 1982, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Nobuhiko Obayashi, Yoshitaka Sakamoto', 'Wataru Kenmotsu', 'Satomi Kobayashi, Toshinori Omi, Makoto Satō, Kirin Kiki, Joe Shishido, Wakaba Irie, Etsuko Shihomi, Sayuri Ishibashi', null, '9th-graders Kazuo and Kazumi take a tumble at a temple in a small seacoast town in Japan. Through supernatural intervention, their minds and bodies are switched, and the result is a touching and hilarious coming-of-age comedy as they attempt to survive the pressures of junior high school life.', '9th-graders Kazuo and Kazumi take a tumble at a temple in a small seacoast town in Japan. Through supernatural intervention, their minds and bodies are switched, and the result is a touching and hilarious coming-of-age comedy as they attempt to survive the pressures of junior high school life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/blsHDgpWpiAB79piVL5HG6BXZKH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:129689'),
  ('458957572186724928', 'I babysitter', 2016, 'Comedy', 'Giovanni Bognetti, Federico Masiero', 'Giovanni Bognetti', 'Francesco Mandelli, Paolo Ruffini, Andrea Pisani, Luca Peracino, Simona Tabasco, Bruno Gambarotta, Antonio Catania, Francesca Cavallin', null, 'On Andrea''s birthday, his boss asks him to babysit his son while he''s away for work: while Andrea is babysitting, his friends arrive and throw a big party.', 'On Andrea''s birthday, his boss asks him to babysit his son while he''s away for work: while Andrea is babysitting, his friends arrive and throw a big party.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bd2RlAHIXkwYuzvyuzD1n2270Sm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:419372'),
