  ('617537293699091850', 'I Bought a Vampire Motorcycle', 1990, 'Comedy, Horror', 'Dirk Campbell, Tom Ingle, Simon Vicary', 'Mycal Miller, John Wolskel', 'Neil Morrissey, Amanda Noar, Michael Elphick, Anthony Daniels, Andrew Powell, George Rossi, Daniel Peacock, Midge Taylor', null, 'When a motorbike gang kills an occultist, the evil spirit he was summoning inhabits a damaged bike. The bike is then bought and restored, but reveals its true nature when it tries to exact vengance on the gang, and anyone else who gets in its way.', 'When a motorbike gang kills an occultist, the evil spirit he was summoning inhabits a damaged bike. The bike is then bought and restored, but reveals its true nature when it tries to exact vengance on the gang, and anyone else who gets in its way.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dCbFIzq64uUo5ZR4W3vLFhaJenk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41153'),
  ('726695456531702279', 'I Bury the Living', 1958, 'Mystery, Horror', 'Frederick Gately, Albert Band, Clark L. Paylow', 'Louis Garfinkle', 'Richard Boone, Theodore Bikel, Herbert Anderson, Robert Osterloh, Howard Smith, Peggy Maurer, Russ Bender, Glen Vernon', 'NR', 'The new manager of a small-town cemetery becomes convinced that he triggered the untimely deaths of several plot owners by tampering with a certain map. When nobody believes him, he risks his sanity to play God once again and prove his point.', 'The new manager of a small-town cemetery becomes convinced that he triggered the untimely deaths of several plot owners by tampering with a certain map. When nobody believes him, he risks his sanity to play God once again and prove his point.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3qBNVDbdXNRsexZ5mLvMcvItayH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34084'),
