  ('1110868333170277460', 'I Came By', 2022, 'Crime, Thriller', 'Babak Anvari, Claire Rudkin, Merv Lewis', 'Namsi Khan, Babak Anvari', 'George MacKay, Percelle Ascott, Kelly Macdonald, Varada Sethu, Franc Ashman, Anthony Calf, Hugh Bonneville, Marilyn Nnadebe', 'R', 'A rebellious young graffiti artist, who targets the homes of the wealthy elite, discovers a shocking secret that leads him on a journey endangering himself and those closest to him.', 'A rebellious young graffiti artist, who targets the homes of the wealthy elite, discovers a shocking secret that leads him on a journey endangering himself and those closest to him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pFB9jZDl52jBNbMPVSlISXD1ggS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:852448'),
  ('617740655258316431', 'I Can Do Bad All By Myself', 2009, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Tyler Perry, Alexander Gruszynski', 'Tyler Perry', 'Tyler Perry, Taraji P. Henson, Adam Rodriguez, Mary J. Blige, Gladys Knight, Brian J. White, Hope Olaidé Wilson, Kwesi Boakye', 'PG-13', 'When Madea catches teenage Jennifer and her two younger brothers looting her home, she decides to take matters into her own hands and delivers the young delinquents to the only relative they have: their aunt April. A heavy-drinking nightclub singer who lives off of her married boyfriend, April wants nothing to do with the kids.', 'When Madea catches teenage Jennifer and her two younger brothers looting her home, she decides to take matters into her own hands and delivers the young delinquents to the only relative they have: their aunt April. A heavy-drinking nightclub singer who lives off of her married boyfriend, April wants nothing to do with the kids.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kl8RNyG7jokw2pTLJNwkPhsBAL9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:26367'),
