  ('624898846620785990', 'I Can Make You Love Me', 1993, 'Thriller, TV Movie, Horror', 'Michael Switzer, Robert Draper', 'Frank Abatemarco', 'Richard Thomas, Brooke Shields, Viveka Davis, William Allen Young, Richard Yniguez, Scott Bryce, Linda Emond, T. Max Graham', null, 'A beautiful young computer technician starting off her career in Silicon Valley during the Eighties, is stalked and harassed by a nerdy, dangerous and mentally-unstable colleague with a twisted obsession.', 'A beautiful young computer technician starting off her career in Silicon Valley during the Eighties, is stalked and harassed by a nerdy, dangerous and mentally-unstable colleague with a twisted obsession.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7AP8Zthv8QyKnEQ1tMpJwaojkna.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:126816'),
  ('359093565423754525', 'I Can No Longer Hear the Guitar', 1991, 'Drama', 'Philippe Garrel, Patrick Piccolo, Hubert Engammare', 'Jean-François Goyet', 'Benoît Régent, Johanna ter Steege, Yann Collette, Mireille Perrier, Brigitte Sy, Anouk Grinberg, Adélaïde Blasquez, Philippe Morier-Genoud', null, 'For those who were young, living under the delusions of love and soft drugs in Paris, May 1968 - even if the guitar is still playing, they can''t hear it any longer.', 'For those who were young, living under the delusions of love and soft drugs in Paris, May 1968 - even if the guitar is still playing, they can''t hear it any longer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p7GUevFkZv8rptjeF7YbJWrrsDc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:65943'),
  ('778543237936763618', 'I Can Only Imagine', 2018, 'Music, Drama', 'Jon Erwin, Andrew Erwin, Kristopher S. Kimlin', 'Jon Erwin, Brent McCorkle', 'J. Michael Finley, Madeline Carroll, Dennis Quaid, Trace Adkins, Cloris Leachman, Jason Burkey, Mark Furze, Randy McDowell', 'PG', 'Growing up in Greenville, Texas, Bart Millard suffers physical and emotional abuse at the hands of his father, Arthur. When Arthur becomes terminally ill, he finds redemption by embracing his faith and rediscovering his love for his son. Years later, Bart''s troubled childhood and mended relationship with his dad inspires him to write the hit song "I Can Only Imagine" as singer of the Christian band MercyMe.', 'Growing up in Greenville, Texas, Bart Millard suffers physical and emotional abuse at the hands of his father, Arthur. When Arthur becomes terminally ill, he finds redemption by embracing his faith and rediscovering his love for his son. Years later, Bart''s troubled childhood and mended relationship with his dad inspires him to write the hit song "I Can Only Imagine" as singer of the Christian band MercyMe.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/veZszwMZu8d3WMU6TJX9sV5w1Y4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:470878'),
  ('509951232756631508', 'I Can Only Imagine 2', 2026, 'Drama, Music', 'Brent McCorkle, Andrew Erwin, Johnny Derango', 'Brent McCorkle', 'J. Michael Finley, Milo Ventimiglia, Sophie Skelton, Arielle Kebbel, Sammy Dell, Mark Furze, Ezra Proch, Jason Burkey', 'PG', 'After the breakout success of the song ''I Can Only Imagine'', MercyMe''s Bart Millard is living the dream—sold-out arenas, a devoted fanbase, and a thriving career. But behind the spotlight, Bart''s past threatens the family he''s built, especially the fragile bond with his son Sam. When hopeful newcomer Tim Timmons joins the band for their biggest tour yet, he unknowingly brings a renewed gratitude to Bart''s life through their unlikely friendship. Bart soon discovers that Tim carries hardships—and secrets—of his own, forcing him to face his past and repair his relationships with Sam and his wife Shannon before fame costs him what matters most.', 'After the breakout success of the song ''I Can Only Imagine'', MercyMe''s Bart Millard is living the dream—sold-out arenas, a devoted fanbase, and a thriving career. But behind the spotlight, Bart''s past threatens the family he''s built, especially the fragile bond with his son Sam. When hopeful newcomer Tim Timmons joins the band for their biggest tour yet, he unknowingly brings a renewed gratitude to Bart''s life through their unlikely friendship. Bart soon discovers that Tim carries hardships—and secrets—of his own, forcing him to face his past and repair his relationships with Sam and his wife Shannon before fame costs him what matters most.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/A4A8YgAzBwDnlXDzuxoc5ZLchO7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1405769'),
  ('921496995302581458', 'I Can Quit Whenever I Want', 2014, 'Comedy', 'Manfredi Bruno, Emanuele Palamara, Fabio Ferro', 'Andrea Garello, Sydney Sibilia, Valerio Attanasio', 'Edoardo Leo, Valeria Solarino, Valerio Aprea, Paolo Calabresi, Stefano Fresi, Lorenzo Lavia, Pietro Sermonti, Libero De Rienzo', null, 'A university researcher is fired because of the cuts to university. To earn a living he decides to produce drugs recruiting his former colleagues, who despite their skills are living at the margins of society.', 'A university researcher is fired because of the cuts to university. To earn a living he decides to produce drugs recruiting his former colleagues, who despite their skills are living at the margins of society.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zcDqnuSpdRoXuw3kmbMDxLkdgXR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:250219'),
  ('1087842731596805248', 'I Can Quit Whenever I Want', 2019, 'Comedy', 'Carlos Therón, Ángel Iguacel, Koldo Zuazua', 'Andrea Garello, Cristóbal Garrido, Adolfo Valor', 'David Verdaguer, Ernesto Sevilla, Carlos Santos, Cristina Castaño, Miren Ibarguren, Amaia Salamanca, Ernesto Alterio, Mero González', 'PG-13', 'Pedro, Arturo and Eligio are three college professors who lost their job because of economic crisis. Accidentally they find a solution for all of their problems; a multi-vitamin that allows them to party all night long without any side effects. The three professors will be launched into the world of nightclubs and the shady business, in order to market the merchandise. Of course, it seems that they are not as prepared for it as they thought.', 'Pedro, Arturo and Eligio are three college professors who lost their job because of economic crisis. Accidentally they find a solution for all of their problems; a multi-vitamin that allows them to party all night long without any side effects. The three professors will be launched into the world of nightclubs and the shady business, in order to market the merchandise. Of course, it seems that they are not as prepared for it as they thought.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k5LP414yqZSaRAZf9uVh1ufO2mN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:574370'),
