  ('749522054610326881', 'I Choose The Window', 2007, 'Comedy', 'Andrés López', 'Andrés López', 'Andrés López', null, '"I choose the window" tells common episodes of life: steps for rumbeo, test anecdotes, pre-puberty, life in the office, marriage, courtship, among other incidents. The particular name of his new work was put in honor of an anecdote: when he was 16 years old he belonged to a rock band called "I ask for the window"; Lopez said he was kicked out of the band and then decided to be a storyteller.', '"I choose the window" tells common episodes of life: steps for rumbeo, test anecdotes, pre-puberty, life in the office, marriage, courtship, among other incidents. The particular name of his new work was put in honor of an anecdote: when he was 16 years old he belonged to a rock band called "I ask for the window"; Lopez said he was kicked out of the band and then decided to be a storyteller.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bG94an0h1GnEvFHX5cX60Mpmr5U.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:75110'),
  ('168634180639336472', 'I Choose to Believe', 2023, 'Documentary', 'Martín Méndez, Gustavo Pagano, Gonzalo Arias', 'Martín Méndez', 'Ricardo Darín, Lionel Scaloni, Lionel Messi, Ángel Di María, Julián Álvarez, Rodrigo De Paul, Emiliano Martínez, Nahuel Molina', null, 'It narrates the epic title obtained by the Argentine National Team in the World Cup Qatar 2022 with testimonies of the protagonists, told from the intimacy and in first person.', 'It narrates the epic title obtained by the Argentine National Team in the World Cup Qatar 2022 with testimonies of the protagonists, told from the intimacy and in first person.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2Sx0Xz8cvnCRNLZjIQWgKWLIaks.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1192578'),
  ('148975897734854107', 'I Come', 2000, 'Drama, Music', 'Tony Gatlif, Thierry Pouget', 'Tony Gatlif, David Trueba', 'Antonio Canales, Orestes Villasan Rodríguez, Antonio Dechent, Juan Luis Corrientes, Bobote, Fernando Guerrero Rebollo, Francisco Chavero Rios, Sophie Bonnet', null, 'Caco is a proud, handsome man, head of a family, and very powerful in the local community. Yet he has been torn to pieces by the death of his beloved daughter. He constantly visits her grave, weeps silently at her photo and has transferred all his wildly protective love and attention onto his mentally challenged nephew, Diego. It seems that Diego''s father, Caco''s brother, is in hiding after having killed a man from the Caravaca family, who are equally powerful in the community. They are looking for vengeance and have come to Caco for justice. When he refuses to betray his brother, the Caravacas grow impatient. When they realize they are getting nowhere, they threaten to kill Diego. Despite his fierce pride, Caco eventually realizes that the cycle of killing and revenge must be broken. But how can he achieve this and protect everyone he loves?', 'Caco is a proud, handsome man, head of a family, and very powerful in the local community. Yet he has been torn to pieces by the death of his beloved daughter. He constantly visits her grave, weeps silently at her photo and has transferred all his wildly protective love and attention onto his mentally challenged nephew, Diego. It seems that Diego''s father, Caco''s brother, is in hiding after having killed a man from the Caravaca family, who are equally powerful in the community. They are looking for vengeance and have come to Caco for justice. When he refuses to betray his brother, the Caravacas grow impatient. When they realize they are getting nowhere, they threaten to kill Diego. Despite his fierce pride, Caco eventually realizes that the cycle of killing and revenge must be broken. But how can he achieve this and protect everyone he loves?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wgWcaqcqZc1ZPNwjgdpbCKoFfNd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:47108'),
  ('174985044929601100', 'I Come with the Rain', 2009, 'Thriller, Mystery', 'Trần Anh Hùng, Juan Ruiz Anchía', 'Trần Anh Hùng', 'Josh Hartnett, Elias Koteas, Takuya Kimura, Lee Byung-hun, Trần Nữ Yên Khê, Shawn Yue Man-Lok, Eusebio Poncela, Sam Lee', null, 'Kline, a former Los Angeles police officer turned private detective, is hired by a powerful pharmaceutical conglomerate boss to investigate in Asia the disappearance of his only son, Shitao, whom he has not seen in person since the boy was ten. Now in his 30s, Shitao has gone missing in the Philippines where he had been helping in an orphanage.', 'Kline, a former Los Angeles police officer turned private detective, is hired by a powerful pharmaceutical conglomerate boss to investigate in Asia the disappearance of his only son, Shitao, whom he has not seen in person since the boy was ten. Now in his 30s, Shitao has gone missing in the Philippines where he had been helping in an orphanage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wOJZ3XvHjcGfLBh0GLJU3HhsJKE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31166'),
  ('606363895032271037', 'I Confess', 1953, 'Drama, Thriller, Crime', 'Alfred Hitchcock, Robert Burks, Don Alvarado', 'George Tabori, William Archibald', 'Montgomery Clift, Anne Baxter, Karl Malden, Brian Aherne, O.E. Hasse, Roger Dann, Dolly Haas, Charles Andre', 'NR', 'When a priest hears a murderer’s confession, he becomes bound by his vow of silence—even as circumstantial evidence turns suspicion toward him. Torn between faith and self-preservation, he faces public scandal and trial for a crime he cannot reveal the truth about.', 'When a priest hears a murderer’s confession, he becomes bound by his vow of silence—even as circumstantial evidence turns suspicion toward him. Torn between faith and self-preservation, he faces public scandal and trial for a crime he cannot reveal the truth about.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5IYyJetEctAypFYIffqx55PXTPT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30159'),
  ('1134751806488325644', 'I Could Go on Singing', 1963, 'Drama, Music', 'Arthur Ibbetson, Ronald Neame', 'Robert Dozier, Dirk Bogarde', 'Judy Garland, Dirk Bogarde, Jack Klugman, Aline MacMahon, Gregory Phillips, Russell Waters, Pauline Jameson, Jeremy Burnham', 'NR', 'Jenny Bowman is a successful singer who, while on an engagement at the London Palladium, visits David Donne to see her son Matt again, spending a few glorious days with him while his father is away in Rome in an attempt to attain the family that she never had. When David returns, Matt is torn between his loyalty to his father and his affection for Jenny.', 'Jenny Bowman is a successful singer who, while on an engagement at the London Palladium, visits David Donne to see her son Matt again, spending a few glorious days with him while his father is away in Rome in an attempt to attain the family that she never had. When David returns, Matt is torn between his loyalty to his father and his affection for Jenny.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4MbUdjRiMiQqICONsVZ1w5Nryys.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:86168'),
