  ('695618349089793040', 'I Didn''t Do It!', 1999, 'Comedy, Adventure, Family', 'Jacques Monnet, Bruno de Keyzer', 'Jean-Patrick Benes, Laurent Molinaro', 'Thierry Lhermitte, Gautier Kusnierek, Arielle Dombasle, Jacques Perrin, Martin Lamotte, Gabrielle Forest, Patrick Guillemin, Giulia Demont', null, 'Eleven-year-old Martin is a basically good boy. Unfortunately each time he decides to give a hand things end in disaster. This summer, he has been invited to spend a vacation at the Hotel Nautilus by his friend Vincent''s parents. This is a great place for kids with its cabin hidden among the branches of a tree they call the "baobab". But this year a holiday camp is being built nearby...', 'Eleven-year-old Martin is a basically good boy. Unfortunately each time he decides to give a hand things end in disaster. This summer, he has been invited to spend a vacation at the Hotel Nautilus by his friend Vincent''s parents. This is a great place for kids with its cabin hidden among the branches of a tree they call the "baobab". But this year a holiday camp is being built nearby...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iZLVs0kkTrA9RMfJUp0lWk3hYzD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:93138'),
